rulings: ["[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “creature spell” is any spell with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact or enchantment. Older cards of type summon are also creature spells.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "A card\'s mana value is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner. The mana value is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {1}{U}{U} has mana value 3. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions that could apply to it. A card with no mana cost has a mana value of 0."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Any triggered abilities that trigger while performing the Expertise spell\'s first effect won\'t be put onto the stack until after you\'re done casting your free spell. They\'re put onto the stack at the same time as any abilities that triggered while casting that spell regardless of the order in which those abilities triggered."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Effects that allow you to "cast" a card don\\\'t allow you to play a land card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If the Expertise spell you cast has any targets, and those targets become illegal before the spell resolves, the spell doesn\'t resolve and none of its effects happen. You won\'t get to cast a free spell."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs, such as emerge costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Cathartic Reunion, you must pay those to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'The card that you cast may be an artifact or creature that was returned to your hand by this spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "While you\'re casting your free spell, the Expertise spell is still on the stack. It will be put into its owner\'s graveyard after the free spell is cast. The free spell can\'t target the Expertise card in your graveyard. It can target the Expertise spell on the stack, but the Expertise spell will become an illegal target before the free spell resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If an expertise spell allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half or, if that split card has fuse, both halves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "A card\'s mana value is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner. The mana value is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {1}{U}{U} has mana value 3. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions that could apply to it. A card with no mana cost has a mana value of 0."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Any triggered abilities that trigger while performing the Expertise spell\'s first effect won\'t be put onto the stack until after you\'re done casting your free spell. They\'re put onto the stack at the same time as any abilities that triggered while casting that spell regardless of the order in which those abilities triggered."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Effects that allow you to "cast" a card don\\\'t allow you to play a land card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs, such as emerge costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Cathartic Reunion, you must pay those to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If you control no creatures with power greater than 0 as Rishkar\'s Expertise resolves, you draw no cards, but you may cast a card with mana value 5 or less from your hand without paying its mana cost."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "The greatest power among creatures you control is determined as Rishkar\'s Expertise resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "While you\'re casting your free spell, the Expertise spell is still on the stack. It will be put into its owner\'s graveyard after the free spell is cast. The free spell can\'t target the Expertise card in your graveyard. It can target the Expertise spell on the stack, but the Expertise spell will become an illegal target before the free spell resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "You may cast one of the cards drawn by Rishkar\'s Expertise\'s first effect while performing its second effect."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If an expertise spell allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half or, if that split card has fuse, both halves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "All cards in the Aether Revolt set with triggered revolt abilities use an intervening “if” clause. A permanent you controlled must have left the battlefield earlier in the turn in order for these abilities to trigger; otherwise they do nothing. In other words, there\'s no way to have the ability trigger if no permanent you controlled has left the battlefield that turn, even if you intend to have one do so in response to the triggered ability."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters aren\'t permanents. Paying {E} won\'t satisfy a revolt ability."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Revolt abilities check only whether a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn or not. They don\'t apply multiple times if more than one permanent you controlled left the battlefield. They don\'t check whether the permanent that left the battlefield is still in the zone it moved to."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Revolt abilities don\'t care why the permanent left the battlefield, who caused it to move, or where it moved to. They\'re equally satisfied by an artifact you sacrificed to pay a cost, a creature you controlled that was destroyed by Murder, or an enchantment you returned to your hand with Leave in the Dust."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Tokens that leave the battlefield will satisfy a revolt ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "All eight of the permanents sharing a name must be artifacts. If you control only seven artifacts with the same name and a nonartifact permanent with that same name, you won\'t win the game."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Any abilities that trigger on the token being created won\'t resolve until after Mechanized Production\'s triggered ability has finished resolving entirely and performed its check for eight artifacts with the same name."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied artifact trigger when the artifact token enters the battlefield. The artifact token also has any "this enters the battlefield with" or "as this enters the battlefield" abilities that the copied artifact has.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If Mechanized Production and the enchanted artifact leave the battlefield simultaneously in response to the triggered ability, then the effect creates a token that\'s a copy of the artifact as it last existed on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If the copied artifact has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be zero.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If the copied artifact is a token, the token that\'s created copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created it."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If the copied artifact is copying something else (for example, if the copied artifact is a Sculpting Steel), then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that artifact copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If the enchanted artifact leaves the battlefield in response to Mechanized Production\'s triggered ability but Mechanized Production does not, Mechanized Production is put into its owner\'s graveyard as a state-based action with no enchanted artifact. The triggered ability creates no token, but you can still win the game if you control enough artifacts with the same name."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If you control eight or more artifacts that share a name while you control Mechanized Production, you won\'t win the game yet. You\'ll win the game while resolving its triggered ability during your upkeep."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "The eight artifacts with the same name don\'t have to have the same name as the enchanted artifact. For example, you win the game if you control eight Thopter artifact creature tokens as Mechanized Production\'s ability resolves, even if Mechanized Production isn\'t attached to a Thopter."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what was printed on the original artifact and nothing else (unless that artifact is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that artifact is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its types, color, or so on."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Because improvise isn\'t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Equipment attached to a creature doesn\'t become tapped when that creature becomes tapped, and tapping that Equipment doesn\'t cause the creature to become tapped."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If an artifact you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with improvise will result in the artifact being tapped when you pay the spell\'s costs. You won\'t be able to tap it again for improvise. Similarly, if you sacrifice an artifact to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with improvise, that artifact won\'t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell\'s costs, so you won\'t be able to tap it for improvise."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If you cast a nonartifact spell that requires you to sacrifice a permanent as an additional cost, you may tap that permanent (if it\'s an artifact) for the spell\'s improvise ability before you sacrifice it to pay that cost."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Improvise can\\\'t be used to pay for anything other than the cost of casting the spell. For example, it can\\\'t be used during the resolution of an ability that says "Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}."\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Improvise can\'t pay for {W}, {U}, {B}, {R}, {G}, or {C} mana symbols in a spell\'s total cost."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Improvise doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Multiple instances of improvise are redundant.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Tapping an artifact won\'t cause its abilities to stop applying unless those abilities say so."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "When calculating a spell\'s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Improvise applies after the total cost is calculated."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "When using improvise to cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, first choose the value for X. That choice, plus any cost increases or decreases, will determine the spell\'s total cost. Then you can tap artifacts you control to help pay that cost. For example, if you cast Whir of Invention (a spell with improvise and mana cost {X}{U}{U}{U}) and choose X to be 3, the total cost is {3}{U}{U}{U}. If you tap two artifacts, you\'ll have to pay {1}{U}{U}{U}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Because improvise isn\'t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Equipment attached to a creature doesn\'t become tapped when that creature becomes tapped, and tapping that Equipment doesn\'t cause the creature to become tapped."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If an artifact you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with improvise will result in the artifact being tapped when you pay the spell\'s costs. You won\'t be able to tap it again for improvise. Similarly, if you sacrifice an artifact to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with improvise, that artifact won\'t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell\'s costs, so you won\'t be able to tap it for improvise."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Improvise can\'t be used to pay for anything other than the cost of casting the spell. For example, it can\'t be used during the resolution of an ability that says “Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.”"}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Improvise can\'t pay for {W}, {U}, {B}, {R}, {G}, or {C} mana symbols in a spell\'s total cost."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Improvise doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Tapping an artifact won\'t cause its abilities to stop applying unless those abilities say so."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "When calculating a spell\'s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Improvise applies after the total cost is calculated."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Creatures of the chosen type that enter the battlefield at the same time as Metallic Mimic won\'t enter with an additional +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Even though Metallic Mimic is a Shapeshifter, other Shapeshifter creatures you control won\'t get a +1/+1 counter unless you chose Shapeshifter as Metallic Mimic entered the battlefield. If you do, that creature must be entering the battlefield as a Shapeshifter to get a +1/+1 counter. It won\'t get a +1/+1 counter if it enters the battlefield as a copy of a non-Shapeshifter creature."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "The choice of creature type is made as Metallic Mimic enters the battlefield. Players can\'t respond to this choice. Metallic Mimic\'s second ability starts applying immediately."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'You must choose an existing creature type. "Artifact" and "Vehicle" aren\\\'t creature types.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Each creature you control has Rishkar\'s mana ability as long as that creature has any kind of counter on it. The effect isn\'t limited to those with +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Rishkar can be a target of its own triggered ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "You can\'t target the same creature twice to have one recipient get two +1/+1 counters."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If Scrap Trawler and another artifact you control are put into a graveyard at the same time, Scrap Trawler\'s ability triggers for each of them."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If an artifact is a copy of another artifact with greater mana value, such as Sculpting Steel copying an artifact with mana value 4, Scrap Trawler\'s ability can target that artifact card in your graveyard when that artifact is put into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "The target artifact card must have a lesser mana value than the artifact that caused Scrap Trawler\'s ability to trigger by being put into a graveyard. Use the artifact\'s mana value as it last existed on the battlefield to determine what may be returned."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "While on the battlefield or in a graveyard, {X} in an object\'s mana cost is 0."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If Yahenni and a creature an opponent controls die simultaneously (perhaps because they fought or were in combat together), Yahenni won\'t be on the battlefield as its triggered ability resolves. It can\'t be saved by the +1/+1 counter that would have been put on it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Lifecrafter\'s Bestiary\'s second triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. The ability will resolve even if that spell is countered."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "The draw step is after the upkeep step, so you\'ll scry 1 before you draw for the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "While resolving Lifecrafter\'s Bestiary\'s second triggered ability, you can\'t pay {G} multiple times to draw multiple cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Servo Schematic\'s ability doesn\'t allow you to sacrifice it whenever you\'d like. You must find another way to get Servo Schematic into the graveyard."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Skyship Plunderer\'s triggered ability can target any permanent or player, regardless of which player was dealt combat damage."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Skyship Plunderer\'s triggered ability gives only one counter of each kind. It doesn\'t double the number of each kind of counter. For example, if a creature has two +1/+1 counters and a charge counter on it, it gets one +1/+1 counter and one charge counter."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "To give a counter is to put a counter on a permanent or to have a player get a counter. Effects that interact with a player getting counters or counters being placed on permanents interact with Skyship Plunderer\'s triggered ability."}]', "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'A Vehicle enchanted by Tezzeret’s Touch becomes a 5/5 creature. Crewing it won’t change its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'An artifact creature enchanted by Tezzeret’s Touch becomes 5/5 instead of its normal power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'An artifact that becomes a creature due to Tezzeret’s Touch can’t attack unless you’ve controlled it continuously since your turn began. It doesn’t matter whether or not it was a creature at that time.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If Tezzeret’s Touch becomes unattached from an artifact that’s attacking or blocking, that artifact will be removed from combat unless it’s normally a creature or another effect such as a crew ability is also making it a creature.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If the enchanted artifact is an Equipment, it becomes unattached and it can’t be attached to anything for as long as it remains a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'A Vehicle targeted by the emblem’s ability becomes a 5/5 creature. Crewing it won’t change its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'An artifact creature targeted by the emblem’s ability becomes 5/5 instead of its normal power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'An artifact that becomes a creature due to the emblem’s ability can’t attack unless you’ve controlled it continuously since your turn began. It doesn’t matter whether or not it was a creature at that time.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an Equipment becomes a creature, it becomes unattached and it can’t be attached to a creature.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'The effect of the emblem’s triggered ability lasts indefinitely.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'The value of X for Tezzeret’s second ability is determined only as the ability resolves. It won’t change later in the turn if the number of artifacts you control changes.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'A card’s converted mana cost is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner. The converted mana cost is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {1}{U}{U} has converted mana cost 3. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions that could apply to it. A card with no mana cost has a converted mana cost of 0.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Any triggered abilities that trigger while performing the Expertise spell’s first effect won’t be put onto the stack until after you’re done casting your free spell. They’re put onto the stack at the same time as any abilities that triggered while casting that spell regardless of the order in which those abilities triggered.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Effects that allow you to “cast” a card don’t allow you to play a land card.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If a creature’s toughness is reduced to 0 or less by Yahenni’s Expertise, that creature is still on the battlefield as you cast your free spell. It can be the target of that spell, although it will become an illegal target before that spell resolves. If it has any abilities that trigger on the spell being cast, those abilities will trigger.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs, such as emerge costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Cathartic Reunion, you must pay those to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'While you’re casting your free spell, the Expertise spell is still on the stack. It will be put into its owner’s graveyard after the free spell is cast. The free spell can’t target the Expertise card in your graveyard. It can target the Expertise spell on the stack, but the Expertise spell will become an illegal target before the free spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The converted mana cost of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If an expertise spell allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half or, if that split card has fuse, both halves.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'A card’s converted mana cost is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner. The converted mana cost is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {1}{U}{U} has converted mana cost 3. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions that could apply to it. A card with no mana cost has a converted mana cost of 0.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Any triggered abilities that trigger while performing the Expertise spell’s first effect won’t be put onto the stack until after you’re done casting your free spell. They’re put onto the stack at the same time as any abilities that triggered while casting that spell regardless of the order in which those abilities triggered.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Effects that allow you to “cast” a card don’t allow you to play a land card.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If the Expertise spell you cast has any targets, and those targets become illegal before the spell resolves, the spell doesn’t resolve and none of its effects happen. You won’t get to cast a free spell.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs, such as emerge costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Cathartic Reunion, you must pay those to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Kari Zev’s Expertise can target any creature or Vehicle, even one that you already control or that is already untapped.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'While you’re casting your free spell, the Expertise spell is still on the stack. It will be put into its owner’s graveyard after the free spell is cast. The free spell can’t target the Expertise card in your graveyard. It can target the Expertise spell on the stack, but the Expertise spell will become an illegal target before the free spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The converted mana cost of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If an expertise spell allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half or, if that split card has fuse, both halves.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'A card’s converted mana cost is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner. The converted mana cost is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {1}{U}{U} has converted mana cost 3. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions that could apply to it. A card with no mana cost has a converted mana cost of 0.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Any triggered abilities that trigger while performing the Expertise spell’s first effect won’t be put onto the stack until after you’re done casting your free spell. They’re put onto the stack at the same time as any abilities that triggered while casting that spell regardless of the order in which those abilities triggered.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Effects that allow you to “cast” a card don’t allow you to play a land card.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs, such as emerge costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Cathartic Reunion, you must pay those to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'While you’re casting your free spell, the Expertise spell is still on the stack. It will be put into its owner’s graveyard after the free spell is cast. The free spell can’t target the Expertise card in your graveyard. It can target the Expertise spell on the stack, but the Expertise spell will become an illegal target before the free spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The converted mana cost of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If an expertise spell allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half or, if that split card has fuse, both halves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'A nonland permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "The amount of life gained from Ajani\'s second ability is equal to power of the creature as it last existed on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "All cards in the Aether Revolt set with triggered revolt abilities use an intervening “if” clause. A permanent you controlled must have left the battlefield earlier in the turn in order for these abilities to trigger; otherwise they do nothing. In other words, there\'s no way to have the ability trigger if no permanent you controlled has left the battlefield that turn, even if you intend to have one do so in response to the triggered ability."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters aren\'t permanents. Paying {E} won\'t satisfy a revolt ability."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If a permanent put onto the battlefield this way has an ability that triggers at the beginning of your end step, it won\'t trigger during this end step."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If the revealed card is not a permanent card or if you choose not to put it onto the battlefield, you may put it on the bottom of your library. If you don\'t, it remains on top of your library."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Revolt abilities check only whether a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn or not. They don\'t apply multiple times if more than one permanent you controlled left the battlefield. They don\'t check whether the permanent that left the battlefield is still in the zone it moved to."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Revolt abilities don\'t care why the permanent left the battlefield, who caused it to move, or where it moved to. They\'re equally satisfied by an artifact you sacrificed to pay a cost, a creature you controlled that was destroyed by Murder, or an enchantment you returned to your hand with Leave in the Dust."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Tokens that leave the battlefield will satisfy a revolt ability.\'}]', "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'All cards in the Aether Revolt set with triggered revolt abilities use an intervening “if” clause. A permanent you controlled must have left the battlefield earlier in the turn in order for these abilities to trigger; otherwise they do nothing. In other words, there’s no way to have the ability trigger if no permanent you controlled has left the battlefield that turn, even if you intend to have one do so in response to the triggered ability.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters aren’t permanents. Paying {E} won’t satisfy a revolt ability.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If a card in your graveyard has no mana symbols in its upper right corner (because it’s a land card, for example), its converted mana cost is 0.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If the mana cost of a card in your graveyard includes {X}, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Revolt abilities check only whether a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn or not. They don’t apply multiple times if more than one permanent you controlled left the battlefield. They don’t check whether the permanent that left the battlefield is still in the zone it moved to.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Revolt abilities don’t care why the permanent left the battlefield, who caused it to move, or where it moved to. They’re equally satisfied by an artifact you sacrificed to pay a cost, a creature you controlled that was destroyed by Murder, or an enchantment you returned to your hand with Leave in the Dust.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'The converted mana cost of a card in your graveyard is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner. The converted mana cost is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {1}{U}{U} has converted mana cost 3.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Tokens that leave the battlefield will satisfy a revolt ability.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You can target any permanent card in your graveyard with converted mana cost 2 or less, not just one that was put there from the battlefield this turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Abilities that create replacement effects, such as a permanent entering the battlefield tapped or with counters on it, can’t be targeted. Abilities that apply “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” are also replacement effects and can’t be targeted.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Activated abilities are written in the form “Cost: Effect.” Some keyword abilities, such as equip and crew, are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder texts.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'An activated mana ability is one that adds mana to a player’s mana pool as it resolves, doesn’t have a target, and isn’t a loyalty ability. A triggered mana ability is one that adds mana to a player’s mana pool and triggers on an activated mana ability.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If you counter a delayed triggered ability that triggers at the beginning of the “next” occurrence of a specified step or phase, that ability won’t trigger again the following time that phase or step occurs.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Triggered abilities use the word “when,” “whenever,” or “at.” They’re often written as “[Trigger condition], [effect].” Some keyword abilities, such as prowess and fabricate, are triggered abilities and will have “when,” “whenever,” or “at” in their reminder text.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'There are many important moments in the story, but the most crucial—called “story spotlights”—are shown on cards. These cards have the Planeswalker symbol in their text box; this symbol has no effect on gameplay. You can read more about these events in the official Magic fiction at http://www.mtgstory.com.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Abilities that trigger “whenever you get one or more {E},” such as that of Fabrication Module from the Kaladesh set, trigger only once as Aetherwind Basker’s triggered ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They’re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters aren’t mana. They don’t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can’t give you energy counters.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'The triggered ability triggers both when Aetherwind Basker enters the battlefield and whenever it attacks. You don’t have to choose only one.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You can’t pay more energy counters than you have.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': '{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Activated abilities are written in the form “Cost: Effect.” Some keyword abilities, such as equip and crew, are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder texts.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'An ability whose cost is simply {0} can be activated as many times as you’d like. Each activation causes Crackdown Construct’s ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'An activated mana ability is one that adds mana to a player’s mana pool as it resolves, doesn’t have a target, and isn’t a loyalty ability.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Crackdown Construct’s ability doesn’t trigger if you activate an ability of an artifact or creature card not on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'After Aethergeode Miner returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the creature that was exiled. It won’t be in combat or have any additional abilities it may have had when it was exiled. Any +1/+1 counters on it or Auras attached to it are removed, and any Equipment will no longer be attached.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They’re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters aren’t mana. They don’t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can’t give you energy counters.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You can’t pay more energy counters than you have.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': '{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'After the enchanted creature is exiled, Caught in the Brights is put into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If Caught in the Brights leaves the battlefield in response to its triggered ability, the resolving ability will exile the creature Caught in the Brights was enchanting as it left the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'After the permanent returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the permanent that was exiled. It won’t have any additional abilities it may have had when it was exiled. Any +1/+1 counters on it or Auras attached to it are removed, and any Equipment will no longer be attached.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If a creature token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and will not return to the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'All attackers are chosen at once. You can’t attack with Mobile Garrison, untap a tapped creature, and then attack with that creature.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Untapping an attacking creature doesn’t remove it from combat.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Any untapped creature you control can be tapped to pay a crew cost, even one that just came under your control.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Creatures that crew a Vehicle aren’t attached to it or related in any other way. Effects that affect the Vehicle, such as by destroying it or giving it a +1/+1 counter, don’t affect the creatures that crewed it.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Each Vehicle is printed with a power and toughness, but it’s not a creature. If it becomes a creature (most likely through its crew ability), it will have that power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'For a Vehicle to be able to attack, it must be a creature as the declare attackers step begins, so the latest you can activate its crew ability to attack with it is during the beginning of combat step. For a Vehicle to be able to block, it must be a creature as the declare blockers step begins, so the latest you can activate its crew ability to block with it is during the declare attackers step. In either case, players may take actions after the crew ability resolves but before the Vehicle has been declared as an attacking or blocking creature.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'If a permanent becomes a copy of a Vehicle, the copy won’t be a creature, even if the Vehicle it’s copying has become an artifact creature.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'If an effect causes a Vehicle to become an artifact creature with a specified power and toughness, that effect overwrites the Vehicle’s printed power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Once a Vehicle becomes a creature, it behaves exactly like any other artifact creature. It can’t attack unless you’ve controlled it continuously since your turn began, it can block if it’s untapped, it can be tapped to pay a Vehicle’s crew cost, and so on.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Once a player announces that they are activating a crew ability, no player may take other actions until the ability has been paid for. Notably, players can’t try to stop the ability by changing a creature’s power or by removing or tapping a creature.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Vehicle is an artifact type, not a creature type. A Vehicle that’s crewed won’t normally have any creature type.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'When a Vehicle becomes a creature, that doesn’t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. The permanent was already on the battlefield; it only changed its types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'You may activate a crew ability of a Vehicle even if it’s already an artifact creature. Doing so has no effect on the Vehicle. It doesn’t change its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'You may tap more creatures than necessary to activate a crew ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'All cards in the Aether Revolt set with triggered revolt abilities use an intervening "if" clause. A permanent you controlled must have left the battlefield earlier in the turn in order for these abilities to trigger; otherwise they do nothing. In other words, there\\\'s no way to have the ability trigger if no permanent you controlled has left the battlefield that turn, even if you intend to have one do so in response to the triggered ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters aren\'t permanents. Paying {E} won\'t satisfy a revolt ability."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Revolt abilities check only whether a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn or not. They don\'t apply multiple times if more than one permanent you controlled left the battlefield. They don\'t check whether the permanent that left the battlefield is still in the zone it moved to."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Revolt abilities don\'t care why the permanent left the battlefield, who caused it to move, or where it moved to. They\'re equally satisfied by an artifact you sacrificed to pay a cost, a creature you controlled that was destroyed by Murder, or an enchantment you returned to your hand with Leave in the Dust."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Tokens that leave the battlefield will satisfy a revolt ability.\'}]', "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'All cards in the Aether Revolt set with triggered revolt abilities use an intervening “if” clause. A permanent you controlled must have left the battlefield earlier in the turn in order for these abilities to trigger; otherwise they do nothing. In other words, there’s no way to have the ability trigger if no permanent you controlled has left the battlefield that turn, even if you intend to have one do so in response to the triggered ability.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters aren’t permanents. Paying {E} won’t satisfy a revolt ability.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Revolt abilities check only whether a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn or not. They don’t apply multiple times if more than one permanent you controlled left the battlefield. They don’t check whether the permanent that left the battlefield is still in the zone it moved to.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Revolt abilities don’t care why the permanent left the battlefield, who caused it to move, or where it moved to. They’re equally satisfied by an artifact you sacrificed to pay a cost, a creature you controlled that was destroyed by Murder, or an enchantment you returned to your hand with Leave in the Dust.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Tokens that leave the battlefield will satisfy a revolt ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'All of the exiled cards are put onto the battlefield at the same time.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If a player controls no permanents destroyed this way, that player reveals no cards from their library and doesn’t shuffle it.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If a player’s library no longer contains an artifact or creature card when instructed to reveal cards, that player reveals the entire library, exiles no cards, and then shuffles it.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an artifact or creature is targeted but not destroyed (perhaps because it gained indestructible or became an illegal target), it doesn’t count as one of the artifacts or creatures destroyed this way. An artifact or creature that’s destroyed but put into a zone other than a graveyard (such as a player’s commander in the Commander variant) does count.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'While revealing cards, a player stops as soon as they reveal a card that’s an artifact or a creature (or both). That player doesn’t choose one type.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Although Ragavan is attacking, it was never declared as an attacking creature (for the purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'The delayed triggered ability that exiles Ragavan triggers at end of combat even if Kari Zev is no longer on the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "You choose which opponent or opposing planeswalker Ragavan is attacking as you create the token. It doesn\'t have to be the same player or planeswalker Kari Zev is attacking."}]', "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'An Implement’s last ability triggers no matter why it’s put into a graveyard from the battlefield. You don’t have to activate its first ability.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If you activate an Implement’s first ability, you’ll draw a card from its second ability before the first ability resolves. If the first ability has a target, you need a legal target to activate that ability, and you choose that target before seeing what card you’ll draw.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Any +1/+1 counters on Untethered Express remain on it when it stops being a creature.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Any untapped creature you control can be tapped to pay a crew cost, even one that just came under your control.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Creatures that crew a Vehicle aren’t attached to it or related in any other way. Effects that affect the Vehicle, such as by destroying it or giving it a +1/+1 counter, don’t affect the creatures that crewed it.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Each Vehicle is printed with a power and toughness, but it’s not a creature. If it becomes a creature (most likely through its crew ability), it will have that power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'For a Vehicle to be able to attack, it must be a creature as the declare attackers step begins, so the latest you can activate its crew ability to attack with it is during the beginning of combat step. For a Vehicle to be able to block, it must be a creature as the declare blockers step begins, so the latest you can activate its crew ability to block with it is during the declare attackers step. In either case, players may take actions after the crew ability resolves but before the Vehicle has been declared as an attacking or blocking creature.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'If a permanent becomes a copy of a Vehicle, the copy won’t be a creature, even if the Vehicle it’s copying has become an artifact creature.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'If an effect causes a Vehicle to become an artifact creature with a specified power and toughness, that effect overwrites the Vehicle’s printed power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Once a Vehicle becomes a creature, it behaves exactly like any other artifact creature. It can’t attack unless you’ve controlled it continuously since your turn began, it can block if it’s untapped, it can be tapped to pay a Vehicle’s crew cost, and so on.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Once a player announces that they are activating a crew ability, no player may take other actions until the ability has been paid for. Notably, players can’t try to stop the ability by changing a creature’s power or by removing or tapping a creature.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Vehicle is an artifact type, not a creature type. A Vehicle that’s crewed won’t normally have any creature type.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'When a Vehicle becomes a creature, that doesn’t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. The permanent was already on the battlefield; it only changed its types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'You may activate a crew ability of a Vehicle even if it’s already an artifact creature. Doing so has no effect on the Vehicle. It doesn’t change its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'You may tap more creatures than necessary to activate a crew ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied artifact will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this artifact] enters the battlefield” or “[this artifact] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen artifact will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If the copied artifact has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If the copied artifact is a token, the token created with Cogwork Assembler copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that that created that token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If the copied artifact is copying something else (for example, if the copied artifact is a Sculpting Steel), then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that artifact copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what was printed on the original artifact and nothing else (unless that artifact is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that artifact is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on."}]', "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled artifacts will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Any counters on the exiled artifacts will cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If Consulate Crackdown leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, no artifacts will be exiled.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an artifact token is exiled, it ceases to exist. It won’t be returned to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if Consulate Crackdown’s owner leaves the game, the exiled cards will return to the battlefield. Because the one-shot effect that returns the cards isn’t an ability that goes on the stack, it won’t cease to exist along with the leaving player’s spells and abilities on the stack.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'The exiled cards return to the battlefield immediately after Consulate Crackdown leaves the battlefield. Nothing happens between the two events, including state-based actions. If Consulate Crackdown exiles multiple artifacts, those cards all return to the battlefield at the same time.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'There are many important moments in the story, but the most crucial—called “story spotlights”—are shown on cards. These cards have the Planeswalker symbol in their text box; this symbol has no effect on gameplay. You can read more about these events in the official Magic fiction at http://www.mtgstory.com.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If Thopter Arrest leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the target permanent won’t be exiled.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if Thopter Arrest’s owner leaves the game, the exiled card will return to the battlefield. Because the one-shot effect that returns the card isn’t an ability that goes on the stack, it won’t cease to exist along with the leaving player’s spells and abilities on the stack.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'The exiled card returns to the battlefield immediately after Thopter Arrest leaves the battlefield. Nothing happens between the two events, including state-based actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Because improvise isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Equipment attached to a creature doesn’t become tapped when that creature becomes tapped, and tapping that Equipment doesn’t cause the creature to become tapped.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If Sly Requisitioner is put into a graveyard at the same time as a nontoken artifact you control, its ability triggers.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an artifact you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with improvise will result in the artifact being tapped when you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for improvise. Similarly, if you sacrifice an artifact to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with improvise, that artifact won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for improvise.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Improvise can’t be used to pay for anything other than the cost of casting the spell. For example, it can’t be used during the resolution of an ability that says “Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.”'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Improvise can’t pay for {W}, {U}, {B}, {R}, {G}, or {C} mana symbols in a spell’s total cost.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Improvise doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or converted mana cost.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Tapping an artifact won’t cause its abilities to stop applying unless those abilities say so.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Improvise applies after the total cost is calculated.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Because improvise isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Equipment attached to a creature doesn’t become tapped when that creature becomes tapped, and tapping that Equipment doesn’t cause the creature to become tapped.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an artifact you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with improvise will result in the artifact being tapped when you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for improvise. Similarly, if you sacrifice an artifact to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with improvise, that artifact won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for improvise.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If the target creature becomes an illegal target, Battle at the Bridge doesn’t resolve and none of its effects happen. You won’t gain life.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Improvise can’t be used to pay for anything other than the cost of casting the spell. For example, it can’t be used during the resolution of an ability that says “Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.”'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Improvise can’t pay for {W}, {U}, {B}, {R}, {G}, or {C} mana symbols in a spell’s total cost.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Improvise doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or mana value.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Tapping an artifact won’t cause its abilities to stop applying unless those abilities say so.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Improvise applies after the total cost is calculated.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'When using improvise to cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, first choose the value for X. That choice, plus any cost increases or decreases, will determine the spell’s total cost. Then you can tap artifacts you control to help pay that cost. For example, if you cast Whir of Invention (a spell with improvise and mana cost {X}{U}{U}{U}) and choose X to be 3, the total cost is {3}{U}{U}{U}. If you tap two artifacts, you’ll have to pay {1}{U}{U}{U}.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'There are many important moments in the story, but the most crucial—called “story spotlights”—are shown on cards. These cards have the Planeswalker symbol in their text box; this symbol has no effect on gameplay. You can read more about these events in the official Magic fiction at http://www.mtgstory.com.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Because improvise isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Equipment attached to a creature doesn’t become tapped when that creature becomes tapped, and tapping that Equipment doesn’t cause the creature to become tapped.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an artifact you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with improvise will result in the artifact being tapped when you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for improvise. Similarly, if you sacrifice an artifact to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with improvise, that artifact won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for improvise.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If, during your declare attackers step, Barricade Breaker is tapped or is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having it attack, you aren’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Improvise can’t be used to pay for anything other than the cost of casting the spell. For example, it can’t be used during the resolution of an ability that says “Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.”'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Improvise can’t pay for {W}, {U}, {B}, {R}, {G}, or {C} mana symbols in a spell’s total cost.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Improvise doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or mana value.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Tapping an artifact won’t cause its abilities to stop applying unless those abilities say so.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Improvise applies after the total cost is calculated.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Because improvise isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Equipment attached to a creature doesn’t become tapped when that creature becomes tapped, and tapping that Equipment doesn’t cause the creature to become tapped.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an artifact you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with improvise will result in the artifact being tapped when you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for improvise. Similarly, if you sacrifice an artifact to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with improvise, that artifact won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for improvise.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Improvise can’t be used to pay for anything other than the cost of casting the spell. For example, it can’t be used during the resolution of an ability that says “Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.”'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Improvise can’t pay for {W}, {U}, {B}, {R}, {G}, or {C} mana symbols in a spell’s total cost.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Improvise doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or converted mana cost.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Tapping an artifact won’t cause its abilities to stop applying unless those abilities say so.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Improvise applies after the total cost is calculated.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'When using improvise to cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, first choose the value for X. That choice, plus any cost increases or decreases, will determine the spell’s total cost. Then you can tap artifacts you control to help pay that cost. For example, if you cast Whir of Invention (a spell with improvise and mana cost {X}{U}{U}{U}) and choose X to be 3, the total cost is {3}{U}{U}{U}. If you tap two artifacts, you’ll have to pay {1}{U}{U}{U}.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Because improvise isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Equipment attached to a creature doesn’t become tapped when that creature becomes tapped, and tapping that Equipment doesn’t cause the creature to become tapped.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an artifact you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with improvise will result in the artifact being tapped when you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for improvise. Similarly, if you sacrifice an artifact to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with improvise, that artifact won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for improvise.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Improvise can’t be used to pay for anything other than the cost of casting the spell. For example, it can’t be used during the resolution of an ability that says “Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.”'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Improvise can’t pay for {W}, {U}, {B}, {R}, {G}, or {C} mana symbols in a spell’s total cost.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Improvise doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or converted mana cost.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Tapping an artifact won’t cause its abilities to stop applying unless those abilities say so.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Improvise applies after the total cost is calculated.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Because improvise isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Equipment attached to a creature doesn’t become tapped when that creature becomes tapped, and tapping that Equipment doesn’t cause the creature to become tapped.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an artifact you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with improvise will result in the artifact being tapped when you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for improvise. Similarly, if you sacrifice an artifact to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with improvise, that artifact won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for improvise.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Improvise can’t be used to pay for anything other than the cost of casting the spell. For example, it can’t be used during the resolution of an ability that says “Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.”'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Improvise can’t pay for {W}, {U}, {B}, {R}, {G}, or {C} mana symbols in a spell’s total cost.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Improvise doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or mana value.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Tapping an artifact won’t cause its abilities to stop applying unless those abilities say so.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Improvise applies after the total cost is calculated.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Chandra’s Revolution can target a land that’s already tapped. That land won’t untap during its controller’s next untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Dawnfeather Eagle’s triggered ability affects itself.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'The set of creatures affected by Dawnfeather Eagle’s triggered ability is determined as the ability resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn and permanents you control that become creatures later in the turn won’t get +1/+1 or gain vigilance.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Each card that returns to the battlefield will be a new object with no connection to the creature that was exiled. It won’t be in combat or have any additional abilities it may have had when it was exiled. Any +1/+1 counters on it or Auras attached to it are removed, and any Equipment will no longer be attached.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If a creature token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and will not return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If each target creature is an illegal target as Illusionist’s Stratagem resolves, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t draw a card.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If you choose two target creatures and one is an illegal target as Illusionist’s Stratagem resolves, you’ll exile the other, return it, and draw a card.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You may cast Illusionist’s Stratagem without any targets if you wish to just draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Each opponent chooses a permanent to sacrifice from among the creatures and planeswalkers that player controls. You don’t choose which type of permanent the player has to sacrifice.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an opponent can’t sacrifice a creature or planeswalker, that player still discards a card if able. You still return a creature or planeswalker card to your hand if able, even if no opponent sacrifices a permanent and/or discards a card. You still draw a card even if you can’t return a card to your hand.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If two or more Dark Intimations are in your graveyard when you cast a Bolas planeswalker spell, you’ll exile each of them and that planeswalker will enter the battlefield with that many additional loyalty counters.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'The draconic Planeswalker Nicol Bolas is not featured in the Aether Revolt set. He must be up to something nefarious elsewhere.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'When Dark Intimations resolves, first the player whose turn it is (if that player is an opponent) chooses which creature or planeswalker they will sacrifice, then each other opponent in turn order does the same, then all chosen permanents are sacrificed at the same time. Then each opponent in the same order chooses a card in their hand without revealing it, then all chosen cards are discarded at the same time.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You choose the creature or planeswalker card to return to your hand while Dark Intimations is resolving. No player may take actions between the time you choose one and the time you put it into your hand.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'There are many important moments in the story, but the most crucial—called “story spotlights”—are shown on cards. These cards have the Planeswalker symbol in their text box; this symbol has no effect on gameplay. You can read more about these events in the official Magic fiction at http://www.mtgstory.com.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Efficient Construction’s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. The ability will resolve even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They’re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters aren’t mana. They don’t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can’t give you energy counters.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If Shielded Aether Thief somehow blocks more than one creature at once, you get only one {E}.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You can’t pay more energy counters than you have.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': '{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They’re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters aren’t mana. They don’t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can’t give you energy counters.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If the target creature becomes an illegal target, the spell doesn’t resolve and none of its effects happen. You won’t get {E}{E}.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You can’t pay more energy counters than you have.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': '{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They’re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters aren’t mana. They don’t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can’t give you energy counters.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If you have only one {E}, you can’t pay it even if you want to.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If you have {E}{E}, you have to pay it, even if you don’t want to.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You can’t pay more energy counters than you have.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': '{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They’re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters aren’t mana. They don’t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can’t give you energy counters.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Gonti’s Machinations’s second ability causes the opposing team to lose a total of 6 life.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, damage and life loss happen to individual players, and the result affects the team’s life total. Combat damage is assigned and dealt to specific players. If your teammate is dealt damage or otherwise loses life, Gonti’s Machinations doesn’t trigger, even though your life total went down.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'The triggered ability gives you at most one energy counter each turn, regardless of how much life you lost.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You can’t pay more energy counters than you have.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': '{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They’re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters aren’t mana. They don’t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can’t give you energy counters.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Some triggered abilities state that you “may pay” a certain amount of {E}. You can’t pay that amount multiple times to multiply the effect. You simply choose whether or not to pay that amount of {E} as the ability resolves, and no player may take actions to try to stop the ability’s effect after you make your choice.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'The first triggered ability triggers both when Glint-Sleeve Siphoner enters the battlefield and whenever it attacks. You don’t have to choose only one.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You can’t pay more energy counters than you have.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': '{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They’re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters aren’t mana. They don’t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can’t give you energy counters.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Some triggered abilities state that you “may pay” a certain amount of {E}. You can’t pay that amount multiple times to multiply the effect. You simply choose whether or not to pay that amount of {E} as the ability resolves, and no player may take actions to try to stop the ability’s effect after you make your choice.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You can’t pay more energy counters than you have.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You untap all creatures you control, including ones that aren’t attacking.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': '{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They’re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters aren’t mana. They don’t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can’t give you energy counters.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Some triggered abilities state that you “may pay” a certain amount of {E}. You can’t pay that amount multiple times to multiply the effect. You simply choose whether or not to pay that amount of {E} as the ability resolves, and no player may take actions to try to stop the ability’s effect after you make your choice.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You can’t pay more energy counters than you have.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': '{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They’re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters aren’t mana. They don’t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can’t give you energy counters.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'The amount of {E} you get is determined as Peema Aether-Seer’s first ability resolves. If the greatest power among creatures you control is somehow negative, you don’t get or lose any {E}.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'The controller of the target creature chooses which attacking creature that creature blocks.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'The target creature blocks only if it’s able to do so as the declare blockers step begins. If, at that time, the creature is tapped, it’s affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t block, or no creatures are attacking its controller or a planeswalker controlled by that player, then it doesn’t block. If there’s a cost associated with having the creature block, the player isn’t forced to pay that cost. If that cost isn’t paid, the creature won’t block.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You can’t pay more energy counters than you have.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': '{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They’re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters aren’t mana. They don’t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can’t give you energy counters.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You can’t pay more energy counters than you have.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': '{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Any untapped creature you control can be tapped to pay a crew cost, even one that just came under your control.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Creatures that crew a Vehicle aren’t attached to it or related in any other way. Effects that affect the Vehicle, such as by destroying it or giving it a +1/+1 counter, don’t affect the creatures that crewed it.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Each Vehicle is printed with a power and toughness, but it’s not a creature. If it becomes a creature (most likely through its crew ability), it will have that power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'For a Vehicle to be able to attack, it must be a creature as the declare attackers step begins, so the latest you can activate its crew ability to attack with it is during the beginning of combat step. For a Vehicle to be able to block, it must be a creature as the declare blockers step begins, so the latest you can activate its crew ability to block with it is during the declare attackers step. In either case, players may take actions after the crew ability resolves but before the Vehicle has been declared as an attacking or blocking creature.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'If a permanent becomes a copy of a Vehicle, the copy won’t be a creature, even if the Vehicle it’s copying has become an artifact creature.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'If an effect causes a Vehicle to become an artifact creature with a specified power and toughness, that effect overwrites the Vehicle’s printed power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Once a Vehicle becomes a creature, it behaves exactly like any other artifact creature. It can’t attack unless you’ve controlled it continuously since your turn began, it can block if it’s untapped, it can be tapped to pay a Vehicle’s crew cost, and so on.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Once a player announces that they are activating a crew ability, no player may take other actions until the ability has been paid for. Notably, players can’t try to stop the ability by changing a creature’s power or by removing or tapping a creature.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Vehicle is an artifact type, not a creature type. A Vehicle that’s crewed won’t normally have any creature type.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'When a Vehicle becomes a creature, that doesn’t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. The permanent was already on the battlefield; it only changed its types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'You may activate a crew ability of a Vehicle even if it’s already an artifact creature. Doing so has no effect on the Vehicle. It doesn’t change its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'You may tap more creatures than necessary to activate a crew ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters are a kind of counter that a player may have. They’re not associated with specific permanents. (Other kinds of counters that players may have include poison and experience.)'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters aren’t mana. They don’t go away as steps, phases, and turns end, and effects that add mana “of any type” to your mana pool can’t give you energy counters.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an effect says you get one or more {E}, you get that many energy counters. To pay one or more {E}, you lose that many energy counters. Any effects that interact with counters a player gets, has, or loses can interact with energy counters.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Keep careful track of how many energy counters each player has. You may do so by keeping a running count on paper, by using a die, or by any other clear and mutually agreeable method.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You can’t pay more energy counters than you have.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': '{E} is the energy symbol. It represents one energy counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters aren’t permanents. Paying {E} won’t satisfy a revolt ability.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If Decommission destroys a permanent you control, it will enable its own revolt ability and you’ll gain 3 life.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If the target artifact or enchantment becomes an illegal target, Decommission doesn’t resolve and none of its effects happen. You won’t gain life.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Revolt abilities check only whether a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn or not. They don’t apply multiple times if more than one permanent you controlled left the battlefield. They don’t check whether the permanent that left the battlefield is still in the zone it moved to.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Revolt abilities don’t care why the permanent left the battlefield, who caused it to move, or where it moved to. They’re equally satisfied by an artifact you sacrificed to pay a cost, a creature you controlled that was destroyed by Murder, or an enchantment you returned to your hand with Leave in the Dust.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Tokens that leave the battlefield will satisfy a revolt ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Energy counters aren’t permanents. Paying {E} won’t satisfy a revolt ability.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Revolt abilities check only whether a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn or not. They don’t apply multiple times if more than one permanent you controlled left the battlefield. They don’t check whether the permanent that left the battlefield is still in the zone it moved to.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Revolt abilities don’t care why the permanent left the battlefield, who caused it to move, or where it moved to. They’re equally satisfied by an artifact you sacrificed to pay a cost, a creature you controlled that was destroyed by Murder, or an enchantment you returned to your hand with Leave in the Dust.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Tokens that leave the battlefield will satisfy a revolt ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Exquisite Archangel’s effect applies any time you would lose the game, even if you’re not losing due to your life total being 0 or less. If you would have lost the game because you tried to draw from an empty library, you won’t lose again until you try to draw again and still can’t do so.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Exquisite Archangel’s effect does nothing if you concede the game. A player who concedes leaves the game.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'For your life total to become your starting life total (normally 20), you gain or lose the appropriate amount of life. For example, if your life total is -4 when Exquisite Archangel’s ability applies, it will cause you to gain 24 life; alternatively, if your life total is 40 when it applies, it will cause you to lose 20 life. Other cards that interact with life gain or life loss will interact with this effect accordingly.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If Exquisite Archangel is dealt lethal damage at the same time that you’re dealt damage that brings your life total to 0 or less, its effect applies and your life total becomes equal to your starting life total. You choose whether Exquisite Archangel is moved to exile or to your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an effect says that you can’t lose the game, Exquisite Archangel’s effect doesn’t apply.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an effect states that an opponent wins the game, Exquisite Archangel’s ability doesn’t apply.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If you control two Exquisite Archangels, you choose which one’s effect applies. The other’s effect won’t be applicable after that until the next time you would lose the game.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Exquisite Archangel’s ability causes the team’s life total to become the team’s starting life total (normally 30), but only you actually gain or lose life.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'For the ability to trigger, Reckless Racer has to actually change from untapped to tapped. If an effect attempts to tap it, but it was already tapped at the time, this ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'This is a triggered ability, not an activated ability. It doesn’t allow you to tap Reckless Racer whenever you want; rather, you need some other way of tapping it, such as by attacking or crewing a Vehicle.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'For the ability to trigger, Renegade Wheelsmith has to actually change from untapped to tapped. If an effect attempts to tap it, but it was already tapped at the time, this ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'This is a triggered ability, not an activated ability. It doesn’t allow you to tap Renegade Wheelsmith whenever you want; rather, you need some other way of tapping it, such as by attacking or crewing a Vehicle.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Fourth Bridge Prowler can be the target of its own ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Ice Over may target and may enchant an untapped creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If Aerial Modification becomes unattached from a Vehicle that’s attacking or blocking, that Vehicle will be removed from combat unless another effect (such as its crew ability) is also making it a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If Daredevil Dragster doesn’t survive the combat damage step, its ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If Daredevil Dragster has one velocity counter on it and leaves the battlefield while its triggered ability is on the stack, it won’t get a second velocity counter and you won’t draw cards.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If Daredevil Dragster somehow has two velocity counters on it and leaves the battlefield while its triggered ability is on the stack, you’ll draw two cards even though you can’t sacrifice it.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If a second velocity counter is put on Daredevil Dragster by something other than the resolution of its triggered ability, you won’t sacrifice it yet.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Any untapped creature you control can be tapped to pay a crew cost, even one that just came under your control.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Creatures that crew a Vehicle aren’t attached to it or related in any other way. Effects that affect the Vehicle, such as by destroying it or giving it a +1/+1 counter, don’t affect the creatures that crewed it.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Each Vehicle is printed with a power and toughness, but it’s not a creature. If it becomes a creature (most likely through its crew ability), it will have that power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'For a Vehicle to be able to attack, it must be a creature as the declare attackers step begins, so the latest you can activate its crew ability to attack with it is during the beginning of combat step. For a Vehicle to be able to block, it must be a creature as the declare blockers step begins, so the latest you can activate its crew ability to block with it is during the declare attackers step. In either case, players may take actions after the crew ability resolves but before the Vehicle has been declared as an attacking or blocking creature.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'If a permanent becomes a copy of a Vehicle, the copy won’t be a creature, even if the Vehicle it’s copying has become an artifact creature.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'If an effect causes a Vehicle to become an artifact creature with a specified power and toughness, that effect overwrites the Vehicle’s printed power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Once a Vehicle becomes a creature, it behaves exactly like any other artifact creature. It can’t attack unless you’ve controlled it continuously since your turn began, it can block if it’s untapped, it can be tapped to pay a Vehicle’s crew cost, and so on.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Once a player announces that they are activating a crew ability, no player may take other actions until the ability has been paid for. Notably, players can’t try to stop the ability by changing a creature’s power or by removing or tapping a creature.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Vehicle is an artifact type, not a creature type. A Vehicle that’s crewed won’t normally have any creature type.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'When a Vehicle becomes a creature, that doesn’t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. The permanent was already on the battlefield; it only changed its types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'You may activate a crew ability of a Vehicle even if it’s already an artifact creature. Doing so has no effect on the Vehicle. It doesn’t change its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'You may tap more creatures than necessary to activate a crew ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If Midnight Entourage and another Aetherborn you control die at the same time, its ability triggers once for each of them.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If a creature has been dealt damage, that damage remains marked on it until the cleanup step. If Midnight Entourage leaves the battlefield and another Aetherborn creature you control has been dealt damage, that creature will be destroyed if the damage is now lethal. The same is true if an Aetherborn’s toughness becomes 0 this way.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Midnight Entourage’s triggered ability is mandatory. You draw a card and lose 1 life even if you don’t want to.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If Quicksmith Rebel leaves the battlefield while its ability is on the stack, the artifact never gains the damage-dealing ability.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If Quicksmith Rebel leaves the battlefield, you no longer control it.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If Quicksmith Rebel or the artifact leaves the battlefield while the damage-dealing ability is on the stack, that ability resolves as normal.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If another player gains control of Quicksmith Rebel, the artifact will no longer have the damage-dealing ability, even if you regain control of Quicksmith Rebel.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If Quicksmith Spy leaves the battlefield while its ability is on the stack, the artifact never gains the card-drawing ability.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If Quicksmith Spy leaves the battlefield, you no longer control it.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If Quicksmith Spy or the artifact leaves the battlefield while the card-drawing ability is on the stack, that ability resolves as normal.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If another player gains control of Quicksmith Spy, the artifact will no longer have the card-drawing ability, even if you regain control of Quicksmith Spy.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If Siege Modification becomes unattached from a Vehicle that’s attacking or blocking, that Vehicle will be removed from combat unless another effect (such as its crew ability) is also making it a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If a nontoken artifact is put into your graveyard at the same time as Pia’s Revolution, Pia’s Revolution’s ability triggers.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If there are no legal targets for Pia’s Revolution’s ability (perhaps because each of your opponents has hexproof), it will be removed from the stack with no effect. No one may choose to be dealt damage and you won’t return the artifact card to your hand.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'It doesn’t matter who controlled the artifact when it was put into your graveyard. Pia’s Revolution’s ability will trigger if you own that artifact.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'The target opponent chooses whether to have Pia’s Revolution deal 3 damage to them as its ability resolves. You won’t return the card to your hand if that player chooses to be dealt damage or if the card leaves the graveyard before the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'There are many important moments in the story, but the most crucial—called “story spotlights”—are shown on cards. These cards have the Planeswalker symbol in their text box; this symbol has no effect on gameplay. You can read more about these events in the official Magic fiction at http://www.mtgstory.com.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an Equipment becomes a creature, it becomes unattached and it can’t be attached to a creature.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If the artifact isn’t a creature or Vehicle as Lifecraft Awakening resolves, the artifact becomes a creature indefinitely.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You can cast Lifecraft Awakening declaring X as 0. If the artifact isn’t a creature or Vehicle, it’ll become a 0/0 creature and, unless another effect modifies its toughness, be put into your graveyard soon after.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You can put +1/+1 counters on a noncreature Vehicle this way. They’ll be put there, apply if the Vehicle becomes a creature, and remain there when it stops being a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an artifact becomes an illegal target for Release the Gremlins, it won’t change the number of tokens created. However, if every target artifact becomes an illegal target, Release the Gremlins doesn’t resolve and no tokens are created.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'The value of X is limited by the number of artifacts that you can target. You can’t target the same artifact more than once.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You can target an artifact with indestructible. It won’t be destroyed, and you’ll still create X Gremlin tokens.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If an artifact or creature you control would enter the battlefield with a number of any kind of counters on it, it enters with that many plus one instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If an effect includes multiple instructions to put one or more counters on an artifact or creature, such as Lifecrafter\'s Gift does, Winding Constrictor\'s effect applies to each of those instructions."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If you control two Winding Constrictors, the number of counters placed on the artifact or creature is the original number plus two. Three Winding Constrictors adds three to the original number, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If you would get counters of multiple kinds at the same time, Winding Constrictor increases the number of each of those kinds of counters by one. The same is true if counters of multiple kinds would be placed on an artifact or creature you control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Winding Constrictor\'s effect can\'t apply to itself as it\'s entering the battlefield or to any other permanent entering the battlefield at the same time as it."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If a nonartifact, noncreature permanent (such as a planeswalker) would enter the battlefield with counters on it and become an artifact or a creature on the battlefield due to another card\'s effect (such as that of Mycosynth Lattice), Winding Constrictor\'s effect will give that permanent another of those counters."}]', "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If an effect causes Foundry Hornet to enter the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it, it satisfies its own triggered ability.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If you don’t control a creature with a +1/+1 counter as Foundry Hornet enters the battlefield, its ability doesn’t trigger, even if you can give a +1/+1 counter to a creature right away. If you control no creatures with a +1/+1 counter as the ability resolves, nothing happens.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'The set of creatures affected by Foundry Hornet’s triggered ability is determined as the ability resolves. Creatures opponents begin to control later in the turn and permanents opponents control that become creatures later in the turn won’t get -1/-1. The effect continues until end of turn even if you stop controlling a creature with a +1/+1 counter on it.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If each creature an opponent controls is an artifact creature, that player sacrifices only one creature. Similarly, if each creature an opponent controls is a nonartifact creature, that player sacrifices only one creature. If an opponent controls no creatures, that player doesn’t sacrifice anything.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'When Perilous Predicament resolves, first the player whose turn it is (if that player is an opponent) chooses which creatures they will sacrifice, then each other opponent in turn order does the same, then all chosen creatures are sacrificed at the same time.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If some (but not all) of the targets become illegal, the original division of damage still applies, but no damage is dealt to illegal targets. If all targets become illegal, Deft Dismissal doesn’t resolve.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You choose how many targets Deft Dismissal has and how the damage is divided as you cast the spell. Each target must receive at least 1 damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If the target creature becomes an illegal target for Tezzeret’s Betrayal, the spell won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t search for Tezzeret, Master of Metal.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If the target creature becomes an illegal target, Cruel Finality doesn’t resolve and none of its effects happen. You won’t scry 1.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If the target creature’s power becomes 5 or greater as you gain control of it (perhaps because an enchantment gives creatures you control +1/+1), Wrangle will continue to resolve as normal. The creature will still be untapped and gain haste until end of turn, and you’ll still control it until end of turn.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Wrangle can target any creature with power 4 or less, even one that you already control or that is already untapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If the target permanent becomes an illegal target, Leave in the Dust doesn’t resolve and none of its effects happen. You won’t draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If the target permanent becomes an illegal target, Renegade’s Getaway doesn’t resolve and none of its effects happen. You won’t create a Servo token.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'There’s no way to have Renegade’s Getaway’s effect create a Servo token and give that token indestructible.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If the value of X is 0, you don’t look at or move any cards.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If the value of X is greater than or equal to the number of cards in your library, you can order your library as you wish.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Merchant’s Dockhand is tapped to pay the {T} cost. It can’t also be one of the X untapped artifacts you tap.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If you activate Watchful Automaton’s ability more than once, you’ll scry 1 each time. You won’t be able to look at multiple cards at once.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If you choose Invigorated Rampage’s second mode and one target becomes an illegal target, the remaining target gets +2/+0 and gains trample. It doesn’t get +4/+0.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If you control no artifacts, you won’t return anything to your hand. There’s no penalty for being unable to do so.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If you don’t have a creature card in your library while resolving Ajani’s second ability, you’ll reveal your library and then randomize it.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'The value of X for Ajani’s third ability is determined only as it resolves. The number of +1/+1 counters on the creature won’t change later if your life total changes.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If you don’t have an artifact card in your library while resolving Tezzeret’s first ability, you’ll reveal your library and then randomize it.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'The effect of Tezzeret’s third ability lasts indefinitely.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If you skip your turn, the affected player will be unable to cast noncreature spells until you actually start a turn.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'The affected player may still activate abilities, play lands, and cast creature spells.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'The affected player won’t be able to cast any noncreature spells until after the time that your “beginning of upkeep” triggered abilities are put onto the stack on your next turn.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'The target player (and any other player) may cast spells in response to the activated ability of Hope of Ghirapur. The ability won’t affect those spells and it won’t affect spells that the target player cast before you activated it. (In other words, the ability can’t be used to counter a spell.)'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'When a player leaves a multiplayer game, any continuous effects with durations that last until that player’s next turn will last until that turn would have begun. They neither expire immediately nor last indefinitely.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If you want to stop someone from attacking with a creature by using Pacification Array’s ability, you must do so before attackers are declared. You can’t wait until after attackers are declared and then try to use it to make a creature stop attacking. Note that your opponent can’t start declaring attackers without letting you use your Pacification Array.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Once a player has activated an ability with {T} in its cost, Pacification Array can’t be used to undo or counter that ability.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Players may respond to Pacification Array’s ability by activating an ability of the target permanent if that ability’s timing permissions allow it. Players may also respond by activating abilities or casting spells whose costs include tapping the target permanent.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If, during your declare attackers step, Frontline Rebel is tapped or is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having it attack, you aren’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Embraal Gear-Smasher’s ability causes 4 damage total to be dealt to the opposing team.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Ironclad Revolutionary’s ability causes the opposing team to lose a total of 4 life.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You can sacrifice an artifact only once when Ironclad Revolutionary’s triggered ability resolves. You can’t sacrifice more to get more counters or more life loss.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You choose whether to sacrifice an artifact or not as Ironclad Revolutionary’s ability resolves. No player may take actions between the time you choose whether to sacrifice an artifact and, if you do so, the time that counters are added and life is lost.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Welder Automaton’s ability causes 2 damage total to be dealt to the opposing team.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Maulfist Revolutionary’s triggered ability gives only one counter of each kind. It doesn’t double the number of each kind of counter. For example, if a creature has two +1/+1 counters and a charge counter on it, it gets one +1/+1 counter and one charge counter.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'The triggered ability triggers both when Maulfist Revolutionary enters the battlefield and when it dies. You don’t have to choose only one.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'To give a counter is to put a counter on a permanent or to have a player get a counter. Effects that interact with a player getting counters or counters being placed on permanents interact with Maulfist Revolutionary’s triggered ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Once a creature with power 3 or greater has blocked Outland Boar, changing the power of the blocking creature won’t cause Outland Boar to become unblocked.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Paradox Engine’s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. The ability will resolve even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Paying Heart of Kiran’s alternative crew cost isn’t a loyalty ability. It can be done even if you’ve already activated a loyalty ability of the planeswalker this turn, and it can be done any time you could activate Heart of Kiran’s crew ability.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Any untapped creature you control can be tapped to pay a crew cost, even one that just came under your control.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Creatures that crew a Vehicle aren’t attached to it or related in any other way. Effects that affect the Vehicle, such as by destroying it or giving it a +1/+1 counter, don’t affect the creatures that crewed it.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Each Vehicle is printed with a power and toughness, but it’s not a creature. If it becomes a creature (most likely through its crew ability), it will have that power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'For a Vehicle to be able to attack, it must be a creature as the declare attackers step begins, so the latest you can activate its crew ability to attack with it is during the beginning of combat step. For a Vehicle to be able to block, it must be a creature as the declare blockers step begins, so the latest you can activate its crew ability to block with it is during the declare attackers step. In either case, players may take actions after the crew ability resolves but before the Vehicle has been declared as an attacking or blocking creature.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'If a permanent becomes a copy of a Vehicle, the copy won’t be a creature, even if the Vehicle it’s copying has become an artifact creature.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'If an effect causes a Vehicle to become an artifact creature with a specified power and toughness, that effect overwrites the Vehicle’s printed power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Once a Vehicle becomes a creature, it behaves exactly like any other artifact creature. It can’t attack unless you’ve controlled it continuously since your turn began, it can block if it’s untapped, it can be tapped to pay a Vehicle’s crew cost, and so on.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Once a player announces that they are activating a crew ability, no player may take other actions until the ability has been paid for. Notably, players can’t try to stop the ability by changing a creature’s power or by removing or tapping a creature.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Vehicle is an artifact type, not a creature type. A Vehicle that’s crewed won’t normally have any creature type.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'When a Vehicle becomes a creature, that doesn’t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. The permanent was already on the battlefield; it only changed its types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'You may activate a crew ability of a Vehicle even if it’s already an artifact creature. Doing so has no effect on the Vehicle. It doesn’t change its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'You may tap more creatures than necessary to activate a crew ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Spire Patrol’s ability can target a creature that’s already tapped. That creature won’t untap during its controller’s next untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Take into Custody can target a creature that’s already tapped. That creature won’t untap during its controller’s next untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'The last ability of Ajani’s Aid doesn’t target anything. You choose a source of damage as the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You can activate the last ability even if there is no creature about to deal combat damage, or even no creature at all. No damage will be prevented, but it will enable your revolt abilities.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Trophy Mage’s ability finds an artifact card with converted mana cost exactly 3.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'When the enchanted artifact is put into a graveyard, Gremlin Infestation’s controller creates the Gremlin token.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'Whether or not you control an artifact is checked as Resourceful Return resolves.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You can’t cast Resourceful Return without a target creature card in your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You can activate Restoration Specialist’s ability choosing no targets at all if you wish.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You can’t cast Hungry Flames unless you target both a creature and a player. If one target is illegal as Hungry Flames resolves, the spell deals damage to the remaining legal target.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'Any untapped creature you control can be tapped to pay a crew cost, even one that just came under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Creatures that crew a Vehicle aren\'t attached to it or related in any other way. Effects that affect the Vehicle, such as by destroying it or giving it a +1/+1 counter, don\'t affect the creatures that crewed it."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Each Vehicle is printed with a power and toughness, but it\'s not a creature. If it becomes a creature (most likely through its crew ability), it will have that power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'For a Vehicle to be able to attack, it must be a creature as the declare attackers step begins, so the latest you can activate its crew ability to attack with it is during the beginning of combat step. For a Vehicle to be able to block, it must be a creature as the declare blockers step begins, so the latest you can activate its crew ability to block with it is during the declare attackers step. In either case, players may take actions after the crew ability resolves but before the Vehicle has been declared as an attacking or blocking creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If a permanent becomes a copy of a Vehicle, the copy won\'t be a creature, even if the Vehicle it\'s copying has become an artifact creature."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If an effect causes a Vehicle to become an artifact creature with a specified power and toughness, that effect overwrites the Vehicle\'s printed power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Once a Vehicle becomes a creature, it behaves exactly like any other artifact creature. It can\'t attack unless you\'ve controlled it continuously since your turn began, it can block if it\'s untapped, it can be tapped to pay a Vehicle\'s crew cost, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Once a player announces that they are activating a crew ability, no player may take other actions until the ability has been paid for. Notably, players can\'t try to stop the ability by changing a creature\'s power or by removing or tapping a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Vehicle is an artifact type, not a creature type. A Vehicle that\'s crewed won\'t normally have any creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "When a Vehicle becomes a creature, that doesn\'t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. The permanent was already on the battlefield; it only changed its types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "You may activate a crew ability of a Vehicle even if it\'s already an artifact creature. Doing so has no effect on the Vehicle. It doesn\'t change its power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'You may tap more creatures than necessary to activate a crew ability.\'}]', "[{'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Any untapped creature you control can be tapped to pay a crew cost, even one that just came under your control.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Creatures that crew a Vehicle aren’t attached to it or related in any other way. Effects that affect the Vehicle, such as by destroying it or giving it a +1/+1 counter, don’t affect the creatures that crewed it.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Each Vehicle is printed with a power and toughness, but it’s not a creature. If it becomes a creature (most likely through its crew ability), it will have that power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'For a Vehicle to be able to attack, it must be a creature as the declare attackers step begins, so the latest you can activate its crew ability to attack with it is during the beginning of combat step. For a Vehicle to be able to block, it must be a creature as the declare blockers step begins, so the latest you can activate its crew ability to block with it is during the declare attackers step. In either case, players may take actions after the crew ability resolves but before the Vehicle has been declared as an attacking or blocking creature.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'If a permanent becomes a copy of a Vehicle, the copy won’t be a creature, even if the Vehicle it’s copying has become an artifact creature.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'If an effect causes a Vehicle to become an artifact creature with a specified power and toughness, that effect overwrites the Vehicle’s printed power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Once a Vehicle becomes a creature, it behaves exactly like any other artifact creature. It can’t attack unless you’ve controlled it continuously since your turn began, it can block if it’s untapped, it can be tapped to pay a Vehicle’s crew cost, and so on.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Once a player announces that they are activating a crew ability, no player may take other actions until the ability has been paid for. Notably, players can’t try to stop the ability by changing a creature’s power or by removing or tapping a creature.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Vehicle is an artifact type, not a creature type. A Vehicle that’s crewed won’t normally have any creature type.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'When a Vehicle becomes a creature, that doesn’t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. The permanent was already on the battlefield; it only changed its types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'You may activate a crew ability of a Vehicle even if it’s already an artifact creature. Doing so has no effect on the Vehicle. It doesn’t change its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'You may tap more creatures than necessary to activate a crew ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Equipment attached to a creature doesn\'t become tapped when that creature becomes tapped, and tapping that Equipment doesn\'t cause the creature to become tapped."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If an artifact you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with improvise will result in the artifact being tapped when you pay the spell\'s costs. You won\'t be able to tap it again for improvise. Similarly, if you sacrifice an artifact to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with improvise, that artifact won\'t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell\'s costs, so you won\'t be able to tap it for improvise."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Improvise can\'t be used to pay for anything other than the cost of casting the spell. For example, it can\'t be used during the resolution of an ability that says “Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.”"}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Improvise can\'t pay for {W}, {U}, {B}, {R}, {G}, or {C} mana symbols in a spell\'s total cost."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Improvise doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Tapping an artifact won\'t cause its abilities to stop applying unless those abilities say so."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "When calculating a spell\'s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Improvise applies after the total cost is calculated."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "When using improvise to cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, first choose the value for X. That choice, plus any cost increases or decreases, will determine the spell\'s total cost. Then you can tap artifacts you control to help pay that cost. For example, if you cast Saheeli\'s Directive and choose X to be 3, the total cost is {3}{R}{R}{R}. If you tap two artifacts, you\'ll have to pay {1}{R}{R}{R}."}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Equipment attached to a creature doesn’t become tapped when that creature becomes tapped, and tapping that Equipment doesn’t cause the creature to become tapped.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If an artifact you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with improvise will result in the artifact being tapped when you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for improvise. Similarly, if you sacrifice an artifact to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with improvise, that artifact won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for improvise.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Improvise can’t be used to pay for anything other than the cost of casting the spell. For example, it can’t be used during the resolution of an ability that says “Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.”'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Improvise can’t pay for {W}, {U}, {B}, {R}, {G}, or {C} mana symbols in a spell’s total cost.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Improvise doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or converted mana cost.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Tapping an artifact won’t cause its abilities to stop applying unless those abilities say so.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Improvise applies after the total cost is calculated.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'When using improvise to cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, first choose the value for X. That choice, plus any cost increases or decreases, will determine the spell’s total cost. Then you can tap artifacts you control to help pay that cost. For example, if you cast Saheeli’s Directive and choose X to be 3, the total cost is {3}{R}{R}{R}. If you tap two artifacts, you’ll have to pay {1}{R}{R}{R}.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until it’s removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to the enchanted creature may become lethal if you return Conviction to its owner’s hand during that turn.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Players don’t have priority to cast spells and activate abilities between combat damage being assigned and being dealt. This means that if you want to return Conviction to its owner’s hand before combat damage is dealt, you must do so before combat damage is assigned (and the creature will no longer get +1/+3).'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If either target is an illegal target as Prey Upon resolves, no creature will deal or be dealt damage.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "A planeswalker with indestructible still loses loyalty counters as it\'s dealt damage and will still be put into its owner\'s graveyard if its loyalty reaches 0."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The set of permanents affected by Heroic Intervention is determined as the spell resolves. Permanents you begin to control later in the turn won\'t gain hexproof and indestructible."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "A battle with indestructible still loses defense counters as it\'s dealt damage. If it\'s a Siege, it will still be exiled when the last defense counter is removed from it, and its controller may still cast it transformed without paying its mana cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Because the effect of Destructive Tampering\'s second mode doesn\'t change the characteristics of any permanents, the set of creatures affected by it is constantly updated. Creatures without flying that enter the battlefield later in the turn won\'t be able to block."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Equipment attached to a creature doesn\'t become tapped when that creature becomes tapped, and tapping that Equipment doesn\'t cause the creature to become tapped."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If an artifact you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with improvise will result in the artifact being tapped when you pay the spell\'s costs. You won\'t be able to tap it again for improvise. Similarly, if you sacrifice an artifact to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with improvise, that artifact won\'t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell\'s costs, so you won\'t be able to tap it for improvise."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Improvise can\'t pay for {U} in Metallic Rebuke\'s total cost."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Improvise doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Tapping an artifact won\'t cause its abilities to stop applying unless those abilities say so."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "When calculating a spell\'s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Improvise applies after the total cost is calculated."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Fatal Push can target any creature, even one with mana value 5 or greater. The creature\'s mana value is checked only as Fatal Push resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If a creature on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Revolt abilities don\'t care why the permanent left the battlefield, who caused it to move, or where it moved to. They\'re equally satisfied by an artifact you sacrificed to pay a cost, a creature you controlled that was destroyed by Cast Down, or an enchantment you returned to your hand with Cyclonic Rift."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Tokens that leave the battlefield will satisfy a revolt ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, those must be paid to cast the spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If you don\'t cast the nonland card with mana value 3 or less, it\'ll be put on the bottom of your library in a random order with the other cards."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If your library has no nonland cards in it with mana value 3 or less, you\'ll reveal all the cards in your library, then put them back in a random order."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a permanent you controlled didn\'t leave the battlefield before your end step begins, Hidden Stockpile\'s first ability doesn\'t trigger at all. The permanent may have left before Hidden Stockpile entered the battlefield, however."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Revolt abilities check only whether a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn or not. They don\'t apply multiple times if more than one permanent you controlled left the battlefield. They don\'t check whether the permanent that left the battlefield is still in the zone it moved to."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Revolt abilities don\'t care why the permanent left the battlefield, who caused it to move, or where it moved to. They\'re equally satisfied by an artifact you sacrificed to pay a cost, a creature you controlled that was destroyed by Cast Down, or an enchantment you returned to your hand with Cyclonic Rift."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Tokens that leave the battlefield will satisfy a revolt ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'A casting cost of {X}{X} means that you pay twice X. If you want X to be 3, you pay {6} to cast Walking Ballista.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If Walking Ballista has been dealt damage or had its toughness reduced by an effect, this limits how many times you\'ll be able to remove +1/+1 counters from it in a single turn. For example, if it has three +1/+1 counters on it and has been dealt 1 damage this turn, it will be destroyed immediately after you activate the ability a second time and you won\'t be able to activate it a third time."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If some of the targets become illegal, the original division of damage still applies. The damage that was divided among the illegal targets simply isn\'t dealt; it isn\'t re-assigned to remaining legal targets."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The damage is dealt by Monstrous Onslaught, not by the creature with the greatest power among creatures you control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined at the time you divide damage. It won\'t change later, even if the greatest power among creatures you control changes."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You divide the damage among the target creatures as you cast Monstrous Onslaught. Each target must be assigned at least 1 damage.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you sacrifice an artifact creature to activate Defiant Salvager\'s ability, you put one +1/+1 counter on Defiant Salvager, not two."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You can sacrifice Defiant Salvager to activate its own ability. It won\'t receive a counter, but abilities that trigger on the sacrifice or watch for a creature dying will see it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Each +1/+1 counter put on the target creature is a separate event. Replacement effects may affect each of these counters being put on the creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Lifecrafter\'s Gift tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. No creatures receive +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If there is a +1/+1 counter on a noncreature permanent you control, such as a Vehicle that isn\'t crewed, it won\'t get another one from Lifecrafter\'s Gift."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The state-based action that removes matching +1/+1 and -1/-1 counters won\'t check until after Lifecrafter\'s Gift finishes resolving. It\'s possible put a +1/+1 counter on a creature with a -1/-1 counter on it and then give it a second +1/+1 counter."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'To move a counter from one creature to another, the counter is removed from the first creature and put onto the second. Any abilities that care about a counter being removed from or placed on a creature will apply.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You choose a target creature as Scrounging Bandar\'s triggered ability is put onto the stack. You choose how many counters to move (if any) as that ability resolves. If that creature becomes an illegal target or if Scrounging Bandar has left the battlefield, you can\'t move any counters."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "A spell or ability counters a spell only if it specifically contains the word “counter” in its text. If a spell or ability you control causes all the targets of a spell to become illegal, that spell doesn\'t resolve but it\'s not countered."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'The cost reduction applies only to generic mana in the cost of instant and sorcery spells you cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as a flashback cost), add any cost increases (such as kicker costs), then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Baral\'s first ability). The mana value of the spell is determined by only its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast that spell was."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Aberkennen\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch, eine aktivierte Fähigkeit oder eine ausgelöste Fähigkeit deiner Wahl. (Manafähigkeiten können nicht als Ziel gewählt werden.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wie einfach sich deine Flammen ersticken lassen." —Baral, Oberster Regelüberwacher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424250&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50d62f6a-ef8d-430a-a346-0c49650daf2b\', \'multiverseId\': 424250}, \'multiverseid\': 424250}, {\'name\': \'Incapacitar\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo, habilidad activada o habilidad disparada objetivo. (Las habilidades de maná no pueden hacerse objetivo.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuán sencillo es sofocar tus llamas...". —Baral, señor de la sumisión\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea4ca6bc-b784-4650-a16c-65a61d89de33\', \'multiverseId\': 425538}, \'multiverseid\': 425538}, {\'name\': \'Refus\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort ciblé, la capacité activée ciblée ou la capacité déclenchée ciblée. (Les capacités de mana ne peuvent pas être ciblées.)\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Vos flammes sont si faciles à éteindre. » —Baral, directeur de conformité\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424434&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'215aeda0-54be-450b-8ac6-aafb26262e60\', \'multiverseId\': 424434}, \'multiverseid\': 424434}, {\'name\': \'Veto\', \'text\': "Neutralizza una magia, un\'abilità attivata o un\'abilità innescata bersaglio. (Le abilità di mana non possono essere bersagliate.)", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Le tue fiamme si spengono fin troppo facilmente." —Baral, Commissario della conformità\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'966ee01c-4c24-4a0c-ac3d-a77fc3b7a157\', \'multiverseId\': 424618}, \'multiverseid\': 424618}, {\'name\': \'不許可\', \'text\': \'呪文１つか起動型能力１つか誘発型能力１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。（マナ能力は対象にできない。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「お前の炎を消す程度、造作もない。」 ――遵法長、バラル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'962d4c9d-751d-43fd-83dd-0f191707b3cc\', \'multiverseId\': 424802}, \'multiverseid\': 424802}, {\'name\': \'불허\', \'text\': \'주문, 활성화능력 또는 격발능력을 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 무효화한다. (마나 능력은 목표로 정해질 수 없다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"네 불꽃은 손쉽게 잠재울 수 있어." —감시 대장 바랄\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b3d4d94-1480-4d18-a96b-df97fe4db5bf\', \'multiverseId\': 424986}, \'multiverseid\': 424986}, {\'name\': \'Desautorizar\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica, a habilidade ativada ou a habilidade desencadeada alvo. (As habilidades de mana não podem ser alvo.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Quão facilmente se extinguem suas chamas..." — Baral, Chefe da Conformidade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c7993e1-6b86-4fc4-8aaa-7c11f002bdd2\', \'multiverseId\': 425170}, \'multiverseid\': 425170}, {\'name\': \'Запрет\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое заклинание, активируемую способность или срабатывающую способность. (Мана-способности не могут быть выбраны целью.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Как легко затушить твое пламя». — Бараль, старший по повиновению\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2576b3a-b1af-4e70-9ebc-6c55968ac006\', \'multiverseId\': 425354}, \'multiverseid\': 425354}, {\'name\': \'不予承认\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语，起动式异能或触发式异能。（其目标不能是法术力异能。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「熄灭你的火焰易如反掌。」 ～监察长巴罗\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2b57960-8da8-4b66-80df-04d95f1fa584\', \'multiverseId\': 423882}, \'multiverseid\': 423882}, {\'name\': \'不予承認\', \'text\': \'反擊目標咒語，起動式異能或觸發式異能。（其目標不能是魔法力異能。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「熄滅你的火焰易如反掌。」 ～監察長巴羅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ad137eb-143c-4afe-8f90-f68159ec1742\', \'multiverseId\': 424066}, \'multiverseid\': 424066}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abgeschirmter Ätherdieb\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch zu jedem Zeitpunkt wirken, zu dem du einen Spontanzauber wirken könntest.)\\nImmer wenn der Abgeschirmte Ätherdieb blockt, erhältst du {E} (eine Energiemarke).\\n{T}, bezahle {E}{E}{E}: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vedalken, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Konflikte bieten Chancen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424263&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e88df893-683f-4fe1-87fc-a1c7d533b9a3\', \'multiverseId\': 424263}, \'multiverseid\': 424263}, {\'name\': \'Ladrón de éter con escudo\', \'text\': \'Destello. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo en cualquier momento en que pudieras lanzar un instantáneo.)\\nSiempre que el Ladrón de éter con escudo bloquee, obtienes {E} (un contador de energía).\\n{T}, pagar {E}{E}{E}: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón vedalken\', \'flavor\': \'El conflicto engendra oportunidades.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16e21848-70ab-4097-9abc-0b4109dabfee\', \'multiverseId\': 425551}, \'multiverseid\': 425551}, {\'name\': "Voleur d\'Éther protégé", \'text\': "Flash (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort à tout moment où vous pourriez lancer un éphémère.)\\nÀ chaque fois que le Voleur d\'Éther protégé bloque, vous gagnez {E} (un marqueur « énergie »).\\n{T}, payez {E}{E}{E} : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : vedalken et gredin\', \'flavor\': "Le conflit cultive l\'opportunité.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424447&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b07e9cc-0950-44da-a1f1-d4e58298c173\', \'multiverseId\': 424447}, \'multiverseid\': 424447}, {\'name\': "Ladro d\'Etere Protetto", \'text\': "Lampo (Puoi lanciare questa magia in ogni momento in cui potresti lanciare un istantaneo.)\\nOgniqualvolta il Ladro d\'Etere Protetto blocca, ottieni {E} (un segnalino energia).\\n{T}, Paga {E}{E}{E}: Pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Vedalken\', \'flavor\': \'Dai conflitti nascono opportunità.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a739578-2780-4550-b7e4-722432f3053e\', \'multiverseId\': 424631}, \'multiverseid\': 424631}, {\'name\': \'守られた霊気泥棒\', \'text\': \'瞬速（あなたはこの呪文を、あなたがインスタントを唱えられるときならいつでも唱えてよい。）\\n守られた霊気泥棒がブロックするたび、あなたは{E}（エネルギー・カウンター１個）を得る。\\n{T}, {E}{E}{E}を支払う：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ヴィダルケン・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'対立は好機の母。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ced0a919-9987-44ee-aa74-ff0a9a8d1909\', \'multiverseId\': 424815}, \'multiverseid\': 424815}, {\'name\': \'보호막 에테르 도둑\', \'text\': \'섬광 (순간마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기라면 당신은 이 주문을 언제든지 발동할 수 있다.)\\n보호막 에테르 도둑이 방어할 때마다, 당신은 {E}(에너지 카운터 한 개)를 얻는다.\\n{T}, {E}{E}{E}를 지불한다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 베달켄 도적\', \'flavor\': \'전쟁은 기회를 낳는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa702817-5d9a-4596-b3ac-320f07e21976\', \'multiverseId\': 424999}, \'multiverseid\': 424999}, {\'name\': \'Ladrão de Éter Escudado\', \'text\': \'Lampejo (Você poderá conjurar esta mágica a qualquer momento em que puder conjurar uma mágica instantânea.)\\nToda vez que Ladrão de Éter Escudado bloqueia, você recebe {E} (um marcador de energia).\\n{T}, Pague {E}{E}{E}: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vedalkeano Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'O conflito cria oportunidades.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75f1d50e-b533-42a9-af96-e500de3e2e92\', \'multiverseId\': 425183}, \'multiverseid\': 425183}, {\'name\': \'Вор Эфирного Щита\', \'text\': \'Миг (Вы можете разыграть это заклинание при любой возможности разыгрывать мгновенные заклинания.)\\nКаждый раз, когда Вор Эфирного Щита блокирует, вы получаете {E} (один жетон энергии).\\n{T}, заплатите {E}{E}{E}: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ведалкен Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'Конфликт порождает возможности.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79d1b9a4-e1a7-474b-9e90-b340514b4c25\', \'multiverseId\': 425367}, \'multiverseid\': 425367}, {\'name\': \'佩盾乙太贼\', \'text\': \'闪现（你可以于你能够施放瞬间的时机下施放此咒语。）\\n每当佩盾乙太贼阻挡时，你得到{E}（一个能量指示物）。\\n{T}，支付{E}{E}{E}：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～维多肯／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'冲突孕育机会。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7570ed77-eb73-4862-a49b-7c66f85573a1\', \'multiverseId\': 423895}, \'multiverseid\': 423895}, {\'name\': \'佩盾乙太賊\', \'text\': \'閃現（你可以於你能夠施放瞬間的時機下施放此咒語。）\\n每當佩盾乙太賊阻擋時，你得到{E}（一個能量指示物）。\\n{T}，支付{E}{E}{E}：抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～維多肯／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'衝突孕育機會。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e738421-0158-4d7f-bd26-d6483504e469\', \'multiverseId\': 424079}, \'multiverseid\': 424079}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abtrünniger Veredler\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Abtrünnige Veredler ins Spiel kommt, ziehst du eine Karte und erhältst {E}{E} (zwei Energiemarken).\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Er ist natürlich, er umgibt uns alle und er ist da, um von uns genutzt zu werden. Also sag mir, welches Vergehens ich schuldig sein soll."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424354&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32ff9e85-20fc-4645-b3f6-186a43d4e4e8\', \'multiverseId\': 424354}, \'multiverseid\': 424354}, {\'name\': \'Refinador bribón\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Refinador bribón entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta y obtienes {E}{E} (dos contadores de energía).\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Es natural, nos rodea a todos y está ahí para disponer de ello. Dime por qué lo que hago está mal".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbaf4d97-9794-4de7-892b-1b795b0eb59a\', \'multiverseId\': 425642}, \'multiverseid\': 425642}, {\'name\': \'Gredin raffineur\', \'text\': \'Quand le Gredin raffineur arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte et vous gagnez {E}{E} (deux marqueurs « énergie »).\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est naturel, tout autour de nous et à notre disposition. Osez me dire que ce que je fais est mal. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424538&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5bce0bc-6da2-4aba-b828-c6aa646f02d3\', \'multiverseId\': 424538}, \'multiverseid\': 424538}, {\'name\': \'Raffinatore Fuorilegge\', \'text\': \'Quando il Raffinatore Fuorilegge entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta e ottieni {E}{E} (due segnalini energia).\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"È naturale, è ovunque e non appartiene a nessuno. Prova a dirmi che quello che faccio è sbagliato."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e426924-5d68-46ba-a155-67f4bdf901cb\', \'multiverseId\': 424722}, \'multiverseid\': 424722}, {\'name\': \'ならず者の精製屋\', \'text\': \'ならず者の精製屋が戦場に出たとき、カードを１枚引き、あなたは{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター２個）を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「自然に、身の回りに、いくらでもあるのさ。まぁ試してみて。何か問題があったら言ってよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8f1389c-d421-4181-b3d8-fafb0da93cf5\', \'multiverseId\': 424906}, \'multiverseid\': 424906}, {\'name\': \'악당 제련가\', \'text\': \'악당 제련가가 전장에 들어올 때, 카드 한 장을 뽑고 당신은 {E}{E}(에너지 카운터 두 개)를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 도적\', \'flavor\': \'"자연적으로 생겼어. 우리 주변에 널렸다구. 그냥 가져가라고 있는 거야. 이게 불법 행위라고 말하지 않는 게 좋을 거야."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91289d8e-42a4-44e9-a658-197ebdcd6b86\', \'multiverseId\': 425090}, \'multiverseid\': 425090}, {\'name\': \'Refinador Clandestino\', \'text\': \'Quando Refinador Clandestino entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card e receba {E}{E} (dois marcadores de energia).\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'"É natural, encontra-se em toda parte e está aqui para ser usado. Não venha me dizer que o que estou fazendo é errado."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38c6438b-6d99-4c57-98c3-9132202f340f\', \'multiverseId\': 425274}, \'multiverseid\': 425274}, {\'name\': \'Мятежный Очиститель\', \'text\': \'Когда Мятежный Очиститель выходит на поле битвы, возьмите карту, и вы получаете {E}{E} (два жетона энергии).\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'«Он натуральный, он всюду вокруг нас, и его можно брать, сколько хочешь. Вот скажи мне, неужели я в чем-то неправ?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58999ec8-48c5-4813-a99d-b03fa08c7b65\', \'multiverseId\': 425458}, \'multiverseid\': 425458}, {\'name\': \'土法精炼师\', \'text\': \'当土法精炼师进战场时，抓一张牌且你得到{E}{E}（两个能量指示物）。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「它源于自然，遍布四周，唾手可得。你倒说说，我哪里做得不妥。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e62fb4c3-0153-42e8-a73e-11e465ac3673\', \'multiverseId\': 423986}, \'multiverseid\': 423986}, {\'name\': \'土法精煉師\', \'text\': \'當土法精煉師進戰場時，抽一張牌且你得到{E}{E}（兩個能量指示物）。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「它源於自然，遍佈四周，唾手可得。你倒說說，我哪裡做得不妥。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab6a3737-90b2-4229-a313-75a17e0a217a\', \'multiverseId\': 424170}, \'multiverseid\': 424170}]', '[{\'name\': \'Admiral der Aeronauten\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nFahrzeuge, die du kontrollierst, haben Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Pilot\', \'flavor\': \'Das Konsulat rekrutiert seine besten Piloten aus der Liga der Aeronauten. Vielen von ihnen wird später das Kommando über ganze Flotten übertragen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424221&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c840934-1d79-4a29-a044-cebeed2dd39d\', \'multiverseId\': 424221}, \'multiverseid\': 424221}, {\'name\': \'Almirante aeronauta\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nLos Vehículos que controlas tienen la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Piloto humano\', \'flavor\': \'El Consulado contrata a sus mejores pilotos en la Liga de Aeronautas. Muchos llegan a dirigir flotas enteras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aece2783-40f1-411b-a9c5-c54867cb14f4\', \'multiverseId\': 425509}, \'multiverseid\': 425509}, {\'name\': \'Amiral aéronaute\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nLes véhicules que vous contrôlez ont le vol.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et pilote\', \'flavor\': "Le Consulat recrute ses meilleurs pilotes au sein de la Ligue des aéronautes. Nombre d\'entre eux commandent ensuite des flottes entières.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424405&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4291150-fe50-457f-89d8-87d980f7f703\', \'multiverseId\': 424405}, \'multiverseid\': 424405}, {\'name\': \'Ammiraglio Aeronauta\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nI Veicoli che controlli hanno volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pilota Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Il Consolato recluta i suoi piloti migliori tra i membri della Lega degli Aeronauti. Molti arrivano a comandare flotte intere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b10bf26-e239-4678-8818-eaf5bcfbfa61\', \'multiverseId\': 424589}, \'multiverseid\': 424589}, {\'name\': \'飛空士の提督\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがコントロールする機体は飛行を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・操縦士\', \'flavor\': \'領事府の優秀な操縦士は大半が飛空会の出身だ。飛空艦隊の指揮官に昇進する者も多い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3f63424-b9be-48ca-b35c-8503b3ceefe0\', \'multiverseId\': 424773}, \'multiverseid\': 424773}, {\'name\': \'비행단 단장\', \'text\': \'비행\\n당신이 조종하는 탑승물들은 비행을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 조종사\', \'flavor\': \'영사관은 비행사 리그에서 최고의 조종사들을 선발한다. 뽑힌 조종사는 대부분 함대 전체를 지휘하게 된다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ff3a683-2e23-4130-a2d3-00f4a218714e\', \'multiverseId\': 424957}, \'multiverseid\': 424957}, {\'name\': \'Almirante Aeronauta\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nOs Veículos que você controla têm voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Piloto\', \'flavor\': \'O Consulado recruta seus melhores pilotos da Liga dos Aeronautas. Muitos chegam a comandar frotas inteiras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd667acc-8f4d-4dd0-aac0-1a0884300b52\', \'multiverseId\': 425141}, \'multiverseid\': 425141}, {\'name\': \'Адмирал Аэронавтов\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nМашины под вашим контролем имеют Полет.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Пилот\', \'flavor\': \'Своих лучших пилотов Консульство нанимает в Лиге Аэронавтов. Многие впоследствии получают целый флот под свое начало.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1e34695-c3df-4c13-9a8d-5a2d7a40b640\', \'multiverseId\': 425325}, \'multiverseid\': 425325}, {\'name\': \'空行统帅\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n由你操控的载具具有飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／驾手\', \'flavor\': \'空行团不断为执政院输出优秀驾手。其中多数进而接掌整支舰队。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38aa7b19-566f-4987-80b2-4ab04f05a4a4\', \'multiverseId\': 423853}, \'multiverseid\': 423853}, {\'name\': \'空行統帥\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n由你操控的載具具有飛行異能。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／駕手\', \'flavor\': \'空行團不斷為執政院輸出優秀駕手。其中多數進而接掌整支艦隊。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff29072d-139a-4c3d-8808-d59252ff2637\', \'multiverseId\': 424037}, \'multiverseid\': 424037}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ajani der Unnachgiebige\', \'text\': \'+2: Decke die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Nimm alle bleibenden Karten, die auf diese Weise aufgedeckt wurden und die keine Länder sind, auf deine Hand und lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\\n−2: Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil. Ihr Beherrscher erhält Lebenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke dazu.\\n−9: Lege fünf +1/+1-Marken auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, und fünf Loyalitätsmarken auf jeden anderen Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424346&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afbe82fb-02eb-43b9-bc8e-c413f6a88a5d\', \'multiverseId\': 424346}, \'multiverseid\': 424346}, {\'name\': \'Ajani implacable\', \'text\': \'+2: Muestra las primeras tres cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon todas las cartas de permanente que no sean tierra mostradas de esta manera en tu mano y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\\n−2: Exilia la criatura objetivo. Su controlador gana una cantidad de vidas igual a su fuerza.\\n−9: Pon cinco contadores +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas y cinco contadores de lealtad sobre cada uno de los otros planeswalkers que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2128a492-8bbe-4de9-824e-af9dd3ccfb0b\', \'multiverseId\': 425634}, \'multiverseid\': 425634}, {\'name\': "Ajani l\'inflexible", \'text\': "+2 : Révélez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez toutes les cartes de permanent non-terrain révélées de cette manière dans votre main et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans l\'ordre de votre choix.\\n-2 : Exilez la créature ciblée. Son contrôleur gagne un nombre de points de vie égal à sa force.\\n-9 : Mettez cinq marqueurs +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez et cinq marqueurs « loyauté » sur chaque autre planeswalker que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker : Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424530&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff6ccd07-ec52-4bbc-a2c3-f27ac1f4f050\', \'multiverseId\': 424530}, \'multiverseid\': 424530}, {\'name\': "Ajani l\'Inflessibile", \'text\': \'+2: Rivela le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungi alla tua mano tutte le carte permanente non terra rivelate in questo modo e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\\n−2: Esilia una creatura bersaglio. Il suo controllore guadagna punti vita pari alla sua forza.\\n−9: Metti cinque segnalini +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli e cinque segnalini fedeltà su ogni altro planeswalker che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0fe139b-c162-4ec8-8037-67e455664253\', \'multiverseId\': 424714}, \'multiverseid\': 424714}, {\'name\': \'不撓のアジャニ\', \'text\': \'+2：あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚公開する。これにより公開されたすべての土地でないパーマネント・カードをあなたの手札に加え、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\\n-2：クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。それのコントローラーは、それのパワーに等しい点数のライフを得る。\\n-9：あなたがコントロールする各クリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ５個と、あなたがコントロールする他の各プレインズウォーカーの上に忠誠カウンターをそれぞれ５個置く。\', \'type\': \'プレインズウォーカー — アジャニ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9b508f2-033b-428b-960e-4b5efafb6569\', \'multiverseId\': 424898}, \'multiverseid\': 424898}, {\'name\': \'단호한 아자니\', \'text\': \'+2: 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 세 장을 공개한다. 그 중에서 대지가 아닌 모든 지속물 카드를 당신의 손으로 가져가고 나머지 카드들은 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 원하는 순서로 놓는다.\\n−2: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 추방한다. 그 생물의 조종자는 그 생물의 공격력만큼 생명점을 얻는다.\\n-9: 당신이 조종하는 각 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 다섯 개를 올려놓고 당신이 조종하는 다른 모든 플레인즈워커에 충성 카운터 다섯 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'플레인즈워커 — 아자니\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e15c609-270b-4679-bd65-a5042d8fbd2f\', \'multiverseId\': 425082}, \'multiverseid\': 425082}, {\'name\': \'Ajani, o Inabalável\', \'text\': \'+2: Revele os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque todos os cards de permanente que não sejam terrenos revelados dessa maneira em sua mão e os demais no fundo de seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\\n−2: Exile a criatura alvo. Seu controlador ganha uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao seu poder.\\n−9: Coloque cinco marcadores +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla e cinco marcadores de lealdade em cada outro planeswalker que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'322b3278-934b-4d06-bc1f-7be8d53a3dc6\', \'multiverseId\': 425266}, \'multiverseid\': 425266}, {\'name\': \'Аджани Неколебимый\', \'text\': \'+2: покажите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Положите все показанные таким образом карты не являющихся землями перманентов в вашу руку, а остальные — в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\\n—2: изгоните целевое существо. Контролирующий его игрок получает количество жизней, равное его силе.\\n—9: положите пять жетонов +1/+1 на каждое существо под вашим контролем и пять жетонов верности на каждого другого planeswalker-а под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Аджани\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425450&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bd2a76d-ada2-4114-b1c3-fa894ebed7c3\', \'multiverseId\': 425450}, \'multiverseid\': 425450}, {\'name\': \'刚毅阿耶尼\', \'text\': \'+2：展示你牌库顶的三张牌。将以此法展示的所有非地永久物牌置于你手上，其余则以任意顺序置于你的牌库底。\\n−2：放逐目标生物。其操控者获得等同于其力量的生命。\\n−9：在每个由你操控的生物上各放置五个+1/+1指示物，并在每个由你操控的其他鹏洛客上各放置五个忠诚指示物。\', \'type\': \'鹏洛客～阿耶尼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7463f01-f8cf-45b5-a71e-d779a7571f95\', \'multiverseId\': 423978}, \'multiverseid\': 423978}, {\'name\': \'剛毅阿耶尼\', \'text\': \'+2：展示你牌庫頂的三張牌。將以此法展示的所有非地永久物牌置於你手上，其餘則以任意順序置於你的牌庫底。\\n−2：放逐目標生物。其操控者獲得等同於其力量的生命。\\n-9：在每個由你操控的生物上各放置五個+1/+1指示物，並在每個由你操控的其他鵬洛客上各放置五個忠誠指示物。\', \'type\': \'鵬洛客～阿耶尼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a84c8d9-a091-4df7-85a6-f13f01def09d\', \'multiverseId\': 424162}, \'multiverseid\': 424162}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ajani, kühner Beschützer\', \'text\': \'+2: Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\n+1: Decke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek auf, bis du eine Kreaturenkarte aufdeckst. Nimm die Karte auf deine Hand und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\\n−11: Lege X +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, wobei X gleich deinem Lebenspunktestand ist. Die Kreatur verursacht Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425722&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe140e42-b981-48a4-aac6-5460a2ffe945\', \'multiverseId\': 425722}, \'multiverseid\': 425722}, {\'name\': \'Ajani, protector gallardo\', \'text\': \'+2: Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre hasta una criatura objetivo.\\n+1: Muestra las primeras cartas de tu biblioteca hasta que muestres una carta de criatura. Pon esa carta en tu mano y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\\n−11: Pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo, donde X es tu total de vidas. Esa criatura gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea590363-2fbe-4cbe-80b1-16ad38bda491\', \'multiverseId\': 425792}, \'multiverseid\': 425792}, {\'name\': \'Ajani, protecteur valeureux\', \'text\': "+2 : Ciblez jusqu\'à une créature. Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 elle.\\n+1 : Révélez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez une carte de créature. Mettez cette carte dans votre main et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.\\n-11 : Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée, X étant votre total de points de vie. Cette créature acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker : Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425732&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8d68d74-30b4-4d17-94d1-8de599e8b316\', \'multiverseId\': 425732}, \'multiverseid\': 425732}, {\'name\': \'Ajani, Protettore Impavido\', \'text\': \'+2: Scegli fino a una creatura bersaglio. Metti due segnalini +1/+1 su di essa.\\n+1: Rivela carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non riveli una carta creatura. Aggiungi quella carta alla tua mano e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\\n−11: Metti X segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio, dove X è pari ai tuoi punti vita. Quella creatura ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5083548c-575d-4df0-a388-5ecb39788cbd\', \'multiverseId\': 425742}, \'multiverseid\': 425742}, {\'name\': \'勇敢な守護者、アジャニ\', \'text\': \'+2：クリーチャー最大１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置く。\\n+1：クリーチャー・カードが公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを１枚ずつ公開する。そのカードをあなたの手札に加え、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\\n-11：クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをＸ個置く。Ｘはあなたのライフ総量に等しい。ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーはトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'プレインズウォーカー — アジャニ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3939bc16-b669-4c23-8a6f-f212e84b528e\', \'multiverseId\': 425752}, \'multiverseid\': 425752}, {\'name\': \'용맹한 수호자 아자니\', \'text\': \'+2: 생물을 최대 한 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 올려놓는다.\\n+1: 생물 카드가 공개될 때까지 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 공개한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 가져가고 나머지 카드들은 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 무작위로 놓는다.\\n−11: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 X개를 올려놓는다. X는 당신의 생명 총점이다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 돌진을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'플레인즈워커 — 아자니\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'429cd7fa-5458-47ab-b610-4c0293c3a23e\', \'multiverseId\': 425762}, \'multiverseid\': 425762}, {\'name\': \'Ajani, Protetor Valente\', \'text\': \'+2: Coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 em até uma criatura alvo.\\n+1: Revele cards do topo de seu grimório até revelar um card de criatura. Coloque aquele card na sua mão e o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\\n-11: Coloque X marcadores +1/+1 na criatura alvo, sendo X seu total de pontos de vida. Aquela criatura ganha atropelar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a996b064-a21a-4fc3-b450-8b4f49e54bac\', \'multiverseId\': 425772}, \'multiverseid\': 425772}, {\'name\': \'Аджани, Доблестный Защитник\', \'text\': \'+2: положите два жетона +1/+1 на не более чем одно целевое существо.\\n+1: показывайте карты с верха вашей библиотеки до тех пор, пока вы не покажете карту существа. Положите ту карту в вашу руку, а остальные — в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.\\n—11: положите X жетонов +1/+1 на целевое существо, где X — количество ваших жизней. То существо получает Пробивной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Аджани\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45cfd01b-3824-4549-80d3-4984ebb5e6e9\', \'multiverseId\': 425782}, \'multiverseid\': 425782}, {\'name\': \'英勇卫士阿耶尼\', \'text\': \'+2：在至多一个目标生物上放置两个+1/+1指示物。\\n+1：从你的牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出一张生物牌为止。将该牌置于你手上，并将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。\\n−11：在目标生物上放置X个+1/+1指示物，X为你的总生命。该生物获得践踏异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'鹏洛客～阿耶尼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f700901f-ce01-47e7-92df-275458ea0e78\', \'multiverseId\': 425702}, \'multiverseid\': 425702}, {\'name\': \'英勇衛士阿耶尼\', \'text\': \'+2：在至多一個目標生物上放置兩個+1/+1指示物。\\n+1：從你牌庫頂開始展示牌，直到展示出一張生物牌為止。將該牌置於你手上，並將其餘的牌以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。\\n−11：在目標生物上放置X個+1/+1指示物，X為你的總生命。該生物獲得踐踏異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'鵬洛客～阿耶尼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c19e45f-a4ea-4f79-b32b-53afdcfa5600\', \'multiverseId\': 425712}, \'multiverseid\': 425712}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ajanis Eid\', \'text\': \'Wenn Ajanis Eid ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst.\\nPlaneswalkerzauber, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Bis jeder seinen Platz gefunden hat, werde ich Wache halten."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424350&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'411a9933-2b5b-43f2-ae90-d68944ac54db\', \'multiverseId\': 424350}, \'multiverseid\': 424350}, {\'name\': \'Juramento de Ajani\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Juramento de Ajani entre al campo de batalla, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas.\\nTe cuesta {1} menos lanzar los hechizos de planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento legendario\', \'flavor\': \'"Hasta que todos encuentren su lugar, mantendré la guardia".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00e17322-170b-4b57-b3e8-91361e1b2643\', \'multiverseId\': 425638}, \'multiverseid\': 425638}, {\'name\': "Serment d\'Ajani", \'text\': "Quand le Serment d\'Ajani arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez.\\nLes sorts de planeswalker que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.", \'type\': \'Enchantement légendaire\', \'flavor\': "« Jusqu\'à ce que chacun ait trouvé sa place, je me ferai sentinelle. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424534&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7760e1b8-2ef5-4d87-83ec-08f008c82dbd\', \'multiverseId\': 424534}, \'multiverseid\': 424534}, {\'name\': \'Giuramento di Ajani\', \'text\': \'Quando il Giuramento di Ajani entra nel campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli.\\nLe magie planeswalker che lanci costano {1} in meno per essere lanciate.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo Leggendario\', \'flavor\': \'"Finché tutti non avranno trovato il loro posto, sarò un guardiano."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7564e8bf-68dd-4b76-9114-35bbfb7bb469\', \'multiverseId\': 424718}, \'multiverseid\': 424718}, {\'name\': \'アジャニの誓い\', \'text\': \'アジャニの誓いが戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールする各クリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。\\nあなたがプレインズウォーカー・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のエンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「すべての者が居場所を見つけるまで、私はゲートウォッチになる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424902&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3ae2834-b613-4f3f-a384-33947abdd586\', \'multiverseId\': 424902}, \'multiverseid\': 424902}, {\'name\': \'아자니의 맹세\', \'text\': \'아자니의 맹세가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종하는 각 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n당신이 발동하는 플레인즈워커 주문들은 발동하는 데 {1}이 덜 든다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"모두가 자신의 자리를 찾을 때까지 계속해서 수호하겠어."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddb1cbbc-aef9-409b-a286-95a629a8c397\', \'multiverseId\': 425086}, \'multiverseid\': 425086}, {\'name\': \'Juramento de Ajani\', \'text\': \'Quando Juramento de Ajani entrar no campo de batalha, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla.\\nAs mágicas de planeswalker que você conjura custam {1} a menos para serem conjuradas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'"Até que todos tenham encontrado seus lugares, eu serei uma sentinela."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'964ca9e0-8806-45b6-9ffb-c6417cb2fca5\', \'multiverseId\': 425270}, \'multiverseid\': 425270}, {\'name\': \'Клятва Аджани\', \'text\': \'Когда Клятва Аджани выходит на поле битвы, положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое существо под вашим контролем.\\nРазыгрываемые вами заклинания planeswalker-ов стоят на {1} меньше.\', \'type\': \'Легендарные Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Пока каждый не обретет свое место, я буду нести стражу».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93342389-5f90-421d-bda3-1d0941bcf702\', \'multiverseId\': 425454}, \'multiverseid\': 425454}, {\'name\': \'阿耶尼的誓约\', \'text\': \'当阿耶尼的誓约进战场时，在每个由你操控的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n你施放的鹏洛客咒语减少{1}来施放。\', \'type\': \'传奇结界\', \'flavor\': \'「在万物各得归属前，我将挚诚守护。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'593f1bc3-d1bf-4e51-bd78-dd2a19590933\', \'multiverseId\': 423982}, \'multiverseid\': 423982}, {\'name\': \'阿耶尼的誓約\', \'text\': \'當阿耶尼的誓約進戰場時，在每個由你操控的生物上各放置一個+1/+1指示物。\\n你施放的鵬洛客咒語減少{1}來施放。\', \'type\': \'傳奇結界\', \'flavor\': \'「在萬物各得歸屬前，我將摯誠守護。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c86a9da-80a1-4e60-9dba-f932b9bc4b27\', \'multiverseId\': 424166}, \'multiverseid\': 424166}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ajanis Hilfe\', \'text\': \'Wenn Ajanis Hilfe ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek und/oder deinen Friedhof nach einer Karte namens Ajani, kühner Beschützer, durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Falls du auf diese Weise deine Bibliothek durchsuchst, mische sie danach.\\nOpfere Ajanis Hilfe: Verhindere allen Kampfschaden, den eine Kreatur, die du bestimmst, in diesem Zug zufügen würde.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425725&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'702148ed-c122-4516-b999-7ab108841f69\', \'multiverseId\': 425725}, \'multiverseid\': 425725}, {\'name\': \'Refuerzos de Ajani\', \'text\': \'Cuando los Refuerzos de Ajani entren al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca y/o cementerio una carta llamada Ajani, protector gallardo, mostrarla y ponerla en tu mano. Si buscas en tu biblioteca de esta manera, barájala.\\nSacrificar los Refuerzos de Ajani: Prevén todo el daño de combate que fuera a hacer una criatura de tu elección este turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b0e5f36-aab8-4c05-bef1-9021aa9b7f49\', \'multiverseId\': 425795}, \'multiverseid\': 425795}, {\'name\': "Aide d\'Ajani", \'text\': "Quand l\'Aide d\'Ajani arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque et/ou votre cimetière une carte appelée Ajani, protecteur valeureux, la révéler et la mettre dans votre main. Si vous cherchez dans votre bibliothèque de cette manière, mélangez-la.\\nSacrifiez l\'Aide d\'Ajani : Prévenez toutes les blessures de combat qu\'une créature de votre choix devrait infliger ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425735&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'662c0974-1584-43f7-aa0b-c2140bc3290c\', \'multiverseId\': 425735}, \'multiverseid\': 425735}, {\'name\': \'Sostegno di Ajani\', \'text\': \'Quando il Sostegno di Ajani entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio e/o il tuo cimitero per una carta chiamata Ajani, Protettore Impavido, rivelarla e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Se passi in rassegna il tuo grimorio in questo modo, rimescolalo.\\nSacrifica il Sostegno di Ajani: Previeni tutto il danno da combattimento che una creatura a tua scelta infliggerebbe in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e898d2de-d2cd-4c4f-8581-e68c41ae80e9\', \'multiverseId\': 425745}, \'multiverseid\': 425745}, {\'name\': \'アジャニの援助\', \'text\': \'アジャニの援助が戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたのライブラリーやあなたの墓地から「勇敢な守護者、アジャニ」という名前のカード１枚を探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加えてもよい。あなたがこれによりあなたのライブラリーからカードを探したなら、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\\nアジャニの援助を生け贄に捧げる：このターン、あなたが選んだクリーチャー１体が与えるすべての戦闘ダメージを軽減する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bfbf4c2-a1fb-4cfa-9ece-1f9891611a5c\', \'multiverseId\': 425755}, \'multiverseid\': 425755}, {\'name\': \'아자니의 지원\', \'text\': \'아자니의 지원이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 당신의 서고 및/또는 무덤에서 이름이 용맹한 수호자 아자니인 카드 한 장을 찾아 공개한 후 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 당신이 이런 식으로 당신의 서고를 찾아보았다면, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\\n아자니의 지원을 희생한다: 이 턴에 당신이 선택한 생물 하나가 입히려는 모든 전투피해를 방지한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0256c60-6bc3-4357-bbf1-057b12e47111\', \'multiverseId\': 425765}, \'multiverseid\': 425765}, {\'name\': \'Ajuda de Ajani\', \'text\': \'Quando Ajuda de Ajani entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar em seu grimório e/ou cemitério um card com o nome Ajani, Protetor Valente, revelá-lo e colocá-lo em sua mão. Se procurar em seu grimório desta maneira, embaralhe-o.\\nSacrifique Ajuda de Ajani: Previna todo o dano de combate que uma criatura à sua escolha causaria neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccba4a87-e568-4629-97c6-d0e87fc666e4\', \'multiverseId\': 425775}, \'multiverseid\': 425775}, {\'name\': \'Помощь Аджани\', \'text\': \'Когда Помощь Аджани выходит на поле битвы, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке и (или) на вашем кладбище карту с именем Аджани, Доблестный Защитник, показать ее и положить в вашу руку. Если вы ищете таким образом в вашей библиотеке, перетасуйте ее.\\nПожертвуйте Помощь Аджани: предотвратите все боевые повреждения, которые должно нанести в этом ходу существо по вашему выбору.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'498587ab-e17f-4e01-a889-3f3483d23cfb\', \'multiverseId\': 425785}, \'multiverseid\': 425785}, {\'name\': \'阿耶尼的援助\', \'text\': \'当阿耶尼的援助进战场时，你可以从你的牌库和／或坟墓场中搜寻一张名称为英勇卫士阿耶尼的牌，展示该牌，并将它置于你手上。如果你以此法搜寻你的牌库，则将它洗牌。\\n牺牲阿耶尼的援助：选择一个生物，于本回合中，防止该生物将造成的所有战斗伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f85ef56e-bfd8-4f63-bd7e-8d577882d8e0\', \'multiverseId\': 425705}, \'multiverseid\': 425705}, {\'name\': \'阿耶尼的援助\', \'text\': \'當阿耶尼的援助進戰場時，你可以從你的牌庫和／或墳墓場中搜尋一張名稱為英勇衛士阿耶尼的牌，展示該牌，並將它置於你手上。如果你以此法搜尋你的牌庫，則將它洗牌。\\n犧牲阿耶尼的援助：選擇一個生物，於本回合中，防止該生物將造成的所有戰鬥傷害。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73ceb5ce-388d-411f-90e4-e72596fbad35\', \'multiverseId\': 425715}, \'multiverseid\': 425715}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ajanis Kameradin\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls du einen Ajani-Planeswalker kontrollierst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Ajanis Kameradin.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich werde gehen, wohin der Löwenmann mich führt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425724&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77d63091-549f-40e4-98c4-73fca9e0b234\', \'multiverseId\': 425724}, \'multiverseid\': 425724}, {\'name\': \'Camarada de Ajani\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nAl comienzo del combate en tu turno, si controlas un planeswalker Ajani, pon un contador +1/+1 en el Camarada de Ajani.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Iré allá donde diga el hombre-león".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9346fad8-34c4-41f4-ac10-bef3a026f824\', \'multiverseId\': 425794}, \'multiverseid\': 425794}, {\'name\': "Camarade d\'Ajani", \'text\': "Piétinement\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, si vous contrôlez un planeswalker Ajani, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Camarade d\'Ajani.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Je suivrai l\'homme-lion où qu\'il aille. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425734&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af52507e-683a-4fa6-9569-4964ac32bb1e\', \'multiverseId\': 425734}, \'multiverseid\': 425734}, {\'name\': \'Camerata di Ajani\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\nAll\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, se controlli un planeswalker Ajani, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Camerata di Ajani.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Seguirò l\\\'uomo leone ovunque mi conduca."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e4d0237-d21f-4324-92cd-839bee38c736\', \'multiverseId\': 425744}, \'multiverseid\': 425744}, {\'name\': \'アジャニの同志\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがアジャニ・プレインズウォーカーをコントロールしている場合、アジャニの同志の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「私はあのライオン男について行くわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c6c1bd6-d035-4b45-b7f1-dabe09fe1c04\', \'multiverseId\': 425754}, \'multiverseid\': 425754}, {\'name\': \'아자니의 동료\', \'text\': \'돌진\\n당신의 턴 전투 시작에, 당신이 아자니 플레인즈워커를 조종한다면, 아자니의 동료에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 병사\', \'flavor\': \'"난 사자 인간이 이끄는 곳으로 향하겠다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b52e87c-5a72-488d-8e91-a5cc8d88e369\', \'multiverseId\': 425764}, \'multiverseid\': 425764}, {\'name\': \'Camarada de Ajani\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nNo início do combate no seu turno, se você controlar um planeswalker do tipo Ajani, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Camarada de Ajani.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Vou onde o homem-leão for."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c6ef553-0f07-4a04-88cd-e50031f787b8\', \'multiverseId\': 425774}, \'multiverseid\': 425774}, {\'name\': \'Соратница Аджани\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nВ начале боя во время вашего хода, если вы контролируете planeswalker-а Аджани, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Соратницу Аджани.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Я иду туда, куда ведет человек-лев».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'408fb1cc-6531-465c-a4cf-2e2df6204065\', \'multiverseId\': 425784}, \'multiverseid\': 425784}, {\'name\': \'阿耶尼的战友\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n在你回合的战斗开始时，若你操控阿耶尼鹏洛客，则在阿耶尼的战友上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「狮人所往之处，我必随之。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb4f8d7d-b20b-4384-a872-5c5f874f890d\', \'multiverseId\': 425704}, \'multiverseid\': 425704}, {\'name\': \'阿耶尼的戰友\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n在你回合的戰鬥開始時，若你操控阿耶尼鵬洛客，則在阿耶尼的戰友上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「獅人所往之處，我必隨之。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d5fa778-6554-4019-98cb-1737ab013b64\', \'multiverseId\': 425714}, \'multiverseid\': 425714}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anspornendes Gebrüll\', \'text\': \'Lege auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Hier geht es um mehr als Äther und Erfindungen. Tezzerets Plänen muss Einhalt geboten werden!" —Ajani Goldmähne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425723&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7027f93c-2da5-410a-998b-43cf39e2a487\', \'multiverseId\': 425723}, \'multiverseid\': 425723}, {\'name\': \'Rugido inspirador\', \'text\': \'Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Esto no es únicamente por el éter o los inventos. ¡Hay que poner fin a los planes de Tezzeret!" —Ajani Melena Dorada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22cec9eb-4f25-4d96-a359-206589757def\', \'multiverseId\': 425793}, \'multiverseid\': 425793}, {\'name\': \'Rugissement inspirateur\', \'text\': \'Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Il n\'est pas uniquement question de l\'Éther ou des inventions. Nous devons mettre un terme aux machinations de Tezzeret ! » —Ajani Crinièredor", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425733&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0f72697-3d35-478e-aac8-57511b29cc1e\', \'multiverseId\': 425733}, \'multiverseid\': 425733}, {\'name\': \'Ruggito Ispiratore\', \'text\': \'Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Qui non si tratta solo di etere o invenzioni: dobbiamo mettere fine alle macchinazioni di Tezzeret!" —Ajani Criniera D\\\'Oro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2874f4f-2a08-4244-8541-8b8b960a2382\', \'multiverseId\': 425743}, \'multiverseid\': 425743}, {\'name\': \'鼓舞する咆哮\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールする各クリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「これは霊気や発明だけの問題ではない。テゼレットの策謀を阻止するのだ。」 ――黄金のたてがみのアジャニ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5540b70f-b36e-49dc-a1de-f818a720d817\', \'multiverseId\': 425753}, \'multiverseid\': 425753}, {\'name\': \'용기를 북돋는 포효\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 각 생물에 +1/+1 카운터를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"이것은 에테르나 발명품에 국한된 문제가 아니다. 테제렛의 흉계는 반드시 저지되어야 한다!" —아자니 골드메인\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2774b073-8b85-4fcc-ad22-89419846484d\', \'multiverseId\': 425763}, \'multiverseid\': 425763}, {\'name\': \'Rugido Inspirador\', \'text\': \'Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"A questão aqui é mais do que éter ou invenções. É preciso acabar com os ardis de Tezzeret!" — Ajani Juba D\\\'ouro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'999795c4-6e05-4ab5-b212-b35f399930bb\', \'multiverseId\': 425773}, \'multiverseid\': 425773}, {\'name\': \'Вдохновляющий Рев\', \'text\': \'Положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое существо под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Речь идет уже не только об эфире и изобретениях. Замыслы Теззерета нужно сорвать!» — Златогривый Аджани\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c0887cf-6e3c-4083-9b90-1fe5464f55ab\', \'multiverseId\': 425783}, \'multiverseid\': 425783}, {\'name\': \'振奋怒吼\', \'text\': \'在每个由你操控的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「这不只牵涉到乙太或发明而已。绝不能让泰兹瑞的阴谋得逞！」 ～金鬃阿耶尼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b864946-19c5-460b-abdb-b178520a4992\', \'multiverseId\': 425703}, \'multiverseid\': 425703}, {\'name\': \'振奮怒吼\', \'text\': \'在每個由你操控的生物上各放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「這不只牽涉到乙太或發明而已。絕不能讓泰茲瑞的陰謀得逞！」 ～金鬃阿耶尼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'157932ad-c1c0-4b00-86bd-f67a17db7245\', \'multiverseId\': 425713}, \'multiverseid\': 425713}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufruf zur Einigkeit\', \'text\': \'Rebellion — Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls in diesem Zug eine bleibende Karte unter deiner Kontrolle das Spiel verlassen hat, lege eine Einigkeitsmarke auf den Aufruf zur Einigkeit.\\nKreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 für jede Einigkeitsmarke auf dem Aufruf zur Einigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Die „undichte Turmspitze" steht für die Befreiung von der Kontrolle durch das Konsulat.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424228&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6cafae8-789f-40aa-87f1-7122a2c117f5\', \'multiverseId\': 424228}, \'multiverseid\': 424228}, {\'name\': \'Llamada a la unidad\', \'text\': \'Revuelta — Al comienzo de tu paso final, si un permanente que controlabas dejó el campo de batalla este turno, pon un contador de unidad sobre la Llamada a la unidad.\\nLas criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 por cada contador de unidad sobre la Llamada a la unidad.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'El "chapitel desbordante" simboliza la liberación del control del Consulado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f2c0167-9478-4ae9-a81f-757c26fc8c7e\', \'multiverseId\': 425516}, \'multiverseid\': 425516}, {\'name\': "Appel à l\'unité", \'text\': "Révolte — Au début de votre étape de fin, si un permanent que vous contrôliez a quitté le champ de bataille ce tour-ci, mettez un marqueur « unité » sur l\'Appel à l\'unité.\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 pour chaque marqueur « unité » sur l\'Appel à l\'unité.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'La « tour percée » est le symbole de la libération du contrôle du Consulat.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424412&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac10dda8-0c8c-47f7-aabe-86d89aad8822\', \'multiverseId\': 424412}, \'multiverseid\': 424412}, {\'name\': "Richiamo all\'Unità", \'text\': "Rivolta — All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se un permanente che controllavi ha lasciato il campo di battaglia in questo turno, metti un segnalino unità sul Richiamo all\'Unità.\\nLe creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 per ogni segnalino unità sul Richiamo all\'Unità.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'La "guglia stillante" rappresenta la liberazione dal giogo del Consolato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34e0cedd-21e6-4756-af74-b49f044df668\', \'multiverseId\': 424596}, \'multiverseid\': 424596}, {\'name\': \'結束への呼びかけ\', \'text\': \'紛争 ― あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたがコントロールするパーマネントが戦場を離れていた場合、結束への呼びかけの上に結束カウンターを１個置く。\\nあなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは、結束への呼びかけの上に置かれている結束カウンター１個につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「漏霊塔」は領事府の統制からの解放を意味する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'785f1ab9-4ea8-4e68-962c-eb41ba0236a3\', \'multiverseId\': 424780}, \'multiverseid\': 424780}, {\'name\': \'단합 촉구\', \'text\': \'봉기 — 당신의 종료단 시작에, 당신이 조종한 지속물이 이 턴에 전장을 떠났다면, 단합 촉구에 단합 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n당신이 조종하는 생물들은 단합 촉구에 올려놓은 단합 카운터 한 개당 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"에테르가 새는 첨탑"은 영사관의 통제에서 벗어나는 것을 상징한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'feb10682-d13a-45be-a0ba-e3dfa80d4ed7\', \'multiverseId\': 424964}, \'multiverseid\': 424964}, {\'name\': \'Chamado à Unidade\', \'text\': \'Revolta — No início de sua etapa final, se uma permanente que você controlava deixou o campo de batalha neste turno, coloque um marcador de unidade em Chamado à Unidade.\\nAs criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1 para cada marcador de unidade em Chamado à Unidade.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'A "torre que vaza" representa a libertação do controle do Consulado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bebb98b6-57d8-4605-be96-85de88606476\', \'multiverseId\': 425148}, \'multiverseid\': 425148}, {\'name\': \'Призыв к Единению\', \'text\': \'Бунт — В начале вашего заключительного шага, если находившийся под вашим контролем перманент покинул поле битвы в этом ходу, положите один жетон единения на Призыв к Единению.\\nСущества под вашим контролем получают +1/+1 за каждый жетон единения на Призыве к Единению.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Рисунок прохудившегося шпиля символизирует освобождение от власти Консульства.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b914592-09c9-475e-9a49-ce9cdb31a00e\', \'multiverseId\': 425332}, \'multiverseid\': 425332}, {\'name\': \'团结呼声\', \'text\': \'反抗～在你的结束步骤开始时，若本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物离开战场，则在团结呼声上放置一个团结指示物。\\n团结呼声上每有一个团结指示物，由你操控的生物便得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「渗漏尖塔」含义是从执政院治下得到解脱。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6617f7f0-f7b6-4168-93a3-bfecc025bef6\', \'multiverseId\': 423860}, \'multiverseid\': 423860}, {\'name\': \'團結呼聲\', \'text\': \'反抗～在你的結束步驟開始時，若本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物離開戰場，則在團結呼聲上放置一個團結指示物。\\n團結呼聲上每有一個團結指示物，由你操控的生物便得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「滲漏尖塔」含義是從執政院治下得到解脫。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b95cd81c-d72a-47b8-bb32-2256ea693eeb\', \'multiverseId\': 424044}, \'multiverseid\': 424044}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufsässiger Schrottsammler\', \'text\': \'Opfere ein Artefakt oder eine Kreatur: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Aufsässigen Schrottsammler. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur zu einem Zeitpunkt, zu dem du auch eine Hexerei wirken könntest.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Äthergeborener, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe den Absturz nicht überlebt, nur um gegen jemanden wie dich zu verlieren."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424275&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf33c798-33c7-4fbc-904b-1a5fb785bf14\', \'multiverseId\': 424275}, \'multiverseid\': 424275}, {\'name\': \'Desarmador rebelde\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar un artefacto o criatura: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Desarmador rebelde. Activa esta habilidad solo cuando puedas lanzar un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice etergénito\', \'flavor\': \'"No sobreviví al choque para caer en las manos de gente como tú".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56b3baae-4893-4ffe-b599-f8ff76127ab8\', \'multiverseId\': 425563}, \'multiverseid\': 425563}, {\'name\': \'Récupérateur provocateur\', \'text\': "Sacrifiez un artefact ou une créature : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Récupérateur provocateur. N\'activez cette capacité que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature : éthérien et artificier\', \'flavor\': "« Je n\'ai pas survécu à cet atterrissage pour me faire tuer par des gens comme vous. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424459&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0cf50e7-6740-4c0e-b97e-bf6ea6a78927\', \'multiverseId\': 424459}, \'multiverseid\': 424459}, {\'name\': \'Recuperatore Spavaldo\', \'text\': \'Sacrifica un artefatto o una creatura: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Recuperatore Spavaldo. Attiva questa abilità solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Eteride\', \'flavor\': \'"Non sono sopravvissuto a quello schianto solo per soccombere a gente come voi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94a09d62-956a-4034-aefd-9e73af9a77f9\', \'multiverseId\': 424643}, \'multiverseid\': 424643}, {\'name\': \'強気な回収者\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つかクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：強気な回収者の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。この能力は、あなたがソーサリーを唱えられるときにのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 霊基体・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'「お前のようなものに負けるなら、あの衝突に生き残らなかっただろう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'792e2380-5e9b-46b1-9a5a-3acdcc128dc7\', \'multiverseId\': 424827}, \'multiverseid\': 424827}, {\'name\': \'거만한 구조대\', \'text\': \'마법물체 또는 생물을 희생한다: 거만한 구조대에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 이 능력을 활성화할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 에테르붙이 기능공\', \'flavor\': \'"고작 네놈들에게 죽으려고 그 충돌에서 생존한 게 아니야."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93105944-53d7-43b3-a9be-846b40d79535\', \'multiverseId\': 425011}, \'multiverseid\': 425011}, {\'name\': \'Salvádego Audaz\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique um artefato ou criatura: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Salvádego Audaz. Ative esta habilidade somente nos momentos em que poderia conjurar um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Etergênito Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'"Não sobrevivi àquele acidente só para cair perante alguém como você."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e94a7793-4dfb-41ed-bf60-ce8168e97092\', \'multiverseId\': 425195}, \'multiverseid\': 425195}, {\'name\': \'Упрямый Собиратель\', \'text\': \'Пожертвуйте артефакт или существо: положите один жетон +1/+1 на Упрямого Собирателя. Активируйте эту способность только при возможности разыгрывать волшебство.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эфирид Механик\', \'flavor\': \'«Сдаваться, вам? Не для того я выжил в катастрофе».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf3b72bb-d1ad-4376-b1eb-eba157134edc\', \'multiverseId\': 425379}, \'multiverseid\': 425379}, {\'name\': \'无畏回收师\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个神器或生物：在无畏回收师上放置一个+1/+1指示物。你只可以于你能施放法术的时机下起动此异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～乙太种／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'「我在那次坠毁中幸存，可不是为了变成你们之流。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3110bfad-19f3-450c-9765-1c1edf3b3c37\', \'multiverseId\': 423907}, \'multiverseid\': 423907}, {\'name\': \'無畏回收師\', \'text\': \'犧牲一個神器或生物：在無畏回收師上放置一個+1/+1指示物。你只可以於你能施放巫術的時機下起動此異能。\', \'type\': \'生物～乙太種／神器師\', \'flavor\': \'「我在那次墜毀中倖存，可不是為了變成你們之流。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'209cd1ef-1d7a-4c98-b1d6-e5880832291a\', \'multiverseId\': 424091}, \'multiverseid\': 424091}]', '[{\'name\': \'Augmentierender Automat\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}: Der Augmentierende Automat erhält +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn du einer Kampfmaschine beibringst, andere ihrer Art zu reparieren, wird sie sich auch selbst reparieren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424362&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'406b365a-5ee7-46d7-9eff-327eed46da1b\', \'multiverseId\': 424362}, \'multiverseid\': 424362}, {\'name\': \'Autómata aumentador\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}: El Autómata aumentador obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Una vez que le enseñas a un autómata a ensamblar a otros como él, es fácil hacer que se ensamble a sí mismo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a5a4f05-0217-4307-8909-f174ac16452a\', \'multiverseId\': 425650}, \'multiverseid\': 425650}, {\'name\': \'Automate progressif\', \'text\': "{1}{B} : L\'Automate progressif gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': "D\'apprendre à un automate à en construire d\'autres à lui apprendre à se construire lui-même, il n\'y a qu\'un pas.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424546&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7033e687-e4a3-442a-b0dc-f36bff7b7b47\', \'multiverseId\': 424546}, \'multiverseid\': 424546}, {\'name\': \'Automa Potenziabile\', \'text\': "{1}{B}: L\'Automa Potenziabile prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'Quando a un automa si insegna come costruire i suoi simili, ci vuole poco perché inizi a costruire se stesso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6391e2c7-437d-4c35-9756-ffba680f3f5b\', \'multiverseId\': 424730}, \'multiverseid\': 424730}, {\'name\': \'増強自動機械\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}：ターン終了時まで、増強自動機械は＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'自動機械が同型機を組み立てられるのだから、それ自身を組み立てられるようになるのももうすぐだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45405746-57cc-4547-84d4-c32942cab7b5\', \'multiverseId\': 424914}, \'multiverseid\': 424914}, {\'name\': \'증식하는 자동장치\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}: 증식하는 자동장치는 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 자동기계\', \'flavor\': \'자동장치에게 자신과 같은 다른 자동장치를 만드는 법을 가르치면, 그것은 어떻게 자신을 만드는지를 가르치는 첫 단계가 된다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f9a3311-e1cf-453c-bf08-5c65189850cd\', \'multiverseId\': 425098}, \'multiverseid\': 425098}, {\'name\': \'Autômato Aprimorador\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}: Autômato Aprimorador recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Depois que você ensina um autômato como construir outros de seu tipo, é fácil fazê-lo construir a si mesmo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18b4936d-fbe6-4873-bb3c-e6f7f8b5c18d\', \'multiverseId\': 425282}, \'multiverseid\': 425282}, {\'name\': \'Усиливающийся Автомат\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}: Усиливающийся Автомат получает +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': \'Когда вы научили автомата собирать таких же, как он, остается всего один шаг до того, чтобы он научился собирать сам себя.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84a49ef9-6717-46a8-914f-41a6c545a7f8\', \'multiverseId\': 425466}, \'multiverseid\': 425466}, {\'name\': \'强固机械兽\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}：强固机械兽得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'教会机械兽如何打造同类后，它便向着打造自己迈进了一小步。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'251b90a0-93d6-4c9e-88b6-0a6a20c3ea33\', \'multiverseId\': 423994}, \'multiverseid\': 423994}, {\'name\': \'強固機械獸\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}：強固機械獸得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～組構體\', \'flavor\': \'教會機械獸如何打造同類後，它便向著打造自己邁進了一小步。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccc5a5f7-2858-4ecc-a940-53a2fa2d7fc9\', \'multiverseId\': 424178}, \'multiverseid\': 424178}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auserlesener Erzengel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nFalls du die Partie verlieren würdest, schicke stattdessen den Auserlesenen Erzengel ins Exil. Dein Lebenspunktestand wird gleich deiner Startlebenspunktezahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'Eine lebende Erfindung, geboren aus einem großartigen Design.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424237&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5600ca59-91a7-48a5-aead-4857c34babca\', \'multiverseId\': 424237}, \'multiverseid\': 424237}, {\'name\': \'Arcángel exquisito\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSi fueras a perder el juego, en vez de eso, exilia al Arcángel exquisito y tu total de vidas se convierte en tu total de vidas inicial.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': \'Una invención animada gracias a un diseño magnífico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7371d7ba-f0a2-4987-a685-8d37b7eb7f7a\', \'multiverseId\': 425525}, \'multiverseid\': 425525}, {\'name\': \'Archange admirable\', \'text\': "Vol\\nSi vous deviez perdre la partie, à la place, exilez l\'Archange admirable et votre total de points de vie devient égal à votre total de points de vie de départ.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': "Une invention vivante d\'une conception inégalable.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424421&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b239f35-87dc-4f58-8694-7e41e6247e52\', \'multiverseId\': 424421}, \'multiverseid\': 424421}, {\'name\': \'Arcangelo Mirabile\', \'text\': "Volare\\nSe stai per perdere la partita, invece esilia l\'Arcangelo Mirabile e i tuoi punti vita diventano pari ai tuoi punti vita iniziali.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': "Un\'invenzione vivente originata da un grandioso progetto.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'631452fd-aaa4-4be8-9d97-c898e601baf2\', \'multiverseId\': 424605}, \'multiverseid\': 424605}, {\'name\': \'極上の大天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがゲームに敗北するなら、代わりに、極上の大天使を追放し、あなたのライフ総量はあなたの初期ライフ総量と等しい値になる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': \'壮大な構想により生まれた、命ある発明品。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39ef6723-cc98-48d8-987a-fc7210e0600f\', \'multiverseId\': 424789}, \'multiverseid\': 424789}, {\'name\': \'정교한 대천사\', \'text\': \'비행\\n당신이 게임에서 패배하려고 하면, 대신에 정교한 대천사를 추방하고 당신의 생명총점은 시작 생명총점과 같아진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 천사\', \'flavor\': \'원대한 설계로 만든 살아있는 발명품이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f1f0ee1-d929-4737-b805-b05c5ee6490b\', \'multiverseId\': 424973}, \'multiverseid\': 424973}, {\'name\': \'Arcanjo Refinado\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nSe você perderia o jogo, em vez disso, exile Arcanjo Refinado e seu total de pontos de vida torna-se igual ao valor inicial.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': \'Uma invenção viva nascida de um grande projeto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16405048-9a90-4b94-9373-013b33be9368\', \'multiverseId\': 425157}, \'multiverseid\': 425157}, {\'name\': \'Изысканный Архангел\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nЕсли вы должны проиграть партию, то вместо этого изгоните Изысканного Архангела, и ваше количество жизней становится равным вашему начальному количеству жизней.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': \'Живое изобретение, рожденное из великого замысла.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47131261-3817-4d6d-9622-ca58c35d2620\', \'multiverseId\': 425341}, \'multiverseid\': 425341}, {\'name\': \'精雅大天使\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n如果你将输掉这盘游戏，则改为放逐精雅大天使且你的总生命成为等同于你的起始总生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～天使\', \'flavor\': \'宏伟设计造就的灵动发明。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc32775b-5513-44a5-b0db-4e7014ff574f\', \'multiverseId\': 423869}, \'multiverseid\': 423869}, {\'name\': \'精雅大天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n如果你將輸掉這盤遊戲，則改為放逐精雅大天使且你的總生命成為等同於你的起始總生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～天使\', \'flavor\': \'宏偉設計造就的靈動發明。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eb5ab42-14b1-4c2a-8be8-503541442972\', \'multiverseId\': 424053}, \'multiverseid\': 424053}]', '[{\'name\': \'Außerbetriebnahme\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\\nRebellion — Falls in diesem Zug eine bleibende Karte unter deiner Kontrolle das Spiel verlassen hat, erhältst du 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Eine Schwachstelle im Design ist die Anfälligkeit gegen wiederholte, kräftige Hammerschläge."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424235&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9067aa40-27d1-4197-a3b8-806d7a71c195\', \'multiverseId\': 424235}, \'multiverseid\': 424235}, {\'name\': \'Desguazar\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo.\\nRevuelta — Si un permanente que controlabas dejó el campo de batalla este turno, ganas 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"El diseño tiene una debilidad importante: no resiste una serie de fuertes martillazos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a3b9c76-7a74-4a5d-b4d8-57b702525f68\', \'multiverseId\': 425523}, \'multiverseid\': 425523}, {\'name\': \'Mise hors service\', \'text\': "Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé ou l\'enchantement ciblé.\\nRévolte — Si un permanent que vous contrôliez a quitté le champ de bataille ce tour-ci, vous gagnez 3 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« L\'un des principaux défauts de sa conception est sa vulnérabilité aux coups puissants et répétés. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424419&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6aa2a428-ea5f-4c69-882e-48d0c754cc02\', \'multiverseId\': 424419}, \'multiverseid\': 424419}, {\'name\': \'Disabilitare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio.\\nRivolta — Se un permanente che controllavi ha lasciato il campo di battaglia in questo turno, guadagni 3 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Un grande punto debole dell\\\'intero progetto è la vulnerabilità a colpi energici ripetuti."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61475646-4846-4637-8387-0fd9fc1ad90c\', \'multiverseId\': 424603}, \'multiverseid\': 424603}, {\'name\': \'稼働停止\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\\n紛争 ― このターンにあなたがコントロールするパーマネントが戦場を離れていたなら、あなたは３点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「強い打撃の繰り返しに弱いという設計上の欠点があるのだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b871157-c46a-4f83-97e8-3968f7c18f9c\', \'multiverseId\': 424787}, \'multiverseid\': 424787}, {\'name\': \'해체\', \'text\': \'마법물체나 부여마법을 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 파괴한다.\\n봉기 — 당신이 조종한 지속물이 이 턴에 전장을 떠났다면, 당신은 생명 3점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"이 디자인의 약점은 반복적이고 강력한 타격에 버티지 못하는 것이다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424971&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7f8e086-04a4-4afb-91ed-96d7e2f3a512\', \'multiverseId\': 424971}, \'multiverseid\': 424971}, {\'name\': \'Descomissionar\', \'text\': \'Destrua o artefato ou encantamento alvo.\\nRevolta — Se uma permanente que você controlava deixou o campo de batalha neste turno, você ganha 3 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"O principal defeito desse modelo é sua vulnerabilidade a repetidos golpes fortes."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2fcb967-ed99-4db0-89cb-6903890a5131\', \'multiverseId\': 425155}, \'multiverseid\': 425155}, {\'name\': \'Вывести из Строя\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевой артефакт или чары.\\nБунт — Если находившийся под вашим контролем перманент покинул поле битвы в этом ходу, вы получаете 3 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Главный недостаток этой конструкции — уязвимость к повторяющимся сильным ударам».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbdebed4-b714-4271-b188-c62ce0c4af1e\', \'multiverseId\': 425339}, \'multiverseid\': 425339}, {\'name\': \'除役\', \'text\': \'消灭目标神器或结界。\\n反抗～如果本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物离开战场，则你获得3点生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「其设计中的主要缺陷，在于反复重击便能造成致命损坏。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1d8beef-16de-46ec-a37c-07f948f646d6\', \'multiverseId\': 423867}, \'multiverseid\': 423867}, {\'name\': \'除役\', \'text\': \'消滅目標神器或結界。\\n反抗～如果本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物離開戰場，則你獲得3點生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「其設計中的主要缺陷，在於反覆重擊便能造成致命損壞。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76cdbdf6-2231-4ea6-9a0b-fd0b390c39ed\', \'multiverseId\': 424051}, \'multiverseid\': 424051}]', '[{\'name\': \'Baral, Oberster Regelüberwacher\', \'text\': \'Spontanzauber und Hexereien, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\\nImmer wenn ein Zauberspruch oder eine Fähigkeit, den bzw. die du kontrollierst, einen Zauberspruch neutralisiert, kannst du eine Karte ziehen. Falls du dies tust, wirf eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Echo der Stille ist Musik in meinen Ohren."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424247&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51e5373c-5c9e-4c8a-96ce-a7304cf2ce17\', \'multiverseId\': 424247}, \'multiverseid\': 424247}, {\'name\': \'Baral, señor de la sumisión\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar hechizos de instantáneo o de conjuro.\\nSiempre que un hechizo o habilidad que controlas contrarreste un hechizo, puedes robar una carta. Si lo haces, descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Los ecos del silencio son música para mis oídos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e74b1048-1f1b-4e65-a0b7-d8a1c8a386a8\', \'multiverseId\': 425535}, \'multiverseid\': 425535}, {\'name\': \'Baral, directeur de conformité\', \'text\': "Les sorts d\'éphémère et de rituel que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un sort ou une capacité que vous contrôlez contrecarre un sort, vous pouvez piocher une carte. Si vous faites ainsi, défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« L\'écho du silence est pour moi une douce mélodie. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424431&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96f21be4-3883-47bc-b7c0-083b567e87b0\', \'multiverseId\': 424431}, \'multiverseid\': 424431}, {\'name\': \'Baral, Commissario della Conformità\', \'text\': \'Le magie istantaneo e stregoneria che lanci costano {1} in meno per essere lanciate.\\nOgniqualvolta una magia o abilità che controlli neutralizza una magia, puoi pescare una carta. Se lo fai, scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'eco del silenzio è musica per le mie orecchie."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e7799e8-5907-4ebb-b2ad-b4a906adaa3f\', \'multiverseId\': 424615}, \'multiverseid\': 424615}, {\'name\': \'遵法長、バラル\', \'text\': \'あなたがインスタント・呪文やソーサリー・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\nあなたがコントロールする呪文や能力が呪文を１つ打ち消すたび、あなたはカードを１枚引いてもよい。そうしたなら、カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「静寂の響きほど心地よい調べはない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'916c2384-51bd-464b-b971-3cf04e888df5\', \'multiverseId\': 424799}, \'multiverseid\': 424799}, {\'name\': \'감시 대장 바랄\', \'text\': \'당신이 발동하는 순간마법 주문과 집중마법 주문은 발동 비용이 {1} 감소한다.\\n당신이 조종하는 주문 또는 능력이 주문을 무효화할 때마다, 당신은 카드 한 장을 뽑을 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 카드 한 장을 버린다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"침묵의 메아리만큼 듣기 좋은 소리는 없어."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6067d64c-8a34-4507-b57c-c215e57d0760\', \'multiverseId\': 424983}, \'multiverseid\': 424983}, {\'name\': \'Baral, Chefe da Conformidade\', \'text\': \'As mágicas instantâneas e os feitiços que você conjura custam {1} a menos para serem conjurados.\\nToda vez que uma mágica ou habilidade que você controla anula uma mágica, você pode comprar um card. Se fizer isso, descarte um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"O eco do silêncio é música para os meus ouvidos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05d2cb1c-5439-4828-865d-91258ebfbbbf\', \'multiverseId\': 425167}, \'multiverseid\': 425167}, {\'name\': \'Бараль, Старший по Повиновению\', \'text\': \'Разыгрываемые вами мгновенные заклинания и заклинания волшебства стоят на {1} меньше.\\nКаждый раз, когда заклинание или способность под вашим контролем отменяет заклинание, вы можете взять карту. Если вы это делаете, сбросьте карту.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Эхо тишины звучит для меня как музыка».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de17ed21-0da9-4d5f-bcf3-27f3dfe01647\', \'multiverseId\': 425351}, \'multiverseid\': 425351}, {\'name\': \'监察长巴罗\', \'text\': \'你施放的瞬间与法术咒语减少{1}来施放。\\n每当由你操控的咒语或异能将咒语反击时，你可以抓一张牌。若你如此作，则弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「寂静回响是我耳中天籁。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c43f2a1-f780-4e3d-9c77-a921196d0605\', \'multiverseId\': 423879}, \'multiverseid\': 423879}, {\'name\': \'監察長巴羅\', \'text\': \'你施放的瞬間與巫術咒語減少{1}來施放。\\n每當由你操控的咒語或異能將咒語反擊時，你可以抽一張牌。若你如此作，則棄一張牌。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「寂靜迴響是我耳中天籟。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'963ed781-1654-4282-9bb1-3d00ab563c52\', \'multiverseId\': 424063}, \'multiverseid\': 424063}]', '[{\'name\': \'Barals Expertise\', \'text\': \'Bringe bis zu drei Artefakte und/oder Kreaturen deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück.\\nDu kannst eine Karte mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 4 oder weniger aus deiner Hand wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Geht mir aus dem Weg."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424248&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e488f3a6-0c7b-4ea1-ba1b-72fac2afe333\', \'multiverseId\': 424248}, \'multiverseid\': 424248}, {\'name\': \'Pericia de Baral\', \'text\': \'Regresa hasta tres artefactos y/o criaturas objetivo a las manos de sus propietarios.\\nPuedes lanzar una carta de tu mano con coste de maná convertido de 4 o menos sin pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Fuera de mi camino".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'628e962b-ce35-4621-b654-cbe196b85822\', \'multiverseId\': 425536}, \'multiverseid\': 425536}, {\'name\': \'Expertise de Baral\', \'text\': "Renvoyez jusqu\'à trois artefacts et/ou créatures ciblés dans les mains de leurs propriétaires.\\nVous pouvez lancer une carte avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 4 depuis votre main sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Hors de mon chemin. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424432&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'083a083d-627f-4fe0-bba3-a52a25307852\', \'multiverseId\': 424432}, \'multiverseid\': 424432}, {\'name\': \'Competenza di Baral\', \'text\': \'Fai tornare fino a tre artefatti e/o creature bersaglio in mano ai rispettivi proprietari.\\nPuoi lanciare una carta con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 4 dalla tua mano senza pagare il suo costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Levatevi dai piedi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59e802db-e693-4bfa-9285-a3db2dac199e\', \'multiverseId\': 424616}, \'multiverseid\': 424616}, {\'name\': \'バラルの巧技\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトやクリーチャー、最大３つを対象とし、それらをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\nあなたは、あなたの手札から点数で見たマナ・コストが４以下のカード１枚を、そのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「邪魔だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e36478a-6342-4382-9a99-a6ccf0fec182\', \'multiverseId\': 424800}, \'multiverseid\': 424800}, {\'name\': \'바랄의 전문 지식\', \'text\': \'마법물체 및/또는 생물을 최대 세 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 목표들을 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\\n당신은 당신의 손에서 전환마나비용이 4 이하인 카드를 마나 비용을 지불하지 않고 발동할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"저리 비켜."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5254b243-c9d7-4358-bced-79802537c342\', \'multiverseId\': 424984}, \'multiverseid\': 424984}, {\'name\': \'Especialidade de Baral\', \'text\': \'Devolva até três artefatos e/ou criaturas alvo para as mãos de seus donos.\\nVocê pode conjurar um card com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a 4 da sua mão sem pagar seu custo de mana.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Saia do meu caminho."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'364e79aa-030a-45d2-983f-05e4c63fead4\', \'multiverseId\': 425168}, \'multiverseid\': 425168}, {\'name\': \'Мастерство Бараля\', \'text\': \'Верните не более трех целевых артефактов и (или) существ в руки их владельцев.\\nВы можете разыграть карту заклинания с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более 4 из вашей руки без оплаты ее мана-стоимости.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Прочь с дороги».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24a9229b-7eba-4f2d-98c9-b71f4fb7b7a5\', \'multiverseId\': 425352}, \'multiverseid\': 425352}, {\'name\': \'巴罗的专才\', \'text\': \'将至多三个目标神器和／或生物移回其拥有者手上。\\n你可以从你手上施放一张总法术力费用等于或小于4的牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「别挡我的路。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423880&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'789ed74b-645f-4841-879d-f38e9c46a0f4\', \'multiverseId\': 423880}, \'multiverseid\': 423880}, {\'name\': \'巴羅的專才\', \'text\': \'將至多三個目標神器和／或生物移回其擁有者手上。\\n你可以從你手上施放一張總魔法力費用等於或小於4的牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「別擋我的路。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc66432e-c50a-45a6-8862-b582c73fad11\', \'multiverseId\': 424064}, \'multiverseid\': 424064}]', '[{\'name\': \'Barrikadenbrecher\', \'text\': \'Improvisieren (Deine Artefakte können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)\\nDer Barrikadenbrecher greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Juggernaut\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Konsulat beabsichtigte, uns zu zerschmettern. Nun werden wir sie ihre eigene Medizin schmecken lassen!" —Venkat Dasai, Renegaten-Kommandeur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424363&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'413e4a6e-1ed3-4bb3-aa58-9eda9ba17e7d\', \'multiverseId\': 424363}, \'multiverseid\': 424363}, {\'name\': \'Destructor de barricadas\', \'text\': \'Improvisar. (Tus artefactos pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada artefacto que gires una vez que termines de activar habilidades de maná paga {1}.)\\nEl Destructor de barricadas ataca cada combate si puede.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Destructor\', \'flavor\': \'"El Consulado quiso destruirnos. Ahora probarán su propia medicina". —Venkat Dasai, comandante renegado\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b59050b2-5aeb-4736-b196-8dd42313e61c\', \'multiverseId\': 425651}, \'multiverseid\': 425651}, {\'name\': \'Briseur de barricades\', \'text\': \'Improvisation (Vos artefacts peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque artefact que vous engagez après avoir activé des capacités de mana paie {1}.)\\nLe Briseur de barricades attaque à chaque combat si possible.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : djaggernaut\', \'flavor\': \'« Le Consulat cherchait à nous briser. Il est temps de lui rendre la monnaie de sa pièce. » —Venkat Dasai, commandant renégat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424547&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b07605ea-05a9-4bf8-9449-be3cdc9165cd\', \'multiverseId\': 424547}, \'multiverseid\': 424547}, {\'name\': \'Spezzabarricate\', \'text\': \'Improvvisare (I tuoi artefatti possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni artefatto che TAPpi dopo aver attivato le abilità di mana corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nLo Spezzabarricate attacca in ogni combattimento, se può farlo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Juggernaut\', \'flavor\': \'"Il Consolato ha cercato di distruggerci. Ripaghiamoli con la stessa moneta." —Venkat Dasai, comandante rinnegato\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4a2524d-52f6-4d94-8702-f37f55186a58\', \'multiverseId\': 424731}, \'multiverseid\': 424731}, {\'name\': \'バリケード破り\', \'text\': \'即席（あなたのアーティファクトが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。あなたはあなたのアーティファクトをタップして、１個あたり{1}の支払いに代えてもよい。）\\n各戦闘で、バリケード破りは可能なら攻撃する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 巨大戦車\', \'flavor\': \'「領事府は我々を押し潰そうとしたのだ。あいつらも同じ目に遭わせてやれ。」 ――改革派の隊長、ベンカト・ダーセイ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d4d3ea8-d434-4d03-963b-bcfbea562bbb\', \'multiverseId\': 424915}, \'multiverseid\': 424915}, {\'name\': \'방어벽 파쇄자\', \'text\': \'급조 (당신의 마법물체들은 이 주문을 발동하는 것을 도울 수 있다. 마나 능력을 활성화한 후에 탭하는 각 마법물체는 이 주문의 비용 중 {1}을 지불한다.)\\n방어벽 파쇄자는 가능하면 매 전투마다 공격한다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 공성차\', \'flavor\': \'"영사관은 우리를 박살내려고 했었지. 당한 만큼 똑같이 갚아주겠어." —무법자 지휘관 벤카트 다사이\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ce48d5a-6f30-4d4f-b39d-594a45d2886a\', \'multiverseId\': 425099}, \'multiverseid\': 425099}, {\'name\': \'Rompedor de Barricadas\', \'text\': \'Improvisar (Seus artefatos podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada artefato que você vira após terminar de ativar habilidades de mana paga por {1}.)\\nRompedor de Barricadas ataca a cada combate se estiver apto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Juggernaut\', \'flavor\': \'"O Consulado tentou nos esmagar. Vamos fazê-los provar o próprio remédio." — Venkat Dasai, comandante renegado\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5d5b1e5-60b8-4fc0-8c17-6626673eb5e0\', \'multiverseId\': 425283}, \'multiverseid\': 425283}, {\'name\': \'Крушитель Баррикад\', \'text\': \'Импровизация (Ваши артефакты могут помочь разыграть это заклинание. Каждый артефакт, который вы поворачиваете после того, как вы закончили активировать мана-способности, считается оплатой {1}.)\\nКрушитель Баррикад атакует в каждом бою, если может.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Джаггернаут\', \'flavor\': \'«Консульство хочет сокрушить нас. Мы отплатим ему той же монетой». — Венкат Дасай, командир отступников\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'110b231d-f313-4402-9f0f-12dc8ce0cd87\', \'multiverseId\': 425467}, \'multiverseid\': 425467}, {\'name\': \'屏障粉碎械\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒语能用你的神器来协助施放。你起动完法术力异能之后每横置一个神器，就能为此咒语支付{1}。）\\n屏障粉碎械每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～攻城巨车\', \'flavor\': \'「执政院想要击溃我们。那就让他们尝尝自己种下的苦果吧。」 ～乱匠指挥官文凯德赛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52fd356f-4b78-4d15-8989-8072785b9b5f\', \'multiverseId\': 423995}, \'multiverseid\': 423995}, {\'name\': \'屏障粉碎械\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒語能用你的神器來協助施放。你起動完魔法力異能之後每橫置一個神器，就能為此咒語支付{1}。）\\n屏障粉碎械每次戰鬥若能攻擊，則必須攻擊。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～攻城巨車\', \'flavor\': \'「執政院想要擊潰我們。那就讓他們嘗嘗自己種下的苦果吧。」 ～亂匠指揮官文凱德賽\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cbca80a-acd8-49b5-981b-22615ef2ef76\', \'multiverseId\': 424179}, \'multiverseid\': 424179}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bastion-Vollstreckerin\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zwerg, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Stationiert in der Bastion der Ehrenhaften, sollen die Vollstrecker des Konsulats das Unmögliche möglich machen und den Frieden bewahren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424227&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8244a9b2-40e7-42d4-829f-ff6df46ec6bb\', \'multiverseId\': 424227}, \'multiverseid\': 424227}, {\'name\': \'Ejecutora del Bastión\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Enano soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Los ejecutores del Consulado, que se congregan en el Bastión de los Honorables, tienen encomendada la imposible tarea de mantener la paz.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d47446e-ad96-4557-a747-cef4664e906b\', \'multiverseId\': 425515}, \'multiverseid\': 425515}, {\'name\': \'Argousin du bastion\', \'type\': \'Créature : nain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Les argousins du Consulat, dont le siège se trouve au bastion des Justes, ont une mission impossible : le maintien de la paix.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424411&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb0d3072-bfd8-4bc5-8a5b-48ce9e605804\', \'multiverseId\': 424411}, \'multiverseid\': 424411}, {\'name\': \'Esecutrice del Baluardo\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Nano\', \'flavor\': "Acquartierati nel Baluardo dell\'Onore, gli esecutori del Consolato sono incaricati dell\'impossibile compito di mantenere la pace.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a884bc6-73f0-4685-a810-e11709c0d7c7\', \'multiverseId\': 424595}, \'multiverseid\': 424595}, {\'name\': \'砦の執行官\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドワーフ・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'名誉の砦に本部のある領事府執行官は、平和維持という困難な任務を担っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'025207c3-01c0-41f6-b016-95246dff32de\', \'multiverseId\': 424779}, \'multiverseid\': 424779}, {\'name\': \'요새 집행자\', \'type\': \'생물 — 드워프 병사\', \'flavor\': \'영예의 요새에 주둔 중인 영사관의 집행자들은 평화 유지라는 불가능한 임무를 맡고 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f50edf08-e937-404d-bfe4-18045c7b0aa8\', \'multiverseId\': 424963}, \'multiverseid\': 424963}, {\'name\': \'Impositora do Bastião\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anão Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'De seu quartel general no Bastião dos Honoráveis, os impositores do Consulado se encarregam da impossível tarefa de manter a paz.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37ecd6d8-d2c0-4a84-bc9c-176fea8cc696\', \'multiverseId\': 425147}, \'multiverseid\': 425147}, {\'name\': \'Блюстительница из Бастиона\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гном Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'В Бастионе Доблестных расположена штаб-квартира блюстителей Консульства, на которых возложена невозможная задача: поддерживать мир.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37dd815c-9567-4f0f-9f50-d428ec208950\', \'multiverseId\': 425331}, \'multiverseid\': 425331}, {\'name\': \'骁勇堡执法者\', \'type\': \'生物～矮人／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'执政院的执法部队主力驻扎在骁勇堡内，肩负着维系社会安宁这项无尽重任。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbcaea98-cc4f-4d0f-9b06-f2ddcef1f0b4\', \'multiverseId\': 423859}, \'multiverseid\': 423859}, {\'name\': \'驍勇堡執法者\', \'type\': \'生物～矮人／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'執政院的執法部隊主力駐紮在驍勇堡內，肩負著維繫社會安寧這項無盡重任。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0555390-60f4-4a29-9ff4-dd080fdc3f17\', \'multiverseId\': 424043}, \'multiverseid\': 424043}]', '[{\'name\': \'Befreierin des Grünviertels\', \'text\': \'Rebellion — Die Befreierin des Grünviertels kommt mit zwei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, falls in diesem Zug eine bleibende Karte unter deiner Kontrolle das Spiel verlassen hat.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich werde erst ruhen, wenn jede Spur des Konsulats — jedes Banner, jede Flagge, jede Standarte — im Staub liegt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424327&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c77a4968-71f0-402c-a37f-7db68a6244a4\', \'multiverseId\': 424327}, \'multiverseid\': 424327}, {\'name\': \'Libertadora de Discoverde\', \'text\': \'Revuelta — La Libertadora de Discoverde entra al campo de batalla con dos contadores +1/+1 sobre ella si un permanente que controlabas dejó el campo de batalla este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"No descansaré hasta que todo vestigio del Consulado —cada estandarte, cada bandera y cada pancarta— haya caído".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3537734d-bf46-45f5-9cc0-950375d83439\', \'multiverseId\': 425615}, \'multiverseid\': 425615}, {\'name\': \'Libératrice de la Roue Verdoyante\', \'text\': \'Révolte — La Libératrice de la Roue Verdoyante arrive sur le champ de bataille avec deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle si un permanent que vous contrôliez a quitté le champ de bataille ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Je ne connaîtrais le repos que lorsque toute trace du Consulat aura disparu : chaque bannière, chaque drapeau et chaque étendard. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424511&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d63fccc1-60fd-4508-86ae-20980465226c\', \'multiverseId\': 424511}, \'multiverseid\': 424511}, {\'name\': \'Liberatrice di Verderuota\', \'text\': \'Rivolta — Se un permanente che controllavi ha lasciato il campo di battaglia in questo turno, la Liberatrice di Verderuota entra nel campo di battaglia con due segnalini +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non mi fermerò finché ogni vestigio del Consolato, ogni insegna, bandiera o stendardo, non sarà stato spazzato via."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6486b9f5-da5e-4047-85ff-bc3e480eaffd\', \'multiverseId\': 424695}, \'multiverseid\': 424695}, {\'name\': \'緑輪地区の解放者\', \'text\': \'紛争 ― このターンにあなたがコントロールするパーマネントが戦場を離れていたなら、緑輪地区の解放者は＋１/＋１カウンターが２個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「領事府の痕跡が、垂れ幕も旗も記章も完全に消えるまで、私は止まらない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc1c4548-b17b-49ae-9139-9f9d659ac4b3\', \'multiverseId\': 424879}, \'multiverseid\': 424879}, {\'name\': \'녹림지구 해방자\', \'text\': \'봉기 — 당신이 조종한 지속물이 이 턴에 전장을 떠났다면, 녹림지구 해방자는 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 가지고 전장에 들어온다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"현수막, 깃발, 기준과 같은 영사관의 모든 흔적들이 사라질 때까지 멈추지 않겠어."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88e1e4bd-5a75-4713-9519-b9d6b2942219\', \'multiverseId\': 425063}, \'multiverseid\': 425063}, {\'name\': \'Libertadora Rodaverde\', \'text\': \'Revolta — Libertadora Rodaverde entra no campo de batalha com dois marcadores +1/+1 se uma permanente que você controlava deixou o campo de batalha neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Não descansarei até que todo vestígio do Consulado — cada emblema, bandeira e estandarte — tenha sido derrubado."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98ac9c76-b6c7-47a0-9079-17e1dc81aa5b\', \'multiverseId\': 425247}, \'multiverseid\': 425247}, {\'name\': \'Освободительница Зеленого Круга\', \'text\': \'Бунт — Освободительница Зеленого Круга выходит на поле битвы с двумя жетонами +1/+1 на ней, если находившийся под вашим контролем перманент покинул поле битвы в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Я не остановлюсь, пока не падут все до единого знамена, флаги и штандарты Консульства».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'382cc804-1e6f-49c5-a44b-80fa49615017\', \'multiverseId\': 425431}, \'multiverseid\': 425431}, {\'name\': \'绿环解放者\', \'text\': \'反抗～如果本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物离开战场，则绿环解放者进战场时上面有两个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「只要这世界上还有执政院势力残留，只要他们的徽帜、旗旛、军标还在，我就绝不停歇。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'585d879b-dc92-4cc2-b75e-9d4a79fdd6dc\', \'multiverseId\': 423959}, \'multiverseid\': 423959}, {\'name\': \'綠環解放者\', \'text\': \'反抗～如果本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物離開戰場，則綠環解放者進戰場時上面有兩個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「只要這世界上還有執政院勢力殘留，只要他們的徽幟、旗旛、軍標還在，我就絕不停歇。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04c3d3a1-407f-4d58-9a7a-20e998684bfb\', \'multiverseId\': 424143}, \'multiverseid\': 424143}]', '[{\'name\': \'Behütender Automat\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}: Bringe eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Straßen von Ghirapur sind ein gefährliches Pflaster geworden. Es ist gut, einen verlässlichen Begleiter zu haben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424360&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f966b70-87f6-4da1-8652-160d1d514fe4\', \'multiverseId\': 424360}, \'multiverseid\': 424360}, {\'name\': \'Autómata de la égida\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}: Regresa otra criatura objetivo que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Las calles de Ghirapur son ahora peligrosas. Es bueno tener un compañero en el que confiar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'655e5ae3-5d54-4103-b4a8-ecf51d58393d\', \'multiverseId\': 425648}, \'multiverseid\': 425648}, {\'name\': "Automate de l\'égide", \'text\': \'{4}{W} : Renvoyez une autre créature ciblée que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': \'Les rues de Ghirapur sont devenues dangereuses. Mieux vaut avoir un compagnon sur lequel compter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424544&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d234d2b9-2930-41c2-9531-24cfe1f2e8ef\', \'multiverseId\': 424544}, \'multiverseid\': 424544}, {\'name\': "Automa dell\'Egida", \'text\': "{4}{W}: Fai tornare un\'altra creatura bersaglio che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'Le strade di Ghirapur sono diventate pericolose. È bello avere un compagno su cui contare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49c3963d-44db-4a1a-88db-647259a53b33\', \'multiverseId\': 424728}, \'multiverseid\': 424728}, {\'name\': \'神盾自動機械\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}：あなたがコントロールする他のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'ギラプールの街路は物騒になってしまった。頼れる仲間との同行が望ましい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5a57678-b0d0-4944-846e-ba50abfcecae\', \'multiverseId\': 424912}, \'multiverseid\': 424912}, {\'name\': \'보호하는 자동장치\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}: 당신이 조종하는 다른 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 자동기계\', \'flavor\': \'기라푸르의 거리가 위험해졌다. 믿을 만한 동료와 함께 있는 것이 좋다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca613c2e-1a62-49f3-9625-12181d134cb3\', \'multiverseId\': 425096}, \'multiverseid\': 425096}, {\'name\': \'Autômato da Égide\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}: Devolva outra criatura alvo que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'As ruas de Ghirapur tornaram-se perigosas. É bom ter uma companhia confiável.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0049bbc7-067f-4597-b121-45c7eafd78f4\', \'multiverseId\': 425280}, \'multiverseid\': 425280}, {\'name\': \'Защитный Автомат\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}: верните другое целевое существо под вашим контролем в руку его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': \'На улицах Гирапура стало небезопасно. Хорошо, когда есть надежный спутник.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e43d1411-a51f-49b3-8d75-e6a4f7ccd7ba\', \'multiverseId\': 425464}, \'multiverseid\': 425464}, {\'name\': \'卫护机械兽\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}：将另一个目标由你操控的生物移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'吉拉波的街头变得越来越危险。最好跟值得信赖的朋友同行作伴。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'583ec390-a9ff-4637-92cf-c0b2f60a5721\', \'multiverseId\': 423992}, \'multiverseid\': 423992}, {\'name\': \'衛護機械獸\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}：將另一個目標由你操控的生物移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～組構體\', \'flavor\': \'吉拉波的街頭變得越來越危險。最好跟值得信賴的朋友同行作伴。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efd37659-614d-4157-8e19-0e8ff1432cd1\', \'multiverseId\': 424176}, \'multiverseid\': 424176}]', '[{\'name\': \'Belagerungsmodifikation\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur oder ein Fahrzeug\\nSolange die verzauberte bleibende Karte ein Fahrzeug ist, ist sie zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen eine Kreatur.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +3/+0 und hat Erstschlag.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Perfekt, um eine Audienz bei den Konsuln zu erhalten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424318&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9982d111-4a41-486e-af69-28d020e4a6a9\', \'multiverseId\': 424318}, \'multiverseid\': 424318}, {\'name\': \'Modificación de asalto\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura o Vehículo.\\nMientras el permanente encantado sea un Vehículo, es una criatura además de sus otros tipos.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +3/+0 y tiene la habilidad de dañar primero.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Es perfecto para llegar hasta los cónsules.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05490408-a691-47e8-b69a-6872bdd73ad4\', \'multiverseId\': 425606}, \'multiverseid\': 425606}, {\'name\': \'Modification de siège\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature ou véhicule\\nTant que le permanent enchanté est un véhicule, c\'est une créature en plus de ses autres types.\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +3/+0 et a l\'initiative.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'Idéale pour se faire entendre des consuls.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424502&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3c70f89-1a6a-45f9-9fb0-df101683752b\', \'multiverseId\': 424502}, \'multiverseid\': 424502}, {\'name\': \'Modifica da Assedio\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura o Veicolo\\nFintanto che il permanente incantato è un Veicolo, è una creatura in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi.\\nLa creatura incantata prende +3/+0 e ha attacco improvviso.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Perfetta per superare le reticenze dei consoli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63a2a30d-9b85-4276-9e53-897945b82ad2\', \'multiverseId\': 424686}, \'multiverseid\': 424686}, {\'name\': \'攻城化改造\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャーか機体）\\nエンチャントされているパーマネントが機体であるかぎり、それは他のタイプに加えてクリーチャーでもある。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋３/＋０の修整を受けるとともに先制攻撃を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'領事への突撃に最適。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424870&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00fc9af1-5799-4edb-b82e-842ebfa4260e\', \'multiverseId\': 424870}, \'multiverseid\': 424870}, {\'name\': \'개조 공성전차\', \'text\': \'생물 또는 탑승물에 부여\\n부여된 지속물이 탑승물인 한, 그 지속물은 자신의 다른 유형에 더불어 생물이다.\\n부여된 생물은 +3/+0을 받고 선제공격을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'영사에게 도달하기 위한 완벽한 방법이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7830cf0-79c6-4230-8134-6a5802bf6293\', \'multiverseId\': 425054}, \'multiverseid\': 425054}, {\'name\': \'Modificação de Cerco\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura ou Veículo\\nEnquanto a permanente encantada for um Veículo, ela será uma criatura além de seus outros tipos.\\nA criatura encantada recebe +3/+0 e tem iniciativa.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Perfeito para atravessar até os cônsules.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'475f2bcc-7188-42a5-b714-461f8d7cb956\', \'multiverseId\': 425238}, \'multiverseid\': 425238}, {\'name\': \'Осадная Модификация\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо или Машину\\nПока зачарованный перманент является Машиной, он является существом в дополнение к своим другим типам.\\nЗачарованное существо получает +3/+0 и имеет Первый удар.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Отличный способ пробиваться через преграды Консулов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7be9cfbc-356d-4980-b834-d7d2b8db77c9\', \'multiverseId\': 425422}, \'multiverseid\': 425422}, {\'name\': \'围攻改装\', \'text\': \'结附于生物或载具\\n只要所结附的永久物是载具，它便额外具有生物此类别。\\n所结附的生物得+3/+0且具有先攻异能。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'冲破执政官防线的完美武器。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae2315b5-a267-4c9f-99be-45d1f2b16676\', \'multiverseId\': 423950}, \'multiverseid\': 423950}, {\'name\': \'圍攻改裝\', \'text\': \'結附於生物或載具\\n只要所結附的永久物是載具，它便額外具有生物此類別。\\n所結附的生物得+3/+0且具有先攻異能。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'衝破執政官防線的完美武器。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4153c47b-33f8-430a-865b-2ccabaf09188\', \'multiverseId\': 424134}, \'multiverseid\': 424134}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bergungskrabbe\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Bergungskrabbe angreift, bringe ein Artefakt, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Krabbe\', \'flavor\': \'Eine Einsiedlerkrabbe verwendet in ihrem Leben viele Schalen und nicht alle sind natürlichen Ursprungs.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424262&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6355810-76b6-4408-bb8d-4799afa6814b\', \'multiverseId\': 424262}, \'multiverseid\': 424262}, {\'name\': \'Crustáceo reciclador\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Crustáceo reciclador ataque, regresa un artefacto que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cangrejo\', \'flavor\': \'Un cangrejo ermitaño vive en muchos caparazones a lo largo de su vida, y no todos son de origen natural...\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a082f9fd-6d41-4e99-a0f8-457b7d08e1cd\', \'multiverseId\': 425550}, \'multiverseid\': 425550}, {\'name\': \'Crabe renfloueur\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que le Crabe renfloueur attaque, renvoyez un artefact que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Créature : crabe\', \'flavor\': "Un bernard-l\'ermite change souvent de coquille au cours de sa vie, et elles ne sont pas toutes d\'origine naturelle.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424446&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f96111e9-4797-46f3-b4e7-40eb467d3796\', \'multiverseId\': 424446}, \'multiverseid\': 424446}, {\'name\': \'Affondatore di Recupero\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta l\'Affondatore di Recupero attacca, fai tornare un artefatto che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Granchio\', \'flavor\': \'Un paguro cambia diversi gusci durante la sua vita e non tutti sono di origine naturale.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cec0f735-b23b-49b7-a75e-54e232dfc4dc\', \'multiverseId\': 424630}, \'multiverseid\': 424630}, {\'name\': \'回収ヤドカリ\', \'text\': \'回収ヤドカリが攻撃するたび、あなたがコントロールするアーティファクト１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — カニ\', \'flavor\': \'ヤドカリは一生の間に何回も殻を取り換えるが、そのすべてが自然の産物というわけではない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424814&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9bf370b-350f-4f4f-b62c-34fddd07b28e\', \'multiverseId\': 424814}, \'multiverseid\': 424814}, {\'name\': \'인양 물품 운반꾼\', \'text\': \'인양 물품 운반꾼이 공격할 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 마법물체 한 개를 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 게\', \'flavor\': \'은둔자 게는 일생 동안 수많은 껍질을 거친다. 그중에는 자연적으로 생기지 않은 것도 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e550adfd-502c-43f4-869b-631f4dcf4863\', \'multiverseId\': 424998}, \'multiverseid\': 424998}, {\'name\': \'Caranguejo Reciclador\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Caranguejo Reciclador atacar, devolva um artefato que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caranguejo\', \'flavor\': \'Um caranguejo hermitão tem muitas carapaças ao longo da vida, e nem todas são de origem natural.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1ad4063-4d16-47b2-928b-4a691548f4da\', \'multiverseId\': 425182}, \'multiverseid\': 425182}, {\'name\': \'Топитель-Мародер\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Топитель-Мародер атакует, верните артефакт под вашим контролем в руку его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Краб\', \'flavor\': \'За свою жизнь рак-отшельник меняет множество раковин, и не все они созданы природой.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fe2f36d-0cbf-4530-b226-e07df14f0d14\', \'multiverseId\': 425366}, \'multiverseid\': 425366}, {\'name\': \'回收凿孔蟹\', \'text\': \'每当回收凿孔蟹攻击时，将一个由你操控的神器移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～蟹\', \'flavor\': \'寄居蟹一生要换许多次壳，但并非每个壳都是天然形成。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f60a6713-799a-4038-bb5f-6ff5352b3feb\', \'multiverseId\': 423894}, \'multiverseid\': 423894}, {\'name\': \'回收鑿孔蟹\', \'text\': \'每當回收鑿孔蟹攻擊時，將一個由你操控的神器移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～蟹\', \'flavor\': \'寄居蟹一生要換許多次殼，但並非每個殼都是天然形成。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'126644df-e59a-4c9b-8249-748ed0e33019\', \'multiverseId\': 424078}, \'multiverseid\': 424078}]', '[{\'name\': \'Biotronische Kavallerie\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nRebellion — Die Biotronische Kavallerie kommt mit zwei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, falls in diesem Zug eine bleibende Karte unter deiner Kontrolle das Spiel verlassen hat.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich verlange nicht, dass du zahm bist. Ich verlange nur, dass du treu bist." —Rishkar, Peema-Renegat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424332&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'626aaab6-e559-498c-85e1-99291af84488\', \'multiverseId\': 424332}, \'multiverseid\': 424332}, {\'name\': \'Caballería de vida fraguada\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nRevuelta — La Caballería de vida fraguada entra al campo de batalla con dos contadores +1/+1 sobre ella si un permanente que controlabas dejó el campo de batalla este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"No quiero domesticarte. Solo quiero que me seas leal". —Rishkar, renegado de Peema\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb060d17-0653-45cb-9731-23064db9cfd6\', \'multiverseId\': 425620}, \'multiverseid\': 425620}, {\'name\': \'Cavalière façonneuse de vie\', \'text\': \'Piétinement\\nRévolte — La Cavalière façonneuse de vie arrive sur le champ de bataille avec deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle si un permanent que vous contrôliez a quitté le champ de bataille ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Je ne te demande pas d\'être apprivoisé. Je te demande seulement d\'être authentique. » —Rishkar, renégat de Peema", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424516&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1779c6c9-cd9f-42b6-8408-19d41ae32483\', \'multiverseId\': 424516}, \'multiverseid\': 424516}, {\'name\': \'Cavalleria Forgiavita\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nRivolta — Se un permanente che controllavi ha lasciato il campo di battaglia in questo turno, la Cavalleria Forgiavita entra nel campo di battaglia con due segnalini +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non ti chiedo di essere docile. Ti chiedo solo di essere leale." —Rishkar, rinnegato di Peema\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37db1066-0896-4140-b0c4-d4b86f9a3117\', \'multiverseId\': 424700}, \'multiverseid\': 424700}, {\'name\': \'造命物騎兵\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n紛争 ― このターンにあなたがコントロールするパーマネントが戦場を離れていたなら、造命物騎兵は＋１/＋１カウンターが２個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「私に従順であることは望まない。自分に正直であることを望む。」 ――ピーマの改革派、リシュカー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3eb5b5c5-f8d2-4f7c-a954-3294f020a559\', \'multiverseId\': 424884}, \'multiverseid\': 424884}, {\'name\': \'생명제작술 기병대\', \'text\': \'돌진\\n봉기 — 당신이 조종한 지속물이 이 턴에 전장을 떠났다면, 생명제작술 기병대는 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 가지고 전장에 들어온다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"내가 당신에게 요구하는 건 순종이 아니라 진실성이다." —피마의 무법자 리시카르\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81b12b31-f248-48ec-9fae-a95fc0bcca95\', \'multiverseId\': 425068}, \'multiverseid\': 425068}, {\'name\': \'Cavalaria Vivideira\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nRevolta — Cavalaria Vivideira entra no campo de batalha com dois marcadores +1/+1 se uma permanente que você controlava deixou o campo de batalha neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Não peço que você seja dócil. Peço apenas que seja fiel." — Rishkar, renegado de Peema\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fecc21db-979e-46e3-a7a0-f4969b7d0e74\', \'multiverseId\': 425252}, \'multiverseid\': 425252}, {\'name\': \'Конница Жизнетворцев\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nБунт — Конница Жизнетворцев выходит на поле битвы с двумя жетонами +1/+1 на ней, если находившийся под вашим контролем перманент покинул поле битвы в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Я не прошу тебя быть смирным. Я лишь прошу тебя быть верным». — Ришкар, пимский отступник\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'099fe1e5-f082-442d-beef-03befae37329\', \'multiverseId\': 425436}, \'multiverseid\': 425436}, {\'name\': \'铸生骑兵\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n反抗～如果本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物离开战场，则铸生骑兵进战场时上面有两个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「我不求你驯从。我只求你展现自我。」 ～皮默乱匠李什克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6a2a557-8666-4787-b5de-5414e51d1a28\', \'multiverseId\': 423964}, \'multiverseid\': 423964}, {\'name\': \'鑄生騎兵\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n反抗～如果本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物離開戰場，則鑄生騎兵進戰場時上面有兩個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「我沒有要求你溫馴順從。我只要你保持真實。」 ～皮默亂匠李什克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83145d96-4a98-4bc6-bc9e-8dc0fd001443\', \'multiverseId\': 424148}, \'multiverseid\': 424148}]', '[{\'name\': \'Biotronisches Bestiarium\', \'text\': \'Wende zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments Hellsicht 1 an.\\nImmer wenn du einen Kreaturenzauber wirkst, kannst du {G} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Inspiration findet man, wenn man nach außen sieht." —Oviya Pashiri, weise Biotronikerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424381&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a895be82-fc8b-4f7a-ac09-e3a768fc735d\', \'multiverseId\': 424381}, \'multiverseid\': 424381}, {\'name\': \'Bestiario del fraguavidas\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, adivina 1.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de criatura, puedes pagar {G}. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"La inspiración se encuentra mirando al exterior". —Oviya Pashiri, fraguavidas sabia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'738855ed-36c0-4dcf-b3a7-14d211ced785\', \'multiverseId\': 425669}, \'multiverseid\': 425669}, {\'name\': \'Bestiaire du façonneur de vie\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, regard 1.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de créature, vous pouvez payer {G}. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« L\'inspiration se trouve à l\'extérieur. » —Oviya Pashiri, sage façonneuse de vie", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424565&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b538da55-129b-43aa-bf58-7e83f7afc34e\', \'multiverseId\': 424565}, \'multiverseid\': 424565}, {\'name\': \'Bestiario del Forgiavita\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, profetizza 1.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia creatura, puoi pagare {G}. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'ispirazione si trova guardando ciò che si ha di fronte." —Oviya Pashiri, saggia forgiavita\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8038f221-78d2-4e16-8bcf-249f0d2af44e\', \'multiverseId\': 424749}, \'multiverseid\': 424749}, {\'name\': \'造命師の動物記\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、占術１を行う。\\nあなたがクリーチャー・呪文を１つ唱えるたび、あなたは{G}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「発想というものは外部を見つめることから得られるのです。」 ――造命の賢者、オビア・パースリー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02f865a6-0013-4ad7-87a0-4b7f0bed3aec\', \'multiverseId\': 424933}, \'multiverseid\': 424933}, {\'name\': \'생명제작자의 우화집\', \'text\': \'당신의 유지단 시작에, 점술 1을 한다.\\n당신이 생물 주문을 발동할 때마다, 당신은 {G}를 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'"영감은 밖으로 시선을 돌림으로써 얻을 수 있다." —현명한 생명체제작자 오비야 파시리\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f89693de-9615-46b1-a533-1fa8a2fe5b0a\', \'multiverseId\': 425117}, \'multiverseid\': 425117}, {\'name\': \'Bestiário do Vivideiro\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, use vidência 1.\\nToda vez que conjura uma mágica de criatura, você pode pagar {G}. Se fizer isso, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"A inspiração é encontrada através da observação do mundo exterior." — Oviya Pashiri, sábia vivideira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2d5723d-7133-4d40-afb4-5c9243c3c499\', \'multiverseId\': 425301}, \'multiverseid\': 425301}, {\'name\': \'Зверинец Жизнетворца\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего шага поддержки предскажите 1.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание существа, вы можете заплатить {G}. Если вы это делаете, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Вдохновение можно найти, если смотреть вдаль». — мудрая Овия Пашири, жизнетворец\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08aaa9d1-a2e6-463a-a6ac-5cacc8657b47\', \'multiverseId\': 425485}, \'multiverseid\': 425485}, {\'name\': \'铸生匠兽图集\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，占卜1。\\n每当你施放生物咒语时，你可以支付{G}。若你如此作，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「往外看才找得到灵感。」 ～铸生智者奥薇亚帕西理\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65b9c6f6-e4c4-4234-afb7-2b69fb580be5\', \'multiverseId\': 424013}, \'multiverseid\': 424013}, {\'name\': \'鑄生匠獸圖集\', \'text\': \'在你的維持開始時，占卜1。\\n每當你施放生物咒語時，你可以支付{G}。若你如此作，則抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「往外看才找得到靈感。」 ～鑄生智者奧薇亞帕西理\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'759c4200-e419-4061-8cc9-aeabdca0c392\', \'multiverseId\': 424197}, \'multiverseid\': 424197}]', '[{\'name\': \'Biotronisches Erwachen\', \'text\': \'Lege X +1/+1-Marken auf ein Artefakt deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst. Falls es keine Kreatur und kein Fahrzeug ist, wird es zu einer 0/0 Konstrukt-Artefaktkreatur.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Es wurde hergestellt, ja, aber das bedeutet nicht, dass es nicht wachsen kann."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424331&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'287e1cae-41e1-4eaf-9268-a636235171e2\', \'multiverseId\': 424331}, \'multiverseid\': 424331}, {\'name\': \'Despertar de vida fraguada\', \'text\': \'Pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre el artefacto objetivo que controlas. Si no es una criatura o un Vehículo, se convierte en una criatura artefacto Constructo 0/0.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Es artificial, sí, pero eso no quiere decir que no crezca".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f8c3483-bbd0-44f6-8e52-0a61f25c7721\', \'multiverseId\': 425619}, \'multiverseid\': 425619}, {\'name\': \'Éveil du façonneur de vie\', \'text\': "Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur un artefact ciblé que vous contrôlez. Si ce n\'est pas une créature ou un véhicule, il devient une créature-artefact 0/0 Construction.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Il a été fabriqué, certes, mais cela signifie pas pour autant qu\'il ne peut pas grandir. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424515&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5a9b4b2-1f54-4e9d-9cb6-cea82663ca8f\', \'multiverseId\': 424515}, \'multiverseid\': 424515}, {\'name\': \'Risveglio Forgiavita\', \'text\': \'Metti X segnalini +1/+1 su un artefatto bersaglio che controlli. Se non è una creatura o un Veicolo, diventa una creatura artefatto Costrutto 0/0.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"È stata creata, certo, ma non significa che non possa crescere da sola."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d92d09e-d61f-4814-ad0b-0315cf021f34\', \'multiverseId\': 424699}, \'multiverseid\': 424699}, {\'name\': \'造命物の目覚め\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするアーティファクト１つを対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをＸ個置く。それがクリーチャーでも機体でもないなら、それは０/０の構築物・アーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「これは人工的に作った物だが、だからと言って成長しないというわけではない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c948419-b1da-43e3-8a52-015f5daf808c\', \'multiverseId\': 424883}, \'multiverseid\': 424883}, {\'name\': \'생명제작술 각성\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 마법물체를 목표로 정한다. 그 마법물체에 +1/+1 카운터 X개를 올려놓는다. 그 마법물체가 생물이나 탑승물이 아니라면, 그것은 0/0 자동기계 마법물체 생물이 된다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"맞아, 이건 만들어진 것이지. 하지만 그게 이것이 성장하지 못한다는 의미는 아니야."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a68f9861-2ed7-4f4a-a6d0-fc7030fa07f6\', \'multiverseId\': 425067}, \'multiverseid\': 425067}, {\'name\': \'Despertar Vivideiro\', \'text\': \'Coloque X marcadores +1/+1 no artefato alvo que você controla. Se ele não for uma criatura nem um Veículo, ele se torna uma criatura artefato 0/0 do tipo Constructo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"É artificial, sim, mas isso não significa que não possa crescer."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'422c6a28-328c-4eb1-8090-0d787e3aab69\', \'multiverseId\': 425251}, \'multiverseid\': 425251}, {\'name\': \'Пробуждение Жизнетворения\', \'text\': \'Положите X жетонов +1/+1 на целевой артефакт под вашим контролем. Если это не существо и не Машина, он становится артефактом существом 0/0 Конструкция.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Да, он сделан, но это не значит, что он не может расти».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4c09dbb-1fe0-4494-aa68-aa515c949d50\', \'multiverseId\': 425435}, \'multiverseid\': 425435}, {\'name\': \'铸生觉醒\', \'text\': \'在目标由你操控的神器上放置X个+1/+1指示物。如果它不是生物或载具，则它成为0/0组构体神器生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「它是造出来的，没错，但这并不意味着它无法成长。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ac0575f-006b-4636-8b8b-f30815096c3a\', \'multiverseId\': 423963}, \'multiverseid\': 423963}, {\'name\': \'鑄生覺醒\', \'text\': \'在目標由你操控的神器上放置X個+1/+1指示物。如果它不是生物或載具，則它成為0/0組構體神器生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「它是造出來的，沒錯，但這並不意味著它無法成長。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e497c1ec-15a4-40c1-9b59-7c466e54ba17\', \'multiverseId\': 424147}, \'multiverseid\': 424147}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzläuferin\', \'text\': \'Doppelschlag, Eile\\nImmer wenn die Blitzläuferin angreift, erhältst du {E}{E} (zwei Energiemarken), dann kannst du {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E} bezahlen. Falls du bezahlst, enttappe alle Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, und es gibt nach dieser Phase eine zusätzliche Kampfphase.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Fang mich, wenn du kannst."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424309&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd1163b7-d99d-4962-920c-31cce4ed84fd\', \'multiverseId\': 424309}, \'multiverseid\': 424309}, {\'name\': \'Acróbata relámpago\', \'text\': \'Daña dos veces, prisa.\\nSiempre que la Acróbata relámpago ataque, obtienes {E}{E} (dos contadores de energía). Luego puedes pagar {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}. Si los pagas, endereza todas las criaturas que controlas y después de esta fase hay una fase de combate adicional.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Atrápame si puedes".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cac8d28f-c9c2-4fd8-a02c-8c2c4f5caa41\', \'multiverseId\': 425597}, \'multiverseid\': 425597}, {\'name\': "Coureuse d\'éclairs", \'text\': "Double initiative, célérité\\nÀ chaque fois que la Coureuse d\'éclairs attaque, vous gagnez {E}{E} (deux marqueurs « énergie »), puis vous pouvez payer {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}. Si vous payez, dégagez toutes les créatures que vous contrôlez et cette phase est suivie d\'une phase de combat supplémentaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Vous ne m\'arrêterez pas ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424493&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9742e58c-87a0-4599-bd04-90fa63de04b8\', \'multiverseId\': 424493}, \'multiverseid\': 424493}, {\'name\': \'Velocista Fulminea\', \'text\': "Doppio attacco, rapidità\\nOgniqualvolta la Velocista Fulminea attacca, ottieni {E}{E} (due segnalini energia), poi puoi pagare {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}. Se paghi, STAPpa tutte le creature che controlli e, dopo questa fase, c\'è una fase di combattimento aggiuntiva.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Provate a prendermi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcc6d7d9-337c-4114-9936-507a925821fc\', \'multiverseId\': 424677}, \'multiverseid\': 424677}, {\'name\': \'稲妻駆け\', \'text\': \'二段攻撃、速攻\\n稲妻駆けが攻撃するたび、あなたは{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター２個）を得る。その後あなたは{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーをすべてアンタップし、このフェイズの後に追加の戦闘フェイズを加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「捕まえてみな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cfe5d3e-8198-4c04-aec1-c287afbbcbef\', \'multiverseId\': 424861}, \'multiverseid\': 424861}, {\'name\': \'번개 질주자\', \'text\': \'이단공격, 신속\\n번개 질주자가 공격할 때마다, 당신은 {E}{E}(에너지 카운터 두 개)를 얻은 후 {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}를 지불할 수 있다. 만약 당신이 지불한다면, 당신이 조종하는 모든 생물들을 언탭하고, 이 단계가 끝난 후 전투단계가 한 번 더 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"날 잡아 봐. 할 수 있으면."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69550b24-b6bd-4e18-a7c1-e580ae4b8821\', \'multiverseId\': 425045}, \'multiverseid\': 425045}, {\'name\': \'Corredora Relâmpago\', \'text\': \'Golpe duplo, ímpeto\\nToda vez que Corredora Relâmpago ataca, você recebe {E}{E} (dois marcadores de energia). Em seguida, você pode pagar {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}. Se pagar, desvire todas as criaturas que você controla e, depois disso, há uma fase de combate adicional.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Pegue-me se puder."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9bf4059-c747-4116-921f-9902e84145f8\', \'multiverseId\': 425229}, \'multiverseid\': 425229}, {\'name\': \'Молниеносная Бегунья\', \'text\': \'Двойной удар, Ускорение\\nКаждый раз, когда Молниеносная Бегунья атакует, вы получаете {E}{E} (два жетона энергии), затем вы можете заплатить {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}. Если вы заплатите, разверните все существа под вашим контролем, и после этой фазы идет дополнительная фаза боя.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Поймай меня, если сможешь».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a34976a0-f55b-43bb-a964-3ad21b974c4a\', \'multiverseId\': 425413}, \'multiverseid\': 425413}, {\'name\': \'迅雷奔越者\', \'text\': \'连击，敏捷\\n每当迅雷奔越者攻击时，你得到{E}{E}（两个能量指示物），然后你可以支付{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}。若你支付，则重置所有由你操控的生物，且在此阶段后，额外多出一个战斗阶段。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「有本事就来抓我呀。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0c22379-053a-485a-bfad-21a1794a9805\', \'multiverseId\': 423941}, \'multiverseid\': 423941}, {\'name\': \'迅雷奔越者\', \'text\': \'連擊，敏捷\\n每當迅雷奔越者攻擊時，你得到{E}{E}（兩個能量指示物），然後你可以支付{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}。若你支付，則重置所有由你操控的生物，且在此階段後，額外多出一個戰鬥階段。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「有本事就來抓我呀。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6babae22-6c29-49f4-988b-cfa21183f9d2\', \'multiverseId\': 424125}, \'multiverseid\': 424125}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bronzeviertel-Ingenieur\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug erhält eine Artefaktkreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir sollten uns auf die Seite des glorreichen Chaos schlagen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424358&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73439c44-798c-4434-960b-58da8cb1c103\', \'multiverseId\': 424358}, \'multiverseid\': 424358}, {\'name\': \'Ingeniero de Sueldafirme\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, la criatura artefacto objetivo que controlas obtiene +2/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Mejor pasarse que quedarse corto".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcdd5136-15d4-40ad-9299-e15c8c474c30\', \'multiverseId\': 425646}, \'multiverseid\': 425646}, {\'name\': \'Ingénieur de Vive-Soudure\', \'text\': "Au début du combat pendant votre tour, une créature-artefact ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': \'« Dans le doute, optons pour un glorieux chaos. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424542&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f74e9521-3851-41eb-b8f5-9e768f18f20b\', \'multiverseId\': 424542}, \'multiverseid\': 424542}, {\'name\': \'Ingegnere della Saldapoli\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, una creatura artefatto bersaglio che controlli prende +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Spingiamoci nei territori del maestoso caos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c8b7836-c394-45f9-9b6b-302f9c275a6e\', \'multiverseId\': 424726}, \'multiverseid\': 424726}, {\'name\': \'速接会の技師\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがコントロールするアーティファクト・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'「栄光ある騒乱に便乗して、間違いを仕出かすとしよう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f407486-4c35-4f44-9395-647862248e4d\', \'multiverseId\': 424910}, \'multiverseid\': 424910}, {\'name\': \'신속땜질지구 기술자\', \'text\': \'당신의 턴 전투 시작에, 당신이 조종하는 마법물체 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +2/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기능공\', \'flavor\': \'"영광스러운 대혼란을 일으켜보자."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a51014c-c0cc-4035-a2db-6a600a8e3f23\', \'multiverseId\': 425094}, \'multiverseid\': 425094}, {\'name\': \'Engenheiro Soldafirme\', \'text\': \'No início do combate no seu turno, a criatura artefato alvo que você controla recebe +2/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'"Vamos mais para o lado de um caos glorioso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11a8e0d9-5233-42f4-bf94-f709aebce590\', \'multiverseId\': 425278}, \'multiverseid\': 425278}, {\'name\': \'Инженер Сварного Шва\', \'text\': \'В начале боя во время вашего хода целевой артефакт существо под вашим контролем получает +2/+0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Механик\', \'flavor\': \'«Подбавим немного славного хаоса».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c90d3f9e-cddd-4214-b0c1-7179954d0ea2\', \'multiverseId\': 425462}, \'multiverseid\': 425462}, {\'name\': \'焊锢区工程师\', \'text\': \'在你回合的战斗开始时，目标由你操控的神器生物得+2/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'「让我们在辉煌的混乱之路上走下去吧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f32b4c7-b84d-4e70-9caf-e9c3f3c2fac3\', \'multiverseId\': 423990}, \'multiverseid\': 423990}, {\'name\': \'焊錮區工程師\', \'text\': \'在你回合的戰鬥開始時，目標由你操控的神器生物得 +2/+0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／神器師\', \'flavor\': \'「讓我們在輝煌的混亂之路上走下去吧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d3fbb43-ca35-4763-bce4-7708b08e052c\', \'multiverseId\': 424174}, \'multiverseid\': 424174}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandras Revolution\', \'text\': \'Chandras Revolution fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu. Tappe ein Land deiner Wahl. Das Land enttappt nicht während des nächsten Enttappsegments seines Beherrschers.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Chandra wurde vom Zorn getrieben, der sich gegen den Mann richtete, der ihr einst ihren Vater nahm.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424296&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'191bbca3-589d-4dbf-b2d6-4c8321b4bd70\', \'multiverseId\': 424296}, \'multiverseid\': 424296}, {\'name\': \'Revolución de Chandra\', \'text\': \'La Revolución de Chandra hace 4 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo. Gira la tierra objetivo. Esa tierra no se endereza durante el próximo paso de enderezar de su controlador.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Chandra estaba motivada por su rabia, que se dirigía en particular al hombre que le había arrebatado a su padre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a02b945f-97bf-401f-913a-3626c63a2127\', \'multiverseId\': 425584}, \'multiverseid\': 425584}, {\'name\': \'Révolte de Chandra\', \'text\': \'La Révolte de Chandra inflige 4 blessures à une créature ciblée. Engagez le terrain ciblé. Ce terrain ne se dégage pas pendant la prochaine étape de dégagement de son contrôleur.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Chandra était mue par la colère qu\'elle vouait à l\'homme qui lui avait enlevé son père.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424480&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2415171c-f67c-478a-a243-3dfa2861e772\', \'multiverseId\': 424480}, \'multiverseid\': 424480}, {\'name\': \'Rivoluzione di Chandra\', \'text\': \'La Rivoluzione di Chandra infligge 4 danni a una creatura bersaglio. TAPpa una terra bersaglio. Quella terra non STAPpa durante il prossimo STAP del suo controllore.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Chandra era mossa dalla rabbia, diretta in particolar modo contro l\'uomo che le aveva strappato suo padre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6159fca5-5f8c-4481-99cf-935e4668d235\', \'multiverseId\': 424664}, \'multiverseid\': 424664}, {\'name\': \'チャンドラの革命\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体と土地１つを対象とする。チャンドラの革命はそのクリーチャーに４点のダメージを与える。その土地をタップする。その土地は、それのコントローラーの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'怒りがチャンドラを突き動かしていた。その怒りは父を奪った男に向けられていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d8dfba8-8998-4f55-ab6d-a28a4826d76e\', \'multiverseId\': 424848}, \'multiverseid\': 424848}, {\'name\': \'찬드라의 혁명\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 찬드라의 혁명은 그 생물에 피해 4점을 입힌다. 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지를 탭한다. 그 대지는 조종자의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'찬드라를 움직이는 힘은 자신의 아버지를 빼앗아간 자에 대한 분노였다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e470c06b-e597-429e-8637-f3f5f2ebdc90\', \'multiverseId\': 425032}, \'multiverseid\': 425032}, {\'name\': \'Revolução de Chandra\', \'text\': \'Revolução de Chandra causa 4 pontos de dano à criatura alvo. Vire o terreno alvo. Ele não é desvirado durante a próxima etapa de desvirar de seu controlador.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Chandra era movida por sua raiva, direcionada particularmente ao homem que lhe tomou o pai.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db04f9cf-c5e6-4b3c-8327-98a5284a8524\', \'multiverseId\': 425216}, \'multiverseid\': 425216}, {\'name\': \'Революция Чандры\', \'text\': \'Революция Чандры наносит 4 повреждения целевому существу. Поверните целевую землю. Та земля не разворачивается во время следующего шага разворота контролирующего ее игрока.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Чандру подстегивал гнев, направленный прежде всего на человека, отнявшего у нее отца.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89eecb9d-fadd-438f-9fdb-f66a5c8259a0\', \'multiverseId\': 425400}, \'multiverseid\': 425400}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的革命\', \'text\': \'茜卓的革命对目标生物造成4点伤害。横置目标地。该地于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'茜卓怒不可遏，将满腔忿恨全数撒在从她身边夺走父亲的元凶身上。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a932470-923d-49b9-9c2d-7245822204f3\', \'multiverseId\': 423928}, \'multiverseid\': 423928}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的革命\', \'text\': \'茜卓的革命對目標生物造成4點傷害。橫置目標地。該地於其操控者的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'茜卓怒不可遏，將滿腔忿恨全數撒在從她身邊奪走父親的元兇身上。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bb8e7ac-7e83-4b2e-b8a2-55ca982533b9\', \'multiverseId\': 424112}, \'multiverseid\': 424112}]', '[{\'name\': \'Draufgängerischer Dragster\', \'text\': \'Am Ende des Kampfes und falls der Draufgängerische Dragster in diesem Kampf angegriffen oder geblockt hat, lege eine Geschwindigkeitsmarke auf ihn. Falls dann zwei oder mehr Geschwindigkeitsmarken auf ihm liegen, opfere ihn und ziehe zwei Karten.\\nBemannen 2 (Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die zusammen Stärke 2 oder mehr haben: Dieses Fahrzeug wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424368&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2852a19-6772-4ca4-a420-3efdeaecf7cc\', \'multiverseId\': 424368}, \'multiverseid\': 424368}, {\'name\': \'Auto trucado temerario\', \'text\': \'Al final del combate, si el Auto trucado temerario atacó o bloqueó este combate, pon un contador de velocidad sobre él. Luego, si tiene dos o más contadores de velocidad sobre él, sacrifícalo y roba dos cartas.\\nTripular 2. (Girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controlas con una fuerza total de 2 o más: Este Vehículo se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d47f3a3-e8d7-461d-8d7c-9d82c4fb2ca1\', \'multiverseId\': 425656}, \'multiverseid\': 425656}, {\'name\': \'Dragster casse-cou\', \'text\': "À la fin du combat, si le Dragster casse-cou a attaqué ou bloqué pendant ce combat, mettez un marqueur « rapidité » sur lui. Ensuite, s\'il a au moins deux marqueurs « rapidité » sur lui, sacrifiez-le et piochez deux cartes.\\nPilotage 2 (Engagez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez dont la force totale est supérieure ou égale à 2 : Ce véhicule devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : véhicule\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424552&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'950128c9-0824-4886-8af5-bdf3f8f35382\', \'multiverseId\': 424552}, \'multiverseid\': 424552}, {\'name\': \'Bolide Spericolato\', \'text\': \'Alla fine del combattimento, se il Bolide Spericolato ha attaccato o bloccato in questo combattimento, metti un segnalino velocità su di esso. Poi, se ha due o più segnalini velocità, sacrificalo e pesca due carte.\\nManovrare 2 (TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli con forza totale pari o superiore a 2: Questo Veicolo diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'581962bf-1560-4452-bd14-e3bea45f5e5e\', \'multiverseId\': 424736}, \'multiverseid\': 424736}, {\'name\': \'無謀者の競走車\', \'text\': \'戦闘終了時に、無謀者の競走車がこの戦闘で攻撃したかブロックした場合、これの上に速度カウンターを１個置く。その後、これの上に速度カウンターが２個以上置かれているなら、これを生け贄に捧げ、カードを２枚引く。\\n搭乗２（あなたがコントロールする望む数のクリーチャーを、パワーの合計が２以上になるように選んでタップする：ターン終了時まで、この機体はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba5dcf31-bb88-45b9-b781-bfc35b6f6162\', \'multiverseId\': 424920}, \'multiverseid\': 424920}, {\'name\': \'무모한 경주자동차\', \'text\': \'전투종료에, 무모한 경주자동차가 이 전투에서 공격하거나 방어했다면, 무모한 경주자동차에 속도 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 그 후 무모한 경주자동차가 속도 카운터를 두 개 이상 가지고 있다면, 무모한 경주자동차를 희생하고 카드 두 장을 뽑는다.\\n탑승 2 (당신이 조종하는 생물을 공격력 총합이 2 이상이 되도록 원하는 수만큼 탭한다: 이 탑승물은 턴종료까지 마법물체 생물이 된다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 탑승물\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61c1a56c-00a0-4d1c-9476-c7bc8b54a777\', \'multiverseId\': 425104}, \'multiverseid\': 425104}, {\'name\': \'Dragster dos Destemidos\', \'text\': \'No final do combate, se Dragster dos Destemidos atacou ou bloqueou neste combate, coloque um marcador de velocidade nele. Em seguida, se ele tiver dois ou mais marcadores de velocidade, sacrifique-o e compre dois cards.\\nTripular 2 (Vire qualquer número de criaturas que você controla com total de poder igual ou superior a 2: Este Veículo se torna uma criatura artefato até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Veículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1834ab71-ec5a-412b-9f65-159cae64db90\', \'multiverseId\': 425288}, \'multiverseid\': 425288}, {\'name\': \'Отчаянный Болид\', \'text\': \'В конце боя, если Отчаянный Болид атаковал или блокировал в этом бою, положите на него один жетон скорости. Затем, если на нем есть два или больше жетонов скорости, пожертвуйте его и возьмите две карты.\\nЭкипаж 2 (Поверните любое количество существ под вашим контролем с суммарной силой 2 или более: эта Машина становится артефактом существом до конца хода.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Машина\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58370433-967a-4cf1-b1f7-efba017b48a1\', \'multiverseId\': 425472}, \'multiverseid\': 425472}, {\'name\': \'铁胆赛车\', \'text\': \'在战斗结束时，若铁胆赛车在本次战斗中攻击或阻挡过，则在其上放置一个速度指示物。然后如果其上有两个或更多速度指示物，则牺牲它且抓两张牌。\\n搭载2（横置任意数量由你操控且力量总和等于或大于2的生物：此载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'神器～载具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed42ef74-2efe-45c1-81d5-6fa018fcf305\', \'multiverseId\': 424000}, \'multiverseid\': 424000}, {\'name\': \'鐵膽賽車\', \'text\': \'在戰鬥結束時，若鐵膽賽車在本次戰鬥中攻擊或阻擋過，則在其上放置一個速度指示物。然後如果其上有兩個或更多速度指示物，則犧牲它且抽兩張牌。\\n搭載2（橫置任意數量由你操控且力量總和等於或大於2的生物：此載具成為神器生物直到回合結束。）\', \'type\': \'神器～載具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6bbfdaf-2c5f-4734-a8c5-18b27c9d3b01\', \'multiverseId\': 424184}, \'multiverseid\': 424184}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dreister Eindringling\', \'text\': \'Der Dreiste Eindringling kann von Artefaktkreaturen nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zwerg, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Dieses kleine Biest zerlegt euch alle in weniger als 30 Sekunden in eure Einzelteile! Na los, kommt schon, wer will der Erste sein? Versucht nur, mich aufzuhalten!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424226&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a4ed5b8-57ef-4930-8161-249847ded3a2\', \'multiverseId\': 424226}, \'multiverseid\': 424226}, {\'name\': \'Infiltrador audaz\', \'text\': \'El Infiltrador audaz no puede ser bloqueado por criaturas artefacto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Enano bribón\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Este bichejo puede convertirlos a todos en chatarra en menos de treinta segundos! Venga, ¿quién quiere ser el primero? ¡Intenten detenerme!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7194da8b-3424-42b4-9e72-5cc58032fd80\', \'multiverseId\': 425514}, \'multiverseid\': 425514}, {\'name\': \'Infiltrateur audacieux\', \'text\': "L\'Infiltrateur audacieux ne peut pas être bloqué par des créatures-artefacts.", \'type\': \'Créature : nain et gredin\', \'flavor\': "« Cette petite bestiole peut tous vous mettre en charpie en moins de trente secondes ! Alors, qui veut être le premier ? Essayez un peu de m\'arrêter ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424410&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0068665-037d-4b2e-ab43-13477bf271e0\', \'multiverseId\': 424410}, \'multiverseid\': 424410}, {\'name\': \'Infiltrato Audace\', \'text\': "L\'Infiltrato Audace non può essere bloccato da creature artefatto.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Nano\', \'flavor\': \'"Questo piccoletto può ridurvi tutti a brandelli in meno di trenta secondi! Forza, chi vuole essere il primo? Provate a fermarmi!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66ce2439-3f49-4603-987d-d2b53f62fba1\', \'multiverseId\': 424594}, \'multiverseid\': 424594}, {\'name\': \'大胆な潜入者\', \'text\': \'大胆な潜入者はアーティファクト・クリーチャーによってはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドワーフ・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「こいつは30秒もあれば何でもスクラップにできるよ！どうした、最初に試すのは誰だい？俺のことを止めてみなよ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e9db13a-d093-49a2-86d1-d5c2a760e991\', \'multiverseId\': 424778}, \'multiverseid\': 424778}, {\'name\': \'무모한 침투자\', \'text\': \'무모한 침투자는 마법물체 생물에게 방어될 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 드워프 도적\', \'flavor\': \'"이 작은 생물이 너희들을 30초 안에 모두 고철로 만들어 놓을 거다. 자, 누가 먼저 도전해 볼 테냐? 어서 덤벼 봐!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5ee4634-77e8-44b9-92b7-d66d36ca9d09\', \'multiverseId\': 424962}, \'multiverseid\': 424962}, {\'name\': \'Infiltrador Audacioso\', \'text\': \'Infiltrador Audacioso não pode ser bloqueado por criaturas artefato.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anão Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'"Essa belezinha pode transformar todos vocês em sucata em menos de trinta segundos. Vamos lá, quem quer vir primeiro? Tentem me deter!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'507b9e1d-afee-421b-aa03-1a28ea712ba5\', \'multiverseId\': 425146}, \'multiverseid\': 425146}, {\'name\': \'Дерзкий Лазутчик\', \'text\': \'Дерзкий Лазутчик не может быть заблокирован артефактами существами.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гном Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'«Этот маленький зверек за полминуты любого превратит в металлолом! Ну, кто хочет стать первым? Только попробуйте меня остановить!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da49cda7-4b17-4d28-84d0-dd5e6ca52c35\', \'multiverseId\': 425330}, \'multiverseid\': 425330}, {\'name\': \'大胆渗透者\', \'text\': \'大胆渗透者不能被神器生物阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物～矮人／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「这小家伙不消半分钟就能把你们全部变成废铁！来啊，谁想先来试试？有本事就来拦我啊！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd0cc25c-735a-4c8b-be34-b90b09a77bf9\', \'multiverseId\': 423858}, \'multiverseid\': 423858}, {\'name\': \'大膽滲透者\', \'text\': \'大膽滲透者不能被神器生物阻擋。\', \'type\': \'生物～矮人／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「這小傢伙不消半分鐘就能把你們全部變成廢鐵！來啊，誰想先來試試？有本事就來攔我啊！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9354cc0e-7add-4075-84b7-a90bfad65b6b\', \'multiverseId\': 424042}, \'multiverseid\': 424042}]', '[{\'name\': \'Druidin des Kuttengrunds\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {G}.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Das wilde Wirrwarr des Kuttengrunds ist den Lebewesen eine Zuflucht, die einst zusahen, wie die ersten Türme gen Himmel wuchsen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424325&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84fda074-3d6f-4ae0-928a-fe48c87f7150\', \'multiverseId\': 424325}, \'multiverseid\': 424325}, {\'name\': \'Druida de Cogulla\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {G} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"La naturaleza salvaje de la Cogulla es un santuario a la vida que vio alzarse a los primeros edificios".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30bae93a-d35f-42f0-9b1f-94e1c5d9a386\', \'multiverseId\': 425613}, \'multiverseid\': 425613}, {\'name\': "Druidesse de l\'Auvent", \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {G} à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': "« La friche de l\'Auvent offre un sanctuaire aux êtres qui ont vu s\'élever les premiers bâtiments. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424509&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86fe9c08-1ded-4a55-bd32-5b00ec6c1aa6\', \'multiverseId\': 424509}, \'multiverseid\': 424509}, {\'name\': \'Druida della Cappa\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {G} alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il selvatico groviglio della Cappa offre rifugio alla fauna che vide sorgere i primi edifici."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'196d6531-fc23-4f8a-91e8-40417a34832d\', \'multiverseId\': 424693}, \'multiverseid\': 424693}, {\'name\': \'僧帽地帯のドルイド\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「僧帽地帯の野生の茂みは、始めて建物が作られる様子を見ていた命の聖域になっている。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'579f43ea-7fed-4335-98fd-c76d4e684260\', \'multiverseId\': 424877}, \'multiverseid\': 424877}, {\'name\': \'카울의 드루이드\', \'text\': \'{T}: {G}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 드루이드\', \'flavor\': \'"카울의 얽히고설킨 야생 환경은 첫 건물들이 세워지는 것을 지켜본 생명의 보금자리였다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6333017a-cd66-418d-b9f6-36f46f2a7eed\', \'multiverseId\': 425061}, \'multiverseid\': 425061}, {\'name\': \'Druida do Capote\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {G} à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"O matagal selvagem do Capote é um santuário para a vida que viu as primeiras construções se erguerem."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5adbb564-702a-40b4-ba48-59f67e064ca5\', \'multiverseId\': 425245}, \'multiverseid\': 425245}, {\'name\': \'Друид Покрова\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {G} в ваше хранилище маны.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Друид\', \'flavor\': \'«Буйные заросли Покрова стали убежищем для той жизни, что наблюдала за возведением первых зданий».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66943eec-3a6f-42d2-ba3a-b65704461678\', \'multiverseId\': 425429}, \'multiverseid\': 425429}, {\'name\': \'外沿区德鲁伊\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{G}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「外沿区的野林地为那些见证过首批建筑物兴起的生物提供庇护所。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ecbf821-e10c-48fa-87fd-d1b34b13011f\', \'multiverseId\': 423957}, \'multiverseid\': 423957}, {\'name\': \'外沿區德魯伊\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{G}到你的魔法力池中。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'「外沿區的野林地為那些見證過首批建築物興起的生物提供庇護所。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54d48a6d-9d90-4b8f-8ddd-e89776c5f397\', \'multiverseId\': 424141}, \'multiverseid\': 424141}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dunkle Vorzeichen\', \'text\': \'Jeder Gegner opfert eine Kreatur oder einen Planeswalker und wirft dann eine Karte ab. Du bringst eine Kreaturen- oder Planeswalkerkarte aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück und ziehst dann eine Karte.\\nWenn du einen Bolas-Planeswalkerzauber wirkst, schicke die Dunklen Vorzeichen aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil. Jener Planeswalker kommt mit einer zusätzlichen Loyalitätsmarke ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424347&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bb763d1-4cb8-436b-ab8a-ef348578b53a\', \'multiverseId\': 424347}, \'multiverseid\': 424347}, {\'name\': \'Indicios oscuros\', \'text\': \'Cada oponente sacrifica una criatura o un planeswalker y luego descarta una carta. Tú regresas una carta de criatura o de planeswalker de tu cementerio a tu mano y luego robas una carta.\\nCuando lances un hechizo de planeswalker Bolas, exilia los Indicios oscuros de tu cementerio. Ese planeswalker entra al campo de batalla con un contador de lealtad adicional sobre él.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73b95bfd-0046-424e-9b7a-d9e72d47b3ec\', \'multiverseId\': 425635}, \'multiverseid\': 425635}, {\'name\': \'Obscures suggestions\', \'text\': "Chaque adversaire sacrifie une créature ou un planeswalker, puis se défausse d\'une carte. Vous renvoyez une carte de créature ou de planeswalker depuis votre cimetière dans votre main, puis vous piochez une carte.\\nQuand vous lancez un sort de planeswalker Bolas, exilez les Obscures suggestions depuis votre cimetière. Ce planeswalker arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur « loyauté » supplémentaire sur lui.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424531&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'822d2365-7b46-46f1-9ce9-7b20882c0e94\', \'multiverseId\': 424531}, \'multiverseid\': 424531}, {\'name\': \'Oscuri Segnali\', \'text\': \'Ogni avversario sacrifica una creatura o un planeswalker, poi scarta una carta. Riprendi in mano una carta creatura o planeswalker dal tuo cimitero, poi pesca una carta.\\nQuando lanci una magia planeswalker Bolas, esilia gli Oscuri Segnali dal tuo cimitero. Quel planeswalker entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino fedeltà addizionale.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6e3527a-4890-4da5-9979-30afc48e62a6\', \'multiverseId\': 424715}, \'multiverseid\': 424715}, {\'name\': \'闇の暗示\', \'text\': \'各対戦相手はそれぞれ、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を生け贄に捧げ、その後カード１枚を捨てる。あなたは、あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚かプレインズウォーカー・カード１枚をあなたの手札に戻し、その後カードを１枚引く。\\nあなたがボーラス・プレインズウォーカー・呪文を１つ唱えたとき、あなたの墓地から闇の暗示を追放する。そのプレインズウォーカーは忠誠カウンターが追加で１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8e5bf10-eb2b-48e8-b170-b7c27d4da540\', \'multiverseId\': 424899}, \'multiverseid\': 424899}, {\'name\': \'사악한 암시\', \'text\': \'각 상대는 생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 희생한 후, 카드 한 장을 버린다. 당신은 생물 또는 플레인즈워커 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 당신의 손으로 되돌린 후, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\\n당신이 볼라스 플레인즈워커 주문을 발동할 때, 당신의 무덤에서 사악한 암시를 추방한다. 그 플레인즈워커는 충성 카운터 한 개를 추가로 가지고 전장에 들어온다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e44f2494-accf-4944-b1b5-06f5407ff65a\', \'multiverseId\': 425083}, \'multiverseid\': 425083}, {\'name\': \'Intimações Sombrias\', \'text\': \'Cada oponente sacrifica uma criatura ou um planeswalker e, em seguida, descarta um card. Você devolve um card de criatura ou planeswalker de seu cemitério para sua mão e, em seguida, compra um card.\\nQuando você conjurar uma mágica de planeswalker do tipo Nicol Bolas, exile Intimações Sombrias do seu cemitério. Aquele planeswalker entra no campo de batalha com um marcador de lealdade adicional.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e62e02b8-562c-49a6-9e53-ad90892f10ab\', \'multiverseId\': 425267}, \'multiverseid\': 425267}, {\'name\': \'Мрачные Намеки\', \'text\': \'Каждый оппонент жертвует существо или planeswalker-а, затем сбрасывает карту. Вы возвращаете карту существа или planeswalker-а из вашего кладбища в вашу руку, затем берете карту.\\nКогда вы разыгрываете заклинание planeswalker-а Боласа, изгоните Мрачные Намеки из вашего кладбища. Тот planeswalker выходит на поле битвы с одним дополнительным жетоном верности на нем.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3bd90f6-1f36-4d96-885d-2f75f6b2eab5\', \'multiverseId\': 425451}, \'multiverseid\': 425451}, {\'name\': \'黑暗预示\', \'text\': \'每位对手各牺牲一个生物或鹏洛客，然后各弃一张牌。你将一张生物或鹏洛客牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上，然后抓一张牌。\\n当你施放波拉斯鹏洛客咒语时，从你的坟墓场中放逐黑暗预示。该鹏洛客进战场时上面额外有一个忠诚指示物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7307e32e-1500-413d-9244-6ada089fb174\', \'multiverseId\': 423979}, \'multiverseid\': 423979}, {\'name\': \'黑暗預示\', \'text\': \'每位對手各犧牲一個生物或鵬洛客，然後各棄一張牌。你將一張生物或鵬洛客牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上，然後抽一張牌。\\n當你施放波拉斯鵬洛客咒語時， 從你的墳墓場中放逐黑暗預示。該鵬洛客進戰場時上面額外有一個忠誠指示物。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9df1186-15d3-4b5e-9df6-17cd8a0c0ea3\', \'multiverseId\': 424163}, \'multiverseid\': 424163}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämmerschwingen-Adler\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Dämmerschwingen-Adler ins Spiel kommt, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 und Wachsamkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': \'„Er setzte sich auf den Arm des Engels und ich spürte die Blicke der beiden auf mir ruhen." —Aufzeichnungen eines Aeronauten\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424233&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df33ae05-20bd-46e2-b8ae-53d358a2583d\', \'multiverseId\': 424233}, \'multiverseid\': 424233}, {\'name\': \'Águila pluma del alba\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Águila pluma del alba entre al campo de batalla, las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 y ganan la habilidad de vigilancia hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'"Vino a posarse en el brazo del ángel y el peso de ambas miradas recayó sobre mí". —Diario del aeronauta\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f07d607f-12e0-443d-a84c-c55ad498c044\', \'multiverseId\': 425521}, \'multiverseid\': 425521}, {\'name\': "Aigle aux plumes d\'aube", \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Aigle aux plumes d\'aube arrive sur le champ de bataille, les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 et acquièrent la vigilance jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau\', \'flavor\': "« Il vint se reposer sur le bras de l\'ange, puis le poids de leur regard m\'accabla. » —Journal de l\'aéronaute", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424417&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1435a98f-b2bc-4bf2-ad39-9e6a9b34c9ab\', \'multiverseId\': 424417}, \'multiverseid\': 424417}, {\'name\': \'Aquila Piumaurora\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Aquila Piumaurora entra nel campo di battaglia, le creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 e hanno cautela fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'"Venne a posarsi sul braccio dell\\\'angelo e fu allora che il peso dei loro sguardi cadde su di me." —Diario dell\\\'Aeronauta\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3e81bee-7a54-4091-9aee-d4e1d44d80da\', \'multiverseId\': 424601}, \'multiverseid\': 424601}, {\'name\': \'暁羽の鷲\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n暁羽の鷲が戦場に出たとき、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともに警戒を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥\', \'flavor\': \'「それは天使の腕に止まると、私をじっと見つめた。」 ――飛空士の日誌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8eae69b1-7e67-4b6d-a15d-8109fc51924c\', \'multiverseId\': 424785}, \'multiverseid\': 424785}, {\'name\': \'여명깃털 독수리\', \'text\': \'비행\\n여명깃털 독수리가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받고 경계를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 조류\', \'flavor\': \'"그 놈은 천사의 팔에 내려 앉더니 매서운 눈초리로 나를 노려보았어." —비행병의 일지\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37b994d9-84f1-465d-bbd0-8b43c974c3d1\', \'multiverseId\': 424969}, \'multiverseid\': 424969}, {\'name\': "Águia-pena-d\'aurora", \'text\': "Voar\\nQuando Águia-pena-d\'aurora entra no campo de batalha, as criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1 e ganham vigilância até o final do turno.", \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'"Ela chegou e pousou no braço do anjo, e então o peso de seus olhares se abateu sobre mim." — Diário de um aeronauta\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b2cac9b-c45a-4c38-aff2-1ffccbb6eedd\', \'multiverseId\': 425153}, \'multiverseid\': 425153}, {\'name\': \'Орел Рассветных Перьев\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Орел Рассветных Перьев выходит на поле битвы, существа под вашим контролем получают +1/+1 и Бдительность до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица\', \'flavor\': \'«Он уселся на руку ангела, и оба обратили на меня свой тяжелый взор». — дневник аэронавта\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf071596-c160-4d28-a6ab-123e22e62bb5\', \'multiverseId\': 425337}, \'multiverseid\': 425337}, {\'name\': \'曙羽雄鹰\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当曙羽雄鹰进战场时，直到回合结束，由你操控的生物得+1/+1且获得警戒异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～鸟\', \'flavor\': \'「它徐徐落在天使臂弯上，我顿时感受到了它那份凝重的目光。」 ～空行师日志\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aedc2cff-7527-4475-96a5-11afa9f6cc61\', \'multiverseId\': 423865}, \'multiverseid\': 423865}, {\'name\': \'曙羽雄鷹\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當曙羽雄鷹進戰場時，直到回合結束，由你操控的生物得+1/+1且獲得警戒異能。\', \'type\': \'生物～鳥\', \'flavor\': \'「牠徐徐落在天使臂彎上，我頓時感受到了牠那份凝重的目光。」 ～空行師日誌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7d4c732-7aea-49e7-a6b8-276a5ced4d04\', \'multiverseId\': 424049}, \'multiverseid\': 424049}]', '[{\'name\': \'Effiziente Konstruktion\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Artefaktzauber wirkst, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Für einige von Ghirapurs Luftschiffkonstrukteuren gehört das Herstellen von Thoptern bei größeren Bauvorhaben einfach dazu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424252&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47f6297c-f0f5-4d72-a007-d70006dbd6c0\', \'multiverseId\': 424252}, \'multiverseid\': 424252}, {\'name\': \'Construcción eficiente\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de artefacto, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Tóptero incolora 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Para algunos aerocreadores de Ghirapur, la construcción de tópteros es un subproducto de proyectos más grandes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a34b50a-844d-420a-a784-b18fc7758266\', \'multiverseId\': 425540}, \'multiverseid\': 425540}, {\'name\': \'Construction efficace\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'artefact, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Pour certains aéro-artisans de Ghirapur, la fabrication de mécanoptères est inévitable à la réalisation de plus grandes constructions.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424436&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'817d45e7-e07b-405e-8753-936abfafb6f6\', \'multiverseId\': 424436}, \'multiverseid\': 424436}, {\'name\': \'Costruzione Efficiente\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia artefatto, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 incolore con volare.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Per alcuni aerocostruttori di Ghirapur, i totteri sono un sottoprodotto di sforzi costruttivi di maggiore entità.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7409eaa-dad7-4714-835b-c4546fbd1e85\', \'multiverseId\': 424620}, \'multiverseid\': 424620}, {\'name\': \'効率的構築\', \'text\': \'あなたがアーティファクト・呪文を１つ唱えるたび、飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'ギラプールの一部の空大工にとって、飛行機械は大規模構築作業の副産物にすぎない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ecef1db-32cc-40e7-b0c4-321dbb5f22b7\', \'multiverseId\': 424804}, \'multiverseid\': 424804}, {\'name\': \'효율적 제조\', \'text\': \'당신이 마법물체 주문을 발동할 때마다, 비행을 가진 1/1 무색 날틀 마법물체 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'기라푸르의 일부 비행선 제작자에게 날틀 제작은 대형 기계 제작의 부산물에 불과하다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a0539dd-3bda-486f-8dd0-b4ca89bd9013\', \'multiverseId\': 424988}, \'multiverseid\': 424988}, {\'name\': \'Construção Eficiente\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica de artefato, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Tóptero com voar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Para alguns dos aeroneiros de Ghirapur, construir tópteros é um subproduto de projetos maiores.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91b8a517-0a9f-4de9-bd52-5eba9379f2d9\', \'multiverseId\': 425172}, \'multiverseid\': 425172}, {\'name\': \'Эффективная Сборка\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание артефакта, создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Топтер с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Для некоторых аэромастеров Гирапура топтеры становятся просто побочным продуктом при постройке масштабных творений.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25dd7dbf-3843-4672-916c-f9ba59709de5\', \'multiverseId\': 425356}, \'multiverseid\': 425356}, {\'name\': \'高效建造\', \'text\': \'每当你施放神器咒语时，派出一个1/1无色，具飞行异能的振翼机衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'对吉拉波部分煅空匠而言，振翼机不过是建设大型工程时顺手造出来的东西而已。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7111793-320b-424b-822f-c286106fd12a\', \'multiverseId\': 423884}, \'multiverseid\': 423884}, {\'name\': \'高效建造\', \'text\': \'每當你施放神器咒語時，派出一個1/1無色，具飛行異能的振翼機衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'對吉拉波部分煅空匠而言，振翼機不過是建設大型工程時順手造出來的東西而已。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26810d41-a59c-4fc1-81ad-3d42ab1a0e35\', \'multiverseId\': 424068}, \'multiverseid\': 424068}]', "[{'name': 'Einzelgängerischer Thopterist', 'text': 'Improvisieren (Deine Artefakte können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)\\nWenn der Einzelgängerische Thopterist ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei 1/1 farblose Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424349&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6200cde4-dab7-4b60-98ab-7b488627f32f', 'multiverseId': 424349}, 'multiverseid': 424349}, {'name': 'Topterista inconformista', 'text': 'Improvisar. (Tus artefactos pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada artefacto que gires una vez que termines de activar habilidades de maná paga {1}.)\\nCuando el Topterista inconformista entre al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de criatura artefacto Tóptero incoloras 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.', 'type': 'Criatura — Artífice humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425637&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20b0aa05-49aa-416a-ba46-53585f59ae2e', 'multiverseId': 425637}, 'multiverseid': 425637}, {'name': 'Mécanoptériste dissident', 'text': 'Improvisation (Vos artefacts peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque artefact que vous engagez après avoir activé des capacités de mana paie {1}.)\\nQuand le Mécanoptériste dissident arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et artificier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424533&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd5ad9f9c-0243-4274-8672-b42faa1c3a49', 'multiverseId': 424533}, 'multiverseid': 424533}, {'name': 'Totterista Dissidente', 'text': 'Improvvisare (I tuoi artefatti possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni artefatto che TAPpi dopo aver attivato le abilità di mana corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nQuando il Totterista Dissidente entra nel campo di battaglia, crea due pedine creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 incolori con volare.', 'type': 'Creatura — Artefice Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424717&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd6df826-e28f-4be0-bdfc-2149e7a535d2', 'multiverseId': 424717}, 'multiverseid': 424717}, {'name': '異端の飛行機械職人', 'text': '即席（あなたのアーティファクトが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。あなたはあなたのアーティファクトをタップして、１個あたり{1}の支払いに代えてもよい。）\\n異端の飛行機械職人が戦場に出たとき、飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを２体生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424901&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '52d656ff-9d2a-4bc4-a8dd-5d122cc90992', 'multiverseId': 424901}, 'multiverseid': 424901}, {'name': '독불장군 날틀제작자', 'text': '급조 (당신의 마법물체들은 이 주문을 발동하는 것을 도울 수 있다. 마나 능력을 활성화한 후에 탭하는 각 마법물체는 이 주문의 비용 중 {1}을 지불한다.)\\n독불장군 날틀제작자가 전장에 들어올 때, 비행을 가진 1/1 무색 날틀 마법물체 생물 토큰 두 개를 만든다.', 'type': '생물 — 인간 기능공', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425085&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1503d62f-7122-46f7-a998-0f65fa0bfa55', 'multiverseId': 425085}, 'multiverseid': 425085}, {'name': 'Topterista Dissidente', 'text': 'Improvisar (Seus artefatos podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada artefato que você vira após terminar de ativar habilidades de mana paga por {1}.)\\nQuando Topterista Dissidente entrar no campo de batalha, crie duas fichas de criatura artefato incolores 1/1 do tipo Tóptero com voar.', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano Artesão', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425269&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1554d0c-1e87-4b79-aded-c1b6f60fd1cf', 'multiverseId': 425269}, 'multiverseid': 425269}, {'name': 'Мятежный Конструктор Топтеров', 'text': 'Импровизация (Ваши артефакты могут помочь разыграть это заклинание. Каждый артефакт, который вы поворачиваете после того, как вы закончили активировать мана-способности, считается оплатой {1}.)\\nКогда Мятежный Конструктор Топтеров выходит на поле битвы, создайте две фишки артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Топтер с Полетом.', 'type': 'Существо — Человек Механик', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425453&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2428d757-8d47-4fe0-8671-972c1c8c699d', 'multiverseId': 425453}, 'multiverseid': 425453}, {'name': '独行扑翼师', 'text': '拼造（此咒语能用你的神器来协助施放。你起动完法术力异能之后每横置一个神器，就能为此咒语支付{1}。）\\n当独行扑翼师进战场时，派出两个1/1无色，具飞行异能的振翼机衍生神器生物。', 'type': '生物～人类／神器师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423981&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '312b8921-b1c7-4361-8a00-f9a5863870b7', 'multiverseId': 423981}, 'multiverseid': 423981}, {'name': '獨行撲翼師', 'text': '拼造（此咒語能用你的神器來協助施放。你起動完魔法力異能之後每橫置一個神器，就能為此咒語支付{1}。）\\n當獨行撲翼師進戰場時，派出兩個1/1無色，具飛行異能的振翼機衍生神器生物。', 'type': '生物～人類／神器師', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424165&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab44dc2c-72e5-484e-a465-672d2b4f7554', 'multiverseId': 424165}, 'multiverseid': 424165}]", '[{\'name\': \'Eisenrad-Brecher\', \'text\': \'Bemannen 3 (Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die zusammen Stärke 3 oder mehr haben: Dieses Fahrzeug wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': \'„Zusammen fahren wir durch Dick und Dünn."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424380&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'057f3a50-6973-4bb9-9c69-5e44e38c352b\', \'multiverseId\': 424380}, \'multiverseid\': 424380}, {\'name\': \'Aplastador ferroruga\', \'text\': \'Tripular 3. (Girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controlas con una fuerza total de 3 o más: Este Vehículo se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': \'"Hemos pasado por mucho juntos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46834ec8-0da5-4491-adbc-f7ffebae9e03\', \'multiverseId\': 425668}, \'multiverseid\': 425668}, {\'name\': \'Écrabouilleur roulefer\', \'text\': "Pilotage 3 (Engagez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez dont la force totale est supérieure ou égale à 3 : Ce véhicule devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : véhicule\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous avons franchi bien des obstacles ensemble. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424564&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b1cf4cd-1bf2-457c-b9b0-2abf66a8a9b1\', \'multiverseId\': 424564}, \'multiverseid\': 424564}, {\'name\': \'Distruttore Ferromobile\', \'text\': \'Manovrare 3 (TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli con forza totale pari o superiore a 3: Questo Veicolo diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ne abbiamo passate tante insieme."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'932cb884-49e9-4ec3-9e0f-c7c6b78ba664\', \'multiverseId\': 424748}, \'multiverseid\': 424748}, {\'name\': \'鉄装破壊車\', \'text\': \'搭乗３（あなたがコントロールする望む数のクリーチャーを、パワーの合計が３以上になるように選んでタップする：ターン終了時まで、この機体はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': \'「我等は共に数多の困難を乗り越えてきた。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06ebec15-ef82-45ec-babd-ffdbd69cc0ea\', \'multiverseId\': 424932}, \'multiverseid\': 424932}, {\'name\': \'철갑 두른 파괴자\', \'text\': \'탑승 3 (당신이 조종하는 생물을 공격력 총합이 3 이상이 되도록 원하는 수만큼 탭한다: 이 탑승물은 턴종료까지 마법물체 생물이 된다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 탑승물\', \'flavor\': \'"우리는 함께 많은 것을 뚫고 지나왔다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c974cc3e-12ae-4dc6-8f9d-d25ac9b2cfc9\', \'multiverseId\': 425116}, \'multiverseid\': 425116}, {\'name\': \'Esmagador Ferromóvel\', \'text\': \'Tripular 3 (Vire qualquer número de criaturas que você controla com total de poder igual ou superior a 3: Este Veículo se torna uma criatura artefato até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Veículo\', \'flavor\': \'"Já passamos por muita coisa juntos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e388247-186c-4de2-958a-f32ce385bbcb\', \'multiverseId\': 425300}, \'multiverseid\': 425300}, {\'name\': \'Крушитель Железного Грохота\', \'text\': \'Экипаж 3 (Поверните любое количество существ под вашим контролем с суммарной силой 3 или более: эта Машина становится артефактом существом до конца хода.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Машина\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы через многое прошли вместе».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'488ea34e-4edd-46ad-9626-ec008c856b7a\', \'multiverseId\': 425484}, \'multiverseid\': 425484}, {\'name\': \'钢轮碾破械\', \'text\': \'搭载3（横置任意数量由你操控且力量总和等于或大于3的生物：此载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'神器～载具\', \'flavor\': \'「我们饱经一路坎坷。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae426ad7-1f56-4670-bfd2-42be3eb42a55\', \'multiverseId\': 424012}, \'multiverseid\': 424012}, {\'name\': \'鋼輪碾破械\', \'text\': \'搭載3（橫置任意數量由你操控且力量總和等於或大於3的生物：此載具成為神器生物直到回合結束。）\', \'type\': \'神器～載具\', \'flavor\': \'「我們飽經一路坎坷。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a3f629d-c2ba-48f3-9499-00ace90422c9\', \'multiverseId\': 424196}, \'multiverseid\': 424196}]', '[{\'name\': \'Embraal-Maschinenvernichter\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere ein Artefakt: Der Embraal-Maschinenvernichter fügt jedem Gegner 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein stabiler Sechskantschlüssel ist vielseitig einsetzbar und einfach unverzichtbar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424298&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01a66081-e92e-408a-861a-ea7f5e2649fd\', \'multiverseId\': 424298}, \'multiverseid\': 424298}, {\'name\': \'Aplastaengranajes de Embraal\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar un artefacto: El Aplastaengranajes de Embraal hace 2 puntos de daño a cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Una herramienta bien forjada es un instrumento versátil e indispensable".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d65e64e-42d1-4992-9f0e-2338800c5da4\', \'multiverseId\': 425586}, \'multiverseid\': 425586}, {\'name\': "Fracasseur d\'équipement d\'Embraal", \'text\': "{T}, sacrifiez un artefact : Le Fracasseur d\'équipement d\'Embraal inflige 2 blessures à chaque adversaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Une bonne clé à molette est un outil polyvalent indispensable. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424482&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ea78f07-1b62-422e-b7f1-e4d41da7f189\', \'multiverseId\': 424482}, \'multiverseid\': 424482}, {\'name\': \'Spacca-Ingranaggi di Embraal\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifica un artefatto: Lo Spacca-Ingranaggi di Embraal infligge 2 danni a ogni avversario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Una buona chiave è uno strumento versatile e indispensabile."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20444450-7c38-404e-ae9e-ba75ddd9300f\', \'multiverseId\': 424666}, \'multiverseid\': 424666}, {\'name\': \'エンブロールの歯車砕き\', \'text\': \'{T}, アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：エンブロールの歯車砕きは各対戦相手にそれぞれ２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「よくできたスパナは何をするにも役に立つ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e2b0a5f-3543-4cf5-9554-03317fd4f576\', \'multiverseId\': 424850}, \'multiverseid\': 424850}, {\'name\': \'엠브라알 기계 파괴자\', \'text\': \'{T}, 마법물체 한 개를 희생한다: 엠브라알 기계 파괴자는 각 상대에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"잘 만든 렌치는 없어서는 안될 만능 연장이다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1185c630-c141-4cf0-b6fa-63bf58fd05ff\', \'multiverseId\': 425034}, \'multiverseid\': 425034}, {\'name\': \'Arrebentador de Engrenagens de Embraal\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifique um artefato: Arrebentador de Engrenagens de Embraal causa 2 pontos de dano a cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Uma chave inglesa bem-feita é uma ferramenta versátil e indispensável."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e809642-e561-4169-9af3-fda662e3111f\', \'multiverseId\': 425218}, \'multiverseid\': 425218}, {\'name\': \'Эмбраальский Крушитель Машин\', \'text\': \'{T}, пожертвуйте артефакт: Эмбраальский Крушитель Машин наносит 2 повреждения каждому оппоненту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Хороший гаечный ключ — универсальный и незаменимый инструмент».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'399d0d91-ab70-4926-bf27-285e6204e7b8\', \'multiverseId\': 425402}, \'multiverseid\': 425402}, {\'name\': \'安布洛碎械匠\', \'text\': \'{T}，牺牲一个神器：安布洛碎械匠向每位对手各造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「做工精良的扳手是必备的多用途工具。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04560e95-8e6c-46ba-83f1-e29bb99408e4\', \'multiverseId\': 423930}, \'multiverseid\': 423930}, {\'name\': \'安布洛碎械匠\', \'text\': \'{T}，犧牲一個神器：安布洛碎械匠向每位對手各造成2點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「做工精良的扳手是必備的多用途工具。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb31d7d0-c3b1-4409-8e9a-e0630d4f3fb8\', \'multiverseId\': 424114}, \'multiverseid\': 424114}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entgleister Express\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn der Entgleiste Express angreift, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf ihn.\\nBemannen 1 (Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die zusammen Stärke 1 oder mehr haben: Dieses Fahrzeug wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': \'Regeln können gebrochen werden, Schienen genauso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424398&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'174934a8-a004-44a3-b9a5-27962e944292\', \'multiverseId\': 424398}, \'multiverseid\': 424398}, {\'name\': \'Exprés desatado\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nSiempre que el Exprés desatado ataque, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre él.\\nTripular 1. (Girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controlas con una fuerza total de 1 o más: Este Vehículo se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': \'Las reglas y los raíles están hechos para romperse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f28a0cb-f954-4a5f-8b80-3afa8702c518\', \'multiverseId\': 425686}, \'multiverseid\': 425686}, {\'name\': \'Express incontrôlé\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Express incontrôlé attaque, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui.\\nPilotage 1 (Engagez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez dont la force totale est supérieure ou égale à 1 : Ce véhicule devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : véhicule\', \'flavor\': \'Les règles et les rails ne sont pas faits pour être suivis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424582&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0b8dab0-dc83-49c0-b523-a5e58a90e58f\', \'multiverseId\': 424582}, \'multiverseid\': 424582}, {\'name\': \'Espresso Deragliato\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Espresso Deragliato attacca, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di esso.\\nManovrare 1 (TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli con forza totale pari o superiore a 1: Questo Veicolo diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.)", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': \'Regole e rotaie sono fatte per essere infrante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae7be218-0119-4222-936c-75b05c6f57b3\', \'multiverseId\': 424766}, \'multiverseid\': 424766}, {\'name\': \'暴走急行\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n暴走急行が攻撃するたび、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\\n搭乗１（あなたがコントロールする望む数のクリーチャーを、パワーの合計が１以上になるように選んでタップする：ターン終了時まで、この機体はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': \'ルールもレールも無視するためにある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'569b234a-3528-404e-b904-ec72996e9146\', \'multiverseId\': 424950}, \'multiverseid\': 424950}, {\'name\': \'고삐 풀린 고속열차\', \'text\': \'돌진\\n고삐 풀린 고속열차가 공격할 때마다, 고삐 풀린 고속열차에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n탑승 1 (당신이 조종하는 생물을 공격력 총합이 1 이상이 되도록 원하는 수만큼 탭한다: 이 탑승물은 턴종료까지 마법물체 생물이 된다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 탑승물\', \'flavor\': \'규칙과 레일은 깨라고 만든 것이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5860315b-84fd-4481-803f-85f48664f7c4\', \'multiverseId\': 425134}, \'multiverseid\': 425134}, {\'name\': \'Expresso Desengatado\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nToda vez que Expresso Desengatado atacar, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nele.\\nTripular 1 (Vire qualquer número de criaturas que você controla com total de poder igual ou superior a 1: Este Veículo se torna uma criatura artefato até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Veículo\', \'flavor\': \'Regras e trilhos são feitos para serem quebrados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd74ef8a-c7ab-48a8-8946-2655bea718c2\', \'multiverseId\': 425318}, \'multiverseid\': 425318}, {\'name\': \'Неудержимый Экспресс\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nКаждый раз, когда Неудержимый Экспресс атакует, положите на него один жетон +1/+1.\\nЭкипаж 1 (Поверните любое количество существ под вашим контролем с суммарной силой 1 или более: эта Машина становится артефактом существом до конца хода.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Машина\', \'flavor\': \'Правила и рельсы существуют, чтобы их ломать.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0c32c8a-42c1-4845-972a-14c4bcbdb47e\', \'multiverseId\': 425502}, \'multiverseid\': 425502}, {\'name\': \'脱轨特快\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n每当脱轨特快攻击时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n搭载1（横置任意数量由你操控且力量总和等于或大于1的生物：此载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'神器～载具\', \'flavor\': \'规则和轨道就是用来跳脱的。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e80bf84b-5de0-486f-b83c-eb43b22a28e1\', \'multiverseId\': 424030}, \'multiverseid\': 424030}, {\'name\': \'脫軌特快\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n每當脫軌特快攻擊時，在其上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\\n搭載1（橫置任意數量由你操控且力量總和等於或大於1的生物：此載具成為神器生物直到回合結束。）\', \'type\': \'神器～載具\', \'flavor\': \'規則和軌道就是用來跳脫的。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9ccf0e9-e4fd-4d83-a13b-51cc0d58710d\', \'multiverseId\': 424214}, \'multiverseid\': 424214}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erfinder der Bastion\', \'text\': \'Improvisieren (Deine Artefakte können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)\\nFluchsicher (Diese Kreatur kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein, die deine Gegner kontrollieren.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vedalken, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'„Diese Rüstung übersteigt die Grenzen, an die bloßes Fleisch und Knochen stoßen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424249&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70a59a22-09f9-41fa-a4b7-1f1b22728ca5\', \'multiverseId\': 424249}, \'multiverseid\': 424249}, {\'name\': \'Inventor del Bastión\', \'text\': \'Improvisar. (Tus artefactos pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada artefacto que gires una vez que termines de activar habilidades de maná paga {1}.)\\nAntimaleficio. (Esta criatura no puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades que controlen tus oponentes.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice vedalken\', \'flavor\': \'"Esta armadura trasciende las limitaciones de la carne".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86e15dc9-6726-449e-a8fc-67ba8a0f4fd4\', \'multiverseId\': 425537}, \'multiverseid\': 425537}, {\'name\': \'Inventeur du bastion\', \'text\': \'Improvisation (Vos artefacts peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque artefact que vous engagez après avoir activé des capacités de mana paie {1}.)\\nDéfense talismanique (Cette créature ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités que vos adversaires contrôlent.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : vedalken et artificier\', \'flavor\': \'« Cette armure transcende les limites de la chair et des os. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424433&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f760405-ee83-48f9-a8a6-dee45d1655fc\', \'multiverseId\': 424433}, \'multiverseid\': 424433}, {\'name\': \'Inventore del Baluardo\', \'text\': \'Improvvisare (I tuoi artefatti possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni artefatto che TAPpi dopo aver attivato le abilità di mana corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nAnti-malocchio (Questa creatura non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità controllate dai tuoi avversari.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Vedalken\', \'flavor\': \'"Questa armatura trascende le banali limitazioni di carne e ossa."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'062ea2eb-b8be-4189-a086-ed1b1f041f12\', \'multiverseId\': 424617}, \'multiverseid\': 424617}, {\'name\': \'砦の発明者\', \'text\': \'即席（あなたのアーティファクトが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。あなたはあなたのアーティファクトをタップして、１個あたり{1}の支払いに代えてもよい。）\\n呪禁（このクリーチャーは、対戦相手がコントロールする呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ヴィダルケン・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'「この鎧は肉や骨の制約を超える。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e26142cc-e185-43c7-a4fa-3a6c08918898\', \'multiverseId\': 424801}, \'multiverseid\': 424801}, {\'name\': \'요새 발명가\', \'text\': \'급조 (당신의 마법물체들은 이 주문을 발동하는 것을 도울 수 있다. 마나 능력을 활성화한 후에 탭하는 각 마법물체는 이 주문의 비용 중 {1}을 지불한다.)\\n방호 (이 생물은 상대가 조종하는 주문이나 능력의 목표로 정해질 수 없다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 베달켄 기능공\', \'flavor\': \'"이 갑옷은 살과 뼈의 한계를 초월한다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'278379c1-edc1-409a-8f13-9a21a2abce56\', \'multiverseId\': 424985}, \'multiverseid\': 424985}, {\'name\': \'Inventor do Bastião\', \'text\': \'Improvisar (Seus artefatos podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada artefato que você vira após terminar de ativar habilidades de mana paga por {1}.)\\nResistência a magia (Esta criatura não pode ser alvo de mágicas ou habilidades controladas por seus oponentes.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vedalkeano Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'"Esta armadura transcende as limitações da mera carne e do simples osso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72a3d2fa-e7f5-4481-a301-c171adb09cbb\', \'multiverseId\': 425169}, \'multiverseid\': 425169}, {\'name\': \'Изобретатель из Бастиона\', \'text\': \'Импровизация (Ваши артефакты могут помочь разыграть это заклинание. Каждый артефакт, который вы поворачиваете после того, как вы закончили активировать мана-способности, считается оплатой {1}.)\\nПорчеустойчивость (Это существо не может быть целью заклинаний или способностей под контролем ваших оппонентов.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ведалкен Механик\', \'flavor\': \'«Этот доспех помогает превзойти ограничения бренной плоти и костей».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3931f149-d4f5-4777-9a85-1562024996a7\', \'multiverseId\': 425353}, \'multiverseid\': 425353}, {\'name\': \'骁勇堡发明家\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒语能用你的神器来协助施放。你起动完法术力异能之后每横置一个神器，就能为此咒语支付{1}。）\\n辟邪（此生物不能成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标。）\', \'type\': \'生物～维多肯／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'「这副盔甲可突破血肉之躯的极限。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d42043b3-56ae-43f6-bb72-13e55ad3d116\', \'multiverseId\': 423881}, \'multiverseid\': 423881}, {\'name\': \'驍勇堡發明家\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒語能用你的神器來協助施放。你起動完魔法力異能之後每橫置一個神器，就能為此咒語支付{1}。）\\n辟邪（此生物不能成為由對手所操控之咒語或異能的目標。）\', \'type\': \'生物～維多肯／神器師\', \'flavor\': \'「這副盔甲可突破血肉之軀的極限。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69f6466f-d4c1-4538-ad7d-1b5bcc1778fd\', \'multiverseId\': 424065}, \'multiverseid\': 424065}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erfindungsreiche Rückkehr\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück. Falls du ein Artefakt kontrollierst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Als das Bergungsteam mit einem zerschmetterten Mechakoloss heimkehrte, wogte eine Welle der Begeisterung durch die Schmiede der Renegaten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424289&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16750959-6b81-45c0-88bd-2208d7777076\', \'multiverseId\': 424289}, \'multiverseid\': 424289}, {\'name\': \'Regreso ingenioso\', \'text\': \'Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano. Si controlas un artefacto, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando el equipo de reciclaje trajo el mecatitán destrozado, una ola de emoción recorrió la fundición de los renegados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'569d0f69-139a-4b53-b629-337acfe01def\', \'multiverseId\': 425577}, \'multiverseid\': 425577}, {\'name\': \'Retour ingénieux\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main. Si vous contrôlez un artefact, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Quand l\'équipe de récupération rapporta la carcasse mécanique endommagée, une vague d\'enthousiasme parcourut la fonderie renégate.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424473&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6bc91df-95d9-478f-a726-c034ad65c5fc\', \'multiverseId\': 424473}, \'multiverseid\': 424473}, {\'name\': \'Restauro Ingegnoso\', \'text\': \'Riprendi in mano una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Se controlli un artefatto, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Quando la squadra di recupero portò i resti del meccatitano, un\'ondata di entusiasmo travolse la fonderia dei rinnegati.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'971e5dff-f061-48d7-b6b2-594b94d153f0\', \'multiverseId\': 424657}, \'multiverseid\': 424657}, {\'name\': \'智恵ある帰還\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。あなたがアーティファクトをコントロールしているなら、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'回収班が壊れた機械巨人を持ち帰って来ると、改革派の鋳造所は興奮の渦に包まれた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'019fcf33-70db-4f3b-9ab2-35f6688aed06\', \'multiverseId\': 424841}, \'multiverseid\': 424841}, {\'name\': \'교묘한 복귀\', \'text\': \'당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다. 당신이 마법물체를 조종한다면, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'인양팀이 부서진 톱니거신병을 회수해 오자 무법자 주조소 안은 흥분의 도가니로 변했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b5ed6ff-9254-42a3-a4f4-7063c78b3204\', \'multiverseId\': 425025}, \'multiverseid\': 425025}, {\'name\': \'Retorno Engenhoso\', \'text\': \'Devolva o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão. Se você controlar um artefato, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Quando a equipe de recuperação trouxe o mecanotitã despedaçado, uma onda de empolgação varreu a fundição dos renegados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16938e13-bbae-4e87-87a3-e9638f562a6c\', \'multiverseId\': 425209}, \'multiverseid\': 425209}, {\'name\': \'Умелое Возвращение\', \'text\': \'Верните целевую карту существа из вашего кладбища в вашу руку. Если под вашим контролем есть артефакт, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Когда поисковый отряд привез разбитого мехагиганта, радостные возгласы раздались по всей литейной отступников.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0587dd6d-e01e-4555-9dbc-ea44351a66a7\', \'multiverseId\': 425393}, \'multiverseid\': 425393}, {\'name\': \'机智归返\', \'text\': \'将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。如果你操控神器，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'当回收队带回粉碎的巨械时，乱匠铸造厂爆出欢呼声浪。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bab79de6-12a1-47a5-a5de-c2cd7a6e685b\', \'multiverseId\': 423921}, \'multiverseid\': 423921}, {\'name\': \'機智歸返\', \'text\': \'將目標生物牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。如果你操控神器，則抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'當回收隊帶回粉碎的巨械時，亂匠鑄造廠爆出歡呼聲浪。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d607143-597e-403c-bc7f-9c7510962b1f\', \'multiverseId\': 424105}, \'multiverseid\': 424105}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ernste Rekrutin\', \'text\': \'Doppelschlag\\nRebellion — Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls in diesem Zug eine bleibende Karte unter deiner Kontrolle das Spiel verlassen hat, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Ernste Rekrutin.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zwerg, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich kann nicht länger in meiner Werkstatt sitzen und ignorieren, was draußen passiert. Meine Hämmer schlagen für das Volk von Ghirapur."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424241&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dd74f05-54da-490f-9f96-4c4c3e8a1115\', \'multiverseId\': 424241}, \'multiverseid\': 424241}, {\'name\': \'Recluta solemne\', \'text\': \'Daña dos veces.\\nRevuelta — Al comienzo de tu paso final, si un permanente que controlabas dejó el campo de batalla este turno, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Recluta solemne.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Enano guerrero\', \'flavor\': \'"No puedo seguir sentada en el taller e ignorar lo que está ocurriendo fuera. Mis martillos golpean por el pueblo de Ghirapur".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ded57b6-ffef-4257-94c6-500dafbce5f8\', \'multiverseId\': 425529}, \'multiverseid\': 425529}, {\'name\': \'Recrue solennelle\', \'text\': \'Double initiative\\nRévolte — Au début de votre étape de fin, si un permanent que vous contrôliez a quitté le champ de bataille ce tour-ci, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la Recrue solennelle.\', \'type\': \'Créature : nain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Je ne peux plus rester assise dans mon atelier, étrangère au cours des événements. Mes marteaux s\'abattent pour le peuple de Ghirapur. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424425&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14f1e306-a5cd-4d12-bc86-8947d7de1b58\', \'multiverseId\': 424425}, \'multiverseid\': 424425}, {\'name\': \'Recluta Solenne\', \'text\': "Doppio attacco\\nRivolta — All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se un permanente che controllavi ha lasciato il campo di battaglia in questo turno, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Recluta Solenne.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Nano\', \'flavor\': \'"Non posso più restarmene in laboratorio ignorando quanto accade fuori. I miei martelli battono per il popolo di Ghirapur."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9488f9b1-c710-4cb9-9e3c-457115876a1e\', \'multiverseId\': 424609}, \'multiverseid\': 424609}, {\'name\': \'生真面目な補充兵\', \'text\': \'二段攻撃\\n紛争 ― あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたがコントロールするパーマネントが戦場を離れていた場合、生真面目な補充兵の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドワーフ・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「これ以上、作業場に閉じこもって世間の出来事から目を背け続けることはできない。この槌をギラプールの人々のために使うことにするわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cbc7939-e7e1-4547-b15b-c50cf666535f\', \'multiverseId\': 424793}, \'multiverseid\': 424793}, {\'name\': \'엄숙한 신병\', \'text\': \'이단공격\\n봉기 — 당신의 종료단 시작에, 당신이 조종한 지속물이 이 턴에 전장을 떠났다면, 엄숙한 신병에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 드워프 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"더 이상 작업장에 처박힌 채 바깥 세상 일을 외면할 수 없어. 기라푸르 주민들을 위해 내 망치를 휘두를 거야."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9722ff1-470c-40b5-89bf-4ec376ceb943\', \'multiverseId\': 424977}, \'multiverseid\': 424977}, {\'name\': \'Recruta Solene\', \'text\': \'Golpe duplo\\nRevolta — No início de sua etapa final, se uma permanente que você controlava deixou o campo de batalha neste turno, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Recruta Solene.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anão Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Não consigo mais ficar em minha oficina e ignorar os eventos do lado de fora. Os golpes de meus martelos servirão o povo de Ghirapur."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acf15703-44d7-4904-9cc9-501713898752\', \'multiverseId\': 425161}, \'multiverseid\': 425161}, {\'name\': \'Серьезный Новобранец\', \'text\': \'Двойной удар\\nБунт — В начале вашего заключительного шага, если находившийся под вашим контролем перманент покинул поле битвы в этом ходу, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Серьезного Новобранца.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гном Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Я не могу больше сидеть в своей мастерской, не обращая внимания на то, что творится за окном. Мои молоты будут сражаться за людей Гирапура».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd86dbce-ac6c-49d4-a436-76109c451234\', \'multiverseId\': 425345}, \'multiverseid\': 425345}, {\'name\': \'庄严新员\', \'text\': \'连击\\n反抗～在你的结束步骤开始时，若本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物离开战场，则在庄严新员上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～矮人／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「我不能继续两耳不闻窗外事，一心埋首工作间。我手中双锤为吉拉波人民而战。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70d78f49-abf1-4cde-b49e-e0170a17fe08\', \'multiverseId\': 423873}, \'multiverseid\': 423873}, {\'name\': \'莊嚴新員\', \'text\': \'連擊\\n反抗～在你的結束步驟開始時，若本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物離開戰場，則在莊嚴新員上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～矮人／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「我不能繼續兩耳不聞窗外事，一心埋首工作間。我手中雙鎚為吉拉波人民而戰。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d344c65-4d51-4c42-8e13-e644037fee6c\', \'multiverseId\': 424057}, \'multiverseid\': 424057}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erzürnter Riese\', \'text\': \'Improvisieren (Deine Artefakte können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden, Eile\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': \'Als die Kämpfe den Riesenpfad erreichten, waren seine sonst so friedfertigen Bewohner wenig erfreut über einschlagende Äther-Geschosse und abstürzende Luftschiffe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424299&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac8bcc1a-5975-4892-8786-492b222a7d6d\', \'multiverseId\': 424299}, \'multiverseid\': 424299}, {\'name\': \'Gigante furioso\', \'text\': \'Improvisar. (Tus artefactos pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada artefacto que gires una vez que termines de activar habilidades de maná paga {1}.)\\nArrolla, prisa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando la batalla llegó al Paseo del Gigante, las armas de éter y las aeronaves que surcaban el aire enfurecieron a las criaturas normalmente plácidas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6766c60e-c1fe-456e-9bd5-54f457ab27b2\', \'multiverseId\': 425587}, \'multiverseid\': 425587}, {\'name\': \'Géant enragé\', \'text\': \'Improvisation (Vos artefacts peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque artefact que vous engagez après avoir activé des capacités de mana paie {1}.)\\nPiétinement, célérité\', \'type\': \'Créature : géant\', \'flavor\': "Quand le combat atteignit la Promenade des géants, les armes éthériques et les aéronefs attisèrent la colère des créatures d\'ordinaire placides.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424483&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89fd1010-4581-4b7c-9383-38518b5a6efa\', \'multiverseId\': 424483}, \'multiverseid\': 424483}, {\'name\': \'Gigante Infuriato\', \'text\': \'Improvvisare (I tuoi artefatti possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni artefatto che TAPpi dopo aver attivato le abilità di mana corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nTravolgere, rapidità\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': "Quando gli scontri raggiunsero il Cammino dei Giganti, le armi d\'etere e le incursioni delle aeronavi fecero innervosire le creature solitamente placide.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5478f99b-9b88-44d6-8d46-fd142a6e229f\', \'multiverseId\': 424667}, \'multiverseid\': 424667}, {\'name\': \'怒れる巨人\', \'text\': \'即席（あなたのアーティファクトが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。あなたはあなたのアーティファクトをタップして、１個あたり{1}の支払いに代えてもよい。）\\nトランプル、速攻\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人\', \'flavor\': \'戦闘が巨人の居住区にも飛び火すると、霊気砲や飛び回る飛行船の影響で、普段おとなしいこの生き物が凶暴化した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35b0599a-5bcb-49ba-868a-6bc31f20a2ec\', \'multiverseId\': 424851}, \'multiverseid\': 424851}, {\'name\': \'격노한 거인\', \'text\': \'급조 (당신의 마법물체들은 이 주문을 발동하는 것을 도울 수 있다. 마나 능력을 활성화한 후에 탭하는 각 마법물체는 이 주문의 비용 중 {1}을 지불한다.)\\n돌진, 신속\', \'type\': \'생물 — 거인\', \'flavor\': \'전투가 거인의 길까지 번지자 에테르 무기와 공습 비행선이 평소에는 평온한 생물들을 격노하게 만들었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26b7392b-9fb4-4cd2-a631-83c085f700b9\', \'multiverseId\': 425035}, \'multiverseid\': 425035}, {\'name\': \'Gigante Enfurecido\', \'text\': \'Improvisar (Seus artefatos podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada artefato que você vira após terminar de ativar habilidades de mana paga por {1}.)\\nAtropelar, ímpeto\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Quando o combate chegou ao Passeio dos Gigantes, as armas etéreas e os rasantes das aeronaus enfureceram as criaturas normalmente plácidas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8ad1559-58e5-412a-9d9c-5860729bc507\', \'multiverseId\': 425219}, \'multiverseid\': 425219}, {\'name\': \'Взбешенный Гигант\', \'text\': \'Импровизация (Ваши артефакты могут помочь разыграть это заклинание. Каждый артефакт, который вы поворачиваете после того, как вы закончили активировать мана-способности, считается оплатой {1}.)\\nПробивной удар, Ускорение\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гигант\', \'flavor\': \'Когда сражения дошли до Долины Гигантов, огонь из эфирного оружия и снующие в воздухе корабли привели в ярость этих обычно мирных созданий.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fcb527d-f777-408d-a420-60c5fadc3ea6\', \'multiverseId\': 425403}, \'multiverseid\': 425403}, {\'name\': \'盛怒巨人\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒语能用你的神器来协助施放。你起动完法术力异能之后每横置一个神器，就能为此咒语支付{1}。）\\n践踏，敏捷\', \'type\': \'生物～巨人\', \'flavor\': \'当战火波及到巨人路径时，乙太武器和呼啸飞船激怒了素来温和的生物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f313cacb-4573-43f0-8a68-c6d2d7b6afd9\', \'multiverseId\': 423931}, \'multiverseid\': 423931}, {\'name\': \'盛怒巨人\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒語能用你的神器來協助施放。你起動完魔法力異能之後每橫置一個神器，就能為此咒語支付{1}。）\\n踐踏，敏捷\', \'type\': \'生物～巨人\', \'flavor\': \'當戰火波及到巨人路徑時，乙太武器和呼嘯飛船激怒了素來溫和的生物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f1ebfed-e4ba-4d03-a2ea-8f9aebce9b91\', \'multiverseId\': 424115}, \'multiverseid\': 424115}]', '[{\'name\': \'Felidar-Wächter\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Felidar-Wächter ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine andere bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil schicken und die Karte dann unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Die Treue eines Felidar ist schwer zu gewinnen, doch sie ist jede Mühe wert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424238&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d0931b9-8afc-45b6-8192-9f63e292bf7b\', \'multiverseId\': 424238}, \'multiverseid\': 424238}, {\'name\': \'Felidar guardián\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Felidar guardián entre al campo de batalla, puedes exiliar otro permanente objetivo que controlas. Luego, regresa esa carta al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia felino\', \'flavor\': \'Es difícil ganarse la lealtad de un felidar, pero merece la pena.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33dec758-9f3d-48de-a814-1388fab63778\', \'multiverseId\': 425526}, \'multiverseid\': 425526}, {\'name\': \'Gardien félidar\', \'text\': \'Quand le Gardien félidar arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez exiler un autre permanent ciblé que vous contrôlez, puis renvoyer cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Créature : chat et bête\', \'flavor\': "Il est difficile de s\'assurer la loyauté d\'un félidar, mais elle en vaut la peine.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424422&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'513cfa83-abe0-46f1-83ff-c8f475b77c86\', \'multiverseId\': 424422}, \'multiverseid\': 424422}, {\'name\': \'Guardiano Felidar\', \'text\': \'Quando il Guardiano Felidar entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi esiliare un altro permanente bersaglio che controlli, poi rimettere quella carta sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia Felino\', \'flavor\': \'È difficile ottenere la lealtà di un felidar, ma ne vale la pena.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6d31980-8503-466d-8298-7eecfad0158c\', \'multiverseId\': 424606}, \'multiverseid\': 424606}, {\'name\': \'守護フェリダー\', \'text\': \'守護フェリダーが戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールする他のパーマネント１つを対象とする。あなたはそれを追放してもよい。そうしたなら、その後そのカードをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'フェリダーの忠誠を得るのは難しいが、苦労に見合う価値がある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfe308fc-a8e1-4963-a217-e7d0ebd63092\', \'multiverseId\': 424790}, \'multiverseid\': 424790}, {\'name\': \'펠리다르 수호자\', \'text\': \'펠리다르 수호자가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종하는 다른 지속물을 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 지속물을 추방한 후 소유자의 조종하에 전장에 되돌릴 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이 야수\', \'flavor\': \'펠리다르의 충성심을 얻는 것은 어렵지만 얻을 만한 가치가 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d901f6b-031b-49db-8fb9-f5c7c3cb9b6d\', \'multiverseId\': 424974}, \'multiverseid\': 424974}, {\'name\': \'Guardião Felidar\', \'text\': \'Quando Guardião Felidar entra no campo de batalha, você pode exilar outra permanente alvo que você controla. Depois, devolva aquele card ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino Besta\', \'flavor\': \'A lealdade de um felidar é difícil de conquistar, mas vale o esforço.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fa61b3f-4cde-40d1-b047-e800bb8c53ed\', \'multiverseId\': 425158}, \'multiverseid\': 425158}, {\'name\': \'Сторожевой Фелидар\', \'text\': \'Когда Сторожевой Фелидар выходит на поле битвы, вы можете изгнать другой целевой перманент под вашим контролем, затем вернуть ту карту на поле битвы под контролем ее владельца.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'Преданность фелидара нелегко завоевать, но результат стоит усилий.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'512fb901-1f5b-4650-be1b-00ae9a0acd9c\', \'multiverseId\': 425342}, \'multiverseid\': 425342}, {\'name\': \'护卫晶角兽\', \'text\': \'当护卫晶角兽进战场时，你可以放逐另一个目标由你操控的永久物，然后将该牌在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物～猫／野兽\', \'flavor\': \'晶角兽的信赖虽极难赢得，但其忠诚值得为之奋斗。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423870&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'466ad5f9-9e07-4f7e-8231-6a872524cc91\', \'multiverseId\': 423870}, \'multiverseid\': 423870}, {\'name\': \'護衛晶角獸\', \'text\': \'當護衛晶角獸進戰場時，你可以放逐另一個目標由你操控的永久物，然後將該牌在其擁有者的操控下移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物～貓／野獸\', \'flavor\': \'晶角獸的信賴雖極難贏得，但其忠誠值得為之奮鬥。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5f0edf4-fd95-4c2c-b826-5db1880368cf\', \'multiverseId\': 424054}, \'multiverseid\': 424054}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fennschlepper\', \'text\': \'Improvisieren (Deine Artefakte können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)\\nDer Fennschlepper kann von Artefaktkreaturen nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'„Erfolg lässt sich dort finden, wo sonst niemand wagt hinzuschauen." —Ara, Renegaten-Schmuggler\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424277&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ad94b41-0d64-42aa-bd57-6c5ce574aacf\', \'multiverseId\': 424277}, \'multiverseid\': 424277}, {\'name\': \'Porteador de la ciénaga\', \'text\': \'Improvisar. (Tus artefactos pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada artefacto que gires una vez que termines de activar habilidades de maná paga {1}.)\\nEl Porteador de la ciénaga no puede ser bloqueado por criaturas artefacto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'"El éxito se encuentra allá donde otros temen buscar". —Ara, contrabandista renegada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'936f912e-f018-4f0f-adf3-4e9c7e331606\', \'multiverseId\': 425565}, \'multiverseid\': 425565}, {\'name\': \'Transporteur des maremmes\', \'text\': \'Improvisation (Vos artefacts peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque artefact que vous engagez après avoir activé des capacités de mana paie {1}.)\\nLe Transporteur des maremmes ne peut pas être bloqué par les créatures-artefacts.\', \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': \'« Le succès se rencontre là où les autres ont peur de le chercher. » —Ara, contrebandière renégate\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424461&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d45ab11-962e-457a-8dc4-eb3329634b4f\', \'multiverseId\': 424461}, \'multiverseid\': 424461}, {\'name\': \'Trascinatore di Palude\', \'text\': \'Improvvisare (I tuoi artefatti possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni artefatto che TAPpi dopo aver attivato le abilità di mana corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nIl Trascinatore di Palude non può essere bloccato da creature artefatto.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'"Il successo si trova dove gli altri hanno paura di cercare." —Ara, contrabbandiera rinnegata\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba2c81a1-915a-4a3e-8e2e-382e7c09b412\', \'multiverseId\': 424645}, \'multiverseid\': 424645}, {\'name\': \'湿原の運び屋\', \'text\': \'即席（あなたのアーティファクトが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。あなたはあなたのアーティファクトをタップして、１個あたり{1}の支払いに代えてもよい。）\\n湿原の運び屋はアーティファクト・クリーチャーによってはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'「他人が怖がって見ようともしないところに勝機があるの。」 ――改革派の密輸人、エイラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d010e9f4-3445-4f5c-a4b4-c2909f14666d\', \'multiverseId\': 424829}, \'multiverseid\': 424829}, {\'name\': \'늪지 운반꾼\', \'text\': \'급조 (당신의 마법물체들은 이 주문을 발동하는 것을 도울 수 있다. 마나 능력을 활성화한 후에 탭하는 각 마법물체는 이 주문의 비용 중 {1}을 지불한다.)\\n늪지 운반꾼은 마법물체 생물에게 방어될 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 곤충\', \'flavor\': \'"성공은 다른 사람들이 두려워서 보지 못하는 곳에 있다." —무법자 밀수꾼 아라\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'929b0fe1-5254-4043-a7c9-c7975a11d586\', \'multiverseId\': 425013}, \'multiverseid\': 425013}, {\'name\': \'Rebocador dos Charcos\', \'text\': \'Improvisar (Seus artefatos podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada artefato que você vira após terminar de ativar habilidades de mana paga por {1}.)\\nRebocador dos Charcos não pode ser bloqueado por criaturas artefato.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Inseto\', \'flavor\': \'"O sucesso encontra-se onde os outros têm medo de procurar." — Ara, contrabandista renegada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e902001-be81-458d-b270-8b1d3acf555d\', \'multiverseId\': 425197}, \'multiverseid\': 425197}, {\'name\': \'Болотный Носильщик\', \'text\': \'Импровизация (Ваши артефакты могут помочь разыграть это заклинание. Каждый артефакт, который вы поворачиваете после того, как вы закончили активировать мана-способности, считается оплатой {1}.)\\nБолотный Носильщик не может быть заблокирован артефактами существами.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Насекомое\', \'flavor\': \'«Успех можно найти там, где другие боятся искать». — Эйра, контрабандистка-отступница\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb1e265e-9640-4fd3-b29d-d517298c3c91\', \'multiverseId\': 425381}, \'multiverseid\': 425381}, {\'name\': \'泽地驮虫\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒语能用你的神器来协助施放。你起动完法术力异能之后每横置一个神器，就能为此咒语支付{1}。）\\n泽地驮虫不能被神器生物阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物～昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'「想成功就要往别人不敢去的地方闯。」 ～乱匠走私贩爱勒\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54eee462-c965-481d-9aa8-fff64e2727be\', \'multiverseId\': 423909}, \'multiverseid\': 423909}, {\'name\': \'澤地馱蟲\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒語能用你的神器來協助施放。你起動完魔法力異能之後每橫置一個神器，就能為此咒語支付{1}。）\\n澤地馱蟲不能被神器生物阻擋。\', \'type\': \'生物～昆蟲\', \'flavor\': \'「想成功就要往別人不敢去的地方闖。」 ～叛軍走私販愛勒\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a386709-44ef-4fa7-b5ba-793393c32ee5\', \'multiverseId\': 424093}, \'multiverseid\': 424093}]', '[{\'name\': \'Filigraner Kriecher\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Filigrane Kriecher stirbt, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'„Die harmonischsten Designs basieren auf Beziehungen, wie man sie in der Natur vorfindet." —Venand Kapur, der Schrotthirte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424369&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d149d18c-3965-4a6a-ac7f-cc19a9f78e28\', \'multiverseId\': 424369}, \'multiverseid\': 424369}, {\'name\': \'Rondador de filigrana\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Rondador de filigrana muera, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Tóptero incolora 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'"Los diseños más armoniosos están basados en las relaciones que se dan en la naturaleza". —Venand Kapur, Pastor de Artilugios\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b73e6ff2-5332-4236-892a-b910bd449ce7\', \'multiverseId\': 425657}, \'multiverseid\': 425657}, {\'name\': \'Rampeur de filigrane\', \'text\': \'Quand le Rampeur de filigrane meurt, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : insecte\', \'flavor\': \'« Les conceptions les plus harmonieuses se basent sur des analogies naturelles. » —Venand Kapur, berger de rouages\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424553&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7297e66b-e53d-42b3-90e3-42b66795ae91\', \'multiverseId\': 424553}, \'multiverseid\': 424553}, {\'name\': \'Miriapode di Filigrana\', \'text\': \'Quando il Miriapode di Filigrana muore, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 incolore con volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'"I progetti più armoniosi si basano su relazioni presenti in natura." —Venand Kapur, il Pastore di Ingranaggi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41fa6429-d4e0-42db-97af-dd8d68124162\', \'multiverseId\': 424737}, \'multiverseid\': 424737}, {\'name\': \'金線這行機\', \'text\': \'金線這行機が死亡したとき、飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'「良く調和する設計は、自然界にある関係性に基づいている。」 ――歯車の牧人、ベナーンド・カプール\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90e85218-12b3-4df2-b242-a073961dfa97\', \'multiverseId\': 424921}, \'multiverseid\': 424921}, {\'name\': \'줄세공 지네\', \'text\': \'줄세공 지네가 죽을 때, 비행을 가진 1/1 무색 날틀 마법물체 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 곤충\', \'flavor\': \'"가장 조화로운 디자인은 자연에서 찾은 관계에 기반한다." —기계 목동 베나드 카푸르\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23872698-e1bb-4e7c-bafa-f6fdc30d6b03\', \'multiverseId\': 425105}, \'multiverseid\': 425105}, {\'name\': \'Rastejador Filigranado\', \'text\': \'Quando Rastejador Filigranado morrer, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Tóptero com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Inseto\', \'flavor\': \'"Os projetos mais harmoniosos são baseados em relações encontradas na natureza." — Venand Kapur, o Pastor de Engrenagens\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf796a4e-1bae-43cf-b62b-168cda8e4659\', \'multiverseId\': 425289}, \'multiverseid\': 425289}, {\'name\': \'Филигранный Ползун\', \'text\': \'Когда Филигранный Ползун умирает, создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Топтер с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Насекомое\', \'flavor\': \'«Самые гармоничные конструкции основаны на отношениях, подсмотренных в природе». — Венанд Капур, механопастух\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a35e0b85-b203-4707-81f0-45a79f86b709\', \'multiverseId\': 425473}, \'multiverseid\': 425473}, {\'name\': \'丝金爬虫\', \'text\': \'当丝金爬虫死去时，派出一个1/1无色，具飞行异能的振翼机衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'「最和谐的设计取自于自然界中的各种关系。」 ～育械师文讷德克普\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23f7e0fd-16f6-49c6-8a4d-7107efbc7c0c\', \'multiverseId\': 424001}, \'multiverseid\': 424001}, {\'name\': \'絲金爬蟲\', \'text\': \'當絲金爬蟲死去時，派出一個1/1無色，具飛行異能的振翼機衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～昆蟲\', \'flavor\': \'「最和諧的設計取自於自然界中的各種關係。」 ～育械師文訥德克普\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'569fd993-4de3-44b6-9532-97117eb1dbfc\', \'multiverseId\': 424185}, \'multiverseid\': 424185}]', '[{\'name\': \'Findige Renegatin\', \'text\': \'Rebellion — Wenn die Findige Renegatin ins Spiel kommt und falls in diesem Zug eine bleibende Karte unter deiner Kontrolle das Spiel verlassen hat, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Servo-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zwerg, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'„Krabble los, mein Kleiner, und richte großen Ärger an!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424232&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e257443b-257d-4c47-b062-ad10de7f43d0\', \'multiverseId\': 424232}, \'multiverseid\': 424232}, {\'name\': \'Renegada de los Mil Artilugios\', \'text\': \'Revuelta — Cuando la Renegada de los Mil Artilugios entre al campo de batalla, si un permanente que controlabas dejó el campo de batalla este turno, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Servo incolora 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Enano artífice\', \'flavor\': \'"Adelántate, pequeñín, y crea problemas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26b6541c-29a4-433f-afb4-219536dc6030\', \'multiverseId\': 425520}, \'multiverseid\': 425520}, {\'name\': \'Renégate aux machines innombrables\', \'text\': \'Révolte — Quand la Renégate aux machines innombrables arrive sur le champ de bataille, si un permanent que vous contrôliez a quitté le champ de bataille ce tour-ci, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Servo.\', \'type\': \'Créature : nain et artificier\', \'flavor\': \'« En avant, mon petit, et fais des dégâts ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424416&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa680bea-1108-46cc-9aec-0ff0714016ba\', \'multiverseId\': 424416}, \'multiverseid\': 424416}, {\'name\': \'Rinnegata dei Mille Ingranaggi\', \'text\': \'Rivolta — Quando la Rinnegata dei Mille Ingranaggi entra nel campo di battaglia, se un permanente che controllavi ha lasciato il campo di battaglia in questo turno, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Servomeccanismo 1/1 incolore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Nano\', \'flavor\': \'"Vai a far danni, piccolo mio!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c5fc7f7-ee78-45f8-90fa-e8d431c26128\', \'multiverseId\': 424600}, \'multiverseid\': 424600}, {\'name\': \'精緻会の改革派\', \'text\': \'紛争 ― 精緻会の改革派が戦場に出たとき、このターンにあなたがコントロールするパーマネントが戦場を離れていた場合、無色の１/１の霊気装置・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドワーフ・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'「行って、ひと暴れしてきなさい！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbfd6870-c08e-45fc-8871-6ea2b25a343d\', \'multiverseId\': 424784}, \'multiverseid\': 424784}, {\'name\': \'톱니바퀴무리 무법자\', \'text\': \'봉기 — 톱니바퀴무리 무법자가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종한 지속물이 이 턴에 전장을 떠났다면, 1/1 무색 서보 마법물체 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 드워프 기능공\', \'flavor\': \'"마음껏 부수고 놀거라, 우리 아가!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2df4bd46-b396-4af5-a938-c50a51717b0d\', \'multiverseId\': 424968}, \'multiverseid\': 424968}, {\'name\': \'Renegada das Engrenagens Incontáveis\', \'text\': \'Revolta — Quando Renegada das Engrenagens Incontáveis entrar no campo de batalha, se uma permanente que você controlava deixou o campo de batalha neste turno, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Servus.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anão Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'"Vá e crie encrenca, meu pequenino!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f64e0f27-6091-4fae-a551-25c0d858546d\', \'multiverseId\': 425152}, \'multiverseid\': 425152}, {\'name\': \'Отступница Сотен Механизмов\', \'text\': \'Бунт — Когда Отступница Сотен Механизмов выходит на поле битвы, если находившийся под вашим контролем перманент покинул поле битвы в этом ходу, создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Сервотрон.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гном Механик\', \'flavor\': \'«Иди похулигань, малыш!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b4bd009-d59b-4ea4-b37e-0e8e015de892\', \'multiverseId\': 425336}, \'multiverseid\': 425336}, {\'name\': \'众械乱匠\', \'text\': \'反抗～当众械乱匠进战场时，若本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物离开战场，则派出一个1/1无色自动机衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～矮人／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'「小家伙们，去吧，尽情捣乱！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79a4d774-197a-4621-a68f-b3c569470614\', \'multiverseId\': 423864}, \'multiverseid\': 423864}, {\'name\': \'眾械亂匠\', \'text\': \'反抗～當眾械亂匠進戰場時，若本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物離開戰場，則派出一個1/1無色自動機衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～矮人／神器師\', \'flavor\': \'「小傢伙們，去吧，盡情搗亂！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3624c414-c65f-4500-ac73-131a39c1da55\', \'multiverseId\': 424048}, \'multiverseid\': 424048}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fixierungsapparat\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Tappe ein Artefakt oder eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Das Konsulat hatte Zugang zu tausenden innovativen Geräten, die auf der Erfindermesse ausgestellt waren. Ein paar kleine Anpassungen transformierten einige davon in Instrumente der Unterdrückung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424387&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f4b6c34-2a18-492d-abad-8184ef2487ce\', \'multiverseId\': 424387}, \'multiverseid\': 424387}, {\'name\': \'Matriz pacificadora\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Gira el artefacto o criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El Consulado tuvo acceso a miles de dispositivos innovadores expuestos en la Feria de Inventores. Unos pocos cambios transformaron algunas de estas maravillas del ingenio en instrumentos de opresión.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76d2e7bf-7f55-4c61-bb3a-ec8f9b5c50bc\', \'multiverseId\': 425675}, \'multiverseid\': 425675}, {\'name\': \'Déploiement de pacification\', \'text\': "{2}, {T} : Engagez l\'artefact ciblé ou la créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Le Consulat avait accès à des milliers d\'appareils innovants exposés à la Foire des inventeurs. Après quelques ajustements, certaines de ces ingénieuses merveilles furent transformées en instruments de l\'oppression.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424571&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6553ed9-ede8-48d5-9dc4-9867b8921ff0\', \'multiverseId\': 424571}, \'multiverseid\': 424571}, {\'name\': \'Dispositivo di Pacificazione\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: TAPpa un artefatto o una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Il Consolato aveva accesso alle migliaia di dispositivi straordinari in mostra alla Fiera degli Inventori. Pochi cambiamenti bastarono a trasformare alcuni di quei capolavori di creatività in strumenti di oppressione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a13dff5-15ff-43a3-ad92-4a4ff7ba99f4\', \'multiverseId\': 424755}, \'multiverseid\': 424755}, {\'name\': \'鎮定工作機\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}：アーティファクト１つかクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'領事府は発明博覧会に展示された何千という最新の装置を利用できた。僅かな変更により、驚嘆の創意から抑圧の手段に変わったものもある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'440af78a-913c-40c6-a08f-0df98534c009\', \'multiverseId\': 424939}, \'multiverseid\': 424939}, {\'name\': \'평화 배열\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: 마법물체 또는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 탭한다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'영사관은 발명 박람회에 출품된 수천 종의 혁신적인 장치에 접근했다. 약간의 개조를 통해 일부 발명품들은 놀랍고 기발한 장치에서 끔찍한 탄압 도구로 변했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17342c0f-9b75-4f19-a2cb-43dfe90ba34a\', \'multiverseId\': 425123}, \'multiverseid\': 425123}, {\'name\': \'Matriz de Pacificação\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Vire o artefato ou a criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'O Consulado teve acesso a milhares de dispositivos inovadores expostos na Feira dos Inventores. Umas poucas modificações transformaram alguns deles de maravilhas de engenhosidade em instrumentos de opressão.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06177343-742a-484e-b8a4-0087313eaa15\', \'multiverseId\': 425307}, \'multiverseid\': 425307}, {\'name\': \'Сеть Умиротворения\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: поверните целевой артефакт или существо.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Консульство заполучило тысячи новейших устройств, выставленных на Ярмарке Изобретателей. Небольшие переделки превратили некоторые из шедевров технической мысли в орудия угнетения.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'161bf9e2-93e4-491c-a3a7-2f2df8a1a845\', \'multiverseId\': 425491}, \'multiverseid\': 425491}, {\'name\': \'绥靖阵列\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}：横置目标神器或生物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'执政院获得了在发明家博览会上展演的无数创新装置。其中一些惊奇发明略加改造后就能转变成迫害工具。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7171a7c-fe33-4b4d-8270-860b3841b6f5\', \'multiverseId\': 424019}, \'multiverseid\': 424019}, {\'name\': \'綏靖陣列\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}：橫置目標神器或生物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'執政院獲得了在發明家博覽會上展演的無數創新裝置。其中一些驚奇發明略加改造後就能轉變成迫害工具。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4aee6ad1-aa22-4538-b0ea-81784d55e7d2\', \'multiverseId\': 424203}, \'multiverseid\': 424203}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flinkschmied-Rebell\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Flinkschmied-Rebell ins Spiel kommt, erhält ein Artefakt deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst, „{T}: Dieses Artefakt fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu", solange du den Flinkschmied-Rebellen kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'„Es fehlt nur ein Fünkchen mehr Durchschlagskraft."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424312&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4efd536-bf6f-42d8-8107-938718e18091\', \'multiverseId\': 424312}, \'multiverseid\': 424312}, {\'name\': \'Rebelde forjacélere\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Rebelde forjacélere entre al campo de batalla, el artefacto objetivo que controlas gana "{T}: Este artefacto hace 2 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo" mientras controles al Rebelde forjacélere.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Vamos a añadir un poco más de energía de parada".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1f02e2b-efa1-4f0c-8e59-31507f25bb05\', \'multiverseId\': 425600}, \'multiverseid\': 425600}, {\'name\': \'Rebelle forgevif\', \'text\': "Quand le Rebelle forgevif arrive sur le champ de bataille, l\'artefact ciblé que vous contrôlez acquiert « {T} : Cet artefact inflige 2 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur » tant que vous contrôlez le Rebelle forgevif.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': \'« Rajoutons un dernier outil de persuasion. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424496&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d32475be-4f54-45db-99c0-8fb447c15612\', \'multiverseId\': 424496}, \'multiverseid\': 424496}, {\'name\': \'Ribelle Tempralesto\', \'text\': \'Quando il Ribelle Tempralesto entra nel campo di battaglia, un artefatto bersaglio che controlli ha "{T}: Questo artefatto infligge 2 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio" fintanto che controlli il Ribelle Tempralesto.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Aggiungiamo un po\\\' di potere d\\\'arresto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c73c059-8d44-4318-be01-ad063526d89a\', \'multiverseId\': 424680}, \'multiverseid\': 424680}, {\'name\': \'速製職人の反逆者\', \'text\': \'速製職人の反逆者が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールするアーティファクト１つを対象とする。あなたが速製職人の反逆者をコントロールし続けているかぎり、それは「{T}：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。このアーティファクトはそれに２点のダメージを与える。」を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'「もう少し抑止力が上がるだろう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8167a0bf-2e1a-45b7-a4ec-0602f1945cfa\', \'multiverseId\': 424864}, \'multiverseid\': 424864}, {\'name\': \'숙련기술공 반란군\', \'text\': \'숙련기술공 반란군이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종하는 마법물체를 목표로 정한다. 그 마법물체는 당신이 숙련기술공 반란군을 조종하는 한, "{T}: 생물이나 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 이 마법물체는 그 목표에 피해 2점을 입힌다"를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기능공\', \'flavor\': \'"제동력을 약간 더 높여보자구."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58b3b3cb-6ae7-4e78-9f42-01d578f528e3\', \'multiverseId\': 425048}, \'multiverseid\': 425048}, {\'name\': \'Rebelde Veloferreiro\', \'text\': \'Quando Rebelde Veloferreiro entra no campo de batalha, o artefato alvo que você controla ganha "{T}: Este artefato causa 2 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo" enquanto você controlar Rebelde Veloferreiro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'"Vamos acrescentar só mais um pouquinho de poder de parada."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aef8bcad-7c5e-4416-8654-8296fd25c334\', \'multiverseId\': 425232}, \'multiverseid\': 425232}, {\'name\': \'Повстанец Проворных Кузнецов\', \'text\': \'Когда Повстанец Проворных Кузнецов выходит на поле битвы, целевой артефакт под вашим контролем получает способность «{T}: этот артефакт наносит 2 повреждения целевому существу или игроку» до тех пор, пока вы контролируете Повстанца Проворных Кузнецов.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Механик\', \'flavor\': \'«Добавим чуть больше останавливающей силы».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5151e789-0f69-466b-a26c-d4b3ad52d2c8\', \'multiverseId\': 425416}, \'multiverseid\': 425416}, {\'name\': \'迅匠反抗军\', \'text\': \'当迅匠反抗军进战场时，于你操控迅匠反抗军的时段内，目标由你操控的神器获得「{T}：此神器对目标生物或牌手造成2点伤害。」\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'「再增加一点止敌火力。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98663afc-9ed7-47da-9863-30c3648dd621\', \'multiverseId\': 423944}, \'multiverseid\': 423944}, {\'name\': \'迅匠反抗軍\', \'text\': \'當迅匠反抗軍進戰場時，於你操控迅匠反抗軍的時段內，目標由你操控的神器獲得「{T}：此神器對目標生物或玩家造成2點傷害」。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／神器師\', \'flavor\': \'「再增加一點止敵火力。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'024642c4-7b42-4786-9def-47d7b2f5a911\', \'multiverseId\': 424128}, \'multiverseid\': 424128}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flinkschmied-Spionin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Flinkschmied-Spionin ins Spiel kommt, erhält ein Artefakt deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst, „{T}: Ziehe eine Karte", solange du die Flinkschmied-Spionin kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich werde nur schnell das Spektrum seiner Überwachungslinsen erweitern."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424260&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93109c28-ae9d-4c26-a528-67d5382ef530\', \'multiverseId\': 424260}, \'multiverseid\': 424260}, {\'name\': \'Espía forjacélere\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Espía forjacélere entre al campo de batalla, el artefacto objetivo que controlas gana "{T}: Roba una carta" mientras controles a la Espía forjacélere.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Ampliemos la lente de escrutinio".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66e5e0c8-0ca1-41ed-8192-98179d4f12ea\', \'multiverseId\': 425548}, \'multiverseid\': 425548}, {\'name\': \'Espionne forgevif\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Espionne forgevif arrive sur le champ de bataille, un artefact ciblé que vous contrôlez acquiert « {T} : Piochez une carte » tant que vous contrôlez l\'Espionne forgevif.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': \'« Améliorons ses objectifs de surveillance. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424444&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4598cd47-5a28-469d-ad28-3b00dca80a7b\', \'multiverseId\': 424444}, \'multiverseid\': 424444}, {\'name\': \'Spia Tempralesta\', \'text\': \'Quando la Spia Tempralesta entra nel campo di battaglia, un artefatto bersaglio che controlli ha "{T}: Pesca una carta" fintanto che controlli la Spia Tempralesta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Basterà estendere le sue lenti di sorveglianza."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c92966f-9595-4b47-a25d-3ff874a11df4\', \'multiverseId\': 424628}, \'multiverseid\': 424628}, {\'name\': \'速製職人のスパイ\', \'text\': \'速製職人のスパイが戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールするアーティファクト１つを対象とする。あなたが速製職人のスパイをコントロールし続けているかぎり、それは「{T}：カードを１枚引く。」を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'「監視レンズを少し広げてみようかしら。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69d61034-7961-4a21-a09f-adc9b4867446\', \'multiverseId\': 424812}, \'multiverseid\': 424812}, {\'name\': \'숙련기술공 스파이\', \'text\': \'숙련기술공 스파이가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종하는 마법물체를 목표로 정한다. 그 마법물체는 당신이 숙련기술공 스파이를 조종하는 한, "{T}: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다"를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기능공\', \'flavor\': \'"감시 장치의 렌즈를 더 크게 만들어봐."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8886941-3954-4e89-b14c-93e5176e0be0\', \'multiverseId\': 424996}, \'multiverseid\': 424996}, {\'name\': \'Espiã Veloferreira\', \'text\': \'Quando Espiã Veloferreira entra no campo de batalha, o artefato alvo que você controla ganha "{T}: Compre um card" enquanto você controlar Espiã Veloferreira.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'"Vamos só ampliar suas lentes de vigilância."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb67d444-5618-467c-9550-c9169c0b3e2b\', \'multiverseId\': 425180}, \'multiverseid\': 425180}, {\'name\': \'Шпионка Проворных Кузнецов\', \'text\': \'Когда Шпионка Проворных Кузнецов выходит на поле битвы, целевой артефакт под вашим контролем получает способность «{T}: возьмите карту» до тех пор, пока вы контролируете Шпионку Проворных Кузнецов.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Механик\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы просто расширим его наблюдательную линзу».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65a751d8-3da3-47b5-81bb-a2b7810519f7\', \'multiverseId\': 425364}, \'multiverseid\': 425364}, {\'name\': \'迅匠探子\', \'text\': \'当迅匠探子进战场时，于你操控迅匠探子的时段内，目标由你操控的神器获得「{T}：抓一张牌。」\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'「把它的监控视野再调宽些。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4848de9b-510a-46ad-8499-877a6ccc7b20\', \'multiverseId\': 423892}, \'multiverseid\': 423892}, {\'name\': \'迅匠探子\', \'text\': \'當迅匠探子進戰場時，於你操控迅匠探子的時段內，目標由你操控的神器獲得「{T}：抽一張牌」。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／神器師\', \'flavor\': \'「把它的監控視野再調寬些。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d538743c-e17f-4336-b81c-fbbe47317eff\', \'multiverseId\': 424076}, \'multiverseid\': 424076}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fluchtroute\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält +1/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Bringe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Schön, du kennst die Gesetze. Aber ich kenne die Straßen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424225&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77774ba3-b047-46a8-ae5a-c20172548833\', \'multiverseId\': 424225}, \'multiverseid\': 424225}, {\'name\': \'Huida por el callejón\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• La criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +1/+2 hasta el final del turno.\\n• Regresa la criatura objetivo que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Tú te conocerás la ley, pero yo me conozco las calles".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1704d3c4-6b5c-48cc-8817-04cde72c4fa0\', \'multiverseId\': 425513}, \'multiverseid\': 425513}, {\'name\': \'Évasion des ruelles\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Renvoyez une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Vous connaissez peut-être la loi. Mais moi, je connais la rue. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424409&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a1812a5-e8db-486d-948b-c1bf7c826856\', \'multiverseId\': 424409}, \'multiverseid\': 424409}, {\'name\': \'Fuga nei Vicoli\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Una creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +1/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\\n• Fai tornare una creatura bersaglio che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Tu conoscerai anche la legge, ma io conosco le strade."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5fac65d-b20a-477c-b076-adef6c4141f8\', \'multiverseId\': 424593}, \'multiverseid\': 424593}, {\'name\': \'路地への回避\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋２の修整を受ける。\\n• あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「そりゃ、あんたは法律に詳しいだろう。こっちは裏道に詳しいんだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31526dcf-d682-46ab-aff5-f377a79eb803\', \'multiverseId\': 424777}, \'multiverseid\': 424777}, {\'name\': \'뒷골목 도주\', \'text\': \'하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+2을 받는다.\\n• 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"당신은 분명 법을 잘 알 테지. 하지만 난 거리 구석구석을 잘 알아."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424961&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c60bfbf-9518-4b9d-b2f4-b35a5f592501\', \'multiverseId\': 424961}, \'multiverseid\': 424961}, {\'name\': \'Evasão pelas Vielas\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• A criatura alvo que você controla recebe +1/+2 até o final do turno.\\n• Devolva a criatura alvo que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Claro, você conhece a lei. Mas eu conheço as ruas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'836e5c15-f112-4a57-bb04-4228187c8eda\', \'multiverseId\': 425145}, \'multiverseid\': 425145}, {\'name\': \'Скрыться в Переулке\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Целевое существо под вашим контролем получает +1/+2 до конца хода.\\n• Верните целевое существо под вашим контролем в руку его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Ага, ты знаешь законы. Зато я знаю улицы».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef139a11-ebbe-4c93-9dcd-37641f7b070e\', \'multiverseId\': 425329}, \'multiverseid\': 425329}, {\'name\': \'暗巷匿踪\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n• 目标由你操控的生物得+1/+2直到回合结束。\\n• 将目标由你操控的生物移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「虽然你精通法律，但我更熟悉街道。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc8341a9-0082-4be6-90cb-a7643b07f1fe\', \'multiverseId\': 423857}, \'multiverseid\': 423857}, {\'name\': \'暗巷匿蹤\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•目標由你操控的生物得+1/+2直到回合結束。\\n• 將目標由你操控的生物移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「雖然你精通法律，但我更熟悉街道。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adbeb71f-f2ee-4bb5-85da-c3d620732af4\', \'multiverseId\': 424041}, \'multiverseid\': 424041}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flugmodifikation\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur oder ein Fahrzeug\\nSolange die verzauberte bleibende Karte ein Fahrzeug ist, ist sie zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen eine Kreatur.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2 und hat Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424220&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18be8e1e-7c4f-4972-b05f-6f7bebe3dd04\', \'multiverseId\': 424220}, \'multiverseid\': 424220}, {\'name\': \'Modificación aérea\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura o Vehículo.\\nMientras el permanente encantado sea un Vehículo, es una criatura además de sus otros tipos.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2 y tiene la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d60768d-d1d9-465f-b3af-8e87acb67102\', \'multiverseId\': 425508}, \'multiverseid\': 425508}, {\'name\': \'Modification aérienne\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature ou véhicule\\nTant que le permanent enchanté est un véhicule, c\'est une créature en plus de ses autres types.\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2 et a le vol.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424404&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'279bf15d-d81a-4499-a147-63d43ec6abf0\', \'multiverseId\': 424404}, \'multiverseid\': 424404}, {\'name\': \'Modifica Aerea\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura o Veicolo\\nFintanto che il permanente incantato è un Veicolo, è una creatura in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi.\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2 e ha volare.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63e89352-0fd0-40c2-aff0-cf07989d0912\', \'multiverseId\': 424588}, \'multiverseid\': 424588}, {\'name\': \'浮遊化改造\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャーか機体）\\nエンチャントされているパーマネントが機体であるかぎり、それは他のタイプに加えてクリーチャーでもある。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは、＋２/＋２の修整を受けるとともに飛行を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a7036f8-befb-4815-8ded-5d4b9f134076\', \'multiverseId\': 424772}, \'multiverseid\': 424772}, {\'name\': \'공중 대응 개조\', \'text\': \'생물 또는 탑승물에 부여\\n부여된 지속물이 탑승물인 한, 그 지속물은 자신의 다른 유형에 더불어 생물이다.\\n부여된 생물은 +2/+2를 받고 비행을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5173c1e-7f72-44de-b095-294461ed2a5b\', \'multiverseId\': 424956}, \'multiverseid\': 424956}, {\'name\': \'Modificação Aérea\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura ou Veículo\\nEnquanto a permanente encantada for um Veículo, ela será uma criatura além de seus outros tipos.\\nA criatura encantada recebe +2/+2 e tem voar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35ca1117-86f9-4e5c-8af9-9ecd00f74f5b\', \'multiverseId\': 425140}, \'multiverseid\': 425140}, {\'name\': \'Летная Модификация\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо или Машину\\nПока зачарованный перманент является Машиной, он является существом в дополнение к своим другим типам.\\nЗачарованное существо получает +2/+2 и имеет Полет.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd8c00a4-48e3-4737-a61e-de80d660a10d\', \'multiverseId\': 425324}, \'multiverseid\': 425324}, {\'name\': \'翔空改装\', \'text\': \'结附于生物或载具\\n只要所结附的永久物是载具，它便额外具有生物此类别。\\n所结附的生物得+2/+2且具有飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8452a9b-3e2b-404f-af60-a44ecf384c51\', \'multiverseId\': 423852}, \'multiverseid\': 423852}, {\'name\': \'翔空改裝\', \'text\': \'結附於生物 或載具\\n只要所結附的永久物是載具，它便額外具有生物此類別。\\n所結附的生物得+2/+2並具有飛行異能。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c86a56a-a223-4f5d-893c-2c57da62f068\', \'multiverseId\': 424036}, \'multiverseid\': 424036}]', '[{\'name\': \'Friedensschreiter-Koloss\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: Ein anderes Fahrzeug deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst, wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.\\nBemannen 4 (Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die zusammen Stärke 4 oder mehr haben: Dieses Fahrzeug wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': \'„Frieden? Furcht zu verbreiten, ist sein einziger Zweck." —Saheeli Rai\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424389&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfe26a87-5ae1-4bb1-9aa6-65b4cf7bd25d\', \'multiverseId\': 424389}, \'multiverseid\': 424389}, {\'name\': \'Coloso pacificador\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: Otro Vehículo objetivo que controlas se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.\\nTripular 4. (Girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controlas con una fuerza total de 4 o más: Este Vehículo se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Paz? Su único fin es inspirar miedo". —Saheeli Rai\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46cb1e9a-9678-45b3-83e0-95ae7f138ed5\', \'multiverseId\': 425677}, \'multiverseid\': 425677}, {\'name\': \'Colosse marchepaix\', \'text\': "{1}{W} : Un autre véhicule ciblé que vous contrôlez devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nPilotage 4 (Engagez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez dont la force totale est supérieure ou égale à 4 : Ce véhicule devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : véhicule\', \'flavor\': "« La paix ? Sa seule raison d\'être est d\'inspirer la peur. » —Saheeli Rai", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424573&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78e2b3af-f9d0-42a9-8cb5-db64561b49ad\', \'multiverseId\': 424573}, \'multiverseid\': 424573}, {\'name\': \'Colosso Pacificatore\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: Un altro Veicolo bersaglio che controlli diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.\\nManovrare 4 (TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli con forza totale pari o superiore a 4: Questo Veicolo diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': \'"Pacificatore? La sua unica funzione è la paura." —Saheeli Raji\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72cdbcd2-b19a-47a0-b004-687d5212e729\', \'multiverseId\': 424757}, \'multiverseid\': 424757}, {\'name\': \'平和歩きの巨像\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}：あなたがコントロールする他の機体１つを対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それはアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。\\n搭乗４（あなたがコントロールする望む数のクリーチャーを、パワーの合計が４以上になるように選んでタップする：ターン終了時まで、この機体はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': \'「平和ですって？あれがもたらすのは恐怖だわ。」 ――サヒーリ・ライ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d81d92c2-a534-474a-86aa-a545134236a3\', \'multiverseId\': 424941}, \'multiverseid\': 424941}, {\'name\': \'평화보행자 거상\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: 당신이 조종하는 다른 탑승물을 목표로 정한다. 그 탑승물은 턴종료까지 마법물체 생물이 된다.\\n탑승 4 (당신이 조종하는 생물을 공격력 총합이 4 이상이 되도록 원하는 수만큼 탭한다: 이 탑승물은 턴종료까지 마법물체 생물이 된다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 탑승물\', \'flavor\': \'"평화? 그것의 유일한 목적은 공포야." —사힐리 라이\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4ca8188-e8c2-449b-8763-a0fb56c0842d\', \'multiverseId\': 425125}, \'multiverseid\': 425125}, {\'name\': \'Colosso Caminhante da Paz\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: Outro Veículo alvo que você controla se torna uma criatura artefato até o final do turno.\\nTripular 4 (Vire qualquer número de criaturas que você controla com total de poder igual ou superior a 4: Este Veículo torna-se uma criatura artefato até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Veículo\', \'flavor\': \'"Paz? O único propósito daquilo é o medo." — Saheeli Rai\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e74e5a2-0b2f-4503-a5c3-1670b25b7545\', \'multiverseId\': 425309}, \'multiverseid\': 425309}, {\'name\': \'Колосс-Мирноход\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: другая целевая Машина под вашим контролем становится артефактом существом до конца хода.\\nЭкипаж 4 (Поверните любое количество существ под вашим контролем с суммарной силой 4 или более: эта Машина становится артефактом существом до конца хода.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Машина\', \'flavor\': \'«Мир? Его единственное предназначение — внушать страх». — Сахили Рей\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'446e4f78-fffd-4799-a7ed-f2d8b227899a\', \'multiverseId\': 425493}, \'multiverseid\': 425493}, {\'name\': \'护宁巨像\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}：另一个目标由你操控的载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。\\n搭载4（横置任意数量由你操控且力量总和等于或大于4的生物：此载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'神器～载具\', \'flavor\': \'「维护和平？它唯一的目的便是让人恐惧。」 ～莎希莉莱伊\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bac041b-5619-4f19-80b8-1fa3b28ee97b\', \'multiverseId\': 424021}, \'multiverseid\': 424021}, {\'name\': \'護寧巨像\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}：另一個目標由你操控的載具成為神器生物直到回合結束。\\n搭載4（橫置任意數量由你操控且力量總和等於或大於4的生物：此載具成為神器生物直到回合結束。）\', \'type\': \'神器～載具\', \'flavor\': \'「維護和平？它唯一的目的便是讓人恐懼。」 ～莎希莉萊伊\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2fbcff1-670a-4522-bf09-74b9898490e3\', \'multiverseId\': 424205}, \'multiverseid\': 424205}]', '[{\'name\': \'Frontlinien-Rebell\', \'text\': \'Der Frontlinien-Rebell greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Wirst du Stärke zeigen und an meiner Seite kämpfen?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424301&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cd54add-18f7-45ef-88ee-e026359774a2\', \'multiverseId\': 424301}, \'multiverseid\': 424301}, {\'name\': \'Rebelde de primera línea\', \'text\': \'El Rebelde de primera línea ataca cada combate si puede.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Serás fuerte y resistirás conmigo?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30cbee19-18b6-41c2-ae97-00342c7c07a2\', \'multiverseId\': 425589}, \'multiverseid\': 425589}, {\'name\': \'Rebelle du front\', \'text\': \'Le Rebelle du front attaque à chaque combat si possible.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Rassemblerez-vous votre courage pour rester à mes côtés ? »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424485&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04663c78-a29a-4457-adf5-cfe963df2ff2\', \'multiverseId\': 424485}, \'multiverseid\': 424485}, {\'name\': \'Ribelle in Prima Linea\', \'text\': \'Il Ribelle in Prima Linea attacca in ogni combattimento, se può farlo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Sarete forti e lotterete con me?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'829813f7-88e8-4d1a-8fbc-12f1768d6f36\', \'multiverseId\': 424669}, \'multiverseid\': 424669}, {\'name\': \'最前線の反逆者\', \'text\': \'各戦闘で、最前線の反逆者は可能なら攻撃する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「強くなって俺と一緒に来るか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71a6329e-e405-4903-8611-2c4f4bc9743f\', \'multiverseId\': 424853}, \'multiverseid\': 424853}, {\'name\': \'최전방 반란군\', \'text\': \'최전방 반란군은 가능하면 매 전투마다 공격한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"용감하게 나와 함께할 수 있겠소?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec5425a4-e39c-46de-887b-78230d227cd6\', \'multiverseId\': 425037}, \'multiverseid\': 425037}, {\'name\': \'Rebelde na Linha de Frente\', \'text\': \'Rebelde na Linha de Frente ataca a cada turno se estiver apto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Vocês vão ser fortes e ficar ao meu lado?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f2314b8-b8e6-4e62-a8fb-9ab0c7ad70a3\', \'multiverseId\': 425221}, \'multiverseid\': 425221}, {\'name\': \'Повстанец с Передовой\', \'text\': \'Повстанец с Передовой атакует в каждом бою, если может.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Будешь ли ты силен, чтобы встать со мной плечом к плечу?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e45a9ff9-0164-475c-a942-49887a4f6542\', \'multiverseId\': 425405}, \'multiverseid\': 425405}, {\'name\': \'前线反抗军\', \'text\': \'前线反抗军每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「你会坚定地与我并肩作战吗？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e9217c5-9d50-4484-a09e-f205bbba941b\', \'multiverseId\': 423933}, \'multiverseid\': 423933}, {\'name\': \'前線反抗軍\', \'text\': \'前線反抗軍每次戰鬥若能攻擊，則必須攻擊。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「你會堅定地與我並肩作戰嗎？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0e56bf8-beb1-43ef-9047-6b8cd965d16f\', \'multiverseId\': 424117}, \'multiverseid\': 424117}]', "[{'name': 'Gabe der Biotronik', 'text': 'Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Lege dann eine +1/+1-Marke auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und auf der bereits mindestens eine +1/+1-Marke liegt.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Die besten Ingenieure erkennen, wenn ein Problem bereits gelöst wurde.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424333&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cf6b8d0d-e20f-4071-9743-0cd3de1264f8', 'multiverseId': 424333}, 'multiverseid': 424333}, {'name': 'Don de la fraguavidas', 'text': 'Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo, luego pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Solo los mejores ingenieros saben advertir cuándo un problema ya ha sido resuelto.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425621&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b99af403-c53f-4dc4-ad2c-21546e397301', 'multiverseId': 425621}, 'multiverseid': 425621}, {'name': 'Don de la façonneuse de vie', 'text': 'Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée, puis mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Les meilleurs ingénieurs reconnaissent quand un problème a déjà été résolu.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424517&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0136e6dc-88c0-4b97-8786-e3ac6a2cf6cb', 'multiverseId': 424517}, 'multiverseid': 424517}, {'name': 'Dono della Forgiavita', 'text': 'Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio, poi metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura con un segnalino +1/+1 che controlli.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Gli ingegneri migliori riconoscono quando un problema è già stato risolto.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424701&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0ecec22a-d745-4bf1-9076-81cee8d784d2', 'multiverseId': 424701}, 'multiverseid': 424701}, {'name': '造命師の贈り物', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。その後、あなたがコントロールする＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれている各クリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '優れた技師には、問題が解決していてもそれがわかる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424885&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de80aea4-078c-4543-92a5-b16af9e0abf0', 'multiverseId': 424885}, 'multiverseid': 424885}, {'name': '생명제작자의 선물', 'text': '생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓은 후, 당신이 조종하는 생물 중 +1/+1 카운터가 올려진 각 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.', 'type': '순간마법', 'flavor': '최고의 기술자는 문제가 이미 해결되었는지 한 눈에 알아본다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425069&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '23bd437f-a90b-45d5-8209-40691ebc88b4', 'multiverseId': 425069}, 'multiverseid': 425069}, {'name': 'Dádiva da Vivideira', 'text': 'Coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo e depois coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla com um marcador +1/+1.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Os melhores engenheiros reconhecem quando um problema já foi resolvido.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425253&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa6c668e-9a6f-4a53-be5d-f7a6d5dd1b2e', 'multiverseId': 425253}, 'multiverseid': 425253}, {'name': 'Дар Жизнетворца', 'text': 'Положите один жетон +1/+1 на целевое существо, затем положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое существо под вашим контролем, на котором есть жетон +1/+1.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': 'Лучшие инженеры понимают, когда проблема уже решена.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425437&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2f446a73-77ef-4028-8f21-1148dc663ab6', 'multiverseId': 425437}, 'multiverseid': 425437}, {'name': '铸生匠赋礼', 'text': '在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物，然后在每个由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '顶尖的工程师一眼便知问题是否已解决。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423965&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '54b288f1-d4c1-4bf3-a064-4782c2e1de14', 'multiverseId': 423965}, 'multiverseid': 423965}, {'name': '鑄生匠賦禮', 'text': '在目標生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物，然後在每個由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物上各放置一個+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': '頂尖的工程師一眼便知問題是否已解決。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424149&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '68536694-e66e-4f4e-8852-4809f1e83de8', 'multiverseId': 424149}, 'multiverseid': 424149}]", '[{\'name\': \'Geblendet vom Scheinwerferlicht\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur kann nicht angreifen oder blocken.\\nWenn ein Fahrzeug, das du kontrollierst, angreift, schicke die verzauberte Kreatur ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Auf der Jagd nach Äther ignoriert ein Gremlin gerne alle anderen Reize, auch wenn sie eine Gefahr für sein Leben bedeuten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424229&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c16fe61a-a7dd-484e-947a-59d7f186d7f0\', \'multiverseId\': 424229}, \'multiverseid\': 424229}, {\'name\': \'Deslumbrado por los faros\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada no puede atacar ni bloquear.\\nCuando un Vehículo que controlas ataque, exilia la criatura encantada.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras buscan éter, los gremlins pueden ignorar otros estímulos, incluso los que ponen en peligro sus vidas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b88c9f8f-bcaf-48e4-8a41-789df5f2db5b\', \'multiverseId\': 425517}, \'multiverseid\': 425517}, {\'name\': \'Pris dans la lumière\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer.\\nQuand un véhicule que vous contrôlez attaque, exilez la créature enchantée.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Lorsqu\'il chasse l\'Éther, un gremlin peut ignorer d\'autres stimuli, y compris les menaces sur sa vie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424413&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'499268fb-dea6-48a7-9d64-20c1c8a2956c\', \'multiverseId\': 424413}, \'multiverseid\': 424413}, {\'name\': \'Colto in Flagrante\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata non può attaccare o bloccare.\\nQuando un Veicolo che controlli attacca, esilia la creatura incantata.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Quando è in cerca di etere, un gremlin può arrivare a ignorare altri stimoli, comprese minacce alla sua stessa vita.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7b86ccd-92a2-4c18-8a6d-95e08aecabeb\', \'multiverseId\': 424597}, \'multiverseid\': 424597}, {\'name\': \'光に目が眩む\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーでは攻撃したりブロックしたりできない。\\nあなたがコントロールする機体が１つ攻撃したとき、エンチャントされているクリーチャーを追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'霊気を追っているグレムリンは、他の一切が目に入らないようだ。それが自身の生存に係わることであっても。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d79ab7e-dd72-4f32-a6bc-ffffb9d0be00\', \'multiverseId\': 424781}, \'multiverseid\': 424781}, {\'name\': \'침투 발각\', \'text\': \'생물에 부여\\n부여된 생물은 공격하거나 방어할 수 없다.\\n당신이 조종하는 탑승물이 공격할 때, 부여된 생물을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'에테르를 훔칠 때 그렘린은 생명의 위협 같은 다른 자극들을 무시할 수 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424965&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff5dfc1f-b147-44d3-93f0-5b44fdbbca01\', \'multiverseId\': 424965}, \'multiverseid\': 424965}, {\'name\': \'Pego pelos Holofotes\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada não pode atacar nem bloquear.\\nQuando um Veículo que você controla atacar, exile a criatura encantada.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Enquanto está à caça de éter, um gremlin pode ignorar outros estímulos, incluindo ameaças a sua própria vida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbd5cc1b-0e5a-4153-af37-244536c53077\', \'multiverseId\': 425149}, \'multiverseid\': 425149}, {\'name\': \'В Свете Фар\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо не может атаковать или блокировать.\\nКогда Машина под вашим контролем атакует, изгоните зачарованное существо.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Охотясь за эфиром, гремлины частенько забывают обо всем, в том числе и об опасностях для собственной жизни.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abc078ec-24d0-4d3d-b191-e555bca9ec72\', \'multiverseId\': 425333}, \'multiverseid\': 425333}, {\'name\': \'束手就擒\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物不能进行攻击或阻挡。\\n当一个由你操控的载具攻击时，放逐所结附的生物。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'怪灵在觅夺乙太时往往眼中无它，就连可能危及生命的东西都能视而不见。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e370e581-7223-42b7-9a33-458e6037fca8\', \'multiverseId\': 423861}, \'multiverseid\': 423861}, {\'name\': \'束手就擒\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物不能進行攻擊或阻擋。\\n當一個由你操控的載具攻擊時，放逐所結附的生物。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'怪靈在覓奪乙太時往往眼中無它，就連可能危及生命的東西都能視而不見。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'136b6d4f-6a50-4237-b927-a43d5762e94c\', \'multiverseId\': 424045}, \'multiverseid\': 424045}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gefräßiger Eindringling\', \'text\': \'Opfere ein Artefakt: Der Gefräßige Eindringling erhält +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Gremlin\', \'flavor\': \'„Vor Kurzem habe ich einige exquisite Objekte erworben, daher plane ich, mein Sicherheitssystem entsprechend zu verbessern. Morgen erwarte ich einen Berater in dieser Angelegenheit." —Kurna Majan, Liga der Koryphäen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424313&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a235a1c-177a-432f-80ab-781114581b45\', \'multiverseId\': 424313}, \'multiverseid\': 424313}, {\'name\': \'Intruso voraz\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar un artefacto: El Intruso voraz obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gremlin\', \'flavor\': \'"Últimamente he adquirido algunas piezas exquisitas, así que estoy planteando aumentar mis sistemas de seguridad de forma proporcional. Mañana viene un asesor". —Kurna Majan, de la Liga de los Luminarios\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f415af31-30a3-40fc-a2d6-ff18820005d6\', \'multiverseId\': 425601}, \'multiverseid\': 425601}, {\'name\': \'Intrus vorace\', \'text\': "Sacrifiez un artefact : L\'Intrus vorace gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : gremlin\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai récemment fait de superbes acquisitions, j\'ai donc l\'intention d\'améliorer mon système de sécurité en conséquence. J\'ai rendez-vous avec un consultant demain. » —Kurna Majan, Ligue des sommités", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424497&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'293f5606-a8d3-4245-9e28-169fec3e6d31\', \'multiverseId\': 424497}, \'multiverseid\': 424497}, {\'name\': \'Intruso Famelico\', \'text\': "Sacrifica un artefatto: L\'Intruso Famelico prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Gremlin\', \'flavor\': \'"Ultimamente ho fatto dei buoni acquisti, di conseguenza intendo potenziare i miei sistemi di sicurezza. Domani ho appuntamento con un consulente." —Kurna Majan, Lega dei Luminari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4824d40b-19af-47a8-a4a4-6355c3e4cb60\', \'multiverseId\': 424681}, \'multiverseid\': 424681}, {\'name\': \'貪欲な侵入者\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、貪欲な侵入者は＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — グレムリン\', \'flavor\': \'「近ごろ素晴らしい品を買い入れたのだ。あれに見合うよう防犯機構を一新しようと思っている。明日、専門家に来てもらう予定だ。」 ――月光会、クルナ・マジャーン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9468f25c-a2c7-4409-a40f-b0bc468592db\', \'multiverseId\': 424865}, \'multiverseid\': 424865}, {\'name\': \'탐욕스러운 침입자\', \'text\': \'마법물체 한 개를 희생한다: 턴종료까지 탐욕스러운 침입자는 +2/+2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 그렘린\', \'flavor\': \'"최근에 아주 값비싼 물건을 입수했어. 그에 맞게 보안 시스템을 업그레이드하려고 해. 내일 자문 위원이 들를 거야." —선지자 리그 쿠르나 마얀\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4277ff29-7d3b-41e8-92c9-e21f990232b0\', \'multiverseId\': 425049}, \'multiverseid\': 425049}, {\'name\': \'Intruso Voraz\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique um artefato: Intruso Voraz recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gremlin\', \'flavor\': \'"Fiz algumas boas aquisições ultimamente. Estou planejando fazer aprimoramentos proporcionais em meus sistemas de segurança. Vou chamar um consultor amanhã." — Kurna Majan, Liga Luminária\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cea6a0b-6bc5-445f-a8e6-fb4b6b47650d\', \'multiverseId\': 425233}, \'multiverseid\': 425233}, {\'name\': \'Прожорливый Паразит\', \'text\': \'Пожертвуйте артефакт: Прожорливый Паразит получает +2/+2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гремлин\', \'flavor\': \'«В последнее время я сделал несколько удачных приобретений, так что собираюсь внести сообразные усиления в мою систему безопасности. Консультант придет завтра». — Курна Маджан из лиги Светоча\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'754c08ae-e7e6-4acd-85bb-f97427740c7b\', \'multiverseId\': 425417}, \'multiverseid\': 425417}, {\'name\': \'贪婪入侵者\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个神器：贪婪入侵者得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～怪灵\', \'flavor\': \'「余近日购得珍玩数件，故欲将保全系统修葺一新，以相般配。明日已约顾问前来洽谈。」 ～名仕盟的库纳默金\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bdb0335-6365-4091-ad75-30ab4e4b3ecb\', \'multiverseId\': 423945}, \'multiverseid\': 423945}, {\'name\': \'貪婪入侵者\', \'text\': \'犧牲一個神器：貪婪入侵者得+2/+2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～怪靈\', \'flavor\': \'「余近日購得珍玩數件，故欲將保全系統修葺一新，以相殷配。明日已約顧問前來洽談。」」 ～名仕盟的庫納默金\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'336a5177-b71d-48c0-ae46-ff1fd507b947\', \'multiverseId\': 424129}, \'multiverseid\': 424129}]', "[{'name': 'Gefährliches Dilemma', 'text': 'Jeder Gegner opfert eine Artefaktkreatur und eine Nichtartefaktkreatur.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Kameraden im Leben. Kameraden im Tod.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424287&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b881c5d8-7bd2-433d-851c-2c0a8c15e787', 'multiverseId': 424287}, 'multiverseid': 424287}, {'name': 'Grandes apuros', 'text': 'Cada oponente sacrifica una criatura artefacto y una criatura que no sea artefacto.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Camaradas en vida, camaradas en la muerte.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425575&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3421430c-e5fb-43d9-b968-ecf695e6a589', 'multiverseId': 425575}, 'multiverseid': 425575}, {'name': 'Situation délicate', 'text': 'Chaque adversaire sacrifie une créature-artefact et une créature non-artefact.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Unis dans la vie. Unis dans la mort.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424471&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8dd59a8a-cca3-4953-9615-67b9f1123eeb', 'multiverseId': 424471}, 'multiverseid': 424471}, {'name': 'Situazione Pericolosa', 'text': 'Ogni avversario sacrifica una creatura artefatto e una creatura non artefatto.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Compagni nella vita. Compagni nella morte.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424655&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '12ed1cd6-72ab-44d9-bde1-e5b10fe06058', 'multiverseId': 424655}, 'multiverseid': 424655}, {'name': '危険な窮地', 'text': '各対戦相手はそれぞれ、アーティファクト・クリーチャー１体とアーティファクトでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '生涯の友。死中の友。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424839&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ab584c4-02de-4b73-9d3c-1b289a76ee87', 'multiverseId': 424839}, 'multiverseid': 424839}, {'name': '위험한 곤경', 'text': '각 상대는 마법물체 생물과 마법물체가 아닌 생물을 하나씩 희생한다.', 'type': '순간마법', 'flavor': '살아 생전 동료는 죽어서도 동료다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425023&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '71318841-b529-42d3-9928-fd496bb8b533', 'multiverseId': 425023}, 'multiverseid': 425023}, {'name': 'Dilema Perigoso', 'text': 'Cada oponente sacrifica uma criatura artefato e uma criatura que não seja um artefato.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Camaradas na vida. Camaradas na morte.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425207&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd886f54c-08fd-40eb-bc4e-6d2e289e2836', 'multiverseId': 425207}, 'multiverseid': 425207}, {'name': 'Опасное Затруднение', 'text': 'Каждый оппонент жертвует артефакт существо и не являющееся артефактом существо.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': 'Товарищи при жизни. Товарищи в момент смерти.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425391&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e11fe69-a05f-4063-905c-ad76f7bb5e6b', 'multiverseId': 425391}, 'multiverseid': 425391}, {'name': '险恶困境', 'text': '每位对手各牺牲一个神器生物和一个非神器的生物。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '生相伴，死相随。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423919&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f3f2b44-ba48-42f3-8679-e251de059d51', 'multiverseId': 423919}, 'multiverseid': 423919}, {'name': '險惡困境', 'text': '每位對手各犧牲一個神器生物和一個非神器的生物。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': '生相伴，死相隨。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424103&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e58d884a-4a25-4db6-b7eb-34e90c250db2', 'multiverseId': 424103}, 'multiverseid': 424103}]", '[{\'name\': \'Geheime Bergung\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil. Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer beliebigen Anzahl an Karten mit demselben Namen wie jene Karte, zeige sie offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'In Ghirapur gibt es genauso viele illegale Bergungen wie es Leute gibt, die davon profitieren möchten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424290&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f485cc0-8f2d-43f0-878e-caa12bc3bb83\', \'multiverseId\': 424290}, \'multiverseid\': 424290}, {\'name\': \'Recuperación secreta\', \'text\': \'Exilia la carta objetivo que no sea tierra de tu cementerio. Busca en tu biblioteca cualquier cantidad de cartas con el mismo nombre que esa carta, muéstralas y ponlas en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los reciclajes ilegales no escasean en Ghirapur... ni tampoco los individuos que sacan provecho de ellos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64f11d1d-e0a2-4267-81ed-9250f023ed42\', \'multiverseId\': 425578}, \'multiverseid\': 425578}, {\'name\': \'Récupération secrète\', \'text\': "Exilez une carte non-terrain ciblée de votre cimetière. Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque n\'importe quel nombre de cartes ayant le même nom que cette carte, révélez-les et mettez-les dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Ghirapur ne manque pas de récupérations illégales, ni d\'individus prêts à en profiter.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424474&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb384fc5-6d16-47d1-a211-96a30b566e31\', \'multiverseId\': 424474}, \'multiverseid\': 424474}, {\'name\': \'Recupero Segreto\', \'text\': \'Esilia una carta non terra bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per un qualsiasi numero di carte con lo stesso nome di quella carta, rivelale e aggiungile alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'I recuperi illegali non mancano di certo a Ghirapur, come non manca chi spera di trarne profitto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da444b73-44d2-471d-b79e-5e0d194751b4\', \'multiverseId\': 424658}, \'multiverseid\': 424658}, {\'name\': \'秘密の回収\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地から土地でないカード１枚を対象とし、それを追放する。あなたのライブラリーからそのカードと同じ名前を持つカードを探し、それらを公開してあなたの手札に加える。その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ギラプールでは不法な回収行為が減ることはない。そこから利益を得ようとする者も後を絶たない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb0c5a50-70dd-45a7-81b1-4e1346dab6ef\', \'multiverseId\': 424842}, \'multiverseid\': 424842}, {\'name\': \'비밀 인양\', \'text\': \'당신의 무덤에 있는 대지가 아닌 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 추방한다. 당신의 서고에서 그 카드와 이름이 같은 카드를 원하는 수만큼 찾아서 공개한 후 당신의 손으로 가져간다. 그러고 나서 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'기라푸르에는 불법 인양 물품이 아주 많다. 이것으로 이득을 취하려는 자들도 그만큼 넘쳐난다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f97377a4-2ae8-49b2-80dd-051f261af0c0\', \'multiverseId\': 425026}, \'multiverseid\': 425026}, {\'name\': \'Recuperação Secreta\', \'text\': \'Exile o card alvo do seu cemitério que não seja um terreno. Procure em seu grimório qualquer número de cards com o mesmo nome que aquele card, revele-os e coloque-os em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Não faltam peças recuperadas ilegais em Ghirapur, nem quem esteja disposto a lucrar com elas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de667e5f-1bd6-430b-a68f-6b3b2831d3bc\', \'multiverseId\': 425210}, \'multiverseid\': 425210}, {\'name\': \'Тайные Трофеи\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевую не являющуюся землей карту из вашего кладбища. Найдите в вашей библиотеке любое количество карт с тем же именем, что у той карты, покажите их и положите в вашу руку. Затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'В Гирапуре хватает и запрещенных законом трофеев, и тех, кто готов на них нажиться.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'403b6081-f743-4671-b89d-8fdc20ffa54e\', \'multiverseId\': 425394}, \'multiverseid\': 425394}, {\'name\': \'隐秘回收\', \'text\': \'将目标非地牌从你的坟墓场放逐。从你的牌库中搜寻任意数量与之同名的牌，展示这些牌，并将它们置于你手上。然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'吉拉波的非法回收活动不少，乐于从中获利的人也不缺。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f4c3c88-532a-431f-9ce8-5ffae7bdac4e\', \'multiverseId\': 423922}, \'multiverseid\': 423922}, {\'name\': \'隱秘回收\', \'text\': \'將目標非地牌從你的墳墓場放逐。從你的牌庫中搜尋任意數量與之同名的牌，展示這些牌，並將它們置於你手上。然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'吉拉波的非法回收活動不少，樂於從中獲利的人也不缺。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d3428fb-b5ba-4274-923c-25b3831460f2\', \'multiverseId\': 424106}, \'multiverseid\': 424106}]', '[{\'name\': \'Genährte Verwüstung\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +4/+0 und verursacht Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl erhalten +2/+0 und verursachen Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Gremlins werden von einem Augenblick zum nächsten von Plagegeistern zu echten Problemen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424305&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22f15332-e7a5-467c-9144-13991c3985d5\', \'multiverseId\': 424305}, \'multiverseid\': 424305}, {\'name\': \'Devastación revigorizada\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• La criatura objetivo obtiene +4/+0 y gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\\n• Dos criaturas objetivo obtienen +2/+0 cada una y ganan la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'En pocos momentos, los gremlins pueden pasar de ser una molestia a un problema, e inmediatamente después una plaga.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66a60bb7-46d9-4e42-96d2-3350508da600\', \'multiverseId\': 425593}, \'multiverseid\': 425593}, {\'name\': \'Sauvagerie revigorée\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• La créature ciblée gagne +4/+0 et acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Deux créatures ciblées gagnent chacune +2/+0 et acquièrent le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Les gremlins peuvent passer de nuisibles, à problème, puis à fléau en l\'espace d\'un instant.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424489&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b0ea67d-66bb-4493-875d-7c18f9bd1861\', \'multiverseId\': 424489}, \'multiverseid\': 424489}, {\'name\': \'Frenesia Energetica\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Una creatura bersaglio prende +4/+0 e ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\\n• Due creature bersaglio prendono +2/+0 e hanno travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "I gremlin possono passare da semplice scocciatura a problema e, infine, a flagello nell\'arco di pochi istanti.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5af799b-3199-41c8-9712-b4330a17ac2f\', \'multiverseId\': 424673}, \'multiverseid\': 424673}, {\'name\': \'暴力の激励\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋４/＋０の修整を受けるとともにトランプルを得る。\\n• クリーチャー２体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それらはそれぞれ＋２/＋０の修整を受けるとともにトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'グレムリンは一瞬にして、困りごとから大災害まで姿を変える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'886597b6-9505-48ed-9dc8-9b6177694934\', \'multiverseId\': 424857}, \'multiverseid\': 424857}, {\'name\': \'광란의 파괴\', \'text\': \'하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +4/+0를 받고 돌진을 얻는다.\\n• 생물 두 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들은 턴종료까지 각각 +2/+0를 받고 돌진을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'그렘린은 순식간에 해충에서 문젯거리로, 문젯거리에서 재앙으로 탈바꿈한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db1c23a0-fbe9-4aff-9b56-09ef949b07ac\', \'multiverseId\': 425041}, \'multiverseid\': 425041}, {\'name\': \'Fúria Revigorada\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• A criatura alvo recebe +4/+0 e ganha atropelar até o final do turno.\\n• Duas criaturas alvo recebem cada uma +2/+0 e ganham atropelar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Em poucos instantes, gremlins podem passar de praga a problema, e enfim, a infestação incontrolável.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af52c9c5-21ba-4c69-91a9-2eb0d829b0a3\', \'multiverseId\': 425225}, \'multiverseid\': 425225}, {\'name\': \'Усиленная Ярость\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Целевое существо получает +4/+0 и Пробивной удар до конца хода.\\n• Два целевых существа получают по +2/+0 и Пробивной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Гремлины в мгновение ока могут превратиться из неприятности в проблему и даже в настоящее бедствие.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63ca4b96-02ba-4612-b774-69355911a26e\', \'multiverseId\': 425409}, \'multiverseid\': 425409}, {\'name\': \'受激狂乱\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n• 直到回合结束，目标生物得+4/+0且获得践踏异能。\\n• 直到回合结束，两个目标生物各得+2/+0且获得践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'只消片刻，怪灵就能从不足挂齿变成棘手问题再到恐怖灾难。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b349cba7-cc58-4c5c-aae1-7929a1e420c6\', \'multiverseId\': 423937}, \'multiverseid\': 423937}, {\'name\': \'受激狂亂\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•直到回合結束，目標生物得+4/+0且獲得踐踏異能。\\n•直到回合結束，兩個目標生物各得+2/+0且獲得踐踏異能。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'只消片刻，怪靈就能從不足掛齒變成棘手問題再到恐怖災難。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b45d0b00-23d5-47f1-921a-4fd7d469ac60\', \'multiverseId\': 424121}, \'multiverseid\': 424121}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gepanzerter Revolutionär\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Gepanzerte Revolutionär ins Spiel kommt, kannst du ein Artefakt opfern. Falls du dies tust, lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf den Gepanzerten Revolutionär und jeder Gegner verliert 2 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Äthergeborener, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'Die Rebellion breitete sich wie ein Lauffeuer aus und der Einfallsreichtum der Renegaten überstieg die größten Befürchtungen des Konsulats.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424284&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8017ecc2-08bc-4a44-aaa9-ff956b665c8c\', \'multiverseId\': 424284}, \'multiverseid\': 424284}, {\'name\': \'Revolucionario acorazado\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Revolucionario acorazado entre al campo de batalla, puedes sacrificar un artefacto. Si lo haces, pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre el Revolucionario acorazado y cada oponente pierde 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice etergénito\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras la rebelión se extendía, el ingenio de los renegados superó los mayores temores del Consulado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc66e51a-a683-4e2d-8804-39de64a8c799\', \'multiverseId\': 425572}, \'multiverseid\': 425572}, {\'name\': \'Révolutionnaire cuirassé\', \'text\': \'Quand le Révolutionnaire cuirassé arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez sacrifier un artefact. Si vous faites ainsi, mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur le Révolutionnaire cuirassé et chaque adversaire perd 2 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : éthérien et artificier\', \'flavor\': "À mesure que la rébellion s\'intensifiait, l\'ingéniosité des renégats surpassait les plus grandes craintes du Consulat.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424468&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'400d7c16-7321-4ca5-aa71-c48ea57dd6ac\', \'multiverseId\': 424468}, \'multiverseid\': 424468}, {\'name\': \'Rivoluzionario Corazzato\', \'text\': \'Quando il Rivoluzionario Corazzato entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi sacrificare un artefatto. Se lo fai, metti due segnalini +1/+1 sul Rivoluzionario Corazzato e ogni avversario perde 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Eteride\', \'flavor\': "Man mano che la ribellione dilagava, l\'ingegno dei rinnegati continuava a surclassare le peggiori paure del Consolato.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d5e0cf1-1ee8-4388-b75e-89276ccc67b6\', \'multiverseId\': 424652}, \'multiverseid\': 424652}, {\'name\': \'鉄覆いの革命家\', \'text\': \'鉄覆いの革命家が戦場に出たとき、あなたはアーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたなら、鉄覆いの革命家の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置き、各対戦相手はそれぞれ２点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 霊基体・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'反乱が拡大すると、改革派の創意工夫は領事府の危惧を上回った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19849a15-fea8-4bb5-ba2e-05c408c5521f\', \'multiverseId\': 424836}, \'multiverseid\': 424836}, {\'name\': \'철갑 혁명가\', \'text\': \'철갑 혁명가가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 마법물체 한 개를 희생할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 철갑 혁명가에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 올려놓고 각 상대는 생명 2점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 에테르붙이 기능공\', \'flavor\': \'반란이 확산되면서 무법자의 교묘함이 영사관이 가장 두려워하는 적들을 능가했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8a04b1f-86dd-40fb-904b-fb664a15f3dd\', \'multiverseId\': 425020}, \'multiverseid\': 425020}, {\'name\': \'Revolucionário Couraçado\', \'text\': \'Quando Revolucionário Couraçado entra no campo de batalha, você pode sacrificar um artefato. Se fizer isso, você coloca dois marcadores +1/+1 em Revolucionário Couraçado e cada oponente perde 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Etergênito Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'Conforme a rebelião se espalhou, a engenhosidade dos renegados superou os maiores temores do Consulado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9347c8f6-5637-4584-a716-5b31b4f680e5\', \'multiverseId\': 425204}, \'multiverseid\': 425204}, {\'name\': \'Облаченный в Броню Революционер\', \'text\': \'Когда Облаченный в Броню Революционер выходит на поле битвы, вы можете пожертвовать артефакт. Если вы это делаете, положите два жетона +1/+1 на Облаченного в Броню Революционера, и каждый оппонент теряет 2 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эфирид Механик\', \'flavor\': \'Бунт разгорался, и изобретательность отступников превзошла самые большие страхи Консульства.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12da4db4-6c22-49ee-9151-78dcf61164d4\', \'multiverseId\': 425388}, \'multiverseid\': 425388}, {\'name\': \'披甲革命家\', \'text\': \'当披甲革命家进战场时，你可以牺牲一个神器。若你如此作，则在披甲革命家上放置两个+1/+1指示物且每位对手各失去2点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～乙太种／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'随着叛乱蔓延，乱匠的才智成为执政院最深的恐惧。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46ecbca0-4ec8-4164-bc93-ce98fc852e09\', \'multiverseId\': 423916}, \'multiverseid\': 423916}, {\'name\': \'披甲革命家\', \'text\': \'當披甲革命家進戰場時，你可以犧牲一個神器。若你如此作，則在披甲革命家上放置兩個+1/+1指示物且每位對手各失去2點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～乙太種／神器師\', \'flavor\': \'隨著叛亂蔓延，亂匠的發明才智成為執政院最深的恐懼。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'887711d1-de44-4aa4-b1f1-a17c278d0d2d\', \'multiverseId\': 424100}, \'multiverseid\': 424100}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gerissene Abwerberin\', \'text\': \'Improvisieren (Deine Artefakte können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)\\nImmer wenn ein Nichtspielstein-Artefakt, das du kontrollierst, aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Servo-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424291&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'404a4480-9bda-4ad4-93d2-018a079ebb77\', \'multiverseId\': 424291}, \'multiverseid\': 424291}, {\'name\': \'Requisadora taimada\', \'text\': \'Improvisar. (Tus artefactos pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada artefacto que gires una vez que termines de activar habilidades de maná paga {1}.)\\nSiempre que un artefacto que no sea ficha que controlas vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Servo incolora 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d52d18f-d3f0-4cff-b8b0-4da70f90717b\', \'multiverseId\': 425579}, \'multiverseid\': 425579}, {\'name\': \'Réquisitionneuse sournoise\', \'text\': "Improvisation (Vos artefacts peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque artefact que vous engagez après avoir activé des capacités de mana paie {1}.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un artefact non-jeton que vous contrôlez est mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Servo.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424475&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'283e298e-2ed6-47e2-bb64-2892ec94d0bf\', \'multiverseId\': 424475}, \'multiverseid\': 424475}, {\'name\': \'Requisitrice Astuta\', \'text\': \'Improvvisare (I tuoi artefatti possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni artefatto che TAPpi dopo aver attivato le abilità di mana corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nOgniqualvolta un artefatto non pedina che controlli viene messo in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Servomeccanismo 1/1 incolore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63d49be3-79ed-4dcb-b5e1-5ac1b2f644f2\', \'multiverseId\': 424659}, \'multiverseid\': 424659}, {\'name\': \'枉惑な調達者\', \'text\': \'即席（あなたのアーティファクトが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。あなたはあなたのアーティファクトをタップして、１個あたり{1}の支払いに代えてもよい。）\\nあなたがコントロールするトークンでないアーティファクトが１つ戦場から墓地に置かれるたび、無色の１/１の霊気装置・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1129500f-3605-42d5-941b-44eed2d3286c\', \'multiverseId\': 424843}, \'multiverseid\': 424843}, {\'name\': \'교활한 징발자\', \'text\': \'급조 (당신의 마법물체들은 이 주문을 발동하는 것을 도울 수 있다. 마나 능력을 활성화한 후에 탭하는 각 마법물체는 이 주문의 비용 중 {1}을 지불한다.)\\n당신이 조종하는 토큰이 아닌 마법물체가 전장에서 무덤에 놓일 때마다, 1/1 무색 서보 마법물체 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기능공\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf92fd5b-c9ac-4760-b11c-d6ae049d27f1\', \'multiverseId\': 425027}, \'multiverseid\': 425027}, {\'name\': \'Requisitora Astuta\', \'text\': \'Improvisar (Seus artefatos podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada artefato que você vira após terminar de ativar habilidades de mana paga por {1}.)\\nToda vez que um artefato que você controla que não seja uma ficha for colocado em um cemitério vindo do campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Servus.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f80a96f2-e291-4450-bc70-d488a898e540\', \'multiverseId\': 425211}, \'multiverseid\': 425211}, {\'name\': \'Коварная Изымательница\', \'text\': \'Импровизация (Ваши артефакты могут помочь разыграть это заклинание. Каждый артефакт, который вы поворачиваете после того, как вы закончили активировать мана-способности, считается оплатой {1}.)\\nКаждый раз, когда не являющийся фишкой артефакт под вашим контролем попадает с поля битвы на кладбище, создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Сервотрон.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Механик\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3dc6566-0268-41ff-ae1f-888cc870d123\', \'multiverseId\': 425395}, \'multiverseid\': 425395}, {\'name\': \'狡黠骗徒\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒语能用你的神器来协助施放。你起动完法术力异能之后每横置一个神器，就能为此咒语支付{1}。）\\n每当一个由你操控且非衍生物的神器从战场进入坟墓场时，派出一个1/1无色自动机衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bf0f91e-4b2e-4cfd-ba2f-d3a64676ab47\', \'multiverseId\': 423923}, \'multiverseid\': 423923}, {\'name\': \'狡黠騙徒\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒語能用你的神器來協助施放。你起動完魔法力異能之後每橫置一個神器，就能為此咒語支付{1}。）\\n每當一個由你操控且非衍生物的神器從戰場進入墳墓場時，派出一個1/1無色自動機衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／神器師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fac6f81-898e-4a8d-9680-f8789bfb4ed0\', \'multiverseId\': 424107}, \'multiverseid\': 424107}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gewandte Zurückweisung\', \'text\': \'Die Gewandte Zurückweisung fügt 3 Schadenspunkte zu, deren Aufteilung auf ein, zwei oder drei angreifende oder blockende Kreaturen deiner Wahl du bestimmst.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wie können die Konsuln so blind sein und trotz des Thopter-Spionagenetzes nicht Tezzerets Manipulationen erkennen?" —Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424236&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f993ba82-18ce-4ad5-b113-5a0517723955\', \'multiverseId\': 424236}, \'multiverseid\': 424236}, {\'name\': \'Rechazo inteligente\', \'text\': \'El Rechazo inteligente hace 3 puntos de daño divididos como elijas entre una, dos o tres criaturas atacantes o bloqueadoras objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Con tantos tópteros espía sueltos, ¿cómo pueden ser los cónsules tan ciegos a las manipulaciones de Tezzeret?". —Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ac61c1b-bb6f-4c86-b5e4-4bf1b35f3f04\', \'multiverseId\': 425524}, \'multiverseid\': 425524}, {\'name\': \'Rejet adroit\', \'text\': \'Le Rejet adroit inflige 3 blessures réparties comme vous le désirez entre une, deux ou trois créatures attaquantes ou bloqueuses ciblées.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Avec tous ces mécanoptères espions, comment les consuls peuvent-ils ne pas être au courant des manigances de Tezzeret ? » —Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424420&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8df50c3-f873-489e-b795-99ff992525cc\', \'multiverseId\': 424420}, \'multiverseid\': 424420}, {\'name\': \'Abile Rimozione\', \'text\': "L\'Abile Rimozione infligge 3 danni divisi a tua scelta tra una, due o tre creature attaccanti o bloccanti bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Con totteri spia ovunque, come fanno i consoli a non vedere le manipolazioni di Tezzeret?" —Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5e1ecd2-a973-44b6-8d5f-65422a566b3f\', \'multiverseId\': 424604}, \'multiverseid\': 424604}, {\'name\': \'巧みな放逐\', \'text\': \'攻撃かブロックしているクリーチャー１体、２体、または３体を対象とする。巧みな放逐はそれらに、３点のダメージをあなたの望むように分割して与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「飛行機械がいたる所で情報収集しているというのに、なぜ領事府はテゼレットに騙されていると気付かないのだ？」 ――ギデオン・ジュラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b001e6f-bcfd-4fb4-a435-4c0d3940131d\', \'multiverseId\': 424788}, \'multiverseid\': 424788}, {\'name\': \'능숙한 해산\', \'text\': \'공격생물이나 방어생물을 최대 세 개까지 목표로 정한다. 능숙한 해산은 그 목표들에게 피해 3점을 당신이 분배한 대로 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"날틀 첩보원이 사방에 이렇게 깔렸는데 영사들은 어찌 테제렛의 계략을 보지 못하는가?" —기디온 주라\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48f9c04e-2d86-4c86-9760-32112567909c\', \'multiverseId\': 424972}, \'multiverseid\': 424972}, {\'name\': \'Dispensa Hábil\', \'text\': \'Dispensa Hábil causa 3 pontos de dano distribuídos à sua escolha entre uma, duas ou três criaturas alvo atacantes ou bloqueadoras.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Com tópteros espiões por toda parte, como os cônsules podem ser tão cegos em relação às manipulações de Tezzeret?" — Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae6d23b4-7c44-4a07-9ea9-20dc24f258d3\', \'multiverseId\': 425156}, \'multiverseid\': 425156}, {\'name\': \'Умелый Отпор\', \'text\': \'Умелый Отпор наносит 3 повреждения, разделенные по вашему выбору между одним, двумя или тремя целевыми атакующими или блокирующими существами.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Как Консульство не замечает махинаций Теззерета? У них же повсюду топтеры-шпионы!» — Гидеон Джура\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5da3ec00-d2d9-481f-aa4a-0b614863a730\', \'multiverseId\': 425340}, \'multiverseid\': 425340}, {\'name\': \'快速打发\', \'text\': \'快速打发对一个，两个或三个目标进行攻击或阻挡的生物造成共3点伤害，你可以任意分配。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「到处都是监视用的振翼机，执政官怎么可能不晓得泰兹瑞在作什么手脚？」 ～基定尤拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f933cd0a-0577-4f35-9d13-0ee013bd6cc8\', \'multiverseId\': 423868}, \'multiverseid\': 423868}, {\'name\': \'快速打發\', \'text\': \'快速打發對一個，兩個或三個目標進行攻擊或阻擋的生物造成共3點傷害，你可以任意分配。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「到處都是監視用的振翼機，執政官怎麼可能不曉得泰茲瑞在作什麼手腳？」 ～基定尤拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f528a48-81ab-4893-8cd3-14590eb6b2c7\', \'multiverseId\': 424052}, \'multiverseid\': 424052}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ghirapur-Fischadler\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': \'Viele Luftschiffkapitäne halten sich Haustiere, die ihre Liebe für den Himmel teilen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424239&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed5e9143-fac4-41ce-a671-9b060f0aa346\', \'multiverseId\': 424239}, \'multiverseid\': 424239}, {\'name\': \'Gavilán de Ghirapur\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'Muchos capitanes de aeronaves tienen mascotas que comparten su amor por los cielos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a8046cc-7101-4730-8546-5c70ad762e0d\', \'multiverseId\': 425527}, \'multiverseid\': 425527}, {\'name\': \'Balbuzard de Ghirapur\', \'text\': \'Vol\', \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau\', \'flavor\': "De nombreux capitaines d\'aéronefs ont des animaux de compagnie qui partagent leur amour des cieux.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424423&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9b01dbe-cce7-48c7-abb6-f1559dfee34f\', \'multiverseId\': 424423}, \'multiverseid\': 424423}, {\'name\': \'Falco Pescatore di Ghirapur\', \'text\': \'Volare\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'Molti capitani di aeronavi possiedono animali che condividono la loro passione per il cielo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b677946-7c59-4cc9-b220-d6922bd7dc04\', \'multiverseId\': 424607}, \'multiverseid\': 424607}, {\'name\': \'ギラプールのミサゴ\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥\', \'flavor\': \'飛行船の船長は空への情熱を分かり合えるペットを飼う者が多い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20096f81-206b-48da-8e63-3547dcbed6e1\', \'multiverseId\': 424791}, \'multiverseid\': 424791}, {\'name\': \'기라푸르 물수리\', \'text\': \'비행\', \'type\': \'생물 — 조류\', \'flavor\': \'많은 함장들이 자신처럼 하늘을 사랑하는 애완동물을 기른다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a0ae3f4-a7b1-4e0c-b2f2-4bea6c2797e8\', \'multiverseId\': 424975}, \'multiverseid\': 424975}, {\'name\': \'Águia-pesqueira de Ghirapur\', \'text\': \'Voar\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'Muitos capitães de aeronaus têm animais de estimação que compartilham seu amor pelo céu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69f2a2d2-a8d2-4719-bd8c-617606b8f25f\', \'multiverseId\': 425159}, \'multiverseid\': 425159}, {\'name\': \'Гирапурская Скопа\', \'text\': \'Полет\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица\', \'flavor\': \'Многие капитаны воздушных кораблей заводят питомцев, разделяющих их любовь к небу.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81873851-8a76-4b40-8abf-88f375c8d74c\', \'multiverseId\': 425343}, \'multiverseid\': 425343}, {\'name\': \'吉拉波鹗\', \'text\': \'飞行\', \'type\': \'生物～鸟\', \'flavor\': \'许多飞船船长身旁，都有同样热爱蓝天的宠物陪伴。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f76a40bd-77de-4ff7-8795-6d1c0ae29c3a\', \'multiverseId\': 423871}, \'multiverseid\': 423871}, {\'name\': \'吉拉波鶚\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'生物～鳥\', \'flavor\': \'許多飛船船長身旁，都有同樣熱愛藍天的寵物陪伴。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3354bcb-905b-4d7b-a7c5-b58074ca4672\', \'multiverseId\': 424055}, \'multiverseid\': 424055}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gießerei-Hornisse\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Gießerei-Hornisse ins Spiel kommt und falls du eine Kreatur mit einer +1/+1-Marke kontrollierst, erhalten Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'Ihr Summen wird leicht verwechselt mit dem Brummen von Thopterflügeln.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424278&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa9e1ee5-14bb-46af-86c1-02f44a4c6781\', \'multiverseId\': 424278}, \'multiverseid\': 424278}, {\'name\': \'Avispa de la fundición\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Avispa de la fundición entre al campo de batalla, si controlas una criatura con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella, las criaturas que controlan tus oponentes obtienen -1/-1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'Su zumbido se confunde fácilmente con el murmullo de las alas de un tóptero.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5bec4ad-0f20-42a2-af1c-bc9659a81da2\', \'multiverseId\': 425566}, \'multiverseid\': 425566}, {\'name\': \'Frelon de la fonderie\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Frelon de la fonderie arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous contrôlez une créature avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle, les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent gagnent -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': "Son bourdonnement se confond facilement avec le vrombissement des ailes d\'un mécanoptère.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424462&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fda3962f-a60d-4779-8c25-b35bcbd2a224\', \'multiverseId\': 424462}, \'multiverseid\': 424462}, {\'name\': \'Calabrone della Fonderia\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Calabrone della Fonderia entra nel campo di battaglia, se controlli una creatura con un segnalino +1/+1, le creature controllate dai tuoi avversari prendono -1/-1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'Il suo ronzio viene facilmente confuso con quello delle ali di un tottero.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfaaa500-395c-41c8-8eb4-81584f51b2d4\', \'multiverseId\': 424646}, \'multiverseid\': 424646}, {\'name\': \'鋳造所のスズメバチ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n鋳造所のスズメバチが戦場に出たとき、あなたが＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているクリーチャーをコントロールしている場合、ターン終了時まで、対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャーは－１/－１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'その羽音は飛行機械の翼とまぎらわしい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24c60ba3-42e9-4098-a057-8a367a6a0dad\', \'multiverseId\': 424830}, \'multiverseid\': 424830}, {\'name\': \'주조소 말벌\', \'text\': \'비행\\n주조소 말벌이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 +1/+1 카운터가 올려진 생물을 조종하고 있다면, 상대가 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 -1/-1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 곤충\', \'flavor\': \'말벌이 윙윙거리는 소리가 마치 날틀의 날개짓 소리와 흡사하다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7461d65d-7680-4568-aa74-c7922611cf70\', \'multiverseId\': 425014}, \'multiverseid\': 425014}, {\'name\': \'Vespa da Fundição\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Vespa da Fundição entra no campo de batalha, se você controla uma criatura com um marcador +1/+1, as criaturas que seus oponentes controlam recebem -1/-1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Inseto\', \'flavor\': \'Seu zumbido é facilmente confundido com o das asas de um tóptero.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e23af24-79c3-4395-be0d-ad64e9f98193\', \'multiverseId\': 425198}, \'multiverseid\': 425198}, {\'name\': \'Шершень из Литейной\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Шершень из Литейной выходит на поле битвы, если вы контролируете существо с жетоном +1/+1 на нем, то существа под контролем ваших оппонентов получают -1/-1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Насекомое\', \'flavor\': \'Его жужжание легко спутать с шумом крыльев топтера.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7e0784a-c0c7-4df3-96d9-b7bde7e30687\', \'multiverseId\': 425382}, \'multiverseid\': 425382}, {\'name\': \'铸造厂黄蜂\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当铸造厂黄蜂进战场时，若你操控其上有+1/+1指示物的生物，则由对手操控的生物得-1/-1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'「它的扇翅嗡音常会被当成是振翼机的扑翼声响。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b95c046a-bc30-4653-bfc7-b5d8c6962cfa\', \'multiverseId\': 423910}, \'multiverseid\': 423910}, {\'name\': \'鑄造廠黃蜂\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當鑄造廠黃蜂進戰場時，若你操控其上有+1/+1指示物的生物，則由對手操控的生物得-1/-1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～昆蟲\', \'flavor\': \'牠的搧翅嗡音常會被當成是振翼機的撲翼聲響。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d11d6125-6f0b-4bdf-beb6-f09c6b3125b1\', \'multiverseId\': 424094}, \'multiverseid\': 424094}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gießerei-Monteur\', \'text\': \'Improvisieren (Deine Artefakte können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Montagearbeiter\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie werden nicht müde, sie beschweren sich nicht und sie stellen keine Fragen. Baut mehr davon." —Ivash, Erfinder des Konsulats\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424370&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e345e773-a2fb-4009-afc4-aba2be7691e7\', \'multiverseId\': 424370}, \'multiverseid\': 424370}, {\'name\': \'Ensamblador de la fundición\', \'text\': \'Improvisar. (Tus artefactos pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada artefacto que gires una vez que termines de activar habilidades de maná paga {1}.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Operario\', \'flavor\': \'"Nunca se cansan, nunca se quejan y nunca preguntan. Construye más". —Ivash, inventor del Consulado\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b3f6a2e-ba6d-4710-8812-f6142158518b\', \'multiverseId\': 425658}, \'multiverseid\': 425658}, {\'name\': \'Assembleur de la fonderie\', \'text\': \'Improvisation (Vos artefacts peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque artefact que vous engagez après avoir activé des capacités de mana paie {1}.)\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : ouvrier spécialisé\', \'flavor\': "« Ils ne se fatiguent jamais, ne se plaignent jamais, et ne posent jamais de questions. Construisez-en d\'autres. » —Ivash, inventeur du Consulat", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424554&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f92de55e-2e7e-43ce-a7e8-1090f03911fd\', \'multiverseId\': 424554}, \'multiverseid\': 424554}, {\'name\': \'Assemblatore della Fonderia\', \'text\': \'Improvvisare (I tuoi artefatti possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni artefatto che TAPpi dopo aver attivato le abilità di mana corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Addetto-al-Montaggio\', \'flavor\': \'"Non si stancano, non si lamentano e non fanno domande. Costruitene ancora." —Ivash, inventore del Consolato\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'471d321d-017f-4c81-b5a2-f422c6f07b11\', \'multiverseId\': 424738}, \'multiverseid\': 424738}, {\'name\': \'鋳造所の組立工\', \'text\': \'即席（あなたのアーティファクトが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。あなたはあなたのアーティファクトをタップして、１個あたり{1}の支払いに代えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 組立作業員\', \'flavor\': \'「疲れを知らず、文句を言わず、質問もしない。もっと増やせ。」 ――領事府の発明者、イヴァーシ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34cf10ca-9c24-4e23-9ad4-6fbb5c147442\', \'multiverseId\': 424922}, \'multiverseid\': 424922}, {\'name\': \'주조소 조립공\', \'text\': \'급조 (당신의 마법물체들은 이 주문을 발동하는 것을 도울 수 있다. 마나 능력을 활성화한 후에 탭하는 각 마법물체는 이 주문의 비용 중 {1}을 지불한다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 조립공\', \'flavor\': \'"그들은 절대 지치거나 불평하거나 질문하지 않아. 더 많이 제작해." —영사관 발명가 이바시\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4eb97b99-41a0-4086-b196-8bcd8a7af468\', \'multiverseId\': 425106}, \'multiverseid\': 425106}, {\'name\': \'Montador da Fundição\', \'text\': \'Improvisar (Seus artefatos podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada artefato que você vira após terminar de ativar habilidades de mana paga por {1}.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Operário de Linha de Montagem\', \'flavor\': \'"Eles jamais se cansam, jamais reclamam e jamais fazem perguntas. Construa mais." — Ivash, inventor do Consulado\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd96a767-0888-436b-8efc-b5bab49485b7\', \'multiverseId\': 425290}, \'multiverseid\': 425290}, {\'name\': \'Сборщик Литейной\', \'text\': \'Импровизация (Ваши артефакты могут помочь разыграть это заклинание. Каждый артефакт, который вы поворачиваете после того, как вы закончили активировать мана-способности, считается оплатой {1}.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Рабочий-Cборщик\', \'flavor\': \'«Они никогда не устают, не жалуются и не задают вопросов. Постройте еще таких». — Иваш, консульский изобретатель\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d87f4682-6a47-44f9-acc9-22a51df46b23\', \'multiverseId\': 425474}, \'multiverseid\': 425474}, {\'name\': \'铸造厂组装工\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒语能用你的神器来协助施放。你起动完法术力异能之后每横置一个神器，就能为此咒语支付{1}。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组装工人\', \'flavor\': \'「它们不会疲倦，不会抱怨，也从不质疑。加大产量。」 ～执政院发明家伊沃什\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d480d9c-85a2-4176-9870-6797a218a3a9\', \'multiverseId\': 424002}, \'multiverseid\': 424002}, {\'name\': \'鑄造廠組裝工\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒語能用你的神器來協助施放。你起動完魔法力異能之後每橫置一個神器，就能為此咒語支付{1}。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物～組裝工人\', \'flavor\': \'「它們不會疲倦，不會抱怨，也從不質疑。加大產量。」 ～執政院發明家伊沃什\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6ae638c-995d-4462-b577-4f12705bb91f\', \'multiverseId\': 424186}, \'multiverseid\': 424186}]', '[{\'name\': \'Glanzband-Abzapferin\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\nImmer wenn die Glanzband-Abzapferin ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, erhältst du {E} (eine Energiemarke).\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments kannst du {E}{E} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, ziehst du eine Karte und verlierst 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424281&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08b18c07-bdd5-43c2-9a23-d172e601a085\', \'multiverseId\': 424281}, \'multiverseid\': 424281}, {\'name\': \'Ladrona mangadestello\', \'text\': \'Amenaza.\\nSiempre que la Ladrona mangadestello entre al campo de batalla o ataque, obtienes {E} (un contador de energía).\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, puedes pagar {E}{E}. Si lo haces, robas una carta y pierdes 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d5d42f4-a647-4279-a56b-43a0f7a1bb6a\', \'multiverseId\': 425569}, \'multiverseid\': 425569}, {\'name\': \'Siphonneuse de la Manche étincelante\', \'text\': \'Menace\\nÀ chaque fois que la Siphonneuse de la Manche étincelante arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, vous gagnez {E} (un marqueur « énergie »).\\nAu début de votre entretien, vous pouvez payer {E}{E}. Si vous faites ainsi, vous piochez une carte et vous perdez 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424465&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9408502-7a99-4f41-bf51-c0a6da67331e\', \'multiverseId\': 424465}, \'multiverseid\': 424465}, {\'name\': \'Convogliatrice Bracciolucente\', \'text\': "Minacciare\\nOgniqualvolta la Convogliatrice Bracciolucente entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, ottieni {E} (un segnalino energia).\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, puoi pagare {E}{E}. Se lo fai, pesca una carta e perdi 1 punto vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b25b75f-3144-4aca-8b40-8a918db4d0b4\', \'multiverseId\': 424649}, \'multiverseid\': 424649}, {\'name\': \'光袖会の収集者\', \'text\': \'威迫\\n光袖会の収集者が戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、あなたは{E}（エネルギー・カウンター１個）を得る。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたは{E}{E}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、あなたはカードを１枚引き、あなたは１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4f211d3-382c-4f09-8d6e-79e2811c21f5\', \'multiverseId\': 424833}, \'multiverseid\': 424833}, {\'name\': \'반짝소매협회 절도범\', \'text\': \'호전적\\n반짝소매협회 절도범이 전장에 들어오거나 공격할 때마다, 당신은 {E}(에너지 카운터 한 개)를 얻는다.\\n당신의 유지단 시작에, 당신은 {E}{E}를 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 당신은 카드 한 장을 뽑고 생명 1점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 도적\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1726c32-2279-4e54-b66b-c4759caf187e\', \'multiverseId\': 425017}, \'multiverseid\': 425017}, {\'name\': \'Sifonadora Braçoluz\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar\\nToda vez que Sifonadora Braçoluz entra no campo de batalha ou ataca, você recebe {E} (um marcador de energia).\\nNo início de sua manutenção, você pode pagar {E}{E}. Se fizer isso, você compra um card e perde 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5cfdc80-a24d-4952-b5bf-f5b6469f1b6e\', \'multiverseId\': 425201}, \'multiverseid\': 425201}, {\'name\': \'Откачивательница Золотой Руки\', \'text\': \'Угроза\\nКаждый раз, когда Откачивательница Золотой Руки выходит на поле битвы или атакует, вы получаете {E} (один жетон энергии).\\nВ начале вашего шага поддержки вы можете заплатить {E}{E}. Если вы это делаете, то берете карту и теряете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Бродяга\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1756a10c-97b4-47b8-b615-674ae8a86d71\', \'multiverseId\': 425385}, \'multiverseid\': 425385}, {\'name\': \'晶袖会汲能客\', \'text\': \'威慑\\n每当晶袖会汲能客进战场或攻击时，你得到{E}（一个能量指示物）。\\n在你的维持开始时，你可以支付{E}{E}。若你如此作，则你抓一张牌且你失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bda19ad8-514c-4c49-8e27-30f491fcdd59\', \'multiverseId\': 423913}, \'multiverseid\': 423913}, {\'name\': \'晶袖會汲能客\', \'text\': \'威懾\\n每當晶袖會汲能客進戰場或攻擊時，你得到{E}（一個能量指示物）。\\n在你的維持開始時，你可以支付{E}{E}。若你如此作，你抽一張牌且你失去1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18ea56f7-4418-4934-b952-1b7175f18853\', \'multiverseId\': 424097}, \'multiverseid\': 424097}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gontis Machenschaften\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du zum ersten Mal in einem Zug Lebenspunkte verlierst, erhältst du {E}. (Du erhältst eine Energiemarke. Schaden verursacht den Verlust von Lebenspunkten.)\\nBezahle {E}{E}, opfere Gontis Machenschaften: Jeder Gegner verliert 3 Lebenspunkte. Du erhältst so viele Lebenspunkte dazu, wie auf diese Weise Lebenspunkte verloren wurden.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich bin überzeugt, dass all unsere Unternehmungen von dieser kleinen Rebellion profitieren können."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424282&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dea57bec-06e5-4e90-87b0-1e63ce8af513\', \'multiverseId\': 424282}, \'multiverseid\': 424282}, {\'name\': \'Maquinaciones de Gonti\', \'text\': \'Siempre que pierdas vidas por primera vez cada turno, obtienes {E}. (Obtienes un contador de energía. El daño causa pérdida de vidas.)\\nPagar {E}{E}, sacrificar las Maquinaciones de Gonti: Cada oponente pierde 3 vidas. Ganas vidas igual a la cantidad de vidas perdidas de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Seguro que todos nuestros proyectos podrán beneficiarse de esta pequeña revolución".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f5749d9-b7e3-4f34-a1d7-c04ed92aa6d5\', \'multiverseId\': 425570}, \'multiverseid\': 425570}, {\'name\': \'Machinations de Gonti\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous perdez des points de vie pour la première fois à chaque tour, vous gagnez {E}. (Vous gagnez un marqueur « énergie ». Les blessures provoquent la perte de points de vie.)\\nPayez {E}{E}, sacrifiez les Machinations de Gonti : Chaque adversaire perd 3 points de vie. Vous gagnez autant de points de vie que ceux perdus de cette manière.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Il ne fait aucun doute que nos affaires peuvent tirer profit de cette petite révolution. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424466&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'916b9d61-93d2-459a-872e-b7dfc09ce810\', \'multiverseId\': 424466}, \'multiverseid\': 424466}, {\'name\': \'Macchinazioni di Gonti\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta perdi punti vita per la prima volta in ogni turno, ottieni {E}. (Ottieni un segnalino energia. Il danno provoca la perdita di punti vita.)\\nPaga {E}{E}, Sacrifica le Macchinazioni di Gonti: Ogni avversario perde 3 punti vita. Guadagni tanti punti vita quanti sono i punti vita persi in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sono certo che questa piccola rivoluzione gioverà ai nostri affari."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f77258b6-3251-43b2-b7fe-51cb6ff363fb\', \'multiverseId\': 424650}, \'multiverseid\': 424650}, {\'name\': \'ゴンティの策謀\', \'text\': \'あなたが各ターン最初にライフを失うたび、あなたは{E}を得る。（あなたはエネルギー・カウンターを１個得る。ダメージはライフを失わせる。）\\n{E}{E}を支払う, ゴンティの策謀を生け贄に捧げる：各対戦相手はそれぞれ３点のライフを失う。あなたはこれにより失われたライフに等しい点数のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「このちょっとした革命が我々の事業に利益をもたらすことを喜ばしく思う。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f3b9700-1992-40c1-ad16-28821484d7e0\', \'multiverseId\': 424834}, \'multiverseid\': 424834}, {\'name\': \'곤티의 술책\', \'text\': \'매 턴 당신이 처음으로 생명점을 잃을 때마다, 당신은 {E}를 얻는다. (당신은 에너지 카운터 한 개를 얻는다. 피해는 생명점을 잃게 한다.)\\n{E}{E}를 지불한다, 곤티의 술책을 희생한다: 각 상대는 생명 3점을 잃는다. 당신은 이렇게 잃은 생명점만큼 생명점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"우리의 모든 사업이 이 작은 혁명으로부터 혜택을 받을 수 있다고 확신하오."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'738f3bb6-56a2-4da8-8dc6-70a35a1a8db4\', \'multiverseId\': 425018}, \'multiverseid\': 425018}, {\'name\': \'Maquinações de Gonti\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você perde pontos de vida pela primeira vez em cada turno, você recebe {E}. (Você recebe um marcador de energia. Dano causa perda de pontos de vida.)\\nPague {E}{E}, Sacrifique Maquinações de Gonti: Cada oponente perde 3 pontos de vida. Você ganha uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual à quantidade de pontos de vida perdida dessa maneira.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Tenho confiança de que todos os nossos empreendimentos podem se beneficiar dessa pequena revolução."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cc12d02-e2fa-4eca-b841-2cbb91952244\', \'multiverseId\': 425202}, \'multiverseid\': 425202}, {\'name\': \'Интриги Гонти\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы теряете жизни первый раз в каждом ходу, вы получаете {E}. (Вы получаете один жетон энергии. Повреждения вызывают потерю жизней.)\\nЗаплатите {E}{E}, пожертвуйте Интриги Гонти: каждый оппонент теряет 3 жизни. Вы получаете столько жизней, сколько их было потеряно таким образом.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Я уверен, что эта небольшая революция пойдет только на пользу всем нашим предприятиям».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26069d15-71a3-410b-adbb-ef645d194756\', \'multiverseId\': 425386}, \'multiverseid\': 425386}, {\'name\': \'贡提的阴谋\', \'text\': \'每当你每回合第一次失去生命时，你得到{E}。（你得到一个能量指示物。伤害会导致失去生命。）\\n支付{E}{E}，牺牲贡提的阴谋：每位对手各失去3点生命。你获得若干生命，其数量等同于以此法失去的生命总和。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「我坚信我们彼此的业务都能从这场小小的革命中获益。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63778b04-c616-4d24-99d0-30562fa55faf\', \'multiverseId\': 423914}, \'multiverseid\': 423914}, {\'name\': \'貢提的陰謀\', \'text\': \'每當你每回合第一次失去生命時，你得到{E}。（你得到一個能量指示物。傷害會導致失去生命）。\\n支付{E}{E}，犧牲貢提的陰謀：每位對手各失去3點生命。你獲得若干生命，其數量等同於以此法失去的生命總和。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「我堅信我們彼此的業務都能從這場小小的革命中獲益。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1edd4f3e-0206-4176-bcdb-07ef5518ea96\', \'multiverseId\': 424098}, \'multiverseid\': 424098}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gontis Ätherherz\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Gontis Ätherherz oder ein anderes Artefakt unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du {E}{E} (zwei Energiemarken).\\nBezahle {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}, schicke Gontis Ätherherz ins Exil: Du erhältst nach diesem Zug einen zusätzlichen Zug.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Ungeachtet der Magie, die Gonti am Leben hält, wird der Fürst der Unterwelt oft als herzlos beschrieben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424371&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'204af979-8716-4251-9282-f70d8c1a1979\', \'multiverseId\': 424371}, \'multiverseid\': 424371}, {\'name\': \'Corazón de éter de Gonti\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Corazón de éter de Gonti u otro artefacto entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, obtienes {E}{E} (dos contadores de energía).\\nPagar {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}, exiliar el Corazón de éter de Gonti: Juega un turno adicional después de este.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': \'A pesar de la magia que mantiene vivo a Gonti, se dice que el señor del crimen "no tiene corazón".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d9f90a6-8fd8-42d5-a397-dd16eb041e52\', \'multiverseId\': 425659}, \'multiverseid\': 425659}, {\'name\': \'Cœur éthérique de Gonti\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que le Cœur éthérique de Gonti ou un autre artefact arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous gagnez {E}{E} (deux marqueurs « énergie »).\\nPayez {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}, exilez le Cœur éthérique de Gonti : Jouez un tour supplémentaire après celui-ci.\', \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': \'Malgré la magie qui maintient Gonti en vie, le baron du crime est souvent décrit comme étant sans cœur.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424555&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e907d9cf-482d-49e3-98c8-0d2dffc787e7\', \'multiverseId\': 424555}, \'multiverseid\': 424555}, {\'name\': "Cuore d\'Etere di Gonti", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta il Cuore d\'Etere di Gonti o un altro artefatto entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, ottieni {E}{E} (due segnalini energia).\\nPaga {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}, Esilia il Cuore d\'Etere di Gonti: Gioca un turno extra dopo questo.", \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': \'Nonostante la magia che permette a Gonti di sopravvivere, il signore del crimine viene spesso descritto come senza cuore.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1628fb6c-4f90-454a-b612-7d096ccfd41f\', \'multiverseId\': 424739}, \'multiverseid\': 424739}, {\'name\': \'ゴンティの霊気心臓\', \'text\': \'ゴンティの霊気心臓か他のアーティファクトが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター２個）を得る。\\n{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}を支払う, ゴンティの霊気心臓を追放する：このターンに続いて追加の１ターンを行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ゴンティを生かし続ける魔法の働きにもかかわらず、この犯罪王は血が通っていないと言われている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ed90694-6ab4-45b0-bb30-2240105f7a1e\', \'multiverseId\': 424923}, \'multiverseid\': 424923}, {\'name\': \'곤티의 에테르 심장\', \'text\': \'곤티의 에테르 심장 또는 다른 마법물체가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신은 {E}{E}(에너지 카운터 두 개)를 얻는다.\\n{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}를 지불한다, 곤티의 에테르 심장을 추방한다: 이번 턴 후에 추가 턴을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'곤티의 생명을 지탱하는 마법에도 불구하고 이 범죄의 군주는 종종 심장이 없는 냉혈한으로 묘사된다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5541088f-0fe3-4600-9bed-6bda55f84e90\', \'multiverseId\': 425107}, \'multiverseid\': 425107}, {\'name\': \'Coração Etérico de Gonti\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Coração Etérico de Gonti ou outro artefato entra no campo de batalha sob o seu controle, você recebe {E}{E} (dois marcadores de energia).\\nPague {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}, Exile Coração Etérico de Gonti: Jogue um turno extra depois deste.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'A despeito da magia que sustenta a vida de Gonti, o senhor do crime é muitas vezes descrito como não tendo coração.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'735ea00f-1751-421f-93fb-ae2ce24fe4ac\', \'multiverseId\': 425291}, \'multiverseid\': 425291}, {\'name\': \'Эфирное Сердце Гонти\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Эфирное Сердце Гонти или другой артефакт выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы получаете {E}{E} (два жетона энергии).\\nЗаплатите {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}, изгоните Эфирное Сердце Гонти: сделайте дополнительный ход после этого.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Несмотря на магию, поддерживающую жизнь Гонти, этого короля преступников часто называют бессердечным.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05ade6fb-12af-41c7-a013-99f2d71ccf72\', \'multiverseId\': 425475}, \'multiverseid\': 425475}, {\'name\': \'贡提的乙太心脏\', \'text\': \'每当贡提的乙太心脏或另一个神器在你的操控下进战场时，你得到{E}{E}（两个能量指示物）。\\n支付{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}，放逐贡提的乙太心脏：于本回合后进行额外的一个回合。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'魔法维系了贡提的生命，这位犯罪头子倒也经常被称作没心没肺。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4e57475-b143-4691-b079-938a77ab7804\', \'multiverseId\': 424003}, \'multiverseid\': 424003}, {\'name\': \'貢提的乙太心臟\', \'text\': \'每當貢提的乙太心臟或另一個神器在你的操控下進戰場時，你得到{E}{E}（兩個能量指示物）。\\n支付{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}，放逐貢提的乙太心臟：於本回合後進行額外的一個回合。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'魔法維繫了貢提的生命，這位犯罪頭子倒也經常被稱作沒心沒肺。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87bff75a-5f74-42b1-bc18-ff3e474691c3\', \'multiverseId\': 424187}, \'multiverseid\': 424187}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grausame Endgültigkeit\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Hellsicht 1. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Bitter schmeckt der Stahl eines Dämons und tief ist der Abgrund, den er aufreißt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424273&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a982957b-2f90-46b8-85cc-124a2d6cee97\', \'multiverseId\': 424273}, \'multiverseid\': 424273}, {\'name\': \'Final cruel\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -2/-2 hasta el final del turno. Adivina 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Amargo es el sabor del acero demoníaco, y profundo el abismo que abre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b17b9399-488f-420b-9a15-ad7d14fc367b\', \'multiverseId\': 425561}, \'multiverseid\': 425561}, {\'name\': \'Fatalité cruelle\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Regard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la mettre au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "La morsure de l\'acier du démon est amère, et l\'abysse qu\'il ouvre est profond.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424457&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'634c00db-d953-49cf-a221-ef1b86ee4489\', \'multiverseId\': 424457}, \'multiverseid\': 424457}, {\'name\': \'Fine Crudele\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende -2/-2 fino alla fine del turno. Profetizza 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere quella carta in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Aspro è il morso dell\'acciaio demoniaco e profondo l\'abisso che apre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2284f018-eca0-43d7-8622-e56bff5126e1\', \'multiverseId\': 424641}, \'multiverseid\': 424641}, {\'name\': \'残酷な決断\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－２/－２の修整を受ける。占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'悪魔の鋼の切れ味は厳しく、それが開く深淵は深い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ae1fc85-136f-4ab4-83cf-083fc51e1009\', \'multiverseId\': 424825}, \'multiverseid\': 424825}, {\'name\': \'잔혹한 마무리\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -2/-2를 받는다. 점술 1을 한다. (당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 한 장을 본다. 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'악마의 칼날에 베이는 것만큼 고통스럽고 심해보다 더 깊은 어둠에 빠진다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e608dd01-d43e-490a-837d-8afb89a975d3\', \'multiverseId\': 425009}, \'multiverseid\': 425009}, {\'name\': \'Finalidade Cruel\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe -2/-2 até o final do turno. Vidência 1. (Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar aquele card no fundo de seu grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Amarga é a picada do aço de um demônio, e profundo o abismo que ela abre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbee0aab-eb18-4054-8053-30841e339a8c\', \'multiverseId\': 425193}, \'multiverseid\': 425193}, {\'name\': \'Жестокая Окончательность\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает -2/-2 до конца хода. Предскажите 1. (Посмотрите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить ту карту в низ вашей библиотеки.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Больно жалит клинок демона, и глубока бездна, что он открывает.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c91e53f3-c4f2-4897-9b74-3252485b75ae\', \'multiverseId\': 425377}, \'multiverseid\': 425377}, {\'name\': \'残酷终局\', \'text\': \'目标生物得-2/-2直到回合结束。占卜1。（检视你牌库顶的牌。你可以将该牌置于你的牌库底。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'恶魔的钢刃滋味苦涩，划开的伤口犹如深渊。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'127863a3-ae2a-4a9d-bd2b-e92574ae2035\', \'multiverseId\': 423905}, \'multiverseid\': 423905}, {\'name\': \'殘酷終局\', \'text\': \'目標生物得-2/-2直到回合結束。占卜1。（檢視你牌庫頂的牌。你可以將該牌置於你的牌庫底。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'惡魔的鋼刃滋味苦澀，劃開的傷口猶如深淵。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7da37e6b-cbd3-41d8-b8d6-54d004f85669\', \'multiverseId\': 424089}, \'multiverseid\': 424089}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gremlinbefall\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert ein Artefakt\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments fügt der Gremlinbefall dem Beherrscher des verzauberten Artefakts 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nWenn das verzauberte Artefakt auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, erzeuge einen 2/2 roten Gremlin-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424302&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ea5c59e-0f86-4845-b822-aecf58e06e81\', \'multiverseId\': 424302}, \'multiverseid\': 424302}, {\'name\': \'Infestación de gremlins\', \'text\': \'Encantar artefacto.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, la Infestación de gremlins hace 2 puntos de daño al controlador del artefacto encantado.\\nCuando el artefacto encantado vaya a un cementerio, crea una ficha de criatura Gremlin roja 2/2.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42069788-456e-41f7-9025-91dfbbd59b8f\', \'multiverseId\': 425590}, \'multiverseid\': 425590}, {\'name\': \'Infestation de gremlins\', \'text\': "Enchanter : artefact\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, l\'Infestation de gremlins inflige 2 blessures au contrôleur de l\'artefact enchanté.\\nQuand l\'artefact enchanté est mis dans un cimetière, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 rouge Gremlin.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424486&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'129a4d9b-4369-415f-b535-8924ceed44ba\', \'multiverseId\': 424486}, \'multiverseid\': 424486}, {\'name\': \'Infestazione di Gremlin\', \'text\': "Incanta artefatto\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, l\'Infestazione di Gremlin infligge 2 danni al controllore dell\'artefatto incantato.\\nQuando l\'artefatto incantato viene messo in un cimitero, crea una pedina creatura Gremlin 2/2 rossa.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d612ee1-73ef-44cb-8bf4-fd21e84bed9c\', \'multiverseId\': 424670}, \'multiverseid\': 424670}, {\'name\': \'グレムリンの侵入\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（アーティファクト）\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、グレムリンの侵入はエンチャントされているアーティファクトのコントローラーに２点のダメージを与える。\\nエンチャントされているアーティファクトが墓地に置かれたとき、赤の２/２のグレムリン・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cc76239-7bbf-4110-9695-36fa3187dbf1\', \'multiverseId\': 424854}, \'multiverseid\': 424854}, {\'name\': \'그렘린의 습격\', \'text\': \'마법물체에 부여\\n당신의 종료단 시작에, 그렘린의 습격은 부여된 마법물체의 조종자에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\\n부여된 마법물체가 무덤에 놓일 때, 2/2 적색 그렘린 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7928d76-c9c5-4155-a06c-12b0f37de77b\', \'multiverseId\': 425038}, \'multiverseid\': 425038}, {\'name\': \'Infestação de Gremlins\', \'text\': \'Encantar artefato\\nNo início de sua etapa final, Infestação de Gremlins causa 2 pontos de dano ao controlador do artefato encantado.\\nQuando o artefato encantado for colocado em um cemitério, crie uma ficha de criatura vermelha 2/2 do tipo Gremlin.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e503d44-1f47-4c5f-a5d3-3ccff9ded4b2\', \'multiverseId\': 425222}, \'multiverseid\': 425222}, {\'name\': \'Нашествие Гремлинов\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать артефакт\\nВ начале вашего заключительного шага Нашествие Гремлинов наносит 2 повреждения игроку, контролирующему зачарованный артефакт.\\nКогда зачарованный артефакт попадает на кладбище, создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 красный Гремлин.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b276e178-169c-4822-9204-88d0d2d6f4fc\', \'multiverseId\': 425406}, \'multiverseid\': 425406}, {\'name\': \'怪灵侵扰\', \'text\': \'结附于神器\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，怪灵侵扰对所结附之神器的操控者造成2点伤害。\\n当所结附的神器置入坟墓场时，派出一个2/2红色怪灵衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a6d5ec9-f107-4ae0-a328-4d1fd9b0355d\', \'multiverseId\': 423934}, \'multiverseid\': 423934}, {\'name\': \'怪靈侵擾\', \'text\': \'結附於神器\\n在你的結束步驟開始時，怪靈侵擾對所結附之神器的操控者造成2點傷害。\\n當所結附的神器置入墳墓場時，派出一個2/2紅色怪靈衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a5ce951-91ad-4251-936a-0b29bd1e5abf\', \'multiverseId\': 424118}, \'multiverseid\': 424118}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grüngürtel-Wüter\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Grüngürtel-Wüter ins Spiel kommt, bezahle {E}{E} (zwei Energiemarken). Falls du das nicht kannst, bringe den Grüngürtel-Wüter auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück und du erhältst {E}.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elefant\', \'flavor\': \'Sabotage muss nicht immer subtil vonstattengehen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424326&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b97cf6e-0252-4825-9f28-1bc3b88457c0\', \'multiverseId\': 424326}, \'multiverseid\': 424326}, {\'name\': \'Devastador de la espesura\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Devastador de la espesura entre al campo de batalla, paga {E}{E} (dos contadores de energía). Si no puedes, regresa el Devastador de la espesura a la mano de su propietario y obtienes {E}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elefante\', \'flavor\': \'El sigilo no es indispensable para el sabotaje.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbef073f-8897-4995-ba02-9155075145a3\', \'multiverseId\': 425614}, \'multiverseid\': 425614}, {\'name\': \'Saccageur de la ceinture de verdure\', \'text\': \'Quand le Saccageur de la ceinture de verdure arrive sur le champ de bataille, payez {E}{E} (deux marqueurs « énergie »). Si vous ne pouvez pas le faire, renvoyez le Saccageur de la ceinture de verdure dans la main de son propriétaire et gagnez {E}.\', \'type\': \'Créature : éléphant\', \'flavor\': "La délicatesse n\'est pas indispensable au sabotage.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424510&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc20b76f-c9ca-4428-adbc-db55c045ece8\', \'multiverseId\': 424510}, \'multiverseid\': 424510}, {\'name\': \'Furioso della Cintura Verde\', \'text\': \'Quando il Furioso della Cintura Verde entra nel campo di battaglia, paga {E}{E} (due segnalini energia). Se non puoi farlo, fai tornare il Furioso della Cintura Verde in mano al suo proprietario e ottieni {E}.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elefante\', \'flavor\': \'Un sabotaggio non richiede necessariamente discrezione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94cda32e-37e2-4111-8b2b-b0d7e9fbdf0d\', \'multiverseId\': 424694}, \'multiverseid\': 424694}, {\'name\': \'緑地帯の暴れ者\', \'text\': \'緑地帯の暴れ者が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター２個）を支払う。それができないなら、緑地帯の暴れ者をオーナーの手札に戻し、あなたは{E}を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 象\', \'flavor\': \'繊細さは妨害工作に必要不可欠というわけではない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a58c1a5-7479-419a-9d4e-e8d582e2df02\', \'multiverseId\': 424878}, \'multiverseid\': 424878}, {\'name\': \'녹지대 난동꾼\', \'text\': \'녹지대 난동꾼이 전장에 들어올 때, {E}{E}(에너지 카운터 두 개)를 지불한다. 지불할 수 없다면, 녹지대 난동꾼을 소유자의 손으로 되돌리고 당신은 {E}를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 코끼리\', \'flavor\': \'섬세함은 파괴의 필수 요소가 아니다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5665dd2-e831-4db9-bbf3-a703844035e5\', \'multiverseId\': 425062}, \'multiverseid\': 425062}, {\'name\': \'Furioso do Cinturão Verde\', \'text\': \'Quando Furioso do Cinturão Verde entrar no campo de batalha, pague {E}{E} (dois marcadores de energia). Se não puder, devolva Furioso do Cinturão Verde para a mão de seu dono e receba {E}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elefante\', \'flavor\': \'A sutileza não faz necessariamente parte da sabotagem.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9445b69-5dfc-4422-82ac-310ebf213682\', \'multiverseId\': 425246}, \'multiverseid\': 425246}, {\'name\': \'Дебошир Зеленого Пояса\', \'text\': \'Когда Дебошир Зеленого Пояса выходит на поле битвы, заплатите {E}{E} (два жетона энергии). Если вы не можете этого сделать, верните Дебошира Зеленого Пояса в руку его владельца, и вы получаете {E}.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Слон\', \'flavor\': \'Скрытность при диверсии нужна не всегда.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37825d1c-4144-45ed-8bb7-455c4670292c\', \'multiverseId\': 425430}, \'multiverseid\': 425430}, {\'name\': \'绿地狂象\', \'text\': \'当绿地狂象进战场时，支付{E}{E}（两个能量指示物）。若你无法如此作，则将绿地狂象移回其拥有者的手上且你得到{E}。\', \'type\': \'生物～象\', \'flavor\': \'破坏从不需遮掩。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3776caf-b779-4ba2-b267-9ce46763707f\', \'multiverseId\': 423958}, \'multiverseid\': 423958}, {\'name\': \'綠地狂象\', \'text\': \'當綠地狂象進戰場時，支付{E}{E}（兩個能量指示物）。若你無法如此作，則將綠地狂象移回其擁有者的手上且你得到{E}。\', \'type\': \'生物～象\', \'flavor\': \'破壞從不需遮掩。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e5150d4-c1ee-4c65-80cf-f772c827bcc3\', \'multiverseId\': 424142}, \'multiverseid\': 424142}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hafenknecht des Händlers\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}, {T}, tappe X ungetappte Artefakte, die du kontrollierst: Schaue dir die obersten X Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Nimm eine davon auf deine Hand und lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'„Was du bauen kannst, können wir bewegen." —Bes Tavani, Bomat-Händler\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424382&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5067bb1-48d9-41b4-b915-f3ace48ee796\', \'multiverseId\': 424382}, \'multiverseid\': 424382}, {\'name\': \'Cargador del mercader\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}, {T}, girar X artefactos enderezados que controlas: Mira las X primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon una de ellas en tu mano y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'"Si puedes construirlo, podemos moverlo". —Bes Tavani, mercader de Bomat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1dae872-8bb4-4369-bc99-809f9602ed0c\', \'multiverseId\': 425670}, \'multiverseid\': 425670}, {\'name\': \'Débardeur du marchand\', \'text\': "{3}{U}, {T}, engagez X artefacts dégagés que vous contrôlez : Regardez les X cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez l\'une d\'elles dans votre main et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': \'« Si vous pouvez le construire, nous pouvons le transporter. » —Bes Tavani, marchand de Bomat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424566&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56b22ab1-4c4a-42a6-9266-8b55a59bd79a\', \'multiverseId\': 424566}, \'multiverseid\': 424566}, {\'name\': \'Portuale del Mercante\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}, {T}, TAPpa X artefatti STAPpati che controlli: Guarda le prime X carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungi una di quelle carte alla tua mano e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'"Se voi potete costruirlo, noi possiamo trasportarlo." —Bes Tavani, mercante di Bomat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424750&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85d13486-d1cf-42e3-b7ea-31f1a39a62d8\', \'multiverseId\': 424750}, \'multiverseid\': 424750}, {\'name\': \'商人の荷運び\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}, {T}, あなたがコントロールするアンタップ状態のアーティファクトＸ個をタップする：あなたのライブラリーの一番上からＸ枚のカードを見る。そのうち１枚をあなたの手札に加え、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'「おたくがそれを作れれば、運ぶのはうちでできますよ。」 ――ボーマットの商人、ベズ・タバーニ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'194df1a0-c59e-4033-b625-4978d2183c64\', \'multiverseId\': 424934}, \'multiverseid\': 424934}, {\'name\': \'상인의 항구 노동자\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}, {T}, 당신이 조종하는 언탭된 마법물체 X개를 탭한다: 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 X장을 본다. 그 중 한 장을 당신의 손으로 가져가고 나머지 카드들은 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 원하는 순서로 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 자동기계\', \'flavor\': \'"당신이 만들면 우리는 옮길 수 있다." —보맷 상인 베스 타바니\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3cb08bf-56ed-4434-a3eb-898822bede21\', \'multiverseId\': 425118}, \'multiverseid\': 425118}, {\'name\': \'Estivador do Mercador\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}, {T}, Vire X artefatos desvirados que você controla: Olhe os X cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque um deles na sua mão e os restantes no fundo do seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se você pode construí-lo, nós podemos transportá-lo." — Bes Tavani, mercador de Bomat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ef5ee74-abc2-4e82-80d9-b740943d73c7\', \'multiverseId\': 425302}, \'multiverseid\': 425302}, {\'name\': \'Подручный Купца\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}, {T}, поверните X неповернутых артефактов под вашим контролем: посмотрите X верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Положите одну из них в вашу руку, а остальные — в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': \'«Если ты это можешь построить, мы это можем передвинуть». — Бехс Тавани, купец из Бомата\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29e8111f-fe06-4467-946c-e3d945cdbc8d\', \'multiverseId\': 425486}, \'multiverseid\': 425486}, {\'name\': \'商用装载械\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}，{T}，横置X个由你操控且未横置的神器：检视你牌库顶的X张牌。将其中一张置于你手上，其余的牌则以任意顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你造得出，我们就搬得动。」 ～博默区商人贝斯特沃尼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'325b336e-9138-46a4-9e1a-87b9933c2831\', \'multiverseId\': 424014}, \'multiverseid\': 424014}, {\'name\': \'商用裝載械\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}，{T}，橫置X個由你操控且未橫置的神器：檢視你牌庫頂的X張牌。將其中一張置於你手上，其餘的牌則以任意順序置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～組構體\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你造得出，我們就搬得動。」 ～博默區商人貝斯特沃尼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88fc45ef-bdb5-4be9-a067-5907fb75725a\', \'multiverseId\': 424198}, \'multiverseid\': 424198}]', "[{'name': 'Hammerfaust-Revolutionärin', 'text': 'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn die Hammerfaust-Revolutionärin ins Spiel kommt oder stirbt, erhält eine bleibende Karte oder ein Spieler deiner Wahl für jede Sorte von Marke, die auf ihr bzw. ihm liegt, eine weitere Marke dieser Sorte.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424334&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3052348c-d73d-4162-9812-ae2c98522146', 'multiverseId': 424334}, 'multiverseid': 424334}, {'name': 'Revolucionaria puñomaza', 'text': 'Arrolla.\\nCuando la Revolucionaria puñomaza entre al campo de batalla o muera, por cada tipo de contador sobre el permanente o jugador objetivo, pon sobre ese permanente o jugador otro contador de ese tipo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Guerrero humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425622&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0022acf1-5b73-4f32-a338-4c298d39db8d', 'multiverseId': 425622}, 'multiverseid': 425622}, {'name': 'Révolutionnaire de Massepoing', 'text': 'Piétinement\\nQuand la Révolutionnaire de Massepoing arrive sur le champ de bataille ou meurt, pour chaque type de marqueur sur le permanent ciblé ou le joueur ciblé, donnez à ce permanent ou à ce joueur un autre marqueur de ce type.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et guerrier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424518&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'caab9f87-5bd4-48ba-8479-0ff27c158c28', 'multiverseId': 424518}, 'multiverseid': 424518}, {'name': 'Rivoluzionaria di Pugnomartello', 'text': 'Travolgere\\nQuando la Rivoluzionaria di Pugnomartello entra nel campo di battaglia o muore, per ogni tipo di segnalino su un permanente o su un giocatore bersaglio, quel permanente o giocatore riceve un altro segnalino di quel tipo.', 'type': 'Creatura — Guerriero Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424702&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c52fac13-e739-4eae-bc8d-0bd9d2a60be1', 'multiverseId': 424702}, 'multiverseid': 424702}, {'name': '襲拳会の革命家', 'text': 'トランプル\\n襲拳会の革命家が戦場に出たか死亡したとき、パーマネント１つかプレイヤー１人を対象とし、それが持つカウンター１種類につきそれぞれその種類のカウンターをもう１個、そのパーマネントの上に置くか、そのプレイヤーに与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424886&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1a307ac4-eed7-4e3c-999e-539a06db73c2', 'multiverseId': 424886}, 'multiverseid': 424886}, {'name': '망치주먹무리 혁명가', 'text': '돌진\\n망치주먹무리 혁명가가 전장에 들어오거나 죽을 때, 지속물 또는 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 목표에 놓여 있는 각 카운터 종류 하나당, 그 목표에게 같은 종류의 카운터 한 개를 추가한다.', 'type': '생물 — 인간 전사', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425070&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dbae0d4b-39fa-4363-b654-2e7c317806b4', 'multiverseId': 425070}, 'multiverseid': 425070}, {'name': 'Revolucionária Punho-de-marreta', 'text': 'Atropelar\\nQuando Revolucionária Punho-de-marreta entrar no campo de batalha ou morrer, para cada tipo de marcador na permanente ou jogador alvo, dê àquela permanente ou jogador outro marcador daquele tipo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425254&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92367163-df62-4f35-91c9-3180cfff6ad7', 'multiverseId': 425254}, 'multiverseid': 425254}, {'name': 'Революционер Молотобойцев', 'text': 'Пробивной удар\\nКогда Революционер Молотобойцев выходит на поле битвы или умирает, дайте целевому перманенту или игроку по одному жетону каждого из уже имеющихся на нем видов жетонов.', 'type': 'Существо — Человек Воин', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425438&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'be2d2671-2cdb-4104-a3be-df6bd0dff3fb', 'multiverseId': 425438}, 'multiverseid': 425438}, {'name': '槌拳会革命家', 'text': '践踏\\n当槌拳会革命家进战场或死去时，选择目标永久物或牌手，对其上每种指示物而言，该永久物或牌手得到另一个同种类的指示物。', 'type': '生物～人类／战士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423966&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02a1a7db-80da-44fd-831a-7cd5fe0ffd18', 'multiverseId': 423966}, 'multiverseid': 423966}, {'name': '槌拳會革命家', 'text': '踐踏\\n當槌拳會革命家進戰場或死去時，選擇目標永久物或玩家，對其上每種指示物而言，該永久物或玩家得到另一個同種類的指示物。', 'type': '生物～人類／戰士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424150&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b3387f7d-4375-402d-ba19-4b4cef36e032', 'multiverseId': 424150}, 'multiverseid': 424150}]", '[{\'name\': \'Heroische Intervention\', \'text\': \'Bleibende Karten, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Fluchsicherheit und Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wo immer ein Stärkerer einem Schwächeren etwas zuleide tun will — ich werde dort sein." —Ajani Goldmähne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424328&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24044ac0-5841-4966-b889-dc41eee838fd\', \'multiverseId\': 424328}, \'multiverseid\': 424328}, {\'name\': \'Intervención heroica\', \'text\': \'Los permanentes que controlas ganan las habilidades de antimaleficio e indestructible hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Siempre que los fuertes intenten dañar a los débiles, se toparán conmigo". —Ajani Melena Dorada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a580862f-dd73-4af5-8b80-df8bbf05ab27\', \'multiverseId\': 425616}, \'multiverseid\': 425616}, {\'name\': \'Intervention héroïque\', \'text\': "Les permanents que vous contrôlez acquièrent la défense talismanique et l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Je me rendrai partout où les forts oppriment les faibles. » —Ajani Crinièredor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424512&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8565466-2233-4ce6-b883-1fa2d0181058\', \'multiverseId\': 424512}, \'multiverseid\': 424512}, {\'name\': \'Intervento Eroico\', \'text\': \'I permanenti che controlli hanno anti-malocchio e indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ovunque i forti opprimano i deboli, io ci sarò." —Ajani Criniera D\\\'Oro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa8160fd-13c7-4484-aa5d-d2afa34dfb39\', \'multiverseId\': 424696}, \'multiverseid\': 424696}, {\'name\': \'英雄的介入\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールするパーマネントは呪禁と破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「強者が弱者を蹂躙するとき、そこに私がいるだろう。」 ――アジャニ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424880&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73dfecf8-0832-40b0-919a-54c1803445e8\', \'multiverseId\': 424880}, \'multiverseid\': 424880}, {\'name\': \'영웅적 개입\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 지속물들은 턴종료까지 방호와 무적을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"강자가 약자를 괴롭히는 곳이라면 어디든 달려가겠다." —아자니 골드메인\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efe6144b-fb41-4412-9c09-ee6b64a8270f\', \'multiverseId\': 425064}, \'multiverseid\': 425064}, {\'name\': \'Intervenção Heroica\', \'text\': \'As permanentes que você controla ganham resistência a magia e indestrutível até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Toda vez que os fortes tentarem ferir os fracos, eu estarei lá." — Ajani Juba D\\\'ouro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'264cfbb0-4326-449d-b755-16381e86d613\', \'multiverseId\': 425248}, \'multiverseid\': 425248}, {\'name\': \'Героическое Вмешательство\', \'text\': \'Перманенты под вашим контролем получают Порчеустойчивость и Неразрушимость до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Я всегда буду там, где сильный угнетает слабого». — Златогривый Аджани\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9b4e7c8-d803-422d-9150-59a57d4efc2f\', \'multiverseId\': 425432}, \'multiverseid\': 425432}, {\'name\': \'英勇干预\', \'text\': \'由你操控的永久物获得辟邪与不灭异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「任何有倚强凌弱的地方，我必现身。」 ～金鬃阿耶尼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b60b629d-15b8-4570-b35b-3e69b0f0dfe1\', \'multiverseId\': 423960}, \'multiverseid\': 423960}, {\'name\': \'英勇干預\', \'text\': \'由你操控的永久物獲得辟邪與不滅異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「任何有倚強凌弱的地方，我必現身。」 ～金鬃阿耶尼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81f33a3f-37e7-4ae1-a34a-debddfefa90f\', \'multiverseId\': 424144}, \'multiverseid\': 424144}]', '[{\'name\': \'Herold der Pein\', \'text\': \'Improvisieren (Deine Artefakte können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)\\nFliegend\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments wirft jeder Gegner eine Karte ab.\\n{1}{B}, opfere ein Artefakt: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424283&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'168e5054-348f-4912-879e-4c6dbfeed822\', \'multiverseId\': 424283}, \'multiverseid\': 424283}, {\'name\': \'Heraldo del padecimiento\', \'text\': \'Improvisar. (Tus artefactos pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada artefacto que gires una vez que termines de activar habilidades de maná paga {1}.)\\nVuela.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, cada oponente descarta una carta.\\n{1}{B}, sacrificar un artefacto: La criatura objetivo obtiene -2/-2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a51070f0-5081-43f5-8bab-7493c3fa841a\', \'multiverseId\': 425571}, \'multiverseid\': 425571}, {\'name\': "Héraut de l\'angoisse", \'text\': "Improvisation (Vos artefacts peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque artefact que vous engagez après avoir activé des capacités de mana paie {1}.)\\nVol\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, chaque adversaire se défausse d\'une carte.\\n{1}{B}, sacrifiez un artefact : La créature ciblée gagne -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424467&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cf2b9b2-ab98-4f74-ac7a-9014f02dc2d4\', \'multiverseId\': 424467}, \'multiverseid\': 424467}, {\'name\': "Araldo dell\'Angoscia", \'text\': "Improvvisare (I tuoi artefatti possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni artefatto che TAPpi dopo aver attivato le abilità di mana corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nVolare\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, ogni avversario scarta una carta.\\n{1}{B}, Sacrifica un artefatto: Una creatura bersaglio prende -2/-2 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78ad5636-086f-4595-9cb5-1a1fe6825cfa\', \'multiverseId\': 424651}, \'multiverseid\': 424651}, {\'name\': \'艱苦の伝令\', \'text\': \'即席（あなたのアーティファクトが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。あなたはあなたのアーティファクトをタップして、１個あたり{1}の支払いに代えてもよい。）\\n飛行\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、各対戦相手はそれぞれカード１枚を捨てる。\\n{1}{B}, アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－２/－２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7e3c433-a9b7-4fde-afc3-ac5de58da50e\', \'multiverseId\': 424835}, \'multiverseid\': 424835}, {\'name\': \'고뇌의 전령\', \'text\': \'급조 (당신의 마법물체들은 이 주문을 발동하는 것을 도울 수 있다. 마나 능력을 활성화한 후에 탭하는 각 마법물체는 이 주문의 비용 중 {1}을 지불한다.)\\n비행\\n당신의 종료단 시작에, 각 상대는 카드 한 장을 버린다.\\n{1}{B}, 마법물체 한 개를 희생한다: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -2/-2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 악마\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'003145f9-7e5e-4af8-a8de-374e618a7ef3\', \'multiverseId\': 425019}, \'multiverseid\': 425019}, {\'name\': \'Arauto da Angústia\', \'text\': \'Improvisar (Seus artefatos podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada artefato que você vira após terminar de ativar habilidades de mana paga por {1}.)\\nVoar\\nNo início de sua etapa final, cada oponente descarta um card.\\n{1}{B}, Sacrifique um artefato: A criatura alvo recebe -2/-2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9e86514-fd87-47a4-afcb-6ce0c0b6df19\', \'multiverseId\': 425203}, \'multiverseid\': 425203}, {\'name\': \'Предвестник Мучений\', \'text\': \'Импровизация (Ваши артефакты могут помочь разыграть это заклинание. Каждый артефакт, который вы поворачиваете после того, как вы закончили активировать мана-способности, считается оплатой {1}.)\\nПолет\\nВ начале вашего заключительного шага каждый оппонент сбрасывает одну карту.\\n{1}{B}, пожертвуйте артефакт: целевое существо получает -2/-2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Демон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70c9dd0b-1e01-4135-9ab9-27462ce3a456\', \'multiverseId\': 425387}, \'multiverseid\': 425387}, {\'name\': \'恸令恶魔\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒语能用你的神器来协助施放。你起动完法术力异能之后每横置一个神器，就能为此咒语支付{1}。）\\n飞行\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，每位对手各弃一张牌。\\n{1}{B}，牺牲一个神器：目标生物得-2/-2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19b154f9-0f39-4762-a77e-d586ec5b6549\', \'multiverseId\': 423915}, \'multiverseid\': 423915}, {\'name\': \'慟令惡魔\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒語能用你的神器來協助施放。你起動完魔法力異能之後每橫置一個神器，就能為此咒語支付{1}。）\\n飛行\\n在你的結束步驟開始時，每位對手各棄一張牌。\\n{1}{B}，犧牲一個神器：目標生物得-2/-2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～惡魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a44a85f-aeba-4e03-9cf3-11cddec5c07a\', \'multiverseId\': 424099}, \'multiverseid\': 424099}]', '[{\'name\': \'Herumtreiberin der Vierten Brücke\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Herumtreiberin der Vierten Brücke ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Kreatur deiner Wahl bis zum Ende des Zuges -1/-1 erhalten lassen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'In den Reihen der Renegaten ist alles vertreten — vom vornehmen Gelehrten bis hin zum Kleinganoven.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424279&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcf490e6-0c10-439d-97e7-4ee023b68e70\', \'multiverseId\': 424279}, \'multiverseid\': 424279}, {\'name\': \'Rondadora del cuarto puente\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Rondadora del cuarto puente entre al campo de batalla, puedes hacer que la criatura objetivo obtenga -1/-1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los renegados abarcan todo tipo de personas, desde sabios eruditos hasta los ladrones más insignificantes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a489a268-7324-4ce6-ba2f-8a777f7d4e8a\', \'multiverseId\': 425567}, \'multiverseid\': 425567}, {\'name\': \'Rôdeuse du quatrième pont\', \'text\': "Quand la Rôdeuse du quatrième pont arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez faire qu\'une créature ciblée gagne -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'Les renégats rassemblent toutes sortes de gens, des nobles sages aux voleurs de bas étage.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424463&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e4ac7a4-6cd9-4a18-afea-b1c40a226d94\', \'multiverseId\': 424463}, \'multiverseid\': 424463}, {\'name\': \'Predatrice del Quarto Ponte\', \'text\': \'Quando la Predatrice del Quarto Ponte entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi far prendere -1/-1 a una creatura bersaglio fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Nelle fila dei rinnegati si trovano tanto nobili saggi quanto piccoli ladruncoli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1d18749-d98c-4a46-9a8a-91535951dd56\', \'multiverseId\': 424647}, \'multiverseid\': 424647}, {\'name\': \'第四橋をうろつく者\', \'text\': \'第四橋をうろつく者が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたは「ターン終了時まで、それは－１/－１の修整を受ける。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'高尚な賢者からケチなこそ泥まで、改革派はどこにでもいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'150ced53-f883-41c9-a4e9-a1d2837da7a8\', \'multiverseId\': 424831}, \'multiverseid\': 424831}, {\'name\': \'4번교 배회자\', \'text\': \'4번교 배회자가 전장에 들어올 때, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 생물이 턴종료까지 -1/-1를 받게 할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 도적\', \'flavor\': \'무법자는 고귀한 현자에서 잡도둑에 이르기까지 출신이 다양하다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5efd29fb-21b0-4cf7-a76c-1b4a60f37571\', \'multiverseId\': 425015}, \'multiverseid\': 425015}, {\'name\': \'Espreitadora da Quarta Ponte\', \'text\': \'Quando Espreitadora da Quarta Ponte entra no campo de batalha, você pode fazer com que a criatura alvo receba -1/-1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'Os renegados reúnem todo tipo de pessoas, desde sábios veneráveis a ladrões baratos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edf3db01-4c12-46bf-bd68-7c935675b056\', \'multiverseId\': 425199}, \'multiverseid\': 425199}, {\'name\': \'Воровка с Четвертого Моста\', \'text\': \'Когда Воровка с Четвертого Моста выходит на поле битвы, вы можете заставить целевое существо получить -1/-1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'Отступники — весьма разношерстная публика. Среди них встречаются и высокомерные мудрецы, и мелкие воришки.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'beac4e71-3671-43d7-99fa-2c6ca09c5441\', \'multiverseId\': 425383}, \'multiverseid\': 425383}, {\'name\': \'四桥游掠者\', \'text\': \'当四桥游掠者进战场时，你可以使目标生物得-1/-1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'从高尚圣贤到市井小偷，乱匠遍布各行各业。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef598691-f108-4a16-b8d5-d76b6e17c0c8\', \'multiverseId\': 423911}, \'multiverseid\': 423911}, {\'name\': \'四橋遊掠者\', \'text\': \'當四橋遊掠者進戰場時，你可以使目標生物得-1/-1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'從高尚聖賢到市井小偷，亂匠遍佈各行各業。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05ae0bc5-a24e-4816-a813-05f73551dd25\', \'multiverseId\': 424095}, \'multiverseid\': 424095}]', '[{\'name\': \'Herz des Kiran\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit\\nBemannen 3 (Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die zusammen Stärke 3 oder mehr haben: Dieses Fahrzeug wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.)\\nDu kannst eine Loyalitätsmarke von einem Planeswalker entfernen, anstatt die Bemannen-Kosten von Herz des Kiran zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424372&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f257e56-63cb-445d-9806-cd11bb5f459f\', \'multiverseId\': 424372}, \'multiverseid\': 424372}, {\'name\': \'Corazón de Kiran\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vigilancia.\\nTripular 3. (Girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controlas con una fuerza total de 3 o más: Este Vehículo se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.)\\nPuedes remover un contador de lealtad de un planeswalker que controlas en vez de pagar el coste de tripular del Corazón de Kiran.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'508152b1-6a04-460b-92e6-7e99516c0bb5\', \'multiverseId\': 425660}, \'multiverseid\': 425660}, {\'name\': \'Cœur de Kiran\', \'text\': "Vol, vigilance\\nPilotage 3 (Engagez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez dont la force totale est supérieure ou égale à 3 : Ce véhicule devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)\\nVous pouvez retirer un marqueur « loyauté » d\'un planeswalker que vous contrôlez à la place de payer le coût de pilotage du Cœur de Kiran.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire : véhicule\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424556&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5478531d-c000-4f2b-9708-823ab80a8b9f\', \'multiverseId\': 424556}, \'multiverseid\': 424556}, {\'name\': \'Cuore di Kiran\', \'text\': \'Volare, cautela\\nManovrare 3 (TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli con forza totale pari o superiore a 3: Questo Veicolo diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.)\\nPuoi rimuovere un segnalino fedeltà da un planeswalker che controlli invece di pagare il costo di manovrare del Cuore di Kiran.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7edafb64-caf4-48fd-a72b-9f9b2bdbdb9b\', \'multiverseId\': 424740}, \'multiverseid\': 424740}, {\'name\': \'キランの真意号\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒\\n搭乗３（あなたがコントロールする望む数のクリーチャーを、パワーの合計が３以上になるように選んでタップする：ターン終了時まで、この機体はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。）\\nあなたはキランの真意号の搭乗コストを支払うのではなく、あなたがコントロールするプレインズウォーカー１体の上から忠誠カウンターを１個取り除いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f938629-1bd0-4dc2-b19e-59ecab149723\', \'multiverseId\': 424924}, \'multiverseid\': 424924}, {\'name\': \'키란의 심장\', \'text\': \'비행, 경계\\n탑승 3 (당신이 조종하는 생물을 공격력 총합이 3 이상이 되도록 원하는 수만큼 탭한다: 이 탑승물은 턴종료까지 마법물체 생물이 된다.)\\n당신은 키란의 심장의 탑승 비용을 지불하는 대신 당신이 조종하는 플레인즈워커에게서 충성 카운터 한 개를 제거할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체 — 탑승물\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9c0b27c-02a3-4fa4-9fa1-c9a0b4b49864\', \'multiverseId\': 425108}, \'multiverseid\': 425108}, {\'name\': \'Coração de Kiran\', \'text\': \'Voar, vigilância\\nTripular 3 (Vire qualquer número de criaturas que você controla com total de poder igual ou superior a 3: Este Veículo se torna uma criatura artefato até o final do turno.)\\nVocê pode remover um marcador de lealdade de um planeswalker que você controla em vez de pagar o custo de tripular de Coração de Kiran.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário — Veículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de8a62c6-f5c5-43b0-88eb-4fc0e6349078\', \'multiverseId\': 425292}, \'multiverseid\': 425292}, {\'name\': \'«Сердце Кирана»\', \'text\': \'Полет, Бдительность\\nЭкипаж 3 (Поверните любое количество существ под вашим контролем с суммарной силой 3 или более: эта Машина становится артефактом существом до конца хода.)\\nВы можете удалить один жетон верности с planeswalker-а под вашим контролем вместо оплаты стоимости Экипажа «Сердца Кирана».\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт — Машина\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d064be6-aa34-4687-a4ce-7670d565d940\', \'multiverseId\': 425476}, \'multiverseid\': 425476}, {\'name\': \'基岚之心号\', \'text\': \'飞行，警戒\\n搭载3（横置任意数量由你操控且力量总和等于或大于3的生物：此载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。）\\n你可以从某个由你操控的鹏洛客上移去一个忠诚指示物，而不支付基岚之心号的搭载费用。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器～载具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aff50bfe-57b3-45cf-8ec1-def3ea374ca9\', \'multiverseId\': 424004}, \'multiverseid\': 424004}, {\'name\': \'基嵐之心號\', \'text\': \'飛行，警戒\\n搭載3（橫置任意數量由你操控且力量總和等於或大於3的生物：此載具成為神器生物直到回合結束。）\\n你可以從某個由你操控的鵬洛客上移去一個忠誠指示物，而不支付基嵐之心號的搭載費用。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器～載具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56c6dc11-61bc-40f6-a189-549980be01df\', \'multiverseId\': 424188}, \'multiverseid\': 424188}]', "[{'name': 'Hinter sich lassen', 'text': 'Bringe eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\\nZiehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Die draufgängerischen Fahrer der Rasenden Krähen standen schon lange mit dem Konsulat im Konflikt und schlossen sich den Renegaten sofort zur offenen Revolte an.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424256&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a4119f59-647a-4fd2-91b6-a9b411d9d97d', 'multiverseId': 424256}, 'multiverseid': 424256}, {'name': 'Ahuecar el ala', 'text': 'Regresa el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra a la mano de su propietario.\\nRoba una carta.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Los temerarios conductores de los Cuervos de Carreras, enemigos del Consulado desde hace tiempo, no tardaron en sumarse a la revuelta abierta de los renegados.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425544&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ff757d10-3cb8-4d4a-a769-ce663ed4a3ab', 'multiverseId': 425544}, 'multiverseid': 425544}, {'name': 'Départ poussiéreux', 'text': 'Renvoyez le permanent non-terrain ciblé dans la main de son propriétaire.\\nPiochez une carte.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Opposés au Consulat depuis des lustres, les pilotes casse-cou des Charognards de la course se sont rapidement joints à la révolte des renégats.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424440&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07ed5d7c-19b7-4398-9c38-64f073ea289b', 'multiverseId': 424440}, 'multiverseid': 424440}, {'name': 'Lasciare nella Polvere', 'text': 'Fai tornare un permanente non terra bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario.\\nPesca una carta.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'I temerari piloti dei Corvi da Gara, da tempo in contrasto con il Consolato, non hanno perso tempo a unirsi alla rivolta dei rinnegati.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424624&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd76f47f6-2802-4702-be61-8e20bdff413d', 'multiverseId': 424624}, 'multiverseid': 424624}, {'name': '置き去り', 'text': '土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\nカードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '競烏会は以前から領事府と折り合いが悪く、紛争が公然のものになるとすぐに無謀な競走者たちが改革派に加わった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424808&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '79471056-fb83-4e35-923d-7d3a1bf0da81', 'multiverseId': 424808}, 'multiverseid': 424808}, {'name': '먼지날리는 탈출', 'text': '대지가 아닌 지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물을 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\\n카드 한 장을 뽑는다.', 'type': '순간마법', 'flavor': '영사관과 오랫동안 불화했던 더비 크로우스의 겁 없는 경주자들은 재빨리 무법자들의 공공연한 봉기에 참가했다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424992&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6a8fd39b-1ed0-4620-8cc8-746c5f2b2514', 'multiverseId': 424992}, 'multiverseid': 424992}, {'name': 'Dar Poeira', 'text': 'Devolva a permanente alvo que não seja um terreno para a mão de seu dono.\\nCompre um card.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Os pilotos destemidos dos Corvos de Corrida, que há muito tinham problemas com o Consulado, foram rápidos para se juntar aos renegados na revolta aberta.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425176&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5107e88f-3de9-452e-9400-21c15743ca43', 'multiverseId': 425176}, 'multiverseid': 425176}, {'name': 'Оставить за Спиной', 'text': 'Верните целевой не являющийся землей перманент в руку его владельца.\\nВозьмите карту.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': 'Гонщики-сорвиголовы из клана Воронов Дерби давно были не в ладах с Консульством. Когда начался бунт, они быстро присоединились к отступникам.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425360&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '36012804-cbdb-40cd-9f94-e0f3380ff73a', 'multiverseId': 425360}, 'multiverseid': 425360}, {'name': '扬尘而去', 'text': '将目标非地永久物移回其拥有者手上。\\n抓一张牌。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '迅鸦会的玩命赛手素与执政院不睦，如今更果断加入乱匠公开叛乱。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423888&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f91cebd5-2219-469b-a0d1-2cc00d22beaf', 'multiverseId': 423888}, 'multiverseid': 423888}, {'name': '揚塵而去', 'text': '將目標非地永久物移回其擁有者手上。\\n抽一張牌。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': '迅鴉會的玩命賽手素與執政院不睦，如今更果斷加入亂匠公開叛亂。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424072&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '59614664-159d-4612-a4e3-f1ef2bd431e2', 'multiverseId': 424072}, 'multiverseid': 424072}]", '[{\'name\': \'Hinterland-Sceada\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDer Hinterland-Sceada kann keine Artefaktkreaturen blocken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sceada\', \'flavor\': \'„Als Kind habe ich davon geträumt, auf einem dieser wilden Sceadas zu fliegen. Sie haben mich dazu inspiriert, mir eigene Flügel zu bauen." —Nadja Wolkenstürmer, Luftschiffkonstrukteurin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424253&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eeb6c111-4255-4b0a-ab99-31351ae20efd\', \'multiverseId\': 424253}, \'multiverseid\': 424253}, {\'name\': \'Draco del interior\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nEl Draco del interior no puede bloquear a criaturas artefacto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Draco\', \'flavor\': \'"De niña soñaba con volar sobre uno de esos dracos salvajes. Me inspiraron a construirme mis propias alas". —Nadja la Rozacúmulos, aerocreadora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69512257-897c-45c6-aa94-8dd6a5b32b24\', \'multiverseId\': 425541}, \'multiverseid\': 425541}, {\'name\': "Drakôn de l\'arrière-pays", \'text\': "Vol\\nLe Drakôn de l\'arrière-pays ne peut pas bloquer les créatures-artefacts.", \'type\': \'Créature : drakôn\', \'flavor\': "« Enfant, je rêvais de chevaucher ces drakôns sauvages. Ils m\'ont donné envie de me construire mes propres ailes. » —Nadja Frôlenuée, aéro-artisane", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424437&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a511dbc1-12e5-4235-af06-e2e3a3e80afa\', \'multiverseId\': 424437}, \'multiverseid\': 424437}, {\'name\': "Draghetto dell\'Entroterra", \'text\': "Volare\\nIl Draghetto dell\'Entroterra non può bloccare creature artefatto.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Draghetto\', \'flavor\': \'"Da piccola, sognavo di volare a cavallo dei draghetti selvatici. Mi hanno ispirato a crearmi delle ali tutte mie." —Nadja Grattanuvole, aerocostruttrice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d24ff82-69df-4f11-957e-d96f86ab0e90\', \'multiverseId\': 424621}, \'multiverseid\': 424621}, {\'name\': \'内陸のドレイク\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n内陸のドレイクではアーティファクト・クリーチャーをブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドレイク\', \'flavor\': \'「子供のころ、野生のドレイクに乗って飛びたいって思ったわ。それで自分用の翼を作ったのよ。」 ――空大工、雲触れのナジャ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea1d6444-d85b-46de-b32e-c0b94fe0b6d5\', \'multiverseId\': 424805}, \'multiverseid\': 424805}, {\'name\': \'내륙 드레이크\', \'text\': \'비행\\n내륙 드레이크는 마법물체 생물을 방어할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 드레이크\', \'flavor\': \'"어릴 때 야생 드레이크를 타고 날아다니는 꿈을 꿨어. 저 드레이크들에게 영감을 받아 나만의 날개를 만들 수 있었지." —비행선 제작자 구름을 만지는 자 나드야\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2acf5254-8e24-4a4e-91e4-85e095da24db\', \'multiverseId\': 424989}, \'multiverseid\': 424989}, {\'name\': \'Dragonete do Interior\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nDragonete do Interior não pode bloquear criaturas artefato.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragonete\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando era criança, eu sonhava em voar nesses dragonetes selvagens. Eles me inspiraram a construir minhas próprias asas." — Nadja Tocanuvens, aeroneira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2113dba-c1bf-4dc8-9e46-bf2c9561afe6\', \'multiverseId\': 425173}, \'multiverseid\': 425173}, {\'name\': \'Дрейк из Глубинки\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nДрейк из Глубинки не может блокировать артефакты существа.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дрейк\', \'flavor\': \'«В детстве я мечтала полетать на этих диких дрейках. Они вдохновили меня собрать собственные крылья». — Наджа Касающаяся Облаков, аэромастер\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47f992ce-d5b6-48e3-85e4-6db5208fab36\', \'multiverseId\': 425357}, \'multiverseid\': 425357}, {\'name\': \'内陆龙兽\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n内陆龙兽不能阻挡神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～龙兽\', \'flavor\': \'「小时候我曾梦想能够驾驭野生龙兽翱翔蓝天。正是它们激发了我要亲手打造翅膀的念头。」 ～煅空匠触云娜杰\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423885&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1e7c429-edb5-4a76-81f9-4da90fad2662\', \'multiverseId\': 423885}, \'multiverseid\': 423885}, {\'name\': \'內陸龍獸\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n內陸龍獸不能阻擋神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～龍獸\', \'flavor\': \'「小時候我曾夢想能駕馭野生龍獸翱翔藍天。正是牠們激發了我要親手打造翅膀的念頭。」 ～煅空匠觸雲娜傑\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42e429c6-58d0-4cdb-9fe1-1ac4ca100032\', \'multiverseId\': 424069}, \'multiverseid\': 424069}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hinterland-Wildschwein\', \'text\': \'Das Hinterland-Wildschwein kann von Kreaturen mit Stärke 2 oder weniger nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wildschwein\', \'flavor\': \'Die pulsierenden Wälder von Peema sind überflutet mit Äther. Die dortig ansässigen Tiere sind stärker, schneller und aggressiver als ihre Artgenossen überall sonst.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424351&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68709f94-a5aa-4387-be03-a9a724843281\', \'multiverseId\': 424351}, \'multiverseid\': 424351}, {\'name\': \'Jabalí de provincia\', \'text\': \'El Jabalí de provincia no puede ser bloqueado por criaturas con fuerza de 2 o menos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Jabalí\', \'flavor\': \'El animado bosque de Peema está repleto de éter. Sus animales son más fuertes, más rápidos y más agresivos que sus homólogos de otros territorios.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dbd6b6e-5b1f-4d78-b217-3c88d90a7ae7\', \'multiverseId\': 425639}, \'multiverseid\': 425639}, {\'name\': "Sanglier de l\'horizon", \'text\': "Le Sanglier de l\'horizon ne peut pas être bloqué par les créatures de force inférieure ou égale à 2.", \'type\': \'Créature : sanglier\', \'flavor\': "La forêt éclatante de Peema regorge d\'Éther. Les animaux qui y vivent sont plus forts, plus rapides et plus agressifs qu\'ailleurs.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424535&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c0e3895-d9b3-4eb2-9623-20f83ef90abc\', \'multiverseId\': 424535}, \'multiverseid\': 424535}, {\'name\': \'Cinghiale delle Zone di Confine\', \'text\': \'Il Cinghiale delle Zone di Confine non può essere bloccato da creature con forza pari o inferiore a 2.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cinghiale\', \'flavor\': \'La lussureggiante foresta di Peema trabocca di etere. I suoi animali sono più forti, veloci e aggressivi delle loro controparti in altri habitat.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83969fd9-aac7-4d40-b71a-565044d6223b\', \'multiverseId\': 424719}, \'multiverseid\': 424719}, {\'name\': \'辺境地の猪\', \'text\': \'辺境地の猪は、パワーが２以下のクリーチャーによってはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猪\', \'flavor\': \'ピーマの鮮烈な森には霊気が満ちている。そこに住む動物は、他所の同種に比べて強く、速く、攻撃的である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'592f9e32-4ac2-4ec4-bf7b-020bfce2294a\', \'multiverseId\': 424903}, \'multiverseid\': 424903}, {\'name\': \'변경지대 멧돼지\', \'text\': \'변경지대 멧돼지는 공격력이 2 이하인 생물에게 방어될 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 멧돼지\', \'flavor\': \'피마의 활기찬 숲은 에테르로 넘쳐난다. 그곳의 생물은 다른 곳의 생물보다 더 강하고 빠르고 공격적이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80519ca9-4d33-499a-ba72-50ddb328fbcc\', \'multiverseId\': 425087}, \'multiverseid\': 425087}, {\'name\': \'Javali Forasteiro\', \'text\': \'Javali Forasteiro não pode ser bloqueado por criaturas de poder igual ou inferior a 2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Javali\', \'flavor\': \'A vibrante floresta de Peema é repleta de éter. Seus animais são mais fortes, mais rápidos e mais agressivos que seus equivalentes de qualquer outro lugar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1a2d2e3-8a02-4c92-a8e3-14eeaaf3c3d6\', \'multiverseId\': 425271}, \'multiverseid\': 425271}, {\'name\': \'Вепрь из Дальнего Леса\', \'text\': \'Вепрь из Дальнего Леса не может быть заблокирован существами с силой 2 или меньше.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вепрь\', \'flavor\': \'Полные жизни леса Пимы щедро омывает эфир. Животные здесь сильнее, быстрее и агрессивнее, чем где-либо.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'293c572b-899d-40ef-aa0b-772b2a36d0d6\', \'multiverseId\': 425455}, \'multiverseid\': 425455}, {\'name\': \'边境野猪\', \'text\': \'边境野猪不能被力量等于或小于2的生物阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物～野猪\', \'flavor\': \'乙太在皮默欣欣向荣的树林中流淌。比起其他地方的动物，这里的动物更强壮、更快速，攻击性更强。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd403230-0ad9-4c3c-adfd-7471075289a2\', \'multiverseId\': 423983}, \'multiverseid\': 423983}, {\'name\': \'邊境野豬\', \'text\': \'邊境野豬不能被力量等於或小於2的生物阻擋。\', \'type\': \'生物～野豬\', \'flavor\': \'乙太在皮默欣欣向榮的樹林中流淌。比起其他地方的動物，這裡的動物更強壯、更快速，攻擊性更強。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8700eea7-a248-4445-bb2e-5318def50789\', \'multiverseId\': 424167}, \'multiverseid\': 424167}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hochturm-Infusion\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +3/+3 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Du erhältst {E}{E} (zwei Energiemarken).\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn wir etwas aus der Erfindermesse gelernt haben, dann sicherlich, dass wir erst beginnen, das wahre Potenzial des Äthers zu begreifen." —Kershan Danil, Hochturm-Kunsthandwerker\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424330&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98b06fd2-10fb-458d-8363-bffc5a7ca116\', \'multiverseId\': 424330}, \'multiverseid\': 424330}, {\'name\': \'Energía de Cumbralta\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +3/+3 hasta el final del turno. Obtienes {E}{E} (dos contadores de energía).\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Como mínimo, la Feria de Inventores nos enseñó que apenas comenzamos a descubrir el verdadero potencial del éter". —Kershan Danil, artesano de Cumbralta\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a1c35cf-2e73-41ca-8217-85e2bd9d142c\', \'multiverseId\': 425618}, \'multiverseid\': 425618}, {\'name\': \'Infusion de hautecime\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +3/+3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Vous gagnez {E}{E} (deux marqueurs « énergie »).", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« La Foire des inventeurs nous aura au moins appris que nous commençons seulement à découvrir le véritable potentiel de l\'Éther. » —Kershan Danil, artisan de hautecime", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424514&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d809b218-d9c0-4914-806a-becd0e6bb219\', \'multiverseId\': 424514}, \'multiverseid\': 424514}, {\'name\': \'Infusione di Altaguglia\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +3/+3 fino alla fine del turno. Ottieni {E}{E} (due segnalini energia).\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se non altro, la Fiera degli Inventori ci ha insegnato che stiamo solo cominciando a scoprire il vero potenziale dell\\\'etere." —Kershan Danil, artigiano di Altaguglia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79b95984-03e3-4f21-9239-a18502808ca6\', \'multiverseId\': 424698}, \'multiverseid\': 424698}, {\'name\': \'高峰の注入\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。あなたは{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター２個）を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「他のことはともかく、私たちが発明博覧会から学んだのは、霊気の本来の力を私たちはまだ知り始めたばかりだということだ。」 ――高峰の職工、ケーシャン・ダニール\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e547edfa-a976-4268-b8a9-77b4bfe89705\', \'multiverseId\': 424882}, \'multiverseid\': 424882}, {\'name\': \'뾰족봉우리 생기주입\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +3/+3을 받는다. 당신은 {E}{E}(에너지 카운터 두 개)를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"발명 박람회는 우리가 에테르의 진정한 잠재력을 발견하기 시작했다는 것을 알려주었다." —뾰족봉우리 장인 케르산 다닐\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f075115-05a4-46bd-bb99-3f591d75db98\', \'multiverseId\': 425066}, \'multiverseid\': 425066}, {\'name\': \'Infusão dos Espigões\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +3/+3 até o final do turno. Você recebe {E}{E} (dois marcadores de energia).\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"No mínimo, a Feira dos Inventores nos ensinou que estamos apenas começando a descobrir o verdadeiro potencial do éter." — Kershan Danil, artesão dos Espigões\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72470d70-38c9-46e3-b786-88c540afe758\', \'multiverseId\': 425250}, \'multiverseid\': 425250}, {\'name\': \'Вливание Высокого Шпиля\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает +3/+3 до конца хода. Вы получаете {E}{E} (два жетона энергии).\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Ярмарка Изобретателей научила нас уже хотя бы тому, что мы лишь начинаем раскрывать истинный потенциал эфира». — Кершан Данил, мастеровой с Высокого Шпиля\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e60d2968-74c8-4cb6-9bc2-e09550aa2eba\', \'multiverseId\': 425434}, \'multiverseid\': 425434}, {\'name\': \'峰顶灌输\', \'text\': \'目标生物得+3/+3直到回合结束。你得到{E}{E}（两个能量指示物）。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「发明家博览会至少让我们明白，我们才刚开始开发乙太真正的潜力。」 ～峰顶工匠凯森德尼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecb351e1-8998-43e6-a205-56d2ea4cd026\', \'multiverseId\': 423962}, \'multiverseid\': 423962}, {\'name\': \'峰頂灌輸\', \'text\': \'目標生物得+3/+3直到回合結束。你得到{E}{E}（兩個能量指示物）。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「發明家博覽會至少讓我們明白，我們才剛開始開發乙太真正的潛力。」 ～峰頂工匠凱森德尼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a194bc5a-692e-4524-a5dd-17bdce805559\', \'multiverseId\': 424146}, \'multiverseid\': 424146}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hoffnung von Ghirapur\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nOpfere die Hoffnung von Ghirapur: Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug kann ein Spieler deiner Wahl, dem die Hoffnung von Ghirapur in diesem Zug Kampfschaden zugefügt hat, keine Nichtkreatur-Zaubersprüche wirken.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Artefaktkreatur — Thopter\', \'flavor\': \'Die Renegaten haben einen Äther-Unterbrecher an Bord eines kleinen Thopters installiert, der Tezzerets Weltenbrücke zerstören soll.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424373&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2e5dfb7-8a04-48cf-a053-ab02c5e41307\', \'multiverseId\': 424373}, \'multiverseid\': 424373}, {\'name\': \'Esperanza de Ghirapur\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSacrificar la Esperanza de Ghirapur: Hasta tu próximo turno, el jugador objetivo que recibió daño de combate de la Esperanza de Ghirapur este turno no puede lanzar hechizos que no sean de criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto legendaria — Tóptero\', \'flavor\': \'Los renegados subieron un disruptor de éter a bordo de un tóptero ligero para destruir el puente entre planos de Tezzeret.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcd00cee-1360-4d65-869f-04a1bb63f8cc\', \'multiverseId\': 425661}, \'multiverseid\': 425661}, {\'name\': \'Espoir de Ghirapur\', \'text\': "Vol\\nSacrifiez l\'Espoir de Ghirapur : Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, le joueur ciblé qui a subi des blessures de combat de l\'Espoir de Ghirapur ce tour-ci ne peut pas lancer de sorts non-créature.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact légendaire : mécanoptère\', \'flavor\': "Les renégats chargèrent un disrupteur d\'Éther à bord d\'un mécanoptère léger afin de détruire le Pont planaire de Tezzeret.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424557&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'766d6fcb-95c9-47e4-aa38-491825f8130d\', \'multiverseId\': 424557}, \'multiverseid\': 424557}, {\'name\': \'Speranza di Ghirapur\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nSacrifica la Speranza di Ghirapur: Fino al tuo prossimo turno, un giocatore bersaglio a cui è stato inflitto danno da combattimento dalla Speranza di Ghirapur in questo turno non può lanciare magie non creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto Leggendaria — Tottero\', \'flavor\': "I rinnegati hanno installato un neutralizzatore d\'etere su un tottero leggero per distruggere il ponte planare di Tezzeret.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aefef973-3662-4fe5-99fb-5239b14ed1be\', \'multiverseId\': 424741}, \'multiverseid\': 424741}, {\'name\': \'ギラプールの希望\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nギラプールの希望を生け贄に捧げる：このターンにギラプールの希望によって戦闘ダメージを与えられたプレイヤー１人を対象とする。あなたの次のターンまで、そのプレイヤーはクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えられない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト・クリーチャー — 飛行機械\', \'flavor\': \'テゼレットの次元橋を破壊するため、改革派は軽量の飛行機械に霊気撹乱機を積み込んだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e800afd-18a3-4908-a7ff-28157e576c30\', \'multiverseId\': 424925}, \'multiverseid\': 424925}, {\'name\': \'기라푸르의 희망\', \'text\': \'비행\\n기라푸르의 희망을 희생한다: 이 턴에 기라푸르의 희망에게 전투피해를 입은 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 당신의 다음 턴까지, 그 플레이어는 생물이 아닌 주문을 발동할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체 생물 — 날틀\', \'flavor\': \'무법자들은 테제렛의 차원의 다리를 파괴하기 위해 경량 날틀 위에 에테르 분열 장치를 탑재했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed0605f8-e6d2-4279-a0f7-9aad07463d96\', \'multiverseId\': 425109}, \'multiverseid\': 425109}, {\'name\': \'Esperança de Ghirapur\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nSacrifique Esperança de Ghirapur: Até seu próximo turno, o jogador alvo que sofreu dano de combate de Esperança de Ghirapur neste turno não pode conjurar mágicas que não sejam de criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato Lendária — Tóptero\', \'flavor\': \'Os renegados montaram um disruptor de éter a bordo de um tóptero leve para destruir a Ponte Planar de Tezzeret.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb7969f4-eb23-44d5-a8c2-6b89f7edcb7c\', \'multiverseId\': 425293}, \'multiverseid\': 425293}, {\'name\': \'Надежда Гирапура\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nПожертвуйте Надежду Гирапура: до вашего следующего хода целевой игрок, которому Надежда Гирапура нанесла боевые повреждения в этом ходу, не может разыгрывать не являющиеся существами заклинания.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт Существо — Топтер\', \'flavor\': \'Ренегаты установили эфирный подавитель на легкий топтер, чтобы уничтожить Межмировой Мост Теззерета.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ad6e1ed-5c8c-458a-b1e1-e59f0ae59a33\', \'multiverseId\': 425477}, \'multiverseid\': 425477}, {\'name\': \'吉拉波之望\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n牺牲吉拉波之望：选择目标牌手，且须是本回合曾受过吉拉波之望战斗伤害者。直到你的下一个回合，该牌手不能施放非生物咒语。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器生物～振翼机\', \'flavor\': \'乱匠在轻型振翼机上搭载了一部乙太干扰器，用来摧毁泰兹瑞的时空渡桥。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbe590dc-7fb5-4976-81d4-30eee4deb10c\', \'multiverseId\': 424005}, \'multiverseid\': 424005}, {\'name\': \'吉拉波之望\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n犧牲吉拉波之望：選擇目標玩家，且須是本回合曾受過吉拉波之望戰鬥傷害者。直到你的下一個回合，該玩家不能施放非生物咒語。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器生物～振翼機\', \'flavor\': \'亂匠在輕型振翼機上搭載了一部乙太干擾器，用來摧毀泰茲瑞的時空渡橋。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2a32621-60f3-4d34-94c2-0250360f0886\', \'multiverseId\': 424189}, \'multiverseid\': 424189}]', "[{'name': 'Hungrige Flammen', 'text': 'Die Hungrigen Flammen fügen einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte und einem Spieler deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Im Frachtraum der Herz des Kiran erwiderte Chandra Dovin Baans Sabotage auf explosive Weise.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424303&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb3c773a-7f1f-4536-ac7f-3ce98fe2155d', 'multiverseId': 424303}, 'multiverseid': 424303}, {'name': 'Llamas hambrientas', 'text': 'Las Llamas hambrientas hacen 3 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo y 2 puntos de daño al jugador objetivo.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'En el centro del Corazón de Kiran, Chandra correspondió al sabotaje de Dovin Baan con una respuesta explosiva.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425591&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3513f603-3245-4087-ac18-eaac95a4828a', 'multiverseId': 425591}, 'multiverseid': 425591}, {'name': 'Flammes voraces', 'text': 'Les Flammes voraces infligent 3 blessures à la créature ciblée et 2 blessures au joueur ciblé.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Dans la cale du Cœur de Kiran, Chandra apporta une réponse explosive au sabotage de Dovin Baàn.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424487&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb4d66ad-44a1-4a9e-b111-3ef877bf05eb', 'multiverseId': 424487}, 'multiverseid': 424487}, {'name': 'Fiamme Fameliche', 'text': 'Le Fiamme Fameliche infliggono 3 danni a una creatura bersaglio e 2 danni a un giocatore bersaglio.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Nella stiva del Cuore di Kiran, Chandra reagì al sabotaggio di Dovin Baan con una replica esplosiva.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424671&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7cde59ec-fabb-4c43-b314-3acf0904e2ff', 'multiverseId': 424671}, 'multiverseid': 424671}, {'name': '飲み込む炎', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体とプレイヤー１人を対象とする。飲み込む炎はその前者に３点のダメージ、その後者に２点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'キランの真意号の船倉で、チャンドラはドビン・バーンの妨害に爆炎で応えた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424855&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f3d641dd-2a87-4b9c-87f2-d0e887e0d3b5', 'multiverseId': 424855}, 'multiverseid': 424855}, {'name': '굶주린 불꽃', 'text': '생물과 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 굶주린 불꽃은 그 생물에 피해 3점을 입히고 그 플레이어에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.', 'type': '순간마법', 'flavor': '키란의 심장의 성채에서 찬드라는 도빈 반의 파괴 행위를 화염 폭발로 응수했다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425039&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e322e33b-7de9-4b2b-8179-1293e720faa9', 'multiverseId': 425039}, 'multiverseid': 425039}, {'name': 'Chamas Famintas', 'text': 'Chamas Famintas causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura alvo e 2 pontos de dano ao jogador alvo.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'No porão do Coração de Kiran, Chandra respondeu à sabotagem de Dovin Baan com uma réplica explosiva.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425223&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c8bdd380-8198-4737-b1ee-c8019bf413aa', 'multiverseId': 425223}, 'multiverseid': 425223}, {'name': 'Голодное Пламя', 'text': 'Голодное Пламя наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу и 2 повреждения целевому игроку.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': 'В трюме «Сердца Кирана» Чандра приготовила взрывной ответ на диверсию Довина Баана.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425407&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '102bd9ef-d38e-40fb-a7a6-e74e4324f853', 'multiverseId': 425407}, 'multiverseid': 425407}, {'name': '贪婪烈焰', 'text': '贪婪烈焰对目标生物造成3点伤害，并对目标牌手造成2点伤害。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '面对在基岚之心号舱内意图下手破坏多温班恩，茜卓还以火爆回击。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423935&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7797d885-c2c6-47fe-ad1a-f89022436eb6', 'multiverseId': 423935}, 'multiverseid': 423935}, {'name': '貪婪烈焰', 'text': '貪婪烈焰對目標生物造成3點傷害，並對目標玩家造成2點傷害。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': '面對在基嵐之心號艙內意圖下手破壞的多溫班恩，茜卓還以火爆回擊。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424119&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '803062e9-8eaa-47e9-8c05-81118698f2a3', 'multiverseId': 424119}, 'multiverseid': 424119}]", '[{\'name\': \'In Gewahrsam nehmen\', \'text\': \'Tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Sie enttappt nicht während des nächsten Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Du kannst mir sagen, was ich wissen möchte, oder mit dem Obersten Regelüberwacher sprechen. Willst du es dir wirklich so schwer machen?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424266&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54553ed4-9866-4b15-ba43-01788245ed22\', \'multiverseId\': 424266}, \'multiverseid\': 424266}, {\'name\': \'Apresar\', \'text\': \'Gira la criatura objetivo. No se endereza durante el próximo paso de enderezar de su controlador.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Puedes decirme lo que quiero saber o hablar con el señor de la sumisión. ¿Por qué no te lo pones fácil?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9122b104-b3fd-4a36-9271-516922edcd4b\', \'multiverseId\': 425554}, \'multiverseid\': 425554}, {\'name\': "Mise en état d\'arrestation", \'text\': \'Engagez la créature ciblée. Elle ne se dégage pas pendant la prochaine étape de dégagement de son contrôleur.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Vous pouvez me dire ce que je veux savoir ou avoir affaire au directeur de conformité. Épargnez-vous ce désagrément. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424450&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40c77cb7-70b4-4418-9115-c22db6de2fce\', \'multiverseId\': 424450}, \'multiverseid\': 424450}, {\'name\': \'Prendere in Custodia\', \'text\': \'TAPpa una creatura bersaglio. Non STAPpa durante il prossimo STAP del suo controllore.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Dimmi ciò che voglio sapere o te la vedrai con il commissario della conformità. Perché non scegli la via più facile?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cde1e438-406b-4043-b8fe-5cc5702412d3\', \'multiverseId\': 424634}, \'multiverseid\': 424634}, {\'name\': \'身柄拘束\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。それは、それのコントローラーの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「俺に白状するか、それとも遵法長のところに行くか。簡単に済ませた方がいいんじゃないか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6de51d49-0f14-457b-9297-04dd6a8e7165\', \'multiverseId\': 424818}, \'multiverseid\': 424818}, {\'name\': \'구금\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 탭되며 조종자의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"내가 알고 싶은 걸 내게 말할지, 아니면 감시 대장에게 말할지 선택해. 이봐, 쉽게 쉽게 가는 게 어때?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d163717-9196-4e49-a583-6deced2128da\', \'multiverseId\': 425002}, \'multiverseid\': 425002}, {\'name\': \'Levar Sob Custódia\', \'text\': \'Vire a criatura alvo. Ela não desvira durante a próxima etapa de desvirar de seu controlador.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Você pode me dizer o que eu preciso saber ou pode falar com o Chefe da Conformidade. Por que não facilita as coisas para você?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d0f6f6f-43d7-4bfe-ba96-8a01b3399eb0\', \'multiverseId\': 425186}, \'multiverseid\': 425186}, {\'name\': \'Взять под Стражу\', \'text\': \'Поверните целевое существо. Оно не разворачивается во время следующего шага разворота контролирующего его игрока.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Можешь рассказать мне, что я тебя спрошу, а можешь поговорить со старшим по повиновению. Советую тебе облегчить свою участь».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ea07463-ea73-41e4-ba5f-ada42a5b2c33\', \'multiverseId\': 425370}, \'multiverseid\': 425370}, {\'name\': \'羁押\', \'text\': \'横置目标生物。它于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「把我想知道的告诉我，不然就去跟监察长谈。你何不让自己好过一点？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78980bbb-468d-461f-a84e-acdc216570d9\', \'multiverseId\': 423898}, \'multiverseid\': 423898}, {\'name\': \'羈押\', \'text\': \'橫置目標生物。它於其操控者的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「把我想知道的告訴我，不然就去跟監察長談。你何不讓自己好過一點？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a332020f-6a5e-496f-9cff-71e478d7375e\', \'multiverseId\': 424082}, \'multiverseid\': 424082}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inspirierende Statuen\', \'text\': \'Nichtartefakt-Zaubersprüche, die du wirkst, haben Improvisieren. (Deine Artefakte können dir helfen, diese Zaubersprüche zu wirken. Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Ghirapurs am meisten gefeierte Erfinder wurden als mechanische Konstrukte verewigt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424379&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c47120c2-24af-4eda-835f-bffc8d9537f9\', \'multiverseId\': 424379}, \'multiverseid\': 424379}, {\'name\': \'Estatuas inspiradoras\', \'text\': \'Los hechizos que no sean de artefacto que lances tienen la habilidad de improvisar. (Tus artefactos pueden ayudar a lanzar esos hechizos. Cada artefacto que gires una vez que termines de activar habilidades de maná paga {1}.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Los inventores más alabados de Ghirapur están inmortalizados en estatuas de engranajes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'738e8a26-a4ff-426f-a87a-e51fb999256b\', \'multiverseId\': 425667}, \'multiverseid\': 425667}, {\'name\': \'Statuaire inspiratrice\', \'text\': "Les sorts non-artefact que vous lancez ont l\'improvisation. (Vos artefacts peuvent aider à lancer ces sorts. Chaque artefact que vous engagez après avoir activé des capacités de mana paie {1}.)", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Les plus illustres inventeurs de Ghirapur ont été immortalisés sous forme mécanique.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424563&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'036ae644-3f15-417e-b65e-c27eb4140623\', \'multiverseId\': 424563}, \'multiverseid\': 424563}, {\'name\': \'Statuaria Ispiratrice\', \'text\': \'Le magie non artefatto che lanci hanno improvvisare. (I tuoi artefatti possono aiutarti a lanciare quelle magie. Ogni artefatto che TAPpi dopo aver attivato le abilità di mana corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'I più celebri inventori di Ghirapur sono stati immortalati in forma meccanica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424747&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83656765-3bbf-44d9-a087-6c561ffc1b0c\', \'multiverseId\': 424747}, \'multiverseid\': 424747}, {\'name\': \'鼓舞する彫像\', \'text\': \'あなたが唱えるアーティファクトでない呪文は即席を持つ。（あなたのアーティファクトが、それらの呪文を唱える助けとなる。あなたはあなたのアーティファクトをタップして、１個あたり{1}の支払いに代えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ギラプール最高の発明者は、機械仕掛けが後世まで讃える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a090caa-dfeb-49a9-a8b0-6263abcb0221\', \'multiverseId\': 424931}, \'multiverseid\': 424931}, {\'name\': \'영감을 주는 조각상\', \'text\': \'당신이 발동하는 마법물체가 아닌 주문들은 급조를 가진다. (당신의 마법물체들은 그 주문들을 발동하는 것을 도울 수 있다. 마나 능력을 활성화한 후에 탭하는 각 마법물체는 그 주문의 비용 중 {1}을 지불한다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'기라푸르에서 가장 유명한 발명가들이 태엽장치 안에서 영원을 얻었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a04c341a-0922-4fed-be3b-cb1fcf7db367\', \'multiverseId\': 425115}, \'multiverseid\': 425115}, {\'name\': \'Estatuária Inspiradora\', \'text\': \'As mágicas que não sejam de artefato que você conjura têm improvisar. (Seus artefatos podem ajudar a conjurar essas mágicas. Cada artefato que você vira após terminar de ativar habilidades de mana paga por {1}.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Os inventores mais célebres de Ghirapur foram imortalizados mecanicamente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d28883f8-0fdb-4247-9b27-bdccfbfa128e\', \'multiverseId\': 425299}, \'multiverseid\': 425299}, {\'name\': \'Вдохновляющее Изваяние\', \'text\': \'Не являющиеся артефактами заклинания, которые вы разыгрываете, имеют Импровизацию. (Ваши артефакты могут помочь разыграть те заклинания. Каждый артефакт, который вы поворачиваете после того, как вы закончили активировать мана-способности, считается оплатой {1}.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Самых знаменитых гирапурских изобретателей увековечивают в механизмах.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'faffac4c-02cb-4e80-bc8d-44dbe68c893b\', \'multiverseId\': 425483}, \'multiverseid\': 425483}, {\'name\': \'启迪塑像\', \'text\': \'你施放的非神器咒语具有拼造异能。（这些咒语能用你的神器来协助施放。你起动完法术力异能之后每横置一个神器，就能为此咒语支付{1}。）\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'金属塑像容貌相似，齿轮运转举止相同：吉拉波各位知名发明家以此得以永生。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e3d3a6c-1108-4447-900e-71aed0d96e35\', \'multiverseId\': 424011}, \'multiverseid\': 424011}, {\'name\': \'啟迪塑像\', \'text\': \'你施放的非神器咒語具有拼造異能。（這些咒語能用你的神器來協助施放。你起動完魔法力異能之後每橫置一個神器，就能為此咒語支付{1}。）\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'金屬塑像容貌相似，齒輪運轉舉止相同；吉拉波各位知名發明家藉此得以永生。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'238ce2c1-4380-4a48-8346-619a410c479c\', \'multiverseId\': 424195}, \'multiverseid\': 424195}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jagd machen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, kämpft gegen eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst. (Jede dieser Kreaturen fügt der anderen Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Zu überleben liegt in der Natur des Stärkeren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424339&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52ba5a62-7da0-4edf-9d61-dd8415202a28\', \'multiverseId\': 424339}, \'multiverseid\': 424339}, {\'name\': \'Cazar la presa\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo que controlas lucha contra la criatura objetivo que no controlas. (Cada una hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a la otra.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La naturaleza de los fuertes es sobrevivir.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a560dbe-1add-4c26-b750-bf1edb29b1b0\', \'multiverseId\': 425627}, \'multiverseid\': 425627}, {\'name\': \'Chasseur chassé\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée que vous contrôlez se bat contre une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas. (Chacune inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à l\'autre.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'La nature des forts est de survivre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424523&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fcd4ea0-5467-4440-b467-ce7d7dd2056b\', \'multiverseId\': 424523}, \'multiverseid\': 424523}, {\'name\': \'Predare\', \'text\': "Una creatura bersaglio che controlli lotta con una creatura bersaglio che non controlli. (Ogni creatura infligge all\'altra danno pari alla propria forza.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Sopravvivere è nella natura dei forti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'325cd17d-74c5-44e3-b451-49c1e87c155f\', \'multiverseId\': 424707}, \'multiverseid\': 424707}, {\'name\': \'捕食\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体と、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者と格闘を行う。（それぞれはもう一方に自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'弱肉強食は自然の定め。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bf62fbc-617c-4fe7-ba48-76d23b812c5c\', \'multiverseId\': 424891}, \'multiverseid\': 424891}, {\'name\': \'약육강식\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물과 당신이 조종하지 않는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 두 생물은 서로 싸운다. (각 생물은 서로에게 각자의 공격력만큼 피해를 입힌다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'이것은 생존을 위한 강자의 본성이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e7cdbaa-000f-42a7-94b2-358bf2edcaea\', \'multiverseId\': 425075}, \'multiverseid\': 425075}, {\'name\': \'Apresar\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo que você controla luta com a criatura alvo que você não controla. (Cada uma causa à outra uma quantidade de dano igual ao seu poder.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'É da natureza dos fortes sobreviver.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f5adc2f-6e99-4193-a3fe-97cb581881ff\', \'multiverseId\': 425259}, \'multiverseid\': 425259}, {\'name\': \'Нападение на Добычу\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо под вашим контролем дерется с целевым существом не под вашим контролем. (Они наносят друг другу повреждения, равные своей силе.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'В природе сильных — выживать.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4fe648d-0a31-4fd4-9399-7144ca2a94a4\', \'multiverseId\': 425443}, \'multiverseid\': 425443}, {\'name\': \'捕食\', \'text\': \'目标由你操控的生物与目标不由你操控的生物互斗。（它们各向对方造成等同于本身力量的伤害。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'强者的天性便是生存。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423971&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3a165a7-a6af-4c3e-8b62-a681ed9a8e44\', \'multiverseId\': 423971}, \'multiverseid\': 423971}, {\'name\': \'捕食\', \'text\': \'目標由你操控的生物與目標不由你操控的生物互鬥。（它們各向對方造成等同於本身力量的傷害。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'強者的天性便是生存。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7df25fc6-8989-4842-af83-1c4b27aca8e3\', \'multiverseId\': 424155}, \'multiverseid\': 424155}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kampf auf der Brücke\', \'text\': \'Improvisieren (Deine Artefakte können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)\\nEine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -X/-X bis zum Ende des Zuges. Du erhältst X Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Das hier ist größer als du. Größer als ihr alle." —Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424272&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32b76597-970a-4ec4-b807-371f896fc258\', \'multiverseId\': 424272}, \'multiverseid\': 424272}, {\'name\': \'Batalla sobre el puente\', \'text\': \'Improvisar. (Tus artefactos pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada artefacto que gires una vez que termines de activar habilidades de maná paga {1}.)\\nLa criatura objetivo obtiene -X/-X hasta el final del turno. Ganas X vidas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Esto es algo mayor que tú. Que todos ustedes". —Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425560&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'669036b5-ced4-4bb2-8ef2-0f983ed9f46c\', \'multiverseId\': 425560}, \'multiverseid\': 425560}, {\'name\': \'Bataille du pont\', \'text\': "Improvisation (Vos artefacts peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque artefact que vous engagez après avoir activé des capacités de mana paie {1}.)\\nLa créature ciblée gagne -X/-X jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Vous gagnez X points de vie.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Cela vous dépasse. Tous autant que vous êtes. » —Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424456&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fec9504-a41b-4cd5-a7a7-d3e319736120\', \'multiverseId\': 424456}, \'multiverseid\': 424456}, {\'name\': \'Battaglia al Ponte\', \'text\': \'Improvvisare (I tuoi artefatti possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni artefatto che TAPpi dopo aver attivato le abilità di mana corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nUna creatura bersaglio prende -X/-X fino alla fine del turno. Guadagni X punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"È qualcosa di più grande di voi. Di tutti voi." —Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f1255e7-c853-4b89-8c92-b213f6df031d\', \'multiverseId\': 424640}, \'multiverseid\': 424640}, {\'name\': \'橋上の戦い\', \'text\': \'即席（あなたのアーティファクトが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。あなたはあなたのアーティファクトをタップして、１個あたり{1}の支払いに代えてもよい。）\\nクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－Ｘ/－Ｘの修整を受ける。あなたはＸ点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「巨大だぞ。お前たち全員を合わせたよりもな。」 ――テゼレット\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7de24e11-aa0e-42bc-aa74-6bdd26509f7c\', \'multiverseId\': 424824}, \'multiverseid\': 424824}, {\'name\': \'교각 전투\', \'text\': \'급조 (당신의 마법물체들은 이 주문을 발동하는 것을 도울 수 있다. 마나 능력을 활성화한 후에 탭하는 각 마법물체는 이 주문의 비용 중 {1}을 지불한다.)\\n생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -X/-X를 받는다. 당신은 생명 X점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"이건 네놈과 네놈들 모두보다도 더 크지." —테제렛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3018697e-8d85-4bf7-9c32-e00860f94f08\', \'multiverseId\': 425008}, \'multiverseid\': 425008}, {\'name\': \'Batalha na Ponte\', \'text\': \'Improvisar (Seus artefatos podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada artefato que você vira após terminar de ativar habilidades de mana paga por {1}.)\\nA criatura alvo recebe -X/-X até o final do turno. Você ganha X pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Isso é maior que vocês. Que todos vocês." — Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf74ec2a-52b7-4da6-bfa9-3c6cf80b8328\', \'multiverseId\': 425192}, \'multiverseid\': 425192}, {\'name\': \'Битва на Мосту\', \'text\': \'Импровизация (Ваши артефакты могут помочь разыграть это заклинание. Каждый артефакт, который вы поворачиваете после того, как вы закончили активировать мана-способности, считается оплатой {1}.)\\nЦелевое существо получает -Х/-Х до конца хода. Вы получаете X жизней.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Вам с этим не совладать. Даже всем вместе». — Теззерет\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfb7ed4f-4934-4ad3-ab5f-4443639589c2\', \'multiverseId\': 425376}, \'multiverseid\': 425376}, {\'name\': \'桥头激战\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒语能用你的神器来协助施放。你起动完法术力异能之后每横置一个神器，就能为此咒语支付{1}。）\\n目标生物得-X/-X直到回合结束。你获得X点生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「你们挡不了，再多的人也挡不了。」 ～泰兹瑞\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4aa25ed-8946-4e96-8127-3ce793f2906e\', \'multiverseId\': 423904}, \'multiverseid\': 423904}, {\'name\': \'橋頭激戰\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒語能用你的神器來協助施放。你起動完魔法力異能之後每橫置一個神器，就能為此咒語支付{1}。）\\n目標生物得-X/-X直到回合結束。你獲得X點生命。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「它比你厲害。比你們全部都厲害。」 ～泰茲瑞\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46752ce0-5e76-43c4-adb2-5c859d767404\', \'multiverseId\': 424088}, \'multiverseid\': 424088}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kari Zev, Freibeuterin der Lüfte\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag, Bedrohlich\\nImmer wenn Kari Zev, Freibeuterin der Lüfte, angreift, erzeuge einen getappten und angreifenden legendären 2/1 roten Affe-Kreaturenspielstein namens Ragavan. Schicke den Spielstein am Ende des Kampfes ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Pirat\', \'flavor\': \'An Bord ihres Schiffes, dem Lächeln des Drachen, folgt Kari nur ihren eigenen Regeln.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424306&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bf3e79e-5905-4aba-b7c1-1207d5af4565\', \'multiverseId\': 424306}, \'multiverseid\': 424306}, {\'name\': \'Kari Zev, pirata de aeronaves\', \'text\': \'Daña primero, amenaza.\\nSiempre que Kari Zev, pirata de aeronaves ataque, crea una ficha de criatura legendaria Primate roja 2/1 llamada Ragavan girada y atacando. Exilia esa ficha al final del combate.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Pirata humano\', \'flavor\': \'A bordo de su nave, la Sonrisa del dragón, Kari solo sigue sus propias reglas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a0ba615-f9cc-4186-9f0f-af34fd5dd875\', \'multiverseId\': 425594}, \'multiverseid\': 425594}, {\'name\': \'Kari Zev, pillarde de vaisseau volant\', \'text\': \'Initiative, menace\\nÀ chaque fois que Kari Zev, pillarde de vaisseau volant attaque, créez, engagé et attaquant, un jeton de créature légendaire 2/1 rouge Singe appelé Ragavan. Exilez ce jeton à la fin du combat.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et pirate\', \'flavor\': "À bord de son navire, le Sourire du dragon, Kari n\'obéit qu\'à ses propres règles.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424490&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03f060cc-a512-48b2-8133-57961ea7926d\', \'multiverseId\': 424490}, \'multiverseid\': 424490}, {\'name\': \'Kari Zev, Predona di Avionavi\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso, minacciare\\nOgniqualvolta Kari Zev, Predona di Avionavi attacca, crea una pedina creatura leggendaria Scimmia 2/1 rossa chiamata Ragavan TAPpata e attaccante. Esilia quella pedina alla fine del combattimento.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Pirata Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Sulla sua nave, la Sorriso del Drago, Kari non segue altre regole che le proprie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'004a6d06-043f-4dc2-ae48-577e6fc7f593\', \'multiverseId\': 424674}, \'multiverseid\': 424674}, {\'name\': \'航空船を強襲する者、カーリ・ゼヴ\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃、威迫\\n航空船を強襲する者、カーリ・ゼヴが攻撃するたび、「ラガバン」という名前の赤の２/１の伝説の猿・クリーチャー・トークンを１体、タップ状態で攻撃している状態で生成する。戦闘終了時に、そのトークンを追放する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・海賊\', \'flavor\': \'自身の船であるドラゴンの笑み号の上では、カーリは自分以外誰の規則にも縛られない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ffee24a-f0c3-44ee-ba00-eb1bb88dd3e2\', \'multiverseId\': 424858}, \'multiverseid\': 424858}, {\'name\': \'비행선 약탈자 카리 제브\', \'text\': \'선제공격, 호전적\\n비행선 약탈자 카리 제브가 공격할 때마다, 탭되고 공격중인 이름이 라가반인 전설적 2/1 적색 원숭이 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다. 전투종료에 그 토큰을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 인간 해적\', \'flavor\': \'자신의 배 위에서 용의 미소 카리는 자기 자신의 규칙만을 따른다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34d00d78-9f72-465e-a640-a9df914685df\', \'multiverseId\': 425042}, \'multiverseid\': 425042}, {\'name\': \'Kari Zev, Incursora das Aeronaus\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa, ameaçar\\nToda vez que Kari Zev, Incursora das Aeronaus, atacar, crie uma ficha de criatura lendária vermelha 2/1 do tipo Macaco com o nome Ragavan, que estará virada e atacando. Exile aquela ficha no final do combate.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Pirata\', \'flavor\': \'A bordo de sua nau, Sorriso do Dragão, Kari segue apenas suas próprias regras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a86a167-cf9b-4e55-b0be-b12beadeb544\', \'multiverseId\': 425226}, \'multiverseid\': 425226}, {\'name\': \'Кари Зев, Небесная Разбойница\', \'text\': \'Первый удар, Угроза\\nКаждый раз, когда Кари Зев, Небесная Разбойница атакует, создайте одну фишку легендарного существа 2/1 красная Мартышка с именем Рагаван повернутой и атакующей. Изгоните ту фишку в конце боя.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Пират\', \'flavor\': \'На своем корабле «Улыбка Дракона» Кари не соблюдает никаких правил, кроме своих собственных.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73d6abe9-d4c2-4af3-8df6-7555be9a8591\', \'multiverseId\': 425410}, \'multiverseid\': 425410}, {\'name\': \'飞船大盗卡丽泽夫\', \'text\': \'先攻，威慑\\n每当飞船大盗卡丽泽夫攻击时，派出一个传奇的2/1红色，名称为勒格文的猴衍生生物，其为横置且正进行攻击。在战斗结束时放逐该衍生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～人类／海盗\', \'flavor\': \'上了龙笑号飞船后，卡丽泽夫就只会遵守自己订下的规矩。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bca9da60-9b95-4a02-a2c8-089f31cd432b\', \'multiverseId\': 423938}, \'multiverseid\': 423938}, {\'name\': \'飛船大盜卡麗澤夫\', \'text\': \'先攻，威懾\\n每當飛船大盜卡麗澤夫攻擊時，派出一個傳奇的2/1紅色，名稱為勒格文的猴衍生生物，其為橫置且正進行攻擊。在戰鬥結束時放逐該衍生物。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物～人類／海盜\', \'flavor\': \'上了龍笑號飛船後，卡麗澤夫就只會遵守自己訂下的規矩。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4c0989e-7bf0-4784-8d6e-6bffff0d1817\', \'multiverseId\': 424122}, \'multiverseid\': 424122}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kari Zevs Expertise\', \'text\': \'Übernimm bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über eine Kreatur oder ein Fahrzeug deiner Wahl. Enttappe jene bleibende Karte. Sie erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nDu kannst eine Karte mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 2 oder weniger aus deiner Hand wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Hierfür wurde ich geboren."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424307&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62773e13-1965-4728-9135-b5c47ada9b65\', \'multiverseId\': 424307}, \'multiverseid\': 424307}, {\'name\': \'Pericia de Kari Zev\', \'text\': \'Gana el control de la criatura o Vehículo objetivo hasta el final del turno. Enderézala. Gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\\nPuedes lanzar una carta de tu mano con coste de maná convertido de 2 o menos sin pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Nací para esto!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'170d2730-af7a-4582-9f44-a6f0fece701b\', \'multiverseId\': 425595}, \'multiverseid\': 425595}, {\'name\': \'Expertise de Kari Zev\', \'text\': "Acquérez le contrôle d\'une créature ciblée ou du véhicule ciblé jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez-le. Il acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nVous pouvez lancer une carte avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 2 depuis votre main sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« J\'étais faite pour cela ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424491&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e6b11e9-6f31-4c46-bb9f-e5b29de30449\', \'multiverseId\': 424491}, \'multiverseid\': 424491}, {\'name\': \'Competenza di Kari Zev\', \'text\': \'Prendi il controllo di una creatura o di un Veicolo bersaglio fino alla fine del turno. STAPpa quel permanente. Ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\\nPuoi lanciare una carta con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 2 dalla tua mano senza pagare il suo costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ce l\\\'ho nel sangue!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82b64bd6-f40e-4c1e-a03f-6215dc3f029e\', \'multiverseId\': 424675}, \'multiverseid\': 424675}, {\'name\': \'カーリ・ゼヴの巧技\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体か機体１つを対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それのコントロールを得る。それをアンタップする。ターン終了時まで、それは速攻を得る。\\nあなたは、あなたの手札から点数で見たマナ・コストが２以下のカード１枚を、そのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「このために生きてるの！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a035128d-5ed3-40ef-93fb-4de5df7767d9\', \'multiverseId\': 424859}, \'multiverseid\': 424859}, {\'name\': \'카리 제브의 전문 지식\', \'text\': \'생물 또는 탑승물을 목표로 정한다. 턴종료까지 그 목표의 조종권을 얻는다. 그 지속물은 언탭되며 턴종료까지 신속을 얻는다.\\n당신은 당신의 손에서 전환마나비용이 2 이하인 카드를 마나 비용을 지불하지 않고 발동할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"이건 내가 제격이지!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52995999-7e77-4017-a3a4-b10e3b199177\', \'multiverseId\': 425043}, \'multiverseid\': 425043}, {\'name\': \'Especialidade de Kari Zev\', \'text\': \'Ganhe o controle da criatura ou Veículo alvo até o final do turno. Desvire-o. Ele ganha ímpeto até o final do turno.\\nVocê pode conjurar um card com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a 2 da sua mão sem pagar seu custo de mana.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Fui feita para isso!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c91fee6f-4d77-460b-90de-7297cd92ef9b\', \'multiverseId\': 425227}, \'multiverseid\': 425227}, {\'name\': \'Мастерство Кари Зев\', \'text\': \'Получите контроль над целевым существом или Машиной до конца хода. Разверните тот перманент. Он получает Ускорение до конца хода.\\nВы можете разыграть карту заклинания с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более 2 из вашей руки без оплаты ее мана-стоимости.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Я просто создана для этого!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52a2b8bc-b12a-410e-a18e-a6b74d6fb4d6\', \'multiverseId\': 425411}, \'multiverseid\': 425411}, {\'name\': \'卡丽泽夫的专才\', \'text\': \'获得目标生物或载具的操控权直到回合结束。将之重置。它获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\\n你可以从你手上施放一张总法术力费用等于或小于2的牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我正是为此而生！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'245e0a02-1c84-4de8-9fcb-dec7b54bbc75\', \'multiverseId\': 423939}, \'multiverseid\': 423939}, {\'name\': \'卡麗澤夫的專才\', \'text\': \'獲得目標生物或載具的操控權直到回合結束。將之重置。它獲得敏捷異能直到回合結束。\\n你可以從你手上施放一張總魔法力費用等於或小於2的牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「我正是為此而生！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'290924bc-3580-497b-89ca-564b1d1fd07d\', \'multiverseId\': 424123}, \'multiverseid\': 424123}]', '[{\'name\': \'Karte der Renegaten\', \'text\': \'Die Karte der Renegaten kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}, opfere die Karte der Renegaten: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir haben Unterschlüpfe in jeder Zone, aber ohne diese Karte wirst du sie nie finden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424392&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2128bd1-7fb6-4442-ac19-88de87be0639\', \'multiverseId\': 424392}, \'multiverseid\': 424392}, {\'name\': \'Mapa de los renegados\', \'text\': \'El Mapa de los renegados entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}, sacrificar el Mapa de los renegados: Busca una carta de tierra básica en tu biblioteca, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Tenemos refugios seguros en todas las zonas, pero nunca encontrarás uno sin esto".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad11e1f4-e358-4191-8bea-39b73c8f7c1f\', \'multiverseId\': 425680}, \'multiverseid\': 425680}, {\'name\': \'Carte des renégats\', \'text\': \'La Carte des renégats arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T}, sacrifiez la Carte des renégats : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Nous possédons des refuges dans toutes les zones, mais vous n\'en trouverez pas un seul sans ça. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424576&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3ba8ea1-37a2-42c5-aa9b-1ebd27194859\', \'multiverseId\': 424576}, \'multiverseid\': 424576}, {\'name\': \'Mappa dei Rinnegati\', \'text\': \'La Mappa dei Rinnegati entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}, Sacrifica la Mappa dei Rinnegati: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Abbiamo dei rifugi in ogni zona, ma non li troverai mai senza questa."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'465106b7-7c12-42da-8333-4b0f1eeeff08\', \'multiverseId\': 424760}, \'multiverseid\': 424760}, {\'name\': \'改革派の地図\', \'text\': \'改革派の地図はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}, 改革派の地図を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「どの地域にも隠れ家があるが、これ無しでは見つけられないさ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1364e39a-f4ee-4d1f-a33a-7fae3f63ea08\', \'multiverseId\': 424944}, \'multiverseid\': 424944}, {\'name\': \'무법자 지도\', \'text\': \'무법자 지도는 탭된 상태로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{T}, 무법자 지도를 희생한다: 당신의 서고에서 기본 대지 카드 한 장을 찾아 공개한 다음 당신의 손으로 가져간다. 그 후 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'"모든 구역에 안전한 아지트가 있다. 하지만 이 지도 없이는 절대 찾지 못한다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d80aa00-dfcf-4735-a806-657f04657f85\', \'multiverseId\': 425128}, \'multiverseid\': 425128}, {\'name\': \'Mapa dos Renegados\', \'text\': \'Mapa dos Renegados entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}, Sacrifique Mapa dos Renegados: Procure um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e, depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Temos refúgios em cada zona, mas você jamais encontrará um sem isso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9422d5ab-2fa9-4a4f-bff2-aff4c8170c46\', \'multiverseId\': 425312}, \'multiverseid\': 425312}, {\'name\': \'Карта Отступников\', \'text\': \'Карта Отступников выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\n{T}, пожертвуйте Карту Отступников: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, покажите ее, положите ее в вашу руку, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«У нас есть убежища в каждом районе, но без этой карты тебе никогда их не найти».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc17a224-6d78-4bc9-a8ed-e14429098863\', \'multiverseId\': 425496}, \'multiverseid\': 425496}, {\'name\': \'乱匠地图\', \'text\': \'乱匠地图须横置进战场。\\n{T}，牺牲乱匠地图：从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「我们在每一区都有安全居所，没这地图的话你一个都找不到。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab9bf206-b3ee-4aad-9008-ada78b399c75\', \'multiverseId\': 424024}, \'multiverseid\': 424024}, {\'name\': \'亂匠地圖\', \'text\': \'亂匠地圖須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}，犧牲亂匠地圖：從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本地牌，展示該牌，將它置於你手上，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「我們在每一區都有安全居所，沒這地圖的話你一個都找不到。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2693a148-6a64-4abb-8253-02aabcbc1d4b\', \'multiverseId\': 424208}, \'multiverseid\': 424208}]', '[{\'name\': \'Klang der Innovation\', \'text\': \'Improvisieren (Deine Artefakte können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)\\nDurchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Artefaktkarte mit umgewandelten Manakosten von X oder weniger, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424268&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45689a1d-9ac1-4092-ba9f-8e3c70df8f14\', \'multiverseId\': 424268}, \'multiverseid\': 424268}, {\'name\': \'Zumbido de la invención\', \'text\': \'Improvisar. (Tus artefactos pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada artefacto que gires una vez que termines de activar habilidades de maná paga {1}.)\\nBusca en tu biblioteca una carta de artefacto con coste de maná convertido de X o menos, ponla en el campo de batalla y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c876e4a9-3b21-422a-b8a4-1233f38891d0\', \'multiverseId\': 425556}, \'multiverseid\': 425556}, {\'name\': "Ronronnement de l\'inventivité", \'text\': "Improvisation (Vos artefacts peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque artefact que vous engagez après avoir activé des capacités de mana paie {1}.)\\nCherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte d\'artefact avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à X, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424452&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01f9a408-6c50-49d7-bef5-aaa8367786e8\', \'multiverseId\': 424452}, \'multiverseid\': 424452}, {\'name\': "Ronzio dell\'Invenzione", \'text\': \'Improvvisare (I tuoi artefatti possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni artefatto che TAPpi dopo aver attivato le abilità di mana corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nPassa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta artefatto con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a X, mettila sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b1078d3-66ae-43b8-ad3f-387396a31222\', \'multiverseId\': 424636}, \'multiverseid\': 424636}, {\'name\': \'発明品の唸り\', \'text\': \'即席（あなたのアーティファクトが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。あなたはあなたのアーティファクトをタップして、１個あたり{1}の支払いに代えてもよい。）\\nあなたのライブラリーから、点数で見たマナ・コストがＸ以下のアーティファクト・カード１枚を探し、それを戦場に出す。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e828ed67-dd3f-4cc3-ad23-6e42c83f3fb2\', \'multiverseId\': 424820}, \'multiverseid\': 424820}, {\'name\': \'발명의 소음\', \'text\': \'급조 (당신의 마법물체들은 이 주문을 발동하는 것을 도울 수 있다. 마나 능력을 활성화한 후에 탭하는 각 마법물체는 이 주문의 비용 중 {1}을 지불한다.)\\n당신의 서고에서 전환마나비용이 X 이하인 마법물체 카드 한 장을 찾아 전장에 놓은 후 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3db5258d-4823-4c3b-9837-ba4dedb0a420\', \'multiverseId\': 425004}, \'multiverseid\': 425004}, {\'name\': \'Zumbido da Invenção\', \'text\': \'Improvisar (Seus artefatos podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada artefato que você vira após terminar de ativar habilidades de mana paga por {1}.)\\nProcure em seu grimório um card de artefato com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a X, coloque-o no campo de batalha e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e757cab4-fd5f-4135-a40d-fd53c5388802\', \'multiverseId\': 425188}, \'multiverseid\': 425188}, {\'name\': \'Гул Изобретений\', \'text\': \'Импровизация (Ваши артефакты могут помочь разыграть это заклинание. Каждый артефакт, который вы поворачиваете после того, как вы закончили активировать мана-способности, считается оплатой {1}.)\\nНайдите в вашей библиотеке карту артефакта с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более Х, положите ее на поле битвы, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72822f8d-9bcb-4584-8c8a-98316887561e\', \'multiverseId\': 425372}, \'multiverseid\': 425372}, {\'name\': \'创发隆响\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒语能用你的神器来协助施放。你起动完法术力异能之后每横置一个神器，就能为此咒语支付{1}。）\\n从你的牌库中搜寻一张总法术力费用等于或小于X的神器牌，将之放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c095cbe-9cf7-4f6e-965d-979d9033a92f\', \'multiverseId\': 423900}, \'multiverseid\': 423900}, {\'name\': \'創發隆響\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒語能用你的神器來協助施放。你起動完魔法力異能之後每橫置一個神器，就能為此咒語支付{1}。）\\n從你的牌庫中搜尋一張總魔法力費用等於或小於X的神器牌，將之放進戰場，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'118faf9d-5515-4200-ad06-911e2554e9bf\', \'multiverseId\': 424084}, \'multiverseid\': 424084}]', '[{\'name\': \'Konsulats-Geschützturm\', \'text\': \'{T}: Du erhältst {E} (eine Energiemarke).\\n{T}, bezahle {E}{E}{E}: Der Konsulats-Geschützturm fügt einem Spieler deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Unsere Wachtürme sind strategisch gut positioniert. Warum statten wir sie nicht mit Geschützen aus?" —Oberster Vollstrecker Ranaj\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424366&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d37bad96-9f98-4960-9400-daffa8e8a7bd\', \'multiverseId\': 424366}, \'multiverseid\': 424366}, {\'name\': \'Torreta del Consulado\', \'text\': \'{T}: Obtienes {E} (un contador de energía).\\n{T}, pagar {E}{E}{E}: La Torreta del Consulado hace 2 puntos de daño al jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Nuestras torretas de vigilancia están bien posicionadas. ¿Por qué no les damos armas?". —Ranaj, brazo ejecutor de la ley\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38bb09d1-1596-4753-bf0f-208b344f1866\', \'multiverseId\': 425654}, \'multiverseid\': 425654}, {\'name\': \'Tourelle du Consulat\', \'text\': \'{T} : Vous gagnez {E} (un marqueur « énergie »).\\n{T}, payez {E}{E}{E} : La Tourelle du Consulat inflige 2 blessures au joueur ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Nos tours de guet sont bien placées. Pourquoi ne pas les armer ? » —Ranaj, argousin en chef\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424550&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbd539ba-353d-42c7-ac83-e6fa02979ded\', \'multiverseId\': 424550}, \'multiverseid\': 424550}, {\'name\': \'Torretta del Consolato\', \'text\': \'{T}: Ottieni {E} (un segnalino energia).\\n{T}, Paga {E}{E}{E}: La Torretta del Consolato infligge 2 danni a un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Le nostre torri di guardia sono in ottime posizioni. Perché non le armiamo?" —Ranaj, esecutore capo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20350272-84af-48ba-9493-03c38c9d7a34\', \'multiverseId\': 424734}, \'multiverseid\': 424734}, {\'name\': \'領事府の砲塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたは{E}（エネルギー・カウンター１個）を得る。\\n{T}, {E}{E}{E}を支払う：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。領事府の砲塔はそのプレイヤーに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「どの監視塔もいい場所にある。なぜ武器を設置しないんだ？」 ――執行官長、ラナージ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'805c4210-7842-42e3-a3ba-ee39a6d7eca2\', \'multiverseId\': 424918}, \'multiverseid\': 424918}, {\'name\': \'영사관 회전포탑\', \'text\': \'{T}: 당신은 {E}(에너지 카운터 한 개)를 얻는다.\\n{T}, {E}{E}{E}를 지불한다: 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 영사관 회전포탑은 그 플레이어에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'"감시탑들이 적절한 위치에 잘 배치됐소. 감시탑에 무기를 장착하는 게 어떻겠소?" —최고 집행자 라나지\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20fd75f3-47b4-400f-9213-28022254dce2\', \'multiverseId\': 425102}, \'multiverseid\': 425102}, {\'name\': \'Torreão do Consulado\', \'text\': \'{T}: Você recebe {E} (um marcador de energia).\\n{T}, Pague {E}{E}{E}: Torreão do Consulado causa 2 pontos de dano ao jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Nossas torres de vigia estão bem-posicionadas. Por que não as armamos?" — Ranaj, Chefe de Policiamento\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5104623c-8a1d-4bd7-a8a7-9a3c1b4ae824\', \'multiverseId\': 425286}, \'multiverseid\': 425286}, {\'name\': \'Турель Консульства\', \'text\': \'{T}: вы получаете {E} (один жетон энергии).\\n{T}, заплатите {E}{E}{E}: Турель Консульства наносит 2 повреждения целевому игроку.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Наши сторожевые башни удачно расположены. Почему бы нам не вооружить их?» — старший блюститель Ранадж\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b49dfb35-6af1-494c-b0ed-a9380efc856e\', \'multiverseId\': 425470}, \'multiverseid\': 425470}, {\'name\': \'执政院炮台\', \'text\': \'{T}：你得到{E}（一个能量指示物）。\\n{T}，支付{E}{E}{E}：执政院炮台对目标牌手造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「我们的守望塔都占据着有利位置。何不将它们武装起来？」 ～执法长拉纳吉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46492fe9-0209-453a-8bc4-9048eece5ad4\', \'multiverseId\': 423998}, \'multiverseid\': 423998}, {\'name\': \'執政院炮台\', \'text\': \'{T}：你得到{E}（一個能量指示物）。\\n{T}，支付{E}{E}{E}：執政院炮台對目標玩家造成2點傷害。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「我們的守望塔都佔據著有利位置。何不將它們武裝起來？」 ～執法長拉納吉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e2a4256-eb34-4af1-a361-7bb6688e3e36\', \'multiverseId\': 424182}, \'multiverseid\': 424182}]', '[{\'name\': \'Konsulats-Schlachtschiff\', \'text\': \'Bemannen 6 (Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die zusammen Stärke 6 oder mehr haben: Dieses Fahrzeug wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist, als hätten sie eine neue Bastion mitten im Hafen errichtet." —Bes Tavani, Bomat-Händler\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424365&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59bfae97-9dcf-4866-9e5c-4e35341b942d\', \'multiverseId\': 424365}, \'multiverseid\': 424365}, {\'name\': \'Acorazado del Consulado\', \'text\': \'Tripular 6. (Girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controlas con una fuerza total de 6 o más: Este Vehículo se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': \'"Es como si hubieran erigido otro Bastión en mitad del puerto". —Bes Tavani, mercader de Bomat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9859f482-6e05-484d-b24f-b3b67b334766\', \'multiverseId\': 425653}, \'multiverseid\': 425653}, {\'name\': \'Cuirassé du Consulat\', \'text\': "Pilotage 6 (Engagez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez dont la force totale est supérieure ou égale à 6 : Ce véhicule devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : véhicule\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est comme s\'ils avaient érigé un nouveau bastion au beau milieu du port. » —Bes Tavani, marchand de Bomat", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424549&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b47e1bc9-86fc-40de-8a14-ddfdc836a659\', \'multiverseId\': 424549}, \'multiverseid\': 424549}, {\'name\': \'Corazzata del Consolato\', \'text\': \'Manovrare 6 (TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli con forza totale pari o superiore a 6: Questo Veicolo diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': \'"È come se avessero piantato un altro Baluardo proprio in mezzo al porto." —Bes Tavani, mercante di Bomat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d4fdb78-09a1-4d4a-88e1-734ed60772b9\', \'multiverseId\': 424733}, \'multiverseid\': 424733}, {\'name\': \'領事府の弩級艦\', \'text\': \'搭乗６（あなたがコントロールする望む数のクリーチャーを、パワーの合計が６以上になるように選んでタップする：ターン終了時まで、この機体はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': \'「まるで港の中央に砦がもう一つできたみたいですよ。」 ――ボーマットの商人、ベズ・タバーニ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15a74e0f-480b-4ef0-aafc-032308c0104f\', \'multiverseId\': 424917}, \'multiverseid\': 424917}, {\'name\': \'영사관 드레드노트\', \'text\': \'탑승 6 (당신이 조종하는 생물을 공격력 총합이 6 이상이 되도록 원하는 수만큼 탭한다: 이 탑승물은 턴종료까지 마법물체 생물이 된다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 탑승물\', \'flavor\': \'"마치 항구 한가운데 다른 요새를 세운 것 같아" —보맷 상인 베스 타바니\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01386845-884c-4b16-9404-8149351dd0d0\', \'multiverseId\': 425101}, \'multiverseid\': 425101}, {\'name\': \'Encouraçado do Consulado\', \'text\': \'Tripular 6 (Vire qualquer número de criaturas que você controla com total de poder igual ou superior a 6: Este Veículo se torna uma criatura artefato até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Veículo\', \'flavor\': \'"É como se eles tivessem plantado outro Bastião bem no meio do porto." — Bes Tavani, mercador de Bomat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44dc84c4-1cbf-47af-b879-bb2bea6b97c7\', \'multiverseId\': 425285}, \'multiverseid\': 425285}, {\'name\': \'Дредноут Консульства\', \'text\': \'Экипаж 6 (Поверните любое количество существ под вашим контролем с суммарной силой 6 или более: эта Машина становится артефактом существом до конца хода.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Машина\', \'flavor\': \'«Они словно воткнули еще один Бастион прямо посредине гавани». — Бехс Тавани, купец из Бомата\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6377f751-eeff-49f4-ba3f-08613c6399bc\', \'multiverseId\': 425469}, \'multiverseid\': 425469}, {\'name\': \'执政院无畏舰\', \'text\': \'搭载6（横置任意数量由你操控且力量总和等于或大于6的生物：此载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'神器～载具\', \'flavor\': \'「就像另一座骁勇堡矗立码头正中一般。」 ～博默区商人贝斯特沃尼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'739051e2-e7b5-40ac-8470-eca0863361fc\', \'multiverseId\': 423997}, \'multiverseid\': 423997}, {\'name\': \'執政院無畏艦\', \'text\': \'搭載6（橫置任意數量由你操控且力量總和等於或大於6的生物：此載具成為神器生物直到回合結束。）\', \'type\': \'神器～載具\', \'flavor\': \'「就像另一座驍勇堡矗立碼頭正中一般。」 ～博默區商人貝斯特沃尼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c0aaec8-49de-4ac6-b9d8-b3354a87dcf5\', \'multiverseId\': 424181}, \'multiverseid\': 424181}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lasst die Gremlins los\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre X Artefakte deiner Wahl. Erzeuge X 2/2 rote Gremlin-Kreaturenspielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Als Erfinder muss man wissen, wie man mit einem Werkzeug etwas Großartiges erschafft — und wie man es zerstört." —Pia Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424315&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0785b538-b505-42d4-8163-5cb90ecff2cf\', \'multiverseId\': 424315}, \'multiverseid\': 424315}, {\'name\': \'Soltar a los gremlins\', \'text\': \'Destruye X artefactos objetivo. Crea X fichas de criatura Gremlin rojas 2/2.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Ser un inventor significa saber usar las herramientas de las que dispones para crear algo fantástico... o para destruirlo". —Pia Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'188d6d98-729c-476d-989d-2ad55c9d3ea6\', \'multiverseId\': 425603}, \'multiverseid\': 425603}, {\'name\': \'Lâcher de gremlins\', \'text\': \'Détruisez X artefacts ciblés. Créez X jetons de créature 2/2 rouge Gremlin.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Être inventeur, c\'est savoir utiliser les outils à sa disposition pour construire, ou détruire, quelque chose de superbe. » —Pia Nalaàr", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424499&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8903534b-7659-4d99-b36c-b15c28458dc7\', \'multiverseId\': 424499}, \'multiverseid\': 424499}, {\'name\': \'Liberare i Gremlin\', \'text\': \'Distruggi X artefatti bersaglio. Crea X pedine creatura Gremlin 2/2 rosse.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Essere un inventore significa sapere come usare gli strumenti a disposizione per costruire qualcosa di grandioso. O per demolirlo." —Pia Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc23f4ca-858a-4504-98b5-d6b2c64fb99d\', \'multiverseId\': 424683}, \'multiverseid\': 424683}, {\'name\': \'グレムリン解放\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトＸ個を対象とし、それらを破壊する。赤の２/２のグレムリン・クリーチャー・トークンをＸ体生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「優れた発明者は、手元にある道具で偉大な物を作り上げる方法を知っている。……台無しにする方法もね。」 ――ピア・ナラー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3974a9d9-fa7f-4e5c-a361-84531586c5cf\', \'multiverseId\': 424867}, \'multiverseid\': 424867}, {\'name\': \'그렘린 방사\', \'text\': \'마법물체 X개를 목표로 정한다. 그 마법물체들을 파괴한다. 2/2 적색 그렘린 생물 토큰 X개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"발명가가 되는 것은 손 안의 도구로 위대한 물건을 만들거나 파괴하는 방법을 배우는 것이다." —피아 날라르\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d89344f-af21-4a92-8ecf-44595abac67e\', \'multiverseId\': 425051}, \'multiverseid\': 425051}, {\'name\': \'Soltar os Gremlins\', \'text\': \'Destrua X artefatos alvo. Crie X fichas de criatura vermelhas 2/2 do tipo Gremlin.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Ser um inventor significa saber quando usar as ferramentas à disposição para fazer alguma coisa incrível — ou para destruí-la." — Pia Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7f60911-a6bb-436b-a16a-09b2f0ca616e\', \'multiverseId\': 425235}, \'multiverseid\': 425235}, {\'name\': \'Выпустить Гремлинов\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте X целевых артефактов. Создайте X фишек существа 2/2 красный Гремлин.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Быть изобретателем — это знать, как использовать имеющиеся в распоряжении инструменты, чтобы создать нечто великое — или разрушить». — Пия Налаар\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68b4677c-76d5-4c5e-92a5-485c90935441\', \'multiverseId\': 425419}, \'multiverseid\': 425419}, {\'name\': \'放出怪灵\', \'text\': \'消灭X个目标神器。派出X个2/2红色怪灵衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「身为发明家，即意味着懂得如何利用手头的工具创造辉煌～或带来毁灭。」 ～琵雅纳拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76bd0e28-1ef3-49c3-8595-aa9de8747122\', \'multiverseId\': 423947}, \'multiverseid\': 423947}, {\'name\': \'放出怪靈\', \'text\': \'消滅X個目標神器。派出X個2/2紅色怪靈衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「身為發明家，即意味著懂得如何利用手頭的工具創造輝煌～或帶來毀滅。」 ～琵雅納拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a446ce34-68a3-4058-996b-7c1c8d29cdf4\', \'multiverseId\': 424131}, \'multiverseid\': 424131}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lathnu-Segelrücken\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eidechse\', \'flavor\': \'Reisende in Lathnu, hoch oben auf den Devraklippen, brauchen sich nicht um die politischen Machtkämpfe in Ghirapur sorgen … Sie haben ganz andere Probleme.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424308&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1254e92-d123-4c4b-8100-9db1f5626cbc\', \'multiverseId\': 424308}, \'multiverseid\': 424308}, {\'name\': \'Dorsovela de Lathnu\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lagarto\', \'flavor\': \'Quienes viajan a Lathnu, en lo alto de las cornisas de Devra, no deben temer las guerras políticas de Ghirapur... aunque tienen otros peligros de los que preocuparse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b596e1b-c7e2-47c4-ad17-f554097ba6a8\', \'multiverseId\': 425596}, \'multiverseid\': 425596}, {\'name\': \'Voiléchine de Lathnu\', \'type\': \'Créature : lézard\', \'flavor\': "Ceux qui voyagent vers Lathnu, sur les hautes falaises de Devra, n\'ont pas à craindre le conflit politique qui secoue Ghirapur... Ils ont d\'autres dangers à redouter.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424492&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fc2a297-a3a5-481e-9bd3-11ad89c09663\', \'multiverseId\': 424492}, \'multiverseid\': 424492}, {\'name\': \'Dorsocrestato di Lathnu\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Lucertola\', \'flavor\': \'Chi è diretto a Lathnu, tra le vette delle Rupi di Devra, non deve temere gli scontri politici di Ghirapur... ma ha altri pericoli da cui guardarsi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e538a463-a548-4520-bcce-d1070b084251\', \'multiverseId\': 424676}, \'multiverseid\': 424676}, {\'name\': \'ラスヌーの帆背びれ\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — トカゲ\', \'flavor\': \'デブラ崖上の高地ラスヌーに向かう旅行者は、ギラプールの政治抗争に巻き込まれる心配はないが、それでも心配するべき危険はある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aca93a89-8c95-4350-8db1-bda67eb2f872\', \'multiverseId\': 424860}, \'multiverseid\': 424860}, {\'name\': \'라스누 돛지느러미\', \'type\': \'생물 — 도마뱀\', \'flavor\': \'데브라 절벽 위에 자리잡은 라스누로 향하는 여행자들은 기라푸르의 정치적 투쟁을 두려워하지 않아도 된다. 대신 다른 위험한 일들을 걱정해야 한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4215e05-77bb-451f-a62d-3bac1a0a93fc\', \'multiverseId\': 425044}, \'multiverseid\': 425044}, {\'name\': \'Dorsoveleiro de Lathnu\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lagarto\', \'flavor\': \'Quem viaja para Lathnu, nas alturas das Colinas de Devra, não precisa temer os conflitos políticos de Ghirapur... mas há outros perigos com os quais se preocupar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64e3bd40-4e5d-4d32-a50a-d27b2d6795ae\', \'multiverseId\': 425228}, \'multiverseid\': 425228}, {\'name\': \'Парусный Ящер из Латну\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ящер\', \'flavor\': \'Путешественникам в Латну, проходящим через утесы Девра, не нужно бояться политических раздоров в Гирапуре... здесь их ждут совсем другие опасности.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a09b82ed-e822-42fa-8681-5a25b0cec503\', \'multiverseId\': 425412}, \'multiverseid\': 425412}, {\'name\': \'勒图帆背蜥\', \'type\': \'生物～蜥蜴\', \'flavor\': \'勒图地处德沃勒崖高处，前往该地的旅行者虽无需担忧吉拉波的政治斗争. . .但他们需要担心其他危险。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4abf3679-95ef-437f-9f0a-b70557d2f85a\', \'multiverseId\': 423940}, \'multiverseid\': 423940}, {\'name\': \'勒圖帆背蜥\', \'type\': \'生物～蜥蜴\', \'flavor\': \'勒圖地處德沃勒崖高處，前往該地的旅行者雖無需擔憂吉拉波的政治鬥爭. . .但他們需要擔心其他危險。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e2ee5f6-0465-44dc-8648-7ba8a4c926e3\', \'multiverseId\': 424124}, \'multiverseid\': 424124}]', '[{\'name\': \'Luftbrücken-Aeronauten\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nRebellion — Wenn die Luftbrücken-Aeronauten ins Spiel kommen und falls in diesem Zug eine bleibende Karte unter deiner Kontrolle das Spiel verlassen hat, erhältst du 5 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zwerg, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'„Vorräte im Anflug. Ihr müsst weiterhin Druck ausüben."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424224&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29fa9bbc-f62b-4e49-8115-ba4fa95d3795\', \'multiverseId\': 424224}, \'multiverseid\': 424224}, {\'name\': \'Aeronautas paracaidistas\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nRevuelta — Cuando los Aeronautas paracaidistas entren al campo de batalla, si un permanente que controlabas dejó el campo de batalla este turno, ganas 5 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Enano explorador\', \'flavor\': \'"Ya llegan los suministros. Mantengan la posición".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0aaafcca-747c-467f-a129-0cecdee625a5\', \'multiverseId\': 425512}, \'multiverseid\': 425512}, {\'name\': \'Aéronautes de largage\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nRévolte — Quand les Aéronautes de largage arrivent sur le champ de bataille, si un permanent que vous contrôliez a quitté le champ de bataille ce tour-ci, vous gagnez 5 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : nain et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': \'« Ravitaillement en approche. Maintenez la pression. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424408&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2a65e69-41ea-4835-b9ac-b3e024344a3b\', \'multiverseId\': 424408}, \'multiverseid\': 424408}, {\'name\': \'Aeronauti Aviolanciati\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nRivolta — Quando gli Aeronauti Aviolanciati entrano nel campo di battaglia, se un permanente che controllavi ha lasciato il campo di battaglia in questo turno, guadagni 5 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Nano\', \'flavor\': \'"Rifornimenti in arrivo. Continuate così."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30a628da-5405-4fd0-bbfe-be04a9ea6176\', \'multiverseId\': 424592}, \'multiverseid\': 424592}, {\'name\': \'急降下飛空士\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n紛争 ― 急降下飛空士が戦場に出たとき、このターンにあなたがコントロールするパーマネントが戦場を離れていた場合、あなたは５点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドワーフ・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'「補給到着。圧力を継続せよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'372356f8-0305-4eff-a1d8-d96e8fba18ab\', \'multiverseId\': 424776}, \'multiverseid\': 424776}, {\'name\': \'강습 비행병\', \'text\': \'비행\\n봉기 — 강습 비행병이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종한 지속물이 이 턴에 전장을 떠났다면, 당신은 생명 5점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 드워프 정찰병\', \'flavor\': \'"지원 물자다. 계속해서 분발하라구."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e486cffc-287e-4e0f-be2f-ba9b01bb62af\', \'multiverseId\': 424960}, \'multiverseid\': 424960}, {\'name\': \'Aeronautas de Entrega\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nRevolta — Quando Aeronautas de Entrega entra no campo de batalha, se uma permanente que você controlava deixou o campo de batalha neste turno, você ganha 5 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anão Batedor\', \'flavor\': \'"Suprimentos a caminho. Mantenham a pressão."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51f1c252-c0a6-4196-8da5-9d87aa62cfc1\', \'multiverseId\': 425144}, \'multiverseid\': 425144}, {\'name\': \'Транспортные Аэронавты\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nБунт — Когда Транспортные Аэронавты выходят на поле битвы, если находившийся под вашим контролем перманент покинул поле битвы в этом ходу, вы получаете 5 жизней.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гном Разведчик\', \'flavor\': \'«Припасы прибыли. Продолжайте сражаться!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecf77abb-4e99-4f9e-96e4-91a06ffefc4e\', \'multiverseId\': 425328}, \'multiverseid\': 425328}, {\'name\': \'运补空行师\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n反抗～当运补空行师进战场时，若本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物离开战场，则你获得5点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～矮人／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'「补给就位。保持压力。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c3b51d8-c94c-4e01-ab22-cbedc0427968\', \'multiverseId\': 423856}, \'multiverseid\': 423856}, {\'name\': \'運補空行師\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n反抗～當運補空行師進戰場時，若本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物離開戰場，則你獲得5點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～矮人／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'「補給就位。保持壓力。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd9da86c-a170-41eb-9169-bbb5aa7bab74\', \'multiverseId\': 424040}, \'multiverseid\': 424040}]', '[{\'name\': \'Luftschiffplünderer\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Luftschiffplünderer einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, erhält eine bleibende Karte oder ein Spieler deiner Wahl für jede Sorte von Marke, die auf ihr bzw. ihm liegt, eine weitere Marke dieser Sorte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Pirat\', \'flavor\': \'Eine Flucht sollte immer waghalsig sein.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424265&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'301afaf6-f22a-47b8-90a0-122e8ef9008a\', \'multiverseId\': 424265}, \'multiverseid\': 424265}, {\'name\': \'Saqueador de aeronaves\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Saqueador de aeronaves haga daño de combate a un jugador, por cada tipo de contador sobre el permanente o jugador objetivo, pon sobre ese permanente o jugador otro contador de ese tipo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pirata humano\', \'flavor\': \'Las huidas siempre deben ser atrevidas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a77f7174-00a3-45c8-a215-50ed7fc27a71\', \'multiverseId\': 425553}, \'multiverseid\': 425553}, {\'name\': \'Saccageur de vaisseau volant\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Saccageur de vaisseau volant inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, pour chaque type de marqueur sur le permanent ciblé ou le joueur ciblé, donnez à ce permanent ou à ce joueur un autre marqueur de ce type.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et pirate\', \'flavor\': "Toute fuite se doit d\'être audacieuse.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424449&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d55d57a-a0a2-415d-8a1a-774dce780b29\', \'multiverseId\': 424449}, \'multiverseid\': 424449}, {\'name\': \'Saccheggiatore di Avionavi\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta il Saccheggiatore di Avionavi infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, per ogni tipo di segnalino su un permanente o un giocatore bersaglio, quel permanente o giocatore riceve un altro segnalino di quel tipo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pirata Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Le fughe devono sempre essere ardite.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a19b2980-9778-446a-81db-086ece619773\', \'multiverseId\': 424633}, \'multiverseid\': 424633}, {\'name\': \'航空船の略取者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n航空船の略取者がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、パーマネント１つかプレイヤー１人を対象とし、それが持つカウンター１種類につきそれぞれその種類のカウンターをもう１個、そのパーマネントの上に置くか、そのプレイヤーに与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・海賊\', \'flavor\': \'脱出は大胆に。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11681619-1934-453b-804c-af7bea2a3b7e\', \'multiverseId\': 424817}, \'multiverseid\': 424817}, {\'name\': \'비행선 약탈자\', \'text\': \'비행\\n비행선 약탈자가 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 지속물 또는 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 목표에 놓여 있는 각 카운터 종류 하나당, 그 목표에게 같은 종류의 카운터 한 개를 추가한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 해적\', \'flavor\': \'탈출은 언제나 대담해야 한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8eb9398-819e-4023-8b5f-9f0e08f4548b\', \'multiverseId\': 425001}, \'multiverseid\': 425001}, {\'name\': \'Saqueador de Aeronaus\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Saqueador de Aeronaus causar dano de combate a um jogador, para cada tipo de marcador na permanente ou jogador alvo, dê àquela permanente ou jogador outro marcador daquele tipo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Pirata\', \'flavor\': \'Todas as fugas devem ter uma dose de ousadia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'402b7921-7eb9-4f72-a328-9dc8d17317dd\', \'multiverseId\': 425185}, \'multiverseid\': 425185}, {\'name\': \'Грабитель Небесных Кораблей\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда Грабитель Небесных Кораблей наносит боевые повреждения игроку, дайте целевому перманенту или игроку по одному жетону каждого из уже имеющихся на нем видов жетонов.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Пират\', \'flavor\': \'Побеги всегда должны быть дерзкими.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa8d1637-10dd-4a21-9ca0-2721d104a63d\', \'multiverseId\': 425369}, \'multiverseid\': 425369}, {\'name\': \'飞船劫匪\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当飞船劫匪对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，选择目标永久物或牌手；对其上每种指示物而言，该永久物或牌手得到另一个同种类的指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／海盗\', \'flavor\': \'要逃就要胆大。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9c82899-411b-4be3-833a-6cddb2bf3138\', \'multiverseId\': 423897}, \'multiverseid\': 423897}, {\'name\': \'飛船劫匪\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當飛船劫匪對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，選擇目標永久物或玩家；對其上每種指示物而言，該永久物或玩家得到另一個同種類的指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／海盜\', \'flavor\': \'要逃就要膽大。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50d18d14-d93c-472a-b85e-f7186fcb2085\', \'multiverseId\': 424081}, \'multiverseid\': 424081}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mausender Bandar\', \'text\': \'Der Mausende Bandar kommt mit zwei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments kannst du eine beliebige Anzahl an +1/+1-Marken vom Mausenden Bandar auf eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl bewegen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Affe\', \'flavor\': \'„Vor einer Sekunde war es doch noch da …"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424343&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb94053e-6290-44ce-aba9-63b1271d9e83\', \'multiverseId\': 424343}, \'multiverseid\': 424343}, {\'name\': \'Bandar agenciador\', \'text\': \'El Bandar agenciador entra al campo de batalla con dos contadores +1/+1 sobre él.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, puedes mover cualquier cantidad de contadores +1/+1 del Bandar agenciador a otra criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Primate felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Pero si estaba aquí hace un segundo...".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a64c90c5-12b6-4efb-8734-521d208756c1\', \'multiverseId\': 425631}, \'multiverseid\': 425631}, {\'name\': \'Bandar fouineur\', \'text\': "Le Bandar fouineur arrive sur le champ de bataille avec deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.\\nAu début de votre entretien, vous pouvez déplacer n\'importe quel nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 du Bandar fouineur sur une autre créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et singe\', \'flavor\': \'« Il était là il y a une seconde... »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424527&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21118687-9a05-4336-8256-9344a02f6f34\', \'multiverseId\': 424527}, \'multiverseid\': 424527}, {\'name\': \'Bandar Sgraffignatore\', \'text\': "Il Bandar Sgraffignatore entra nel campo di battaglia con due segnalini +1/+1.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, puoi spostare un qualsiasi numero di segnalini +1/+1 dal Bandar Sgraffignatore a un\'altra creatura bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Scimmia Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Ce l\\\'avevo qui un secondo fa..."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76db8d8f-2792-444f-921a-f7db661b8be4\', \'multiverseId\': 424711}, \'multiverseid\': 424711}, {\'name\': \'たかり猫猿\', \'text\': \'たかり猫猿は、＋１/＋１カウンターが２個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、他のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはたかり猫猿の上から望む数の＋１/＋１カウンターをそれの上に移動してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・猿\', \'flavor\': \'「ついさっき、ここにいたんだが……」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d67b6dc-94a8-41be-8b55-761a39fcce23\', \'multiverseId\': 424895}, \'multiverseid\': 424895}, {\'name\': \'약탈하는 반다르\', \'text\': \'약탈하는 반다르는 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 가지고 전장에 들어온다.\\n당신의 유지단 시작에, 다른 생물을 목표로 정한다. 당신은 약탈하는 반다르의 +1/+1 카운터를 원하는 만큼 그 생물에게 옮길 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이 원숭이\', \'flavor\': \'"방금 전에 여기 있었는데 . . ."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e78deea7-3b95-48a4-b6ea-089ce1a68f13\', \'multiverseId\': 425079}, \'multiverseid\': 425079}, {\'name\': \'Bandar Surrupiador\', \'text\': \'Bandar Surrupiador entra no campo de batalha com dois marcadores +1/+1.\\nNo início de sua manutenção, você pode mover qualquer número de marcadores +1/+1 de Bandar Surrupiador para outra criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino Macaco\', \'flavor\': \'"Estava bem aqui há um segundo..."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8f2f03b-541d-4a96-a7fa-bf8edc82691c\', \'multiverseId\': 425263}, \'multiverseid\': 425263}, {\'name\': \'Вороватый Бандар\', \'text\': \'Вороватый Бандар выходит на поле битвы с двумя жетонами +1/+1 на нем.\\nВ начале вашего шага поддержки вы можете переместить любое количество жетонов +1/+1 с Вороватого Бандара на другое целевое существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка Мартышка\', \'flavor\': \'«Он еще секунду назад был тут...»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0de4e714-5ea9-470a-a3ab-3c4a618e5a02\', \'multiverseId\': 425447}, \'multiverseid\': 425447}, {\'name\': \'灵巧猫猴\', \'text\': \'灵巧猫猴进战场时上面有两个+1/+1指示物。\\n在你的维持开始时，你可以将灵巧猫猴上任意数量的+1/+1指示物移至另一个目标生物上。\', \'type\': \'生物～猫／猴\', \'flavor\': \'「它刚刚还在这里. . .」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72e9103f-ad48-4f09-bd7f-c6a522b52869\', \'multiverseId\': 423975}, \'multiverseid\': 423975}, {\'name\': \'靈巧貓猴\', \'text\': \'靈巧貓猴進戰場時上面有兩個+1/+1指示物。\\n在你的維持開始時，你可以將靈巧貓猴上任意數量的+1/+1指示物移到另一個目標生物上。\', \'type\': \'生物～貓／猴\', \'flavor\': \'「它剛剛還在這裡. . .」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82288ecd-b58d-4eea-8e28-0f0092af824e\', \'multiverseId\': 424159}, \'multiverseid\': 424159}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mechanisierte Produktion\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert ein Artefakt, das du kontrollierst\\nErzeuge zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie des verzauberten Artefakts ist. Falls du dann acht oder mehr Artefakte kontrollierst, die untereinander denselben Namen haben, gewinnst du die Partie.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Gebt mir acht Schreiter und ich gebe euch die Stadt." —Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424257&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'180373a1-6247-4d93-afe7-4925b409885a\', \'multiverseId\': 424257}, \'multiverseid\': 424257}, {\'name\': \'Producción mecanizada\', \'text\': \'Encantar artefacto que controlas.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, crea una ficha que es una copia del artefacto encantado. Luego, si controlas ocho artefactos o más con el mismo nombre, ganas el juego.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Denme ocho caminantes; yo les daré la ciudad". —Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b35914b-2e11-4af2-9cef-3f06bbbeac5e\', \'multiverseId\': 425545}, \'multiverseid\': 425545}, {\'name\': \'Production mécanisée\', \'text\': "Enchanter : un artefact que vous contrôlez\\nAu début de votre entretien, créez un jeton qui est une copie de l\'artefact enchanté. Puis, si vous contrôlez au moins huit artefacts ayant tous le même nom, vous gagnez la partie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'« Donnez-moi huit marcheurs, je vous livrerai la ville. » —Dovin Baàn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424441&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e491431-45fd-40c4-85f5-90abaad132ac\', \'multiverseId\': 424441}, \'multiverseid\': 424441}, {\'name\': \'Produzione Meccanizzata\', \'text\': "Incanta artefatto che controlli\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, crea una pedina che è una copia dell\'artefatto incantato. Poi, se controlli otto o più artefatti che condividono lo stesso nome, vinci la partita.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Datemi otto camminatori e la città sarà vostra." —Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e10de9e-f020-485c-9a1e-8528416bd054\', \'multiverseId\': 424625}, \'multiverseid\': 424625}, {\'name\': \'機械化製法\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（あなたがコントロールするアーティファクト）\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、エンチャントされているアーティファクトのコピーであるトークンを１つ生成する。その後、あなたが互いに同じ名前を持つアーティファクトを８つ以上コントロールしているなら、あなたはこのゲームに勝利する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「歩行機械が８台あれば、市を手に入れて差し上げますよ。」 ――ドビン・バーン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e4d1351-0b19-4226-ad3b-970f8154405b\', \'multiverseId\': 424809}, \'multiverseid\': 424809}, {\'name\': \'기계화 생산\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 마법물체에 부여\\n당신의 유지단 시작에, 부여된 마법물체의 복사본인 토큰 한 개를 만든다. 그런 다음 당신이 서로 이름이 같은 마법물체를 여덟 개 이상 조종한다면, 당신은 게임에서 승리한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'"내게 기계 보행자 여덟 대를 주면 당신에게 도시 하나를 주겠소." —도빈 반\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8edcc915-b3d0-463d-b441-a18cf6e3ea41\', \'multiverseId\': 424993}, \'multiverseid\': 424993}, {\'name\': \'Produção Mecanizada\', \'text\': \'Encantar artefato que você controla\\nNo início de sua manutenção, crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia do artefato encantado. Em seguida, se você controlar oito ou mais artefatos de mesmo nome, você ganha o jogo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Dê-me oito caminhantes e eu lhe darei a cidade." — Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16fb31b2-6d90-4104-a7f0-9d3232d65dcd\', \'multiverseId\': 425177}, \'multiverseid\': 425177}, {\'name\': \'Механизированное Производство\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать артефакт под вашим контролем\\nВ начале вашего шага поддержки создайте фишку, являющуюся копией зачарованного артефакта. Затем, если вы контролируете восемь или больше артефактов с одинаковым именем, вы выигрываете партию.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'«Дайте мне восемь ходунов, и я дам вам город». — Довин Баан\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1c15c90-ddad-40e3-8cd2-a690151fdc29\', \'multiverseId\': 425361}, \'multiverseid\': 425361}, {\'name\': \'机械化生产\', \'text\': \'结附于由你操控的神器\\n在你的维持开始时，派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为所结附的神器之复制品。然后如果在所有由你操控的神器中，彼此同名的神器有八个或更多，你便赢得这盘游戏。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「给我八台巨像，我就能保全城安宁。」 ～多温班恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc231ce8-eb1b-4cc2-9114-84930a9798fa\', \'multiverseId\': 423889}, \'multiverseid\': 423889}, {\'name\': \'機械化生產\', \'text\': \'結附於由你操控的神器\\n在你的維持開始時，派出一個衍生物，此衍生物為所結附的神器之複製品。然後如果在所有由你操控的神器中，彼此同名的神器有八個或更多，你便贏得這盤遊戲。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'「給我八台巨像，我就能保全城安寧。」 ～多溫班恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'347fc8eb-36d5-4598-ba7e-14bb2cb3117b\', \'multiverseId\': 424073}, \'multiverseid\': 424073}]', '[{\'name\': \'Meister-Restauratorin\', \'text\': \'{W}, opfere die Meister-Restauratorin: Bringe bis zu eine Artefaktkarte deiner Wahl und bis zu eine Verzauberungskarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zwerg, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'Bei den Werkzeugen der Zwerge handelt es sich meist um unbezahlbare Erbstücke, die über Generationen weitergegeben werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424240&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43cdad5e-ff03-4a21-a419-6275c6786aba\', \'multiverseId\': 424240}, \'multiverseid\': 424240}, {\'name\': \'Especialista en restauración\', \'text\': \'{W}, sacrificar a la Especialista en restauración: Regresa hasta una carta de artefacto objetivo y hasta una carta de encantamiento objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Enano artífice\', \'flavor\': \'Las herramientas de los enanos son legados de incalculable valor que pasan de generación en generación.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1453d7a4-4af4-49ae-9d26-6d2c3f20211c\', \'multiverseId\': 425528}, \'multiverseid\': 425528}, {\'name\': \'Spécialiste de la restauration\', \'text\': "{W}, sacrifiez la Spécialiste de la restauration : Renvoyez jusqu\'à une carte d\'artefact ciblée et jusqu\'à une carte d\'enchantement ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : nain et artificier\', \'flavor\': \'Les outils des nains sont des héritages inestimables transmis de génération en génération.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424424&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e296433-7690-4d54-b95d-b6bca79a67c2\', \'multiverseId\': 424424}, \'multiverseid\': 424424}, {\'name\': \'Specialista in Riparazioni\', \'text\': \'{W}, Sacrifica la Specialista in Riparazioni: Riprendi in mano fino a una carta artefatto bersaglio e fino a una carta incantesimo bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Nano\', \'flavor\': \'Gli attrezzi dei nani sono cimeli inestimabili tramandati di generazione in generazione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'404ec64d-6cbc-4aaf-ad61-75c7335edce7\', \'multiverseId\': 424608}, \'multiverseid\': 424608}, {\'name\': \'修復専門家\', \'text\': \'{W}, 修復専門家を生け贄に捧げる：あなたの墓地からアーティファクト・カード最大１枚とエンチャント・カード最大１枚を対象とし、それらをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドワーフ・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'ドワーフが使う工具は何代も受け継がれた家宝であり値段は付けられない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4700f42f-25be-49ab-a0f7-107f5442decb\', \'multiverseId\': 424792}, \'multiverseid\': 424792}, {\'name\': \'복원 전문가\', \'text\': \'{W}, 복원 전문가를 희생한다: 당신의 무덤에서 마법물체 카드 최대 한 장과 부여마법 카드 최대 한 장을 목표로 정한다. 그 카드들을 당신의 무덤에서 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 드워프 기능공\', \'flavor\': \'드워프의 연장은 대대로 물려받는 가보다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2800b3b-2f88-4574-931d-3029da56638f\', \'multiverseId\': 424976}, \'multiverseid\': 424976}, {\'name\': \'Especialista em Restauração\', \'text\': \'{W}, Sacrifique Especialista em Restauração: Devolva até um card de artefato alvo e até um card de encantamento alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anão Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'As ferramentas dos anões são heranças inestimáveis passadas de geração em geração.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e6b68a9-c348-4bfa-b5d5-ce8943935bea\', \'multiverseId\': 425160}, \'multiverseid\': 425160}, {\'name\': \'Специалист-Реставратор\', \'text\': \'{W}, пожертвуйте Специалиста-Реставратора: верните не более одной целевой карты артефакта и не более одной целевой карты чар из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гном Механик\', \'flavor\': \'Инструменты гномов — это бесценные сокровища, передающиеся из поколения в поколение.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'850dadbd-bcf2-4eb4-bdec-24c589d8418f\', \'multiverseId\': 425344}, \'multiverseid\': 425344}, {\'name\': \'修复专家\', \'text\': \'{W}，牺牲修复专家：将至多一张目标神器牌和至多一张目标结界牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～矮人／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'矮人手中工具乃是代代相承的传家至宝。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423872&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5da2d0ca-5375-4dc7-b80b-8e658cb45df6\', \'multiverseId\': 423872}, \'multiverseid\': 423872}, {\'name\': \'修復專家\', \'text\': \'{W}，犧牲修復專家：將至多一張目標神器牌和至多一張目標結界牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～矮人／神器師\', \'flavor\': \'矮人手中工具乃是代代相承的傳家至寶。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e687892c-6079-45a4-9c07-40e97d1835a0\', \'multiverseId\': 424056}, \'multiverseid\': 424056}]', '[{\'name\': \'Metallische Zurechtweisung\', \'text\': \'Improvisieren (Deine Artefakte können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)\\nNeutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl, es sei denn, sein Beherrscher bezahlt {3}.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Zu wenig, zu spät. Die Maschine läuft bereits." —Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424258&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c07f2f6-1c5b-4210-a03e-1ad20e3b6ab7\', \'multiverseId\': 424258}, \'multiverseid\': 424258}, {\'name\': \'Censura metálica\', \'text\': \'Improvisar. (Tus artefactos pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada artefacto que gires una vez que termines de activar habilidades de maná paga {1}.)\\nContrarresta el hechizo objetivo a menos que su controlador pague {3}.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Demasiado tarde. La máquina ya está en funcionamiento". —Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0a459f4-1575-472a-b216-4376155c5eb7\', \'multiverseId\': 425546}, \'multiverseid\': 425546}, {\'name\': \'Blâme métallique\', \'text\': \'Improvisation (Vos artefacts peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque artefact que vous engagez après avoir activé des capacités de mana paie {1}.)\\nContrecarrez le sort ciblé à moins que son contrôleur ne paie {3}.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Trop tard. La machine est lancée. » —Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424442&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c29b47b-73b5-4ad2-bfe3-d408c2a6d0ca\', \'multiverseId\': 424442}, \'multiverseid\': 424442}, {\'name\': \'Risposta Metallica\', \'text\': \'Improvvisare (I tuoi artefatti possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni artefatto che TAPpi dopo aver attivato le abilità di mana corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nNeutralizza una magia bersaglio a meno che il suo controllore non paghi {3}.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Troppo poco e troppo tardi. La macchina si è messa in moto." —Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58abeb70-720f-4c6a-aaeb-c0d04443528e\', \'multiverseId\': 424626}, \'multiverseid\': 424626}, {\'name\': \'金属の叱責\', \'text\': \'即席（あなたのアーティファクトが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。あなたはあなたのアーティファクトをタップして、１個あたり{1}の支払いに代えてもよい。）\\n呪文１つを対象とする。それのコントローラーが{3}を支払わないかぎり、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「手遅れだ。あれはもう動いている。」 ――テゼレット\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f492736b-825e-4075-86bd-23ff75d37bdf\', \'multiverseId\': 424810}, \'multiverseid\': 424810}, {\'name\': \'금속성 비난\', \'text\': \'급조 (당신의 마법물체들은 이 주문을 발동하는 것을 도울 수 있다. 마나 능력을 활성화한 후에 탭하는 각 마법물체는 이 주문의 비용 중 {1}을 지불한다.)\\n주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문의 조종자가 {3}을 지불하지 않으면 그 주문을 무효화한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"기계가 아주 굼뜨게 동작하는군." —테제렛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb6c5199-3af0-4c77-988b-7d32fa08555f\', \'multiverseId\': 424994}, \'multiverseid\': 424994}, {\'name\': \'Repreensão Metálica\', \'text\': \'Improvisar (Seus artefatos podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada artefato que você vira após terminar de ativar habilidades de mana paga por {1}.)\\nAnule a mágica alvo, a menos que seu controlador pague {3}.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Muito pouco, e tarde demais. A máquina está funcionando." — Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7129ced2-3768-412a-bf6e-a62f417586ac\', \'multiverseId\': 425178}, \'multiverseid\': 425178}, {\'name\': \'Металлический Упрек\', \'text\': \'Импровизация (Ваши артефакты могут помочь разыграть это заклинание. Каждый артефакт, который вы поворачиваете после того, как вы закончили активировать мана-способности, считается оплатой {1}.)\\nОтмените целевое заклинание, если только контролирующий его игрок не заплатит {3}.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Боюсь, уже поздно. Машина пришла в движение». — Теззерет\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c92f3a3b-7f36-4ab6-a3f4-88dc689c97d0\', \'multiverseId\': 425362}, \'multiverseid\': 425362}, {\'name\': \'聚金拒斥\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒语能用你的神器来协助施放。你起动完法术力异能之后每横置一个神器，就能为此咒语支付 {1}。）\\n除非目标咒语的操控者支付{3}，否则反击之。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「可惜来不及了。机械已开始运转。」 ～泰兹瑞\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a457c44-e06b-48ae-8959-c595e816961c\', \'multiverseId\': 423890}, \'multiverseid\': 423890}, {\'name\': \'聚金拒斥\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒語能用你的神器來協助施放。你起動完魔法力異能之後每橫置一個神器，就能為此咒語支付{1}。）\\n除非目標咒語的操控者支付{3}，否則反擊之。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「可惜來不及了。機械已開始運轉。」 ～泰茲瑞\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abb90b6a-3374-4e03-b54c-d3672f50a30b\', \'multiverseId\': 424074}, \'multiverseid\': 424074}]', "[{'name': 'Metallischer Nachahmer', 'text': 'Sowie der Metallische Nachahmer ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Kreaturentyp.\\nDer Metallische Nachahmer hat zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Typen den bestimmten Kreaturentyp.\\nJede andere Kreatur des bestimmten Typs, die du kontrollierst, kommt mit einer zusätzlichen +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Gestaltwandler', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424383&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51be06b6-845d-41f8-9003-cb00e73bdd00', 'multiverseId': 424383}, 'multiverseid': 424383}, {'name': 'Mímico metálico', 'text': 'En cuanto el Mímico metálico entre al campo de batalla, elige un tipo de criatura.\\nEl Mímico metálico es del tipo elegido además de sus otros tipos.\\nCada una de las otras criaturas que controlas del tipo elegido entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 adicional sobre ella.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Metamorfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425671&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3086582c-7758-43f7-810a-bfefa41df055', 'multiverseId': 425671}, 'multiverseid': 425671}, {'name': 'Mimique métallique', 'text': 'Au moment où le Mimique métallique arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un type de créature.\\nLe Mimique métallique a le type choisi en plus de ses autres types.\\nChaque autre créature du type choisi que vous contrôlez arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 supplémentaire sur elle.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : changeforme', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424567&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7acfcd7e-6567-40ec-9f33-406d7e4f6b3e', 'multiverseId': 424567}, 'multiverseid': 424567}, {'name': 'Mimic Metallico', 'text': 'Mentre il Mimic Metallico entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un tipo di creatura.\\nIl Mimic Metallico ha il tipo scelto in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi.\\nOgni altra creatura che controlli del tipo scelto entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1 addizionale.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Polimorfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424751&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a10aecbd-d256-40b5-a176-59e8d0e07ecc', 'multiverseId': 424751}, 'multiverseid': 424751}, {'name': '金属ミミック', 'text': '金属ミミックが戦場に出るに際し、クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。\\n金属ミミックは、他のタイプに加えてその選ばれたタイプでもある。\\nあなたがコントロールする選ばれたタイプを持つ他の各クリーチャーはそれぞれ、＋１/＋１カウンターが追加で１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 多相の戦士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424935&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ae98a53a-3363-4de6-be9a-63969ed1d8d2', 'multiverseId': 424935}, 'multiverseid': 424935}, {'name': '금속 모방자', 'text': '금속 모방자가 전장에 들어오면서, 생물 유형 한 가지를 선택한다.\\n금속 모방자는 자신의 다른 유형에 더불어 당신이 선택한 유형이 된다.\\n당신이 조종하는 선택한 유형의 다른 생물은 각각 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 추가로 가지고 전장에 들어온다.', 'type': '마법물체 생물 — 변신괴물', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425119&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '061795e4-8633-4520-85ce-dab78231bb47', 'multiverseId': 425119}, 'multiverseid': 425119}, {'name': 'Mímico Metálico', 'text': 'Conforme Mímico Metálico entra no campo de batalha, escolha um tipo de criatura.\\nMímico Metálico é do tipo escolhido além de seus outros tipos.\\nCada outra criatura do tipo escolhido que você controla entra no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1 adicional.', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato — Metamorfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425303&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '15a60f95-71a2-4160-9646-ea824cd82435', 'multiverseId': 425303}, 'multiverseid': 425303}, {'name': 'Металлический Подражатель', 'text': 'При выходе Металлического Подражателя на поле битвы выберите тип существа.\\nМеталлический Подражатель обладает выбранным типом в дополнение к своим другим типам.\\nКаждое другое существо выбранного типа под вашим контролем выходит на поле битвы с одним дополнительным жетоном +1/+1 на нем.', 'type': 'Артефакт Существо — Имитатор', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425487&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f403ae19-c265-4940-b59b-a778980e0de9', 'multiverseId': 425487}, 'multiverseid': 425487}, {'name': '金属拟态械', 'text': '于金属拟态械进战场时，选择一种生物类别。\\n金属拟态械额外具有该类别。\\n每个由你操控且具该类别的其他生物进战场时上面额外有一个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '神器生物～变形兽', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424015&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '777f3ab8-ca7e-44ab-bcd3-1ef32085acfb', 'multiverseId': 424015}, 'multiverseid': 424015}, {'name': '金屬擬態械', 'text': '於金屬擬態械進戰場時，選擇一種生物類別。\\n金屬擬態械額外具有該類別。\\n每個由你操控且具該類別的其他生物進戰場時上面額外有一個+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '神器生物～變形獸', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424199&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1c409db4-7818-40d5-8d16-fac138cfec9e', 'multiverseId': 424199}, 'multiverseid': 424199}]", '[{\'name\': \'Mitternächtliches Gefolge\', \'text\': \'Andere Äthergeborene, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\nImmer wenn das Mitternächtliche Gefolge oder ein anderer Äthergeborener, den du kontrollierst, stirbt, ziehst du eine Karte und verlierst 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Äthergeborener, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424285&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec796070-bbd4-40ac-aed3-9d09acff7560\', \'multiverseId\': 424285}, \'multiverseid\': 424285}, {\'name\': \'Séquito de medianoche\', \'text\': \'Los otros Etergénitos que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\\nSiempre que el Séquito de medianoche u otro Etergénito que controlas muera, roba una carta y pierde 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón etergénito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e98de80-2030-4078-9b57-4f021f314636\', \'multiverseId\': 425573}, \'multiverseid\': 425573}, {\'name\': \'Entourage de minuit\', \'text\': "Les autres éthériens que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Entourage de minuit ou un autre éthérien que vous contrôlez meurt, vous piochez une carte et vous perdez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : éthérien et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424469&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7b699ba-61c2-4eef-9844-4508b588841b\', \'multiverseId\': 424469}, \'multiverseid\': 424469}, {\'name\': \'Entourage di Mezzanotte\', \'text\': "Gli altri Eteridi che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Entourage di Mezzanotte o un altro Eteride che controlli muoiono, peschi una carta e perdi 1 punto vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Eteride\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0eb98b7a-50a7-4bb5-be5d-c2ad0f48b327\', \'multiverseId\': 424653}, \'multiverseid\': 424653}, {\'name\': \'真夜中の随員\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールする他の霊基体は＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n真夜中の随員かあなたがコントロールする他の霊基体が１体死亡するたび、あなたはカードを１枚引き、あなたは１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 霊基体・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88ab7c3b-95f0-4bc2-ba28-2a2d9bcb2488\', \'multiverseId\': 424837}, \'multiverseid\': 424837}, {\'name\': \'심야의 수행단\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 다른 에테르붙이는 +1/+1을 받는다.\\n심야의 수행단 또는 당신이 조종하는 다른 에테르붙이가 죽을 때마다, 당신은 카드 한 장을 뽑고 생명 1점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 에테르붙이 도적\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'526d5737-7893-49fe-ae08-82aeff81a1cf\', \'multiverseId\': 425021}, \'multiverseid\': 425021}, {\'name\': \'Comitiva da Meia-noite\', \'text\': \'Os outros Etergênitos que você controla recebem +1/+1.\\nToda vez que Comitiva da Meia-noite ou outro Etergênito que você controla morre, você compra um card e perde 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Etergênito Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27247b1f-432e-4091-8be1-96b13894e807\', \'multiverseId\': 425205}, \'multiverseid\': 425205}, {\'name\': \'Полночная Свита\', \'text\': \'Другие Эфириды под вашим контролем получают +1/+1.\\nКаждый раз, когда Полночная Свита или другой Эфирид под вашим контролем умирает, вы берете карту и теряете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эфирид Бродяга\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf43b6e9-9872-496d-b58f-c159ef12b8f2\', \'multiverseId\': 425389}, \'multiverseid\': 425389}, {\'name\': \'午夜随扈\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他乙太种得+1/+1。\\n每当午夜随扈或另一个由你操控的乙太种死去时，你抓一张牌且失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～乙太种／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c900bbd7-4079-4c45-b14c-27886146e46f\', \'multiverseId\': 423917}, \'multiverseid\': 423917}, {\'name\': \'午夜隨扈\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他乙太種得+1/+1。\\n每當午夜隨扈或另一個由你操控的乙太種死去時，你抽一張牌且失去1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～乙太種／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22de62e5-3ce9-4d09-b275-65e42afc123e\', \'multiverseId\': 424101}, \'multiverseid\': 424101}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mobile Garnison\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Mobile Garnison angreift, enttappe ein anderes Artefakt oder eine andere Kreatur, das bzw. die du kontrollierst.\\nBemannen 2 (Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die zusammen Stärke 2 oder mehr haben: Dieses Fahrzeug wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424384&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9e04794-d76b-4e9e-9b16-2cae08184067\', \'multiverseId\': 424384}, \'multiverseid\': 424384}, {\'name\': \'Baluarte móvil\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Baluarte móvil ataque, endereza otro artefacto o criatura objetivo que controlas.\\nTripular 2. (Girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controlas con una fuerza total de 2 o más: Este Vehículo se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03b1fc41-052c-425f-8602-1b91793b2dd0\', \'multiverseId\': 425672}, \'multiverseid\': 425672}, {\'name\': \'Garnison mobile\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que la Garnison mobile attaque, dégagez un autre artefact ciblé ou une autre créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\nPilotage 2 (Engagez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez dont la force totale est supérieure ou égale à 2 : Ce véhicule devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : véhicule\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424568&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74b3de1e-7055-43b0-a4eb-e2189b8ed91d\', \'multiverseId\': 424568}, \'multiverseid\': 424568}, {\'name\': \'Presidio Mobile\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta il Presidio Mobile attacca, STAPpa un altro artefatto o un\'altra creatura bersaglio che controlli.\\nManovrare 2 (TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli con forza totale pari o superiore a 2: Questo Veicolo diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.)", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'425566bc-734d-4caa-a618-a34ab431d016\', \'multiverseId\': 424752}, \'multiverseid\': 424752}, {\'name\': \'移動駐屯所\', \'text\': \'移動駐屯所が攻撃するたび、あなたがコントロールする、他のアーティファクト１つか他のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをアンタップする。\\n搭乗２（あなたがコントロールする望む数のクリーチャーを、パワーの合計が２以上になるように選んでタップする：ターン終了時まで、この機体はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2087431-23f1-43c5-8c6d-72291310d17a\', \'multiverseId\': 424936}, \'multiverseid\': 424936}, {\'name\': \'기동 수비대\', \'text\': \'기동 수비대가 공격할 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 마법물체 또는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 언탭한다.\\n탑승 2 (당신이 조종하는 생물을 공격력 총합이 2 이상이 되도록 원하는 수만큼 탭한다: 이 탑승물은 턴종료까지 마법물체 생물이 된다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 탑승물\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36ee1341-f30e-41ee-bfc1-3ae9f7eb9ecc\', \'multiverseId\': 425120}, \'multiverseid\': 425120}, {\'name\': \'Guarnição Móvel\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Guarnição Móvel atacar, desvire outro artefato ou criatura alvo que você controla.\\nTripular 2 (Vire qualquer número de criaturas que você controla com total de poder igual ou superior a 2: Este Veículo se torna uma criatura artefato até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Veículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1519365c-4834-4202-84ba-e114539a4098\', \'multiverseId\': 425304}, \'multiverseid\': 425304}, {\'name\': \'Мобильный Гарнизон\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Мобильный Гарнизон атакует, разверните другой целевой артефакт или существо под вашим контролем.\\nЭкипаж 2 (Поверните любое количество существ под вашим контролем с суммарной силой 2 или более: эта Машина становится артефактом существом до конца хода.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Машина\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3ebf1ed-b80c-47a7-ab98-7f6c9cd242b3\', \'multiverseId\': 425488}, \'multiverseid\': 425488}, {\'name\': \'可动驻防地\', \'text\': \'每当可动驻防地攻击时，重置另一个目标由你操控的神器或生物。\\n搭载2（横置任意数量由你操控且力量总和等于或大于2的生物：此载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'神器～载具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed174a40-ec94-4536-aa0e-8a1ca06e61d2\', \'multiverseId\': 424016}, \'multiverseid\': 424016}, {\'name\': \'可動駐防地\', \'text\': \'每當可動駐防地攻擊時，重置另一個目標由你操控的神器或生物。\\n搭載2（橫置任意數量由你操控且力量總和等於或大於2的生物：此載具成為神器生物直到回合結束。）\', \'type\': \'神器～載具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38c71c3a-1ad3-4d45-833e-40750596d98e\', \'multiverseId\': 424200}, \'multiverseid\': 424200}]', '[{\'name\': \'Monströser Ansturm\', \'text\': \'Der Monströse Ansturm fügt X Schadenspunkte zu, deren Aufteilung auf eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen deiner Wahl du bestimmst, wobei X die höchste Stärke unter den Kreaturen ist, die du kontrollierst, sowie du den Monströsen Ansturm wirkst.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Grüße aus Peema." —Rishkar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424335&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f26a3927-f064-4bbf-8635-9ea3f967efae\', \'multiverseId\': 424335}, \'multiverseid\': 424335}, {\'name\': \'Embestida monstruosa\', \'text\': \'La Embestida monstruosa hace X puntos de daño divididos como elijas entre cualquier cantidad de criaturas objetivo, donde X es la mayor fuerza entre las criaturas que controlas en cuanto lanzas la Embestida monstruosa.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Saludos de Peema". —Rishkar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abd329c2-9e08-49a3-8f8f-30b3cdc7680e\', \'multiverseId\': 425623}, \'multiverseid\': 425623}, {\'name\': \'Carnage monstrueux\', \'text\': "Le Carnage monstrueux inflige X blessures réparties comme vous le désirez entre n\'importe quel nombre de créatures ciblées, X étant la force la plus élevée parmi les créatures que vous contrôlez au moment où vous lancez le Carnage monstrueux.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Salutations de Peema. » —Rishkar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424519&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c284e05-9c7c-418a-8fb1-0cc02d5bdf93\', \'multiverseId\': 424519}, \'multiverseid\': 424519}, {\'name\': \'Assalto Mostruoso\', \'text\': "L\'Assalto Mostruoso infligge X danni divisi a tua scelta tra un qualsiasi numero di creature bersaglio, dove X è la forza maggiore tra le creature che controlli mentre lanci l\'Assalto Mostruoso.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Saluti da Peema." —Rishkar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c38fc911-4eb6-4a19-ba5f-5b22dfbebb92\', \'multiverseId\': 424703}, \'multiverseid\': 424703}, {\'name\': \'巨怪の猛攻\', \'text\': \'望む数のクリーチャーを対象とする。巨怪の猛攻はそれらにＸ点のダメージをあなたの望むように分割して与える。Ｘは、あなたが巨怪の猛攻を唱える際にあなたがコントロールしていたクリーチャーの中のパワーの最大値に等しい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「ピーマから、ほんのご挨拶。」 ――リシュカー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a4984e7-eac2-4ea1-ad3a-eb0370bd47d1\', \'multiverseId\': 424887}, \'multiverseid\': 424887}, {\'name\': \'터무니없는 맹습\', \'text\': \'생물을 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 터무니없는 맹습은 그 생물들에게 피해 X점을 당신이 분배한 대로 입힌다. X는 당신이 터무니없는 맹습을 발동하면서 조종한 생물 중 공격력이 가장 높은 생물의 공격력이다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"피마로부터의 안부 인사다." —리시카르\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d40843b-df81-4e88-b999-6729fdcd7849\', \'multiverseId\': 425071}, \'multiverseid\': 425071}, {\'name\': \'Investida Monstruosa\', \'text\': \'Investida Monstruosa causa X pontos de dano divididos à sua escolha a qualquer número de criaturas alvo, sendo X o maior poder entre as criaturas que você controla conforme conjura Investida Monstruosa.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Saudações de Peema." — Rishkar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e23af93-a285-4cc0-a8e5-18d3e6ceb90f\', \'multiverseId\': 425255}, \'multiverseid\': 425255}, {\'name\': \'Чудовищная Резня\', \'text\': \'Чудовищная Резня наносит X повреждений, разделенных по вашему выбору между любым количеством целевых существ, где X — наибольшее значение силы среди существ под вашим контролем в момент разыгрывания вами Чудовищной Резни.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Привет из Пимы». — Ришкар\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cc624c0-b748-4472-8180-9028c1d4112b\', \'multiverseId\': 425439}, \'multiverseid\': 425439}, {\'name\': \'怪兽猛攻\', \'text\': \'怪兽猛攻对任意数量的目标生物造成共X点伤害，你可以任意分配，X为于你施放怪兽猛攻时，由你操控之生物中力量最大者的数值。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「来自皮默的问候。」 ～李什克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0341a52e-ba7d-4b67-b1ca-90d168609414\', \'multiverseId\': 423967}, \'multiverseid\': 423967}, {\'name\': \'怪獸猛攻\', \'text\': \'怪獸猛攻對任意數量的目標生物造成共X點傷害，你可以任意分配，X為於你施放怪獸猛攻時，由你操控之生物中力量最大者的數值。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「來自皮默的問候。」 ～李什克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ba9d22c-32a6-4a60-a324-bc061e72d077\', \'multiverseId\': 424151}, \'multiverseid\': 424151}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nachkonstruieren\', \'text\': \'Improvisieren (Deine Artefakte können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)\\nZiehe drei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Der „Frachtraum" — ein illegales Forschungslabor im Wrack eines Handelsschiffes — wurde für die Renegaten zu einem Quell von Informationen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424261&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'162a2ddf-0156-4114-b83b-991aa8e1765b\', \'multiverseId\': 424261}, \'multiverseid\': 424261}, {\'name\': \'Ingeniería inversa\', \'text\': \'Improvisar. (Tus artefactos pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada artefacto que gires una vez que termines de activar habilidades de maná paga {1}.)\\nRoba tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La Bodega, un laboratorio de investigación ilegal situado en un barco mercante abandonado, se convirtió en fuente de innovación para los renegados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24fa47ba-99e5-4df1-9de8-845887a8f860\', \'multiverseId\': 425549}, \'multiverseid\': 425549}, {\'name\': \'Rétro-ingénieur\', \'text\': \'Improvisation (Vos artefacts peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque artefact que vous engagez après avoir activé des capacités de mana paie {1}.)\\nPiochez trois cartes.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Centre de recherche illégal dissimulé dans un vaisseau marchand abandonné, la Forteresse devint une importante source de renseignements pour les renégats.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424445&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65933345-0f0b-4ef2-b3ff-542e7b3fd198\', \'multiverseId\': 424445}, \'multiverseid\': 424445}, {\'name\': \'Ingegneria Inversa\', \'text\': \'Improvvisare (I tuoi artefatti possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni artefatto che TAPpi dopo aver attivato le abilità di mana corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nPesca tre carte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'La Stiva, un centro di ricerca illegale in una nave mercantile abbandonata, divenne una fonte inesauribile di informazioni per i rinnegati.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3357c3cd-663d-4094-8581-c730982528be\', \'multiverseId\': 424629}, \'multiverseid\': 424629}, {\'name\': \'解析調査\', \'text\': \'即席（あなたのアーティファクトが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。あなたはあなたのアーティファクトをタップして、１個あたり{1}の支払いに代えてもよい。）\\nカードを３枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'船倉とは、廃棄された商船の内部にある非合法な研究施設の名である。そこは改革派の情報拠点になっている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e7a3ca9-9475-43d2-b5b0-2c6728c6bc87\', \'multiverseId\': 424813}, \'multiverseid\': 424813}, {\'name\': \'역설계\', \'text\': \'급조 (당신의 마법물체들은 이 주문을 발동하는 것을 도울 수 있다. 마나 능력을 활성화한 후에 탭하는 각 마법물체는 이 주문의 비용 중 {1}을 지불한다.)\\n카드 세 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'버려진 상선의 불법 연구 시설인 선창은 무법자 정보의 원천으로 변했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5812c8bd-5557-4ab1-a76b-227ae3d00394\', \'multiverseId\': 424997}, \'multiverseid\': 424997}, {\'name\': \'Engenharia Reversa\', \'text\': \'Improvisar (Seus artefatos podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada artefato que você vira após terminar de ativar habilidades de mana paga por {1}.)\\nCompre três cards.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'O Porão, uma instalação de pesquisa ilegal em um navio mercante abandonado, tornou-se um centro de inteligência dos renegados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8e3ad40-a3d2-43a8-ad03-e3a5fdb26a82\', \'multiverseId\': 425181}, \'multiverseid\': 425181}, {\'name\': \'Обратное Проектирование\', \'text\': \'Импровизация (Ваши артефакты могут помочь разыграть это заклинание. Каждый артефакт, который вы поворачиваете после того, как вы закончили активировать мана-способности, считается оплатой {1}.)\\nВозьмите три карты.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Трюм — тайная исследовательская лаборатория в древнем торговом корабле — стал центром разведывательных сведений для отступников.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'982c2563-6ca7-478d-a77a-8521c0d659a5\', \'multiverseId\': 425365}, \'multiverseid\': 425365}, {\'name\': \'究研原理\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒语能用你的神器来协助施放。你起动完法术力异能之后每横置一个神器，就能为此咒语支付{1}。）\\n抓三张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「要塞」这处设在废弃商船上的非法研究设施，现已成为乱匠的情报泉源。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b5f7011-329d-4df9-af62-fdb2538a612c\', \'multiverseId\': 423893}, \'multiverseid\': 423893}, {\'name\': \'究研原理\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒語能用你的神器來協助施放。你起動完魔法力異能之後每橫置一個神器，就能為此咒語支付{1}。）\\n抽三張牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「要塞」這處設在廢棄商船上的非法研究機構，現已成為亂匠的情報泉源。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2912a0d-40ed-4b9a-b4d7-cf3d56fd9767\', \'multiverseId\': 424077}, \'multiverseid\': 424077}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nachtmarkt-Aeronaut\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nRebellion — Der Nachtmarkt-Aeronaut kommt mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel, falls in diesem Zug eine bleibende Karte unter deiner Kontrolle das Spiel verlassen hat.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Äthergeborener, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Morgen schon mag mich der Tod ereilen, doch heute, heute bin ich voller Leben."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424286&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddabf31f-d9ef-48dd-a9e1-6d801cf9700b\', \'multiverseId\': 424286}, \'multiverseid\': 424286}, {\'name\': \'Aeronauta del mercado nocturno\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nRevuelta — El Aeronauta del mercado nocturno entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre él si un permanente que controlabas dejó el campo de batalla este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero etergénito\', \'flavor\': \'"La muerte puede llegar mañana, pero hoy... hoy aún estoy vivo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fbac1ff-4cc5-45e7-8a8a-6f957a48641d\', \'multiverseId\': 425574}, \'multiverseid\': 425574}, {\'name\': \'Aéronaute du marché nocturne\', \'text\': "Vol\\nRévolte — L\'Aéronaute du marché nocturne arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui si un permanent que vous contrôliez a quitté le champ de bataille ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : éthérien et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« La mort m\'attend peut-être demain, mais aujourd\'hui je suis bien vivant. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424470&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06d20ad8-9dc4-4898-8ea1-280da89cdbfe\', \'multiverseId\': 424470}, \'multiverseid\': 424470}, {\'name\': \'Aeronauta del Mercato Notturno\', \'text\': "Volare\\nRivolta — Se un permanente che controllavi ha lasciato il campo di battaglia in questo turno, l\'Aeronauta del Mercato Notturno entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Eteride\', \'flavor\': \'"Domani potrà anche giungere la morte, ma oggi... oggi sono vivo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b85ff5cc-50cb-4cf2-9a24-0d8bdc95147a\', \'multiverseId\': 424654}, \'multiverseid\': 424654}, {\'name\': \'夜市の飛空士\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n紛争 ― このターンにあなたがコントロールするパーマネントが戦場を離れていたなら、夜市の飛空士は＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 霊基体・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「明日死ぬかもしれんが、今日は—今日は生きてるぞ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03a0ac6b-2e87-4217-a24b-5c078e99a927\', \'multiverseId\': 424838}, \'multiverseid\': 424838}, {\'name\': \'야시장 비행병\', \'text\': \'비행\\n봉기 — 당신이 조종한 지속물이 이 턴에 전장을 떠났다면, 야시장 비행병은 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 가지고 전장에 들어온다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 에테르붙이 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"내일 죽음이 찾아올지 모른다. 하지만 오늘 나는 살아있다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52117043-ba61-4198-955d-b6ef77b871c6\', \'multiverseId\': 425022}, \'multiverseid\': 425022}, {\'name\': \'Aeronauta do Mercado Noturno\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nRevolta — Aeronauta do Mercado Noturno entra no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1 se uma permanente que você controlava deixou o campo de batalha neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Etergênito Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"A morte pode chegar amanhã, mas hoje... hoje eu estou vivo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8063e19d-05d9-4213-bc98-ceb94cc63883\', \'multiverseId\': 425206}, \'multiverseid\': 425206}, {\'name\': \'Аэронавт с Ночного Рынка\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nБунт — Аэронавт с Ночного Рынка выходит на поле битвы с одним жетоном +1/+1 на нем, если находившийся под вашим контролем перманент покинул поле битвы в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эфирид Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Быть может, смерть придет завтра, но сегодня... сегодня я жив».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8e07b50-623b-45f1-befd-5caa625a614d\', \'multiverseId\': 425390}, \'multiverseid\': 425390}, {\'name\': \'晚市空行师\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n反抗～如果本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物离开战场，则晚市空行师进战场时上面有一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～乙太种／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「我的生命可能明天就会凋零，但今天～今天我还依然绽放。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a18ca19-821b-41bc-9eb1-aad92daea531\', \'multiverseId\': 423918}, \'multiverseid\': 423918}, {\'name\': \'晚市空行師\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n反抗～如果本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物離開戰場，則晚市空行師進戰場時上面有一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～乙太種／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「我的生命可能明天就會凋零，但今天～今天我還依然綻放。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a64e5a95-2e80-44b0-965f-31fcfa68f4be\', \'multiverseId\': 424102}, \'multiverseid\': 424102}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nachtmarkt-Wache\', \'text\': \'Die Nachtmarkt-Wache kann in jedem Kampf eine zusätzliche Kreatur blocken.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein Kopf hält Ausschau nach Vollstreckern des Konsulats. Der andere sucht nach diebischen Renegaten." —Gonti, Fürst der Unterwelt\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424385&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06e51fc5-5443-4e46-b76d-08a5ccc70bbb\', \'multiverseId\': 424385}, \'multiverseid\': 424385}, {\'name\': \'Guardia del mercado nocturno\', \'text\': \'El Guardia del mercado nocturno puede bloquear una criatura adicional cada combate.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'"Una cabeza vigila por si vienen ejecutores del Consulado. La otra, por si aparecen ladrones renegados". —Gonti, señor del crimen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b8a23dc-7ecd-48ce-8592-9d644558f940\', \'multiverseId\': 425673}, \'multiverseid\': 425673}, {\'name\': \'Garde du marché nocturne\', \'text\': \'Le Garde du marché nocturne peut bloquer une créature supplémentaire à chaque combat.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': "« Une tête guette les argousins du Consulat ; l\'autre les voleurs renégats. » —Baron du crime Gonti", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424569&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65eb965f-a0a7-4794-b6ab-b5e06795bc26\', \'multiverseId\': 424569}, \'multiverseid\': 424569}, {\'name\': \'Guardia del Mercato Notturno\', \'text\': \'La Guardia del Mercato Notturno può bloccare una creatura addizionale in ogni combattimento.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'"Una testa cerca gli esecutori del Consolato. L\\\'altra cerca i ladri rinnegati." —Gonti, signore del crimine\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eefaadb0-649f-45e6-8e1a-0259f57f9d19\', \'multiverseId\': 424753}, \'multiverseid\': 424753}, {\'name\': \'夜市の護衛\', \'text\': \'各戦闘で、夜市の護衛は、追加で１体のクリーチャーをブロックできる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'「１つの頭が領事府の執行官を警戒、もう１つが改革派の盗人を警戒。」 ――犯罪王ゴンティ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4165fa1d-2dc5-4656-a8d0-0c993436daa4\', \'multiverseId\': 424937}, \'multiverseid\': 424937}, {\'name\': \'야시장 경비병\', \'text\': \'야시장 경비병은 매 전투마다 생물 한 개를 추가로 방어할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 자동기계\', \'flavor\': \'"한 쪽 머리로는 영사관 집행자들을 경계하고, 다른 쪽 머리로는 무법자 도둑들을 경계한다." —범죄의 군주 곤티\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ae752c2-2896-4882-a321-11f679dfa246\', \'multiverseId\': 425121}, \'multiverseid\': 425121}, {\'name\': \'Guarda do Mercado Noturno\', \'text\': \'Guarda do Mercado Noturno pode bloquear uma criatura adicional a cada combate.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'"Uma cabeça fica alerta a impositores do Consulado. A outra, a ladrões renegados." — Gonti, Senhor do Crime\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2398ff1-ccc4-4dcd-92f7-0ded6c6ce64a\', \'multiverseId\': 425305}, \'multiverseid\': 425305}, {\'name\': \'Стражник Ночного Рынка\', \'text\': \'Стражник Ночного Рынка может блокировать дополнительное существо в каждом бою.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': \'«Одна голова высматривает блюстителей Консульства. Другая высматривает воров-отступников». — король преступников Гонти\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af503927-90c9-4940-9a2c-707a9ac9fa50\', \'multiverseId\': 425489}, \'multiverseid\': 425489}, {\'name\': \'晚市守卫\', \'text\': \'晚市守卫每次战斗可以额外多阻挡一个生物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'「一个脑袋留意执政院执法者，一个脑袋监视乱匠盗贼。」 ～犯罪头子贡提\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'205e748d-5eda-4649-9c89-b38b2ff8080d\', \'multiverseId\': 424017}, \'multiverseid\': 424017}, {\'name\': \'晚市守衛\', \'text\': \'晚市守衛每次戰鬥可以額外多阻擋一個生物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～組構體\', \'flavor\': \'「一個腦袋留意執政院執法者，一個腦袋監視亂匠盜賊。」 ～犯罪頭子貢提\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0781d589-6cfb-4977-9a1c-949287cee9c1\', \'multiverseId\': 424201}, \'multiverseid\': 424201}]', '[{\'name\': \'Narnam-Renegat\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nRebellion — Der Narnam-Renegat kommt mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel, falls in diesem Zug eine bleibende Karte unter deiner Kontrolle das Spiel verlassen hat.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich muss dein Herz nicht durchbohren, um sein Schlagen zu beenden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424336&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3533f09b-ab2f-46b6-9d9c-8f07fa95c93c\', \'multiverseId\': 424336}, \'multiverseid\': 424336}, {\'name\': \'Renegado de Narnam\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\nRevuelta — El Renegado de Narnam entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre él si un permanente que controlabas dejó el campo de batalla este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"No necesito atravesarte el corazón para detener su latido".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef4926f3-1eee-4ba8-832e-5959f47ba091\', \'multiverseId\': 425624}, \'multiverseid\': 425624}, {\'name\': \'Renégat de Narnam\', \'text\': \'Contact mortel\\nRévolte — Le Renégat de Narnam arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui si un permanent que vous contrôliez a quitté le champ de bataille ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Je n\'ai nul besoin de vous transpercer le cœur pour l\'empêcher de battre. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424520&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13cf01fa-5510-4a1c-94d1-3d8d5787cd38\', \'multiverseId\': 424520}, \'multiverseid\': 424520}, {\'name\': \'Rinnegato di Narnam\', \'text\': \'Tocco letale\\nRivolta — Se un permanente che controllavi ha lasciato il campo di battaglia in questo turno, il Rinnegato di Narnam entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non è necessario trapassarti il cuore per fermarne il battito."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24ac694b-cf2d-4471-a34d-4e5b0607c19b\', \'multiverseId\': 424704}, \'multiverseid\': 424704}, {\'name\': \'ナーナムの改革派\', \'text\': \'接死\\n紛争 ― このターンにあなたがコントロールするパーマネントが戦場を離れていたなら、ナーナムの改革派は＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「お前の心臓を串刺しにする以外にも、それを止める方法はあるのだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff615a12-59b3-413c-9723-3dd225e9e56f\', \'multiverseId\': 424888}, \'multiverseid\': 424888}, {\'name\': \'나르남 무법자\', \'text\': \'치명타\\n봉기 — 당신이 조종한 지속물이 이 턴에 전장을 떠났다면, 나르남 무법자는 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 가지고 전장에 들어온다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"심장을 찌르지 않아도 당신의 심장 박동을 멈출 수 있다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c34703c9-0888-474e-9bf4-c75e02630171\', \'multiverseId\': 425072}, \'multiverseid\': 425072}, {\'name\': \'Renegado de Narnam\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero\\nRevolta — Renegado de Narnam entra no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1 se uma permanente que você controlava deixou o campo de batalha neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Não preciso perfurar seu coração para interromper suas batidas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33b287bd-0fe6-4443-9f41-5ef10b5e3418\', \'multiverseId\': 425256}, \'multiverseid\': 425256}, {\'name\': \'Нарнамский Отступник\', \'text\': \'Смертельное касание\\nБунт — Нарнамский Отступник выходит на поле битвы с одним жетоном +1/+1 на нем, если находившийся под вашим контролем перманент покинул поле битвы в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Мне не нужно пронзать твое сердце, чтобы остановить его биение».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c27e474f-1dde-434f-8e4d-e77377d9b88a\', \'multiverseId\': 425440}, \'multiverseid\': 425440}, {\'name\': \'纳南乱匠\', \'text\': \'死触\\n反抗～如果本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物离开战场，则纳南乱匠进战场时上面有一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「我不必刺穿你的心脏也能让它停止跳动。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fdc1821-4d29-44e7-81b2-c900cb12afb3\', \'multiverseId\': 423968}, \'multiverseid\': 423968}, {\'name\': \'納南亂匠\', \'text\': \'死觸\\n反抗～如果本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物離開戰場，則納南亂匠進戰場時上面有一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「我不必刺穿你的心臟也能讓它停止跳動。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25ec509a-6d49-48f3-8e92-95913e30a37c\', \'multiverseId\': 424152}, \'multiverseid\': 424152}]', '[{\'name\': \'Natürliche Überalterung\', \'text\': \'Lege ein Artefakt deiner Wahl unter die Bibliothek seines Besitzers.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist Torheit, anzunehmen, dass deine kostbaren Erfindungen die Ewigkeit überdauern. Alle Dinge kehren in die Erde zurück." —Nirav, Ältester der Tirahar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424337&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9da38a3-f950-42f4-82d9-fc9350545bd3\', \'multiverseId\': 424337}, \'multiverseid\': 424337}, {\'name\': \'Obsolescencia natural\', \'text\': \'Pon el artefacto objetivo en el fondo de la biblioteca de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Es absurdo creer que tus preciados inventos perdurarán. Todo regresa a la tierra". —Nirav, anciana de Tirahar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d087205c-fe0b-4275-b7ba-e4c193e785fa\', \'multiverseId\': 425625}, \'multiverseid\': 425625}, {\'name\': \'Obsolescence naturelle\', \'text\': "Mettez l\'artefact ciblé au-dessous de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Quelle folie d\'imaginer que vos précieuses inventions seront à l\'épreuve du temps. Tout finit en terre un jour. » —Nirav, ancêtre des Tirahar", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424521&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0df7448-3b7f-490a-a7ee-162355dd8b52\', \'multiverseId\': 424521}, \'multiverseid\': 424521}, {\'name\': \'Obsolescenza Naturale\', \'text\': \'Metti un artefatto bersaglio in fondo al grimorio del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Siete folli se credete che le vostre preziose invenzioni possano sopravvivere. Ogni cosa torna alla terra." —Nirav, anziana dei Tirahar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54ed0d00-3817-49d6-9759-0622faf2048d\', \'multiverseId\': 424705}, \'multiverseid\': 424705}, {\'name\': \'自然廃退\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つを対象とし、それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番下に置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「貴重な発明品に持続性があると思い込むなど愚かなこと。すべては土に還るのです。」 ――ティーラハーの賢者、ニーラブ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'452742bd-3ce0-410d-9a7b-4a93bb368df6\', \'multiverseId\': 424889}, \'multiverseid\': 424889}, {\'name\': \'자연적 폐기\', \'text\': \'마법물체를 목표로 정한다. 그 마법물체를 소유자의 서고 맨 밑에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"소중한 발명품이 영원할 거라고 믿는 것은 어리석은 짓이야. 모든 것은 결국 흙으로 돌아간다." —티라하르 장로 니라브\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fef64350-e508-4df1-ad57-55018f75e3cf\', \'multiverseId\': 425073}, \'multiverseid\': 425073}, {\'name\': \'Obsolescência Natural\', \'text\': \'Coloque o artefato alvo no fundo do grimório de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"É tolice acreditar que suas preciosas invenções vão durar. Todas as coisas retornam ao solo." — Nirav, anciã de Tirahar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3ebce72-64da-4cbe-a841-4b965764ee1b\', \'multiverseId\': 425257}, \'multiverseid\': 425257}, {\'name\': \'Естественное Устаревание\', \'text\': \'Положите целевой артефакт в низ библиотеки его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Глупо было бы думать, что ваши драгоценные изобретения переживут время. Все рано или поздно вернется в землю». — Нирав, старейшина Тирахаров\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4de0bc65-c6a9-4316-b62f-732ef35eff0f\', \'multiverseId\': 425441}, \'multiverseid\': 425441}, {\'name\': \'自然废退\', \'text\': \'将目标神器置于其拥有者的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「相信自己珍贵的发明会长存实属不明智。万物皆归尘土。」 ～蒂厄赫长老妮勒芙\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'618132a6-185a-496b-ba0c-70674c4671eb\', \'multiverseId\': 423969}, \'multiverseid\': 423969}, {\'name\': \'自然廢退\', \'text\': \'將目標神器置於其擁有者的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「相信自己珍貴的發明會長存實屬不明智。萬物皆歸塵土。」 ～蒂厄赫長老妮勒芙\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'953c1b36-20a7-4bfc-b2a0-7d9559bd1615\', \'multiverseId\': 424153}, \'multiverseid\': 424153}]', '[{\'name\': \'Negieren\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Zu beobachten, wie die Bewohner dieser Welt magische Techniken wiederholen, ohne die natürliche Gabe dazu zu besitzen, ist faszinierend. Und frustrierend." —Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424259&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'438542fd-f9dc-4c87-b28f-5877f9eb7924\', \'multiverseId\': 424259}, \'multiverseid\': 424259}, {\'name\': \'Negar\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo que no sea de criatura.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Es fascinante que los habitantes de este plano emulen las técnicas mágicas sin ningún don natural. También es frustrante, la verdad sea dicha". —Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3121d4e-eeab-4612-abf4-c34bf97c6972\', \'multiverseId\': 425547}, \'multiverseid\': 425547}, {\'name\': \'Négation\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort non-créature ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Observer les habitants de ce plan reproduire des techniques magiques sans don inné est absolument fascinant... Et exceptionnellement frustrant. » —Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424443&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c4c6f6e-305b-43e8-bffa-552916d7b172\', \'multiverseId\': 424443}, \'multiverseid\': 424443}, {\'name\': \'Negare\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia non creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Vedere come gli abitanti di questo piano replichino le tecniche magiche senza possederne il dono naturale è affascinante, oltre che frustrante." —Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18b571fb-07e9-4634-b61d-60ed2865a8ad\', \'multiverseId\': 424627}, \'multiverseid\': 424627}, {\'name\': \'否認\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーでない呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「この次元では、魔法の才能のない人々がその技法をうまく再現している。大変興味深いが、不愉快でもある。」 ――ジェイス・ベレレン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf43855a-ffb7-4a44-b3c2-bbbfa89103f8\', \'multiverseId\': 424811}, \'multiverseid\': 424811}, {\'name\': \'부인\', \'text\': \'생물 주문이 아닌 주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 무효화한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"이 차원의 사람들이 타고난 재능 없이도 마법 기술을 복제하는 것은 정말 놀랍지만 실망스럽기도 하군." —제이스 벨레렌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fb0b4dd-0dbf-478c-859d-34b56cfd1777\', \'multiverseId\': 424995}, \'multiverseid\': 424995}, {\'name\': \'Negar\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo que não seja de criatura.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"É fascinante ver como as pessoas deste plano replicam técnicas mágicas sem um dom natural. É frustrante, também." — Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df0c15c7-fb7b-461b-9126-2eec2d3d2858\', \'multiverseId\': 425179}, \'multiverseid\': 425179}, {\'name\': \'Отвергнуть\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое заклинание, не являющееся заклинанием существа.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Люди этого мира воспроизводят магические приемы без всякого природного дара к волшебству. Удивительное зрелище. И раздражающее». — Джейс Белерен\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3843bd5d-af6c-42ba-acb8-3766debf2009\', \'multiverseId\': 425363}, \'multiverseid\': 425363}, {\'name\': \'失效\', \'text\': \'反击目标非生物咒语。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「此时空的人民不需要天赋便可复制魔法技艺，令人称奇。但也令人沮丧。」 ～杰斯贝连\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f52627ab-6633-4a9c-a4ed-e5b6c81ba478\', \'multiverseId\': 423891}, \'multiverseid\': 423891}, {\'name\': \'失效\', \'text\': \'反擊目標非生物咒語。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「此時空的人民不需要天賦便可複製魔法技藝，令人稱奇。但也令人沮喪。」 ～傑斯貝連\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a631039-c2d7-4fd7-94c0-a76da37310a6\', \'multiverseId\': 424075}, \'multiverseid\': 424075}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ornithopter\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Thopter\', \'flavor\': \'„Du willst wissen, wofür wir kämpfen? Dann schau in die Augen dieses Kindes." —Pia Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424386&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3950ce6-0d55-472f-9e18-45342671b01f\', \'multiverseId\': 424386}, \'multiverseid\': 424386}, {\'name\': \'Ornitóptero\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Tóptero\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Quieres saber por qué luchamos? Mira los ojos maravillados de la niña". —Pia Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf4fbc22-c768-4f9d-9964-6afdbd55fecb\', \'multiverseId\': 425674}, \'multiverseid\': 425674}, {\'name\': \'Ornithoptère\', \'text\': \'Vol\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : mécanoptère\', \'flavor\': "« Vous voulez savoir pour quoi nous nous battons ? Regardez l\'émerveillement dans les yeux de cet enfant. » —Pia Nalaàr", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424570&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b97cd74d-87bd-4c1b-8f6c-5a05a54dd113\', \'multiverseId\': 424570}, \'multiverseid\': 424570}, {\'name\': \'Ornitottero\', \'text\': \'Volare\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Tottero\', \'flavor\': \'"Vuoi sapere per cosa lottiamo? Guarda la meraviglia negli occhi di quella bambina." —Pia Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ce4ff06-0956-4a1d-bc16-eed4e0942f36\', \'multiverseId\': 424754}, \'multiverseid\': 424754}, {\'name\': \'羽ばたき飛行機械\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 飛行機械\', \'flavor\': \'「私たちが何のために戦っているのか知りたいというの？あの子の驚いた顔を見てごらんなさい。」 ――ピア・ナラー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab0e648d-9915-43ff-a5b6-61d3b2966242\', \'multiverseId\': 424938}, \'multiverseid\': 424938}, {\'name\': \'퍼덕이는 날틀\', \'text\': \'비행\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 날틀\', \'flavor\': \'"우리가 무얼 위해 싸우는지 알고 싶은가요? 저 아이들의 눈에 깃든 경이로움을 보세요." —피아 날라르\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4ead622-7ecf-4272-9fdb-db3a8654c71e\', \'multiverseId\': 425122}, \'multiverseid\': 425122}, {\'name\': \'Ornitóptero\', \'text\': \'Voar\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Tóptero\', \'flavor\': \'"Quer saber pelo que lutamos? Veja o maravilhamento nos olhos daquela criança." — Pia Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425306&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c8e8439-b5a5-4ba7-a7c5-845490660414\', \'multiverseId\': 425306}, \'multiverseid\': 425306}, {\'name\': \'Орнитоптер\', \'text\': \'Полет\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Топтер\', \'flavor\': \'«Хочешь узнать, за что мы сражаемся? Загляни в глаза ребенку, увидевшему чудо». — Пия Налаар\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fb40f08-d529-4d45-8b06-8af4d5619273\', \'multiverseId\': 425490}, \'multiverseid\': 425490}, {\'name\': \'扑翼机\', \'text\': \'飞行\', \'type\': \'神器生物～振翼机\', \'flavor\': \'「想知道我们为何而战？看看那孩子眼中的光彩就知道了。」 ～琵雅纳拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd6385e7-e8cc-41e8-9b5c-7011ecb1f921\', \'multiverseId\': 424018}, \'multiverseid\': 424018}, {\'name\': \'撲翼機\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'神器生物～振翼機\', \'flavor\': \'「想知道我們為何而戰？看看那孩子眼中的光彩就知道了。」 ～琵雅納拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'173b4c77-5e48-42cd-81eb-2c4908d63a1a\', \'multiverseId\': 424202}, \'multiverseid\': 424202}]', '[{\'name\': \'Paradoxon-Antrieb\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, enttappe alle bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst und die keine Länder sind.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein Blick auf diesen prächtigen Gegenstand überzeugte mich davon, dass Kaladesh meine volle Aufmerksamkeit verdiente. Und tatsächlich, mein Aufenthalt hier war mehr als fruchtbar." —Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424388&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6a2b8f7-9695-4ffd-be95-d0d64339fd87\', \'multiverseId\': 424388}, \'multiverseid\': 424388}, {\'name\': \'Motor de paradojas\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo, endereza todos los permanentes que no sean tierra que controles.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': \'"Una sola mirada a este objeto glorioso me convenció de que Kaladesh merecía toda mi atención. Sin duda, mi tiempo aquí ha dado frutos exquisitos". —Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e195e6c8-6159-4e4d-8f0a-e89d5ba855f5\', \'multiverseId\': 425676}, \'multiverseid\': 425676}, {\'name\': \'Machine paradoxale\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort, dégagez tous les permanents non-terrain que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': "« Il a suffi d\'un regard sur ce formidable objet pour me convaincre que Kaladesh méritait toute mon attention. De toute évidence, mon temps ici a déjà porté de délicieux fruits. » —Tezzeret", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424572&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e29d49e-b30a-4137-9374-43a9adef1c85\', \'multiverseId\': 424572}, \'multiverseid\': 424572}, {\'name\': \'Macchina del Paradosso\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia, STAPpa tutti i permanenti non terra che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': \'"Un\\\'occhiata a questo magnifico dispositivo mi ha convinto a dedicare tutta la mia attenzione a Kaladesh. In effetti, il tempo trascorso qui ha dato ottimi frutti." —Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dd526be-32de-4508-a856-20bae94a9a00\', \'multiverseId\': 424756}, \'multiverseid\': 424756}, {\'name\': \'パラドックス装置\', \'text\': \'あなたが呪文を１つ唱えるたび、あなたがコントロールするすべての土地でないパーマネントをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「この卓越した装置を一目見たとき、カラデシュには専心する価値があると確信したのだ。予想通り、ここでの日々は極上の成果をもたらした。」 ――テゼレット\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0b5fcbd-1611-4b1a-b03b-e6142ce6ba47\', \'multiverseId\': 424940}, \'multiverseid\': 424940}, {\'name\': \'패러독스 엔진\', \'text\': \'당신이 주문을 발동할 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 대지가 아닌 지속물을 모두 언탭한다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'"이 황홀한 장치를 한 번 보고 나서 칼라데시에 모든 관심을 기울여야 한다는 확신이 들었다. 물론 이곳에서 보낸 시간은 대단히 생산적이었다." —테제렛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfb4000c-88b2-4c6d-b487-7ad574473352\', \'multiverseId\': 425124}, \'multiverseid\': 425124}, {\'name\': \'Motor do Paradoxo\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que conjurar uma mágica, desvire todas as permanentes que você controla que não sejam terrenos.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'"Bastou-me olhar este objeto glorioso para convencer-me de que Kaladesh merecia minha total atenção. Certamente meu tempo aqui deu frutos primorosos." — Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efbbf595-65ad-44f8-b895-fe489846343a\', \'multiverseId\': 425308}, \'multiverseid\': 425308}, {\'name\': \'Машина Парадоксов\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание, разверните все не являющиеся землями перманенты под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Один лишь взгляд на эту чудесную вещицу убедил меня, что Каладеш заслуживает моего пристального внимания. И, конечно же, потраченные усилия принесли замечательные плоды». — Теззерет\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69cbe078-ea61-4eb2-b18c-da488a0cdf35\', \'multiverseId\': 425492}, \'multiverseid\': 425492}, {\'name\': \'悖论引擎\', \'text\': \'每当你施放咒语时，重置所有由你操控的非地永久物。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'「我第一眼看到这件精美物品，就晓得卡拉德许值得我倾注全力。也确实如此，我在此付出的光阴已结出丰硕成果。」 ～泰兹瑞\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e2ed3d0-a04b-4bc4-9572-4cce001bd2b8\', \'multiverseId\': 424020}, \'multiverseid\': 424020}, {\'name\': \'悖論引擎\', \'text\': \'每當你施放咒語時，重置所有由你操控的非地永久物。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'「我第一眼看到這件精美物品，就曉得卡拉德許值得我傾注全力。也確實如此，我在此付出的光陰已結出豐碩成果。」 ～泰茲瑞\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3eb553f4-6602-4384-9b3a-432ca01f1806\', \'multiverseId\': 424204}, \'multiverseid\': 424204}]', '[{\'name\': \'Peema-Ätherseherin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Peema-Ätherseherin ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du so viele {E} (Energiemarken), wie die höchste Stärke unter den Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, beträgt.\\nBezahle {E}{E}{E}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl blockt in diesem Zug, falls möglich.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Große Verbindung vernetzt uns alle."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424338&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a16912a-8177-4bc8-97c6-3d881b751fa3\', \'multiverseId\': 424338}, \'multiverseid\': 424338}, {\'name\': \'Adivina del éter de Peema\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Adivina del éter de Peema entre al campo de batalla, obtienes una cantidad de {E} (contadores de energía) igual a la mayor fuerza entre las criaturas que controlas.\\nPagar {E}{E}{E}: La criatura objetivo bloquea este turno si puede.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"La Panconexión nos une a todos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b189f1d-2669-47b3-a576-47000317423d\', \'multiverseId\': 425626}, \'multiverseid\': 425626}, {\'name\': \'Voyante éthérique de Peema\', \'text\': \'Quand la Voyante éthérique de Peema arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez un nombre de {E} (marqueurs « énergie ») égal à la force la plus élevée parmi les créatures que vous contrôlez.\\nPayez {E}{E}{E} : La créature ciblée bloque ce tour-ci si possible.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous sommes tous unis par le Grand conduit. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424522&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'960faf32-c84c-494e-aa64-9b90a9ca4ab2\', \'multiverseId\': 424522}, \'multiverseid\': 424522}, {\'name\': "Veggente dell\'Etere di Peema", \'text\': "Quando la Veggente dell\'Etere di Peema entra nel campo di battaglia, ottieni un ammontare di {E} (segnalini energia) pari alla forza maggiore tra le creature che controlli.\\nPaga {E}{E}{E}: Una creatura bersaglio blocca in questo turno, se può farlo.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il Grande Flusso ci unisce tutti."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcaf6d71-ee6e-4a19-adba-bcaeb78e0b11\', \'multiverseId\': 424706}, \'multiverseid\': 424706}, {\'name\': \'ピーマの霊気予見者\', \'text\': \'ピーマの霊気予見者が戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたがコントロールするクリーチャーの中のパワーの最大値に等しい数の{E}（エネルギー・カウンター）を得る。\\n{E}{E}{E}を支払う：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それは可能ならブロックする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「大導路は私たちすべてと結びついているのです。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b930264d-a592-4978-9ec7-2dfce1c02d27\', \'multiverseId\': 424890}, \'multiverseid\': 424890}, {\'name\': \'피마 에테르 예언자\', \'text\': \'피마 에테르 예언자가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 당신이 조종하는 생물 중 제일 높은 공격력을 가진 생물의 공격력만큼 {E}(에너지 카운터)를 얻는다.\\n{E}{E}{E}를 지불한다: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 가능하면 이 턴에 방어한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 드루이드\', \'flavor\': \'"찬란한 수로는 우리 모두를 연결한다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99e013a1-30e5-4683-a726-32a30d0a4421\', \'multiverseId\': 425074}, \'multiverseid\': 425074}, {\'name\': \'Eteromante de Peema\', \'text\': \'Quando Eteromante de Peema entra no campo de batalha, você recebe uma quantidade de {E} (marcadores de energia) igual ao maior poder entre os das criaturas que você controla.\\nPague {E}{E}{E}: A criatura alvo bloqueia neste turno se estiver apta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"O Grande Conduíte conecta todos nós."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb699549-6ed8-45bc-9b67-14404ffc20ad\', \'multiverseId\': 425258}, \'multiverseid\': 425258}, {\'name\': \'Пимская Эфирная Провидица\', \'text\': \'Когда Пимская Эфирная Провидица выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете {E} (жетоны энергии) в количестве, равном наибольшему значению силы среди существ под вашим контролем.\\nЗаплатите {E}{E}{E}: целевое существо блокирует в этом ходу, если может.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Друид\', \'flavor\': \'«Великий Канал объединяет нас всех».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d166637-fc6b-4909-89f1-e55e1f2cc580\', \'multiverseId\': 425442}, \'multiverseid\': 425442}, {\'name\': \'皮默乙太预言师\', \'text\': \'当皮默乙太预言师进战场时，你得到若干{E}（能量指示物），其数量等同于由你操控的生物中力量最大者的数值。\\n支付{E}{E}{E}：目标生物本回合若能进行阻挡，则须如此作。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「大通联将我们全部串连起来。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e316d91-b794-4ee2-a8b0-32dd2b9dee7e\', \'multiverseId\': 423970}, \'multiverseid\': 423970}, {\'name\': \'皮默乙太預言師\', \'text\': \'當皮默乙太預言師進戰場時，你得到若干{E}（能量指示物），其數量等同於由你操控的生物中力量最大者的數值。\\n支付{E}{E}{E}：目標生物本回合若能進行阻擋，則須如此作。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'「大通聯將我們全部串連起來。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b54e5f0-6c45-4006-ac22-fb5cace321dc\', \'multiverseId\': 424154}, \'multiverseid\': 424154}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pendel der Strukturen\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Pendel der Strukturen ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\n{5}, {T}, opfere das Pendel der Strukturen: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Sein ausgeklügeltes Design enthüllt die Geheimnisse des Ätherflusses.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425729&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b749bdba-68d8-49a9-979f-f183bf264adf\', \'multiverseId\': 425729}, \'multiverseid\': 425729}, {\'name\': \'Péndulo de patrones\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Péndulo de patrones entre al campo de batalla, ganas 3 vidas.\\n{5}, {T}, sacrificar el Péndulo de patrones: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Su elaborado diseño revela los secretos del flujo de éter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'844c3f85-323f-43da-9f49-852550502224\', \'multiverseId\': 425799}, \'multiverseid\': 425799}, {\'name\': \'Pendule à motifs\', \'text\': \'Quand le Pendule à motifs arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 3 points de vie.\\n{5}, {T}, sacrifiez le Pendule à motifs : Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Ses motifs complexes révèle les secrets du flux de l\'Éther.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425739&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ba4499a-dff6-4bfb-aee5-34b5a8a120ad\', \'multiverseId\': 425739}, \'multiverseid\': 425739}, {\'name\': \'Pendolo dei Diagrammi\', \'text\': \'Quando il Pendolo dei Diagrammi entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 3 punti vita.\\n{5}, {T}, Sacrifica il Pendolo dei Diagrammi: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Gli intricati disegni che traccia rivelano i segreti dei flussi dell\'etere.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10c1e2ce-e7c1-4d91-b33c-3e6279648d3d\', \'multiverseId\': 425749}, \'multiverseid\': 425749}, {\'name\': \'霊紋の振り子\', \'text\': \'霊紋の振り子が戦場に出たとき、あなたは３点のライフを得る。\\n{5}, {T}, 霊紋の振り子を生け贄に捧げる：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'精緻な紋様が霊気の流れの秘密を解き明かす。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55c3ec4a-4330-4162-8b15-869627ed1934\', \'multiverseId\': 425759}, \'multiverseid\': 425759}, {\'name\': \'문양을 빚는 추\', \'text\': \'문양을 빚는 추가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 생명 3점을 얻는다.\\n{5}, {T}, 문양을 빚는 추를 희생한다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'이 정교한 무늬는 에테르의 흐름에 감춰진 비밀을 보여준다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dce34580-7e26-42c1-8b76-2337812d6ac7\', \'multiverseId\': 425769}, \'multiverseid\': 425769}, {\'name\': \'Pêndulo dos Padrões\', \'text\': \'Quando Pêndulo dos Padrões entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 3 pontos de vida.\\n{5}, {T}, Sacrifique Pêndulo dos Padrões: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Seus desenhos elaborados revelam segredos do fluxo do éter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffe435ff-a3eb-49ba-b4aa-72ed64fabac2\', \'multiverseId\': 425779}, \'multiverseid\': 425779}, {\'name\': \'Маятник Узоров\', \'text\': \'Когда Маятник Узоров выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете 3 жизни.\\n{5}, {T}, пожертвуйте Маятник Узоров: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Его замысловатая конструкция раскрывает тайны эфира.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11413c1a-2105-4b3f-a7c8-8e2e83da90a9\', \'multiverseId\': 425789}, \'multiverseid\': 425789}, {\'name\': \'调律钟摆\', \'text\': \'当调律钟摆进战场时，你获得3点生命。\\n{5}，{T}，牺牲调律钟摆：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'此精巧设计透露出乙太流的秘密。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6428f256-bcec-41b1-9f5d-4b33f83c0b6b\', \'multiverseId\': 425709}, \'multiverseid\': 425709}, {\'name\': \'調律鐘擺\', \'text\': \'當調律鐘擺進戰場時，你獲得3點生命。\\n{5}，{T}，犧牲調律鐘擺：抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'此精巧設計透露出乙太流的秘密。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa3fbc4e-733b-4fb7-b319-f9d03366227b\', \'multiverseId\': 425719}, \'multiverseid\': 425719}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pias Revolution\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Nichtspielsteinartefakt aus dem Spiel auf deinen Friedhof gelegt wird, bringe es auf deine Hand zurück, es sei denn, ein Gegner deiner Wahl lässt sich von Pias Revolution 3 Schadenspunkte zufügen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Pia hatte bei all ihrer Hingabe nur ein großes Ziel vor Augen: einen wirklichen, andauernden Wandel herbeizuführen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424310&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fad3610-2e09-4ad6-8011-06cbc57b677a\', \'multiverseId\': 424310}, \'multiverseid\': 424310}, {\'name\': \'Revolución de Pia\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un artefacto que no sea ficha vaya a tu cementerio desde el campo de batalla, regresa esa carta a tu mano a menos que el oponente objetivo permita que la Revolución de Pia le haga 3 puntos de daño a sí mismo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'La pasión de Pia estaba dirigida al conjunto: a la forja de un cambio real y duradero.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9b6c455-4f0e-4f60-abe4-d31c49ce9180\', \'multiverseId\': 425598}, \'multiverseid\': 425598}, {\'name\': \'Révolte de Pia\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un artefact non-jeton est mis dans votre cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, renvoyez cette carte dans votre main à moins que la Révolte de Pia n\'inflige 3 blessures à un adversaire ciblé.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Pia avait pour passion la mise en place de changements visibles et durables.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424494&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c7df8d9-99ea-49d8-9e46-8140a7ca93fa\', \'multiverseId\': 424494}, \'multiverseid\': 424494}, {\'name\': \'Rivoluzione di Pia\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un artefatto non pedina viene messo nel tuo cimitero dal campo di battaglia, riprendi in mano quella carta a meno che un avversario bersaglio non si faccia infliggere 3 danni dalla Rivoluzione di Pia.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'La passione di Pia non si limitava alla propria vita, ma era dedita alla realizzazione di cambiamenti reali e duraturi per tutti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99cb26de-243c-4f18-b1fb-33ddb53ad412\', \'multiverseId\': 424678}, \'multiverseid\': 424678}, {\'name\': \'ピアの革命\', \'text\': \'トークンでないアーティファクトが１つ戦場からあなたの墓地に置かれるたび、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーが「ピアの革命はそのプレイヤーに３点のダメージを与える」を選ばないかぎり、そのカードをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'ピアの情熱は大局を目指している。真実の永続性のある変化をもたらすことだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10f386d4-22bf-4064-b936-93eaddb0cec0\', \'multiverseId\': 424862}, \'multiverseid\': 424862}, {\'name\': \'피아의 혁명\', \'text\': \'토큰이 아닌 마법물체가 전장에서 당신의 무덤에 놓일 때마다, 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대가 피아의 혁명이 자신에게 피해 3점을 입히게 하지 않으면 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'피아의 열정은 실제 지속되는 변화라는 큰 그림에 초점이 맞춰져 있었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76304a82-7ba3-4d90-9433-fbc46b9a85d0\', \'multiverseId\': 425046}, \'multiverseid\': 425046}, {\'name\': \'Revolução de Pia\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um artefato que não seja ficha é colocado em seu cemitério vindo do campo de batalha, devolva aquele card para sua mão, a menos que o oponente alvo faça com que Revolução de Pia cause 3 pontos de dano a si próprio.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'A paixão de Pia era direcionada por uma perspectiva mais ampla — realizar uma mudança real e duradoura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfc453f5-3388-4ec4-8dd9-a5cd4a32e8a6\', \'multiverseId\': 425230}, \'multiverseid\': 425230}, {\'name\': \'Революция Пии\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда не являющийся фишкой артефакт попадает с поля битвы на ваше кладбище, верните ту карту в вашу руку, если только целевой оппонент не заставит Революцию Пии нанести себе 3 повреждения.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Страсть Пии была направлена на большую цель — добиться настоящих и длительных изменений.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'923a07a2-d978-46f4-94b4-9bca01e47615\', \'multiverseId\': 425414}, \'multiverseid\': 425414}, {\'name\': \'琵雅的革命\', \'text\': \'每当一个非衍生物的神器从战场进入你的坟墓场时，除非目标对手让琵雅的革命对他造成3点伤害，否则将该牌移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'琵雅的心血则全数倾注在了大局上～倾注在为真正实现长久改变的奋斗上。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3af6f106-d412-47ea-aa24-7eb0d9f5112b\', \'multiverseId\': 423942}, \'multiverseid\': 423942}, {\'name\': \'琵雅的革命\', \'text\': \'每當一個非衍生物的神器從戰場進入你的墳墓場時，除非目標對手讓琵雅的革命對他造成3點傷害，否則將該牌移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'琵雅的心血則全數傾注在了大局上～傾注在為真正實現長久改變的奮鬥上。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23e5fadc-7c57-4d87-bc7f-12e9f23de211\', \'multiverseId\': 424126}, \'multiverseid\': 424126}]', '[{\'name\': \'Preiskampf-Konstrukt\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Schrotter, eine Untergrundbewegung mit einer Leidenschaft für Konstrukt-Preiskämpfe, waren schon vor der Razzia des Konsulats den Renegaten freundlich gesinnt. Es dauerte nicht lange, bis sie ihre besten Streiter in den Kampf schickten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424391&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b6f464d-1fe5-4129-9973-e73d894bcfcf\', \'multiverseId\': 424391}, \'multiverseid\': 424391}, {\'name\': \'Constructo luchador\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Los Batalladores, un grupo contracultural con pasión por las luchas entre autómatas, ya simpatizaba con los renegados antes del endurecimiento del Consulado. No les llevó mucho tiempo enviarles a sus mejores luchadores para el conflicto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d3c7021-cb11-4914-aa86-33f32e941954\', \'multiverseId\': 425679}, \'multiverseid\': 425679}, {\'name\': \'Construction pugiliste\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': "Les Ferrailleurs, un groupe clandestin réunissant des passionnés du combat d\'automates, avaient des idées renégates bien avant la répression du Consulat. Il ne leur fallut pas longtemps pour engager leurs meilleurs bagarreurs dans la lutte.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424575&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1d47941-b939-4c63-8b39-08f5c1ed3398\', \'multiverseId\': 424575}, \'multiverseid\': 424575}, {\'name\': \'Costrutto da Combattimento\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'I Rissosi, un gruppo segreto con la passione per i combattimenti tra automi, erano rinnegati ancor prima della repressione del Consolato. Non attesero un istante per prestare i loro lottatori migliori alla causa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c796e0f3-d595-4625-bec4-d96a0a5606f7\', \'multiverseId\': 424759}, \'multiverseid\': 424759}, {\'name\': \'拳闘構築物\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'屑鉄会は、自動機械による乱闘を好む合法とは言いにくいグループで、領事府の弾圧以前から改革派寄りだった。彼らが最高の格闘機械を対立に投入するのは時間の問題だった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424943&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'667cbb10-7991-4cdf-8093-a61b8a493e91\', \'multiverseId\': 424943}, \'multiverseid\': 424943}, {\'name\': \'상금 사냥꾼 기계장치\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 자동기계\', \'flavor\': \'자동장치 결투에 대한 열정으로 가득한 지하 단체 "싸움꾼들"은 영사관의 탄압이 시작되기 전부터 무법자들에게 우호적이었다. 얼마의 시간도 지나지 않아 단체에서 가장 뛰어난 싸움꾼들을 전투에 파견하기 시작했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ba39d73-bf69-4655-b38d-19f113b9d071\', \'multiverseId\': 425127}, \'multiverseid\': 425127}, {\'name\': \'Constructo Lutador\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Os Sucateiros, grupo clandestino apaixonado por brigas de autômato, tinham inclinações renegadas antes mesmo da repressão do Consulado. Não levou muito tempo para que eles cedessem seus melhores lutadores para o conflito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b7d7001-27a9-49f6-85c8-ed3f4ebf7ad0\', \'multiverseId\': 425311}, \'multiverseid\': 425311}, {\'name\': \'Конструкция-Гладиатор\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': \'Дуэлянты — подпольное общество любителей сражений автоматов — склонялись к идеям отступников еще до репрессий Консульства. Вскоре на улицы вышли их лучшие бойцы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2a8b0c5-290c-411c-8cae-3657ec81bdf8\', \'multiverseId\': 425495}, \'multiverseid\': 425495}, {\'name\': \'争耀组构体\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'拆解手是个热衷于机械兽互搏的地下团体，早在执政院镇压前就已倾向乱匠。他们不久便派出最好的搏斗械加入战团。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b7ee861-a822-4e28-be70-573670559bbf\', \'multiverseId\': 424023}, \'multiverseid\': 424023}, {\'name\': \'爭耀組構體\', \'type\': \'神器生物～組構體\', \'flavor\': \'拆解手是個熱衷於機械獸互搏的地下團體，早在執政院鎮壓前就已傾向亂匠。他們不久便派出最好的搏鬥械加入戰團。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19a60a66-d4a0-4fb2-82cf-3c5f1af61f46\', \'multiverseId\': 424207}, \'multiverseid\': 424207}]', '[{\'name\': \'Präzise Harpunenschützin\', \'text\': \'Rebellion — Wenn die Präzise Harpunenschützin ins Spiel kommt und falls in diesem Zug eine bleibende Karte unter deiner Kontrolle das Spiel verlassen hat, zerstöre eine getappte Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zwerg, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Anscheinend kann man hier unten sogar noch besser jagen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424234&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a54a5a92-2909-4143-9aa5-ec3f699e61e1\', \'multiverseId\': 424234}, \'multiverseid\': 424234}, {\'name\': \'Arponeadora ojo de halcón\', \'text\': \'Revuelta — Cuando la Arponeadora ojo de halcón entre al campo de batalla, si un permanente que controlabas dejó el campo de batalla este turno, destruye la criatura girada objetivo que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Enano guerrero\', \'flavor\': \'"Las presas son incluso mejores aquí abajo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60e6cc7d-e20a-40ff-b622-fbb9b4b68dde\', \'multiverseId\': 425522}, \'multiverseid\': 425522}, {\'name\': "Harponneuse d\'élite", \'text\': "Révolte — Quand la Harponneuse d\'élite arrive sur le champ de bataille, si un permanent que vous contrôliez a quitté le champ de bataille ce tour-ci, détruisez une créature engagée ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature : nain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Voilà un bien meilleur terrain de chasse. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424418&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea6f604c-9ed8-4683-9cc7-aa12481337bf\', \'multiverseId\': 424418}, \'multiverseid\': 424418}, {\'name\': \'Fiociniera Infallibile\', \'text\': \'Rivolta — Quando la Fiociniera Infallibile entra nel campo di battaglia, se un permanente che controllavi ha lasciato il campo di battaglia in questo turno, distruggi una creatura TAPpata bersaglio controllata da un avversario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Nano\', \'flavor\': \'"Sembra che quaggiù la caccia sia persino migliore."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fecfa4b4-426d-4397-8e52-760d2bee320e\', \'multiverseId\': 424602}, \'multiverseid\': 424602}, {\'name\': \'銛撃ちの名手\', \'text\': \'紛争 ― 銛撃ちの名手が戦場に出たとき、このターンにあなたがコントロールするパーマネントが戦場を離れていた場合、対戦相手がコントロールするタップ状態のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドワーフ・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「この辺りではいい狩りができそうだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05e63cca-2bef-449f-a8bc-3e582e3c7f8f\', \'multiverseId\': 424786}, \'multiverseid\': 424786}, {\'name\': \'예리한 작살 사냥꾼\', \'text\': \'봉기 — 예리한 작살 사냥꾼이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종한 지속물이 이 턴에 전장을 떠났다면, 상대가 조종하는 탭된 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 드워프 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"아래쪽에는 사냥감이 훨씬 더 많아 보이는군."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ee3f908-c399-442d-b085-8a55ea827c05\', \'multiverseId\': 424970}, \'multiverseid\': 424970}, {\'name\': \'Arpoadora Certeira\', \'text\': \'Revolta — Quando Arpoadora Certeira entrar no campo de batalha, se uma permanente que você controlava deixou o campo de batalha neste turno, destrua a criatura virada alvo que um oponente controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anão Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Parece que há caça ainda melhor aqui embaixo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cc59e04-0002-48c2-afa4-3a5e19038e40\', \'multiverseId\': 425154}, \'multiverseid\': 425154}, {\'name\': \'Меткая Гарпунщица\', \'text\': \'Бунт — Когда Меткая Гарпунщица выходит на поле битвы, если находившийся под вашим контролем перманент покинул поле битвы в этом ходу, уничтожьте целевое повернутое существо под контролем оппонента.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гном Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Похоже, внизу охота даже лучше».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8574a902-3ff3-446f-a05c-40e3a1029e8d\', \'multiverseId\': 425338}, \'multiverseid\': 425338}, {\'name\': \'神准鱼叉手\', \'text\': \'反抗～当神准鱼叉手进战场时，若本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物离开战场，则消灭目标由对手操控且已横置的生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～矮人／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「似乎云下的捕猎更精彩。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5540770-27ac-42a6-8e38-ae29b2d3144c\', \'multiverseId\': 423866}, \'multiverseid\': 423866}, {\'name\': \'神準魚叉手\', \'text\': \'反抗～當神準魚叉手進戰場時，若本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物離開戰場，則消滅目標由對手操控且已橫置的生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～矮人／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「似乎雲下的捕獵更精彩。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5840d10-6819-432d-886d-ac037dc2c61f\', \'multiverseId\': 424050}, \'multiverseid\': 424050}]', '[{\'name\': \'Präziser Schlag\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +1/+0 und Erstschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Schlag dort zu, wo es wehtut, und schlag immer zuerst zu."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424311&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb244004-8cc3-4e0a-97bd-2500418e982d\', \'multiverseId\': 424311}, \'multiverseid\': 424311}, {\'name\': \'Golpe preciso\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +1/+0 y gana la habilidad de dañar primero hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Golpea donde duele, y golpea siempre primero".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1caa8e3-b17b-4a9d-91c9-cf926c10bf44\', \'multiverseId\': 425599}, \'multiverseid\': 425599}, {\'name\': \'Frappe de précision\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +1/+0 et acquiert l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Frappez là où ça fait mal, et frappez toujours en premier. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424495&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcd6ec8d-2696-4ea0-933c-a85ad95d0a9b\', \'multiverseId\': 424495}, \'multiverseid\': 424495}, {\'name\': \'Colpo Preciso\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +1/+0 e ha attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Colpisci dove fa male e sempre per primo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec54c99f-ad63-4dd3-bc19-981bf2d496d1\', \'multiverseId\': 424679}, \'multiverseid\': 424679}, {\'name\': \'正確な一撃\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋０の修整を受けるとともに先制攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「弱いところを突け。常に最初に突け。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b7628c3-a294-4389-a05b-89d4bdef07fc\', \'multiverseId\': 424863}, \'multiverseid\': 424863}, {\'name\': \'정밀 공격\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+0을 받고 선제공격을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"아픈 곳을 언제나 가장 먼저 공격해."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6945b7cd-dc04-424c-829a-3095e6dc55fd\', \'multiverseId\': 425047}, \'multiverseid\': 425047}, {\'name\': \'Golpe Preciso\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +1/+0 e ganha iniciativa até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Bata onde dói, e sempre acerte primeiro."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f095caba-0759-470a-bffa-594b5ac6d46e\', \'multiverseId\': 425231}, \'multiverseid\': 425231}, {\'name\': \'Точный Удар\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает +1/+0 и Первый удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Бей в слабое место и всегда бей первым».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a713e010-70d6-4164-9fe5-d62796aa2c89\', \'multiverseId\': 425415}, \'multiverseid\': 425415}, {\'name\': \'精确一击\', \'text\': \'目标生物得+1/+0且获得先攻异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「朝着弱点打，先下手为强。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423943&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6e32374-2ef9-4ce7-bea8-9391ad82a8ef\', \'multiverseId\': 423943}, \'multiverseid\': 423943}, {\'name\': \'精確一擊\', \'text\': \'目標生物得+1/+0且獲得先攻異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「朝痛處下手，先下手為強。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef8cf07e-c44f-45fa-b778-3349e4377e0d\', \'multiverseId\': 424127}, \'multiverseid\': 424127}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rachsüchtiger Rebell\', \'text\': \'Rebellion — Wenn der Rachsüchtige Rebell ins Spiel kommt und falls in diesem Zug eine bleibende Karte unter deiner Kontrolle das Spiel verlassen hat, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, -3/-3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Äthergeborener, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Einige Äthergeborene schlossen sich der Rebellion aus Profitgier an, andere, um für ihre Freiheit zu kämpfen, und wieder andere, um Rache zu nehmen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424292&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52a82b7f-0d66-4bb1-b768-24169b25e890\', \'multiverseId\': 424292}, \'multiverseid\': 424292}, {\'name\': \'Rebelde vengador\', \'text\': \'Revuelta — Cuando el Rebelde vengador entre al campo de batalla, si un permanente que controlabas dejó el campo de batalla este turno, la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente obtiene -3/-3 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero etergénito\', \'flavor\': \'Algunos etergénitos se unieron a la rebelión para obtener riquezas; otros, su libertad; y algunos, venganza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df6c78ae-0457-4724-a7e9-be5cd065a0e1\', \'multiverseId\': 425580}, \'multiverseid\': 425580}, {\'name\': \'Rebelle vengeur\', \'text\': "Révolte — Quand le Rebelle vengeur arrive sur le champ de bataille, si un permanent que vous contrôliez a quitté le champ de bataille ce tour-ci, une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle gagne -3/-3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : éthérien et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Certains éthériens rejoignirent la rébellion pour l\'argent, d\'autres pour la liberté et d\'autres encore par vengeance.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424476&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b29a97c3-83ca-44f0-8b10-10b0b1cfdff1\', \'multiverseId\': 424476}, \'multiverseid\': 424476}, {\'name\': \'Ribelle Vendicativo\', \'text\': \'Rivolta — Quando il Ribelle Vendicativo entra nel campo di battaglia, se un permanente che controllavi ha lasciato il campo di battaglia in questo turno, una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario prende -3/-3 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Eteride\', \'flavor\': \'Alcuni eteridi si unirono alla ribellione per profitto, altri per difendere la propria libertà, altri ancora per vendetta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4e7f913-f69c-4ec8-8057-8b8726f2520e\', \'multiverseId\': 424660}, \'multiverseid\': 424660}, {\'name\': \'復讐に燃えた反逆者\', \'text\': \'紛争 ― 復讐に燃えた反逆者が戦場に出たとき、このターンにあなたがコントロールするパーマネントが戦場を離れていた場合、対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－３/－３の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 霊基体・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'改革派に加わる霊基体には、利益が目当ての者も自由を目指す者もいる。中には復讐が目的の者もいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31e6093e-2db6-42d7-b48c-7165cfd73cc3\', \'multiverseId\': 424844}, \'multiverseid\': 424844}, {\'name\': \'복수심에 불타는 반란군\', \'text\': \'봉기 — 복수심에 불타는 반란군이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종한 지속물이 이 턴에 전장을 떠났다면, 상대가 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -3/-3을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 에테르붙이 전사\', \'flavor\': \'일부 에테르붙이들은 이익을 위해 반란에 참가했다. 하지만 자유를 위해서 또는 복수를 위해서 참가한 자들도 많다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c53f0526-2204-42eb-b019-001579fc9742\', \'multiverseId\': 425028}, \'multiverseid\': 425028}, {\'name\': \'Rebelde Vingativo\', \'text\': \'Revolta — Quando Rebelde Vingativo entra no campo de batalha, se uma permanente que você controlava deixou o campo de batalha neste turno, a criatura alvo que um oponente controla recebe -3/-3 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Etergênito Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Alguns etergênitos se juntaram à rebelião pelo lucro, outros, pela própria liberdade, outros ainda, por vingança.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c85d4f0-1758-4e58-a647-f830924a029a\', \'multiverseId\': 425212}, \'multiverseid\': 425212}, {\'name\': \'Мстительный Повстанец\', \'text\': \'Бунт — Когда Мстительный Повстанец выходит на поле битвы, если находившийся под вашим контролем перманент покинул поле битвы в этом ходу, целевое существо под контролем оппонента получает -3/-3 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эфирид Воин\', \'flavor\': \'Одни эфириды участвуют в бунте ради денег, другие — ради собственной свободы, а третьи — ради мести.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff36d275-6549-49c1-8094-f36dfe6071be\', \'multiverseId\': 425396}, \'multiverseid\': 425396}, {\'name\': \'复仇反抗军\', \'text\': \'反抗～当复仇反抗军进战场时，若本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物离开战场，则目标由对手操控的生物得-3/-3直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～乙太种／战士\', \'flavor\': \'乙太种加入叛乱之目的各不相同：有的是为了谋取利益，有的则是为了争取自由，还有的则是为了复仇雪恨。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dc1208b-36f3-4f4b-b68f-f920a3502bfd\', \'multiverseId\': 423924}, \'multiverseid\': 423924}, {\'name\': \'復仇反抗軍\', \'text\': \'反抗～當復仇反抗軍進戰場時，若本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物離開戰場，則目標由對手操控的生物得-3/-3直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～乙太種／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'乙太種加入叛亂的目的各不相同：有的是為了謀取利益，有的則是為了爭取自由，還有的則是為了復仇雪恨。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43d24464-6723-4573-b5ed-ed2c42a61545\', \'multiverseId\': 424108}, \'multiverseid\': 424108}]', '[{\'name\': \'Razzia des Konsulats\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Razzia des Konsulats ins Spiel kommt, schicke alle Artefakte, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, ins Exil, bis die Razzia des Konsulats das Spiel verlässt.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Werkstätten liegen still. Unsere Schöpfungen wurden beschlagnahmt. Sie haben getötet, was uns lebendig machte." —Pia Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424230&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02cb5478-b5ca-465c-8042-3aebba1c07cf\', \'multiverseId\': 424230}, \'multiverseid\': 424230}, {\'name\': \'Opresión del Consulado\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Opresión del Consulado entre al campo de batalla, exilia todos los artefactos que controlan tus oponentes hasta que la Opresión del Consulado deje el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Hay silencio en los talleres. Nuestras creaciones han sido requisadas. Han matado lo que nos daba vida". —Pia Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b273403-2387-4e15-ad99-d3fe2da1d4de\', \'multiverseId\': 425518}, \'multiverseid\': 425518}, {\'name\': \'Répression du Consulat\', \'text\': "Quand la Répression du Consulat arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez tous les artefacts que votre adversaire contrôle jusqu\'à ce que la Répression du Consulat quitte le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Les ateliers sont silencieux. Nos créations ont été saisies. Ils ont tué notre désir de vivre. » —Pia Nalaàr\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424414&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cae79ac-a96f-4872-a94b-3c661054daef\', \'multiverseId\': 424414}, \'multiverseid\': 424414}, {\'name\': \'Repressione del Consolato\', \'text\': \'Quando la Repressione del Consolato entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia tutti gli artefatti controllati dai tuoi avversari finché la Repressione del Consolato non lascia il campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"I laboratori sono vuoti. Le nostre creazioni sono state confiscate. Hanno distrutto ciò che ci rendeva vivi." —Pia Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2662d1ff-ae0b-421f-bbc8-a9dc810df52c\', \'multiverseId\': 424598}, \'multiverseid\': 424598}, {\'name\': \'領事府の弾圧\', \'text\': \'領事府の弾圧が戦場に出たとき、領事府の弾圧が戦場を離れるまで、対戦相手がコントロールするすべてのアーティファクトを追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「作業場はどこも静まり返っている。作品も奪われてしまった。領事府は、私たちの命を奪ったようなものだわ。」 ――ピア・ナラー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e0a9f58-88ab-4de9-b3d3-68c0c8425236\', \'multiverseId\': 424782}, \'multiverseid\': 424782}, {\'name\': \'영사관 단속\', \'text\': \'영사관 단속이 전장에 들어올 때, 영사관 단속이 전장을 떠날 때까지 당신의 상대들이 조종하는 모든 마법물체를 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"작업장은 쥐 죽은 듯 고요했고 우리는 발명품들을 모두 빼앗겼어. 우리를 살아있게 만드는 힘을 빼앗긴 거야." —피아 날라르\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d7d1de4-28c2-4a7d-979f-0f2aee76e8c0\', \'multiverseId\': 424966}, \'multiverseid\': 424966}, {\'name\': \'Repressão do Consulado\', \'text\': \'Quando Repressão do Consulado entrar no campo de batalha, exile todos os artefatos que seus oponentes controlam até que Repressão do Consulado deixe o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Há silêncio nas oficinas. Nossas criações nos foram tomadas. Eles mataram o que nos dava vida." — Pia Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f4a81fa-d277-4f2e-b530-6a7a6e6ac702\', \'multiverseId\': 425150}, \'multiverseid\': 425150}, {\'name\': \'Репрессии Консульства\', \'text\': \'Когда Репрессии Консульства выходят на поле битвы, изгоните все артефакты под контролем ваших оппонентов до тех пор, пока Репрессии Консульства не покинут поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«В мастерских стало тихо. У нас отняли наши творения. Они убили то, что делало нас живыми». — Пия Налаар\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6fbac42-ff1b-401c-b451-b1f046099845\', \'multiverseId\': 425334}, \'multiverseid\': 425334}, {\'name\': \'执政院镇压\', \'text\': \'当执政院镇压进战场时，放逐所有由对手操控的神器，直到执政院镇压离开战场为止。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「工作室已然静寂无声。我们的心血造物都被掠夺殆尽。他们彻底扼杀了我们的生存之本。」 ～琵雅纳拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30d4162c-d05c-4d82-9847-fd75bd846972\', \'multiverseId\': 423862}, \'multiverseid\': 423862}, {\'name\': \'執政院鎮壓\', \'text\': \'當執政院鎮壓進戰場時，放逐所有由對手操控的神器，直到執政院鎮壓離開戰場為止。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「工作室已然靜寂無聲。我們的心血造物都被掠奪殆盡。他們徹底扼殺了我們的生存之本。」 ～琵雅納拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d9f17de-f8d0-4c49-a96e-1130790d08d9\', \'multiverseId\': 424046}, \'multiverseid\': 424046}]', '[{\'name\': \'Regent des Wüsterwinkels\', \'text\': \'Improvisieren (Deine Artefakte können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)\\nFliegend\\n{1}{R}: Der Regent des Wüsterwinkels erhält +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'Die Drachen, die die Turmspitzen in Wüsterwinkel säumen, zeugen von der wilden Unabhängigkeit dieses Landstrichs.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424300&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fbe1829-2a67-4a00-b634-a34e5c7666aa\', \'multiverseId\': 424300}, \'multiverseid\': 424300}, {\'name\': \'Regente de Improlibre\', \'text\': \'Improvisar. (Tus artefactos pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada artefacto que gires una vez que termines de activar habilidades de maná paga {1}.)\\nVuela.\\n{1}{R}: El Regente de Improlibre obtiene +2/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'Los dragones que coronan las torres de Improlibre simbolizan la férrea independencia de la zona.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc554fae-371a-4d82-9b90-688f448ae6fc\', \'multiverseId\': 425588}, \'multiverseid\': 425588}, {\'name\': \'Régent de Librefusion\', \'text\': "Improvisation (Vos artefacts peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque artefact que vous engagez après avoir activé des capacités de mana paie {1}.)\\nV\\n{1}{R} : Le Régent de Librefusion gagne +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': \'Les dragons juchés sur les tours de Librefusion symbolisent la farouche indépendance de la zone.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424484&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26513e6a-1753-4cb1-aa74-f406c85addba\', \'multiverseId\': 424484}, \'multiverseid\': 424484}, {\'name\': \'Reggente di Freejam\', \'text\': \'Improvvisare (I tuoi artefatti possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni artefatto che TAPpi dopo aver attivato le abilità di mana corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nVare\\n{1}{R}: Il Reggente di Freejam prende +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': \'I draghi appollaiati sulle torri di Freejam simboleggiano la fiera indipendenza della zona.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2be17abe-5cc9-46d0-be5e-43b81b83a0ed\', \'multiverseId\': 424668}, \'multiverseid\': 424668}, {\'name\': \'無秩序街の主\', \'text\': \'即席（あなたのアーティファクトが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。あなたはあなたのアーティファクトをタップして、１個あたり{1}の支払いに代えてもよい。）\\n飛行\\n{1}{R}：ターン終了時まで、無秩序街の主は＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'無秩序街の塔に鎮座するドラゴンは、この地域の断固とした独立を象徴している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86a70d23-76b5-48f4-a9ac-768563bded1e\', \'multiverseId\': 424852}, \'multiverseid\': 424852}, {\'name\': \'자유창작구역 섭정\', \'text\': \'급조 (당신의 마법물체들은 이 주문을 발동하는 것을 도울 수 있다. 마나 능력을 활성화한 후에 탭하는 각 마법물체는 이 주문의 비용 중 {1}을 지불한다.)\\n비행\\n{1}{R}: 자유창작구역 섭정은 턴종료까지 +2/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 용\', \'flavor\': \'자유창작구역의 탑 꼭대기에 자리 잡은 용은 이 구역의 열렬한 자주정신을 상징한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7187291-2a3d-4e59-92a5-96ad384593d7\', \'multiverseId\': 425036}, \'multiverseid\': 425036}, {\'name\': \'Regente de Impróvia\', \'text\': \'Improvisar (Seus artefatos podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada artefato que você vira após terminar de ativar habilidades de mana paga por {1}.)\\nVr\\n{1}{R}: Regente de Impróvia recebe +2/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': \'Os dragões empoleirados nas torres de Impróvia simbolizam a ferina independência da região.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa3208d3-e494-4b52-b300-151bb520df05\', \'multiverseId\': 425220}, \'multiverseid\': 425220}, {\'name\': \'Регент Вольной Стороны\', \'text\': \'Импровизация (Ваши артефакты могут помочь разыграть это заклинание. Каждый артефакт, который вы поворачиваете после того, как вы закончили активировать мана-способности, считается оплатой {1}.)\\nПолет\\n{1}{R}: Регент Вольной Стороны получает +2/+0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': \'Драконы, усевшиеся на башнях Вольной Стороны, символизируют непримиримую независимость этого места.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'263046da-011e-4e53-bf56-51ca5f9ac621\', \'multiverseId\': 425404}, \'multiverseid\': 425404}, {\'name\': \'费李杰龙侯\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒语能用你的神器来协助施放。你起动完法术力异能之后每横置一个神器，就能为此咒语支付{1}。）\\n飞行\\n{1}{R}：费李杰龙侯得+2/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～龙\', \'flavor\': \'栖息在费李杰高塔上的巨龙代表了这块区域彪悍的独立性。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64547a58-f765-44a7-a3da-82d93f7d973d\', \'multiverseId\': 423932}, \'multiverseid\': 423932}, {\'name\': \'費李傑龍侯\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒語能用你的神器來協助施放。你起動完魔法力異能之後每橫置一個神器，就能為此咒語支付{1}。）\\n飛行\\n{1}{R}：費李傑龍侯得+2/+0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～龍\', \'flavor\': \'棲息在費李傑高塔上的巨龍代表了這塊區域彪悍的獨立性。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6488c560-c988-4fa3-b2e2-31b01cc49464\', \'multiverseId\': 424116}, \'multiverseid\': 424116}]', '[{\'name\': \'Renegaten-Fluchtplan\', \'text\': \'Eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl erhält Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. Erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Servo-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein. (Effekte, die „zerstören", zerstören eine bleibende Karte mit Unzerstörbarkeit nicht, und falls sie eine Kreatur ist, kann sie nicht durch Schaden zerstört werden.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Du kannst nicht bekämpfen, was du nicht findest.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424288&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b50539f-ac76-4c21-9b00-9e2996d4b06a\', \'multiverseId\': 424288}, \'multiverseid\': 424288}, {\'name\': \'Huida del renegado\', \'text\': \'El permanente objetivo gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno. Crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Servo incolora 1/1. (Los efectos que dicen "destruye" no destruyen a un permanente con la habilidad de indestructible y, si es una criatura, no puede ser destruida por daño.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'No se puede luchar contra lo que no se encuentra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a165553-f818-43b9-8a93-833669401221\', \'multiverseId\': 425576}, \'multiverseid\': 425576}, {\'name\': \'Subterfuge du renégat\', \'text\': "Le permanent ciblé acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Servo. (Les effets qui disent « détruisez » ne détruisent pas un permanent avec l\'indestructible, et si c\'est une créature, elle ne peut pas être détruite par des blessures.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Vous ne pouvez combattre ce que vous ne pouvez trouver.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424472&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a29902a0-2cc1-4da6-b422-3c077a0ebd83\', \'multiverseId\': 424472}, \'multiverseid\': 424472}, {\'name\': \'Fuga dei Rinnegati\', \'text\': \'Un permanente bersaglio ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno. Crea una pedina creatura artefatto Servomeccanismo 1/1 incolore. (Gli effetti che dicono "distruggi" non distruggono un permanente con indistruttibile e, se è una creatura, non può essere distrutta dal danno.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Non puoi affrontare ciò che non puoi trovare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fab5cfc7-97ae-44d7-9d07-03d78d4c7661\', \'multiverseId\': 424656}, \'multiverseid\': 424656}, {\'name\': \'改革派の逃亡\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つを対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは破壊不能を得る。無色の１/１の霊気装置・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。（破壊不能を持つパーマネントは「破壊する」と書かれた効果では破壊されない。それがクリーチャーなら、ダメージによっても破壊されない。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'見つけられなければ戦うこともできない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3009deb9-3eb7-4b59-a29c-cdb55c6e681a\', \'multiverseId\': 424840}, \'multiverseid\': 424840}, {\'name\': \'무법자의 도주\', \'text\': \'지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물은 턴종료까지 무적을 얻는다. 1/1 무색 서보 마법물체 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다. (무적을 가진 지속물은 "파괴"라고 명시된 효과에 의해 파괴되지 않으며, 그것이 생물이라면 피해에 의해 파괴될 수 없다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'찾을 수 없는 상대와 싸울 수는 없다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55cf1dd4-932f-46c5-9ec2-b1f4b638714d\', \'multiverseId\': 425024}, \'multiverseid\': 425024}, {\'name\': \'Escapada do Renegado\', \'text\': \'A permanente alvo ganha indestrutível até o final do turno. Crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Servus. (Os efeitos que dizem "destrua" não destroem uma permanente com indestrutível, e, se for uma criatura, ela não pode ser destruída por dano.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Você não pode enfrentar aquilo que não consegue encontrar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2743767-a149-48bf-9982-f348d09ed9d8\', \'multiverseId\': 425208}, \'multiverseid\': 425208}, {\'name\': \'Побег Отступника\', \'text\': \'Целевой перманент получает Неразрушимость до конца хода. Создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Сервотрон. (Эффекты с указанием «уничтожьте» не уничтожают перманент с Неразрушимостью, а если это существо, то его нельзя уничтожить повреждениями.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Нельзя сражаться с тем, что не можешь найти.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae391735-35c9-470a-b4b7-11e84d62a5b3\', \'multiverseId\': 425392}, \'multiverseid\': 425392}, {\'name\': \'乱匠脱身\', \'text\': \'目标永久物获得不灭异能直到回合结束。派出一个1/1无色自动机衍生神器生物。（注明「消灭」的效应不会消灭具不灭异能的永久物，且如果其是生物，则不会因伤害而消灭。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'你无法与找不到的事物为敌。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5785200-5681-4942-ad6c-708d6b4a3136\', \'multiverseId\': 423920}, \'multiverseid\': 423920}, {\'name\': \'亂匠脫身\', \'text\': \'目標永久物獲得不滅異能直到回合結束。派出一個1/1無色自動機衍生神器生物。（註明「消滅」的效應不會消滅具不滅異能的永久物，且如果其是生物，則不會因傷害而消滅。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'你無法與找不到的事物為敵。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75850bff-aab7-4431-b870-efd456d9f8a4\', \'multiverseId\': 424104}, \'multiverseid\': 424104}]', "[{'name': 'Renegaten-Velopilot', 'text': 'Immer wenn der Renegaten-Velopilot getappt wird, kann eine Kreatur deiner Wahl in diesem Zug nicht blocken.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Zwerg, Pilot', 'flavor': 'Viele Veteranen der Ovalhatz-Rennstrecke setzen ihre Talente für die Sache der Renegaten ein.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424353&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0e75701-3e4f-4d6e-aa54-0933a0e2f010', 'multiverseId': 424353}, 'multiverseid': 424353}, {'name': 'Forjaciclos renegado', 'text': 'Siempre que el Forjaciclos renegado se gire, la criatura objetivo no puede bloquear este turno.', 'type': 'Criatura — Enano piloto', 'flavor': 'Muchos veteranos del circuito ovalado consagraron su talento a la causa de los renegados.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425641&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f52f7318-4cd9-4ccf-afc0-7df60f295764', 'multiverseId': 425641}, 'multiverseid': 425641}, {'name': 'Gyrocycliste renégat', 'text': 'À chaque fois que le Gyrocycliste renégat devient engagé, la créature ciblée ne peut pas bloquer ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Créature : nain et pilote', 'flavor': 'Bon nombre de vétérans du circuit de la Course ovale ont mis leur talent au service des renégats.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424537&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cf681c9b-e6ec-4fbe-8a73-60ae364e7fb8', 'multiverseId': 424537}, 'multiverseid': 424537}, {'name': 'Rotatore Rinnegato', 'text': 'Ogniqualvolta il Rotatore Rinnegato viene TAPpato, una creatura bersaglio non può bloccare in questo turno.', 'type': 'Creatura — Pilota Nano', 'flavor': 'Molti veterani del Circuito Ovale hanno votato il proprio talento alla causa dei rinnegati.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424721&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9ffefb8f-64c5-4649-9cf9-fe61d5610e40', 'multiverseId': 424721}, 'multiverseid': 424721}, {'name': '改革派の車輪職人', 'text': '改革派の車輪職人がタップ状態になるたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それではブロックできない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドワーフ・操縦士', 'flavor': '楕円競走のベテランが大勢、自分たちの才能を改革派の役に立てている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424905&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55655ecd-2703-49f7-b6cb-4decac9a8d20', 'multiverseId': 424905}, 'multiverseid': 424905}, {'name': '무법자 바퀴조종사', 'text': '무법자 바퀴조종사가 탭될 때마다, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 이 턴에 방어할 수 없다.', 'type': '생물 — 드워프 조종사', 'flavor': '많은 타원경주로 베테랑들이 자신의 재능을 무법자들의 대의를 위해 사용했다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425089&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07f7b7ae-cdba-4f33-8c98-3a9dde3becc7', 'multiverseId': 425089}, 'multiverseid': 425089}, {'name': 'Rodociclista Renegado', 'text': 'Toda vez que Rodociclista Renegado é virado, a criatura alvo não pode bloquear neste turno.', 'type': 'Criatura — Anão Piloto', 'flavor': 'Muitos veteranos da Pista Oval forneceram seus talentos à causa dos renegados.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425273&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '33f88633-1fb6-4c9c-946f-0ecb71234326', 'multiverseId': 425273}, 'multiverseid': 425273}, {'name': 'Колесовщик-Отступник', 'text': 'Каждый раз, когда Колесовщик-Отступник поворачивается, целевое существо не может блокировать в этом ходу.', 'type': 'Существо — Гном Пилот', 'flavor': 'Многие опытные гонщики с Овального Трека посвятили свои таланты делу отступников.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425457&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4c28d01c-ce69-44cf-86ef-7c1f7f10f81f', 'multiverseId': 425457}, 'multiverseid': 425457}, {'name': '乱匠驾轮', 'text': '每当乱匠驾轮成为横置时，目标生物本回合不能进行阻挡。', 'type': '生物～矮人／驾手', 'flavor': '逐榄赛道的许多赛车老手转为将自身天赋投身于乱匠事业。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423985&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ccbc3bfb-6f72-406e-8f10-ebe1fe3c2614', 'multiverseId': 423985}, 'multiverseid': 423985}, {'name': '亂匠駕輪', 'text': '每當亂匠駕輪成為橫置時，目標生物本回合不能進行阻擋。', 'type': '生物～矮人／駕手', 'flavor': '逐欖賽道的許多賽車老手轉為將自身天賦投投身於亂匠事業。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424169&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b450de60-4b94-4857-b7dc-d459ca11427f', 'multiverseId': 424169}, 'multiverseid': 424169}]", '[{\'name\': \'Renegaten-Zusammentrommler\', \'text\': \'Rebellion — Wenn der Renegaten-Zusammentrommler ins Spiel kommt und falls in diesem Zug eine bleibende Karte unter deiner Kontrolle das Spiel verlassen hat, bringe eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 2 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Dieser Kampf betrifft uns alle."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424352&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd46ce6a-9752-45d4-aed0-fa5d0b5a0bfd\', \'multiverseId\': 424352}, \'multiverseid\': 424352}, {\'name\': \'Arengador renegado\', \'text\': \'Revuelta — Cuando el Arengador renegado entre al campo de batalla, si un permanente que controlabas dejó el campo de batalla este turno, regresa la carta de permanente objetivo con coste de maná convertido de 2 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Esta lucha es de todos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b1519bd-2dc5-4fea-9c65-367a86ee4e3c\', \'multiverseId\': 425640}, \'multiverseid\': 425640}, {\'name\': \'Rallieur renégat\', \'text\': \'Révolte — Quand le Rallieur renégat arrive sur le champ de bataille, si un permanent que vous contrôliez a quitté le champ de bataille ce tour-ci, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte de permanent avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 2 ciblée depuis votre cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Ce combat appartient à chacun d\'entre nous. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424536&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49b07917-e451-4e59-a3db-684922336975\', \'multiverseId\': 424536}, \'multiverseid\': 424536}, {\'name\': \'Attivista Rinnegato\', \'text\': "Rivolta — Quando l\'Attivista Rinnegato entra nel campo di battaglia, se un permanente che controllavi ha lasciato il campo di battaglia in questo turno, rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta permanente bersaglio con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 2 dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Questa guerra ci appartiene."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'841ac0f2-c34a-4ef7-9876-b25e6d0baf2a\', \'multiverseId\': 424720}, \'multiverseid\': 424720}, {\'name\': \'改革派の結集者\', \'text\': \'紛争 ― 改革派の結集者が戦場に出たとき、このターンにあなたがコントロールするパーマネントが戦場を離れていた場合、あなたの墓地から点数で見たマナ・コストが２以下のパーマネント・カード１枚を対象とし、それを戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「これは俺たち全員の戦いだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e9aed3f-9d19-4012-a6ba-6f76d2b80c0f\', \'multiverseId\': 424904}, \'multiverseid\': 424904}, {\'name\': \'무법자 선동가\', \'text\': \'봉기 — 무법자 선동가가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종한 지속물이 이 턴에 전장을 떠났다면, 당신의 무덤에 있는 전환마나비용이 2 이하인 지속물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 전장으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"이 싸움은 우리 모두의 것이다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2ee2a68-bd0c-44dd-abb2-466b2dbc5264\', \'multiverseId\': 425088}, \'multiverseid\': 425088}, {\'name\': \'Arregimentador Renegado\', \'text\': \'Revolta — Quando Arregimentador Renegado entrar no campo de batalha, se uma permanente que você controlava deixou o campo de batalha neste turno, devolva o card de permanente alvo com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a 2 de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Esta luta pertence a todos nós."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c986216-d50b-4ce3-acfc-9dd542af8984\', \'multiverseId\': 425272}, \'multiverseid\': 425272}, {\'name\': \'Сплотитель Отступников\', \'text\': \'Бунт — Когда Сплотитель Отступников выходит на поле битвы, если находившийся под вашим контролем перманент покинул поле битвы в этом ходу, верните целевую карту перманента с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более 2 из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Эта борьба принадлежит нам всем».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425456&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89a24391-6f91-4df4-8af3-739baaec6433\', \'multiverseId\': 425456}, \'multiverseid\': 425456}, {\'name\': \'乱匠召集人\', \'text\': \'反抗～当乱匠召集人进战场时，若本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物离开战场，则将目标总法术力费用等于或小于2的永久牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「这是属于我们所有人的战斗。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1ed5954-c39e-434b-be4f-6ce87192bc85\', \'multiverseId\': 423984}, \'multiverseid\': 423984}, {\'name\': \'亂匠召集人\', \'text\': \'反抗～當亂匠召集人進戰場時，若本回合某個由你操控的永久物離開戰場，則將目標總魔法力費用等於或小於2的永久物牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「這是屬於我們所有人的戰鬥。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c82fdf71-12fb-4c58-9e05-f9f5a0dde538\', \'multiverseId\': 424168}, \'multiverseid\': 424168}]', "[{'name': 'Reservoir-Schreiter', 'text': 'Wenn der Reservoir-Schreiter ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 3 Lebenspunkte dazu und {E}{E}{E} (drei Energiemarken).', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt', 'flavor': 'Die Versorgungslinien der Renegaten sind notwendigerweise sehr mobil und schwer zu unterbrechen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424393&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f9f93de9-18ba-4c76-b586-a656b6e54388', 'multiverseId': 424393}, 'multiverseid': 424393}, {'name': 'Caminante de la reserva', 'text': 'Cuando el Caminante de la reserva entre al campo de batalla, ganas 3 vidas y obtienes {E}{E}{E} (tres contadores de energía).', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Constructo', 'flavor': 'Las líneas de suministros de los renegados son, por necesidad, móviles y difíciles de interceptar.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425681&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '52b6766a-2701-4c68-beae-8e67228e67e9', 'multiverseId': 425681}, 'multiverseid': 425681}, {'name': 'Marcheur réservoir', 'text': 'Quand le Marcheur réservoir arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 3 points de vie et {E}{E}{E} (trois marqueurs « énergie »).', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : construction', 'flavor': 'Les lignes de ravitaillement des renégats sont par nécessité mobiles et difficiles à perturber.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424577&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '415dd28a-01a9-4994-9f42-19d763643c4d', 'multiverseId': 424577}, 'multiverseid': 424577}, {'name': 'Serbatoio Semovente', 'text': 'Quando il Serbatoio Semovente entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 3 punti vita e ottieni {E}{E}{E} (tre segnalini energia).', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto', 'flavor': 'Le linee di rifornimento dei rinnegati sono, per necessità, mobili e difficili da interrompere.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424761&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b67d6100-e302-4ebe-8f89-45f4dfddef67', 'multiverseId': 424761}, 'multiverseid': 424761}, {'name': '歩行貯蔵器', 'text': '歩行貯蔵器が戦場に出たとき、あなたは３点のライフを得て、{E}{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター３個）を得る。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': '改革派の補給線は、その必要上から、機動性に富み妨害が困難になっている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424945&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '57394b12-4b43-42db-9a4c-1df0225c6782', 'multiverseId': 424945}, 'multiverseid': 424945}, {'name': '저장소 보행자', 'text': '저장소 보행자가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 생명 3점과 {E}{E}{E}(에너지 카운터 세 개)를 얻는다.', 'type': '마법물체 생물 — 자동기계', 'flavor': '무법자들의 공급로는 유동적일 수 밖에 없어 차단하기가 어렵다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425129&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '52ce98b9-3614-4ab9-87ae-7c2cc7f8ff4e', 'multiverseId': 425129}, 'multiverseid': 425129}, {'name': 'Caminhante do Reservatório', 'text': 'Quando Caminhante do Reservatório entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 3 pontos de vida e recebe {E}{E}{E} (três marcadores de energia).', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato — Constructo', 'flavor': 'As linhas de suprimento dos renegados são, por necessidade, móveis e difíceis de cortar.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425313&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '547a32e8-9ac7-4468-8b64-ae402e477da9', 'multiverseId': 425313}, 'multiverseid': 425313}, {'name': 'Резервуарный Ходун', 'text': 'Когда Резервуарный Ходун выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете 3 жизни и {E}{E}{E} (три жетона энергии).', 'type': 'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция', 'flavor': 'Средства снабжения отступники вынуждены делать подвижными и такими, чтобы им сложно было помешать.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425497&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '931042d6-5489-469d-9557-f605f0aed6bf', 'multiverseId': 425497}, 'multiverseid': 425497}, {'name': '贮能库搬运械', 'text': '当贮能库搬运械进战场时，你获得3点生命且得到{E}{E}{E}（三个能量指示物）。', 'type': '神器生物～组构体', 'flavor': '迫于形势，乱匠的补给线既机动灵活，又难以滋扰。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424025&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dab9d218-c8f8-44a7-85a7-57197bbe0881', 'multiverseId': 424025}, 'multiverseid': 424025}, {'name': '貯能庫搬運械', 'text': '當貯能庫搬運械進戰場時，你獲得3點生命且得到{E}{E}{E}（三個能量指示物）。', 'type': '神器生物～組構體', 'flavor': '迫於形勢，亂匠的補給線既機動靈活，又難以滋擾。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424209&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9bc2a8a8-c1d1-431d-8a16-b37d18c7841b', 'multiverseId': 424209}, 'multiverseid': 424209}]", '[{\'name\': \'Rishkar, Peema-Renegat\', \'text\': \'Wenn Rishkar, Peema-Renegat, ins Spiel kommt, lege je eine +1/+1-Marke auf bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl.\\nJede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und auf der mindestens eine Marke liegt, hat „{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {G}."\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Äther ist die Seele von Kaladesh und alle Seelen sollten frei sein."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424341&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cb7d5e2-54f2-4d27-91ba-38c826857077\', \'multiverseId\': 424341}, \'multiverseid\': 424341}, {\'name\': \'Rishkar, renegado de Peema\', \'text\': \'Cuando Rishkar, renegado de Peema entre al campo de batalla, elige hasta dos criaturas objetivo y pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada una.\\nCada criatura que controlas con un contador sobre ella tiene "{T}: Agrega {G} a tu reserva de maná".\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"El éter es el alma de Kaladesh, y todas las almas deben ser libres".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22e95caf-b7ff-4d34-b31b-47c4e013ccb5\', \'multiverseId\': 425629}, \'multiverseid\': 425629}, {\'name\': \'Rishkar, renégat de Peema\', \'text\': "Quand Rishkar, renégat de Peema arrive sur le champ de bataille, ciblez jusqu\'à deux créatures. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chacune d\'elles.\\nChaque créature que vous contrôlez avec un marqueur sur elle a « {T} : Ajoutez {G} à votre réserve. »", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': "« L\'Éther est l\'âme de Kaladesh, et toutes les âmes devraient être libres. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424525&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'624fb404-ecfc-473c-a2f5-408e6e8c674f\', \'multiverseId\': 424525}, \'multiverseid\': 424525}, {\'name\': \'Rishkar, Rinnegato di Peema\', \'text\': \'Quando Rishkar, Rinnegato di Peema entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli fino a due creature bersaglio e metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ciascuna.\\nOgni creatura con un segnalino che controlli ha "{T}: Aggiungi {G} alla tua riserva di mana".\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'etere è l\\\'anima di Kaladesh e ogni anima deve essere libera."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76519d07-fc87-45be-a737-93e651b18854\', \'multiverseId\': 424709}, \'multiverseid\': 424709}, {\'name\': \'ピーマの改革派、リシュカー\', \'text\': \'ピーマの改革派、リシュカーが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー最大２体を対象とし、それらの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。\\nあなたがコントロールするカウンターが置かれている各クリーチャーはそれぞれ「{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「霊気は言わばカラデシュの魂。魂は自由であるべきだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5103d451-972f-41a4-91a1-955e128b075f\', \'multiverseId\': 424893}, \'multiverseid\': 424893}, {\'name\': \'피마의 무법자 리시카르\', \'text\': \'피마의 무법자 리시카르가 전장에 들어올 때, 생물을 최대 두 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들에게 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 각각 올려놓는다.\\n당신이 조종하는 생물 중 카운터가 놓여진 각 생물은 "{T}: {G}를 당신의 마나풀에 추가한다."를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 엘프 드루이드\', \'flavor\': \'"에테르는 칼라데시의 영혼이야. 모든 영혼은 자유로워야 해."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66d55cfb-c392-44bb-ab2a-3fca3bad71ba\', \'multiverseId\': 425077}, \'multiverseid\': 425077}, {\'name\': \'Rishkar, Renegado de Peema\', \'text\': \'Quando Rishkar, Renegado de Peema, entrar no campo de batalha, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada uma de até duas criaturas alvo.\\nCada criatura que você controla com um marcador tem "{T}: Adicione {G} a sua reserva de mana."\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"O éter é a alma de Kaladesh, e todas as almas deveriam ser livres."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'501d87df-a98a-49d5-947d-8f7904b1d61e\', \'multiverseId\': 425261}, \'multiverseid\': 425261}, {\'name\': \'Ришкар, Пимский Отступник\', \'text\': \'Когда Ришкар, Пимский Отступник выходит на поле битвы, положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое из не более двух целевых существ.\\nКаждое существо под вашим контролем, на котором есть жетон, имеет способность «{T}: добавьте {G} в ваше хранилище маны».\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Эльф Друид\', \'flavor\': \'«Эфир — душа Каладеша, а любая душа должна быть свободна».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'487bc86d-1104-4f34-be90-ba8ee4ccad41\', \'multiverseId\': 425445}, \'multiverseid\': 425445}, {\'name\': \'皮默乱匠李什克\', \'text\': \'当皮默乱匠李什克进战场时，在至多两个目标生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n每个由你操控且其上有指示物的生物具有「{T}：加{G}到你的法术力池中。」\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「乙太是卡拉德许的灵魂，而所有灵魂都应自由无羁。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85d66cef-ae37-43b0-8dd3-40cd3fbfd559\', \'multiverseId\': 423973}, \'multiverseid\': 423973}, {\'name\': \'皮默亂匠李什克\', \'text\': \'當皮默亂匠李什克進戰場時，在至多兩個目標生物上各放置一個+1/+1指示物。\\n每個由你操控且其上有指示物的生物具有「{T}：加{G}到你的魔法力池中。」\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物～妖精／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'「乙太是卡拉德許的靈魂，而所有靈魂都應自由無羈。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56e37c7a-52ae-415a-b810-34ea7ddbcd54\', \'multiverseId\': 424157}, \'multiverseid\': 424157}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rishkars Expertise\', \'text\': \'Ziehe so viele Karten, wie die höchste Stärke unter den Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, beträgt.\\nDu kannst eine Karte mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 5 oder weniger aus deiner Hand wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Große Verbindung kontrollieren? Du kannst auch versuchen, einen Fluss mit deinen Händen zu teilen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424342&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11186c06-a5e9-4c85-845d-a2aa162513b0\', \'multiverseId\': 424342}, \'multiverseid\': 424342}, {\'name\': \'Pericia de Rishkar\', \'text\': \'Roba una cantidad de cartas igual a la mayor fuerza entre las criaturas que controlas.\\nPuedes lanzar una carta de tu mano con coste de maná convertido de 5 o menos sin pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Controlar la Panconexión? Sería como alterar el curso de un río con las manos desnudas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bcb3c58-79f9-4d8f-acba-f39190031d8c\', \'multiverseId\': 425630}, \'multiverseid\': 425630}, {\'name\': \'Expertise de Rishkar\', \'text\': \'Piochez un nombre de cartes égal à la force la plus élevée parmi les créatures que vous contrôlez.\\nVous pouvez lancer une carte avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 5 depuis votre main sans payer son coût de mana.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Contrôler le Grand conduit ? Vous auriez tôt fait de détourner une rivière avec les mains. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424526&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25e3a767-d7b1-431c-a4f8-e61c083b5530\', \'multiverseId\': 424526}, \'multiverseid\': 424526}, {\'name\': \'Competenza di Rishkar\', \'text\': \'Pesca carte pari alla forza maggiore tra le creature che controlli.\\nPuoi lanciare una carta con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 5 dalla tua mano senza pagare il suo costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Controllare il Grande Flusso? Tanto vale cercare di deviare un fiume a mani nude."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26ec6dde-2768-4ba0-8cfd-c9ff6c6964c1\', \'multiverseId\': 424710}, \'multiverseid\': 424710}, {\'name\': \'リシュカーの巧技\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーの中のパワーの最大値に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\\nあなたは、あなたの手札から点数で見たマナ・コストが５以下のカード１枚を、そのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「大導路を制御する？君なら川の流れを逆向きにもできるのだろうね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67ecbd10-7a26-452a-8375-339a6006ecfa\', \'multiverseId\': 424894}, \'multiverseid\': 424894}, {\'name\': \'리시카르의 전문 지식\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물 중 제일 높은 공격력을 가진 생물의 공격력만큼 카드를 뽑는다.\\n당신은 당신의 손에서 전환마나비용이 5 이하인 카드를 마나 비용을 지불하지 않고 발동할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"찬란한 수로를 통제한다고? 손으로 강줄기를 바꾸는 게 더 쉬울 걸."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db874d14-f7fb-4534-a4c7-d5d6f4697d34\', \'multiverseId\': 425078}, \'multiverseid\': 425078}, {\'name\': \'Especialidade de Rishkar\', \'text\': \'Compre uma quantidade de cards equivalente ao maior poder entre as criaturas que você controla.\\nVocê pode conjurar um card com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a 5 da sua mão sem pagar seu custo de mana.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Controlar o Grande Conduíte? Mais vale tentar desviar um rio com as mãos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c7cbd6b-8baf-4c87-86c5-2f39e6c08ccd\', \'multiverseId\': 425262}, \'multiverseid\': 425262}, {\'name\': \'Мастерство Ришкара\', \'text\': \'Возьмите количество карт, равное наибольшему значению силы среди существ под вашим контролем.\\nВы можете разыграть карту заклинания с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более 5 из вашей руки без оплаты ее мана-стоимости.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Управлять Великим Каналом? С тем же успехом можно попытаться остановить реку голыми руками».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edf8156b-afab-40ec-bafc-65d36427d510\', \'multiverseId\': 425446}, \'multiverseid\': 425446}, {\'name\': \'李什克的专才\', \'text\': \'抓若干牌，其数量等同于由你操控的生物中力量最大者的数值。\\n你可以从你手上施放一张总法术力费用等于或小于5的牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「控制大通联？你还不如试试徒手使河水改道。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c398d574-6846-4240-a24e-625e486a7fcb\', \'multiverseId\': 423974}, \'multiverseid\': 423974}, {\'name\': \'李什克的專才\', \'text\': \'抽若干牌，其數量等同於由你操控的生物中力量最大者的數值。\\n你可以從你手上施放一張總魔法力費用等於或小於5的牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「控制大通聯？你還不如試試徒手使河水改道。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df29db0b-9931-4797-ad0b-a7ff05a10f87\', \'multiverseId\': 424158}, \'multiverseid\': 424158}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rücksichtsloser Rennfahrer\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nImmer wenn der Rücksichtslose Rennfahrer getappt wird, kannst du eine Karte abwerfen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Pilot\', \'flavor\': \'Illegale Straßenrennen erwiesen sich als perfekte Übung, Patrouillen des Konsulats abzuhängen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424314&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a4fc71b-cb0e-4075-a591-f92b58db94e0\', \'multiverseId\': 424314}, \'multiverseid\': 424314}, {\'name\': \'Piloto temerario\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nSiempre que el Piloto temerario se gire, puedes descartar una carta. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Piloto humano\', \'flavor\': \'Las carreras ilegales de vehículos se convirtieron en una práctica perfecta para evitar las patrullas del Consulado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bda824cf-2e91-448d-a34b-eb5f769ce4b2\', \'multiverseId\': 425602}, \'multiverseid\': 425602}, {\'name\': \'Coureur téméraire\', \'text\': "Initiative\\nÀ chaque fois que le Coureur téméraire devient engagé, vous pouvez vous défausser d\'une carte. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et pilote\', \'flavor\': "Les courses de rue illégales s\'avérèrent un entraînement idéal pour éviter les patrouilles du Consulat.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424498&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab729a28-7bb5-4581-a9c9-170250af4cdf\', \'multiverseId\': 424498}, \'multiverseid\': 424498}, {\'name\': \'Pilota Temerario\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso\\nOgniqualvolta il Pilota Temerario viene TAPpato, puoi scartare una carta. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pilota Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Le corse illegali si rivelarono un ottimo esercizio per imparare a evitare le pattuglie del Consolato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b552f191-06dd-4f51-a254-ac919e46b74c\', \'multiverseId\': 424682}, \'multiverseid\': 424682}, {\'name\': \'無謀なレーサー\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n無謀なレーサーがタップ状態になるたび、あなたはカード１枚を捨ててもよい。そうしたなら、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・操縦士\', \'flavor\': \'街路での違法な競走が、領事府の警備を避ける理想的な練習になっていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c4bfff6-b170-4773-ada8-5669d18d99f0\', \'multiverseId\': 424866}, \'multiverseid\': 424866}, {\'name\': \'무모한 경주자\', \'text\': \'선제공격\\n무모한 경주자가 탭될 때마다, 당신은 카드 한 장을 버릴 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 조종사\', \'flavor\': \'불법 길거리 경주는 영사관 순찰병을 따돌리기 위한 완벽한 연습이었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b7fbf26-c563-4eb2-867c-c6d2fb78d0d0\', \'multiverseId\': 425050}, \'multiverseid\': 425050}, {\'name\': \'Piloto Ousado\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nToda vez que Piloto Ousado é virado, você pode descartar um card. Se fizer isso, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Piloto\', \'flavor\': \'Corridas de rua ilegais acabaram sendo o treinamento perfeito para evitar patrulhas do Consulado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e57aa15-bdda-40b2-b938-bdd6f58441d1\', \'multiverseId\': 425234}, \'multiverseid\': 425234}, {\'name\': \'Безрассудный Гонщик\', \'text\': \'Первый удар\\nКаждый раз, когда Безрассудный Гонщик становится повернутым, вы можете сбросить карту. Если вы это делаете, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Пилот\', \'flavor\': \'Нелегальные уличные гонки оказались отличной тренировкой, чтобы спасаться от патрулей Консульства.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3363064d-eef5-4b64-b851-6c41b4eeb601\', \'multiverseId\': 425418}, \'multiverseid\': 425418}, {\'name\': \'鲁莽赛手\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n每当鲁莽赛手成为横置时，你可以弃一张牌。若你如此作，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／驾手\', \'flavor\': \'非法的街头赛车最适合用来练习避开执政院的巡逻队。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36808572-efb7-49c0-afbe-c46eda09829f\', \'multiverseId\': 423946}, \'multiverseid\': 423946}, {\'name\': \'魯莽賽手\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n每當魯莽賽手成為橫置時，你可以棄一張牌。若你如此作，則抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／駕手\', \'flavor\': \'非法的街頭賽車最適合用來練習避開執政院的巡邏隊。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00a9590f-6832-4362-ad1d-664433440614\', \'multiverseId\': 424130}, \'multiverseid\': 424130}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schatzhüter\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Schatzhüter stirbt, decke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek auf, bis du eine Karte aufdeckst, die kein Land ist und deren umgewandelte Manakosten 3 oder weniger betragen. Du kannst die Karte wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege alle aufgedeckten Karten, die nicht auf diese Weise gewirkt wurden, in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424396&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d83cf85-03d9-49a8-be3f-57d2bd94b44f\', \'multiverseId\': 424396}, \'multiverseid\': 424396}, {\'name\': \'Cuidador del tesoro\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Cuidador del tesoro muera, muestra cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que muestres una carta que no sea tierra con coste de maná convertido de 3 o menos. Puedes lanzar esa carta sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon todas las cartas que muestres de esta manera y no lances en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9d2d720-6836-4f30-8af7-8810bbe1b898\', \'multiverseId\': 425684}, \'multiverseid\': 425684}, {\'name\': \'Gardien du trésor\', \'text\': "Quand le Gardien du trésor meurt, révélez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez une carte non-terrain avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 3. Vous pouvez lancer cette carte sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez toutes les cartes révélées non lancées de cette manière au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424580&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28c4ba5e-a046-42f3-9f9c-0e005b633df8\', \'multiverseId\': 424580}, \'multiverseid\': 424580}, {\'name\': \'Guardiano del Tesoro\', \'text\': \'Quando il Guardiano del Tesoro muore, rivela carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non riveli una carta non terra con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 3. Puoi lanciare quella carta senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Metti tutte le carte rivelate non lanciate in questo modo in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f82a02b-59c6-4377-a7ff-e98b69a46f15\', \'multiverseId\': 424764}, \'multiverseid\': 424764}, {\'name\': \'財宝の守り手\', \'text\': \'財宝の守り手が死亡したとき、点数で見たマナ・コストが３以下の土地でないカードが公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを１枚ずつ公開する。あなたはそのカードをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。これにより公開された唱えられていないすべてのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc4e1526-a141-4f6d-87cf-f0c594cb3650\', \'multiverseId\': 424948}, \'multiverseid\': 424948}, {\'name\': \'보물 수호자\', \'text\': \'보물 수호자가 죽을 때, 전환마나비용이 3 이하인 대지가 아닌 카드가 공개될 때까지 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 공개한다. 당신은 마나 비용을 지불하지 않고 그 카드를 발동할 수 있다. 이렇게 발동되지 않은 공개된 카드는 모두 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 무작위로 넣는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 자동기계\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41fc2273-da4c-4b27-9275-5e2b51f7e088\', \'multiverseId\': 425132}, \'multiverseid\': 425132}, {\'name\': \'Guardião do Tesouro\', \'text\': \'Quando Guardião do Tesouro morrer, revele cards do topo de seu grimório até revelar um card que não seja terreno com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a 3. Você pode conjurar aquele card sem pagar seu custo de mana. Coloque todos os cards revelados não conjurados desta forma no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c00fd535-40e1-4e76-ac53-69ec45b917a6\', \'multiverseId\': 425316}, \'multiverseid\': 425316}, {\'name\': \'Хранитель Сокровищ\', \'text\': \'Когда Хранитель Сокровищ умирает, показывайте карты с верха вашей библиотеки до тех пор, пока вы не покажете не являющуюся землей карту с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более 3. Вы можете разыграть ту карту без уплаты ее мана-стоимости. Положите все показанные карты, не разыгранные таким образом, в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f35abb34-2f1a-44e4-9176-653c0da4667c\', \'multiverseId\': 425500}, \'multiverseid\': 425500}, {\'name\': \'宝藏守卫\', \'text\': \'当宝藏守卫死去时，从你牌库顶开始展示牌，直到你展示出一张总法术力费用等于或小于3的非地牌为止。你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。将所有以此法展示且未施放的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c17fd2cc-8a87-4067-b2a8-bbbe39b7c0eb\', \'multiverseId\': 424028}, \'multiverseid\': 424028}, {\'name\': \'寶藏守衛\', \'text\': \'當寶藏守衛死去時，從你牌庫頂開始展示牌，直到你展示出一張總魔法力費用等於或小於3的非地牌為止。你可以施放該牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。將所有以此法展示且未施放的牌以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～組構體\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ad84d1a-222b-4119-ac8d-2cfafe3ea255\', \'multiverseId\': 424212}, \'multiverseid\': 424212}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schiffswrack-Muräne\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Schiffswrack-Muräne ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du {E}{E}{E}{E} (vier Energiemarken).\\nBezahle {E}: Die Schiffswrack-Muräne erhält +2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Fisch\', \'flavor\': \'Schiffswracks sind ein Segen für die lokale Fauna, denn sie bieten Unterschlupf und Äther.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424264&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a42c6e2-da6e-4927-81a8-51c9c6ac6fae\', \'multiverseId\': 424264}, \'multiverseid\': 424264}, {\'name\': \'Morena de naufragios\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Morena de naufragios entre al campo de batalla, obtienes {E}{E}{E}{E} (cuatro contadores de energía).\\nPagar {E}: La Morena de naufragios obtiene +2/-2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pez\', \'flavor\': \'Los naufragios hacen maravillas por la fauna local; proporcionan refugio y éter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a608286e-c617-4355-9d64-b933ef0285d7\', \'multiverseId\': 425552}, \'multiverseid\': 425552}, {\'name\': \'Murène des épaves\', \'text\': "Quand la Murène des épaves arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez {E}{E}{E}{E} (quatre marqueurs « énergie »).\\nPayez {E} : La Murène des épaves gagne +2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : poisson\', \'flavor\': \'Les épaves font des miracles pour la faune locale, elles fournissent refuge et Éther.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424448&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c5ff956-a719-4bfe-ac3f-b9643f2cf162\', \'multiverseId\': 424448}, \'multiverseid\': 424448}, {\'name\': \'Murena dei Relitti\', \'text\': \'Quando la Murena dei Relitti entra nel campo di battaglia, ottieni {E}{E}{E}{E} (quattro segnalini energia).\\nPaga {E}: La Murena dei Relitti prende +2/-2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pesce\', \'flavor\': \'I naufragi fanno meraviglie per la fauna locale, fornendo sia riparo che etere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04365342-04b7-489b-a371-0c804fef549d\', \'multiverseId\': 424632}, \'multiverseid\': 424632}, {\'name\': \'難破船ウツボ\', \'text\': \'難破船ウツボが戦場に出たとき、あなたは{E}{E}{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター４個）を得る。\\n{E}を支払う：ターン終了時まで、難破船ウツボは＋２/－２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 魚\', \'flavor\': \'難破船は周辺の生物に好都合である。隠れ家と霊気の両方が手に入るからだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67fdf6ab-c900-4956-8c96-e7df7979117b\', \'multiverseId\': 424816}, \'multiverseid\': 424816}, {\'name\': \'난파선 곰치\', \'text\': \'난파선 곰치가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 {E}{E}{E}{E}(에너지 카운터 네 개)를 얻는다.\\n{E}를 지불한다: 난파선 곰치는 턴종료까지 +2/-2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 어류\', \'flavor\': \'난파선은 현지 어류들에게 놀라운 일을 한다. 즉 보금자리와 에테르를 제공한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28ccd524-c7d9-43db-9771-171b165f1a2a\', \'multiverseId\': 425000}, \'multiverseid\': 425000}, {\'name\': \'Moreia do Naufrágio\', \'text\': \'Quando Moreia do Naufrágio entra no campo de batalha, você recebe {E}{E}{E}{E} (quatro marcadores de energia).\\nPague {E}: Moreia do Naufrágio recebe +2/-2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Peixe\', \'flavor\': \'Os naufrágios são uma maravilha para a fauna local, fornecendo tanto abrigo quanto éter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df5c764b-31a1-400f-abd5-57498097b70c\', \'multiverseId\': 425184}, \'multiverseid\': 425184}, {\'name\': \'Мурена Кораблекрушений\', \'text\': \'Когда Мурена Кораблекрушений выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете {E}{E}{E}{E} (четыре жетона энергии).\\nЗаплатите {E}: Мурена Кораблекрушений получает +2/-2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Рыба\', \'flavor\': \'Кораблекрушения — настоящий дар для морских обитателей. Они получают и укрытия, и эфир.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b806d0e-d618-4493-9098-3b855a73847a\', \'multiverseId\': 425368}, \'multiverseid\': 425368}, {\'name\': \'覆船海鳝\', \'text\': \'当覆船海鳝进战场时，你得到{E}{E}{E}{E}（四个能量指示物）。\\n支付{E}：覆船海鳝得+2/-2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～鱼\', \'flavor\': \'船难为水底动物创造了奇迹，不仅提供栖所，更是乙太来源。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36b6a2f0-2733-433f-b0de-3b0da96a2aa7\', \'multiverseId\': 423896}, \'multiverseid\': 423896}, {\'name\': \'覆船海鱔\', \'text\': \'當覆船海鱔進戰場時，你得到{E}{E}{E}{E}（四個能量指示物）。\\n支付{E}：覆船海鱔得+2/-2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～魚\', \'flavor\': \'船難為水底動物創造了奇蹟，不僅提供棲所，更是乙太來源。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e82a19a-b7a3-471e-9781-05330b4b185b\', \'multiverseId\': 424080}, \'multiverseid\': 424080}]', "[{'name': 'Schlängelnde Boa', 'text': 'Falls eine oder mehrere Marken auf ein Artefakt oder eine Kreatur gelegt würden, das bzw. die du kontrollierst, werden stattdessen so viele plus eine solcher Marken darauf gelegt.\\nFalls du eine oder mehrere Marken erhalten würdest, erhältst du stattdessen so viele plus eine solcher Marken.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Ophis', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424359&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'afb59856-3d14-40c6-a899-022d9eaf18a8', 'multiverseId': 424359}, 'multiverseid': 424359}, {'name': 'Boa sinuosa', 'text': 'Si fueran a colocarse uno o más contadores sobre un artefacto o criatura que controlas, en vez de eso, se coloca esa cantidad de contadores más uno sobre ese permanente.\\nSi fueras a obtener uno o más contadores, en vez de eso, obtienes esa cantidad de contadores más uno.', 'type': 'Criatura — Víbora', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425647&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '06d49d03-9536-4849-b064-7f83fa9b5449', 'multiverseId': 425647}, 'multiverseid': 425647}, {'name': 'Boa sinueux', 'text': 'Si au moins un marqueur devait être placé sur un artefact ou une créature que vous contrôlez, autant de ces marqueurs plus un sont placés sur ce permanent à la place.\\nSi vous deviez gagner au moins un marqueur, vous gagnez autant de ces marqueurs plus un à la place.', 'type': 'Créature : serpent', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424543&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b83abc61-5f7f-4f02-9ad4-da8d6bdcc543', 'multiverseId': 424543}, 'multiverseid': 424543}, {'name': 'Costrittore Sinuoso', 'text': 'Se uno o più segnalini stanno per essere messi su un artefatto o su una creatura che controlli, ne vengono invece messi altrettanti più uno su quel permanente.\\nSe stai per ottenere uno o più segnalini, ne ottieni invece quel numero più uno.', 'type': 'Creatura — Serpente', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424727&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b47cda8c-83b6-47c7-8af8-7a8e694c8429', 'multiverseId': 424727}, 'multiverseid': 424727}, {'name': '巻きつき蛇', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールする、アーティファクトやクリーチャーの上にカウンターが１個以上置かれるなら、代わりにその数に１を足した数のその種類のカウンターをそのパーマネントの上に置く。\\nあなたがカウンターを１個以上得るなら、代わりにあなたはその数に１を足した数のその種類のカウンターを得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 蛇', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424911&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ef95f5bd-e0cc-465c-b5ed-5ba740c344a3', 'multiverseId': 424911}, 'multiverseid': 424911}, {'name': '대형 보아뱀', 'text': '당신이 조종하는 마법물체나 생물에 카운터가 한 개 이상 놓이려고 한다면, 대신에 그 숫자에 한 개를 더한 만큼의 카운터를 그 지속물에 올려놓는다.\\n당신이 카운터를 한 개 이상 얻는다면, 대신에 당신은 그 숫자에 한 개를 더한 만큼의 카운터를 얻는다.', 'type': '생물 — 뱀', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425095&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cd482877-f52e-4d9d-8496-ec7f6f35fcb2', 'multiverseId': 425095}, 'multiverseid': 425095}, {'name': 'Constritora Sinuosa', 'text': 'Se um ou mais marcadores seriam colocados em um artefato ou uma criatura que você controla, em vez disso, aquela quantidade de marcadores mais um é colocada naquela permanente.\\nSe você receberia um ou mais marcadores, em vez disso, você recebe aquela quantidade mais um.', 'type': 'Criatura — Cobra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425279&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fdbd4664-5bb5-483c-ac36-b15be8231ff1', 'multiverseId': 425279}, 'multiverseid': 425279}, {'name': 'Извилистый Удав', 'text': 'Если на артефакт или существо под вашим контролем должны быть помещены один или более жетонов, вместо этого на тот перманент помещается столько же плюс один такой жетон.\\nЕсли вы должны получить один или более жетонов, вместо этого вы получаете столько же плюс один такой жетон.', 'type': 'Существо — Змея', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425463&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1194c6ba-a2e2-4fb5-8794-f3519ded64f2', 'multiverseId': 425463}, 'multiverseid': 425463}, {'name': '蜿蜒缠蟒', 'text': '如果将会在由你操控的神器或生物上放置一个或数个指示物，则改为在其上放置该数量加一的指示物。\\n如果你将得到一个或数个指示物，则改为你得到该数量加一的指示物。', 'type': '生物～蛇', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423991&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e15e13c0-7fb4-44ee-816a-be689d6e992d', 'multiverseId': 423991}, 'multiverseid': 423991}, {'name': '蜿蜒纏蟒', 'text': '如果將會在由你操控的神器或生物上放置一個或數個指示物，則改為在其上放置該數量加一的指示物。\\n如果你將得到一個或數個指示物，則改為你得到該數量加一的指示物。', 'type': '生物～蛇', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424175&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b49ef5cd-b718-4ae9-8f5b-6a18c2022c73', 'multiverseId': 424175}, 'multiverseid': 424175}]", '[{\'name\': \'Schock\', \'text\': \'Der Schock fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Werkzeuge der Erfinder wurden zu Waffen der Revolution.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424317&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a6d0810-be1a-4d03-a016-377bb4a95c77\', \'multiverseId\': 424317}, \'multiverseid\': 424317}, {\'name\': \'Choque\', \'text\': \'El Choque hace 2 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Las herramientas de invención se convirtieron en las armas de la revolución.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c08019cb-e430-4288-8fce-b19b868ce16b\', \'multiverseId\': 425605}, \'multiverseid\': 425605}, {\'name\': \'Choc\', \'text\': \'Le Choc inflige 2 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Les outils de l\'invention devinrent les armes de la révolution.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424501&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e58f191-dd03-4ce2-b58d-04b5419ef1d3\', \'multiverseId\': 424501}, \'multiverseid\': 424501}, {\'name\': \'Shock\', \'text\': \'Lo Shock infligge 2 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Gli strumenti dell\'invenzione divennero le armi della rivoluzione.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5896c462-534e-4094-bde7-f47d3272cfc2\', \'multiverseId\': 424685}, \'multiverseid\': 424685}, {\'name\': \'ショック\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。ショックはそれに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'発明の賜物が革命の業物になった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77456896-c485-48f3-89ac-1010146736e3\', \'multiverseId\': 424869}, \'multiverseid\': 424869}, {\'name\': \'충격\', \'text\': \'생물이나 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 충격은 그 목표에 피해 2점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'발명의 도구가 혁명의 무기가 되었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9402daef-15db-4beb-b280-7e039b377343\', \'multiverseId\': 425053}, \'multiverseid\': 425053}, {\'name\': \'Choque\', \'text\': \'Choque causa 2 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'As ferramentas da invenção tornaram-se as armas da revolução.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0926cfa-0428-46ae-a04e-3e5005dab76f\', \'multiverseId\': 425237}, \'multiverseid\': 425237}, {\'name\': \'Шок\', \'text\': \'Шок наносит 2 повреждения целевому существу или игроку.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Инструменты изобретателей стали оружием революции.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf563a4e-e62f-4440-b0f4-74ef77d2da7c\', \'multiverseId\': 425421}, \'multiverseid\': 425421}, {\'name\': \'电震\', \'text\': \'电震对目标生物或牌手造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'发明的工具成为了革命的武器。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfb02cfa-f52f-4b8d-9597-36ac62f0bc5a\', \'multiverseId\': 423949}, \'multiverseid\': 423949}, {\'name\': \'電震\', \'text\': \'電震對目標生物或玩家造成2點傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'發明的工具成為了革命的武器。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56f620fe-f11b-4756-aed6-096acfbaeb25\', \'multiverseId\': 424133}, \'multiverseid\': 424133}]', "[{'name': 'Schreitende Balliste', 'text': 'Die Schreitende Balliste kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\n{4}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Schreitende Balliste.\\nEntferne eine +1/+1-Marke von der Schreitenden Balliste: Sie fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424400&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '06d01d5a-872c-417f-9391-f1e05d2ee845', 'multiverseId': 424400}, 'multiverseid': 424400}, {'name': 'Balista andante', 'text': 'La Balista andante entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.\\n{4}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Balista andante.\\nRemover un contador +1/+1 de la Balista andante: La Balista andante hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Constructo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425688&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2cef486b-933a-491c-8666-56a5768c6b21', 'multiverseId': 425688}, 'multiverseid': 425688}, {'name': 'Baliste ambulante', 'text': 'La Baliste ambulante arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.\\n{4} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la Baliste ambulante.\\nRetirez un marqueur +1/+1 de la Baliste ambulante : Elle inflige 1 blessure à une cible, créature ou joueur.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : construction', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424584&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d69ead4-2439-4339-9896-ce9968e3a64b', 'multiverseId': 424584}, 'multiverseid': 424584}, {'name': 'Balista Mobile', 'text': 'La Balista Mobile entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1.\\n{4}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Balista Mobile.\\nRimuovi un segnalino +1/+1 dalla Balista Mobile: Infligge 1 danno a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424768&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c226054e-0051-4f52-9dcf-cbdd6e793659', 'multiverseId': 424768}, 'multiverseid': 424768}, {'name': '歩行バリスタ', 'text': '歩行バリスタは、＋１/＋１カウンターがＸ個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{4}：歩行バリスタの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\\n歩行バリスタの上から＋１/＋１カウンターを１個取り除く：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。歩行バリスタはそれに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424952&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0ea7a0c6-b4c6-4409-be74-6d9e41823886', 'multiverseId': 424952}, 'multiverseid': 424952}, {'name': '이동식 노포', 'text': '이동식 노포는 +1/+1 카운터 X개를 가지고 전장에 들어온다.\\n{4}: 이동식 노포에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n이동식 노포에서 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 제거한다: 생물이나 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 이동식 노포는 그 목표에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.', 'type': '마법물체 생물 — 자동기계', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425136&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '701c2c40-c14a-48ca-9804-83b429e020c0', 'multiverseId': 425136}, 'multiverseid': 425136}, {'name': 'Balista Ambulante', 'text': 'Balista Ambulante entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1.\\n{4}: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Balista Ambulante.\\nRemova um marcador +1/+1 de Balista Ambulante: Ela causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato — Constructo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425320&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '69e75420-b69f-4c7a-ab84-df9a1d9aff38', 'multiverseId': 425320}, 'multiverseid': 425320}, {'name': 'Ходячая Баллиста', 'text': 'Ходячая Баллиста выходит на поле битвы с Х жетонами +1/+1 на ней.\\n{4}: положите один жетон +1/+1 на Ходячую Баллисту.\\nУдалите один жетон +1/+1 с Ходячей Баллисты: она наносит 1 повреждение целевому существу или игроку.', 'type': 'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425504&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a610926d-ad6c-4f78-a8f0-f6c31e6caacd', 'multiverseId': 425504}, 'multiverseid': 425504}, {'name': '自行弩炮', 'text': '自行弩炮进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。\\n{4}：在自行弩炮上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n从自行弩炮上移去一个+1/+1指示物：它对目标生物或牌手造成1点伤害。', 'type': '神器生物～组构体', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424032&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e635e461-2a2f-4e07-95d4-1dd68c5d0d38', 'multiverseId': 424032}, 'multiverseid': 424032}, {'name': '自行弩炮', 'text': '自行弩炮進戰場時上面有X個+1/+1指示物。\\n{4}：在自行弩炮上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\\n從自行弩炮上移去一個+1/+1指示物：它對目標生物或玩家造成1點傷害。', 'type': '神器生物～組構體', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424216&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4c1fc1bb-3aed-49d8-a01c-aaf6d979398e', 'multiverseId': 424216}, 'multiverseid': 424216}]", '[{\'name\': \'Schrotter-Champion\', \'text\': \'Doppelschlag (Diese Kreatur fügt sowohl Erstschlags- als auch normalen Kampfschaden zu.)\\nWenn der Schrotter-Champion ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du {E}{E} (zwei Energiemarken).\\nImmer wenn der Schrotter-Champion angreift, kannst du {E}{E} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf ihn.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424316&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8c2c9f3-c2e3-4719-a52d-7664351c70ec\', \'multiverseId\': 424316}, \'multiverseid\': 424316}, {\'name\': \'Campeona batalladora\', \'text\': \'Daña dos veces. (Esta criatura daña primero y también hace daño de combate normal.)\\nCuando la Campeona batalladora entre al campo de batalla, obtienes {E}{E} (dos contadores de energía).\\nSiempre que la Campeona batalladora ataque, puedes pagar {E}{E}. Si lo haces, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'998c2d12-234d-4076-b5b5-09f6ef679d57\', \'multiverseId\': 425604}, \'multiverseid\': 425604}, {\'name\': \'Championne ferrailleuse\', \'text\': "Double initiative (Cette créature inflige des blessures de combat d\'initiative et des blessures de combat normales.)\\nQuand la Championne ferrailleuse arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez {E}{E} (deux marqueurs « énergie »).\\nÀ chaque fois que la Championne ferrailleuse attaque, vous pouvez payer {E}{E}. Si vous faites ainsi, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424500&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94e7b085-017c-46d1-b72f-13a27f458cba\', \'multiverseId\': 424500}, \'multiverseid\': 424500}, {\'name\': \'Campionessa Rissosa\', \'text\': \'Doppio attacco (Questa creatura infligge sia danno da combattimento da attacco improvviso che danno da combattimento regolare.)\\nQuando la Campionessa Rissosa entra nel campo di battaglia, ottieni {E}{E} (due segnalini energia).\\nOgniqualvolta la Campionessa Rissosa attacca, puoi pagare {E}{E}. Se lo fai, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5550302-c9c3-4323-a71b-0705790867b1\', \'multiverseId\': 424684}, \'multiverseid\': 424684}, {\'name\': \'屑鉄会の勇者\', \'text\': \'二段攻撃（このクリーチャーは先制攻撃と通常の戦闘ダメージの両方を与える。）\\n屑鉄会の勇者が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター２個）を得る。\\n屑鉄会の勇者が攻撃するたび、あなたは{E}{E}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0c9a637-b47b-4362-a9db-a8bb2bc9aacd\', \'multiverseId\': 424868}, \'multiverseid\': 424868}, {\'name\': \'싸움꾼 투사\', \'text\': \'이단공격 (이 생물은 선제공격 전투피해와 일반 전투피해를 같이 입힌다.)\\n싸움꾼 투사가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 {E}{E}(에너지 카운터 두 개)를 얻는다.\\n싸움꾼 투사가 공격할 때마다, 당신은 {E}{E}를 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 싸움꾼 투사에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기능공\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21279996-aadb-45dd-94d7-f3232d61c1c4\', \'multiverseId\': 425052}, \'multiverseid\': 425052}, {\'name\': \'Campeã Sucateira\', \'text\': \'Golpe duplo (Esta criatura causa tanto o dano de iniciativa quanto o de combate normal.)\\nQuando Campeã Sucateira entra no campo de batalha, você recebe {E}{E} (dois marcadores de energia).\\nToda vez que Campeã Sucateira ataca, você pode pagar {E}{E}. Se fizer isso, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b636fdc-87a7-466c-a5c5-f0ae8fb09c6a\', \'multiverseId\': 425236}, \'multiverseid\': 425236}, {\'name\': \'Непобедимая Дуэлянтка\', \'text\': \'Двойной удар (Это существо наносит боевые повреждения как на этапе Первого удара, так и на этапе обычных повреждений.)\\nКогда Непобедимая Дуэлянтка выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете {E}{E} (два жетона энергии).\\nКаждый раз, когда Непобедимая Дуэлянтка атакует, вы можете заплатить {E}{E}. Если вы это делаете, положите на нее один жетон +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Механик\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b6b6c87-395f-41bc-bb48-5e1be965a569\', \'multiverseId\': 425420}, \'multiverseid\': 425420}, {\'name\': \'拆解斗士\', \'text\': \'连击（此生物能造成先攻伤害以及普通战斗伤害。）\\n当拆解斗士进战场时，你得到{E}{E}（两个能量指示物）。\\n每当拆解斗士攻击时，你可以支付{E}{E}。若你如此作，则在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5928301b-9909-43b5-bea4-26f6ada58058\', \'multiverseId\': 423948}, \'multiverseid\': 423948}, {\'name\': \'拆解鬥士\', \'text\': \'連擊（此生物能造成先攻傷害以及普通戰鬥傷害。）\\n當拆解鬥士進戰場時，你得到{E}{E}（兩個能量指示物）。\\n每當拆解鬥士攻擊時，你可以支付{E}{E}。若你如此作，則在其上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／神器師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5a83de5-5ad9-43f9-b060-578ab3794952\', \'multiverseId\': 424132}, \'multiverseid\': 424132}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schrottfischer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Schrottfischer oder ein anderes Artefakt, das du kontrollierst, aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, bringe eine Artefaktkarte deiner Wahl mit niedrigeren umgewandelten Manakosten aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424394&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fb5d34b-619d-43e5-8396-5fd40f325367\', \'multiverseId\': 424394}, \'multiverseid\': 424394}, {\'name\': \'Arrastrero de chatarra\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Arrastrero de chatarra u otro artefacto que controlas vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, regresa a tu mano una carta de artefacto objetivo de tu cementerio con menor coste de maná convertido.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3daa806-1d38-4c28-9f27-4d81def7952f\', \'multiverseId\': 425682}, \'multiverseid\': 425682}, {\'name\': \'Charrieur de ferraille\', \'text\': "Quand le Charrieur de ferraille ou un autre artefact que vous contrôlez est mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, renvoyez dans votre main une carte d\'artefact avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ciblée depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424578&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'777625b1-6877-4a50-bf5e-8247539472fb\', \'multiverseId\': 424578}, \'multiverseid\': 424578}, {\'name\': \'Collettore di Rottami\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta il Collettore di Rottami o un altro artefatto che controlli vengono messi in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, riprendi in mano una carta artefatto bersaglio nel tuo cimitero con costo di mana convertito inferiore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eac4728d-9f48-4340-951c-4aa32053c53e\', \'multiverseId\': 424762}, \'multiverseid\': 424762}, {\'name\': \'屑鉄さらい\', \'text\': \'屑鉄さらいかあなたがコントロールする他のアーティファクトが１つ戦場から墓地に置かれるたび、あなたの墓地から点数で見たマナ・コストがそれより小さいアーティファクト・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53a5aef5-bf1d-461c-b98c-e8d7e6832975\', \'multiverseId\': 424946}, \'multiverseid\': 424946}, {\'name\': \'고철 투망꾼\', \'text\': \'고철 투망꾼 또는 당신이 조종하는 다른 마법물체가 전장에서 무덤에 놓일 때마다, 당신의 무덤에 있는 전환마나비용이 더 낮은 마법물체 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 마법물체를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 자동기계\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25d505be-28d0-4759-bc5e-6b9b26fed3fd\', \'multiverseId\': 425130}, \'multiverseid\': 425130}, {\'name\': \'Arrastador de Sucata\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Arrastador de Sucata ou outro artefato que você controla for colocado num cemitério vindo do campo de batalha, devolva para a sua mão o card de artefato alvo de seu cemitério com o custo de mana convertido mais baixo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33c521a2-6a23-4b43-befb-d450703874f0\', \'multiverseId\': 425314}, \'multiverseid\': 425314}, {\'name\': \'Тральщик-Мусорщик\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Тральщик-Мусорщик или другой артефакт под вашим контролем попадает с поля битвы на кладбище, верните в вашу руку находящуюся на вашем кладбище целевую карту артефакта с меньшей конвертированной мана-стоимостью.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df728f48-2eca-407a-9ad1-efb3426514d3\', \'multiverseId\': 425498}, \'multiverseid\': 425498}, {\'name\': \'废铁打捞械\', \'text\': \'每当废铁打捞械或另一个由你操控的神器从战场进入坟墓场时，将目标在你坟墓场中且总法术力费用小于前述神器的神器牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36c36d18-1bab-442c-93f5-54c9e17822f3\', \'multiverseId\': 424026}, \'multiverseid\': 424026}, {\'name\': \'廢鐵打撈械\', \'text\': \'每當廢鐵打撈械或另一個由你操控的神器從戰場進入墳墓場時，將目標在你墳墓場且總魔法力費用小於前述神器的神器牌移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～組構體\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ed1aec3-16de-49d2-896c-39532b02bb19\', \'multiverseId\': 424210}, \'multiverseid\': 424210}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schweißender Automat\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}: Der Schweißende Automat fügt jedem Gegner 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'Die meisten Konstrukte, die die Renegaten gegen das Konsulat einsetzen, wurden ursprünglich nicht für den Kampf konzipiert. Doch einige mussten nicht sonderlich modifiziert werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424402&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84ccb6a1-00b4-484e-bfde-de1cc60b9cb0\', \'multiverseId\': 424402}, \'multiverseid\': 424402}, {\'name\': \'Autómata soldador\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}: El Autómata soldador hace 1 punto de daño a cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'La mayoría de constructos que los renegados usaron contra el Consulado no estaban diseñados para el combate, pero algunos no necesitaron muchas modificaciones.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a09068d0-702d-419c-80d8-67cbc2e2f3ab\', \'multiverseId\': 425690}, \'multiverseid\': 425690}, {\'name\': \'Automate soudeur\', \'text\': "{3}{R} : L\'Automate soudeur inflige 1 blessure à chaque adversaire.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': "La plupart des constructions utilisées par les renégats contre le Consulat n\'étaient à l\'origine pas destinées au combat. Certaines n\'ont toutefois pas nécessité beaucoup de modifications.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424586&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cd6b509-25e7-4d84-b697-025d94151a9a\', \'multiverseId\': 424586}, \'multiverseid\': 424586}, {\'name\': \'Automa Saldatore\', \'text\': "{3}{R}: L\'Automa Saldatore infligge 1 danno a ogni avversario.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'Molti dei costrutti impiegati dai rinnegati contro il Consolato non erano pensati per il combattimento. Alcuni, però non richiesero grandi modifiche.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3db8e03b-69a4-4030-92b8-4ccb5d525e06\', \'multiverseId\': 424770}, \'multiverseid\': 424770}, {\'name\': \'溶接自動機械\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}：溶接自動機械は各対戦相手にそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'改革派が領事府相手に使っている構築物の大半は、本来は戦闘用ではないが、大した改造が不要だった物もある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca996839-ea11-4867-87e9-5f1bebff82a7\', \'multiverseId\': 424954}, \'multiverseid\': 424954}, {\'name\': \'용접꾼 자동장치\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}: 용접꾼 자동장치는 각 상대에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 자동기계\', \'flavor\': \'무법자들이 영사관을 대상으로 사용한 기계장치의 대부분은 전투를 목적으로 만들어지지 않았다. 하지만 일부 기계장치는 개조할 필요도 없었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f758f8e-387e-4328-87ea-fc0b5efa5514\', \'multiverseId\': 425138}, \'multiverseid\': 425138}, {\'name\': \'Autômato Soldador\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}: Autômato Soldador causa 1 ponto de dano a cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'A maioria dos constructos que os renegados usaram contra o Consulado não era originalmente feita para combate. Alguns, porém, não precisaram de muitas modificações.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77ea2208-745a-40ab-8985-7e26be769a25\', \'multiverseId\': 425322}, \'multiverseid\': 425322}, {\'name\': \'Сварочный Автомат\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}: Сварочный Автомат наносит 1 повреждение каждому оппоненту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': \'Большинство конструкций, брошенных отступниками в бой с Консульством, изначально не предназначались для сражений. Но некоторые из них практически не пришлось дорабатывать.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0add31ef-a3b8-40f0-b623-7e637ece50bd\', \'multiverseId\': 425506}, \'multiverseid\': 425506}, {\'name\': \'焊熔机械兽\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}：焊熔机械兽向每位对手各造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'乱匠用来对抗执政院的组构体，原本的用途大多不是战斗。但有些不需多做改动就能派上用场。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbcf20b1-1802-47bc-b303-74def3dc158b\', \'multiverseId\': 424034}, \'multiverseid\': 424034}, {\'name\': \'焊熔機械獸\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}：焊熔機械獸向每位對手各造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～組構體\', \'flavor\': \'亂匠用來對抗執政院的組構體，原本的用途大多不是戰鬥。但有些不需多做改動就能派上用場。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99e2bcc9-3011-47ec-bd90-84da7f75a37f\', \'multiverseId\': 424218}, \'multiverseid\': 424218}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schweißfabrik-Raufbold\', \'text\': \'Improvisieren (Deine Artefakte können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)\\nBedrohlich\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'Die Einwohner von Embraal waren nie für ihre Finesse bekannt. Eher dafür, dass sie zu Ende bringen, was sie anfangen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424319&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8053251-5a2f-4b28-8eac-b93ca49b1884\', \'multiverseId\': 424319}, \'multiverseid\': 424319}, {\'name\': \'Pendenciera de la fundición opresora\', \'text\': \'Improvisar. (Tus artefactos pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada artefacto que gires una vez que termines de activar habilidades de maná paga {1}.)\\nAmenaza.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los residentes de Embraal nunca destacaron por su refinamiento, solo por sacar el trabajo adelante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe5c9e36-7d82-4e17-9fa9-cbe2a68cf2f9\', \'multiverseId\': 425607}, \'multiverseid\': 425607}, {\'name\': \'Bagarreuse de la ferronnerie clandestine\', \'text\': \'Improvisation (Vos artefacts peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque artefact que vous engagez après avoir activé des capacités de mana paie {1}.)\\nMenace\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': "Les résidents d\'Embraal ne sont pas connus pour leur délicatesse, mais pour leur efficacité.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424503&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36dbcf78-d07c-48dc-a5f7-f8f572e52a6d\', \'multiverseId\': 424503}, \'multiverseid\': 424503}, {\'name\': \'Picchiatrice dello Sfruttatorio\', \'text\': \'Improvvisare (I tuoi artefatti possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni artefatto che TAPpi dopo aver attivato le abilità di mana corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nMinacciare\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Gli abitanti di Embraal non sono noti per la loro diplomazia, ma perché ottengono dei risultati.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'243f58c9-2154-4194-bbfb-744a09642e67\', \'multiverseId\': 424687}, \'multiverseid\': 424687}, {\'name\': \'搾取工区の喧嘩屋\', \'text\': \'即席（あなたのアーティファクトが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。あなたはあなたのアーティファクトをタップして、１個あたり{1}の支払いに代えてもよい。）\\n威迫\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'エンブロールの人々は技巧派ではない。やり遂げることが得意なのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'857204f2-0232-4a30-aeea-774e7793b297\', \'multiverseId\': 424871}, \'multiverseid\': 424871}, {\'name\': \'철공소 싸움꾼\', \'text\': \'급조 (당신의 마법물체들은 이 주문을 발동하는 것을 도울 수 있다. 마나 능력을 활성화한 후에 탭하는 각 마법물체는 이 주문의 비용 중 {1}을 지불한다.)\\n호전적\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기능공\', \'flavor\': \'엠브라알의 주민들은 술책이 아니라 임무를 완수하는 것으로 잘 알려져 있었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da2980ad-2575-4abb-8faa-7e559d56c823\', \'multiverseId\': 425055}, \'multiverseid\': 425055}, {\'name\': \'Rufiã da Serralheria Clandestina\', \'text\': \'Improvisar (Seus artefatos podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada artefato que você vira após terminar de ativar habilidades de mana paga por {1}.)\\nAmeaçar\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'Os residentes de Embraal jamais foram conhecidos pela fineza, mas por colocarem a mão na massa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77698098-3080-4d55-a18c-5efa90778dc4\', \'multiverseId\': 425239}, \'multiverseid\': 425239}, {\'name\': \'Задира из Потогонки\', \'text\': \'Импровизация (Ваши артефакты могут помочь разыграть это заклинание. Каждый артефакт, который вы поворачиваете после того, как вы закончили активировать мана-способности, считается оплатой {1}.)\\nУгроза\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Механик\', \'flavor\': \'Жители Эмбрааля никогда не славились тонкой работой. Они просто доводили дело до конца.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62a76659-08ae-48ca-8b16-caf307d50b81\', \'multiverseId\': 425423}, \'multiverseid\': 425423}, {\'name\': \'血汗厂喧哗兵\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒语能用你的神器来协助施放。你起动完法术力异能之后每横置一个神器，就能为此咒语支付{1}。）\\n威慑\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'虽然从来没听人说安布洛居民作事漂亮，但大家都知道他们办事稳妥。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e09d5b14-f6a1-40b7-a969-43d0bb6e1cec\', \'multiverseId\': 423951}, \'multiverseid\': 423951}, {\'name\': \'血汗廠喧嘩兵\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒語能用你的神器來協助施放。你起動完魔法力異能之後每橫置一個神器，就能為此咒語支付{1}。）\\n威懾\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／神器師\', \'flavor\': \'雖然從來沒聽人說安布洛居民作事漂亮，但大家都知道他們辦事穩妥。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72c12cbe-af14-44f4-8e51-21015498a30a\', \'multiverseId\': 424135}, \'multiverseid\': 424135}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seidenweber-Elitekriegerin\', \'text\': \'Reichweite (Diese Kreatur kann fliegende Kreaturen blocken.)\\nRebellion — Wenn die Seidenweber-Elitekriegerin ins Spiel kommt und falls in diesem Zug eine bleibende Karte unter deiner Kontrolle das Spiel verlassen hat, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Bogenschütze\', \'flavor\': \'Elfische Weber verwenden Spinnenseide für alles — vom Wandbehang bis hin zum Kletterseil.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424344&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'953dc17d-294c-4f39-ba58-9057d28298ec\', \'multiverseId\': 424344}, \'multiverseid\': 424344}, {\'name\': \'Élite tejeseda\', \'text\': \'Alcance. (Esta criatura puede bloquear criaturas con la habilidad de volar.)\\nRevuelta — Cuando la Élite tejeseda entre al campo de batalla, si un permanente que controlabas dejó el campo de batalla este turno, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arquero elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Los tejedores élficos usan la seda arácnida para todo tipo de tejidos, desde tapices hasta cuerdas de escalada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'747fa581-ad8e-43df-9a88-9bc084d1b913\', \'multiverseId\': 425632}, \'multiverseid\': 425632}, {\'name\': \'Élite tissesoie\', \'text\': "Portée (Cette créature peut bloquer les créatures avec le vol.)\\nRévolte — Quand l\'Élite tissesoie arrive sur le champ de bataille, si un permanent que vous contrôliez a quitté le champ de bataille ce tour-ci, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et archer\', \'flavor\': "Les tisseurs elfes utilisent largement la soie d\'araignée, de la confection des tapisseries à celle des cordes de rappel.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424528&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0efbf00d-cb52-4dbb-b0e4-c49b9889f5a4\', \'multiverseId\': 424528}, \'multiverseid\': 424528}, {\'name\': \'Elite Tessitela\', \'text\': "Raggiungere (Questa creatura può bloccare le creature con volare.)\\nRivolta — Quando l\'Elite Tessitela entra nel campo di battaglia, se un permanente che controllavi ha lasciato il campo di battaglia in questo turno, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Arciere Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'I tessitori elfici usano la tela di ragno per realizzare qualsiasi cosa, dagli arazzi alle corde da arrampicata.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'316c5606-cbb6-45b6-911e-98f6d98d8b57\', \'multiverseId\': 424712}, \'multiverseid\': 424712}, {\'name\': \'絹織りの精鋭\', \'text\': \'到達（このクリーチャーは飛行を持つクリーチャーをブロックできる。）\\n紛争 ― 絹織りの精鋭が戦場に出たとき、このターンにあなたがコントロールするパーマネントが戦場を離れていた場合、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・射手\', \'flavor\': \'エルフの織り手は蜘蛛絹で何でも作る。美しい織物でも、降下用ロープでも。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b09c024-22a4-40ee-a493-fb8183371a64\', \'multiverseId\': 424896}, \'multiverseid\': 424896}, {\'name\': \'정예 비단방직공\', \'text\': \'대공 (이 생물은 비행을 가진 생물을 방어할 수 있다.)\\n봉기 — 정예 비단방직공이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종한 지속물이 이 턴에 전장을 떠났다면, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 궁수\', \'flavor\': \'엘프 방직공은 거미비단으로 태피스트리에서 수직 강하 밧줄에 이르기까지 모든 것을 만든다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'543951b5-2012-4b60-933e-299548881f0f\', \'multiverseId\': 425080}, \'multiverseid\': 425080}, {\'name\': \'Elite Teceseda\', \'text\': \'Alcance (Esta criatura pode bloquear criaturas com voar.)\\nRevolta — Quando Elite Teceseda entrar no campo de batalha, se uma permanente que você controlava deixou o campo de batalha neste turno, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Arqueiro\', \'flavor\': \'Os tecelões élficos usam seda aranhosa para fazer de tudo, de tapeçaria a cordas de rapel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42ba1fff-90f3-4e99-8ae9-b5d38e6c63da\', \'multiverseId\': 425264}, \'multiverseid\': 425264}, {\'name\': \'Мастерица Шелкопрядов\', \'text\': \'Захват (Это существо может блокировать существа с Полетом.)\\nБунт — Когда Мастерица Шелкопрядов выходит на поле битвы, если находившийся под вашим контролем перманент покинул поле битвы в этом ходу, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Лучник\', \'flavor\': \'Эльфийские ткачи используют паутину как материал для чего угодно — от гобеленов до прочных тросов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86b32273-b28e-47e9-881c-400f05443ec7\', \'multiverseId\': 425448}, \'multiverseid\': 425448}, {\'name\': \'纺丝精兵\', \'text\': \'延势（此生物能阻挡具飞行异能的生物。）\\n反抗～当纺丝精兵进战场时，若本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物离开战场，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／弓箭手\', \'flavor\': \'从壁毯到索绳，妖精织匠会用蛛丝编织所有东西。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4418dbe8-b9f5-45e6-97b3-6fe66c34ce13\', \'multiverseId\': 423976}, \'multiverseid\': 423976}, {\'name\': \'紡絲精兵\', \'text\': \'延勢（此生物能阻擋具飛行異能的生物。）\\n反抗～當紡絲精兵進戰場時，若本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物離開戰場，則抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／弓箭手\', \'flavor\': \'從壁毯到索繩，妖精織匠會用蛛絲編織所有東西。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0e8971f-ae57-4151-89b7-44103005725f\', \'multiverseId\': 424160}, \'multiverseid\': 424160}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seitengassenwürger\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Äthergeborener, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Du weißt nie, welcher Tag dein letzter sein könnte."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424271&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'727434db-30e7-4345-85cf-b76fab719ec6\', \'multiverseId\': 424271}, \'multiverseid\': 424271}, {\'name\': \'Estrangulador del callejón\', \'text\': \'Amenaza.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón etergénito\', \'flavor\': \'"Nunca se sabe cuál de tus días será el último".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7efadd1-1cff-4c74-ae5f-3071c33da1e7\', \'multiverseId\': 425559}, \'multiverseid\': 425559}, {\'name\': \'Étrangleur des ruelles\', \'text\': \'Menace\', \'type\': \'Créature : éthérien et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'« Tu ne sauras jamais quel jour sera ton dernier. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424455&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46225cad-da46-4a03-9b3a-d45798035cb0\', \'multiverseId\': 424455}, \'multiverseid\': 424455}, {\'name\': \'Strangolatore dei Vicoli\', \'text\': \'Minacciare\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Eteride\', \'flavor\': \'"Non si può mai sapere quando sarà il tuo ultimo giorno."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3771b695-b073-45fc-92e1-f98091df3324\', \'multiverseId\': 424639}, \'multiverseid\': 424639}, {\'name\': \'路地の絞殺者\', \'text\': \'威迫\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 霊基体・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「いつ最期の日を迎えるのか。そんなことはわからない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ada7551-5e8a-497e-b598-2845bd0a2830\', \'multiverseId\': 424823}, \'multiverseid\': 424823}, {\'name\': \'뒷골목 교살범\', \'text\': \'호전적\', \'type\': \'생물 — 에테르붙이 도적\', \'flavor\': \'"언제가 죽는 날일지 절대 모를 거다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a34995a-1f8b-475f-bb4f-5fda3dcab345\', \'multiverseId\': 425007}, \'multiverseid\': 425007}, {\'name\': \'Estrangulador das Vielas\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Etergênito Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'"Você nunca sabe que dia pode ser o seu último."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'268baf0c-4f9b-4438-aff7-5a4eb3f3c42e\', \'multiverseId\': 425191}, \'multiverseid\': 425191}, {\'name\': \'Душитель из Переулка\', \'text\': \'Угроза\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эфирид Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'«Никогда не знаешь, какой день может стать для тебя последним».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3746e9c-7c5d-4730-b484-cde5019805c3\', \'multiverseId\': 425375}, \'multiverseid\': 425375}, {\'name\': \'暗巷绞杀客\', \'text\': \'威慑\', \'type\': \'生物～乙太种／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「你不会知道哪天就是你的死期。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'634ed1d4-a5e8-4d7a-be15-43d6719bcb3e\', \'multiverseId\': 423903}, \'multiverseid\': 423903}, {\'name\': \'暗巷絞殺客\', \'text\': \'威懾\', \'type\': \'生物～乙太種／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「你不會知道哪天就是你的死期。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34e3bcf3-446f-4e08-b647-e951a5fe0c73\', \'multiverseId\': 424087}, \'multiverseid\': 424087}]', '[{\'name\': \'Servo-Bauplan\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Servo-Bauplan ins Spiel kommt oder aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Servo-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Das Konsulat schätzt Erfindungen, die zuverlässig sind und sich reproduzieren lassen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424395&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4af3f09c-e707-4c40-992a-d69945b29616\', \'multiverseId\': 424395}, \'multiverseid\': 424395}, {\'name\': \'Boceto de servo\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Boceto de servo entre al campo de batalla o vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Servo incolora 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El Consulado recompensa la innovación cuando es fiable y reproducible.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56ba28de-c2a4-4165-ad51-9548bb253d4f\', \'multiverseId\': 425683}, \'multiverseid\': 425683}, {\'name\': \'Schéma de servo\', \'text\': "Quand le Schéma de servo arrive sur le champ de bataille ou qu\'il est mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Servo.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Le Consulat attache beaucoup de valeur à l\'innovation quand elle est fiable et reproductible.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424579&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0ff6610-0a96-44e1-a8e6-2f2d3da19904\', \'multiverseId\': 424579}, \'multiverseid\': 424579}, {\'name\': \'Progetto di Servomeccanismo\', \'text\': \'Quando il Progetto di Servomeccanismo entra nel campo di battaglia o viene messo in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Servomeccanismo 1/1 incolore.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Il Consolato apprezza l\'innovazione quando è affidabile e riproducibile.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c753c0c9-8fd6-4b34-ad0f-4fc8ad7fd469\', \'multiverseId\': 424763}, \'multiverseid\': 424763}, {\'name\': \'霊気装置の設計図\', \'text\': \'霊気装置の設計図が戦場に出たか戦場から墓地に置かれたとき、無色の１/１の霊気装置・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１つ生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'信頼できる複製可能な発明を、領事府は報奨する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4d7d947-8515-4e72-afc9-ce8b59e768bc\', \'multiverseId\': 424947}, \'multiverseid\': 424947}, {\'name\': \'서보 설계도\', \'text\': \'서보 설계도가 전장에 들어오거나 전장에서 무덤에 놓일 때, 1/1 무색 서보 마법물체 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'영사관은 믿을 수 있고 복제가 가능할 때 혁신을 칭찬한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a8a112c-5c82-45d0-8bbc-2233627cf671\', \'multiverseId\': 425131}, \'multiverseid\': 425131}, {\'name\': \'Diagrama de Servus\', \'text\': \'Quando Diagrama de Servus entrar no campo de batalha ou for colocado no cemitério vindo do campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Servus.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'O Consulado valoriza a inovação quando ela é confiável e replicável.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bfca573-2477-4928-8fd2-18ea7e4213da\', \'multiverseId\': 425315}, \'multiverseid\': 425315}, {\'name\': \'Чертеж Сервотрона\', \'text\': \'Когда Чертеж Сервотрона выходит на поле битвы или попадает с поля битвы на кладбище, создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Сервотрон.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Консульство ценит новинки тогда, когда они надежные и их легко воспроизвести.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00874f13-6d74-438c-a926-87fade63c9e8\', \'multiverseId\': 425499}, \'multiverseid\': 425499}, {\'name\': \'自动机图解\', \'text\': \'当自动机图解进战场或从战场进入坟墓场时，派出一个1/1无色自动机衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'执政院器重那些可靠且可复制的创造发明。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fd39ffd-bcc3-4a62-b6d3-c453594900c7\', \'multiverseId\': 424027}, \'multiverseid\': 424027}, {\'name\': \'自動機圖解\', \'text\': \'當自動機圖解進戰場或從戰場進入墳墓場時，派出一個1/1無色自動機衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'執政院器重那些可靠且可複製的創造發明。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f4340e2-b4ed-4093-b74d-8da579f082b8\', \'multiverseId\': 424211}, \'multiverseid\': 424211}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sprießender Automat\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Sprießenden Automaten.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'„Eine perfekte Fusion aus Natur und Handwerkskunst." —Irsi, Kujar-Gärtnerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424399&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48f0f677-f00d-4664-a7f7-32410b8fac11\', \'multiverseId\': 424399}, \'multiverseid\': 424399}, {\'name\': \'Autómata verdeante\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Autómata verdeante.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'"Una fusión perfecta entre naturaleza y artificio". —Irsi, jardinera de Kujar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f246b94-0ece-436c-9ba2-9816a1e59cfa\', \'multiverseId\': 425687}, \'multiverseid\': 425687}, {\'name\': \'Automate verdoyant\', \'text\': "{3}{G} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Automate verdoyant.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': "« L\'alliance parfaite entre naturel et artificiel. » —Irsi, jardinière de Kujar", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424583&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc955314-ea5c-4f8a-a193-404d37492293\', \'multiverseId\': 424583}, \'multiverseid\': 424583}, {\'name\': \'Automa Verdeggiante\', \'text\': "{3}{G}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Automa Verdeggiante.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'"Una perfetta fusione di natura e artificio." —Irsi, giardiniera di Kujar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84413641-095c-49e1-b06d-1c2a24629afc\', \'multiverseId\': 424767}, \'multiverseid\': 424767}, {\'name\': \'新緑自動機械\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}：新緑自動機械の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'「自然と工芸の完璧な融合よ。」 ――クジャールの庭師、イルシー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5581789-0b7a-432a-b203-9ab74a565606\', \'multiverseId\': 424951}, \'multiverseid\': 424951}, {\'name\': \'신록의 자동장치\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}: 신록의 자동장치에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 자동기계\', \'flavor\': \'"자연과 인공물의 완벽한 융합이다." —쿠자르 정원사 이르시\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f97f6701-63e7-4ff3-a1ac-581888e0c779\', \'multiverseId\': 425135}, \'multiverseid\': 425135}, {\'name\': \'Autômato Verdejante\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Autômato Verdejante.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'"A fusão perfeita entre natureza e artifício." — Irsi, jardineira de Kujar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1fe37b0-39b6-4033-beef-4192b85bf0fe\', \'multiverseId\': 425319}, \'multiverseid\': 425319}, {\'name\': \'Зеленый Автомат\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}: положите один жетон +1/+1 на Зеленый Автомат.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': \'«Идеальное слияние природы и мастерства механика». — Ирси, куджарская садовница\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac4981a5-60f1-483e-a7c0-a25df4c8b81f\', \'multiverseId\': 425503}, \'multiverseid\': 425503}, {\'name\': \'新绿机械兽\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}：在新绿机械兽上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'「自然与人工的完美融合。」 ～库贾园丁伊尔丝\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'557c0f85-d67a-4445-a289-59fffc5278c6\', \'multiverseId\': 424031}, \'multiverseid\': 424031}, {\'name\': \'新綠機械獸\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}：在新綠機械獸上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～組構體\', \'flavor\': \'「自然與人工的完美融合。」 ～庫賈園丁伊爾絲\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db53ba81-cfa7-4871-b609-d76817790f81\', \'multiverseId\': 424215}, \'multiverseid\': 424215}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sram, leitender Konstrukteur\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Aura-, Ausrüstungs- oder Fahrzeug-Zauberspruch wirkst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Zwerg, Berater\', \'flavor\': \'„Je mehr dieser Konflikt eskaliert, desto schwieriger wird es, die Stadt vor dem Zusammenbruch zu bewahren. Wie lange können wir diese Maschinerie wohl noch in der Balance halten?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424242&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b78853bc-f98a-4866-b8c6-d76cc4140c1b\', \'multiverseId\': 424242}, \'multiverseid\': 424242}, {\'name\': \'Sram, edificador experto\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de aura, equipo o Vehículo, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Enano consejero\', \'flavor\': \'"A medida que el conflicto se recrudece, cuesta más impedir que la ciudad entera se desmorone. ¿Cuánto tiempo podremos mantener la maquinaria en funcionamiento?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37b81f10-4d45-4228-9f45-104102a6a2a3\', \'multiverseId\': 425530}, \'multiverseid\': 425530}, {\'name\': \'Sram, chef édificateur\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'aura, d\'équipement ou de véhicule, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : nain et conseiller\', \'flavor\': "« Le conflit prend de l\'ampleur et il devient de plus en plus difficile d\'empêcher la ville de se diviser. Combien de temps encore pourrons-nous préserver l\'équilibre de ce mécanisme ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424426&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'340f3397-5b51-44cb-b450-f72579ad8209\', \'multiverseId\': 424426}, \'multiverseid\': 424426}, {\'name\': \'Sram, Edificatore Capo\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia Aura, Equipaggiamento o Veicolo, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Consigliere Nano\', \'flavor\': \'"Con il crescere del conflitto, è sempre più difficile impedire che la città cada in pezzi. Per quanto ancora riusciremo a mantenere in equilibrio questo meccanismo?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a80e272-7d7f-4eb1-9f8e-6c7bf5baa86d\', \'multiverseId\': 424610}, \'multiverseid\': 424610}, {\'name\': \'上級建設官、スラム\', \'text\': \'あなたがオーラ・呪文か装備品・呪文か機体・呪文を１つ唱えるたび、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドワーフ・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': \'「対立が深まり市の崩壊を防ぐのは難しくなるばかりだ。機構のバランスを、あとどれほど維持できるだろうか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d8e1477-62d3-4480-838b-a98524a19cd4\', \'multiverseId\': 424794}, \'multiverseid\': 424794}, {\'name\': \'수석 건축가 스람\', \'text\': \'당신이 마법진, 장비 또는 탑승물 주문을 발동할 때마다, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 드워프 참모\', \'flavor\': \'"전투가 치열해질 수록 도시의 붕괴를 막는 일이 점점 어려워지는군. 이 기계들의 균형을 얼마나 오래 유지할 수 있을까?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5257fedb-0e4f-4272-8837-381381cdd926\', \'multiverseId\': 424978}, \'multiverseid\': 424978}, {\'name\': \'Sram, Edificador Sênior\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica de Aura, Equipamento ou Veículo, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Anão Conselheiro\', \'flavor\': \'"À medida que este conflito cresce, fica mais difícil evitar que a cidade entre em colapso. Por quanto tempo mais conseguiremos manter este mecanismo em equilíbrio?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'607cab9b-d6dc-4ff1-80d9-54a2603bb2a6\', \'multiverseId\': 425162}, \'multiverseid\': 425162}, {\'name\': \'Эсрам, Старший Градостроитель\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание Ауры, Снаряжения или Машины, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Гном Советник\', \'flavor\': \'«Конфликт разрастается, и поддерживать город в рабочем состоянии становится все сложнее и сложнее. Сколько мы еще продержимся, прежде чем машины выйдут из строя?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54d54d20-bae2-4e09-ab7c-b7dad6313df0\', \'multiverseId\': 425346}, \'multiverseid\': 425346}, {\'name\': \'资深建筑师斯勒姆\', \'text\': \'每当你施放灵气，武具或载具咒语时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～矮人／参谋\', \'flavor\': \'「随着冲突愈演愈烈，眼下越来越难维持城市完整不至毁坏。这样的机械平衡还能维持多久？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a66b8f76-1208-4c12-98e7-b1a99eb03e75\', \'multiverseId\': 423874}, \'multiverseid\': 423874}, {\'name\': \'資深建築師斯勒姆\', \'text\': \'每當你施放靈氣，武具或載具咒語時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物～矮人／參謀\', \'flavor\': \'「隨著衝突愈演愈烈，眼下越來越難維持城市完整不至毀壞。這樣的機械平衡還能維持多久？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6d4ec2c-bdeb-4f4c-a544-0854ea06f927\', \'multiverseId\': 424058}, \'multiverseid\': 424058}]', '[{\'name\': \'Srams Expertise\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge drei 1/1 farblose Servo-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine.\\nDu kannst eine Karte mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 3 oder weniger aus deiner Hand wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist wichtig, für jede Arbeit das passende Werkzeug parat zu haben. Dieses hier dient zum Herumstochern in meinen Zähnen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424243&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68497fed-343a-4689-9568-0e1ff72e86b6\', \'multiverseId\': 424243}, \'multiverseid\': 424243}, {\'name\': \'Pericia de Sram\', \'text\': \'Crea tres fichas de criatura artefacto Servo incoloras 1/1.\\nPuedes lanzar una carta de tu mano con coste de maná convertido de 3 o menos sin pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Es importante disponer de la herramienta adecuada para cada trabajo. Esta me sirve de mondadientes".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1edc6aeb-f4df-4bdd-9934-d7414255abaf\', \'multiverseId\': 425531}, \'multiverseid\': 425531}, {\'name\': \'Expertise de Sram\', \'text\': \'Créez trois jetons de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Servo.\\nVous pouvez lancer une carte avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 3 depuis votre main sans payer son coût de mana.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« À chaque outil, sa fonction. Celui-là sert à me curer les dents. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424427&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45cf1f26-7bed-4cd4-aaa5-01fe1fd097d2\', \'multiverseId\': 424427}, \'multiverseid\': 424427}, {\'name\': \'Competenza di Sram\', \'text\': \'Crea tre pedine creatura artefatto Servomeccanismo 1/1 incolori.\\nPuoi lanciare una carta con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 3 dalla tua mano senza pagare il suo costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"È importante avere sempre lo strumento adatto allo scopo. Questo è per pulirmi i denti."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08273976-4ef1-48c4-aa78-9513d61c03a1\', \'multiverseId\': 424611}, \'multiverseid\': 424611}, {\'name\': \'スラムの巧技\', \'text\': \'無色の１/１の霊気装置・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを３体生成する。\\nあなたは、あなたの手札から点数で見たマナ・コストが３以下のカード１枚を、そのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「どんな場合でも重要なのは、仕事に最適な工具の選択だ。爪楊枝には、こいつが最適だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'475a2da2-ae85-44da-985d-5b07b6a3591a\', \'multiverseId\': 424795}, \'multiverseid\': 424795}, {\'name\': \'스람의 전문 지식\', \'text\': \'1/1 무색 서보 마법물체 생물 토큰 세 개를 만든다.\\n당신은 당신의 손에서 전환마나비용이 3 이하인 카드를 마나 비용을 지불하지 않고 발동할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"무슨 일이든 올바른 도구가 있어야 한다. 이건 내가 이쑤시개로 쓰는 거야."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d27ab630-32ae-4b9f-8933-9f516c4f9994\', \'multiverseId\': 424979}, \'multiverseid\': 424979}, {\'name\': \'Especialidade de Sram\', \'text\': \'Crie três fichas de criatura artefato incolores 1/1 do tipo Servus.\\nVocê pode conjurar um card com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a 3 de sua mão sem pagar seu custo de mana.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"É importante ter sempre a ferramente certa para o trabalho. Esta aqui é para palitar os dentes."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cfd4f1e-276f-429f-a59e-069c330c185f\', \'multiverseId\': 425163}, \'multiverseid\': 425163}, {\'name\': \'Мастерство Эсрама\', \'text\': \'Создайте три фишки артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Сервотрон.\\nВы можете разыграть карту заклинания с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более 3 из вашей руки без оплаты ее мана-стоимости.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Для каждой работы важно иметь подходящий инструмент. Этот, например, чтобы в зубах ковыряться».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'922b04b7-f756-4352-a37d-3d9e63155ae7\', \'multiverseId\': 425347}, \'multiverseid\': 425347}, {\'name\': \'斯勒姆的专才\', \'text\': \'派出三个1/1无色自动机衍生神器生物。\\n你可以从你手上施放一张总法术力费用等于或小于3的牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「做事务必选好工具，不可大材小用。这就是给我用来剔牙的。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a79f81e-bcc3-4675-8bac-8ef118ae5fff\', \'multiverseId\': 423875}, \'multiverseid\': 423875}, {\'name\': \'斯勒姆的專才\', \'text\': \'派出三個1/1無色自動機衍生神器生物。\\n你可以從你手上施放一張總魔法力費用等於或小於3的牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「做事務必選好工具，不可大材小用。這就是給我用來剔牙的。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46ab3a82-0790-47f7-a44f-258fcfb6cdc1\', \'multiverseId\': 424059}, \'multiverseid\': 424059}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stille Weite\', \'text\': \'Die Stille Weite kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {G} oder {W}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Fernab des Chaos von Ghirapur liegt eine pulsierende Welt, in der Äther die Natur durchströmt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425726&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e41b52ea-1088-46b5-9714-a1d1e3416e2e\', \'multiverseId\': 425726}, \'multiverseid\': 425726}, {\'name\': \'Extensión tranquila\', \'text\': \'La Extensión tranquila entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {W} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Más allá del caos de Ghirapur existe un mundo vivo donde el éter fluye por la naturaleza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77a5a72a-2d21-401a-8c88-caed5e6184d8\', \'multiverseId\': 425796}, \'multiverseid\': 425796}, {\'name\': \'Immensité tranquille\', \'text\': "L\'Immensité tranquille arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W} à votre réserve.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Au-delà du chaos de Ghirapur, se trouve un monde vivant où l\'Éther circule dans la nature.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425736&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebb60312-5934-43ca-9e89-31c57eae620f\', \'multiverseId\': 425736}, \'multiverseid\': 425736}, {\'name\': \'Distesa Tranquilla\', \'text\': \'La Distesa Tranquilla entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W} alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "Oltre il caos di Ghirapur si estende un mondo lussureggiante dove l\'etere scorre tra la vegetazione.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1ceb65e-3a87-43cc-a6ae-baba17bbf5f3\', \'multiverseId\': 425746}, \'multiverseid\': 425746}, {\'name\': \'平穏なる広野\', \'text\': \'平穏なる広野はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}か{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'ギラプールの混沌の背後には、自然の中に霊気が循環する鮮烈な世界が広がっている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b63da29-f3e4-4aff-84e5-5e318ff1e062\', \'multiverseId\': 425756}, \'multiverseid\': 425756}, {\'name\': \'평온한 광야\', \'text\': \'평온한 광야는 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{T}: {G} 또는 {W}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': \'기라푸르의 혼돈 너머에는 에테르가 자연을 통해 흐르는 생기 넘치는 세상이 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95fe4ca8-d20e-4fdb-bc43-67e48e83590c\', \'multiverseId\': 425766}, \'multiverseid\': 425766}, {\'name\': \'Vastidão Tranquila\', \'text\': \'Vastidão Tranquila entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {W} à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Para além do caos de Ghirapur há um mundo vibrante onde o éter flui pela natureza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'240a06f1-9d5b-416c-b355-758b55805e1e\', \'multiverseId\': 425776}, \'multiverseid\': 425776}, {\'name\': \'Безмятежная Долина\', \'text\': \'Безмятежная Долина выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\n{T}: добавьте {G} или {W} в ваше хранилище маны.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'За границами шумного Гирапура раскинулся яркий, живой мир природы, пронизанный потоками эфира.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'319e1adb-31ba-4a05-ac2a-fbf31196cda0\', \'multiverseId\': 425786}, \'multiverseid\': 425786}, {\'name\': \'静谧旷野\', \'text\': \'静谧旷野须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{G}或{W}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'在混乱不堪的吉拉波之外，是一片生机盎然的世界，那里的乙太在自然中川流不息。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29fb4ee3-d7b7-4bdc-a91a-e98bb7032984\', \'multiverseId\': 425706}, \'multiverseid\': 425706}, {\'name\': \'靜謐曠野\', \'text\': \'靜謐曠野須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{G}或{W}到你的魔法力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'在混亂不堪的吉拉波之外，是一片生機盎然的世界，那裡的乙太在自然中川流不息。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65f77be8-eb3b-4756-b5e9-048b3317b27b\', \'multiverseId\': 425716}, \'multiverseid\': 425716}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stratagem des Illusionisten\', \'text\': \'Schicke bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil und bringe jene Karten dann unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn alles an einem einzigen Moment hängt, dann stelle sicher, dass du den richtigen wählst." —Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424255&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1df2b1cf-cec7-494e-8c3f-1271e41a5efd\', \'multiverseId\': 424255}, \'multiverseid\': 424255}, {\'name\': \'Estratagema del ilusionista\', \'text\': \'Exilia hasta dos criaturas objetivo que controlas, luego regresa esas cartas al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando todo depende de un único momento, asegúrate de que lo eliges bien". —Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8448cb1b-0e3d-40f3-9432-8aef045e7d97\', \'multiverseId\': 425543}, \'multiverseid\': 425543}, {\'name\': "Stratagème de l\'illusionniste", \'text\': "Exilez jusqu\'à deux créatures ciblées que vous contrôlez, puis renvoyez ces cartes sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de leur propriétaire.\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Quand tout dépend d\'un seul instant, assurez-vous d\'attendre le bon moment. » —Jace Beleren", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424439&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8f6cfaf-0434-4eac-b4de-8e18bd42f805\', \'multiverseId\': 424439}, \'multiverseid\': 424439}, {\'name\': "Stratagemma dell\'Illusionista", \'text\': \'Esilia fino a due creature bersaglio che controlli, poi rimetti quelle carte sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo dei rispettivi proprietari.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando tutto dipende da un singolo momento, assicurati di scegliere quello giusto." —Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a164607-e5d2-4db4-86d3-bb2e981e64b7\', \'multiverseId\': 424623}, \'multiverseid\': 424623}, {\'name\': \'幻術師の謀\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー最大２体を対象とし、それらを追放し、その後それらのカードをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\\nカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「すべてが一瞬にかかっているのだから、適切な瞬間を選ぶべきだ。」 ――ジェイス・ベレレン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51b0ad41-218b-4083-8f3b-52aadc9931e1\', \'multiverseId\': 424807}, \'multiverseid\': 424807}, {\'name\': \'환영술사의 술수\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물을 최대 두 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들을 추방한 후, 소유자의 조종하에 전장으로 되돌린다.\\n카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"모든 것이 한 순간에 달렸다면 반드시 올바른 순간을 선택해라." —제이스 벨레렌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7120724a-3c3a-45e1-a62c-7b711009bf97\', \'multiverseId\': 424991}, \'multiverseid\': 424991}, {\'name\': \'Estratagema do Ilusionista\', \'text\': \'Exile até duas criaturas alvo que você controla e, em seguida, devolva aqueles cards ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seus donos.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando tudo depende de um único momento, certifique-se de escolher o momento certo." — Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0e456d8-6089-4f9d-a756-9bd5bbea52f9\', \'multiverseId\': 425175}, \'multiverseid\': 425175}, {\'name\': \'Уловка Иллюзиониста\', \'text\': \'Изгоните не более двух целевых существ под вашим контролем, затем верните те карты на поле битвы под контролем их владельца.\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Когда все может решиться в один момент, постарайся, чтобы этот момент был правильный». — Джейс Белерен\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6cf82a5-03df-4e89-9bfe-b9523213e815\', \'multiverseId\': 425359}, \'multiverseid\': 425359}, {\'name\': \'幻影师谋略\', \'text\': \'放逐至多两个目标由你操控的生物，然后将这些牌在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「命悬一刻时，务必找准时机。」 ～杰斯贝连\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97a15055-16cd-4bfe-9f92-3e5932128d77\', \'multiverseId\': 423887}, \'multiverseid\': 423887}, {\'name\': \'幻影師謀略\', \'text\': \'放逐至多兩個目標由你操控的生物，然後將這些牌在其擁有者的操控下移回戰場。\\n抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「命懸一刻時，務必找準時機。」 ～傑斯貝連\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87432022-7403-428f-9f86-850009ddb43d\', \'multiverseId\': 424071}, \'multiverseid\': 424071}]', '[{\'name\': \'Streuungstechniker\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Streuungstechniker ins Spiel kommt, kannst du ein Artefakt deiner Wahl auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vedalken, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'Als die Streitkraft der Renegaten auf den Ätherturm vorrückte, wurde eine Blockade des Konsulats nach der anderen aufgerieben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424251&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dee9cfe-6c97-41cd-8b6a-ad13fde20559\', \'multiverseId\': 424251}, \'multiverseid\': 424251}, {\'name\': \'Especialista en dispersión\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Especialista en dispersión entre al campo de batalla, puedes regresar el artefacto objetivo a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice vedalken\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras las fuerzas de los renegados se acercaban más y más al Chapitel de Éter, las barreras del Consulado caían una detrás de otra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4e18434-35a5-4723-9a01-336046c828ce\', \'multiverseId\': 425539}, \'multiverseid\': 425539}, {\'name\': \'Technicien de dispersion\', \'text\': \'Quand le Technicien de dispersion arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez renvoyer un artefact ciblé dans la main de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vedalken et artificier\', \'flavor\': "Les renégats approchaient de la tour d\'Éther, franchissant l\'un après l\'autre tous les barrages du Consulat.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424435&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77db03ea-65f0-409b-942b-f0cb90b0b654\', \'multiverseId\': 424435}, \'multiverseid\': 424435}, {\'name\': \'Tecnico della Dispersione\', \'text\': \'Quando il Tecnico della Dispersione entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi far tornare un artefatto bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Vedalken\', \'flavor\': "Mentre le forze rinnegate si avvicinavano alla Guglia Eterea, i posti di blocco del Consolato cadevano uno dopo l\'altro.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82c96081-20fb-424a-ba57-fd2af75c7774\', \'multiverseId\': 424619}, \'multiverseid\': 424619}, {\'name\': \'分散の技師\', \'text\': \'分散の技師が戦場に出たとき、アーティファクト１つを対象とする。あなたはそれをオーナーの手札に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ヴィダルケン・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'領事府の封鎖を一つ一つ突破して、改革派の攻勢が霊気塔に迫った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68a7a448-80a4-4058-bfbd-0fce8cb73290\', \'multiverseId\': 424803}, \'multiverseid\': 424803}, {\'name\': \'분산 기술자\', \'text\': \'분산 기술자가 전장에 들어올 때, 마법물체를 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 마법물체를 소유자의 손으로 되돌릴 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 베달켄 기능공\', \'flavor\': \'무법자 부대가 에테르 첨탑을 포위하자 영사관의 방어벽이 하나씩 무너졌다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'775805a0-9ae3-477f-95a4-ed0ed4c6f5f8\', \'multiverseId\': 424987}, \'multiverseid\': 424987}, {\'name\': \'Técnico de Dispersão\', \'text\': \'Quando Técnico de Dispersão entra no campo de batalha, você pode devolver o artefato alvo para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vedalkeano Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'Conforme as forças dos renegados se aproximavam da Torre do Éter, as barricadas do Consulado caíam uma a uma.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a65df430-78ca-447c-babc-9f33d9b964dc\', \'multiverseId\': 425171}, \'multiverseid\': 425171}, {\'name\': \'Техник по Рассеиванию\', \'text\': \'Когда Техник по Рассеиванию выходит на поле битвы, вы можете вернуть целевой артефакт в руку его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ведалкен Механик\', \'flavor\': \'Силы отступников приближались к Эфирному Шпилю, одну за другой снимая блокады Консульства.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba81b39a-5ab8-4bc3-8f25-ea37654feb43\', \'multiverseId\': 425355}, \'multiverseid\': 425355}, {\'name\': \'离散技师\', \'text\': \'当离散技师进战场时，你可以将目标神器移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～维多肯／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'乱匠们迫近乙太尖塔，执政院的防线节节败退。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5a5a58c-93c5-4969-ba8a-16f7b2caaee1\', \'multiverseId\': 423883}, \'multiverseid\': 423883}, {\'name\': \'離散技師\', \'text\': \'當離散技師進戰場時，你可以將目標神器移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～維多肯／神器師\', \'flavor\': \'亂匠們迫近乙太尖塔，執政院的防線節節敗退。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbc4f594-80c4-48de-b14a-038240ee1dc1\', \'multiverseId\': 424067}, \'multiverseid\': 424067}]', '[{\'name\': \'Talentierter Äthergeborener\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung, Lebensverknüpfung\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Äthergeborener, Vampir\', \'flavor\': \'Einige wenige Äthergeborene haben einen Weg entdeckt, ihre Existenz aufrechtzuerhalten — auf Kosten einer unstillbaren Gier nach der Lebensessenz anderer Lebewesen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424280&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbb8c139-7cd0-4a8f-82a8-e0491cdd431c\', \'multiverseId\': 424280}, \'multiverseid\': 424280}, {\'name\': \'Etergénito excepcional\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal, vínculo vital.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro etergénito\', \'flavor\': \'Unos pocos etergénitos han descubierto la forma de sobrevivir a costa de un hambre insaciable por la esencia vital de otras criaturas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b1d870a-2a55-49cb-a239-fa244eabe85c\', \'multiverseId\': 425568}, \'multiverseid\': 425568}, {\'name\': \'Éthérien doué\', \'text\': \'Contact mortel, lien de vie\', \'type\': \'Créature : éthérien et vampire\', \'flavor\': "Quelques éthériens ont trouvé un moyen de se maintenir en vie, au prix d\'une soif insatiable pour l\'essence vitale d\'autrui.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424464&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'978b8e4a-8613-4c41-a854-06d00e150474\', \'multiverseId\': 424464}, \'multiverseid\': 424464}, {\'name\': \'Eteride Talentuoso\', \'text\': \'Tocco letale, legame vitale\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro Eteride\', \'flavor\': "Alcuni eteridi hanno scoperto come estendere la propria esistenza al prezzo di un\'insaziabile brama per l\'essenza vitale di altri esseri.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a28af695-4546-4e5b-977f-45e0da549044\', \'multiverseId\': 424648}, \'multiverseid\': 424648}, {\'name\': \'才気ある霊基体\', \'text\': \'接死、絆魂\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 霊基体・吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'霊基体の中には、他人の生命の本質への限りない渇望を代償として、自身の生存を引き延ばす方法を見つけた者もいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d0cc39c-0e52-4ffa-a93c-fd2cd9a65225\', \'multiverseId\': 424832}, \'multiverseid\': 424832}, {\'name\': \'타고난 에테르붙이\', \'text\': \'치명타, 생명연결\', \'type\': \'생물 — 에테르붙이 흡혈귀\', \'flavor\': \'몇몇 에테르붙이들은 삶을 지속하는 자신만의 방식을 찾아냈다. 다른 존재의 생명 정수에 대한 채울 수 없는 굶주림을 대가로 치름으로써 말이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db6e1bba-5a80-4c9d-bb73-d93bfe2aa4bf\', \'multiverseId\': 425016}, \'multiverseid\': 425016}, {\'name\': \'Etergênito Talentoso\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero, vínculo com a vida\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Etergênito Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Alguns etergênitos descobriram uma forma de sustentar a própria existência valendo-se de uma fome insaciável pela essência vital de outros seres.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b255acf2-70b0-4391-b7c7-4221f68abbb8\', \'multiverseId\': 425200}, \'multiverseid\': 425200}, {\'name\': \'Одаренный Эфирид\', \'text\': \'Смертельное касание, Цепь жизни\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эфирид Вампир\', \'flavor\': \'Некоторые эфириды нашли способ продлить свою жизнь, но расплатой стал неутолимый голод к жизненной силе других живых существ.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8341690-5864-40d8-a6cc-7958bde33410\', \'multiverseId\': 425384}, \'multiverseid\': 425384}, {\'name\': \'天资乙太种\', \'text\': \'死触，系命\', \'type\': \'生物～乙太种／吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'有些乙太种找到了让自己永存于世的方法，代价却是余生要去不断汲取其他生灵的生命菁华，以满足由此而生的无餍渴求。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59b9ff58-6be0-42c0-ab91-cbf37f2425e6\', \'multiverseId\': 423912}, \'multiverseid\': 423912}, {\'name\': \'天資乙太種\', \'text\': \'死觸，繫命\', \'type\': \'生物～乙太種／吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'有些乙太種找到了讓自己永存於世的方法，代價卻是餘生要去不斷汲取其他生靈的生命菁華，以滿足由此而生的無饜渴求。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1faf2c3-72d2-47ba-a59c-5b45b735cf28\', \'multiverseId\': 424096}, \'multiverseid\': 424096}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tezzeret der Ränkeschmied\', \'text\': \'+1: Erzeuge einen farblosen Artefaktspielstein namens Ätheriumzelle mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe."\\n−2: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +X/-X bis zum Ende des Zuges, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Artefakten ist, die du kontrollierst.\\n−7: Du erhältst ein Emblem mit „Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug wird ein Artefakt deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst, eine Artefaktkreatur mit Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 5/5."\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Tezzeret\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424356&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbcb7fc9-6bb1-41c9-a640-c53b087ce25f\', \'multiverseId\': 424356}, \'multiverseid\': 424356}, {\'name\': \'Tezzeret, el conspirador\', \'text\': \'+1: Crea una ficha de artefacto incolora llamada Célula de eterium con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color a tu reserva de maná".\\n−2: La criatura objetivo obtiene +X/-X hasta el final del turno, donde X es la cantidad de artefactos que controlas.\\n−7: Obtienes un emblema con "Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, el artefacto objetivo que controlas se convierte en una criatura artefacto con fuerza y resistencia base de 5/5".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Tezzeret\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00168305-a8e0-4c23-b84a-4e0c9eee4009\', \'multiverseId\': 425644}, \'multiverseid\': 425644}, {\'name\': \'Tezzeret le Conspirateur\', \'text\': "+1 : Créez un jeton d\'artefact incolore appelé Pile à étherium avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix à votre réserve ».\\n-2 : La créature ciblée gagne +X/-X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre d\'artefacts que vous contrôlez.\\n-7 : Vous gagnez un emblème avec « Au début du combat pendant votre tour, l\'artefact ciblé que vous contrôlez devient une créature-artefact ayant une force et une endurance de base de 5/5. »", \'type\': \'Planeswalker : Tezzeret\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424540&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6545b446-9425-444d-9b23-a1f9db0f5046\', \'multiverseId\': 424540}, \'multiverseid\': 424540}, {\'name\': \'Tezzeret il Manipolatore\', \'text\': \'+1: Crea una pedina artefatto incolore chiamata Cella di Eterium con "{T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore alla tua riserva di mana".\\n−2: Una creatura bersaglio prende +X/-X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è il numero di artefatti che controlli.\\n−7: Ottieni un emblema con "All\\\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, un artefatto bersaglio che controlli diventa una creatura artefatto con forza e costituzione base 5/5".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Tezzeret\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7ab33ba-db0c-42f9-bfc4-602e92d78a3f\', \'multiverseId\': 424724}, \'multiverseid\': 424724}, {\'name\': \'策謀家テゼレット\', \'text\': \'+1：「エーテリウム電池」と言う名前の無色のアーティファクト・トークンを１つ生成する。それは「{T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのマナ・プールに好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つ。\\n-2：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋Ｘ/－Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたがコントロールするアーティファクトの総数に等しい。\\n-7：あなたは「あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがコントロールするアーティファクト１つを対象とする。それは基本のパワーとタフネスが５/５のアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。」を持つ紋章を得る。\', \'type\': \'プレインズウォーカー — テゼレット\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f5fb76e-0b28-412a-a453-0e0aff141506\', \'multiverseId\': 424908}, \'multiverseid\': 424908}, {\'name\': \'책략가 테제렛\', \'text\': \'+1: "{T}, 이 마법물체를 희생한다: 당신의 마나풀에 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 담는다."를 가진 이름이 에테리움 전지인 무색 마법물체 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n−2: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +X/-X를 받는다. X는 당신이 조종하는 마법물체의 개수다.\\n−7: 당신은 "당신의 턴 전투 시작에, 당신이 조종하는 마법물체를 목표로 정한다. 그 마법물체는 기본 공격력과 방어력이 5/5인 마법물체 생물이 된다."를 가진 휘장을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'플레인즈워커 — 테제렛\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03ee2d77-3329-4f4f-839a-f4819bada73f\', \'multiverseId\': 425092}, \'multiverseid\': 425092}, {\'name\': \'Tezzeret, o Maquinador\', \'text\': \'+1: Crie uma ficha de artefato incolor com o nome Célula de Etherium com "{T}, Sacrifique este artefato: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor a sua reserva de mana."\\n−2: A criatura alvo recebe +X/-X até o final do turno, sendo X o número de artefatos que você controla.\\n−7: Você recebe um emblema com "No início do combate em seu turno, o artefato alvo que você controla se torna uma criatura artefato com poder e resistência básicos 5/5."\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Tezzeret\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7f41ed0-f77b-4361-b13d-91c9ad081832\', \'multiverseId\': 425276}, \'multiverseid\': 425276}, {\'name\': \'Теззерет Интриган\', \'text\': \'+1: создайте одну фишку бесцветного артефакта с именем Эфириевая Батарея и способностью «{T}, пожертвуйте этот артефакт: добавьте одну ману любого цвета в ваше хранилище маны».\\n—2: целевое существо получает +X/-X до конца хода, где Х — количество артефактов под вашим контролем.\\n—7: вы получаете эмблему со способностью «В начале боя во время вашего хода целевой артефакт под вашим контролем становится артефактом существом с базовыми силой и выносливостью 5/5».\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Теззерет\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e97ff12-737f-4de9-8606-792ae497592a\', \'multiverseId\': 425460}, \'multiverseid\': 425460}, {\'name\': \'阴谋家泰兹瑞\', \'text\': \'+1：派出一个无色，名称为乙金源的衍生神器，它具有「{T}，牺牲此神器：加一点任意颜色的法术力到你的法术力池中。」\\n−2：目标生物得+X/-X直到回合结束，X为由你操控的神器数量。\\n−7：你获得具有「在你回合的战斗开始时，目标由你操控的神器成为基础力量与防御力为5/5的神器生物」的徽记。\', \'type\': \'鹏洛客～泰兹瑞\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'deab5ce1-c283-4d5c-901e-4a4c0e484aa1\', \'multiverseId\': 423988}, \'multiverseid\': 423988}, {\'name\': \'陰謀家泰茲瑞\', \'text\': \'+1：派出一個無色，名稱為乙金源的衍生神器，它具有「{T}，犧牲此神器：加一點任意顏色的魔法力到你的魔法力池中。」\\n−2：目標生物得+X/-X直到回合結束，X為由你操控的神器數量。\\n−7：你獲得具有「在你回合的戰鬥開始時，目標由你操控的神器成為基礎力量與防禦力為5/5的神器生物」的徽記。\', \'type\': \'鵬洛客～泰茲瑞\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'730504ec-fcf4-410d-8242-016ea9c302a6\', \'multiverseId\': 424172}, \'multiverseid\': 424172}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tezzeret, Meister des Metalls\', \'text\': \'+1: Decke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek auf, bis du eine Artefaktkarte aufdeckst. Nimm die Karte auf deine Hand und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\\n−3: Ein Gegner deiner Wahl verliert so viele Lebenspunkte, wie du Artefakte kontrollierst.\\n−8: Übernimm die Kontrolle über alle Artefakte und Kreaturen, die ein Gegner deiner Wahl kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Tezzeret\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425727&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab979f02-1a81-45de-9257-b7f6ec5f537a\', \'multiverseId\': 425727}, \'multiverseid\': 425727}, {\'name\': \'Tezzeret, maestro del metal\', \'text\': \'+1: Muestra cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que muestres una carta de artefacto. Pon esa carta en tu mano y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\\n−3: El oponente objetivo pierde una cantidad de vidas igual al número de artefactos que controlas.\\n−8: Ganas el control de todos los artefactos y las criaturas que el oponente objetivo controla.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Tezzeret\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fb17d26-6fbf-400b-a817-6cb5389ba662\', \'multiverseId\': 425797}, \'multiverseid\': 425797}, {\'name\': \'Tezzeret, maître du métal\', \'text\': "+1 : Révélez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez une carte d\'artefact. Mettez cette carte dans votre main et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.\\n-3 : L\'adversaire ciblé perd un nombre de points de vie égal au nombre d\'artefacts que vous contrôlez.\\n-8 : Acquérez le contrôle de tous les artefacts et de toutes les créatures que l\'adversaire ciblé contrôle.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker : Tezzeret\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425737&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'030a97db-ae68-458b-b934-aa00c1f2d9dd\', \'multiverseId\': 425737}, \'multiverseid\': 425737}, {\'name\': \'Tezzeret, Maestro del Metallo\', \'text\': \'+1: Rivela carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non riveli una carta artefatto. Aggiungi quella carta alla tua mano e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\\n−3: Un avversario bersaglio perde punti vita pari al numero di artefatti che controlli.\\n−8: Prendi il controllo di tutte le creature e gli artefatti controllati da un avversario bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Tezzeret\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425747&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'000f7d59-f3cc-41f4-b658-81137174f051\', \'multiverseId\': 425747}, \'multiverseid\': 425747}, {\'name\': \'金属の支配者、テゼレット\', \'text\': \'+1：アーティファクト・カードが公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを１枚ずつ公開する。そのカードをあなたの手札に加え、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\\n−3：対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはあなたがコントロールするアーティファクトの総数に等しい点数のライフを失う。\\n−8：対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーがコントロールするすべてのアーティファクトとそのプレイヤーがコントロールするすべてのクリーチャーのコントロールを得る。\', \'type\': \'プレインズウォーカー — テゼレット\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3004d3e-d680-4cf0-8623-0669ca56f968\', \'multiverseId\': 425757}, \'multiverseid\': 425757}, {\'name\': \'금속 마도사 테제렛\', \'text\': \'+1: 마법물체 카드가 공개될 때까지 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 공개한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 가져가고 나머지 카드들은 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 무작위로 놓는다.\\n−3: 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대는 당신이 조종하는 마법물체의 개수만큼 생명점을 잃는다.\\n−8: 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대가 조종하는 모든 마법물체와 생물의 조종권을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'플레인즈워커 — 테제렛\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d1f359f-8eca-4370-a32d-e8bb96342830\', \'multiverseId\': 425767}, \'multiverseid\': 425767}, {\'name\': \'Tezzeret, Mestre do Metal\', \'text\': \'+1: Revele cards do topo de seu grimório até revelar um card de artefato. Coloque aquele card na sua mão e o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\\n−3: O oponente alvo perde uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao número de artefatos que você controla.\\n−8: Ganhe o controle de todos os artefatos e criaturas que o oponente alvo controla.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Tezzeret\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bddf0be7-6d10-4472-82b5-b2bbf3f50e72\', \'multiverseId\': 425777}, \'multiverseid\': 425777}, {\'name\': \'Теззерет, Владыка Металла\', \'text\': \'+1: показывайте карты с верха вашей библиотеки до тех пор, пока вы не покажете карту артефакта. Положите ту карту в вашу руку, а остальные — в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.\\n—3: целевой оппонент теряет количество жизней, равное количеству артефактов под вашим контролем.\\n—8: получите контроль над всеми артефактами и существами под контролем целевого оппонента.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Теззерет\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2fbf351-caf8-4197-8b43-1f0fe1a3fd5c\', \'multiverseId\': 425787}, \'multiverseid\': 425787}, {\'name\': \'金属大师泰兹瑞\', \'text\': \'+1：从你牌库顶开始展示牌，直到你展示出一张神器牌为止。将该牌置于你手上，并将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。\\n−3：目标对手失去等同于由你操控之神器数量的生命。\\n−8：获得所有由目标对手操控之神器和生物的操控权。\', \'type\': \'鹏洛客～泰兹瑞\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20ebad3c-c338-457f-87da-70e0e2d900f1\', \'multiverseId\': 425707}, \'multiverseid\': 425707}, {\'name\': \'金屬大師泰茲瑞\', \'text\': \'+1：從你牌庫頂開始展示牌，直到你展示出一張神器牌為止。將該牌置於你手上，並將其餘的牌以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。\\n−3：目標對手失去等同於由你操控之神器數量的生命。\\n−8：獲得所有由目標對手操控之神器和生物的操控權。\', \'type\': \'鵬洛客～泰茲瑞\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42bc1c8c-b4c4-4259-9fdc-0e60f2028aa4\', \'multiverseId\': 425717}, \'multiverseid\': 425717}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tezzerets Berührung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert ein Artefakt\\nDas verzauberte Artefakt ist zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Typen eine Kreatur mit Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 5/5.\\nWenn das verzauberte Artefakt auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, bringe es auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424357&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd5d2ff6-277a-4542-abad-9139c3694514\', \'multiverseId\': 424357}, \'multiverseid\': 424357}, {\'name\': \'Bendición de Tezzeret\', \'text\': \'Encantar artefacto.\\nEl artefacto encantado es una criatura con fuerza y resistencia base 5/5 además de sus otros tipos.\\nCuando el artefacto encantado vaya a un cementerio, regresa esa carta a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'643f6022-caf8-489c-a687-acaefc4f04ef\', \'multiverseId\': 425645}, \'multiverseid\': 425645}, {\'name\': \'Toucher de Tezzeret\', \'text\': "Enchanter : artefact\\nL\'artefact enchanté est une créature avec une force et une endurance de base de 5/5 en plus de ses autres types.\\nQuand l\'artefact enchanté est mis dans un cimetière, renvoyez cette carte dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424541&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'892a1542-c38c-48df-b1b1-847c47a00033\', \'multiverseId\': 424541}, \'multiverseid\': 424541}, {\'name\': \'Tocco di Tezzeret\', \'text\': "Incanta artefatto\\nL\'artefatto incantato è una creatura con forza e costituzione base 5/5 in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi.\\nQuando l\'artefatto incantato viene messo in un cimitero, fallo tornare in mano al suo proprietario.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c4b2c0a-3227-4ebf-a96a-8f516fc40c45\', \'multiverseId\': 424725}, \'multiverseid\': 424725}, {\'name\': \'テゼレットの手法\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（アーティファクト）\\nエンチャントされているアーティファクトは、他のタイプに加えて基本のパワーとタフネスが５/５のクリーチャーである。\\nエンチャントされているアーティファクトが墓地に置かれたとき、そのカードをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1b1d6cf-a83d-45b1-aadd-368824b84f77\', \'multiverseId\': 424909}, \'multiverseid\': 424909}, {\'name\': \'테제렛의 손길\', \'text\': \'마법물체에 부여\\n부여된 마법물체는 자신의 다른 유형에 더불어 기본 공격력 및 방어력이 5/5인 생물이다.\\n부여된 마법물체가 무덤에 놓일 때, 그 카드를 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'177d3245-27a6-41b8-bf6a-adffe70d2912\', \'multiverseId\': 425093}, \'multiverseid\': 425093}, {\'name\': \'Toque de Tezzeret\', \'text\': \'Encantar artefato\\nO artefato encantado é uma criatura com 5/5 de poder e resistência básicos além de seus outros tipos.\\nQuando o artefato encantado for colocado em um cemitério, devolva aquele card para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e7b3d12-350a-418c-932f-37d245838c40\', \'multiverseId\': 425277}, \'multiverseid\': 425277}, {\'name\': \'Прикосновение Теззерета\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать артефакт\\nЗачарованный артефакт является существом с базовыми силой и выносливостью 5/5 в дополнение к своим другим типам.\\nКогда зачарованный артефакт попадает на кладбище, верните ту карту в руку ее владельца.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'141c9b35-1d3a-491a-b5a9-047963e77040\', \'multiverseId\': 425461}, \'multiverseid\': 425461}, {\'name\': \'泰兹瑞之触\', \'text\': \'结附于神器\\n所结附的神器是基础力量与防御力为5/5的生物，且仍具有原本类别。\\n当所结附的神器置入坟墓场时，将该牌移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a421ccb-3fc3-4c7d-ac6f-d1a2bb18c630\', \'multiverseId\': 423989}, \'multiverseid\': 423989}, {\'name\': \'泰茲瑞之觸\', \'text\': \'結附於神器\\n所結附的神器是基礎力量與防禦力為5/5的生物，且仍具有原本類別。\\n當所結附的神器置入墳墓場時，將該牌移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acd8486a-6c3d-4fde-a629-080063d57b9e\', \'multiverseId\': 424173}, \'multiverseid\': 424173}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tezzerets Scheinbild\', \'text\': \'{T}: Ein Gegner deiner Wahl verliert 1 Lebenspunkt. Falls du einen Tezzeret-Planeswalker kontrollierst, verliert der Spieler stattdessen 3 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'Tezzerets Kontrolle über lebendiges Metall hat mit Feinmechanik oder Ätherversorgung nichts zu tun.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425730&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66f0c2e9-2106-4649-831d-5d020b826d3b\', \'multiverseId\': 425730}, \'multiverseid\': 425730}, {\'name\': \'Simulacro de Tezzeret\', \'text\': \'{T}: El oponente objetivo pierde 1 vida. Si controlas un planeswalker Tezzeret, en vez de eso, ese jugador pierde 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gólem\', \'flavor\': \'El dominio que Tezzeret tiene sobre el metal vivo no está relacionado con mecanismos intrincados ni con reservas de éter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6090225-d7fd-4d37-9476-37d0fc161890\', \'multiverseId\': 425800}, \'multiverseid\': 425800}, {\'name\': \'Simulacre de Tezzeret\', \'text\': "{T} : L\'adversaire ciblé perd 1 point de vie. Si vous contrôlez un planeswalker Tezzeret, ce joueur perd 3 points de vie à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : golem\', \'flavor\': "La maîtrise du métal vivant de Tezzeret n\'a rien à voir avec un attirail complexe ou des réserves d\'Éther.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425740&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05df6e7f-9a05-485e-82c6-e4219725dcb0\', \'multiverseId\': 425740}, \'multiverseid\': 425740}, {\'name\': \'Simulacro di Tezzeret\', \'text\': \'{T}: Un avversario bersaglio perde 1 punto vita. Se controlli un planeswalker Tezzeret, quel giocatore perde invece 3 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'Il dominio che Tezzeret esercita sul metallo vivo non ha nulla a che vedere con intricati ingranaggi né con le scorte di etere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425750&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccd6d9ee-bb75-445c-8e1a-89f858ed47e9\', \'multiverseId\': 425750}, \'multiverseid\': 425750}, {\'name\': \'テゼレットの代人\', \'text\': \'{T}：対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは１点のライフを失う。あなたがテゼレット・プレインズウォーカーをコントロールしているなら、代わりにそのプレイヤーは３点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': \'テゼレットが操る生きた金属は、入り組んだ歯車構造や霊気の供給によって動作しているわけではない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65c0a614-bdf4-471c-87b4-6d845fc372c9\', \'multiverseId\': 425760}, \'multiverseid\': 425760}, {\'name\': \'테제렛의 복제품\', \'text\': \'{T}: 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대는 생명 1점을 잃는다. 당신이 테제렛 플레인즈워커를 조종한다면, 대신에 그 플레이어는 생명 3점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 골렘\', \'flavor\': \'테제렛의 살아 움직이는 금속 물체를 다루는 능력은 복잡한 톱니 공예나 에테르 공급 장치와 무관하다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c2d73aa-37ce-4973-ab82-2666ce66cbd2\', \'multiverseId\': 425770}, \'multiverseid\': 425770}, {\'name\': \'Simulacro de Tezzeret\', \'text\': \'{T}: O oponente alvo perde 1 ponto de vida. Se você controla um planeswalker do tipo Tezzeret, em vez disso, aquele jogador perde 3 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'O domínio de Tezzeret sobre o metal vivo não tem nada a ver com engrenagens intrincadas nem com suprimentos de éter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed3e84c7-55d2-4d9d-bb28-f721b00dec32\', \'multiverseId\': 425780}, \'multiverseid\': 425780}, {\'name\': \'Симулякр Теззерета\', \'text\': \'{T}: целевой оппонент теряет 1 жизнь. Если под вашим контролем есть planeswalker Теззерет, тот игрок вместо этого теряет 3 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Голем\', \'flavor\': \'Власть Теззерета над живым металлом не имеет ничего общего с затейливыми механизмами и запасами эфира.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d989c924-2910-4cda-8090-57febf8c4470\', \'multiverseId\': 425790}, \'multiverseid\': 425790}, {\'name\': \'泰兹瑞拟像械\', \'text\': \'{T}：目标对手失去1点生命。如果你操控泰兹瑞鹏洛客，则改为该牌手失去3点生命。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～魔像\', \'flavor\': \'泰兹瑞对活化金属掌控自如，而这与精妙的机械技艺或乙太供能毫无关联。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76dacc81-ebaf-4892-896c-eeda912ab419\', \'multiverseId\': 425710}, \'multiverseid\': 425710}, {\'name\': \'泰茲瑞擬像械\', \'text\': \'{T}：目標對手失去1點生命。如果你操控泰茲瑞鵬洛客，則改為該玩家失去3點生命。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～魔像\', \'flavor\': \'泰茲瑞對活化金屬掌控自如，而這與精妙的機械技藝或乙太供能毫無關聯。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9f640eb-908f-4e34-b496-98a10fb64da3\', \'multiverseId\': 425720}, \'multiverseid\': 425720}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tezzerets Verrat\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Du kannst deine Bibliothek und/oder deinen Friedhof nach einer Karte namens Tezzeret, Meister des Metalls, durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Falls du auf diese Weise deine Bibliothek durchsuchst, mische sie danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ihr werdet niemals begreifen, welche Mächte hier am Werk sind." —Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425728&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d6838bf-0fc2-4afc-a0a2-7355114fb855\', \'multiverseId\': 425728}, \'multiverseid\': 425728}, {\'name\': \'La traición de Tezzeret\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo. Puedes buscar en tu biblioteca y/o cementerio una carta llamada Tezzeret, maestro del metal, mostrarla y ponerla en tu mano. Si buscas en tu biblioteca de esta manera, barájala.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"No puedes comprender los planes que hay en marcha". —Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f1ed4ed-458a-4a3d-a109-9d81d5c5431d\', \'multiverseId\': 425798}, \'multiverseid\': 425798}, {\'name\': \'Trahison de Tezzeret\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature ciblée. Vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque et/ou votre cimetière une carte appelée Tezzeret, maître du métal, la révéler et la mettre dans votre main. Si vous cherchez dans votre bibliothèque de cette manière, mélangez-la.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« N\'espérez pas comprendre les intrigues qui sont en marche. » —Tezzeret", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425738&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'132a169d-e3f9-4913-821e-752ce33304d2\', \'multiverseId\': 425738}, \'multiverseid\': 425738}, {\'name\': \'Tradimento di Tezzeret\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio. Puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio e/o il tuo cimitero per una carta chiamata Tezzeret, Maestro del Metallo, rivelarla e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Se passi in rassegna il tuo grimorio in questo modo, rimescolalo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Non potete sperare di comprendere i piani che si stanno compiendo." —Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82d9da80-394f-4903-afa7-6875912aa513\', \'multiverseId\': 425748}, \'multiverseid\': 425748}, {\'name\': \'テゼレットの企み\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。あなたはあなたのライブラリーやあなたの墓地から「金属の支配者、テゼレット」という名前のカード１枚を探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加えてもよい。あなたがこれによりあなたのライブラリーからカードを探したなら、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「お前にこの計画を理解できるはずがない。」 ――テゼレット\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcff1a0b-8501-411e-b798-4a5f3ad1b157\', \'multiverseId\': 425758}, \'multiverseid\': 425758}, {\'name\': \'테제렛의 배신\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다. 당신은 당신의 서고 및/또는 무덤에서 이름이 금속 마도사 테제렛인 카드 한 장을 찾아 공개한 후 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 당신이 이런 식으로 당신의 서고를 찾아보았다면, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"현재 진행형인 계획을 파악할 수 있으리라 기대하지 마라." —테제렛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8450ad2-ac0a-44cf-b876-ed001f512a24\', \'multiverseId\': 425768}, \'multiverseid\': 425768}, {\'name\': \'Traição de Tezzeret\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo. Você pode procurar em seu grimório e/ou cemitério um card com o nome Tezzeret, Mestre do Metal, revelá-lo e colocá-lo em sua mão. Se procurar em seu grimório desta maneira, embaralhe-o.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Vocês não podem esperar compreender os planos que estão em andamento." — Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62d2ee9c-b865-4bb6-80d8-02dae34973e4\', \'multiverseId\': 425778}, \'multiverseid\': 425778}, {\'name\': \'Предательство Теззерета\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо. Вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке и (или) на вашем кладбище карту с именем Теззерет, Владыка Металла, показать ее и положить в вашу руку. Если вы ищете таким образом в вашей библиотеке, перетасуйте ее.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Даже не надейтесь понять всю глубину планов, которые сейчас претворяются в жизнь». — Теззерет\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b36f8ee1-2bda-4369-9fb2-227bf492d934\', \'multiverseId\': 425788}, \'multiverseid\': 425788}, {\'name\': \'泰兹瑞的背叛\', \'text\': \'消灭目标生物。你可以从你的牌库和／或坟墓场中搜寻一张名称为金属大师泰兹瑞的牌，展示该牌，并将它置于你手上。如果你以此法搜寻你的牌库，则将它洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「这运作中的计划不是你能理解的。」 ～泰兹瑞\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c741a92-6a23-4891-8c27-43c374f9cde9\', \'multiverseId\': 425708}, \'multiverseid\': 425708}, {\'name\': \'泰茲瑞的背叛\', \'text\': \'消滅目標生物。你可以從你的牌庫和／或墳墓場中搜尋一張名稱為金屬大師泰茲瑞的牌，展示該牌，並將它置於你手上。如果你以此法搜尋你的牌庫，則將它洗牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「這運作中的計劃不是你能理解的。」 ～泰茲瑞\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1dadfe1-4b78-4aad-8e35-806faa5b3a84\', \'multiverseId\': 425718}, \'multiverseid\': 425718}]', '[{\'name\': \'Thopter-Festnahme\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Thopter-Festnahme ins Spiel kommt, schicke ein Artefakt oder eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, das bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert, ins Exil, bis die Thopter-Festnahme das Spiel verlässt.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Die Augen des Konsulats sind überall — sie schlafen nie, sie blinzeln nicht einmal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424244&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afac8beb-6c91-479e-b747-78af890182bc\', \'multiverseId\': 424244}, \'multiverseid\': 424244}, {\'name\': \'Arresto tóptero\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Arresto tóptero entre al campo de batalla, exilia la criatura o artefacto objetivo que controla un oponente hasta que el Arresto tóptero deje el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Los ojos del Consulado —que nunca duermen y nunca se cierran— están por todas partes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'923b07bf-319b-43d1-be93-bf245af1f167\', \'multiverseId\': 425532}, \'multiverseid\': 425532}, {\'name\': \'Arrestation par mécanoptère\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Arrestation par mécanoptère arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez un artefact ciblé ou une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle jusqu\'à ce que l\'Arrestation par mécanoptère quitte le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Omniprésents, les yeux du Consulat ne se ferment jamais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424428&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae19b5ed-5054-4fbb-a69b-0043e43d4309\', \'multiverseId\': 424428}, \'multiverseid\': 424428}, {\'name\': \'Arresto dei Totteri\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Arresto dei Totteri entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia un artefatto o una creatura bersaglio controllati da un avversario finché l\'Arresto dei Totteri non lascia il campo di battaglia.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Gli occhi del Consolato sono ovunque, sempre aperti e vigili.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a03f414-0684-4a9e-8400-4311d38b5896\', \'multiverseId\': 424612}, \'multiverseid\': 424612}, {\'name\': \'飛行機械による拘束\', \'text\': \'飛行機械による拘束が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールするアーティファクト１つかクリーチャー１体を対象とし、飛行機械による拘束が戦場を離れるまでそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'領事府の目はどこにでもあって、瞬きすることも眠ることもない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60df07d1-2878-486d-a4e3-7aa8ef7b33fa\', \'multiverseId\': 424796}, \'multiverseid\': 424796}, {\'name\': \'날틀 체포\', \'text\': \'날틀 체포가 전장에 들어올 때, 상대가 조종하는 마법물체 또는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 날틀 체포가 전장을 떠날 때까지 그 목표를 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'깜박이지도 잠들지도 않는 영사관의 눈이 사방에 깔려 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae1f4f1f-f56c-45e8-921b-35779b52a918\', \'multiverseId\': 424980}, \'multiverseid\': 424980}, {\'name\': \'Prisão por Tópteros\', \'text\': \'Quando Prisão por Tópteros entrar no campo de batalha, exile o artefato ou a criatura alvo que um oponente controla até que Prisão por Tópteros deixe o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Os olhos incansáveis do Consulado estão por toda parte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e566c89-1767-45c9-a5e4-bbff7a4dc4da\', \'multiverseId\': 425164}, \'multiverseid\': 425164}, {\'name\': \'Арест с Топтеров\', \'text\': \'Когда Арест с Топтеров выходит на поле битвы, изгоните целевой артефакт или существо под контролем оппонента до тех пор, пока Арест с Топтеров не покинет поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Глаза Консульства повсюду — немигающие, неспящие.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af918ccc-ab23-49f0-a77c-9b574e9bdd6b\', \'multiverseId\': 425348}, \'multiverseid\': 425348}, {\'name\': \'振翼机缉捕\', \'text\': \'当振翼机缉捕进战场时，放逐目标由对手操控的神器或生物，直到振翼机缉捕离开战场为止。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'执政院眼线无休无眠，无处不在。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eff3d736-80cb-4b39-9ba4-fed90a86453c\', \'multiverseId\': 423876}, \'multiverseid\': 423876}, {\'name\': \'振翼機緝捕\', \'text\': \'當振翼機緝捕進戰場時，放逐目標由對手操控的神器或生物，直到振翼機緝捕離開戰場為止。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'執政院眼線無休無眠，無處不在。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'535616e9-6ccf-4597-8d97-abec2e916d0f\', \'multiverseId\': 424060}, \'multiverseid\': 424060}]', '[{\'name\': \'Trophäenmagierin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Trophäenmagierin ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Artefaktkarte mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 3 durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf deine Hand nehmen und dann deine Bibliothek mischen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Werkzeuge der Vergangenheit werden uns helfen, eine neue Zukunft zu schmieden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424267&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a84e755-0d48-4220-99ce-e267b0ee946f\', \'multiverseId\': 424267}, \'multiverseid\': 424267}, {\'name\': \'Maga del trofeo\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Maga del trofeo entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de artefacto con coste de maná convertido de 3, mostrarla, ponerla en tu mano y luego barajar tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Las herramientas del pasado nos ayudarán a forjar el futuro".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f1365ee-75cc-46a6-ae7e-6bb2acc43c80\', \'multiverseId\': 425555}, \'multiverseid\': 425555}, {\'name\': \'Mage des trophées\', \'text\': "Quand la Mage des trophées arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte d\'artefact avec un coût converti de mana de 3, la révéler, la mettre dans votre main et mélanger votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Les outils du passé nous aiderons à forger l\'avenir. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424451&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1747dbd0-328f-4725-8fec-4a0a0fbedad5\', \'multiverseId\': 424451}, \'multiverseid\': 424451}, {\'name\': \'Maga dei Trofei\', \'text\': \'Quando la Maga dei Trofei entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta artefatto con costo di mana convertito pari a 3, rivelarla, aggiungerla alla tua mano, poi rimescolare il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Gli strumenti del passato ci aiuteranno a forgiare il futuro."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a55b6fe-ca54-4622-a527-4b395ad3f2fb\', \'multiverseId\': 424635}, \'multiverseid\': 424635}, {\'name\': \'戦利品の魔道士\', \'text\': \'戦利品の魔道士が戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたのライブラリーから点数で見たマナ・コストが３のアーティファクト・カード１枚を探してもよい。そうしたなら、それを公開してあなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「過去の工具が、未来を作る役に立つのです。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'530932f6-f45f-49d4-9484-61a6e0436a68\', \'multiverseId\': 424819}, \'multiverseid\': 424819}, {\'name\': \'전리품 마도사\', \'text\': \'전리품 마도사가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 당신의 서고에서 전환마나비용이 3인 마법물체 카드 한 장을 찾아 공개한 후 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"과거의 도구들은 우리의 미래를 만드는 데 도움이 된다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9eafc02-58e2-4f6e-8557-7134df44772b\', \'multiverseId\': 425003}, \'multiverseid\': 425003}, {\'name\': \'Maga dos Troféus\', \'text\': \'Quando Maga dos Troféus entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar em seu grimório um card de artefato com custo de mana convertido igual a 3, revelá-lo, colocá-lo em sua mão e depois embaralhar seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"As ferramentas do passado nos ajudarão a forjar o futuro."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c25a123c-70a2-44a5-8807-794300539636\', \'multiverseId\': 425187}, \'multiverseid\': 425187}, {\'name\': \'Маг Трофеев\', \'text\': \'Когда Маг Трофеев выходит на поле битвы, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту артефакта с конвертированной мана-стоимостью, равной 3, показать ее, положить ее в вашу руку, затем перетасовать вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Инструменты из прошлого помогают нам выковать будущее».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23c04360-b695-4035-9359-c07d6302530b\', \'multiverseId\': 425371}, \'multiverseid\': 425371}, {\'name\': \'珍物法师\', \'text\': \'当珍物法师进战场时，你可以从你牌库中搜寻一张总法术力费用等于3的神器牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「过去的工具将助我们打造未来。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c0a698c-f7ef-4109-9387-a6c47dad5b97\', \'multiverseId\': 423899}, \'multiverseid\': 423899}, {\'name\': \'珍物法師\', \'text\': \'當珍物法師進戰場時，你可以從你牌庫中搜尋一張總魔法力費用等於3的神器牌，展示該牌，將它置於你手上，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「過去的工具將助我們打造未來。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b588c826-1db7-40da-bdc0-b6c9dd04aa07\', \'multiverseId\': 424083}, \'multiverseid\': 424083}]', '[{\'name\': \'Turm der Industrie\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {C}.\\n{T}, bezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du ein Artefakt kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Leuchtfeuer des Wohlstands für einige, ein Schatten der Unterdrückung für andere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424403&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7929b155-676c-4241-8756-869d839a89a5\', \'multiverseId\': 424403}, \'multiverseid\': 424403}, {\'name\': \'Chapitel de la industria\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{T}, pagar 1 vida: Agrega un maná de cualquier color a tu reserva de maná. Activa esta habilidad solo si controlas un artefacto.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Un faro de prosperidad para algunos, una sombra de opresión para otros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ef43390-2c93-48dc-a1bd-506666ca8506\', \'multiverseId\': 425691}, \'multiverseid\': 425691}, {\'name\': "Tour de l\'industrie", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C} à votre réserve.\\n{T}, payez 1 point de vie : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix à votre réserve. N\'activez cette capacité que si vous contrôlez un artefact.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Modèle de prospérité pour certains, ombre de la répression pour d\'autres.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424587&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b883aa7e-f84c-4927-9c7a-f5620251ed8b\', \'multiverseId\': 424587}, \'multiverseid\': 424587}, {\'name\': "Spirale dell\'Industria", \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{T}, Paga 1 punto vita: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore alla tua riserva di mana. Attiva questa abilità solo se controlli un artefatto.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "Un faro di prosperità per alcuni, un\'ombra di oppressione per altri.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbaa8f10-4529-448a-a9be-c61bfd1129be\', \'multiverseId\': 424771}, \'multiverseid\': 424771}, {\'name\': \'産業の塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{C}を加える。\\n{T}, １点のライフを支払う：あなたのマナ・プールに、好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。この能力は、あなたがアーティファクトをコントロールしているときにのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'ある者には繁栄の灯、他の者には抑圧の影。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46eb04dc-4a79-41ad-9bd5-ba1518207150\', \'multiverseId\': 424955}, \'multiverseid\': 424955}, {\'name\': \'산업의 첨탑\', \'text\': \'{T}: {C}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\\n{T}, 생명 1점을 지불한다: 당신의 마나풀에 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 담는다. 이 능력은 당신이 마법물체를 조종할 때에만 활성화할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': \'누군가에게는 번영의 불빛이고 다른 누군가에게는 압제의 그늘이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8570ab7e-bc3f-4cd2-958b-a160f7afbcd6\', \'multiverseId\': 425139}, \'multiverseid\': 425139}, {\'name\': \'Torre da Indústria\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C} à sua reserva de mana.\\n{T}, Pague 1 ponto de vida: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor à sua reserva de mana. Ative esta habilidade somente se você controlar um artefato.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Um farol de prosperidade para alguns, uma sombra de opressão para outros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09613767-ef04-4cf2-9ce6-390f1efa441d\', \'multiverseId\': 425323}, \'multiverseid\': 425323}, {\'name\': \'Шпиль Производства\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C} в ваше хранилище маны.\\n{T}, заплатите 1 жизнь: добавьте одну ману любого цвета в ваше хранилище маны. Активируйте эту способность, только если вы контролируете артефакт.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Для одних — маяк процветания, для других — тень деспотизма.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e25ee2c4-50dd-4fbf-87ab-b63d3376a11a\', \'multiverseId\': 425507}, \'multiverseid\': 425507}, {\'name\': \'工业尖塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}到你的法术力池中。\\n{T}，支付1点生命：加一点任意颜色的法术力到你的法术力池中。只能于你操控神器时起动此异能。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'有人尊其为繁荣信标，而另一些人则唾之为压迫阴影。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1d87bf9-8f89-41ec-bb1d-a22b2cc94e98\', \'multiverseId\': 424035}, \'multiverseid\': 424035}, {\'name\': \'工業尖塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}到你的魔法力池中。\\n{T}，支付1點生命：加一點任意顏色的魔法力到你的魔法力池中。只能於你操控神器時起動此異能。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'有人尊其為繁榮信標，而另一些人則唾之為壓迫陰影。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cb4f594-1968-4544-99de-e298cbf52dbf\', \'multiverseId\': 424219}, \'multiverseid\': 424219}]', '[{\'name\': \'Turmpatrouille\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Turmpatrouille ins Spiel kommt, tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. Die Kreatur enttappt nicht während des nächsten Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Sobald ich deine Fracht durchsucht und deine Papiere kontrolliert habe, kannst du weiter."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424355&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddbdb978-ab9e-47bb-aeef-08f753699053\', \'multiverseId\': 424355}, \'multiverseid\': 424355}, {\'name\': \'Patrulla del chapitel\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Patrulla del chapitel entre al campo de batalla, gira la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente. Esa criatura no se endereza durante el próximo paso de enderezar de su controlador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Una vez que examine tu cargamento y compruebe tus papeles, podrás pasar".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cb1f32b-b298-422e-bfb8-e15eebce9af7\', \'multiverseId\': 425643}, \'multiverseid\': 425643}, {\'name\': \'Patrouille des tours\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand la Patrouille des tours arrive sur le champ de bataille, engagez une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle. Cette créature ne se dégage pas pendant la prochaine étape de dégagement de son contrôleur.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Une fois que j\'aurai examiné votre cargaison et vérifié vos papiers, vous pourrez passer. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424539&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a7f26e8-f7ca-4ed5-af23-4b17efe3a37e\', \'multiverseId\': 424539}, \'multiverseid\': 424539}, {\'name\': \'Pattuglia della Spirale\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando la Pattuglia della Spirale entra nel campo di battaglia, TAPpa una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario. Quella creatura non STAPpa durante il prossimo STAP del suo controllore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Potrete andarvene dopo che avrò esaminato il vostro carico e controllato i documenti."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424723&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93d459cf-64c0-4ca5-9ba5-62ac1f22af12\', \'multiverseId\': 424723}, \'multiverseid\': 424723}, {\'name\': \'尖塔の巡回員\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n尖塔の巡回員が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。そのクリーチャーは、それのコントローラーの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「積み荷を調べて書類を確認する。そうしたら、行っていいわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'188bcc63-5880-4fda-8565-d0a9c87c97c8\', \'multiverseId\': 424907}, \'multiverseid\': 424907}, {\'name\': \'첨탑 순찰대\', \'text\': \'비행\\n첨탑 순찰대가 전장에 들어올 때, 상대가 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 탭한다. 그 생물은 조종자의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': \'"짐과 서류에 대한 검사가 끝나면 지나가도 좋소."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b63172c0-735e-431f-85a8-841a8865917f\', \'multiverseId\': 425091}, \'multiverseid\': 425091}, {\'name\': \'Patrulheira das Torres\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Patrulheira das Torres entrar no campo de batalha, vire a criatura alvo que um oponente controla. Aquela criatura não desvira durante a próxima etapa de desvirar de seu controlador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Depois que eu examinar a sua carga e verificar os seus documentos, você pode ir."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b588eba3-9c40-447f-9bd8-f1425a7abc56\', \'multiverseId\': 425275}, \'multiverseid\': 425275}, {\'name\': \'Патрульная Шпилей\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Патрульная Шпилей выходит на поле битвы, поверните целевое существо под контролем оппонента. То существо не разворачивается во время следующего шага разворота контролирующего его игрока.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Я осмотрю твой груз и проверю документы, и можешь продолжать путь».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b4ad698-4f00-44fe-922f-69143e4ac2e0\', \'multiverseId\': 425459}, \'multiverseid\': 425459}, {\'name\': \'尖塔巡卫\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当尖塔巡卫进战场时，横置目标由对手操控的生物。该生物于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「待我检查完你的货物和文件后，你就可以上路了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42507243-a952-47ae-8dd6-153bd11c3b11\', \'multiverseId\': 423987}, \'multiverseid\': 423987}, {\'name\': \'尖塔巡衛\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當尖塔巡衛進戰場時，橫置目標由對手操控的生物。該生物於其操控者的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「待我檢查完你的貨物和文件後，你就可以上路了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b02bc57f-1e77-4db8-b202-2dbcc584db20\', \'multiverseId\': 424171}, \'multiverseid\': 424171}]', "[{'name': 'Tödlicher Stoß', 'text': 'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, falls sie umgewandelte Manakosten von 2 oder weniger hat.\\nRebellion — Falls in diesem Zug eine bleibende Karte unter deiner Kontrolle das Spiel verlassen hat, zerstöre stattdessen die Kreatur, falls sie umgewandelte Manakosten von 4 oder weniger hat.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424276&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '813c5f23-a6a4-4117-9094-2494ce78df72', 'multiverseId': 424276}, 'multiverseid': 424276}, {'name': 'Empujón fatal', 'text': 'Destruye la criatura objetivo si tiene un coste de maná convertido de 2 o menos.\\nRevuelta — Destruye esa criatura si tiene un coste de maná convertido de 4 o menos en vez de eso si un permanente que controlabas dejó el campo de batalla este turno.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425564&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c063202b-bf0d-4220-93b6-72a8d8ef87a5', 'multiverseId': 425564}, 'multiverseid': 425564}, {'name': 'Poussée fatale', 'text': 'Détruisez la créature ciblée si son coût converti de mana est inférieur ou égal à 2.\\nRévolte — Détruisez cette créature si son coût converti de mana est inférieur ou égal à 4 à la place, si un permanent que vous contrôliez a quitté le champ de bataille ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424460&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9216f67c-064f-4f44-9b21-b39577e715cd', 'multiverseId': 424460}, 'multiverseid': 424460}, {'name': 'Spinta Fatale', 'text': 'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio se ha costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 2.\\nRivolta — Se un permanente che controllavi ha lasciato il campo di battaglia in questo turno, distruggi invece quella creatura se ha costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 4.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424644&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a77b213d-54e9-4472-8467-f58064d4440c', 'multiverseId': 424644}, 'multiverseid': 424644}, {'name': '致命的な一押し', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの点数で見たマナ・コストが２以下であるなら、それを破壊する。\\n紛争 ― このターンにあなたがコントロールするパーマネントが戦場を離れていたなら、代わりに、そのクリーチャーの点数で見たマナ・コストが４以下であるなら、それを破壊する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424828&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '85c0592c-0fbc-4c07-a6bf-7dbf6cb0a1a4', 'multiverseId': 424828}, 'multiverseid': 424828}, {'name': '치명적 밀치기', 'text': '생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물의 전환마나비용이 2 이하라면 그 생물을 파괴한다.\\n봉기 — 당신이 조종한 지속물이 이 턴에 전장을 떠났다면, 대신에 전환마나비용이 4 이하라면 그 생물을 파괴한다.', 'type': '순간마법', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425012&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8a3af4a7-9e92-4d90-ba96-a99dbc219836', 'multiverseId': 425012}, 'multiverseid': 425012}, {'name': 'Empurrão Fatal', 'text': 'Destrua a criatura alvo se ela tiver custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a 2.\\nRevolta — Em vez disso, destrua aquela criatura se ela tiver um custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a 4 se uma permanente que você controlava deixou o campo de batalha neste turno.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425196&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5a61f36a-57bf-445a-a4ce-3ec42c92bbc6', 'multiverseId': 425196}, 'multiverseid': 425196}, {'name': 'Смертельный Толчок', 'text': 'Уничтожьте целевое существо, если его конвертированная мана-стоимость равна 2 или меньше.\\nБунт — Вместо этого уничтожьте то существо, если его конвертированная мана-стоимость равна 4 или меньше, и если находившийся под вашим контролем перманент покинул поле битвы в этом ходу.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425380&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '910d7d7a-15e7-4df4-8e5c-d1fa85171209', 'multiverseId': 425380}, 'multiverseid': 425380}, {'name': '送终一击', 'text': '如果目标生物的总法术力费用等于或小于2，则消灭之。\\n反抗～如果本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物离开战场，则改为如果目标生物的总法术力费用等于或小于4，则消灭之。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423908&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2b511f92-2bab-4798-9cb3-81551326055a', 'multiverseId': 423908}, 'multiverseid': 423908}, {'name': '送終一擊', 'text': '如果目標生物的總魔法力費用等於或小於2，則消滅之。\\n反抗～如果本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物離開戰場，則改為如果目標生物的總魔法力費用等於或小於4，則消滅之。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424092&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd51d84b-a86a-4a6f-871f-037b6cf2b1f2', 'multiverseId': 424092}, 'multiverseid': 424092}]", '[{\'name\': \'Unbeugsame Kreativität\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre X Artefakte und/oder Kreaturen deiner Wahl. Für jede auf diese Weise zerstörte bleibende Karte deckt ihr Beherrscher Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek auf, bis er eine Artefakt- oder Kreaturenkarte aufdeckt, und schickt jene Karte ins Exil. Diese Spieler bringen die ins Exil geschickten Karten ins Spiel und mischen dann ihre Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424304&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f96c6293-e66f-4f51-9633-76e3920f47b1\', \'multiverseId\': 424304}, \'multiverseid\': 424304}, {\'name\': \'Creatividad indomable\', \'text\': \'Destruye X artefactos y/o criaturas objetivo. Por cada permanente destruido de esta manera, su controlador muestra cartas de la parte superior de su biblioteca hasta que muestre una carta de criatura o de artefacto y exilia esa carta. Esos jugadores ponen las cartas exiliadas en el campo de batalla y luego barajan sus bibliotecas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'051194a9-f580-4b09-9a28-247cda0462bb\', \'multiverseId\': 425592}, \'multiverseid\': 425592}, {\'name\': \'Créativité indomptable\', \'text\': "Détruisez X artefacts ciblés et/ou créatures ciblées. Pour chaque permanent détruit de cette manière, son contrôleur révèle les cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce qu\'une carte de créature ou d\'artefact soit révélée et exile cette carte. Ces joueurs mettent les cartes exilées sur le champ de bataille, puis mélangent leurs bibliothèques.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424488&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a934835d-e292-4559-b575-fd4d7236f4d5\', \'multiverseId\': 424488}, \'multiverseid\': 424488}, {\'name\': \'Creatività Indomita\', \'text\': \'Distruggi X artefatti e/o creature bersaglio. Per ogni permanente distrutto in questo modo, il suo controllore rivela carte dalla cima del proprio grimorio finché non viene rivelata una carta artefatto o creatura ed esilia quella carta. Quei giocatori mettono le carte esiliate sul campo di battaglia e poi rimescolano i rispettivi grimori.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e16992c0-c01c-42fc-bffb-3611cb6498ce\', \'multiverseId\': 424672}, \'multiverseid\': 424672}, {\'name\': \'不屈の独創力\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトやクリーチャー、合わせてＸ個を対象とし、それらを破壊する。これにより破壊されたパーマネント１つにつき、それのコントローラーはそれぞれ、アーティファクト・カードかクリーチャー・カードが公開されるまで自分のライブラリーの一番上からカードを１枚ずつ公開し、そのカードを追放する。それらのプレイヤーは、それらの追放されたカードを戦場に出し、その後自分のライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4010185b-7fab-4f0e-95b6-d5ecb5b6f8f0\', \'multiverseId\': 424856}, \'multiverseid\': 424856}, {\'name\': \'불굴의 창의력\', \'text\': \'마법물체 및/또는 생물 X개를 목표로 정한다. 그 목표들을 파괴한다. 이렇게 파괴된 지속물 한 개당, 그 지속물의 조종자는 마법물체 또는 생물 카드를 공개할 때까지 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 공개한 후 그 카드를 추방한다. 그 플레이어들은 추방한 카드들을 전장에 놓은 후 자신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b74f75b-f066-4817-a0d5-4da3480f658d\', \'multiverseId\': 425040}, \'multiverseid\': 425040}, {\'name\': \'Criatividade Indômita\', \'text\': \'Destrua X artefatos e/ou criaturas alvo. Para cada permanente destruída desta forma, seu controlador revela cards do topo do próprio grimório até que um card de artefato ou criatura seja revelado e exila aquele card. Aqueles jogadores colocam os cards exilados no campo de batalha e, em seguida, embaralham seus grimórios.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2d7f108-e557-49e7-9a46-a44d321dff9b\', \'multiverseId\': 425224}, \'multiverseid\': 425224}, {\'name\': \'Неукротимое Творчество\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте X целевых артефактов и (или) существ. За каждый перманент, уничтоженный таким образом, контролировавший его игрок показывает карты с верха своей библиотеки до тех пор, пока не покажет карту артефакта или существа, и изгоняет ту карту. Те игроки кладут изгнанные карты на поле битвы, затем тасуют свои библиотеки.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84b8d850-4d53-453d-ba63-4ac2fef1b241\', \'multiverseId\': 425408}, \'multiverseid\': 425408}, {\'name\': \'无畏创新\', \'text\': \'消灭X个目标神器和／或生物。为每个以此法消灭的永久物进行以下流程～其操控者从其牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出一张神器或生物牌为止，放逐该牌。这些牌手各将所放逐的牌放进战场，然后将各自的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6f03685-30d6-44a7-8739-1fbe5de7670f\', \'multiverseId\': 423936}, \'multiverseid\': 423936}, {\'name\': \'無畏創新\', \'text\': \'消滅X個目標神器和／或生物。為每個以此法消滅的永久物進行以下流程～其操控者從其牌庫頂開始展示牌，直到展示出一張神器或生物牌為止，放逐該牌。這些玩家各將所放逐的牌放進戰場，然後將各自的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41b22522-ca19-4c61-b1bc-4fbd05e80a9a\', \'multiverseId\': 424120}, \'multiverseid\': 424120}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ungezügeltes Wachstum\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert ein Land\\nDas verzauberte Land hat „{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe."\\nOpfere das Ungezügelte Wachstum: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn das Konsulat seine Zurückhaltung ablegt, so wird es die Wildnis ebenfalls tun." —Surash, Hüter des Kuttengrunds\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424345&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3e375bd-ff89-4f21-9f72-d3a5f6e5755f\', \'multiverseId\': 424345}, \'multiverseid\': 424345}, {\'name\': \'Crecimiento desenfrenado\', \'text\': \'Encantar tierra.\\nLa tierra encantada tiene "{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color a tu reserva de maná".\\nSacrificar el Crecimiento desenfrenado: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Si el Consulado ha abandonado toda contención, la naturaleza le pagará con la misma moneda". —Surash, guardián de la Cogulla\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fa0d138-d42c-406a-94b6-4218a2e8eba6\', \'multiverseId\': 425633}, \'multiverseid\': 425633}, {\'name\': \'Croissance déchaînée\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : terrain\\nLe terrain enchanté a « {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix à votre réserve. »\\nSacrifiez la Croissance déchaînée : Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "« Si le Consulat a abandonné toute retenue, alors la nature fera de même. » —Surash, gardien de l\'Auvent", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424529&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51553871-0e48-484d-aa08-2cb2b437e109\', \'multiverseId\': 424529}, \'multiverseid\': 424529}, {\'name\': \'Crescita Sfrenata\', \'text\': \'Incanta terra\\nLa terra incantata ha "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore alla tua riserva di mana".\\nSacrifica la Crescita Sfrenata: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Se il Consolato ha abbandonato la moderazione, lo stesso faranno le terre selvagge." —Surash, custode della Cappa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e404d1c-3a91-4785-81f0-267833924bfb\', \'multiverseId\': 424713}, \'multiverseid\': 424713}, {\'name\': \'枷はずれな成長\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（土地）\\nエンチャントされている土地は「{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに、好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つ。\\n枷はずれな成長を生け贄に捧げる：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「領事府が好き勝手をするなら、自然もそうするさ。」 ――僧帽地帯の番人、スーラーシ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58bfc68f-82d9-4305-b2d9-23176e30cbf4\', \'multiverseId\': 424897}, \'multiverseid\': 424897}, {\'name\': \'거침없는 성장\', \'text\': \'대지에 부여\\n부여된 대지는 "{T}: 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다."를 가진다.\\n거침없는 성장을 희생한다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'"영사관이 자제력을 잃었다면 야생 환경 또한 마찬가지다." —카울의 수호자 수라시\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10cbd181-3033-4306-a0d7-1c9849e92611\', \'multiverseId\': 425081}, \'multiverseid\': 425081}, {\'name\': \'Crescimento Desgovernado\', \'text\': \'Encantar terreno\\nO terreno encantado tem "{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor à sua reserva de mana."\\nSacrifique Crescimento Desgovernado: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Se o Consulado desistiu de se conter, a natureza fará o mesmo." — Surash, guardião do Capote\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0247ad6a-b85d-48e0-9655-fe8e36abe95a\', \'multiverseId\': 425265}, \'multiverseid\': 425265}, {\'name\': \'Необузданный Рост\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать землю\\nЗачарованная земля имеет способность «{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета в ваше хранилище маны».\\nПожертвуйте Необузданный Рост: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'«Если Консульство решило не сдерживать себя, то лес поступит также». — Сураш, хранитель Покрова\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6f2641d-a49e-4e84-9b2f-3d57f87a5349\', \'multiverseId\': 425449}, \'multiverseid\': 425449}, {\'name\': \'放肆成长\', \'text\': \'结附于地\\n所结附的地具有「{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力到你的法术力池中。」\\n牺牲放肆成长：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「如果执政院已经放弃执行限制令，荒野自然也应抛下束缚。」 ～外沿区守卫苏勒什\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfa05cde-13f8-4de4-b804-692fa6259b8d\', \'multiverseId\': 423977}, \'multiverseid\': 423977}, {\'name\': \'放肆成長\', \'text\': \'結附於地\\n所結附的地具有「{T}：加一點任意顏色的魔法力到你的魔法力池中。」\\n犧牲放肆成長：抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'「如果執政院已經放棄執行限制令，荒野自然也應拋下束縛。」 ～外沿區守衛蘇勒什\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'601118f8-8388-4630-be09-d80708a6e37e\', \'multiverseId\': 424161}, \'multiverseid\': 424161}]', '[{\'name\': \'Universal-Lösungsmittel\', \'text\': \'{7}, {T}, opfere das Universal-Lösungsmittel: Zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein paar Tropfen davon, und selbst die heikelsten Probleme lösen sich in Wohlgefallen auf." —Thamaz, Bronzeviertel-Erfinder\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424397&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dcb87b5-e9fd-4c7e-88e8-91e9f1e5fcd6\', \'multiverseId\': 424397}, \'multiverseid\': 424397}, {\'name\': \'Disolvente universal\', \'text\': \'{7}, {T}, sacrificar el Disolvente universal: Destruye el permanente objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Unas pocas gotas y los obstáculos más complicados desaparecen sin más". —Thamaz, inventora de Sueldafirme\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44da8ef8-e77c-4f8a-ae51-4b723a1e4c83\', \'multiverseId\': 425685}, \'multiverseid\': 425685}, {\'name\': \'Solvant universel\', \'text\': \'{7}, {T}, sacrifiez le Solvant universel : Détruisez le permanent ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Il suffit de quelques gouttes pour faire disparaître les problèmes les plus complexes. » —Thamaz, inventeur de Vive-Soudure\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424581&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f5fc35e-2e21-4d55-947d-62e295ce5b02\', \'multiverseId\': 424581}, \'multiverseid\': 424581}, {\'name\': \'Solvente Universale\', \'text\': \'{7}, {T}, Sacrifica il Solvente Universale: Distruggi un permanente bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Bastano poche gocce e i problemi più complessi svaniscono." —Thamaz, inventrice della Saldapoli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0116fccc-d253-4389-b353-014378eaf61f\', \'multiverseId\': 424765}, \'multiverseid\': 424765}, {\'name\': \'万能溶剤\', \'text\': \'{7}, {T}, 万能溶剤を生け贄に捧げる：パーマネント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「これ数滴で、どんな問題も解決よ。」 ――速接会の発明者、ターマズ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ac38080-6599-43fa-a2aa-ffe5ac23773d\', \'multiverseId\': 424949}, \'multiverseid\': 424949}, {\'name\': \'만능 용매\', \'text\': \'{7}, {T}, 만능 용매를 희생한다: 지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'"이 용액 몇 방울이면 사소한 문젯거리는 금세 사라지지." —신속땜질지구 발명가 타마즈\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8639476a-d839-4c7c-85e8-f38aadb8d162\', \'multiverseId\': 425133}, \'multiverseid\': 425133}, {\'name\': \'Solvente Universal\', \'text\': \'{7}, {T}, Sacrifique Solvente Universal: Destrua a permanente alvo.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Algumas gotas disso e os problemas mais complicados simplesmente se desfazem." — Thamaz, inventora Soldafirme\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'342f566c-25a7-4c26-a5b7-9cc8e163ba90\', \'multiverseId\': 425317}, \'multiverseid\': 425317}, {\'name\': \'Универсальный Растворитель\', \'text\': \'{7}, {T}, пожертвуйте Универсальный Растворитель: уничтожьте целевой перманент.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Несколько капель этого средства — и самые большие проблемы просто растворяются». — Тамаз, изобретатель из Сварного Шва\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00ad07f3-5f10-4121-9be6-9bd2c457a818\', \'multiverseId\': 425501}, \'multiverseid\': 425501}, {\'name\': \'万溶剂\', \'text\': \'{7}，{T}，牺牲万溶剂：消灭目标永久物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「只消几滴，最棘手的问题也会溶于无形。」 ～焊锢区发明家泰玛慈\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'732bfc6f-4b40-454c-8f70-53b8c5462068\', \'multiverseId\': 424029}, \'multiverseid\': 424029}, {\'name\': \'萬溶劑\', \'text\': \'{7}，{T}，犧牲萬溶劑：消滅目標永久物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「只消幾滴，最棘手的問題也會溶於無形。」 ～速焊會發明家泰瑪慈\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd4a5e29-3669-4cbd-b9ec-2a0f6c5a25bc\', \'multiverseId\': 424213}, \'multiverseid\': 424213}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unterstützung vom Kuttengrund\', \'text\': \'Rebellion — Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls in diesem Zug eine bleibende Karte unter deiner Kontrolle das Spiel verlassen hat, decke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf. Falls die aufgedeckte Karte eine bleibende Karte ist, kannst du sie ins Spiel bringen. Anderenfalls kannst du sie unter deine Bibliothek legen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424324&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db491b28-2620-46ff-9e51-1fbed1a80395\', \'multiverseId\': 424324}, \'multiverseid\': 424324}, {\'name\': \'Refuerzos de Cogulla\', \'text\': \'Revuelta — Al comienzo de tu paso final, si un permanente que controlabas dejó el campo de batalla este turno, muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Si es una carta de permanente, puedes ponerla en el campo de batalla. Si no, puedes ponerla en el fondo de tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66cb8894-6404-4329-a459-d703bb7d1cca\', \'multiverseId\': 425612}, \'multiverseid\': 425612}, {\'name\': "Aide de l\'Auvent", \'text\': "Révolte — Au début de votre étape de fin, si un permanent que vous contrôliez a quitté le champ de bataille ce tour-ci, révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de permanent, vous pouvez la mettre sur le champ de bataille. Sinon, vous pouvez la mettre au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424508&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'278af030-753f-4b74-9b59-3b8b19a3f8d8\', \'multiverseId\': 424508}, \'multiverseid\': 424508}, {\'name\': \'Sostegno dalla Cappa\', \'text\': "Rivolta — All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se un permanente che controllavi ha lasciato il campo di battaglia in questo turno, rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se è una carta permanente, puoi metterla sul campo di battaglia. Altrimenti, puoi metterla in fondo al tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b9ff48b-21a5-40a6-b00b-6183b2ec456b\', \'multiverseId\': 424692}, \'multiverseid\': 424692}, {\'name\': \'僧帽地帯からの援軍\', \'text\': \'紛争 ― あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたがコントロールするパーマネントが戦場を離れていた場合、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。それがパーマネント・カードであるなら、あなたはそれを戦場に出してもよい。そうでないなら、あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76b570ec-b246-4e16-b1e7-a3f3172b9f76\', \'multiverseId\': 424876}, \'multiverseid\': 424876}, {\'name\': \'카울의 지원\', \'text\': \'봉기 — 당신의 종료단 시작에, 당신이 조종한 지속물이 이 턴에 전장을 떠났다면, 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 공개한다. 그 카드가 지속물 카드라면 당신은 그 카드를 전장에 놓을 수 있다. 그렇지 않으면 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓을 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'568779cc-a999-462d-b15b-e33758ab20c1\', \'multiverseId\': 425060}, \'multiverseid\': 425060}, {\'name\': \'Ajuda do Capote\', \'text\': \'Revolta — No início de sua etapa final, se uma permanente que você controlava deixou o campo de batalha neste turno, revele o card do topo de seu grimório. Se for um card de permanente, você poderá colocá-lo no campo de batalha. Do contrário, você poderá colocá-lo no fundo de seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'754c7002-11d4-4b67-9ed5-bc70b467b51e\', \'multiverseId\': 425244}, \'multiverseid\': 425244}, {\'name\': \'Помощь из Покрова\', \'text\': \'Бунт — В начале вашего заключительного шага, если находившийся под вашим контролем перманент покинул поле битвы в этом ходу, покажите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Если это карта перманента, вы можете положить ее на поле битвы. В противном случае вы можете положить ее в низ вашей библиотеки.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81aa3798-ca53-42b1-a702-15fa4625420b\', \'multiverseId\': 425428}, \'multiverseid\': 425428}, {\'name\': \'外沿区相助\', \'text\': \'反抗～在你的结束步骤开始时，若本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物离开战场，则展示你的牌库顶牌。若它是永久物牌，你可以将它放进战场。若否，则你可以将其置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c62d9a0a-01c8-4f79-ad88-267a10e09a2a\', \'multiverseId\': 423956}, \'multiverseid\': 423956}, {\'name\': \'外沿區相助\', \'text\': \'反抗～在你的結束步驟開始時，若本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物離開戰場，則展示你的牌庫頂牌。若它是永久物牌，你可以將它放進戰場。若否，則你可以將其置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ae0363f-2d98-446d-8e83-5610332edc74\', \'multiverseId\': 424140}, \'multiverseid\': 424140}]', '[{\'name\': \'Utensil der Besserung\', \'text\': \'{W}, opfere das Utensil der Besserung: Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nWenn das Utensil der Besserung aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Ein metallenes Mysterium.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424377&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0fbb481-f3b2-461f-9889-df886deb03ba\', \'multiverseId\': 424377}, \'multiverseid\': 424377}, {\'name\': \'Ingenio de mejora\', \'text\': \'{W}, sacrificar el Ingenio de mejora: Ganas 2 vidas.\\nCuando el Ingenio de mejora vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Un misterio de metal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0ed296e-faa8-4024-bc22-ae52128957e4\', \'multiverseId\': 425665}, \'multiverseid\': 425665}, {\'name\': "Outil d\'amélioration", \'text\': "{W}, sacrifiez l\'Outil d\'amélioration : Vous gagnez 2 points de vie.\\nQuand l\'Outil d\'amélioration est mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Un mystère de métal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424561&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bb53a01-00eb-467a-a0bc-31e53a25f6d7\', \'multiverseId\': 424561}, \'multiverseid\': 424561}, {\'name\': \'Strumento di Ripresa\', \'text\': \'{W}, Sacrifica lo Strumento di Ripresa: Guadagni 2 punti vita.\\nQuando lo Strumento di Ripresa viene messo in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Un mistero di metallo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ecc6049-5b2f-45e0-a301-ce9841377dd4\', \'multiverseId\': 424745}, \'multiverseid\': 424745}, {\'name\': \'改良器具\', \'text\': \'{W}, 改良器具を生け贄に捧げる：あなたは２点のライフを得る。\\n改良器具が戦場から墓地に置かれたとき、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'金属に隠された神秘。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fc7494d-7851-4bd9-8dd6-e0a5e8888858\', \'multiverseId\': 424929}, \'multiverseid\': 424929}, {\'name\': \'향상 장치\', \'text\': \'{W}, 향상 장치를 희생한다: 당신은 생명 2점을 얻는다.\\n향상 장치가 전장에서 무덤에 놓일 때, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'금속 안에 숨겨진 비밀.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e869b320-21ac-4f28-909e-4ea86d1b9a5d\', \'multiverseId\': 425113}, \'multiverseid\': 425113}, {\'name\': \'Implemento de Aprimoramento\', \'text\': \'{W}, Sacrifique Implemento de Aprimoramento: Você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\\nQuando Implemento de Aprimoramento for colocado em um cemitério vindo do campo de batalha, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Um mistério em metal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ace161f4-f428-4b1a-a6dd-e94d30aef2b6\', \'multiverseId\': 425297}, \'multiverseid\': 425297}, {\'name\': \'Орудие Улучшения\', \'text\': \'{W}, пожертвуйте Орудие Улучшения: вы получаете 2 жизни.\\nКогда Орудие Улучшения попадает с поля битвы на кладбище, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Тайна, заключенная в металле.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'308ab55d-3819-4f6f-a661-eaabf18983cd\', \'multiverseId\': 425481}, \'multiverseid\': 425481}, {\'name\': \'改进擎具\', \'text\': \'{W}，牺牲改进擎具：你获得2点生命。\\n当改进擎具从战场进入坟墓场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'金属构成的谜团。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70415778-b943-4228-bf6e-017fb71ee887\', \'multiverseId\': 424009}, \'multiverseid\': 424009}, {\'name\': \'改進擎具\', \'text\': \'{W}，犧牲改進擎具：你獲得2點生命。\\n當改進擎具從戰場進入墳墓場時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'金屬構成的謎團。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c84d23c4-f9dc-4ada-98bd-9408b4fcc510\', \'multiverseId\': 424193}, \'multiverseid\': 424193}]', '[{\'name\': \'Utensil der Bosheit\', \'text\': \'{B}, opfere das Utensil der Bosheit: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl wirft eine Karte ab. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur zu einem Zeitpunkt, zu dem du auch eine Hexerei wirken könntest.\\nWenn das Utensil der Bosheit aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424378&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac6a2017-6ce5-4054-8271-afd4e564d764\', \'multiverseId\': 424378}, \'multiverseid\': 424378}, {\'name\': \'Ingenio de malignidad\', \'text\': \'{B}, sacrificar el Ingenio de malignidad: El jugador objetivo descarta una carta. Activa esta habilidad solo cuando puedas lanzar un conjuro.\\nCuando el Ingenio de malignidad vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af9ac8eb-3107-4303-a618-6d4a231f5773\', \'multiverseId\': 425666}, \'multiverseid\': 425666}, {\'name\': \'Outil de malice\', \'text\': "{B}, sacrifiez l\'Outil de malice : Le joueur ciblé se défausse d\'une carte. N\'activez cette capacité que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.\\nQuand l\'Outil de malice est mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424562&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d9c6467-4c6b-46bd-b8eb-d44bc5104a40\', \'multiverseId\': 424562}, \'multiverseid\': 424562}, {\'name\': \'Strumento di Malvagità\', \'text\': \'{B}, Sacrifica lo Strumento di Malvagità: Un giocatore bersaglio scarta una carta. Attiva questa abilità solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.\\nQuando lo Strumento di Malvagità viene messo in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3536553-a7a7-4ace-babf-09e3e02a42e9\', \'multiverseId\': 424746}, \'multiverseid\': 424746}, {\'name\': \'悪意器具\', \'text\': \'{B}, 悪意器具を生け贄に捧げる：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード１枚を捨てる。この能力は、あなたがソーサリーを唱えられるときにのみ起動できる。\\n悪意器具が戦場から墓地に置かれたとき、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ee2f458-7a7b-4317-b1d7-127340cc2749\', \'multiverseId\': 424930}, \'multiverseid\': 424930}, {\'name\': \'악의의 장치\', \'text\': \'{B}, 악의의 장치를 희생한다: 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 카드 한 장을 버린다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 이 능력을 활성화할 수 있다.\\n악의의 장치가 전장에서 무덤에 놓일 때, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66447429-2cd5-4b0f-8268-a55977f98aec\', \'multiverseId\': 425114}, \'multiverseid\': 425114}, {\'name\': \'Implemento de Malícia\', \'text\': \'{B}, Implemento de Malícia: O jogador alvo descarta um card. Ative esta habilidade somente nos momentos em que poderia conjurar um feitiço.\\nQuando Implemento de Malícia for colocado em um cemitério vindo do campo de batalha, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'280aa5e2-f1d3-45b0-81ba-5171481b13f3\', \'multiverseId\': 425298}, \'multiverseid\': 425298}, {\'name\': \'Орудие Злобы\', \'text\': \'{B}, пожертвуйте Орудие Злобы: целевой игрок сбрасывает карту. Активируйте эту способность только при возможности разыгрывать волшебство.\\nКогда Орудие Злобы попадает с поля битвы на кладбище, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2232de0a-5b40-4e48-bb12-71212861237c\', \'multiverseId\': 425482}, \'multiverseid\': 425482}, {\'name\': \'恶意擎具\', \'text\': \'{B}，牺牲恶意擎具：目标牌手弃一张牌。只可以于你能施放法术的时机下起动此异能。\\n当恶意擎具从战场进入坟墓场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8705c583-1f6b-4cc4-a14f-c1508d6c0125\', \'multiverseId\': 424010}, \'multiverseid\': 424010}, {\'name\': \'惡意擎具\', \'text\': \'{B}，犧牲惡意擎具：目標玩家棄一張牌。只可以於你能施放巫術的時機下起動此異能。\\n當惡意擎具從戰場進入墳墓場時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45c3d4c9-46ec-4f05-90f3-7963560d180b\', \'multiverseId\': 424194}, \'multiverseid\': 424194}]', '[{\'name\': \'Utensil der Untersuchung\', \'text\': \'{U}, opfere das Utensil der Untersuchung: Ziehe eine Karte.\\nWenn das Utensil der Untersuchung aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Werkzeug, um das Unsichtbare sichtbar zu machen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424375&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9ca9221-1061-47d8-aaa9-a2732b8aa01a\', \'multiverseId\': 424375}, \'multiverseid\': 424375}, {\'name\': \'Ingenio de investigación\', \'text\': \'{U}, sacrificar el Ingenio de investigación: Roba una carta.\\nCuando el Ingenio de investigación vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Un artefacto para ver lo invisible.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'380bf22a-4a02-4ee2-ba9d-8b9c804bde1c\', \'multiverseId\': 425663}, \'multiverseid\': 425663}, {\'name\': "Outil d\'observation", \'text\': "{U}, sacrifiez l\'Outil d\'observation : Piochez une carte.\\nQuand l\'Outil d\'observation est mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Un outil destiné à voir l\'invisible.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424559&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d659787-8a5b-44f6-8c43-fc49d475a1df\', \'multiverseId\': 424559}, \'multiverseid\': 424559}, {\'name\': \'Strumento di Verifica\', \'text\': \'{U}, Sacrifica lo Strumento di Verifica: Pesca una carta.\\nQuando lo Strumento di Verifica viene messo in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Uno mezzo per vedere l\'invisibile.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f96fb74-cde9-431d-858a-240809e0c0a3\', \'multiverseId\': 424743}, \'multiverseid\': 424743}, {\'name\': \'検査器具\', \'text\': \'{U}, 検査器具を生け贄に捧げる：カードを１枚引く。\\n検査器具が戦場から墓地に置かれたとき、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'目に見えぬものを見る道具。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0fc9327-60de-4bf0-8008-84d789bde4b0\', \'multiverseId\': 424927}, \'multiverseid\': 424927}, {\'name\': \'검사 장치\', \'text\': \'{U}, 검사 장치를 희생한다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\\n검사 장치가 전장에서 무덤에 놓일 때, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'보이지 않는 것을 볼 수 있는 도구다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ac73d3d-1f6b-48d2-9ea0-98cac270a480\', \'multiverseId\': 425111}, \'multiverseid\': 425111}, {\'name\': \'Implemento de Exame\', \'text\': \'{U}, Sacrifique Implemento de Exame: Compre um card.\\nQuando Implemento de Exame for colocado em um cemitério vindo do campo de batalha, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Uma ferramenta para ver o que não é visto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c58b33d-b749-4924-963f-d2f1ed7caedf\', \'multiverseId\': 425295}, \'multiverseid\': 425295}, {\'name\': \'Орудие Исследования\', \'text\': \'{U}, пожертвуйте Орудие Исследования: возьмите карту.\\nКогда Орудие Исследования попадает с поля битвы на кладбище, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Прибор, чтобы видеть невидимое.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a46a3dd-5faa-4ed0-b473-ca985eca8a7f\', \'multiverseId\': 425479}, \'multiverseid\': 425479}, {\'name\': \'巡检擎具\', \'text\': \'{U}，牺牲巡检擎具：抓一张牌。\\n当巡检擎具从战场进入坟墓场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'侦测未见之物的工具。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37408fc9-6d95-4929-a08d-cef79af61bd5\', \'multiverseId\': 424007}, \'multiverseid\': 424007}, {\'name\': \'巡檢擎具\', \'text\': \'{U}，犧牲巡檢擎具：抽一張牌。\\n當巡檢擎具從戰場進入墳墓場時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'偵測未見之物的工具。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'730d0d30-842d-4d35-ad81-b8991663f17f\', \'multiverseId\': 424191}, \'multiverseid\': 424191}]', '[{\'name\': \'Utensil der Verbrennung\', \'text\': \'{R}, opfere das Utensil der Verbrennung: Es fügt einem Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\nWenn das Utensil der Verbrennung aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Im Innern schläft eine Flamme und wartet darauf, erweckt zu werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424374&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50c22ddd-2885-433b-8768-1f666bcb896c\', \'multiverseId\': 424374}, \'multiverseid\': 424374}, {\'name\': \'Ingenio de combustión\', \'text\': \'{R}, sacrificar el Ingenio de combustión: Hace 1 punto de daño al jugador objetivo.\\nCuando el Ingenio de combustión vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Un ensueño de fuego yace silente dentro, esperando su gloriosa liberación.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c27356f-7a1c-4069-a100-800a655f700f\', \'multiverseId\': 425662}, \'multiverseid\': 425662}, {\'name\': \'Outil de combustion\', \'text\': "{R}, sacrifiez l\'Outil de combustion : Il inflige 1 blessure au joueur ciblé.\\nQuand l\'Outil de combustion est mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Un songe de feu y repose, attendant patiemment son éveil glorieux.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424558&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d98a758-a471-4a9b-be60-f0b34cfd26d3\', \'multiverseId\': 424558}, \'multiverseid\': 424558}, {\'name\': \'Strumento di Combustione\', \'text\': \'{R}, Sacrifica lo Strumento di Combustione: Infligge 1 danno a un giocatore bersaglio.\\nQuando lo Strumento di Combustione viene messo in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Un sogno di fuoco dorme avviluppato al suo interno, in attesa di un glorioso risveglio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26919df7-4a15-43c2-a830-faf2708c9e5f\', \'multiverseId\': 424742}, \'multiverseid\': 424742}, {\'name\': \'発火器具\', \'text\': \'{R}, 発火器具を生け贄に捧げる：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。発火器具はそのプレイヤーに１点のダメージを与える。\\n発火器具が戦場から墓地に置かれたとき、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'中では夢見る炎がとぐろを巻き、栄光の目覚めを待っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57a661ab-8c2e-4403-a71d-619d27f064b1\', \'multiverseId\': 424926}, \'multiverseid\': 424926}, {\'name\': \'연소 장치\', \'text\': \'{R}, 연소 장치를 희생한다: 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 연소 장치는 그 플레이어에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.\\n연소 장치가 전장에서 무덤에 놓일 때, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'영광스러운 각성을 위해 꿈의 불길이 안에서 똬리를 틀고 기다리고 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68d09de3-fa0c-4e08-a960-545b0e1cdc4c\', \'multiverseId\': 425110}, \'multiverseid\': 425110}, {\'name\': \'Implemento de Combustão\', \'text\': \'{R}, Sacrifique Implemento de Combustão: Este causa 1 ponto de dano ao jogador alvo.\\nQuando Implemento de Combustão for colocado em um cemitério vindo do campo de batalha, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Um sonho de fogo jaz enovelado ali dentro, aguardando seu glorioso despertar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'234f5dab-d781-4d12-8061-c21732e31859\', \'multiverseId\': 425294}, \'multiverseid\': 425294}, {\'name\': \'Орудие Возгорания\', \'text\': \'{R}, пожертвуйте Орудие Возгорания: оно наносит 1 повреждение целевому игроку.\\nКогда Орудие Возгорания попадает с поля битвы на кладбище, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'В нем свернулась мечта об огне, ожидая славного пробуждения.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9336d412-ffbb-4c12-96c4-bec618095ae1\', \'multiverseId\': 425478}, \'multiverseid\': 425478}, {\'name\': \'燃烧擎具\', \'text\': \'{R}，牺牲燃烧擎具：它对目标牌手造成1点伤害。\\n当燃烧擎具从战场进入坟墓场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'火焰之梦盘绕其中，静等荣耀觉醒。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e962918f-1d78-4a38-a24a-196a1eca52c0\', \'multiverseId\': 424006}, \'multiverseid\': 424006}, {\'name\': \'燃燒擎具\', \'text\': \'{R}，犧牲燃燒擎具：它對目標玩家造成1點傷害。\\n當燃燒擎具從戰場進入墳墓場時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'火焰之夢盤繞其中，靜等榮耀覺醒。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cc82850-cfba-44f5-bd0c-564676657d27\', \'multiverseId\': 424190}, \'multiverseid\': 424190}]', '[{\'name\': \'Utensil der Wildheit\', \'text\': \'{G}, opfere das Utensil der Wildheit: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur zu einem Zeitpunkt, zu dem du auch eine Hexerei wirken könntest.\\nWenn das Utensil der Wildheit aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424376&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c784d8f-885e-4d9d-9133-75abae7daa78\', \'multiverseId\': 424376}, \'multiverseid\': 424376}, {\'name\': \'Ingenio de ferocidad\', \'text\': \'{G}, sacrificar el Ingenio de ferocidad: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo. Activa esta habilidad solo cuando puedas lanzar un conjuro.\\nCuando el Ingenio de ferocidad vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e9ebe23-1e4a-4ed9-9a73-5e0e55e2825a\', \'multiverseId\': 425664}, \'multiverseid\': 425664}, {\'name\': \'Outil de férocité\', \'text\': "{G}, sacrifiez l\'Outil de férocité : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la créature ciblée. N\'activez cette capacité que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.\\nQuand l\'Outil de férocité est mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424560&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5245f536-e8a8-4eb4-8b88-7b956dfbd471\', \'multiverseId\': 424560}, \'multiverseid\': 424560}, {\'name\': \'Strumento di Ferocia\', \'text\': \'{G}, Sacrifica lo Strumento di Ferocia: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio. Attiva questa abilità solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.\\nQuando lo Strumento di Ferocia viene messo in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ab7cd17-d46b-4279-bbc6-684682d4a0b2\', \'multiverseId\': 424744}, \'multiverseid\': 424744}, {\'name\': \'獰猛器具\', \'text\': \'{G}, 獰猛器具を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。この能力は、あなたがソーサリーを唱えられるときにのみ起動できる。\\n獰猛器具が戦場から墓地に置かれたとき、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c309d75-fe05-4711-8ca3-eb738a4fb4ca\', \'multiverseId\': 424928}, \'multiverseid\': 424928}, {\'name\': \'광포화 장치\', \'text\': \'{G}, 광포화 장치를 희생한다: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 이 능력을 활성화할 수 있다.\\n광포화 장치가 전장에서 무덤에 놓일 때, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cafeff3c-09d1-49e5-8b51-f3e0015c303c\', \'multiverseId\': 425112}, \'multiverseid\': 425112}, {\'name\': \'Implemento de Ferocidade\', \'text\': \'{G}, Sacrifique Implemento de Ferocidade: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo. Ative esta habilidade somente nos momentos em que poderia conjurar um feitiço.\\nQuando Implemento de Ferocidade for colocado em um cemitério vindo do campo de batalha, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eef64422-ad95-48cb-a126-20043175bc53\', \'multiverseId\': 425296}, \'multiverseid\': 425296}, {\'name\': \'Орудие Свирепости\', \'text\': \'{G}, пожертвуйте Орудие Свирепости: положите один жетон +1/+1 на целевое существо. Активируйте эту способность только при возможности разыгрывать волшебство.\\nКогда Орудие Свирепости попадает с поля битвы на кладбище, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b7e13ae-614a-483c-b1cb-bc12357e8b87\', \'multiverseId\': 425480}, \'multiverseid\': 425480}, {\'name\': \'蛮野擎具\', \'text\': \'{G}，牺牲蛮野擎具：在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。只可以于你能施放法术的时机下起动此异能。\\n当蛮野擎具从战场进入坟墓场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5e4c890-40b3-4696-8ac4-3a28b144c62c\', \'multiverseId\': 424008}, \'multiverseid\': 424008}, {\'name\': \'蠻野擎具\', \'text\': \'{G}，犧牲蠻野擎具：在目標生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。只可以於你能施放巫術的時機下起動此異能。\\n當蠻野擎具從戰場進入墳墓場時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef76e3d4-6d42-455c-8271-2e5d566f1722\', \'multiverseId\': 424192}, \'multiverseid\': 424192}]', "[{'name': 'Verborgene Kräuterkundler', 'text': 'Rebellion — Wenn die Verborgenen Kräuterkundler ins Spiel kommen und falls in diesem Zug eine bleibende Karte unter deiner Kontrolle das Spiel verlassen hat, erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {G}{G}.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Druide', 'flavor': 'In den Kellern unter dem Narnam-Gewächshaus wächst ein seltsamer und tödlicher Garten.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424329&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '454e74a8-2774-4cdb-becc-beb0cc3dc610', 'multiverseId': 424329}, 'multiverseid': 424329}, {'name': 'Herboristas ocultos', 'text': 'Revuelta — Cuando los Herboristas ocultos entren al campo de batalla, si un permanente que controlabas dejó el campo de batalla este turno, agrega {G}{G} a tu reserva de maná.', 'type': 'Criatura — Druida humano', 'flavor': 'En los sótanos de la mansión Narnam crece un extraño jardín letal.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425617&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5bb23d75-48e9-46d5-9d3d-e4ad39e742d4', 'multiverseId': 425617}, 'multiverseid': 425617}, {'name': 'Herboristes cachés', 'text': 'Révolte — Quand les Herboristes cachés arrivent sur le champ de bataille, si un permanent que vous contrôliez a quitté le champ de bataille ce tour-ci, ajoutez {G}{G} à votre réserve.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et druide', 'flavor': 'Dans les sous-sols de la serre de Narnam pousse un jardin étrange et mortel.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424513&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b6611dda-ef7e-41ff-818b-4bf3f170a11c', 'multiverseId': 424513}, 'multiverseid': 424513}, {'name': 'Erboristi Nascosti', 'text': 'Rivolta — Quando gli Erboristi Nascosti entrano nel campo di battaglia, se un permanente che controllavi ha lasciato il campo di battaglia in questo turno, aggiungi {G}{G} alla tua riserva di mana.', 'type': 'Creatura — Druido Umano', 'flavor': 'Nei sotterranei della Serra di Narnam cresce uno strano e letale giardino.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424697&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '56500b16-02de-4a35-88e8-02d3d1b368a8', 'multiverseId': 424697}, 'multiverseid': 424697}, {'name': '隠れた薬草医', 'text': '紛争 ― 隠れた薬草医が戦場に出たとき、このターンにあなたがコントロールするパーマネントが戦場を離れていた場合、あなたのマナ・プールに{G}{G}を加える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド', 'flavor': 'ナーナム温室の地下には、奇妙で危険な庭園が広がっている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424881&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '35307e85-b64a-40e3-9dd5-7cd567bdd458', 'multiverseId': 424881}, 'multiverseid': 424881}, {'name': '은둔한 약초 재배자', 'text': '봉기 — 은둔한 약초 재배자가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종한 지속물이 이 턴에 전장을 떠났다면, {G}{G}를 당신의 마나풀에 추가한다.', 'type': '생물 — 인간 드루이드', 'flavor': '나르남 저택의 지하 저장고에는 기이하고 치명적인 식물들이 자란다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425065&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '325b5494-29a0-4afb-a858-4eb0fdaf4c05', 'multiverseId': 425065}, 'multiverseid': 425065}, {'name': 'Herboristas Ocultos', 'text': 'Revolta — Quando Herboristas Ocultos entrar no campo de batalha, se uma permanente que você controlava deixou o campo de batalha neste turno, adicione {G}{G} a sua reserva de mana.', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano Druida', 'flavor': 'Nos porões da Casa de Narnam cresce um jardim estranho e mortal.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425249&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c09bd1a-441c-4762-ba2c-c7d37e4f7db9', 'multiverseId': 425249}, 'multiverseid': 425249}, {'name': 'Тайные Травники', 'text': 'Бунт — Когда Тайные Травники выходят на поле битвы, если находившийся под вашим контролем перманент покинул поле битвы в этом ходу, добавьте {G}{G} в ваше хранилище маны.', 'type': 'Существо — Человек Друид', 'flavor': 'В подвалах Нарнамской теплицы растет странный и смертоносный сад.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425433&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bef4fbd2-85c1-455d-a031-5ec421b359a8', 'multiverseId': 425433}, 'multiverseid': 425433}, {'name': '隐匿草药师', 'text': '反抗～当隐匿草药师进战场时，若本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物离开战场，则加{G}{G}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '生物～人类／德鲁伊', 'flavor': '在纳南温室底下的地窖内，有一片奇异而致命的花园在茁壮成长。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423961&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bdee6d2d-063c-46cc-aaad-47d8dd62607c', 'multiverseId': 423961}, 'multiverseid': 423961}, {'name': '隱匿草藥師', 'text': '反抗～當隱匿草藥師進戰場時，若本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物離開戰場，則加{G}{G}到你的魔法力池中。', 'type': '生物～人類／德魯伊', 'flavor': '在納南溫室底下的地窖內，有一片奇異而致命的花園茁壯成長。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424145&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cf2f24d8-0714-42e0-b3ee-a831c86570dc', 'multiverseId': 424145}, 'multiverseid': 424145}]", '[{\'name\': \'Vereisen\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert ein Artefakt oder eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte bleibende Karte enttappt nicht während des Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Verlangsamt das Konsulat mit allem, was ihr habt!" —Jasi Ganin, Meister-Abzapferin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424254&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e6a2090-5fc0-47d0-837e-0b7ebb29de8f\', \'multiverseId\': 424254}, \'multiverseid\': 424254}, {\'name\': \'Congelación\', \'text\': \'Encantar artefacto o criatura.\\nEl permanente encantado no se endereza durante el paso de enderezar de su controlador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Detén al Consulado con lo que tengas a mano!". —Jasi Ganin, maestro de los ladrones de éter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97b119cb-e6c8-43a1-8117-d96b1641d5d0\', \'multiverseId\': 425542}, \'multiverseid\': 425542}, {\'name\': \'Recouvrir de glace\', \'text\': "Enchanter : artefact ou créature\\nLe permanent enchanté ne se dégage pas pendant l\'étape de dégagement de son contrôleur.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'« Ralentissez le Consulat par tous les moyens à votre disposition ! » —Jasi Ganin, maîtresse siphonneuse\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424438&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'caf0a7cf-cb1e-40e3-b0ac-8ec9305f0f43\', \'multiverseId\': 424438}, \'multiverseid\': 424438}, {\'name\': \'Ricoprire di Ghiaccio\', \'text\': \'Incanta artefatto o creatura\\nIl permanente incantato non STAPpa durante lo STAP del suo controllore.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Fermate il Consolato con qualsiasi mezzo!" —Jasi Ganin, maestra convogliatrice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d6af7ba-79e6-4dfd-81d8-ab2249b99b4b\', \'multiverseId\': 424622}, \'multiverseid\': 424622}, {\'name\': \'凍り付け\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（アーティファクトかクリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているパーマネントは、それのコントローラーのアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「使えるものは何でも使って、領事府を妨害するのよ！」 ――収集の達人、ジャシー・ガーニン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4864136-fd75-4c14-94da-ed2fe5ff87cd\', \'multiverseId\': 424806}, \'multiverseid\': 424806}, {\'name\': \'얼음 뒤덮기\', \'text\': \'마법물체나 생물에게 부여\\n부여된 지속물은 조종자의 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'"무슨 수를 써서라도 영사관의 움직임을 늦춰야 해!" —대절도범 자시 가닌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52273a08-b1c1-4c92-8ba0-8960961af319\', \'multiverseId\': 424990}, \'multiverseid\': 424990}, {\'name\': \'Cobrir de Gelo\', \'text\': \'Encantar artefato ou criatura\\nA permanente encantada não desvira durante a etapa de desvirar de seu controlador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Atrasem o Consulado com tudo que tiverem!" — Jasi Ganin, mestra sifonadora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be3e35d9-0c47-48c1-9b71-ea2a9907916d\', \'multiverseId\': 425174}, \'multiverseid\': 425174}, {\'name\': \'Обледенение\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать артефакт или существо\\nЗачарованный перманент не разворачивается во время шага разворота контролирующего его игрока.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'«Надо любыми способами замедлить силы Консульства!» — Яси Ганин, мастер по откачке\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'232ed7c4-2f2a-416d-a52c-a73b34bb5d0b\', \'multiverseId\': 425358}, \'multiverseid\': 425358}, {\'name\': \'覆以寒冰\', \'text\': \'结附于神器或生物\\n所结附的永久物于其操控者的重置步骤中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「竭尽所能拖住执政院！」 ～汲能大师嘉丝格宁\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'456b924f-8290-463a-ba40-3da98c2eb02f\', \'multiverseId\': 423886}, \'multiverseid\': 423886}, {\'name\': \'覆以寒冰\', \'text\': \'結附於神器或生物\\n所結附的永久物於其操控者的重置步驟中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'「竭盡所能拖住執政院！」 ～汲能大師嘉絲格寧\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45a29023-1841-47de-bbd3-1b539662778a\', \'multiverseId\': 424070}, \'multiverseid\': 424070}]', '[{\'name\': \'Versteckte Vorräte\', \'text\': \'Rebellion — Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls in diesem Zug eine bleibende Karte unter deiner Kontrolle das Spiel verlassen hat, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Servo-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\\n{1}, opfere eine Kreatur: Hellsicht 1.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424348&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f39a0c64-a970-4562-b90e-be9ed6812c23\', \'multiverseId\': 424348}, \'multiverseid\': 424348}, {\'name\': \'Reserva oculta\', \'text\': \'Revuelta — Al comienzo de tu paso final, si un permanente que controlabas dejó el campo de batalla este turno, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Servo incolora 1/1.\\n{1}, sacrificar una criatura: Adivina 1.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac665471-e2b9-4d2a-ad39-ce0d772e06a4\', \'multiverseId\': 425636}, \'multiverseid\': 425636}, {\'name\': \'Réserve cachée\', \'text\': \'Révolte — Au début de votre étape de fin, si un permanent que vous contrôliez a quitté le champ de bataille ce tour-ci, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Servo.\\n{1}, sacrifiez une créature : Regard 1.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424532&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8648c30b-fc14-4430-a8bc-981ebbb45eec\', \'multiverseId\': 424532}, \'multiverseid\': 424532}, {\'name\': \'Riserva Nascosta\', \'text\': "Rivolta — All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se un permanente che controllavi ha lasciato il campo di battaglia in questo turno, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Servomeccanismo 1/1 incolore.\\n{1}, Sacrifica una creatura: Profetizza 1.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f548e3b1-1452-4822-b207-43be53e545b8\', \'multiverseId\': 424716}, \'multiverseid\': 424716}, {\'name\': \'秘密の備蓄品\', \'text\': \'紛争 ― あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたがコントロールするパーマネントが戦場を離れていた場合、無色の１/１の霊気装置・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n{1}, クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：占術１を行う。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'625c7fc8-f51c-4ad1-9f14-0f35146d2344\', \'multiverseId\': 424900}, \'multiverseid\': 424900}, {\'name\': \'숨겨진 비축물\', \'text\': \'봉기 — 당신의 종료단 시작에, 당신이 조종한 지속물이 이 턴에 전장을 떠났다면, 1/1 무색 서보 마법물체 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n{1}, 생물 한 개를 희생한다: 점술 1을 한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94eb6fdd-c3b0-43da-9bdd-53c15f554a02\', \'multiverseId\': 425084}, \'multiverseid\': 425084}, {\'name\': \'Depósito Escondido\', \'text\': \'Revolta — No início de sua etapa final, se uma permanente que você controlava deixou o campo de batalha neste turno, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Servus.\\n{1}, Sacrifique uma criatura: Use vidência 1.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96928365-ee4d-4957-9a94-8a441d1198ac\', \'multiverseId\': 425268}, \'multiverseid\': 425268}, {\'name\': \'Спрятанные Запасы\', \'text\': \'Бунт — В начале вашего заключительного шага, если находившийся под вашим контролем перманент покинул поле битвы в этом ходу, создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Сервотрон.\\n{1}, пожертвуйте существо: предскажите 1.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb470279-77ee-4edf-a375-4641116a6417\', \'multiverseId\': 425452}, \'multiverseid\': 425452}, {\'name\': \'秘藏备品\', \'text\': \'反抗～在你的结束步骤开始时，若本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物离开战场，则派出一个1/1无色自动机衍生神器生物。\\n{1}，牺牲一个生物：占卜1。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5c599c7-0856-443d-a349-82d2ed49b89b\', \'multiverseId\': 423980}, \'multiverseid\': 423980}, {\'name\': \'秘藏備品\', \'text\': \'反抗～在你的結束步驟開始時，若本回合中曾有由你操控的永久物離開戰場，則派出一個1/1無色自動機衍生神器生物。\\n{1}，犧牲一個生物：占卜1。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f12f4b2-b16c-446e-be4a-7dafc9fe2c75\', \'multiverseId\': 424164}, \'multiverseid\': 424164}]', '[{\'name\': \'Viehtrieb\', \'text\': \'Übernimm bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke 4 oder weniger. Enttappe sie. Sie erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Gremlins sind nur demjenigen gegenüber treu, der sie füttert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424320&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9acc8271-f1d8-4092-82bf-e2b1b4c45622\', \'multiverseId\': 424320}, \'multiverseid\': 424320}, {\'name\': \'Amaestrar\', \'text\': \'Gana el control de la criatura objetivo con fuerza de 4 o menos hasta el final del turno. Endereza esa criatura. Gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los gremlins no son leales a nada excepto su próxima comida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c81692c6-336d-4b44-aac5-b7e5c2a15ac2\', \'multiverseId\': 425608}, \'multiverseid\': 425608}, {\'name\': \'Dompter\', \'text\': "Acquérez le contrôle d\'une créature ciblée avec une force inférieure ou égale à 4 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez cette créature. Elle acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les gremlins ne sont fidèles qu\'à leur prochain repas.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424504&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'571b547a-832a-4791-8cba-73319e24c6f5\', \'multiverseId\': 424504}, \'multiverseid\': 424504}, {\'name\': \'Rodeo\', \'text\': \'Prendi il controllo di una creatura bersaglio con forza pari o inferiore a 4 fino alla fine del turno. STAPpa quella creatura. Ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Ai gremlin non importa nulla se non del prossimo pasto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67cbbdd6-d65b-481c-81f5-5e969c5d4760\', \'multiverseId\': 424688}, \'multiverseid\': 424688}, {\'name\': \'世話\', \'text\': \'パワーが４以下のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、ターン終了時まで、それのコントロールを得る。そのクリーチャーをアンタップする。ターン終了時まで、それは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'グレムリンには忠誠心などないが、餌探しには熱心だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424872&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95188bed-1617-4aec-b7bd-ec40954b5b34\', \'multiverseId\': 424872}, \'multiverseid\': 424872}, {\'name\': \'조련\', \'text\': \'공격력이 4 이하인 생물을 목표로 정한다. 턴종료까지 그 생물의 조종권을 얻는다. 그 생물은 언탭되고 턴종료까지 신속을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'그렘린은 자신의 다음 먹을거리에만 충실하다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd955149-9047-4522-b92f-75d89444259d\', \'multiverseId\': 425056}, \'multiverseid\': 425056}, {\'name\': \'Domar\', \'text\': \'Ganhe o controle da criatura alvo com poder igual ou inferior a 4 até o final do turno. Desvire aquela criatura. Ela ganha ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Os gremlins são leais apenas a sua próxima refeição.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'242c0bb0-08ad-46e1-bd92-223f9df4f57c\', \'multiverseId\': 425240}, \'multiverseid\': 425240}, {\'name\': \'Выпас\', \'text\': \'Получите контроль над целевым существом с силой не более 4 до конца хода. Разверните то существо. Оно получает Ускорение до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Гремлины истово стремятся лишь к своему следующему обеду.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'108d80be-7c42-453b-8109-798c01d3bfd2\', \'multiverseId\': 425424}, \'multiverseid\': 425424}, {\'name\': \'放养\', \'text\': \'获得目标力量等于或小于4之生物的操控权直到回合结束。重置该生物。它获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'在怪灵眼里，唯下一餐不能辜负。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bce41282-764f-4228-a8f2-83fa88592ee0\', \'multiverseId\': 423952}, \'multiverseid\': 423952}, {\'name\': \'放養\', \'text\': \'獲得力量等於或小於4之目標生物的操控權直到回合結束。重置該生物。它獲得敏捷異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'在怪靈眼裡，唯下一餐不能辜負。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48950e86-a8be-4391-8d69-61f78393b995\', \'multiverseId\': 424136}, \'multiverseid\': 424136}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vollstrecker-Konstrukt\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du eine Fähigkeit eines Artefakts oder einer Kreatur aktivierst, die keine Manafähigkeit ist, erhält das Vollstrecker-Konstrukt +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'„Alle Gebäude werden durchsucht. Widerstand wird bestraft." —Oberster Vollstrecker Ranaj\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424367&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f04db401-2685-4f99-816e-cd94abbd7754\', \'multiverseId\': 424367}, \'multiverseid\': 424367}, {\'name\': \'Constructo opresor\', \'text\': \'Siempre que actives una habilidad de un artefacto o una criatura que no sea una habilidad de maná, el Constructo opresor obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'"Registraremos todos los edificios. Se castigará cualquier resistencia". —Ranaj, brazo ejecutor de la ley\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7543ec2-cd0a-4143-8d56-38e170fff16a\', \'multiverseId\': 425655}, \'multiverseid\': 425655}, {\'name\': \'Construction répressive\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous activez une capacité d\'un artefact ou d\'une créature qui n\'est pas une capacité de mana, la Construction répressive gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': \'« Tous les bâtiments seront perquisitionnés. Toute résistance sera punie. » —Ranaj, argousin en chef\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424551&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b5712ba-8fd2-4055-ab4f-0cd099e17c92\', \'multiverseId\': 424551}, \'multiverseid\': 424551}, {\'name\': \'Costrutto Repressore\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta attivi un\'abilità di un artefatto o di una creatura che non è un\'abilità di mana, il Costrutto Repressore prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'"Tutti gli edifici sono soggetti a perquisizione. Ogni forma di resistenza sarà punita." —Ranaj, esecutore capo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e76b892-65b3-4447-8844-f056da5bae70\', \'multiverseId\': 424735}, \'multiverseid\': 424735}, {\'name\': \'弾圧する構築物\', \'text\': \'あなたがアーティファクトやクリーチャーのマナ能力でない能力を１つ起動するたび、ターン終了時まで、弾圧する構築物は＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'「すべての建物が捜査対象である。抵抗する者は処罰する。」 ――執行官長、ラナージ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424919&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99b1c637-c537-461c-b592-8f3e91d24a4a\', \'multiverseId\': 424919}, \'multiverseid\': 424919}, {\'name\': \'단속반 기계장치\', \'text\': \'당신이 마나 능력이 아닌 마법물체 또는 생물의 능력을 활성화할 때마다, 단속반 기계장치는 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 자동기계\', \'flavor\': \'"모든 건물을 조사해야 한다. 저항하는 자는 모두 엄벌에 처하도록." —최고 집행자 라나지\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e66b569c-ea8a-4fc0-a778-d183bda5000b\', \'multiverseId\': 425103}, \'multiverseid\': 425103}, {\'name\': \'Constructo Repressor\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você ativa uma habilidade de um artefato ou criatura que não seja uma habilidade de mana, Constructo Repressor recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'"Haverá busca em todos os prédios. Qualquer resistência será punida." — Ranaj, Chefe de Policiamento\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b73e1bba-eceb-4dc9-96ce-a31c3d5a02ab\', \'multiverseId\': 425287}, \'multiverseid\': 425287}, {\'name\': \'Карательная Конструкция\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы активируете способность артефакта или существа, не являющуюся мана-способностью, Карательная Конструкция получает +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': \'«Все здания будут обысканы. Сопротивление будет наказано». — старший блюститель Ранадж\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c2868d4-981b-4887-9c3f-a2eb4a151c0e\', \'multiverseId\': 425471}, \'multiverseid\': 425471}, {\'name\': \'防暴组构体\', \'text\': \'每当你起动神器或生物上不属法术力异能之异能时，防暴组构体得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'「所有建筑都要接受检查。反抗必受惩罚。」 ～执法长拉纳吉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aff7c9e5-2d41-44b1-82e7-96c805e650ac\', \'multiverseId\': 423999}, \'multiverseid\': 423999}, {\'name\': \'防暴組構體\', \'text\': \'每當你起動神器或生物上不屬魔法力異能之異能時，防暴組構體得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～組構體\', \'flavor\': \'「所有建築都要接受檢查。反抗必受懲罰。」 ～執法長拉納吉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5952fd1a-ad64-433d-8eb8-35b77a035937\', \'multiverseId\': 424183}, \'multiverseid\': 424183}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wachsamer Automat\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}: Hellsicht 1. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'„Bevor wir unsere Feinde zerstören können, müssen wir sie aufspüren. Wir müssen jede elende Hütte und jeden wimmelnden Marktplatz durchsuchen." —Baral, Oberster Regelüberwacher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424401&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d02c7f2-122a-4f3d-9c29-9fc66a008196\', \'multiverseId\': 424401}, \'multiverseid\': 424401}, {\'name\': \'Autómata vigilante\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}: Adivina 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'"Antes de poder destruir a nuestros enemigos, tenemos que encontrarlos. Debemos buscar en los cuchitriles más abyectos y los mercados más atestados". —Baral, señor de la sumisión\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d72d79d-c16b-4e97-87b3-a5e720d224fe\', \'multiverseId\': 425689}, \'multiverseid\': 425689}, {\'name\': \'Automate alerte\', \'text\': \'{2}{U} : Regard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la mettre au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': \'« Avant de pouvoir détruire nos ennemis, nous devons les trouver. Nous devons fouiller chaque masure délabrée et chaque marché grouillant de monde. » —Baral, directeur de conformité\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424585&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b70db91-fc20-4dcc-8fb7-3f50a9332cd6\', \'multiverseId\': 424585}, \'multiverseid\': 424585}, {\'name\': \'Automa Vigile\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}: Profetizza 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere quella carta in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'"Prima di poter distruggere i nostri avversari, dobbiamo trovarli. Dobbiamo frugare in ogni misera baracca e tra i banchi di ogni mercato." —Baral, Commissario della conformità\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4f724f4-d2f2-470e-b3fd-e56a47f693b5\', \'multiverseId\': 424769}, \'multiverseid\': 424769}, {\'name\': \'警戒自動機械\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}：占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'「敵を倒すには、まず発見する必要がある。みすぼらしい小屋、市場の人混み、そういう場所を見て回るのだ。」 ――遵法長、バラル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424953&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d22a256-9268-4ec9-aa05-0e3fa86c37b3\', \'multiverseId\': 424953}, \'multiverseid\': 424953}, {\'name\': \'경계하는 자동장치\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}: 점술 1을 한다. (당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 한 장을 본다. 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 자동기계\', \'flavor\': \'"우리의 적들을 파괴하려면 먼저 찾아야 한다. 모든 낡은 오두막집과 번잡한 시장 구석구석을 잘 감시해야 한다." —감시 대장 바랄\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a668f54-a229-4e81-89cc-969cfa88f737\', \'multiverseId\': 425137}, \'multiverseid\': 425137}, {\'name\': \'Autômato Vigilante\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}: Vidência 1. (Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar aquele card no fundo de seu grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'"Antes de podermos destruir nossos inimigos, precisamos encontrá-los. Precisamos perscrutar cada casebre miserável e cada mercado lotado." — Baral, Chefe da Conformidade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81d2243d-7857-4efd-a0f0-dbd18aa72cfd\', \'multiverseId\': 425321}, \'multiverseid\': 425321}, {\'name\': \'Наблюдательный Автомат\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}: предскажите 1. (Посмотрите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить ту карту в низ вашей библиотеки.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': \'«Прежде чем мы сможем уничтожить врагов, их нужно найти. Мы должны заглянуть в каждую жалкую лачугу и на каждый переполненный рынок». — Бараль, старший по повиновению\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52e851bc-6482-4196-943b-8d35c74840f2\', \'multiverseId\': 425505}, \'multiverseid\': 425505}, {\'name\': \'警醒机械兽\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}：占卜1。（检视你牌库顶的牌。你可以将该牌置于你的牌库底。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'「我们要先找出敌人，才能消灭他们。我们必须寻遍每一处破败居所，每一片熙攘集市。」 ～监察长巴罗\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9c6df4b-6db8-4498-a18c-fd238b4385d9\', \'multiverseId\': 424033}, \'multiverseid\': 424033}, {\'name\': \'警醒機械獸\', \'text\': \'{2}{U}：占卜1。（檢視你牌庫頂的牌。你可以將該牌置於你的牌庫底。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物～組構體\', \'flavor\': \'「我們要先找出敵人，才能消滅他們。我們必須尋遍每一處破敗居所，每一片熙攘集市。」 ～監察長巴羅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c04cab1b-26ea-4e93-a443-f39e279028b6\', \'multiverseId\': 424217}, \'multiverseid\': 424217}]', '[{\'name\': \'Waghalsige Zerstörung\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur oder ein Fahrzeug deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Immer an der Schwelle zum Tod zu leben, gibt den Äthergeborenen eine ungewöhnliche Sicht auf Risiken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424274&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f2ca33b-ae78-4247-9aee-78fcfcd5e1c6\', \'multiverseId\': 424274}, \'multiverseid\': 424274}, {\'name\': \'Demolición arriesgada\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura o Vehículo objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Su existencia al borde de la muerte les da a los etergénitos una actitud inusual ante el riesgo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42931206-e4a4-4910-b905-2c36bdd5a337\', \'multiverseId\': 425562}, \'multiverseid\': 425562}, {\'name\': \'Démolition audacieuse\', \'text\': \'Détruisez la créature ciblée ou le véhicule ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Côtoyer la mort de si près donne aux éthériens un point de vue inhabituel sur le risque.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424458&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9128d84-ca34-4513-b852-e0528bbfef68\', \'multiverseId\': 424458}, \'multiverseid\': 424458}, {\'name\': \'Demolizione Audace\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura o un Veicolo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Vivere a stretto contatto con la morte dà agli eteridi un\'insolita concezione del rischio.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de55c3d2-7fb7-478d-8f4d-f44d59e8091b\', \'multiverseId\': 424642}, \'multiverseid\': 424642}, {\'name\': \'果敢な爆破\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体か機体１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'死と背中合わせで生きる霊基体には、尋常ではない危機予測能力が備わっている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'771976c3-2137-47f3-bbaa-c3e2a3f6067c\', \'multiverseId\': 424826}, \'multiverseid\': 424826}, {\'name\': \'겁 없는 파괴\', \'text\': \'생물이나 탑승물을 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'에테르붙이는 늘 죽음과 가까이 살아서 위험에 대한 관점이 남다르다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a13df46-b501-49c5-9c4f-294271ef8c42\', \'multiverseId\': 425010}, \'multiverseid\': 425010}, {\'name\': \'Demolição Ousada\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura ou o Veículo alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Viver tão perto da morte dá aos etergênitos uma perspectiva incomum do risco.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'239bb0aa-2f4c-4915-9c3c-f03e3ce07658\', \'multiverseId\': 425194}, \'multiverseid\': 425194}, {\'name\': \'Дерзкое Разрушение\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо или Машину.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Каждый день своей жизни эфириды смотрят в лицо смерти, и поэтому у них свои представления о риске.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a061a2a8-aa86-4159-8df4-e058d392878a\', \'multiverseId\': 425378}, \'multiverseid\': 425378}, {\'name\': \'大胆爆破\', \'text\': \'消灭目标生物或载具。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'乙太种时时与死亡相伴，对风险的见解非比寻常。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'645f4ada-1715-4ce1-8180-351e33cbd1a6\', \'multiverseId\': 423906}, \'multiverseid\': 423906}, {\'name\': \'大膽爆破\', \'text\': \'消滅目標生物或載具。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'乙太種時時與死亡相伴，對風險的見解非比尋常。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2472dc9e-437b-48c7-954d-489ee91347fd\', \'multiverseId\': 424090}, \'multiverseid\': 424090}]', '[{\'name\': \'Weltenbrücke\', \'text\': \'{8}, {T}: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer bleibenden Karte, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist vollbracht. Nun kann die wahre Arbeit beginnen." —Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424390&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8862168-4d4b-4f20-ab39-a3268aa1dc9a\', \'multiverseId\': 424390}, \'multiverseid\': 424390}, {\'name\': \'Puente entre planos\', \'text\': \'{8}, {T}: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de permanente, ponla en el campo de batalla y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': \'"Está terminado. Ahora puede empezar el verdadero trabajo". —Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bb6fb7c-8c8a-4d79-b653-2803f364a630\', \'multiverseId\': 425678}, \'multiverseid\': 425678}, {\'name\': \'Pont planaire\', \'text\': \'{8}, {T} : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de permanent, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille, puis mélangez votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': \'« Le voilà terminé. Le travail peut enfin commencer. » —Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424574&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89abf740-1f05-4c8b-a8d2-02a8beb2bc10\', \'multiverseId\': 424574}, \'multiverseid\': 424574}, {\'name\': \'Ponte Planare\', \'text\': \'{8}, {T}: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta permanente, mettila sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': \'"È finito. Ora può iniziare il vero lavoro." —Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b0a898b-9682-4f93-be9f-9b19d47a70e1\', \'multiverseId\': 424758}, \'multiverseid\': 424758}, {\'name\': \'次元橋\', \'text\': \'{8}, {T}：あなたのライブラリーからパーマネント・カード１枚を探し、それを戦場に出す。その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「完成だ。ここからが本番だぞ。」 ――テゼレット\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9295c08-4c7b-4b7a-ba0f-f2c68c1b6294\', \'multiverseId\': 424942}, \'multiverseid\': 424942}, {\'name\': \'차원의 다리\', \'text\': \'{8}, {T}: 당신의 서고에서 지속물 카드 한 장을 찾아 전장에 놓는다. 그런 다음 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'"끝마쳤다. 이제 진정한 작업을 시작할 수 있겠군." —테제렛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb36e562-766e-42b9-88a9-038140b9dbbe\', \'multiverseId\': 425126}, \'multiverseid\': 425126}, {\'name\': \'Ponte Planar\', \'text\': \'{8}, {T}: Procure em seu grimório um card de permanente, coloque-o no campo de batalha e, em seguida, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'"Terminado. Agora o verdadeiro trabalho pode começar." — Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dc5bca5-d190-496d-bb6a-51c56bb6ee1e\', \'multiverseId\': 425310}, \'multiverseid\': 425310}, {\'name\': \'Межмировой Мост\', \'text\': \'{8}, {T}: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту перманента, положите ее на поле битвы, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«С ним закончено. Теперь можно начинать настоящую работу». — Теззерет\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c201e262-b134-40e9-9606-fa0e4e12bcb3\', \'multiverseId\': 425494}, \'multiverseid\': 425494}, {\'name\': \'时空渡桥\', \'text\': \'{8}，{T}：从你的牌库中搜寻一张永久物牌，将之放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'「大功告成。接下来可以开始干正事了。」 ～泰兹瑞\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2053356a-9066-432d-808c-d52e4eed6ecf\', \'multiverseId\': 424022}, \'multiverseid\': 424022}, {\'name\': \'時空渡橋\', \'text\': \'{8}，{T}：從你的牌庫中搜尋一張永久物牌，將之放進戰場，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'「大功告成。接下來可以開始幹正事了。」 ～泰茲瑞\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8a06a99-ed97-4eb2-900b-6a9e87704620\', \'multiverseId\': 424206}, \'multiverseid\': 424206}]', '[{\'name\': \'Windvolk-Freibeuter\', \'text\': \'Improvisieren (Deine Artefakte können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)\\nFliegend\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'Kleinere Zusammenschlüsse von Aeronauten wie das Windvolk schlossen sich den Renegaten an, weil sie wenig zu verlieren, aber viel zu gewinnen hatten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424269&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e57eb749-9069-49d4-910d-071b5cd71045\', \'multiverseId\': 424269}, \'multiverseid\': 424269}, {\'name\': \'Jinetes Galernos\', \'text\': \'Improvisar. (Tus artefactos pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada artefacto que gires una vez que termines de activar habilidades de maná paga {1}.)\\nVuela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'Las pequeñas sociedades de aeronautas, como los Galernos, no tenían mucho que perder al aliarse con los renegados, y sí mucho que ganar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04e32eb9-c377-4a65-861a-15a08542575c\', \'multiverseId\': 425557}, \'multiverseid\': 425557}, {\'name\': \'Pillards frères des vents\', \'text\': \'Improvisation (Vos artefacts peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque artefact que vous engagez après avoir activé des capacités de mana paie {1}.)\\nVol\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': "Les petites sociétés d\'aéronautes comme les Frères des vents avaient peu de choses à perdre et beaucoup à gagner en se ralliant aux renégats.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424453&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ed797aa-6f8f-4491-8fd3-bf89c5a521b2\', \'multiverseId\': 424453}, \'multiverseid\': 424453}, {\'name\': \'Fratelli del Vento da Incursione\', \'text\': \'Improvvisare (I tuoi artefatti possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni artefatto che TAPpi dopo aver attivato le abilità di mana corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nVolare\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Le piccole società di aeronauti come i Fratelli del Vento avevano poco da perdere alleandosi con i rinnegati, e molto da guadagnare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07d2f11f-534d-4a93-8fe9-a730a2ebca1c\', \'multiverseId\': 424637}, \'multiverseid\': 424637}, {\'name\': \'風友会の強襲者\', \'text\': \'即席（あなたのアーティファクトが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。あなたはあなたのアーティファクトをタップして、１個あたり{1}の支払いに代えてもよい。）\\n飛行\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'風友会のような小さな飛空士組織には、改革派に組しても失う物は少なく、得る物は大きい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bb1d09c-d759-415c-bfe9-c29fd342e641\', \'multiverseId\': 424821}, \'multiverseid\': 424821}, {\'name\': \'바람일족 약탈자\', \'text\': \'급조 (당신의 마법물체들은 이 주문을 발동하는 것을 도울 수 있다. 마나 능력을 활성화한 후에 탭하는 각 마법물체는 이 주문의 비용 중 {1}을 지불한다.)\\n비행\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기능공\', \'flavor\': \'바람일족 같이 작은 비행단의 경우 무법자들과 함께 하면 잃을 것은 적고 얻을 것은 많다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02b89196-7578-4aac-b700-cc23f164780f\', \'multiverseId\': 425005}, \'multiverseid\': 425005}, {\'name\': \'Salteadores Eolinos\', \'text\': \'Improvisar (Seus artefatos podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada artefato que você vira após terminar de ativar habilidades de mana paga por {1}.)\\nVoar\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'Pequenas sociedades de aeronautas, como os eolinos, tinham pouco a perder se aliando aos renegados, e muito a ganhar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b35a4522-c1a9-4ec0-b91d-6436569d1980\', \'multiverseId\': 425189}, \'multiverseid\': 425189}, {\'name\': \'Налетчики Братьев Ветра\', \'text\': \'Импровизация (Ваши артефакты могут помочь разыграть это заклинание. Каждый артефакт, который вы поворачиваете после того, как вы закончили активировать мана-способности, считается оплатой {1}.)\\nПолет\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Механик\', \'flavor\': \'Небольшим сообществам аэронавтов, вроде Братьев Ветра, нечего терять от союза с отступниками, а вот выиграть можно многое.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02f6c5aa-f2de-405d-b2b8-2e853cf7c3f7\', \'multiverseId\': 425373}, \'multiverseid\': 425373}, {\'name\': \'风伴会突击兵\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒语能用你的神器来协助施放。你起动完法术力异能之后每横置一个神器，就能为此咒语支付{1}。）\\n飞行\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'像风伴会这样的小型空行师协会，跟乱匠合作风险不高，但收获很大。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5d6dbf6-7b27-4fae-9fa3-945b59af1e5e\', \'multiverseId\': 423901}, \'multiverseid\': 423901}, {\'name\': \'風伴會突擊兵\', \'text\': \'拼造（此咒語能用你的神器來協助施放。你起動完魔法力異能之後每橫置一個神器，就能為此咒語支付{1}。）\\n飛行\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／神器師\', \'flavor\': \'像風伴會這樣的小型空行師協會跟亂匠合作風險不高，但收穫很大。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81f3aa6f-ac14-4e9a-9ea3-f1c97732ee42\', \'multiverseId\': 424085}, \'multiverseid\': 424085}]', '[{\'name\': \'Yahenni, unvergänglicher Partisan\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, stirbt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Yahenni, unvergänglicher Partisan.\\nOpfere eine andere Kreatur: Yahenni erhält Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Äthergeborener, Vampir\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Zeit für subtiles Vorgehen ist vorbei, mein Liebling."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424293&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f530b181-4366-427e-a881-641f8417f437\', \'multiverseId\': 424293}, \'multiverseid\': 424293}, {\'name\': \'Yahenni, partisano eterno\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nSiempre que una criatura que controla un oponente muera, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre Yahenni, partisano eterno.\\nSacrificar otra criatura: Yahenni gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Vampiro etergénito\', \'flavor\': \'"La hora de las sutilezas ha terminado, cariño".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ee6b0e0-dd4c-48ef-8b9d-2f0f367a9ceb\', \'multiverseId\': 425581}, \'multiverseid\': 425581}, {\'name\': \'Yahenni, partisan immortel\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle meurt, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Yahenni, partisan immortel.\\nSacrifiez une autre créature : Yahenni acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : éthérien et vampire\', \'flavor\': \'« Le temps de la subtilité est révolu. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424477&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6ec32ff-261e-4f52-8294-6eb5e053d548\', \'multiverseId\': 424477}, \'multiverseid\': 424477}, {\'name\': \'Yahenni, Partigiano Immortale\', \'text\': "Rapidità\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura controllata da un avversario muore, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su Yahenni, Partigiano Immortale.\\nSacrifica un\'altra creatura: Yahenni ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Vampiro Eteride\', \'flavor\': \'"Il tempo dei sotterfugi è finito, tesoro."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f06833f-7d11-4c8f-80c8-990627638afd\', \'multiverseId\': 424661}, \'multiverseid\': 424661}, {\'name\': \'不死の援護者、ヤヘンニ\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、不死の援護者、ヤヘンニの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\\n他のクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、不死の援護者、ヤヘンニは破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 霊基体・吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「繊細さの時期は終わったのよ、あなた。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72461d2f-00e0-4a04-bd12-f0bef28becf2\', \'multiverseId\': 424845}, \'multiverseid\': 424845}, {\'name\': \'불사의 유격병 야헤니\', \'text\': \'신속\\n상대가 조종하는 생물이 죽을 때마다, 불사의 유격병 야헤니에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n다른 생물 한 개를 희생한다: 불사의 유격병 야헤니는 턴종료까지 무적을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 에테르붙이 흡혈귀\', \'flavor\': \'"힘든 시간은 이제 끝났어, 자기야."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eef02158-aa4e-4827-a6b9-1f786b7b3d4a\', \'multiverseId\': 425029}, \'multiverseid\': 425029}, {\'name\': \'Yahenni, Guerrilheiro Imortal\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nToda vez que uma criatura que um oponente controla morrer, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Yahenni, Guerrilheiro Imortal.\\nSacrifique outra criatura: Yahenni ganha indestrutível até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Etergênito Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"O tempo das sutilezas acabou, querido."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ae906b4-3eff-4b80-b3f4-984dae0efcd6\', \'multiverseId\': 425213}, \'multiverseid\': 425213}, {\'name\': \'Яхенни, Бессмертный Партизан\', \'text\': \'Ускорение\\nКаждый раз, когда существо под контролем оппонента умирает, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Яхенни, Бессмертного Партизана.\\nПожертвуйте другое существо: Яхенни получает Неразрушимость до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Эфирид Вампир\', \'flavor\': \'«Время для нежностей прошло, дорогуша».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8765646-f84f-49e4-b867-9715cb668783\', \'multiverseId\': 425397}, \'multiverseid\': 425397}, {\'name\': \'永生抗军耶赫尼\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n每当一个由对手操控的生物死去时，在永生抗军耶赫尼上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n牺牲另一个生物：耶赫尼获得不灭异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～乙太种／吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「亲爱的，遮遮掩掩的时代结束了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fb2fee2-e311-4d3c-813b-70e413134dbc\', \'multiverseId\': 423925}, \'multiverseid\': 423925}, {\'name\': \'永生抗軍耶赫尼\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n每當一個由對手操控的生物死去時，在永生抗軍耶赫尼上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\\n犧牲另一個生物：耶赫尼獲得不滅異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物～乙太種／吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「親愛的，遮遮掩掩的時代結束了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1eae42d-3db4-45c8-8824-dece52d0c7d5\', \'multiverseId\': 424109}, \'multiverseid\': 424109}]', '[{\'name\': \'Yahennis Expertise\', \'text\': \'Alle Kreaturen erhalten -3/-3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nDu kannst eine Karte mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 3 oder weniger aus deiner Hand wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Konsulat hat mich in die Enge getrieben, mein Liebling, und dies ist die Quittung dafür."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424294&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77c0b74f-1c47-4e3b-ab26-9c322ae00ef2\', \'multiverseId\': 424294}, \'multiverseid\': 424294}, {\'name\': \'Pericia de Yahenni\', \'text\': \'Todas las criaturas obtienen -3/-3 hasta el final del turno.\\nPuedes lanzar una carta de tu mano con coste de maná convertido de 3 o menos sin pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"El Consulado me ha llevado al límite, cariño, y este es el resultado".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b13a6ddb-ae5e-4896-9185-26b14160a57f\', \'multiverseId\': 425582}, \'multiverseid\': 425582}, {\'name\': \'Expertise de Yahenni\', \'text\': "Toutes les créatures gagnent -3/-3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nVous pouvez lancer une carte avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 3 depuis votre main sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Le Consulat m\'a poussé à bout et voilà le résultat. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424478&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63b80269-4e64-4146-9433-e27ec95d6a4c\', \'multiverseId\': 424478}, \'multiverseid\': 424478}, {\'name\': \'Competenza di Yahenni\', \'text\': \'Tutte le creature prendono -3/-3 fino alla fine del turno.\\nPuoi lanciare una carta con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 3 dalla tua mano senza pagare il suo costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Il Consolato mi ha spinto al limite, tesoro, e questo è il risultato."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec2d8108-984b-4816-9ba1-fb58825d17de\', \'multiverseId\': 424662}, \'multiverseid\': 424662}, {\'name\': \'ヤヘンニの巧技\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、すべてのクリーチャーは－３/－３の修整を受ける。\\nあなたは、あなたの手札から点数で見たマナ・コストが３以下のカード１枚を、そのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「領事府が私を追い込んだのよ、あなた。その結果が、これ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c94653f1-7620-43c6-bdb9-451c32da370a\', \'multiverseId\': 424846}, \'multiverseid\': 424846}, {\'name\': \'야헤니의 전문 지식\', \'text\': \'모든 생물은 턴종료까지 -3/-3을 받는다.\\n당신은 당신의 손에서 전환마나비용이 3 이하인 카드를 마나 비용을 지불하지 않고 발동할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"영사관은 나를 한계까지 밀어붙였지. 이게 그 결과야."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d30d39f1-671c-4cf4-aa13-a53bb3597d2f\', \'multiverseId\': 425030}, \'multiverseid\': 425030}, {\'name\': \'Especialidade de Yahenni\', \'text\': \'Todas as criaturas recebem -3/-3 até o final do turno.\\nVocê pode conjurar um card com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a 3 da sua mão sem pagar seu custo de mana.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"O Consulado levou-me ao limite, querido, e esse é o resultado."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35df871f-c739-4039-b7d0-b0b77415c06a\', \'multiverseId\': 425214}, \'multiverseid\': 425214}, {\'name\': \'Мастерство Яхенни\', \'text\': \'Все существа получают -3/-3 до конца хода.\\nВы можете разыграть карту заклинания с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более 3 из вашей руки без оплаты ее мана-стоимости.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Консульство довело меня до предела, дорогуша, и вот результат».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48a4918f-6256-460b-a25a-066044b565ef\', \'multiverseId\': 425398}, \'multiverseid\': 425398}, {\'name\': \'耶赫尼的专才\', \'text\': \'所有生物得-3/-3直到回合结束。\\n你可以从你手上施放一张总法术力费用等于或小于3的牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「执政院逼我用尽全力，亲爱的，这就是结果。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b06e7d28-ed49-404e-8814-e1f6d1e13106\', \'multiverseId\': 423926}, \'multiverseid\': 423926}, {\'name\': \'耶赫尼的專才\', \'text\': \'所有生物得-3/-3直到回合結束。\\n你可以從你手上施放一張總魔法力費用等於或小於3的牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「執政院逼我用盡全力，親愛的，這就是結果。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8dcbb17-24d8-4586-b232-415adfce0db6\', \'multiverseId\': 424110}, \'multiverseid\': 424110}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zackenschuppen-Keiler\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Zackenschuppen-Keiler ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf jede andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'„Jedes Geschöpf ist ein Schlüssel zur Lösung eines Problems." —Oviya Pashiri, weise Biotronikerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424340&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e571c725-7048-4555-80ea-b77b8b32a069\', \'multiverseId\': 424340}, \'multiverseid\': 424340}, {\'name\': \'Colmilludo escamacoraza\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Colmilludo escamacoraza entre al campo de batalla, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada una de las otras criaturas que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Cada criatura contiene una solución a un problema, una lección que aprender". —Oviya Pashiri, fraguavidas sabia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8f1d902-dd7f-4b6a-aac9-094b88217bf2\', \'multiverseId\': 425628}, \'multiverseid\': 425628}, {\'name\': \'Terrocorne à écailles striées\', \'text\': \'Quand le Terrocorne à écailles striées arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque autre créature que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': \'« Chaque créature détient la solution à un problème, une leçon à apprendre. » —Oviya Pashiri, sage façonneuse de vie\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424524&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01b63e01-6e2c-4094-81c4-68ef8b90e200\', \'multiverseId\': 424524}, \'multiverseid\': 424524}, {\'name\': \'Zannuto Scagliarugosa\', \'text\': \'Quando lo Zannuto Scagliarugosa entra nel campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni altra creatura che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Ogni creatura cela una soluzione a un problema, una lezione da imparare." —Oviya Pashiri, saggia forgiavita\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fd674cd-3ffe-44cc-99d1-e33710c9c010\', \'multiverseId\': 424708}, \'multiverseid\': 424708}, {\'name\': \'起伏鱗の大牙獣\', \'text\': \'起伏鱗の大牙獣が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールする他の各クリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'「どの生き物も課題の解決法を持っているわ。見習わなくてはね。」 ――造命の賢者、オビア・パースリー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0662c705-ec78-4355-8789-8a0f276acd2e\', \'multiverseId\': 424892}, \'multiverseid\': 424892}, {\'name\': \'뾰족비늘 두더지\', \'text\': \'뾰족비늘 두더지가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종하는 다른 모든 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 야수\', \'flavor\': \'"각 생물은 문제에 대한 해결책을 가지고 있지. 바로 이점을 배워야 해." —현명한 생명체제작자 오비야 파시리\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff1e6498-b24c-449c-acb7-decf91417f74\', \'multiverseId\': 425076}, \'multiverseid\': 425076}, {\'name\': \'Preseiro-de-escama-dentada\', \'text\': \'Quando Preseiro-de-escama-dentada entrar no campo de batalha, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada outra criatura que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'"Cada criatura guarda a solução de um problema, uma lição a se aprender." — Oviya Pashiri, sábia vivideira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ee99f39-502d-41e4-bad2-e2081e6d31a9\', \'multiverseId\': 425260}, \'multiverseid\': 425260}, {\'name\': \'Острочешуйчатый Клыкач\', \'text\': \'Когда Острочешуйчатый Клыкач выходит на поле битвы, положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое другое существо под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'«Каждое живое существо — решение проблемы, урок, который нужно выучить». — мудрая Овия Пашири, жизнетворец\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f76f8b98-eef4-429b-b66e-965577cb7a87\', \'multiverseId\': 425444}, \'multiverseid\': 425444}, {\'name\': \'脊鳞长牙兽\', \'text\': \'当脊鳞长牙兽进战场时，在每个由你操控的其他生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'「每个生物都拥有针对某个问题的解答，这是必须汲取的教训。」 ～铸生智者奥薇亚帕西理\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78dfe618-5a18-4d9b-aac7-6742b7ef1d94\', \'multiverseId\': 423972}, \'multiverseid\': 423972}, {\'name\': \'脊鱗長牙獸\', \'text\': \'當脊鱗長牙獸進戰場時，在每個由你操控的其他生物上各放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～野獸\', \'flavor\': \'「每個生物都擁有針對某個問題的解答，這是必須汲取的教訓。」 ～鑄生智者奧薇亞帕西理\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c356a54f-d4a6-4d04-a773-7247ea2a31da\', \'multiverseId\': 424156}, \'multiverseid\': 424156}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zahnradmonteur\', \'text\': \'{7}: Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie eines Artefakts deiner Wahl ist. Der Spielstein erhält Eile. Schicke ihn zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Montagearbeiter\', \'flavor\': \'Vervielfältigung ist weder Diebstahl noch Schmeichelei. Vervielfältigung ist pure Effizienz.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424364&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b90e811-ff11-4c83-be81-2f4aed46f8ff\', \'multiverseId\': 424364}, \'multiverseid\': 424364}, {\'name\': \'Ensamblador de engranajes\', \'text\': \'{7}: Crea una ficha que es una copia del artefacto objetivo. Esa ficha gana la habilidad de prisa. Exíliala al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Operario\', \'flavor\': \'Duplicar no es ni robar ni homenajear. Es ser eficiente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7185e9f-87a2-4e25-ba6c-0ac0bc3c851b\', \'multiverseId\': 425652}, \'multiverseid\': 425652}, {\'name\': \'Assembleur mécanique\', \'text\': "{7} : Créez un jeton qui est une copie de l\'artefact ciblé. Ce jeton acquiert la célérité. Exilez-le au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : ouvrier spécialisé\', \'flavor\': "La copie ne constitue ni un vol ni une flatterie. C\'est une preuve d\'efficacité.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424548&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9b39a26-a2be-4b83-8139-e32f0e8c858d\', \'multiverseId\': 424548}, \'multiverseid\': 424548}, {\'name\': \'Assemblatore di Ingranaggi\', \'text\': "{7}: Crea una pedina che è una copia di un artefatto bersaglio. Quella pedina ha rapidità. Esiliala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Addetto-al-Montaggio\', \'flavor\': \'La duplicazione non è né furto né adulazione. È efficienza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b3afe74-ccfe-4ebd-a999-74f20fd0a8ad\', \'multiverseId\': 424732}, \'multiverseid\': 424732}, {\'name\': \'歯車組立工\', \'text\': \'{7}：アーティファクト１つを対象とし、それのコピーであるトークンを１つ生成する。そのトークンは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 組立作業員\', \'flavor\': \'複製は盗用でも迎合でもない。効率の追求なのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebf40c95-875a-4f45-a660-36ae2c5dd3c5\', \'multiverseId\': 424916}, \'multiverseid\': 424916}, {\'name\': \'톱니장치 조립공\', \'text\': \'{7}: 마법물체를 목표로 정한다. 그 마법물체의 복사본인 토큰 한 개를 만든다. 그 토큰은 신속을 얻는다. 다음 종료단 시작에 그 토큰을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 조립공\', \'flavor\': \'복제는 도둑질이나 아첨이 아니라 효율성이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d48e452-fd9d-4402-836d-4d6cae493002\', \'multiverseId\': 425100}, \'multiverseid\': 425100}, {\'name\': \'Montador de Engrenagem\', \'text\': \'{7}: Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia do artefato alvo. Aquela ficha ganha ímpeto. Exile-a no início da próxima etapa final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Operário de Linha de Montagem\', \'flavor\': \'A duplicação não é roubo nem lisonja. É eficiência.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13d770d8-597f-43c1-a557-4aa3ffb4b658\', \'multiverseId\': 425284}, \'multiverseid\': 425284}, {\'name\': \'Сборщик Механизмов\', \'text\': \'{7}: создайте фишку, являющуюся копией целевого артефакта. Та фишка получает Ускорение. Изгоните ее в начале следующего заключительного шага.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Рабочий-Cборщик\', \'flavor\': \'Копирование — это не воровство и не лесть. Это эффективность.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff46d8ef-7ef2-4aad-84d2-cef4427e0e11\', \'multiverseId\': 425468}, \'multiverseid\': 425468}, {\'name\': \'齿轮组装工\', \'text\': \'{7}：派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为目标神器之复制品。该衍生物获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组装工人\', \'flavor\': \'复制既不算剽窃也不算奉承。它意味着效率。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65ea9bf2-4da3-4e24-a578-19f4dc0dc0f8\', \'multiverseId\': 423996}, \'multiverseid\': 423996}, {\'name\': \'齒輪組裝工\', \'text\': \'{7}：派出一個衍生物，此衍生物為目標神器之複製品。該衍生物獲得敏捷異能。在下一個結束步驟開始時，將它放逐。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～組裝工人\', \'flavor\': \'複製既不算剽竊也不算奉承。它意味著效率。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79574a70-486e-4001-bf83-074cf7698d9c\', \'multiverseId\': 424180}, \'multiverseid\': 424180}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zerstörerische Manipulation\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl.\\n• Nichtfliegende Kreaturen können in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich glaube nicht, dass sie ihnen gefallen werden, meine … Anpassungen." —Karavin, Renegaten-Saboteur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424297&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d264922e-8b2f-47ac-a730-35ac4e5786ac\', \'multiverseId\': 424297}, \'multiverseid\': 424297}, {\'name\': \'Manipulación destructiva\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Destruye el artefacto objetivo.\\n• Las criaturas sin la habilidad de volar no pueden bloquear este turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"No creo que les gusten mis... ajustes". —Karavin, saboteador renegado\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6d19079-f4d8-4765-9a38-bfc8b3e19f8c\', \'multiverseId\': 425585}, \'multiverseid\': 425585}, {\'name\': \'Détraquement destructeur\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé.\\n• Les créatures sans le vol ne peuvent pas bloquer ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Je ne suis pas sûr qu\'ils apprécient mes... réglages. » —Karavin, saboteur renégat", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424481&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba8f59c9-7d63-4643-9070-86d6de28b241\', \'multiverseId\': 424481}, \'multiverseid\': 424481}, {\'name\': \'Manomissione Distruttiva\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio.\\n• Le creature senza volare non possono bloccare in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Non credo che gradiranno la mia... messa a punto." —Karavin, sabotatore rinnegato\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c839a7f5-97e5-4570-82d8-2120f9bb2cf3\', \'multiverseId\': 424665}, \'multiverseid\': 424665}, {\'name\': \'破壊的細工\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• アーティファクト１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\\n• このターン、飛行を持たないクリーチャーではブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「感謝はしないだろうな、俺のやった……調整にね。」 ――改革派の妨害工作者、カラビーン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0962daed-ab0a-43f2-aa19-fcea7cf30aaa\', \'multiverseId\': 424849}, \'multiverseid\': 424849}, {\'name\': \'파괴적 조작\', \'text\': \'하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 마법물체를 목표로 정한다. 그 마법물체를 파괴한다.\\n• 비행이 없는 생물들은 이 턴에 방어할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"그들이 내 "조정" 작업을 고마워하진 않을 것 같군." —무법자 파괴공작원 카라빈\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38545fa3-6db9-4201-8d44-304ab354cc09\', \'multiverseId\': 425033}, \'multiverseid\': 425033}, {\'name\': \'Modificação Destrutiva\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Destrua o artefato alvo.\\n• As criaturas sem voar não podem bloquear neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Não acho que eles apreciarão os meus... ajustes." — Karavin, sabotador renegado\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6667b1e-4f1c-4746-8865-356fd9146a5f\', \'multiverseId\': 425217}, \'multiverseid\': 425217}, {\'name\': \'Разрушительное Вмешательство\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Уничтожьте целевой артефакт.\\n• Существа без Полета не могут блокировать в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Не думаю, что им понравятся мои... усовершенствования». — Каравин, отступник-диверсант\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b04a09b0-0a4c-4718-bdd2-7f48de388779\', \'multiverseId\': 425401}, \'multiverseid\': 425401}, {\'name\': \'擅动致灾\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n• 消灭目标神器。\\n• 不具飞行异能的生物本回合不能进行阻挡。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「他们大概不会喜欢我所做的. . .调整。」 ～乱匠破坏者克勒温\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eefe0f8f-3e0b-4552-9c79-c0360cfa1f79\', \'multiverseId\': 423929}, \'multiverseid\': 423929}, {\'name\': \'擅動致災\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n• 消滅目標神器。\\n• 不具飛行異能的生物本回合不能進行阻擋。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「他們大概不會喜歡我所做的. . .調整。」 ～叛軍破壞者克勒溫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52762608-a70c-42b5-8196-eecc2d6db287\', \'multiverseId\': 424113}, \'multiverseid\': 424113}]', '[{\'name\': \'Äther-Giftmischerin\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung (Eine beliebige Menge Schadenspunkte, die sie einer Kreatur zufügt, sind ausreichend, um diese zu zerstören.)\\nWenn die Äther-Giftmischerin ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du {E}{E} (zwei Energiemarken).\\nImmer wenn die Äther-Giftmischerin angreift, kannst du {E}{E} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Servo-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424270&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a69d3e57-8c85-4996-ad52-236abae107c7\', \'multiverseId\': 424270}, \'multiverseid\': 424270}, {\'name\': \'Envenenadora de éter\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal. (Cualquier cantidad de daño que esto haga a una criatura es suficiente para destruirla.)\\nCuando la Envenenadora de éter entre al campo de batalla, obtienes {E}{E} (dos contadores de energía).\\nSiempre que la Envenenadora de éter ataque, puedes pagar {E}{E}. Si lo haces, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Servo incolora 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63658348-5b81-4671-8454-0ee67dc97b8b\', \'multiverseId\': 425558}, \'multiverseid\': 425558}, {\'name\': "Empoisonneuse d\'Éther", \'text\': "Contact mortel (Le nombre de blessures que cette créature inflige à une créature, quel qu\'il soit, est suffisant pour la détruire.)\\nQuand l\'Empoisonneuse d\'Éther arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez {E}{E} (deux marqueurs « énergie »).\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Empoisonneuse d\'Éther attaque, vous pouvez payer {E}{E}. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Servo.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424454&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc8b56a1-c947-4017-963d-77ce78571a82\', \'multiverseId\': 424454}, \'multiverseid\': 424454}, {\'name\': "Avvelenatrice d\'Etere", \'text\': "Tocco letale (Qualsiasi danno che questa creatura infligge a una creatura è sufficiente a distruggerla.)\\nQuando l\'Avvelenatrice d\'Etere entra nel campo di battaglia, ottieni {E}{E} (due segnalini energia).\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Avvelenatrice d\'Etere attacca, puoi pagare {E}{E}. Se lo fai, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Servomeccanismo 1/1 incolore.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0b20bd4-352c-40b0-b99e-5293f5726a8c\', \'multiverseId\': 424638}, \'multiverseid\': 424638}, {\'name\': \'霊気毒殺者\', \'text\': \'接死（これが何らかのダメージをクリーチャーに与えたら、それだけで破壊する。）\\n霊気毒殺者が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター２個）を得る。\\n霊気毒殺者が攻撃するたび、あなたは{E}{E}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、無色の１/１の霊気装置・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'543bfc50-6268-44fd-b2a4-0cc0bafa5c70\', \'multiverseId\': 424822}, \'multiverseid\': 424822}, {\'name\': \'에테르 독살범\', \'text\': \'치명타 (이 생물에게 피해를 입은 생물은 입은 피해의 양에 상관없이 파괴된다.)\\n에테르 독살범이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 {E}{E}(에너지 카운터 두 개)를 얻는다.\\n에테르 독살범이 공격할 때마다, 당신은 {E}{E}를 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 1/1 무색 서보 마법물체 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기능공\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1379974a-e330-4239-bffd-6d5736684d00\', \'multiverseId\': 425006}, \'multiverseid\': 425006}, {\'name\': \'Envenenadora do Éter\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero (Qualquer quantidade de dano que esta criatura cause a uma criatura é suficiente para destruí-la.)\\nQuando Envenenadora do Éter entra no campo de batalha, você recebe {E}{E} (dois marcadores de energia).\\nToda vez que Envenenadora do Éter ataca, você pode pagar {E}{E}. Se fizer isso, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Servus.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71dae753-ce9d-4b30-9a73-14eaabb099d8\', \'multiverseId\': 425190}, \'multiverseid\': 425190}, {\'name\': \'Эфирная Отравительница\', \'text\': \'Смертельное касание (Любое количество повреждений, которое этот объект наносит существу, достаточно, чтобы его уничтожить.)\\nКогда Эфирная Отравительница выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете {E}{E} (два жетона энергии).\\nКаждый раз, когда Эфирная Отравительница атакует, вы можете заплатить {E}{E}. Если вы это делаете, создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Сервотрон.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Механик\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b1be03c-c54a-4312-a465-c4a3b014736f\', \'multiverseId\': 425374}, \'multiverseid\': 425374}, {\'name\': \'乙太投毒师\', \'text\': \'死触（它对生物造成的任何数量伤害都足以消灭后者。）\\n当乙太投毒师进战场时，你得到{E}{E}（两个能量指示物）。\\n每当乙太投毒师攻击时，你可以支付{E}{E}。若你如此作，则派出一个1/1无色自动机衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423902&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6202d1f4-9457-4e65-9cf2-de4001e0f008\', \'multiverseId\': 423902}, \'multiverseid\': 423902}, {\'name\': \'乙太投毒師\', \'text\': \'死觸（它對生物造成的任何數量傷害都足以消滅後者。）\\n當乙太投毒師進戰場時，你得到{E}{E}（兩個能量指示物）。\\n每當乙太投毒師攻擊時，你可以支付{E}{E}。若你如此作，則派出一個1/1無色自動機衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／神器師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1e4891a-c786-44c1-95e7-09a6cf87cbd6\', \'multiverseId\': 424086}, \'multiverseid\': 424086}]', '[{\'name\': \'Äther-Gleiterin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Äther-Gleiterin ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du {E}{E} (zwei Energiemarken).\\nImmer wenn die Äther-Gleiterin angreift, kannst du {E}{E} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Servo-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vedalken, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424245&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c08c325-57d8-4fc1-b0c3-d2789db85a18\', \'multiverseId\': 424245}, \'multiverseid\': 424245}, {\'name\': \'Surcadora de éter\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Surcadora de éter entre al campo de batalla, obtienes {E}{E} (dos contadores de energía).\\nSiempre que la Surcadora de éter ataque, puedes pagar {E}{E}. Si lo haces, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Servo incolora 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice vedalken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a83dfbc6-496f-45ed-b569-44e5538bca11\', \'multiverseId\': 425533}, \'multiverseid\': 425533}, {\'name\': "Voltigeuse de l\'Éther", \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand la Voltigeuse de l\'Éther arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez {E}{E} (deux marqueurs « énergie »).\\nÀ chaque fois que la Voltigeuse de l\'Éther attaque, vous pouvez payer {E}{E}. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Servo.", \'type\': \'Créature : vedalken et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424429&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'065fa0e3-01cd-475a-9c92-0b0fef369bcc\', \'multiverseId\': 424429}, \'multiverseid\': 424429}, {\'name\': "Planatrice dell\'Etere", \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando la Planatrice dell\'Etere entra nel campo di battaglia, ottieni {E}{E} (due segnalini energia).\\nOgniqualvolta la Planatrice dell\'Etere attacca, puoi pagare {E}{E}. Se lo fai, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Servomeccanismo 1/1 incolore.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Vedalken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19b44847-d512-4638-bb96-6e54121e2171\', \'multiverseId\': 424613}, \'multiverseid\': 424613}, {\'name\': \'霊気急襲者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n霊気急襲者が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター２個）を得る。\\n霊気急襲者が攻撃するたび、あなたは{E}{E}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、無色の１/１の霊気装置・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ヴィダルケン・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d15e0023-6514-4c75-ae2e-cc3c25f16944\', \'multiverseId\': 424797}, \'multiverseid\': 424797}, {\'name\': \'에테르 강습병\', \'text\': \'비행\\n에테르 강습병이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 {E}{E}(에너지 카운터 두 개)를 얻는다.\\n에테르 강습병이 공격할 때마다, 당신은 {E}{E}를 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 1/1 무색 서보 마법물체 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 베달켄 기능공\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee20e5f1-5076-4776-89cf-ec8bb8f7c346\', \'multiverseId\': 424981}, \'multiverseid\': 424981}, {\'name\': \'Planadora Etérea\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Planadora Etérea entra no campo de batalha, você recebe {E}{E} (dois marcadores de energia).\\nToda vez que Planadora Etérea ataca, você pode pagar {E}{E}. Se fizer isso, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Servus.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vedalkeano Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ae2950c-18be-492a-a209-1d495b7d272f\', \'multiverseId\': 425165}, \'multiverseid\': 425165}, {\'name\': \'Эфирная Пикировщица\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Эфирная Пикировщица выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете {E}{E} (два жетона энергии).\\nКаждый раз, когда Эфирная Пикировщица атакует, вы можете заплатить {E}{E}. Если вы это делаете, создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Сервотрон.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ведалкен Механик\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5863d73a-da20-4c2d-99d1-ef01fb03e2b1\', \'multiverseId\': 425349}, \'multiverseid\': 425349}, {\'name\': \'乙太攫击兵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当乙太攫击兵进战场时，你得到{E}{E}（两个能量指示物）。\\n每当乙太攫击兵攻击时，你可以支付{E}{E}。若你如此作，则派出一个1/1无色自动机衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～维多肯／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfa5b1ed-f5ee-4352-990b-8f5ff507c83c\', \'multiverseId\': 423877}, \'multiverseid\': 423877}, {\'name\': \'乙太攫擊兵\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當乙太攫擊兵進戰場時，你得到{E}{E}（兩個能量指示物）。\\n每當乙太攫擊兵攻擊時，你可以支付{E}{E}。若你如此作，則派出一個1/1無色自動機衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～維多肯／神器師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acf023eb-827e-40c2-814b-2a4ed8b8bd5e\', \'multiverseId\': 424061}, \'multiverseid\': 424061}]', '[{\'name\': \'Äther-Hirte\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Äther-Hirte ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du {E}{E} (zwei Energiemarken).\\nImmer wenn der Äther-Hirte angreift, kannst du {E}{E} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Servo-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Handwerker, Druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424321&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a93651f-fb0d-49ff-b9be-6e9d84cd948b\', \'multiverseId\': 424321}, \'multiverseid\': 424321}, {\'name\': \'Pastor del éter\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Pastor del éter entre al campo de batalla, obtienes {E}{E} (dos contadores de energía).\\nSiempre que el Pastor del éter ataque, puedes pagar {E}{E}. Si lo haces, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Servo incolora 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida artífice elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef847c72-0063-491c-bc02-46f580887851\', \'multiverseId\': 425609}, \'multiverseid\': 425609}, {\'name\': "Berger de l\'Éther", \'text\': "Quand le Berger de l\'Éther arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez {E}{E} (deux marqueurs « énergie »).\\nÀ chaque fois que le Berger de l\'Éther attaque, vous pouvez payer {E}{E}. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Servo.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et artificier et druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424505&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c62caa3-fa6d-4acc-9675-0b91998a02d3\', \'multiverseId\': 424505}, \'multiverseid\': 424505}, {\'name\': "Pastore dell\'Etere", \'text\': "Quando il Pastore dell\'Etere entra nel campo di battaglia, ottieni {E}{E} (due segnalini energia).\\nOgniqualvolta il Pastore dell\'Etere attacca, puoi pagare {E}{E}. Se lo fai, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Servomeccanismo 1/1 incolore.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Artefice Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63a7d292-d746-441d-b5a5-a75dfe9f8777\', \'multiverseId\': 424689}, \'multiverseid\': 424689}, {\'name\': \'霊気運用者\', \'text\': \'霊気運用者が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター２個）を得る。\\n霊気運用者が攻撃するたび、あなたは{E}{E}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、無色の１/１の霊気装置・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・工匠・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91c596e2-63c4-4558-b155-e571728b2ae0\', \'multiverseId\': 424873}, \'multiverseid\': 424873}, {\'name\': \'에테르 목동\', \'text\': \'에테르 목동이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 {E}{E}(에너지 카운터 두 개)를 얻는다.\\n에테르 목동이 공격할 때마다, 당신은 {E}{E}를 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 1/1 무색 서보 마법물체 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 기능공 드루이드\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74fa4e0d-694e-4c7d-940c-bbf44777a4e6\', \'multiverseId\': 425057}, \'multiverseid\': 425057}, {\'name\': \'Pastor do Éter\', \'text\': \'Quando Pastor do Éter entra no campo de batalha, você recebe {E}{E} (dois marcadores de energia).\\nToda vez que Pastor do Éter ataca, você pode pagar {E}{E}. Se fizer isso, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Servus.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Artesão Druida\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f39c56ce-d21d-4700-a139-f28a0070f805\', \'multiverseId\': 425241}, \'multiverseid\': 425241}, {\'name\': \'Эфирный Пастух\', \'text\': \'Когда Эфирный Пастух выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете {E}{E} (два жетона энергии).\\nКаждый раз, когда Эфирный Пастух атакует, вы можете заплатить {E}{E}. Если вы это делаете, создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Сервотрон.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Механик Друид\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7ea80e6-5343-471f-a771-efe4036fbb66\', \'multiverseId\': 425425}, \'multiverseid\': 425425}, {\'name\': \'乙太牧人\', \'text\': \'当乙太牧人进战场时，你得到{E}{E}（两个能量指示物）。\\n每当乙太牧人攻击时，你可以支付{E}{E}。若你如此作，则派出一个1/1无色自动机衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／神器师／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423953&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bbea6b3-6f15-4d36-8958-351c03fbacb4\', \'multiverseId\': 423953}, \'multiverseid\': 423953}, {\'name\': \'乙太牧人\', \'text\': \'當乙太牧人進戰場時，你得到{E}{E}（兩個能量指示物）。\\n每當乙太牧人攻擊時，你可以支付{E}{E}。若你如此作，則派出一個1/1無色自動機衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／神器師／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8daa5ab3-6fc7-4a27-a572-581014c89297\', \'multiverseId\': 424137}, \'multiverseid\': 424137}]', '[{\'name\': \'Äther-Inspektor\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nWenn der Äther-Inspektor ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du {E}{E} (zwei Energiemarken).\\nImmer wenn der Äther-Inspektor angreift, kannst du {E}{E} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Servo-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zwerg, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424222&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da15ff87-5fa8-463c-b884-c9061c2448fe\', \'multiverseId\': 424222}, \'multiverseid\': 424222}, {\'name\': \'Inspector de éter\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nCuando el Inspector de éter entre al campo de batalla, obtienes {E}{E} (dos contadores de energía).\\nSiempre que el Inspector de éter ataque, puedes pagar {E}{E}. Si lo haces, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Servo incolora 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Enano artífice\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3630ae8-6480-46d5-8c98-c79e9af9d80e\', \'multiverseId\': 425510}, \'multiverseid\': 425510}, {\'name\': "Inspecteur d\'Éther", \'text\': "Vigilance\\nQuand l\'Inspecteur d\'Éther arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez {E}{E} (deux marqueurs « énergie »).\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Inspecteur d\'Éther attaque, vous pouvez payer {E}{E}. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Servo.", \'type\': \'Créature : nain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424406&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2cf6af0-dad7-4901-a36d-cd4745f207ae\', \'multiverseId\': 424406}, \'multiverseid\': 424406}, {\'name\': "Ispettore dell\'Etere", \'text\': "Cautela\\nQuando l\'Ispettore dell\'Etere entra nel campo di battaglia, ottieni {E}{E} (due segnalini energia).\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Ispettore dell\'Etere attacca, puoi pagare {E}{E}. Se lo fai, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Servomeccanismo 1/1 incolore.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Nano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'961ccbef-7123-4d4f-b893-729afc6ab796\', \'multiverseId\': 424590}, \'multiverseid\': 424590}, {\'name\': \'霊気査閲者\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n霊気査閲者が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター２個）を得る。\\n霊気査閲者が攻撃するたび、あなたは{E}{E}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、無色の１/１の霊気装置・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドワーフ・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e133d277-ea40-48a8-b7c3-c0da09bc2450\', \'multiverseId\': 424774}, \'multiverseid\': 424774}, {\'name\': \'에테르 검사관\', \'text\': \'경계\\n에테르 검사관이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 {E}{E}(에너지 카운터 두 개)를 얻는다.\\n에테르 검사관이 공격할 때마다, 당신은 {E}{E}를 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 1/1 무색 서보 마법물체 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 드워프 기능공\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44f4cfae-943c-4ae3-bd4e-9db4436c41a2\', \'multiverseId\': 424958}, \'multiverseid\': 424958}, {\'name\': \'Inspetor de Éter\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nQuando Inspetor de Éter entra no campo de batalha, você recebe {E}{E} (dois marcadores de energia).\\nToda vez que Inspetor de Éter ataca, você pode pagar {E}{E}. Se fizer isso, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Servus.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anão Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a5a04af-e19b-4b57-b859-ee9852279177\', \'multiverseId\': 425142}, \'multiverseid\': 425142}, {\'name\': \'Инспектор Эфира\', \'text\': \'Бдительность\\nКогда Инспектор Эфира выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете {E}{E} (два жетона энергии).\\nКаждый раз, когда Инспектор Эфира атакует, вы можете заплатить {E}{E}. Если вы это делаете, создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Сервотрон.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гном Механик\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'387ee6e5-6853-42ef-9760-40d823ef500e\', \'multiverseId\': 425326}, \'multiverseid\': 425326}, {\'name\': \'乙太检察官\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n当乙太检察官进战场时，你得到{E}{E}（两个能量指示物）。\\n每当乙太检察官攻击时，你可以支付{E}{E}。若你如此作，则派出一个1/1无色自动机衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～矮人／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a965d9ca-fc2d-4122-82bb-c868906bc3e7\', \'multiverseId\': 423854}, \'multiverseid\': 423854}, {\'name\': \'乙太檢察官\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n當乙太檢察官進戰場時，你得到{E}{E}（兩個能量指示物）。\\n每當乙太檢察官攻擊時，你可以支付{E}{E}。若你如此作，則派出一個1/1無色自動機衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～矮人／神器師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bbe2b6d-8bfd-4fa8-9d75-b0a31d3e294e\', \'multiverseId\': 424038}, \'multiverseid\': 424038}]', '[{\'name\': \'Äther-Verfolger\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nWenn der Äther-Verfolger ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du {E}{E} (zwei Energiemarken).\\nImmer wenn der Äther-Verfolger angreift, kannst du {E}{E} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Servo-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424295&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'022b281f-e5ac-4d75-b894-68c9e0ac2990\', \'multiverseId\': 424295}, \'multiverseid\': 424295}, {\'name\': \'Perseguidor de éter\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nCuando el Perseguidor de éter entre al campo de batalla, obtienes {E}{E} (dos contadores de energía).\\nSiempre que el Perseguidor de éter ataque, puedes pagar {E}{E}. Si lo haces, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Servo incolora 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425583&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'249b692b-65a3-4a23-bc3e-350ddeba3eb7\', \'multiverseId\': 425583}, \'multiverseid\': 425583}, {\'name\': "Chasseur d\'Éther", \'text\': "Initiative\\nQuand le Chasseur d\'Éther arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez {E}{E} (deux marqueurs « énergie »).\\nÀ chaque fois que le Chasseur d\'Éther attaque, vous pouvez payer {E}{E}. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Servo.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424479&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afb48c48-94ba-4256-8dce-980ae23a10a1\', \'multiverseId\': 424479}, \'multiverseid\': 424479}, {\'name\': "Inseguitore d\'Etere", \'text\': "Attacco improvviso\\nQuando l\'Inseguitore d\'Etere entra nel campo di battaglia, ottieni {E}{E} (due segnalini energia).\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Inseguitore d\'Etere attacca, puoi pagare {E}{E}. Se lo fai, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Servomeccanismo 1/1 incolore.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c71e28c7-5809-401a-9fd9-0935166f1764\', \'multiverseId\': 424663}, \'multiverseid\': 424663}, {\'name\': \'霊気追跡者\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n霊気追跡者が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター２個）を得る。\\n霊気追跡者が攻撃するたび、あなたは{E}{E}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、無色の１/１の霊気装置・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2bc80b1-32ae-43c1-9871-04a71c88854d\', \'multiverseId\': 424847}, \'multiverseid\': 424847}, {\'name\': \'에테르 추적자\', \'text\': \'선제공격\\n에테르 추적자가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 {E}{E}(에너지 카운터 두 개)를 얻는다.\\n에테르 추적자가 공격할 때마다, 당신은 {E}{E}를 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 1/1 무색 서보 마법물체 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기능공\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88ebc4ef-dce9-40fb-9063-05ae0964a345\', \'multiverseId\': 425031}, \'multiverseid\': 425031}, {\'name\': \'Caçador de Éter\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nQuando Caçador de Éter entra no campo de batalha, você recebe {E}{E} (dois marcadores de energia).\\nToda vez que Caçador de Éter ataca, você pode pagar {E}{E}. Se fizer isso, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Servus.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a427bf6-3a8f-4f27-bb6a-e383fcccab66\', \'multiverseId\': 425215}, \'multiverseid\': 425215}, {\'name\': \'Эфирный Преследователь\', \'text\': \'Первый удар\\nКогда Эфирный Преследователь выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете {E}{E} (два жетона энергии).\\nКаждый раз, когда Эфирный Преследователь атакует, вы можете заплатить {E}{E}. Если вы это делаете, создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Сервотрон.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Механик\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed5c7d3b-5b36-4807-9665-7310ee33dc81\', \'multiverseId\': 425399}, \'multiverseid\': 425399}, {\'name\': \'乙太追逐客\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n当乙太追逐客进战场时，你得到{E}{E}（两个能量指示物）。\\n每当乙太追逐客攻击时，你可以支付{E}{E}。若你如此作，则派出一个1/1无色自动机衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fddce78-1374-454f-b9c8-637fbf8dda0f\', \'multiverseId\': 423927}, \'multiverseid\': 423927}, {\'name\': \'乙太追逐客\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n當乙太追逐客進戰場時，你得到{E}{E}（兩個能量指示物）。\\n每當乙太追逐客攻擊時，你可以支付{E}{E}。若你如此作，則派出一個1/1無色自動機衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／神器師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fb18fc7-102f-4398-8bd1-7220208cf2c8\', \'multiverseId\': 424111}, \'multiverseid\': 424111}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ätherflut-Wal\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Ätherflut-Wal ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E} (sechs Energiemarken).\\nBezahle {E}{E}{E}{E}: Bringe den Ätherflut-Wal auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wal\', \'flavor\': \'„Um hier oben zu überleben, muss man wissen, wann man die Harpune benutzt und wann man einfach nur die Aussicht genießt." —Kadhu, Himmelswalfänger\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424246&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02fdce6b-b1db-4f42-8b59-3a3b9b1c453d\', \'multiverseId\': 424246}, \'multiverseid\': 424246}, {\'name\': \'Ballena de marea etérica\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Ballena de marea etérica entre al campo de batalla, obtienes {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E} (seis contadores de energía).\\nPagar {E}{E}{E}{E}: Regresa la Ballena de marea etérica a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ballena\', \'flavor\': \'"Para sobrevivir aquí arriba, tuve que aprender cuándo usar el arpón y cuándo disfrutar de la vista". —Kadhu, ballenero celeste\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4024deb1-e29c-4711-89c3-607c95932240\', \'multiverseId\': 425534}, \'multiverseid\': 425534}, {\'name\': \'Baleine éthertidale\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nQuand la Baleine éthertidale arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E} (six marqueurs « énergie »).\\nPayez {E}{E}{E}{E} : Renvoyez la Baleine éthertidale dans la main de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Créature : baleine\', \'flavor\': "« Pour survivre ici, j\'ai appris quand utiliser mon harpon et quand admirer la vue. » —Kadhu, baleinier volant", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424430&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0647910f-547c-4487-a00f-3c3c0782d8c1\', \'multiverseId\': 424430}, \'multiverseid\': 424430}, {\'name\': \'Balena della Marea Eterea\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando la Balena della Marea Eterea entra nel campo di battaglia, ottieni {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E} (sei segnalini energia).\\nPaga {E}{E}{E}{E}: Fai tornare la Balena della Marea Eterea in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Balena\', \'flavor\': \'"Per sopravvivere quassù, ho dovuto imparare quando usare la fiocina e quando limitarmi ad ammirare lo spettacolo." —Kadhu, aviobaleniere\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74badf65-cae5-41b4-88a1-ec6eec0e9c1a\', \'multiverseId\': 424614}, \'multiverseid\': 424614}, {\'name\': \'霊気海嘯の鯨\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n霊気海嘯の鯨が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター６個）を得る。\\n{E}{E}{E}{E}を支払う：霊気海嘯の鯨をオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鯨\', \'flavor\': \'「修羅場をくぐってるとな、銛を使わにゃならん時と、眺めを楽しめばいい時が、わかるようになるんだよ。」 ――空鯨捕りのカドフー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90122909-d920-41ac-967d-c6fa9e2b92a4\', \'multiverseId\': 424798}, \'multiverseid\': 424798}, {\'name\': \'에테르조류 고래\', \'text\': \'비행\\n에테르조류 고래가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}(에너지 카운터 여섯 개)를 얻는다.\\n{E}{E}{E}{E}를 지불한다: 에테르조류 고래를 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고래\', \'flavor\': \'"여기서 살아남기 위해서 언제 작살을 사용해야 하고 언제 경치를 즐겨야 하는 지를 터득했어." —하늘고래잡이 카드후\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02541dc0-ad53-4021-a2a7-52564ff7205e\', \'multiverseId\': 424982}, \'multiverseid\': 424982}, {\'name\': \'Baleia-da-maré-etérea\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Baleia-da-maré-etérea entra no campo de batalha, você recebe {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E} (seis marcadores de energia).\\nPague {E}{E}{E}{E}: Devolva Baleia-da-maré-etérea para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Baleia\', \'flavor\': \'"Para sobreviver aqui em cima, precisei aprender a saber quando devo usar o meu arpão e quando devo só apreciar a vista." — Kadhu, aerobaleeiro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa826070-9adc-4faa-a3ec-3e201ca5f295\', \'multiverseId\': 425166}, \'multiverseid\': 425166}, {\'name\': \'Кит Эфирных Приливов\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Кит Эфирных Приливов выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E} (шесть жетонов энергии).\\nЗаплатите {E}{E}{E}{E}: верните Кита Эфирных Приливов в руку его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кит\', \'flavor\': \'«Чтобы здесь выжить, пришлось научиться, когда браться за гарпун, а когда — просто любоваться зрелищем». — Кадху, небесный китобой\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98808a07-c19a-4836-b4d6-0bd693378070\', \'multiverseId\': 425350}, \'multiverseid\': 425350}, {\'name\': \'乙太潮巨鲸\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当乙太潮巨鲸进战场时，你得到{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}（六个能量指示物）。\\n支付{E}{E}{E}{E}：将乙太潮巨鲸移回其拥有者的手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～鲸鱼\', \'flavor\': \'「为了在这里求生，我学会何时该使用鱼叉，何时该欣赏美景。」 ～飞鲸猎手克杜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb22783f-077d-4125-84d4-8773afde9a13\', \'multiverseId\': 423878}, \'multiverseid\': 423878}, {\'name\': \'乙太潮巨鯨\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當乙太潮巨鯨進戰場時，你得到{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}（六個能量指示物）。\\n支付{E}{E}{E}{E}：將乙太潮巨鯨移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～鯨魚\', \'flavor\': \'「為了在這裡求生，我學會何時該使用魚叉，何時該欣賞美景。」 ～飛鯨獵手克杜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c192dfa7-7a01-46b1-ae80-f3ce2b6d571d\', \'multiverseId\': 424062}, \'multiverseid\': 424062}]', '[{\'name\': \'Äthergeoden-Schürferin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Äthergeoden-Schürferin angreift, erhältst du {E}{E} (zwei Energiemarken).\\nBezahle {E}{E}: Schicke die Äthergeoden-Schürferin ins Exil und bringe sie danach unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zwerg, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'Gremlins laben sich in der Wildnis an Ansammlungen reinen Äthers, die auch von Bergleuten sehr geschätzt werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424223&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'357d7d3b-7fc3-4c44-990b-76a38b34ad0c\', \'multiverseId\': 424223}, \'multiverseid\': 424223}, {\'name\': \'Minera etergeoda\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la Minera etergeoda ataque, obtienes {E}{E} (dos contadores de energía).\\nPagar {E}{E}: Exilia a la Minera etergeoda, luego regrésala al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Enano Explorador\', \'flavor\': \'Los gremlins salvajes se alimentan de nódulos de éter puro, los mismos que también buscan sin cesar los mineros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'443b05b5-8d94-4c11-ade1-8ad77ca03bbd\', \'multiverseId\': 425511}, \'multiverseid\': 425511}, {\'name\': "Mineuse de géodes d\'Éther", \'text\': "À chaque fois que la Mineuse de géodes d\'Éther attaque, vous gagnez {E}{E} (deux marqueurs « énergie »).\\nPayez {E}{E} : Exilez la Mineuse de géodes d\'Éther, puis renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : nain et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': "Dans la nature, les gremlins se nourrissent de nodules d\'Éther pur, aussi très convoités par les mineurs.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424407&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d06b0e3-bb25-4881-9a5b-212b467a8143\', \'multiverseId\': 424407}, \'multiverseid\': 424407}, {\'name\': \'Minatrice di Geodetere\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta la Minatrice di Geodetere attacca, ottieni {E}{E} (due segnalini energia).\\nPaga {E}{E}: Esilia la Minatrice di Geodetere, poi rimettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Nano\', \'flavor\': \'I gremlin nelle zone selvagge si cibano di noduli di etere puro, molto ricercati anche dai minatori.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7571af89-4855-4e26-b5cd-c6cfe8fc7962\', \'multiverseId\': 424591}, \'multiverseid\': 424591}, {\'name\': \'霊気晶の鉱夫\', \'text\': \'霊気晶の鉱夫が攻撃するたび、あなたは{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター２個）を得る。\\n{E}{E}を支払う：霊気晶の鉱夫を追放し、その後これをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドワーフ・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'野生のグレムリンは純粋な霊気を食べる。これは鉱夫にとっての貴重品でもある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ea9452f-8f81-48da-b1eb-0b096c966825\', \'multiverseId\': 424775}, \'multiverseid\': 424775}, {\'name\': \'에테르정동 광부\', \'text\': \'에테르정동 광부가 공격할 때마다, 당신은 {E}{E}(에너지 카운터 두 개)를 얻는다.\\n{E}{E}를 지불한다: 에테르정동 광부를 추방한 후 소유자의 조종하에 전장으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 드워프 정찰병\', \'flavor\': \'야생의 그렘린은 광부들이 소중하게 여기는 순수 에테르 광석을 먹고 산다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97d29c9c-614f-4fe2-8ac0-b9c303f8fa09\', \'multiverseId\': 424959}, \'multiverseid\': 424959}, {\'name\': \'Mineradora do Geodo Etéreo\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Mineradora do Geodo Etéreo ataca, você recebe {E}{E} (dois marcadores de energia).\\nPague {E}{E}: Exile Mineradora do Geodo Etéreo e, em seguida, devolva-a ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anão Batedor\', \'flavor\': \'Os gremlins das zonas selvagens alimentam-se de nódulos de éter puro, igualmente estimados pelos mineradores.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3bcc07d-8110-4447-94a2-05a228659807\', \'multiverseId\': 425143}, \'multiverseid\': 425143}, {\'name\': \'Эфирный Рудокоп\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Эфирный Рудокоп атакует, вы получаете {E}{E} (два жетона энергии).\\nЗаплатите {E}{E}: изгоните Эфирного Рудокопа, затем верните его на поле битвы под контролем его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гном Разведчик\', \'flavor\': \'Дикие гремлины питаются сгустками чистого эфира — такими, какие очень ценят рудокопы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f033720-a0c6-4ce6-bc31-4433556f059a\', \'multiverseId\': 425327}, \'multiverseid\': 425327}, {\'name\': \'乙太岩矿工\', \'text\': \'每当乙太岩矿工攻击时，你得到{E}{E}（两个能量指示物）。\\n支付{E}{E}：放逐乙太岩矿工，然后将它在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物～矮人／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'至纯乙太结核是野生怪灵的珍馐，也是矿工的至宝。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a3b5055-61e3-489f-9f15-b7736f7e0d6e\', \'multiverseId\': 423855}, \'multiverseid\': 423855}, {\'name\': \'乙太岩礦工\', \'text\': \'每當乙太岩礦工攻擊時，你得到{E}{E}（兩個能量指示物）。\\n支付{E}{E}：放逐乙太岩礦工，然後將它在其擁有者的操控下移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物～矮人／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'至純乙太結核是野生怪靈的珍饈，也是礦工的至寶。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d8da696-8eb7-4ba5-9ca8-5a2d9a957fb5\', \'multiverseId\': 424039}, \'multiverseid\': 424039}]', '[{\'name\': \'Äthersphären-Erntemaschine\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Äthersphären-Erntemaschine ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du {E}{E} (zwei Energiemarken).\\nBezahle {E}: Die Äthersphären-Erntemaschine erhält Lebensverknüpfung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nBemannen 1 (Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die zusammen Stärke 1 oder mehr haben: Dieses Fahrzeug wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424361&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8646bc48-bd8f-4ebd-b363-446892914d0a\', \'multiverseId\': 424361}, \'multiverseid\': 424361}, {\'name\': \'Recolector de la eteresfera\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Recolector de la eteresfera entre al campo de batalla, obtienes {E}{E} (dos contadores de energía).\\nPagar {E}: El Recolector de la eteresfera gana la habilidad de vínculo vital hasta el final del turno.\\nTripular 1. (Girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controlas con una fuerza total de 1 o más: Este Vehículo se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da61e599-aea7-412a-8f5f-14eacafa4bae\', \'multiverseId\': 425649}, \'multiverseid\': 425649}, {\'name\': "Moissonneur de l\'Éthersphère", \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Moissonneur de l\'Éthersphère arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez {E}{E} (deux marqueurs « énergie »).\\nPayez {E} : Le Moissonneur de l\'Éthersphère acquiert le lien de vie jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nPilotage 1 (Engagez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez dont la force totale est supérieure ou égale à 1 : Ce véhicule devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : véhicule\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424545&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76549ac1-4271-411f-9ac5-38d9b9993704\', \'multiverseId\': 424545}, \'multiverseid\': 424545}, {\'name\': "Mietitore dell\'Etersfera", \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando il Mietitore dell\'Etersfera entra nel campo di battaglia, ottieni {E}{E} (due segnalini energia).\\nPaga {E}: Il Mietitore dell\'Etersfera ha legame vitale fino alla fine del turno.\\nManovrare 1 (TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli con forza totale pari o superiore a 1: Questo Veicolo diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.)", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51975a29-1e16-477f-8ad3-57cc684fcb60\', \'multiverseId\': 424729}, \'multiverseid\': 424729}, {\'name\': \'霊気圏の収集艇\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n霊気圏の収集艇が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{E}{E}（エネルギー・カウンター２個）を得る。\\n{E}を支払う：ターン終了時まで、霊気圏の収集艇は絆魂を得る。\\n搭乗１（あなたがコントロールする望む数のクリーチャーを、パワーの合計が１以上になるように選んでタップする：ターン終了時まで、この機体はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71a4fa43-36d3-4dbf-87ec-d1376e62cce4\', \'multiverseId\': 424913}, \'multiverseid\': 424913}, {\'name\': \'에테르권 수확기계\', \'text\': \'비행\\n에테르권 수확기계가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 {E}{E}(에너지 카운터 두 개)를 얻는다.\\n{E}를 지불한다: 에테르권 수확기계는 턴종료까지 생명연결을 얻는다.\\n탑승 1 (당신이 조종하는 생물을 공격력 총합이 1 이상이 되도록 원하는 수만큼 탭한다: 이 탑승물은 턴종료까지 마법물체 생물이 된다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 탑승물\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08260226-b923-4442-b4ec-1ce04172e2a3\', \'multiverseId\': 425097}, \'multiverseid\': 425097}, {\'name\': \'Segadeira da Eteresfera\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Segadeira da Eteresfera entra no campo de batalha, você recebe {E}{E} (dois marcadores de energia).\\nPague {E}: Segadeira da Eteresfera ganha vínculo com a vida até o final do turno.\\nTripular 1 (Vire qualquer número de criaturas que você controla com total de poder igual ou superior a 1: Este Veículo se torna uma criatura artefato até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Veículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30aecb2e-cedb-4811-9bf7-a81384e8a82e\', \'multiverseId\': 425281}, \'multiverseid\': 425281}, {\'name\': \'Эфиросферный Сборщик\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Эфиросферный Сборщик выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете {E}{E} (два жетона энергии).\\nЗаплатите {E}: Эфиросферный Сборщик получает Цепь жизни до конца хода.\\nЭкипаж 1 (Поверните любое количество существ под вашим контролем с суммарной силой 1 или более: эта Машина становится артефактом существом до конца хода.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Машина\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3db66a7-fc4f-434e-86e4-18cd93a4bb22\', \'multiverseId\': 425465}, \'multiverseid\': 425465}, {\'name\': \'乙太层收集机\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当乙太层收集机进战场时，你得到{E}{E}（两个能量指示物）。\\n支付{E}：乙太层收集机获得系命异能直到回合结束。\\n搭载1（横置任意数量由你操控且力量总和等于或大于1的生物：此载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'神器～载具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4aabd673-97b8-4aa8-9cc6-4c236b9519a6\', \'multiverseId\': 423993}, \'multiverseid\': 423993}, {\'name\': \'乙太層收集機\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當乙太層收集機進戰場時，你得到{E}{E}（兩個能量指示物）。\\n支付{E}：乙太層收集機獲得繫命異能直到回合結束。\\n搭載1（橫置任意數量由你操控且力量總和等於或大於1的生物：此載具成為神器生物直到回合結束。）\', \'type\': \'神器～載具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfa25bb9-d4b2-468c-a512-7c5151665366\', \'multiverseId\': 424177}, \'multiverseid\': 424177}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ätherstrom-Leopard\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn der Ätherstrom-Leopard ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du {E} (eine Energiemarke).\\nImmer wenn der Ätherstrom-Leopard angreift, kannst du {E} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erhält er +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424322&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af271591-8770-4513-b350-3939c85bd21b\', \'multiverseId\': 424322}, \'multiverseid\': 424322}, {\'name\': \'Leopardo de corriente etérica\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nCuando el Leopardo de corriente etérica entre al campo de batalla, obtienes {E} (un contador de energía).\\nSiempre que el Leopardo de corriente etérica ataque, puedes pagar {E}. Si lo haces, obtiene +2/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a634120-7f90-4e4d-af8d-ab51c4c6d843\', \'multiverseId\': 425610}, \'multiverseid\': 425610}, {\'name\': "Léopard des ruisseaux d\'Éther", \'text\': "Piétinement\\nQuand le Léopard des ruisseaux d\'Éther arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez {E} (un marqueur « énergie »).\\nÀ chaque fois que le Léopard des ruisseaux d\'Éther attaque, vous pouvez payer {E}. Si vous faites ainsi, il gagne +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424506&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82a2af10-7b28-4670-b517-ad56dac92fe3\', \'multiverseId\': 424506}, \'multiverseid\': 424506}, {\'name\': \'Leopardo della Corrente Eterea\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nQuando il Leopardo della Corrente Eterea entra nel campo di battaglia, ottieni {E} (un segnalino energia).\\nOgniqualvolta il Leopardo della Corrente Eterea attacca, puoi pagare {E}. Se lo fai, prende +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cacc8a8c-a566-4aac-b7be-8f6daa640da8\', \'multiverseId\': 424690}, \'multiverseid\': 424690}, {\'name\': \'霊気流の豹\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n霊気流の豹が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{E}（エネルギー・カウンター１個）を得る。\\n霊気流の豹が攻撃するたび、あなたは{E}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、ターン終了時まで、これは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c568242-ff10-49d3-8420-7768fdb12983\', \'multiverseId\': 424874}, \'multiverseid\': 424874}, {\'name\': \'에테르 개울 표범\', \'text\': \'돌진\\n에테르 개울 표범이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 {E}(에너지 카운터 한 개)를 얻는다.\\n에테르 개울 표범이 공격할 때마다, 당신은 {E}를 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 에테르 개울 표범은 턴종료까지 +2/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee9c4466-d7b4-4dd3-a3f0-3f0c7b025103\', \'multiverseId\': 425058}, \'multiverseid\': 425058}, {\'name\': \'Leopardo-das-correntes-de-éter\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nQuando Leopardo-das-correntes-de-éter entra no campo de batalha, você recebe {E} (um marcador de energia).\\nToda vez que Leopardo-das-correntes-de-éter ataca, você pode pagar {E}. Se fizer isso, ele receberá +2/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d2744e9-5df2-42b5-a1dc-73ae6435d7a4\', \'multiverseId\': 425242}, \'multiverseid\': 425242}, {\'name\': \'Леопард Эфирных Потоков\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nКогда Леопард Эфирных Потоков выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете {E} (один жетон энергии).\\nКаждый раз, когда Леопард Эфирных Потоков атакует, вы можете заплатить {E}. Если вы это делаете, он получает +2/+0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecfb38c0-179d-4c5b-b5bf-ee26393cc998\', \'multiverseId\': 425426}, \'multiverseid\': 425426}, {\'name\': \'乙太流猎豹\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n当乙太流猎豹进战场时，你得到{E}（一个能量指示物）。\\n每当乙太流猎豹攻击时，你可以支付{E}。若你如此作，则它得+2/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～猫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35cff4ad-0b1f-4d4d-af87-363b66320844\', \'multiverseId\': 423954}, \'multiverseid\': 423954}, {\'name\': \'乙太流獵豹\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n當乙太流獵豹進戰場時，你得到{E}（一個能量指示物）。\\n每當乙太流獵豹攻擊時，你可以支付{E}。若你如此作，則它得+2/+0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～貓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8266b470-7e86-46ae-85b4-f2b99ec468df\', \'multiverseId\': 424138}, \'multiverseid\': 424138}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ätherwind-Reptil\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn das Ätherwind-Reptil ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, erhältst du {E} (eine Energiemarke) für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst.\\nBezahle {E}: Das Ätherwind-Reptil erhält +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eidechse\', \'flavor\': \'Sein Kragen lieferte das Design für effiziente Äther-Kollektoren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424323&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3d61998-daed-48fc-9d85-0d1f40e9415c\', \'multiverseId\': 424323}, \'multiverseid\': 424323}, {\'name\': \'Recolector vientoetéreo\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nSiempre que el Recolector vientoetéreo entre al campo de batalla o ataque, obtienes {E} (un contador de energía) por cada criatura que controlas.\\nPagar {E}: El Recolector vientoetéreo obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lagarto\', \'flavor\': \'Sus crestas inspiraron el diseño de eficientes recolectores de éter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f973bd3-a022-4088-bb7b-30835724278b\', \'multiverseId\': 425611}, \'multiverseid\': 425611}, {\'name\': \'Lézard des vents éthériques\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois que le Lézard des vents éthériques arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, vous gagnez {E} (un marqueur « énergie ») pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez.\\nPayez {E} : Le Lézard des vents éthériques gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : lézard\', \'flavor\': "Sa collerette a inspiré la création des meilleurs collecteurs d\'Éther.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424507&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3431f7b3-2160-48dc-bb83-945956f51bf3\', \'multiverseId\': 424507}, \'multiverseid\': 424507}, {\'name\': \'Assimilatore di Vento Etereo\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Assimilatore di Vento Etereo entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, ottieni {E} (un segnalino energia) per ogni creatura che controlli.\\nPaga {E}: L\'Assimilatore di Vento Etereo prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Lucertola\', \'flavor\': "Il suo collare ha ispirato la progettazione di raccoglitori d\'etere più efficienti.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f84566d-5188-4474-b6e5-1f0ced5f1ea9\', \'multiverseId\': 424691}, \'multiverseid\': 424691}, {\'name\': \'霊気風浴び\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n霊気風浴びが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、あなたは、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体につき{E}（エネルギー・カウンター１個）を得る。\\n{E}を支払う：ターン終了時まで、霊気風浴びは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — トカゲ\', \'flavor\': \'その襞が効率よい霊気収集器を設計するヒントとなった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2926e15-0da7-410e-84a0-27f5296e7134\', \'multiverseId\': 424875}, \'multiverseid\': 424875}, {\'name\': \'에테르바람 도마뱀\', \'text\': \'돌진\\n에테르바람 도마뱀이 전장에 들어오거나 공격할 때마다, 당신은 당신이 조종하는 생물 한 개당 {E}(에너지 카운터 한 개)를 얻는다.\\n{E}를 지불한다: 에테르바람 도마뱀은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 도마뱀\', \'flavor\': \'도마뱀의 목주름이 효율적인 에테르 수집기를 만드는 데 영감을 주었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94d5315e-3920-478c-83c9-78ccb37898dc\', \'multiverseId\': 425059}, \'multiverseid\': 425059}, {\'name\': \'Assimilador de Ventos Etéreos\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nToda vez que Assimilador de Ventos Etéreos entra no campo de batalha ou ataca, você recebe {E} (um marcador de energia) para cada criatura que você controla.\\nPague {E}: Assimilador de Ventos Etéreos recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lagarto\', \'flavor\': \'Sua gola inspirou os projetos de eficientes coletores de éter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c777b87c-5c96-4a67-b5ae-4738a2ed3076\', \'multiverseId\': 425243}, \'multiverseid\': 425243}, {\'name\': \'Поглотитель Эфирных Ветров\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nКаждый раз, когда Поглотитель Эфирных Ветров выходит на поле битвы или атакует, вы получаете {E} (один жетон энергии) за каждое существо под вашим контролем.\\nЗаплатите {E}: Поглотитель Эфирных Ветров получает +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ящер\', \'flavor\': \'Его перепонки стали прообразом крайне эффективных эфиросборщиков.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'972b2fcf-592d-420d-9be8-0c3bb24cc467\', \'multiverseId\': 425427}, \'multiverseid\': 425427}, {\'name\': \'乙太风浴蜥\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n每当乙太风浴蜥进战场或攻击时，你每操控一个生物，便得到{E}（一个能量指示物）。\\n支付{E}：乙太风浴蜥得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～蜥蜴\', \'flavor\': \'高效乙太收集器的设计灵感来自它的皮褶。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3d3cd9f-03f1-4093-ae3e-c971c1d54463\', \'multiverseId\': 423955}, \'multiverseid\': 423955}, {\'name\': \'乙太風浴蜥\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n每當乙太風浴蜥進戰場或攻擊時，你每操控一個生物，便得到{E}（一個能量指示物）。\\n支付{E}：乙太風浴蜥得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～蜥蜴\', \'flavor\': \'高效乙太收集器的設計靈感來自牠的皮褶。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d59e491f-a5fc-44ad-8413-29d6f3438ce3\', \'multiverseId\': 424139}, \'multiverseid\': 424139}]', '[{\'name\': \'Überschwemmter Knochenacker\', \'text\': \'Der Überschwemmte Knochenacker kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {U} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Die Ätherströmungen im Himmel spiegeln die Strömungen wider, die im Wasser darunter schon so manch einem das Leben gekostet haben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425731&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c800daa-1cbb-4245-ab7a-45047bcd31e7\', \'multiverseId\': 425731}, \'multiverseid\': 425731}, {\'name\': \'Osario sumergido\', \'text\': \'El Osario sumergido entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {B} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Las corrientes de éter que surcan los cielos reflejan las de agua, y incluidos los letales rápidos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b02cc74b-287f-4c52-b767-ed8de55d9e82\', \'multiverseId\': 425801}, \'multiverseid\': 425801}, {\'name\': \'Ossuaire submergé\', \'text\': "L\'Ossuaire submergé arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B} à votre réserve.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Les courants d\'Éther dans le ciel reflètent les courants aquatiques, et même les rapides périlleux.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425741&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a9cd271-897e-4ec1-a4c9-bab808bd61c4\', \'multiverseId\': 425741}, \'multiverseid\': 425741}, {\'name\': \'Ossario Sommerso\', \'text\': "L\'Ossario Sommerso entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B} alla tua riserva di mana.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "Le correnti di etere nel cielo sono uno specchio dei flussi d\'acqua sottostanti, incluse le rapide letali.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425751&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa27fecc-1e95-4325-8dac-ec5ac02c3b49\', \'multiverseId\': 425751}, \'multiverseid\': 425751}, {\'name\': \'水没した骨塚\', \'text\': \'水没した骨塚はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{U}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'空中の霊気の流れは、その下の水流と対をなしている。その流れには命取りとなる奔流も含まれる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0145e96b-b5eb-4ee8-916a-806930712a84\', \'multiverseId\': 425761}, \'multiverseid\': 425761}, {\'name\': \'물에 잠긴 납골지\', \'text\': \'물에 잠긴 납골지는 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{T}: {U} 또는 {B}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': \'하늘의 에테르 기류는 급류를 포함한 바다의 해류를 반영한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c98659e-73e4-46a0-809a-e2d66f3ad8d2\', \'multiverseId\': 425771}, \'multiverseid\': 425771}, {\'name\': \'Ossário Submerso\', \'text\': \'Ossário Submerso entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {U} ou {B} à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'As correntes do éter nos céus espelham as das águas abaixo, incluindo as corredeiras mortais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c84312bd-19c7-4037-be38-4b9ee26a9970\', \'multiverseId\': 425781}, \'multiverseid\': 425781}, {\'name\': \'Затопленное Кладбище\', \'text\': \'Затопленное Кладбище выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {U} или {B} в ваше хранилище маны.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Потоки эфира в небе повторяют движение потоков воды внизу — даже их смертоносные течения.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6183094-e157-4df1-8f16-2597f404d852\', \'multiverseId\': 425791}, \'multiverseid\': 425791}, {\'name\': \'水下聚骨场\', \'text\': \'水下聚骨场须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{U}或{B}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'苍穹的乙太流与海底洋流相仿，自然也少不了致命湍流。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'389c4236-3b34-4321-9ccd-70bb7f579299\', \'multiverseId\': 425711}, \'multiverseid\': 425711}, {\'name\': \'水下聚骨場\', \'text\': \'水下聚骨場須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{U}或{B}到你的魔法力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'蒼穹的乙太流與海底洋流相仿，自然也少不了致命湍流。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdc1eb3b-e3a5-48c2-9f44-c841c88b09c5\', \'multiverseId\': 425721}, \'multiverseid\': 425721}]', '[{\'name\': \'Überzeugung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+3.\\n{W}: Bringe die Überzeugung auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Es gibt keinen größeren Feigling als denjenigen, der an gar nichts glaubt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424231&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f30fb1a-96ba-4214-a796-4ea87be7149c\', \'multiverseId\': 424231}, \'multiverseid\': 424231}, {\'name\': \'Convicción\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+3.\\n{W}: Regresa la Convicción a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"No hay mayor cobarde que aquel que no cree en nada".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55c664c1-0c0d-413a-96b5-2e923c0cd5ba\', \'multiverseId\': 425519}, \'multiverseid\': 425519}, {\'name\': \'Conviction\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+3.\\n{W} : Renvoyez la Conviction dans la main de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "« Nul n\'est plus lâche que celui qui ne croit en rien. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424415&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f4c0dfc-d186-44fb-a160-d275f0242eef\', \'multiverseId\': 424415}, \'multiverseid\': 424415}, {\'name\': \'Condanna\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+3.\\n{W}: Fai tornare la Condanna in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Non esiste codardo più grande di chi non crede in nulla."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa72d2bb-7f62-45ee-adc4-daed3ace70b3\', \'multiverseId\': 424599}, \'multiverseid\': 424599}, {\'name\': \'罪の自覚\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋１/＋３の修整を受ける。\\n{W}：罪の自覚をオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「何も信じないなんて、なんて臆病なの。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec31478b-6b57-4bf6-b529-0e0675b576a8\', \'multiverseId\': 424783}, \'multiverseid\': 424783}, {\'name\': \'책임감\', \'text\': \'생물에 부여\\n부여된 생물은 +1/+3을 받는다.\\n{W}: 책임감을 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'"믿음이 없는 자보다 더 겁 많은 사람은 없다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7eafeb90-653e-458c-830d-820e6ccff772\', \'multiverseId\': 424967}, \'multiverseid\': 424967}, {\'name\': \'Convicção\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+3.\\n{W}: Devolva Convicção para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Não há covarde maior que aquele que não acredita em nada."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4d4e94d-51d2-4d88-a460-84d47ca9982b\', \'multiverseId\': 425151}, \'multiverseid\': 425151}, {\'name\': \'Твердые Убеждения\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +1/+3.\\n{W}: верните Твердые Убеждения в руку их владельца.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'«Нет большего труса, чем тот, кто ни во что не верит».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=425335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ab415c9-69af-43ca-8229-a2617215428b\', \'multiverseId\': 425335}, \'multiverseid\': 425335}, {\'name\': \'使命感\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+1/+3。\\n{W}：将使命感移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「毫无信仰的人最为懦弱。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8caede6-233a-465c-afcc-dcf021bd8700\', \'multiverseId\': 423863}, \'multiverseid\': 423863}, {\'name\': \'使命感\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+1/+3。\\n{W}：將使命感移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'「毫無信仰的人最為懦弱。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=424047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a96d843-7bee-46bc-893d-8e34c1900cf2\', \'multiverseId\': 424047}, \'multiverseid\': 424047}]']
printings: ['10E', '2X2', '2XM', '3ED', '4BB', '4ED', '5ED', '6ED', '7ED', '8ED', '9ED', 'A25', 'AER', 'AFC', 'AJMP', 'AKH', 'ANB', 'ATQ', 'BBD', 'BRC', 'BRR', 'BTD', 'C17', 'C18', 'C20', 'C21', 'CLB', 'CMM', 'CMR', 'CN2', 'DDL', 'DDN', 'DDU', 'DMC', 'DMR', 'DMU', 'DPA', 'DTK', 'E02', 'EMN', 'F17', 'FBB', 'FNM', 'GN2', 'GN3', 'GNT', 'GRN', 'HA1', 'HA4', 'HA5', 'ISD', 'J21', 'J22', 'JMP', 'KLR', 'LCC', 'LTC', 'M10', 'M11', 'M12', 'M13', 'M14', 'M15', 'M19', 'M20', 'M21', 'MIC', 'MKC', 'MKM', 'MOC', 'MOM', 'MOR', 'MPS', 'MRD', 'MUL', 'NCC', 'NEC', 'OGW', 'ONS', 'ORI', 'OTC', 'OTP', 'P09', 'PAER', 'PIP', 'PLST', 'PM20', 'PM21', 'PMEI', 'PRM', 'PS11', 'PSAL', 'PW23', 'RIX', 'SCD', 'SCH', 'SLD', 'SLP', 'SS1', 'STA', 'STH', 'SUM', 'TPR', 'TSR', 'UMA', 'WC04', 'WC98', 'WC99', 'WHO', 'WOC', 'ZNC', 'ZNR']
original_text: ['+1: Create a colorless artifact token named Etherium Cell with "{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool."\\n−2: Target creature gets +X/-X until end of turn, where X is the number of artifacts you control.\\n−7: You get an emblem with "At the beginning of combat on your turn, target artifact you control becomes an artifact creature with base power and toughness 5/5."', '+1: Reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal an artifact card. Put that card into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.\\n−3: Target opponent loses life equal to the number of artifacts you control.\\n−8: Gain control of all artifacts and creatures target opponent controls.', '+2: Put two +1/+1 counters on up to one target creature.\\n+1: Reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a creature card. Put that card into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.\\n−11: Put X +1/+1 counters on target creature, where X is your life total. That creature gains trample until end of turn.', '+2: Reveal the top three cards of your library. Put all nonland permanent cards revealed this way into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.\\n−2: Exile target creature. Its controller gains life equal to its power.\\n−9: Put five +1/+1 counters on each creature you control and five loyalty counters on each other planeswalker you control.', 'All creatures get -3/-3 until end of turn.\\nYou may cast a card with converted mana cost 3 or less from your hand without paying its mana cost.', 'As Metallic Mimic enters the battlefield, choose a creature type.\\nMetallic Mimic is the chosen type in addition to its other types.\\nEach other creature you control of the chosen type enters the battlefield with an additional +1/+1 counter on it.', 'At end of combat, if Daredevil Dragster attacked or blocked this combat, put a velocity counter on it. Then if it has two or more velocity counters on it, sacrifice it and draw two cards.\\nCrew 2 (Tap any number of creatures you control with total power 2 or more: This Vehicle becomes an artifact creature until end of turn.)', 'At the beginning of combat on your turn, target artifact creature you control gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, scry 1.\\nWhenever you cast a creature spell, you may pay {G}. If you do, draw a card.', "Audacious Infiltrator can't be blocked by artifact creatures.", "Chandra's Revolution deals 4 damage to target creature. Tap target land. That land doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.", "Choose one —\\n• Destroy target artifact.\\n• Creatures without flying can't block this turn.", 'Choose one —\\n• Target creature gets +4/+0 and gains trample until end of turn.\\n• Two target creatures each get +2/+0 and gain trample until end of turn.', "Choose one —\\n• Target creature you control gets +1/+2 until end of turn.\\n• Return target creature you control to its owner's hand.", 'Counter target noncreature spell.', "Counter target spell, activated ability, or triggered ability. (Mana abilities can't be targeted.)", 'Create three 1/1 colorless Servo artifact creature tokens.\\nYou may cast a card with converted mana cost 3 or less from your hand without paying its mana cost.', 'Crew 3 (Tap any number of creatures you control with total power 3 or more: This Vehicle becomes an artifact creature until end of turn.)', 'Crew 6 (Tap any number of creatures you control with total power 6 or more: This Vehicle becomes an artifact creature until end of turn.)', 'Deathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)\\nWhen Aether Poisoner enters the battlefield, you get {E}{E} (two energy counters).\\nWhenever Aether Poisoner attacks, you may pay {E}{E}. If you do, create a 1/1 colorless Servo artifact creature token.', 'Deathtouch, lifelink', 'Deathtouch\\nRevolt — Narnam Renegade enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it if a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn.', 'Deft Dismissal deals 3 damage divided as you choose among one, two, or three target attacking or blocking creatures.', 'Destroy X target artifacts and/or creatures. For each permanent destroyed this way, its controller reveals cards from the top of his or her library until an artifact or creature card is revealed and exiles that card. Those players put the exiled cards onto the battlefield, then shuffle their libraries.', 'Destroy X target artifacts. Create X 2/2 red Gremlin creature tokens.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.\\nRevolt — If a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn, you gain 3 life.', 'Destroy target creature if it has converted mana cost 2 or less.\\nRevolt — Destroy that creature if it has converted mana cost 4 or less instead if a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn.', 'Destroy target creature or Vehicle.', 'Destroy target creature. You may search your library and/or graveyard for a card named Tezzeret, Master of Metal, reveal it, and put it into your hand. If you search your library this way, shuffle it.', 'Double strike (This creature deals both first-strike and regular combat damage.)\\nWhen Scrapper Champion enters the battlefield, you get {E}{E} (two energy counters).\\nWhenever Scrapper Champion attacks, you may pay {E}{E}. If you do, put a +1/+1 counter on it.', 'Double strike, haste\\nWhenever Lightning Runner attacks, you get {E}{E} (two energy counters), then you may pay {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}. If you pay, untap all creatures you control, and after this phase, there is an additional combat phase.', 'Double strike\\nRevolt — At the beginning of your end step, if a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn, put a +1/+1 counter on Solemn Recruit.', 'Draw cards equal to the greatest power among creatures you control.\\nYou may cast a card with converted mana cost 5 or less from your hand without paying its mana cost.', 'Each opponent sacrifices a creature or planeswalker, then discards a card. You return a creature or planeswalker card from your graveyard to your hand, then draw a card.\\nWhen you cast a Bolas planeswalker spell, exile Dark Intimations from your graveyard. That planeswalker enters the battlefield with an additional loyalty counter on it.', 'Each opponent sacrifices an artifact creature and a nonartifact creature.', "Enchant artifact or creature\\nEnchanted permanent doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.", "Enchant artifact you control\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, create a token that's a copy of enchanted artifact. Then if you control eight or more artifacts with the same name as one another, you win the game.", "Enchant artifact\\nAt the beginning of your end step, Gremlin Infestation deals 2 damage to enchanted artifact's controller.\\nWhen enchanted artifact is put into a graveyard, create a 2/2 red Gremlin creature token.", "Enchant artifact\\nEnchanted artifact is a creature with base power and toughness 5/5 in addition to its other types.\\nWhen enchanted artifact is put into a graveyard, return that card to its owner's hand.", "Enchant creature or Vehicle\\nAs long as enchanted permanent is a Vehicle, it's a creature in addition to its other types.\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has flying.", "Enchant creature or Vehicle\\nAs long as enchanted permanent is a Vehicle, it's a creature in addition to its other types.\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+0 and has first strike.", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block.\\nWhen a Vehicle you control attacks, exile enchanted creature.", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+3.\\n{W}: Return Conviction to its owner's hand.", 'Enchant land\\nEnchanted land has "{T}: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool."\\nSacrifice Unbridled Growth: Draw a card.', 'Exile target nonland card from your graveyard. Search your library for any number of cards with the same name as that card, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then shuffle your library.', "Exile up to two target creatures you control, then return those cards to the battlefield under their owner's control.\\nDraw a card.", "First strike, menace\\nWhenever Kari Zev, Skyship Raider attacks, create a legendary 2/1 red Monkey creature token named Ragavan that's tapped and attacking. Exile that token at end of combat.", 'First strike\\nWhen Aether Chaser enters the battlefield, you get {E}{E} (two energy counters).\\nWhenever Aether Chaser attacks, you may pay {E}{E}. If you do, create a 1/1 colorless Servo artifact creature token.', 'First strike\\nWhenever Reckless Racer becomes tapped, you may discard a card. If you do, draw a card.', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\\nWhenever Shielded Aether Thief blocks, you get {E} (an energy counter).\\n{T}, Pay {E}{E}{E}: Draw a card.', 'Flying', "Flying, vigilance\\nCrew 3 (Tap any number of creatures you control with total power 3 or more: This Vehicle becomes an artifact creature until end of turn.)\\nYou may remove a loyalty counter from a planeswalker you control rather than pay Heart of Kiran's crew cost.", "Flying\\nHinterland Drake can't block artifact creatures.", 'Flying\\nIf you would lose the game, instead exile Exquisite Archangel and your life total becomes equal to your starting life total.', 'Flying\\nRevolt — Night Market Aeronaut enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it if a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn.', 'Flying\\nRevolt — When Airdrop Aeronauts enters the battlefield, if a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn, you gain 5 life.', "Flying\\nSacrifice Hope of Ghirapur: Until your next turn, target player who was dealt combat damage by Hope of Ghirapur this turn can't cast noncreature spells.", 'Flying\\nVehicles you control have flying.', 'Flying\\nWhen Aether Swooper enters the battlefield, you get {E}{E} (two energy counters).\\nWhenever Aether Swooper attacks, you may pay {E}{E}. If you do, create a 1/1 colorless Servo artifact creature token.', 'Flying\\nWhen Aethersphere Harvester enters the battlefield, you get {E}{E} (two energy counters).\\nPay {E}: Aethersphere Harvester gains lifelink until end of turn.\\nCrew 1 (Tap any number of creatures you control with total power 1 or more: This Vehicle becomes an artifact creature until end of turn.)', "Flying\\nWhen Aethertide Whale enters the battlefield, you get {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E} (six energy counters).\\nPay {E}{E}{E}{E}: Return Aethertide Whale to its owner's hand.", 'Flying\\nWhen Dawnfeather Eagle enters the battlefield, creatures you control get +1/+1 and gain vigilance until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nWhen Foundry Hornet enters the battlefield, if you control a creature with a +1/+1 counter on it, creatures your opponents control get -1/-1 until end of turn.', "Flying\\nWhen Spire Patrol enters the battlefield, tap target creature an opponent controls. That creature doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.", 'Flying\\nWhenever Skyship Plunderer deals combat damage to a player, for each kind of counter on target permanent or player, give that permanent or player another counter of that kind.', 'Frontline Rebel attacks each combat if able.', 'Gain control of target creature or Vehicle until end of turn. Untap it. It gains haste until end of turn.\\nYou may cast a card with converted mana cost 2 or less from your hand without paying its mana cost.', 'Gain control of target creature with power 4 or less until end of turn. Untap that creature. It gains haste until end of turn.', 'Haste\\nWhenever a creature an opponent controls dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Yahenni, Undying Partisan.\\nSacrifice another creature: Yahenni gains indestructible until end of turn.', 'Hungry Flames deals 3 damage to target creature and 2 damage to target player.', 'If one or more counters would be placed on an artifact or creature you control, that many of those counters plus one are placed on that permanent instead.\\nIf you would get one or more counters, you get that many of those counters plus one instead.', "Improvise (Your artifacts can help cast this spell. Each artifact you tap after you're done activating mana abilities pays for {1}.)", "Improvise (Your artifacts can help cast this spell. Each artifact you tap after you're done activating mana abilities pays for {1}.)\\nBarricade Breaker attacks each combat if able.", "Improvise (Your artifacts can help cast this spell. Each artifact you tap after you're done activating mana abilities pays for {1}.)\\nCounter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.", "Improvise (Your artifacts can help cast this spell. Each artifact you tap after you're done activating mana abilities pays for {1}.)\\nDraw three cards.", "Improvise (Your artifacts can help cast this spell. Each artifact you tap after you're done activating mana abilities pays for {1}.)\\nFen Hauler can't be blocked by artifact creatures.", "Improvise (Your artifacts can help cast this spell. Each artifact you tap after you're done activating mana abilities pays for {1}.)\\nFlying", "Improvise (Your artifacts can help cast this spell. Each artifact you tap after you're done activating mana abilities pays for {1}.)\\nFlying\\nAt the beginning of your end step, each opponent discards a card.\\n{1}{B}, Sacrifice an artifact: Target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn.", "Improvise (Your artifacts can help cast this spell. Each artifact you tap after you're done activating mana abilities pays for {1}.)\\nFlying\\n{1}{R}: Freejam Regent gets +2/+0 until end of turn.", "Improvise (Your artifacts can help cast this spell. Each artifact you tap after you're done activating mana abilities pays for {1}.)\\nHexproof (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)", "Improvise (Your artifacts can help cast this spell. Each artifact you tap after you're done activating mana abilities pays for {1}.)\\nMenace", "Improvise (Your artifacts can help cast this spell. Each artifact you tap after you're done activating mana abilities pays for {1}.)\\nSearch your library for an artifact card with converted mana cost X or less, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle your library.", "Improvise (Your artifacts can help cast this spell. Each artifact you tap after you're done activating mana abilities pays for {1}.)\\nTarget creature gets -X/-X until end of turn. You gain X life.", "Improvise (Your artifacts can help cast this spell. Each artifact you tap after you're done activating mana abilities pays for {1}.)\\nTrample, haste", "Improvise (Your artifacts can help cast this spell. Each artifact you tap after you're done activating mana abilities pays for {1}.)\\nWhen Maverick Thopterist enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature tokens with flying.", "Improvise (Your artifacts can help cast this spell. Each artifact you tap after you're done activating mana abilities pays for {1}.)\\nWhenever a nontoken artifact you control is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, create a 1/1 colorless Servo artifact creature token.", 'Instant and sorcery spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.\\nWhenever a spell or ability you control counters a spell, you may draw a card. If you do, discard a card.', 'Menace', 'Menace\\nWhenever Glint-Sleeve Siphoner enters the battlefield or attacks, you get {E} (an energy counter).\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may pay {E}{E}. If you do, you draw a card and you lose 1 life.', 'Monstrous Onslaught deals X damage divided as you choose among any number of target creatures, where X is the greatest power among creatures you control as you cast Monstrous Onslaught.', 'Night Market Guard can block an additional creature each combat.', "Nonartifact spells you cast have improvise. (Your artifacts can help cast those spells. Each artifact you tap after you're done activating mana abilities pays for {1}.)", 'Other Aetherborn you control get +1/+1.\\nWhenever Midnight Entourage or another Aetherborn you control dies, you draw a card and you lose 1 life.', "Outland Boar can't be blocked by creatures with power 2 or less.", 'Permanents you control gain hexproof and indestructible until end of turn.', "Put X +1/+1 counters on target artifact you control. If it isn't a creature or Vehicle, it becomes a 0/0 Construct artifact creature.", 'Put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control.', 'Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature, then put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it.', "Put target artifact on the bottom of its owner's library.", 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\\nRevolt — When Silkweaver Elite enters the battlefield, if a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn, draw a card.', 'Renegade Map enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}, Sacrifice Renegade Map: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library.', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand. If you control an artifact, draw a card.', "Return target nonland permanent to its owner's hand.\\nDraw a card.", "Return up to three target artifacts and/or creatures to their owners' hands.\\nYou may cast a card with converted mana cost 4 or less from your hand without paying its mana cost.", 'Revolt — At the beginning of your end step, if a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn, create a 1/1 colorless Servo artifact creature token.\\n{1}, Sacrifice a creature: Scry 1.', 'Revolt — At the beginning of your end step, if a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn, put a unity counter on Call for Unity.\\nCreatures you control get +1/+1 for each unity counter on Call for Unity.', "Revolt — At the beginning of your end step, if a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn, reveal the top card of your library. If it's a permanent card, you may put it onto the battlefield. Otherwise, you may put it on the bottom of your library.", 'Revolt — Greenwheel Liberator enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it if a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn.', 'Revolt — When Countless Gears Renegade enters the battlefield, if a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn, create a 1/1 colorless Servo artifact creature token.', 'Revolt — When Deadeye Harpooner enters the battlefield, if a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn, destroy target tapped creature an opponent controls.', 'Revolt — When Hidden Herbalists enters the battlefield, if a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn, add {G}{G} to your mana pool.', 'Revolt — When Renegade Rallier enters the battlefield, if a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn, return target permanent card with converted mana cost 2 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'Revolt — When Vengeful Rebel enters the battlefield, if a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn, target creature an opponent controls gets -3/-3 until end of turn.', 'Sacrifice an artifact or creature: Put a +1/+1 counter on Defiant Salvager. Activate this ability only any time you could cast a sorcery.', 'Sacrifice an artifact: Ravenous Intruder gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Scrounging Bandar enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may move any number of +1/+1 counters from Scrounging Bandar onto another target creature.', 'Shock deals 2 damage to target creature or player.', 'Submerged Boneyard enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {B} to your mana pool.', "Tap target creature. It doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.", 'Target creature gets +1/+0 and gains first strike until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn. You get {E}{E} (two energy counters).', 'Target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn. Scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)', "Target creature you control fights target creature you don't control. (Each deals damage equal to its power to the other.)", 'Target permanent gains indestructible until end of turn. Create a 1/1 colorless Servo artifact creature token. (Effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy a permanent with indestructible, and if it\'s a creature, it can\'t be destroyed by damage.)', "Trample\\nAt the beginning of combat on your turn, if you control an Ajani planeswalker, put a +1/+1 counter on Ajani's Comrade.", 'Trample\\nRevolt — Lifecraft Cavalry enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it if a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn.', 'Trample\\nWhen Aetherstream Leopard enters the battlefield, you get {E} (an energy counter).\\nWhenever Aetherstream Leopard attacks, you may pay {E}. If you do, it gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Trample\\nWhen Maulfist Revolutionary enters the battlefield or dies, for each kind of counter on target permanent or player, give that permanent or player another counter of that kind.', 'Trample\\nWhenever Aetherwind Basker enters the battlefield or attacks, you get {E} (an energy counter) for each creature you control.\\nPay {E}: Aetherwind Basker gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Trample\\nWhenever Untethered Express attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on it.\\nCrew 1 (Tap any number of creatures you control with total power 1 or more: This Vehicle becomes an artifact creature until end of turn.)', 'Tranquil Expanse enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {W} to your mana pool.', 'Vigilance\\nWhen Aether Inspector enters the battlefield, you get {E}{E} (two energy counters).\\nWhenever Aether Inspector attacks, you may pay {E}{E}. If you do, create a 1/1 colorless Servo artifact creature token.', 'Walking Ballista enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{4}: Put a +1/+1 counter on Walking Ballista.\\nRemove a +1/+1 counter from Walking Ballista: It deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', 'When Aether Herder enters the battlefield, you get {E}{E} (two energy counters).\\nWhenever Aether Herder attacks, you may pay {E}{E}. If you do, create a 1/1 colorless Servo artifact creature token.', "When Ajani's Aid enters the battlefield, you may search your library and/or graveyard for a card named Ajani, Valiant Protector, reveal it, and put it into your hand. If you search your library this way, shuffle it.\\nSacrifice Ajani's Aid: Prevent all combat damage a creature of your choice would deal this turn.", 'When Consulate Crackdown enters the battlefield, exile all artifacts your opponents control until Consulate Crackdown leaves the battlefield.', "When Dispersal Technician enters the battlefield, you may return target artifact to its owner's hand.", "When Felidar Guardian enters the battlefield, you may exile another target permanent you control, then return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control.", 'When Filigree Crawler dies, create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying.', 'When Fourth Bridge Prowler enters the battlefield, you may have target creature get -1/-1 until end of turn.', "When Greenbelt Rampager enters the battlefield, pay {E}{E} (two energy counters). If you can't, return Greenbelt Rampager to its owner's hand and you get {E}.", 'When Ironclad Revolutionary enters the battlefield, you may sacrifice an artifact. If you do, put two +1/+1 counters on Ironclad Revolutionary and each opponent loses 2 life.', 'When Oath of Ajani enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control.\\nPlaneswalker spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.', 'When Peema Aether-Seer enters the battlefield, you get an amount of {E} (energy counters) equal to the greatest power among creatures you control.\\nPay {E}{E}{E}: Target creature blocks this turn if able.', 'When Pendulum of Patterns enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.\\n{5}, {T}, Sacrifice Pendulum of Patterns: Draw a card.', 'When Quicksmith Rebel enters the battlefield, target artifact you control gains "{T}: This artifact deals 2 damage to target creature or player" for as long as you control Quicksmith Rebel.', 'When Quicksmith Spy enters the battlefield, target artifact you control gains "{T}: Draw a card" for as long as you control Quicksmith Spy.', 'When Reservoir Walker enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life and get {E}{E}{E} (three energy counters).', 'When Ridgescale Tusker enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on each other creature you control.', 'When Rishkar, Peema Renegade enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target creatures.\\nEach creature you control with a counter on it has "{T}: Add {G} to your mana pool."', 'When Rogue Refiner enters the battlefield, draw a card and you get {E}{E} (two energy counters).', 'When Servo Schematic enters the battlefield or is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, create a 1/1 colorless Servo artifact creature token.', 'When Shipwreck Moray enters the battlefield, you get {E}{E}{E}{E} (four energy counters).\\nPay {E}: Shipwreck Moray gets +2/-2 until end of turn.', 'When Thopter Arrest enters the battlefield, exile target artifact or creature an opponent controls until Thopter Arrest leaves the battlefield.', 'When Treasure Keeper dies, reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a nonland card with converted mana cost 3 or less. You may cast that card without paying its mana cost. Put all revealed cards not cast this way on the bottom of your library in a random order.', 'When Trophy Mage enters the battlefield, you may search your library for an artifact card with converted mana cost 3, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library.', "Whenever Aethergeode Miner attacks, you get {E}{E} (two energy counters).\\nPay {E}{E}: Exile Aethergeode Miner, then return it to the battlefield under its owner's control.", "Whenever Gonti's Aether Heart or another artifact enters the battlefield under your control, you get {E}{E} (two energy counters).\\nPay {E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}{E}, Exile Gonti's Aether Heart: Take an extra turn after this one.", 'Whenever Mobile Garrison attacks, untap another target artifact or creature you control.\\nCrew 2 (Tap any number of creatures you control with total power 2 or more: This Vehicle becomes an artifact creature until end of turn.)', "Whenever Renegade Wheelsmith becomes tapped, target creature can't block this turn.", "Whenever Salvage Scuttler attacks, return an artifact you control to its owner's hand.", 'Whenever Scrap Trawler or another artifact you control is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return to your hand target artifact card in your graveyard with lesser converted mana cost.', "Whenever a nontoken artifact is put into your graveyard from the battlefield, return that card to your hand unless target opponent has Pia's Revolution deal 3 damage to him or her.", "Whenever you activate an ability of an artifact or creature that isn't a mana ability, Crackdown Construct gets +1/+1 until end of turn.", 'Whenever you cast a spell, untap all nonland permanents you control.', 'Whenever you cast an Aura, Equipment, or Vehicle spell, draw a card.', 'Whenever you cast an artifact spell, create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying.', "Whenever you lose life for the first time each turn, you get {E}. (You get an energy counter. Damage causes loss of life.)\\nPay {E}{E}, Sacrifice Gonti's Machinations: Each opponent loses 3 life. You gain life equal to the life lost this way.", '{1}{B}: Augmenting Automaton gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{1}{W}: Another target Vehicle you control becomes an artifact creature until end of turn.\\nCrew 4 (Tap any number of creatures you control with total power 4 or more: This Vehicle becomes an artifact creature until end of turn.)', '{2}, {T}: Tap target artifact or creature.', '{2}{U}: Scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)', '{3}{G}: Put a +1/+1 counter on Verdant Automaton.', '{3}{R}: Welder Automaton deals 1 damage to each opponent.', '{3}{U}, {T}, Tap X untapped artifacts you control: Look at the top X cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', "{4}{W}: Return another target creature you control to its owner's hand.", '{7}, {T}, Sacrifice Universal Solvent: Destroy target permanent.', "{7}: Create a token that's a copy of target artifact. That token gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step.", '{8}, {T}: Search your library for a permanent card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle your library.', '{B}, Sacrifice Implement of Malice: Target player discards a card. Activate this ability only any time you could cast a sorcery.\\nWhen Implement of Malice is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, draw a card.', '{G}, Sacrifice Implement of Ferocity: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature. Activate this ability only any time you could cast a sorcery.\\nWhen Implement of Ferocity is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, draw a card.', '{R}, Sacrifice Implement of Combustion: It deals 1 damage to target player.\\nWhen Implement of Combustion is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, draw a card.', '{T}, Sacrifice an artifact: Embraal Gear-Smasher deals 2 damage to each opponent.', '{T}: Add {C} to your mana pool.\\n{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool. Activate this ability only if you control an artifact.', '{T}: Add {G} to your mana pool.', '{T}: Target opponent loses 1 life. If you control a Tezzeret planeswalker, that player loses 3 life instead.', '{T}: You get {E} (an energy counter).\\n{T}, Pay {E}{E}{E}: Consulate Turret deals 2 damage to target player.', '{U}, Sacrifice Implement of Examination: Draw a card.\\nWhen Implement of Examination is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, draw a card.', '{W}, Sacrifice Implement of Improvement: You gain 2 life.\\nWhen Implement of Improvement is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, draw a card.', '{W}, Sacrifice Restoration Specialist: Return up to one target artifact card and up to one target enchantment card from your graveyard to your hand.']
